## About ARC Raiders Scrappy the Rooster Boost

Maximize your passive income from the Workshop with our **ARC Raiders Scrappy the Roaster Leveling Boost**. Scrappy is your loyal rooster companion who periodically brings you "dubiously-sourced materials." This service is designed to **level up Scrappy**, which permanently increases the quantity and quality of the resources he finds for you while you are playing.

### **Why Leveling Scrappy Matters**

Leveling up your companion is the key to maximizing your resource farm with zero effort. As the description notes, Scrappy only works while you''re topside (actively playing the game). A leveled-up Scrappy makes every minute you spend in a raid more profitable by:

- **Bringing back MORE materials:** A higher level increases the amount of resources Scrappy will find for you.
- **Bringing back BETTER materials:** Leveling up gives Scrappy a higher chance to find rare and valuable crafting components.
- **Maximizing Your Active Time:** Since he only works while you play, this upgrade ensures you are getting the best possible "return on time" for your raids.

### **What You Get with Our Companion Leveling Boost**

- **Your Scrappy the Roaster Leveled Up:** We will perform all the necessary actions, quests or item turn-ins required to level up Scrappy to your desired tier.
- **A Permanent Boost to Your Income:** This is a one-time upgrade that will benefit you for your entire ARC Raiders journey.
- **An Efficient and Fast Service:** Our boosters know the fastest and most effective methods to complete Scrappy''s leveling process, saving you the grind.
- **All Loot Kept:** You keep all the currency, resources and gear acquired by our booster during the leveling process.

### **Why Choose MmonsteR for Your Companion?**

- 💪 Our boosters are **leveling experts** who have mastered the most efficient strategies to upgrade your Workshop and companions.
- 🛡️ This service is **100% manual and secure**. We play legitimately on your character to ensure its safety at all times.
- 📞 Our **24/7 live support** is ready to help you with your order and provide progress updates on Scrappy''s leveling.
- 🏆 With over **10 years of experience**, **MmonsteR** is the most reliable choice for all your character progression needs in ARC Raiders.

## FAQ

🐔 What is Scrappy in ARC Raiders?

Scrappy is the friendly rooster who lives in your Workshop. He provides a passive benefit by periodically finding and giving you "dubiously-sourced materials" **while you are actively in a raid**.

* * *

🤔 What does it mean to "level up" Scrappy?

You can permanently upgrade Scrappy''s "coop" or "perch" in your Workshop. Leveling him up makes him more efficient. An upgraded Scrappy will **bring you more materials and rarer items** for every hour you spend playing the game.

* * *

🥵 How do I level up Scrappy?

Leveling up Scrappy is a hidden, endgame grind. It requires you to find a series of **rare, specific "comfort" items** in raids. These items have extremely low drop rates and must be extracted safely to be used for his upgrade.

* * *

👍 Why should I get a Scrappy Leveling Boost?

This is a one-time, permanent investment in your account''s efficiency. By purchasing this boost, you skip the frustrating RNG grind for the rare upgrade items. An upgraded Scrappy **makes every single raid you play more profitable** for the rest of your time in the game.

