StripeM-Inner', 6, 'multi_range', 'ARC Raiders Scrappy the Rooster Leveling Boost', 'arc-raiders-scrappy-rooster-leveling-boost', 'Boost your Scrappy the Rooster in ARC Raiders to unlock a continuous flow of valuable materials, making every in-game minute more rewarding. Skip the grind and supercharge your resource income with Misti!', '<h3>Unlock Scrappy''s Full Potential with Misti!</h3><p>Say goodbye to the endless grind for crafting materials and hello to efficiency! Our ARC Raiders Scrappy the Rooster Leveling Boost ensures your loyal workshop companion reaches its peak potential, providing a steady stream of much-needed resources. Scrappy is more than just a charming rooster; he''s your personal passive farm, diligently gathering items while you''re out exploring the dangerous topside. Let our seasoned pros handle the tedious leveling process, so you can focus on the heart-pounding action that ARC Raiders delivers.</p><p>A higher-level Scrappy translates directly into more and better materials, maximizing the return on every minute you spend in-game. This isn''t just about convenience; it''s about optimizing your entire ARC Raiders experience. Whether you''re a casual player looking to stockpile resources without the hassle or a dedicated Raider aiming for ultimate efficiency, our Scrappy boost is your secret weapon.</p><h3>What''s Included</h3><ul><li>🐔 Your ARC Raiders Scrappy the Rooster leveled to your chosen rank.</li><li>✨ A consistent, enhanced flow of crafting materials from your Workshop companion.</li><li>👀 Our expert team dedicating time topside to efficiently farm necessary upgrade items.</li><li>🛡️ A secure, hand-played service to safely power up your in-game sidekick.</li></ul><h3>Requirements</h3><ul><li>An active ARC Raiders account and character.</li></ul><h3>Options</h3><h4>Play Method:</h4><ul><li><strong>Piloted:</strong> Our professional booster takes control of your account to complete the Scrappy leveling process quickly and efficiently.