ome and making every future raid more profitable.","question":"Why should I choose a Scrappy leveling boost?"},{"answer":"Absolutely. Our service is 100% manual, with actual players expertly navigating your character. We prioritize account safety and legitimacy above all else, ensuring a secure and policy-compliant experience.","question":"Is this a safe service for my ARC Raiders account?"},{"answer":"A leveled Scrappy brings back a variety of crafting materials. The higher his level, the more likely he is to find higher-tier, rarer components essential for advanced crafting and upgrades in ARC Raiders.","question":"What materials does a leveled Scrappy bring back?"},{"answer":"For Piloted services, we recommend coordinating with your booster to avoid logging in during active service times to prevent any potential disruptions or delays. Communication is key!","question":"Can I play on my account while the service is active?"},{"answer":"Completion times vary based on the desired level range and selected priority. Our Express Priority option ensures the fastest possible completion, getting your Scrappy boosted in an accelerated timeframe.","question":"How quickly will my Scrappy be leveled?"},{"answer":"This service is available for ARC Raiders players on PC, PlayStation, and XBOX platforms.","question":"Which platforms are supported for this service?"},{"answer":"Yes, absolutely! All additional currency, resources, and any other loot acquired by our booster during the Scrappy leveling process will remain on your account.","question":"Will I keep any other loot or progress made during the boost?"}]', true, '{"step":1,"to_label":"Desired Scrappy Level","max_value":5,"min_value":1,"default_to":5,"from_label":"Current Scrappy Level","slider_type":null,"default_from":1}', 1.99, 'pc psn xbox', 'level', 'pilot and selfplay', NULL, 'draft', '03765a40-f338-4035-a2ba-8928fff30834', '2025-12-24T15:49:29.659712+00:00', '2025-12-24T16:10:45.64276+00:00');

