/p><ul><li><strong>The Mount:</strong> Xy Trustee''s Gearglider permanently added to your collection.</li><li><strong>The Grind:</strong> Completion of all specific in-game activities, quests, or farming required to unlock the mount.</li><li><strong>Loot Rights:</strong> You keep all gold, gear, and resources earned during the service.</li><li><strong>Manual Service:</strong> 100% hand-played by experienced boosters.</li></ul><h2><strong>Xy Trustee''s Gearglider Mount: All Information</strong></h2><p>The Xy Trustee''s Gearglider is a highly sought-after mount in <em>The War Within</em> expansion. Its design features the signature geometric elegance of the Brokers, making it a favorite for players who prefer a clean, technological look for their characters.</p><p><strong>How to obtain the mount?</strong> Unlocking the Gearglider is a multi-step process that often involves navigating high-level zones, completing repetitive daily or weekly tasks, or farming specific currencies. It is designed to be a long-term goal for dedicated players.</p><p><strong>Why choose our boost?</strong> For many, the time investment required to get this mount is simply too high. Our service removes the barrier between you and your desired reward. We assign professional players who know the most efficient routes and strategies to secure the mount in the shortest time possible, allowing you to enjoy the reward without suffering through the grind.</p><h2><strong>Boost Options Explained</strong></h2><p>We offer two secure methods to deliver your mount:</p><ul><li><strong>Piloted:</strong> Our professional player logs into your account to complete the boost. We utilize strict security protocols, including VPNs matching your country, to ensure your account remains safe and flagged as a local login.</li><li><strong>Remote Control:</strong> For the highest level of security, our booster connects to your PC via a secure application like Parsec. They play the game using your mouse and keyboard while you watch the stream live. Your login credentials are never shared.</li></ul>', '<ul><li><strong>Place Order:</strong> Place your order for the WoW Xy Trustee''s Gearglider Mount Boost on our site.</li><li><strong>Contact:</strong> Our support manager will contact you asap via the website''s online chat to clarify all order details and scheduling.</li><li><strong>Assignment:</strong> We assign an experienced booster skilled in unlocking rare mounts efficiently.</li><li><strong>Completion:</strong> The booster completes all required steps to secure the Xy Trustee''s Gearglider mount for you.</li><li><strong>Enjoy:</strong> You receive confirmation once the mount is delivered to your account.</li></ul>', '<ul><li><strong>Level:</strong> Level 80 Character.</li><li><strong>Expansion:</strong> The War Within active.</li><li><strong>Account:</strong> Active World of Warcraft subscription.</li></ul>', 24.65, 'https://kdjlhibxxygfdmlvdfcl.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/game-images/wow-xy-trustees-gearglider-1763931220745.webp', NULL, 4.9, 0, true, true, 0, '2025-11-22T19:08:01.665672+00:00', '2025-12-16T07:22:22.458034+00:00', 'b4c0ccaf-a937-4b30-9ab4-7dacee8f739b', false, NULL, true, 1, '15 minutes', 'average start time', 'Flexible', 'order completion', 'Glide through the skies on Xy Trustee''s Gearglider without the hassle. misti.services offers quick, secure boosting for this unique mount.', 'wow xy trustee''s gearglider buy, xy trustee''s gearglider mount, wow futuristic mount, xy trustee''s gearglider price, buy gearglider wow, unique wow mount, engineering masterpiece wow, wow xy trustee''s mount, sleek wow mount, gearglider in azeroth, buy xy trustee''s gearglider, wow rare mount, xy trustee''s mount for sale', 'https://kdjlhibxxygfdmlvdfcl.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/game-images/wow-xy-trustees-gearglider-1763931220745.webp', NULL, 'Game gaming service - WoW Xy Trustee''s Gearglider', 'WoW Xy Gearglider Mount | misti.services', NULL);
INSERT INTO public.products (id, name, slug, short_description, description, how_it_works, requirements, base_price, image_url, badge_text, trust_score, total_reviews, is_active, is_featured, sort_order, created_at, updated_at, category_id, is_slider_product, slider_config, is_manually_popular, total_sales, start_time_text, start_time_value, delivery_text, delivery_value, meta_description, meta_keywords, og_image, canonical_url, image_alt_text, meta_title, parent_link) VALUES ('c44e51a6-6928-4e15-9740-8ddf01790e56', 'Prapor Quests ', 'eft-prapor-quests-boost', 'Master the fundamentals of Tarkov with the EFT Prapor Quests Boost from misti.services. From early Customs tasks to the brutal Punisher series, our pros handle the entire questline so you can focus on playing with powerful weapons instead of grinding basic kills. Unlock top-tier AK rifles, meta ammo and valuable containers faster and safer than doing it alone.', '<h1><strong>Escape from Tarkov Prapor Quests Completion Boost</strong></h1><p>Master the fundamentals of Tarkov with the <strong>EFT Prapor Quests Boost</strong> from <strong>misti.services</strong>. From early Customs tasks to the brutal <strong>Punisher</strong> series, our pros handle the entire questline so you can focus on playing with powerful weapons instead of grinding basic kills. Unlock top-tier AK rifles, meta ammo and valuable containers faster and safer than doing it alone.</p><h2><strong>Service Includes</strong></h2><ul><li>Any Prapor quest completion, from Debut to the final Punisher part</li><li>Progress toward or unlock of the Epsilon secure container</li><li>Access to top-tier AK ammunition such as 7.62 BP and 5.45 BS/Igolnik once unlocked in game</li><li>Faster progression toward Loyalty Level 4 for the best Russian weapons, armor and grenades</li><li>Professional handling of elimination and objective-based quests across key maps</li></ul><h3><strong>Boost Options Explained</strong></h3><ul><li><strong>Piloted</strong> – Our booster logs into your account and completes the selected Prapor quests for you.</li><li><strong>Selfplay</strong> – You play together with our booster while they guide you through every objective.</li><li><strong>Stream</strong> – Optional live stream so you can watch the progress and see how each quest is completed.</li></ul><h3><strong>About EFT Prapor Quests</strong></h3><p>The <strong>Prapor questline</strong> is the backbone of early Escape from Tarkov progression. As your main source of Russian weapons and ammo, Prapor controls access to many of the game’s most popular rifles and cartridges. His quests teach core gameplay on maps like Customs while pushing you into high-pressure fights.</p><p>The <strong>EFT Prapor Quests Boost</strong> from misti.services is designed to clear this foundation quickly, including the demanding <strong>Punisher</strong> series, so you can move into mid-game with a fully prepared arsenal.</p><h3><strong>Why Prapor Quests Are Mandatory</strong></h3><p>Ignoring Prapor is not an option if you want to succeed in Tarkov. Completing his quests:</p><ul><li>Levels up his loyalty, unlocking reliable access to AK-74 and AKM variants</li><li>Grants powerful ammunition such as 7.62x39 BP and 5.45x39 BT/BS once the right unlocks are obtained</li><li>Progresses important chains, including the Punisher series, which gate other traders and quests</li><li>Moves you toward the Epsilon secure container and other key progression milestones</li></ul><p>By letting professionals handle the grind, you secure these advantages early in the wipe instead of struggling through them over weeks.</p><h3><strong>What You Get with Our Prapor Boost</strong></h3><ul><li>Any Prapor quest completed, from the first Debut task to the final Punisher part</li><li>All combat objectives handled, including specific gear or weapon requirements</li><li>Fast increase in Prapor reputation and loyalty, with a clear path toward Loyalty Level 4</li><li>All quest rewards kept on your account: roubles, XP, reputation and item drops remain yours</li></ul><h3><strong>Why Choose misti.services for Tarkov Boosting</strong></h3><ul><li>Our boosters are experienced Tarkov players who know every spawn, power position and rotation for Prapor’s quests</li><li>All services are fully manual and secure, with no cheats, bots or unsafe software</li><li>Responsive support via chat or Discord, including custom packages for specific quests or Punisher parts</li><li>misti.services builds on more than a decade of boosting experience, helping thousands of players establish a strong start each wipe</li></ul><p>Let <strong>misti.services</strong> clear your <strong>Prapor questline</strong> so you can jump straight into Tarkov with elite AK builds, strong ammo and a solid foundation for the rest of the wipe.</p>', '<ul><li>Choose the Prapor quests you want completed, from early Customs tasks to the Punisher chain, and place your order on misti.services.</li><li>We assign a battle-tested Tarkov veteran who specializes in early- and mid-wipe combat quests.</li><li>The booster secures key items like the bronze pocket watch, completes elimination tasks on Customs and other maps, and advances every selected objective.</li><li>Your Prapor quests are completed, unlocking access to stronger AK-platform weapons, high-performing ammunition and better armor offers as they become available.</li><li>You receive a notification when the boost is finished and all rewards are ready to claim.</li><li>Log in and enjoy a huge power spike with improved gear options and smoother progression.</li></ul>', '<ul><li>Escape from Tarkov purchased and accessible on your account</li><li>Desired Prapor quests must be unlocked and available</li></ul>', 1.99, 'https://kdjlhibxxygfdmlvdfcl.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/game-images/eft-prapor-quests-boost-1765925713706.webp', NULL, 4.9, 0, true, true, 0, '2025-12-10T19:47:07.082834+00:00', '2025-12-16T23:08:34.210138+00:00', 'ad312297-e28b-4185-8694-55f8078c94b1', false, NULL, true, 0, '15 minutes', 'average start time', 'Flexible', 'order completion', 'Crush Prapor’s questline with our EFT Prapor Quests Boost on misti.services. Veterans clear Debut to Punisher, unlock Epsilon, top AK ammo and faster wipe progress.', 'EFT Prapor quests boost, Prapor questline boost, Escape from Tarkov Prapor quests, EFT Punisher quests carry, Punisher series boost, EFT Debut quest help, Customs quest boost, EFT secure container Epsilon, Epsilon container unlock, EFT Russian weapons boost, AKM quest boost, AK-74 quest boost, EFT 7.62 BP ammo, EFT 5.45 BS ammo, Tarkov early wipe boost, EFT mid wipe progression, EFT scav kills service, EFT PMC kills service, Tarkov combat quests, EFT trader reputation boost, Prapor loyalty level 4, EFT LL4 Prapor, EFT ammo unlock service, EFT AK loadout boost, Escape from Tarkov quest boosting, misti.services Tarkov, EFT piloted boosting, EFT selfplay boost, EFT express boost, EFT secure manual service, Tarkov progression service, EFT objective completion, Customs map quest boost, EFT Punisher chain completion', 'https://kdjlhibxxygfdmlvdfcl.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/game-images/eft-prapor-quests-boost-1765925713706.webp', NULL, 'Eft Prapor Quests Boost', 'EFT Prapor Quests Boost | misti.services', NULL);
INSERT INTO public.products (id, name, slug, short_description, description, how_it_works, requirements, base_price, image_url, badge_text, trust_score, total_reviews, is_active, is_featured, sort_order, created_at, updated_at, category_id, is_slider_product, slider_config, is_manually_popular, total_sales, start_time_text, start_time_value, delivery_text, delivery_value, meta_description, meta_keywords, og_image, canonical_url, image_alt_text, meta_title, parent_link) VALUES ('5b7a773f-10ee-4feb-8abb-56ee74a646f9', 'Challenge Mode Gold Pack', 'challenge-mode-gold-pack', 'Complete all MoP Challenge Modes with Gold medals. Earn exclusive transmog, mounts, and titles safely with our expert boosting team.', '<h1><strong>MoP Classic Challenge Mode Gold Pack</strong></h1><h3>Earn Gold Medals and Unlock Exclusive Rewards</h3><p>Buy the <strong>WoW Pandaria Classic </strong><a href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/guide/dungeons/challenge-modes-overview" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank"><strong>Challenge Mode</strong></a><strong> Gold Pack</strong> from Misti Services to complete all Challenge Mode dungeons with guaranteed Gold times. Our professional boosting team will help you achieve the <strong>Challenge Conqueror: Gold</strong> achievement, class-specific transmog sets, mounts, and titles without the need for endless retries or stressful time limits.</p><p>Challenge Modes in Mists of Pandaria Classic focus on skill, teamwork, and precision. Gear is scaled to a fixed level, making player coordination and execution more important than item strength. With Misti Services, you can secure every reward efficiently and safely.</p><h3>What’s Included</h3><ul><li>Completion of all nine Challenge Mode dungeons with Gold rating</li><li>Full class-themed transmog set with unique visual effects</li><li>Challenge Conqueror: Gold achievement</li><li>The Undaunted title</li><li>Nine dungeon teleports</li><li>Ancestral Phoenix Egg mount token with your choice of Ashen, Emerald, Violet, or Crimson Pandaren Phoenix</li></ul><h3>Boost Options</h3><p><strong>Piloted Boost</strong></p><p>A professional booster logs into your account and completes the Gold Challenge Modes for you.</p><p><strong>Selfplay Boost</strong></p><p>Join our skilled team and complete the runs together, guided by experienced players who ensure success.</p><p><strong>Remote Control Boost</strong></p><p>Our booster connects through a secure remote control app such as Parsec, allowing you to watch every action live.</p><h3>About the MoP Classic Challenge Mode Gold Pack</h3><p>Challenge Modes are timed five-player dungeons where gear is normalized to ensure fairness. Success depends on mastering your class, optimizing group coordination, and executing perfect strategies. Each dungeon requires teamwork and communication to achieve Gold times.</p><p>The nine Challenge Mode dungeons include Gate of the Setting Sun, Mogu’shan Palace, Scarlet Halls, Scarlet Monastery, Scholomance, Shado-Pan Monastery, Siege of Niuzao Temple, Stormstout Brewery, and Temple of the Jade Serpent.</p><h3>Gold Medal Rewards</h3><p>Completing all Challenge Modes with Gold medals unlocks exclusive content, including:</p><ul><li>The Challenge Conqueror: Gold achievement</li><li>Unique class-specific transmog sets with striking visual effects</li><li>The Undaunted title</li><li>Dungeon teleports for faster travel</li><li>The Ancestral Phoenix Egg, which grants a choice of four Pandaren Phoenix mounts</li></ul><p>These rewards are highly prestigious and symbolize mastery in Pandaria Classic dungeons.</p><h3>Why Choose the Gold Pack</h3><p><strong>Prestigious Rewards</strong> – Earn class-specific transmog sets, rare mounts, and exclusive achievements.</p><p><strong>Guaranteed Gold Completion</strong> – Our expert team ensures you achieve Gold times in all dungeons.</p><p><strong>Skill-Based Gameplay</strong> – Experience true teamwork and precision-based content without relying on overpowered gear.</p><p><strong>Safe and Reliable</strong> – All boosts are completed securely by trusted professionals.</p><p><strong>Perfect for Collectors</strong> – Ideal for players chasing legacy achievements and exclusive cosmetic items.</p><h3>Why Choose Misti Services</h3><p>Misti Services provides professional, secure World of Warcraft boosting solutions trusted by thousands of players. We guarantee safety, efficiency, and top-tier customer support. Get your <strong>MoP Classic Challenge Mode Gold Pack</strong> today and unlock the most prestigious rewards in Pandaria Classic.</p>', '<ul><li>Select your desired options and complete your order on&nbsp;Misti.Services.</li><li>You’ll receive an order confirmation and tracking number via email.</li><li>Our support manager will contact you through live chat to confirm all details.</li><li>If you’re unavailable, we’ll reach out via email or your preferred contact method.</li><li>When the boost is finished, you’ll receive a completion notification on Discord or another messenger of your choice.</li></ul>', '<ul><li>Active World of Warcraft subscription</li><li>Level 90 character</li></ul><p>Need help reaching level 90? Try our&nbsp;<a href="https://misti.services/game/wow-mistsofpandaria-classic" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank" style="color: rgb(60, 113, 221);">WoW Power Leveling Boost</a>&nbsp;</p>', 69, 'https://kdjlhibxxygfdmlvdfcl.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/game-images/challenge-mode-gold-pack-1762549408186.webp', NULL, 4.9, 350, true, true, 0, '2025-10-31T16:52:44.559284+00:00', '2025-12-16T07:54:39.295044+00:00', 'cfe09cfd-59e3-467e-bbcd-f3b0373cdc84', false, NULL, true, 0, '15 minutes', 'average start time', '3 days', 'order completion', 'Complete all MoP Challenge Modes with Gold medals. Earn exclusive transmog, mounts, and titles safely with our expert boosting team.', 'mists of pandaria challenge mode boost, mop challenge mode gold carry, wow mop gold cm, buy mop challenge mode boost, mop challenge mode transmog unlock, mop challenge mode mounts service, challenge mode gold title boost, professional mop cm team, fast mop challenge mode completion, secure mop challenge mode boost, mop cm gold farming, cheap mop challenge mode boost', 'https://kdjlhibxxygfdmlvdfcl.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/game-images/challenge-mode-gold-pack-1762549408186.webp', NULL, 'Challenge Mode Gold Pack', 'MoP Classic Gold CM Boost | misti.services', NULL);
