ing the boost kept on your account</li><li>Reputation gains with the BTR Driver, improving prices and expanding available services</li></ul><h2><strong>Why Choose misti.services for Tarkov Boosting</strong></h2><ul><li>Our boosters are seasoned Streets of Tarkov players who understand every BTR spawn, route and interaction</li><li>All services are 100% manual and secure, with VPN and other safety measures used where appropriate</li><li>We keep you updated via chat or Discord, and can adapt the plan to your specific needs or quest priorities</li><li>misti.services closely follows every Tarkov update, so we always know the most efficient methods for new traders and systems</li></ul><p>Let <strong>misti.services</strong> handle your <strong>BTR Driver quests</strong> so you can focus on enjoying Tarkov with upgraded APC support, cheaper rides and powerful new tactical options across the city.</p>', '<ul><li><strong>Select your quests</strong> – Choose the BTR Driver quests you want done and place your order on misti.services.</li><li><strong>Assignment</strong> – We assign an experienced Tarkov veteran who specializes in Streets of Tarkov and BTR gameplay.</li><li><strong>Execution</strong> – Your booster completes the required missions: clearing routes, securing objectives and gathering vehicle parts.</li><li><strong>Completion</strong> – The selected BTR Driver quests are finished, unlocking discounts, new options and reputation gains.</li><li><strong>Notification</strong> – You are notified as soon as the work is complete so you can log in and enjoy the upgraded APC services.</li><li><strong>Play with benefits</strong> – Travel across Tarkov’s deadliest maps more safely and cheaply using your improved BTR access.</li></ul>', '<ul><li>Escape from Tarkov purchased on your account</li><li>Desired BTR Driver quests unlocked and available</li></ul>', 1.99, 'https://kdjlhibxxygfdmlvdfcl.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/game-images/eft-btr-driver-quests-boost-176592433