><li>Affliction Warlock</li></ul><p><strong>The Highlord''s Return – Highlord Kruul</strong></p><ul><li>Blood Death Knight</li><li>Vengeance Demon Hunter</li><li>Guardian Druid</li><li>Brewmaster Monk</li><li>Protection Paladin</li><li>Protection Warrior</li></ul><p><strong>End of the Risen Threat – Lord Erdris Thorn</strong></p><ul><li>Restoration Druid</li><li>Mistweaver Monk</li><li>Holy Paladin</li><li>Holy Priest</li><li>Restoration Shaman</li></ul><h2><strong>Get Your Tower Overwhelming Boost Today</strong></h2><p>Stop wasting weeks on Mage Tower challenges. Buy the <strong>Tower Overwhelming Boost</strong> now with <strong>account sharing</strong> or <strong>remote control</strong>, and secure your <strong>Tower Overwhelming meta-achievement</strong>, mounts, transmog sets, and achievements quickly and safely.</p>', '<ul><li>Select your desired boost options and complete your order payment.</li><li>Receive your <strong>order number</strong> and email confirmation.</li><li>Our support manager will contact you via website chat, or if unavailable, we’ll reach out by email or other methods.</li><li>Provide any necessary details, and we’ll assign a suitable booster.</li><li>Share your game account or character credentials for the booster to start.</li><li>Once the boost is completed, you’ll receive a notification via <strong>Discord</strong> or your preferred messenger.</li><li>Relax and enjoy the rewards as your characters achieve every Mage Tower milestone.</li><li><strong>Leave a review on Trustpilot – your feedback helps us maintain the best boosting service.</strong></li></ul>', '<ul><li><strong>Level 80 Characters</strong> – Don’t have one yet? Use our <a href="https://misti.services/game/warwithin/leveling" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank"><strong>WoW Power Leveling Boost</strong></a> to reach max level fast.</li></ul>', 112.24, 'https://kdjlhibxxygfdmlvdfcl.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/game-images/8fwt9y6e1z5.webp', NULL, 4.9, 0, true, fal