 Our Mechanic Quests Boost</strong></h2><ul><li>Any Mechanic quest completed, whether it is one specific job or the entire questline</li><li>The full Gunsmith series handled, with all weapon parts sourced and every required build assembled correctly</li><li>Steady increase in Mechanic loyalty, opening higher tiers of his shop and more powerful weapon options</li><li>All quest rewards kept on your account, including roubles, XP, reputation, items and fully modded weapons</li></ul><h2><strong>Why Choose misti.services for Tarkov Boosting</strong></h2><ul><li>Our boosters are true build specialists who know what each Gunsmith task requires and how to complete it efficiently</li><li>All services are performed manually and securely; no cheats, bots or unsafe software are ever used</li><li>We use smart, cost-effective routes and barters to limit wasted roubles while still meeting every requirement</li><li>24/7 support via chat or Discord to help you design a custom package for the exact Mechanic quests you want finished</li><li>misti.services has years of experience solving Tarkov’s hardest questlines for thousands of players, making us a reliable choice when you are stuck</li></ul><p>Let <strong>misti.services</strong> handle your <strong>Mechanic quests</strong> so you can skip the confusing weapon builds, unlock top-tier mods and focus on playing Tarkov with perfectly tuned guns.</p>', '<ul><li><strong>Choose your quests</strong> – Select the Mechanic quests you are stuck on, from Gunsmith parts to advanced tech tasks, and place your order on misti.services.</li><li><strong>Assignment</strong> – We assign a Tarkov veteran who specializes in weapon building and knows all important technical item spawns.</li><li><strong>Execution</strong> – Your booster builds the required weapon presets, farms rare components and completes the objectives across Tarkov’s maps.</li><li><strong>Completion</strong> – The selected Mechanic quests are finished, unlocking new weapon parts, barters and follow-up tasks.</li><li><strong>Notification</strong> – You receive an update as soon as the boost is done and all rewards are available to claim.</li><li><strong>Enjoy the results</strong> – Log in, collect your rewards and start using Mechanic’s inventory to create powerful, optimized guns.</li></ul>', '<ul><li>Escape from Tarkov purchased and accessible on your account</li><li>Desired Mechanic quests must be unlocked and available</li></ul>', 1.99, 'https://kdjlhibxxygfdmlvdfcl.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/game-images/eft-mechanic-quests-boost-1765925031888.webp', NULL, 4.9, 0, true, true, 0, '2025-12-14T19:21:37.255793+00:00', '2025-12-16T23:08:32.288962+00:00', 'ad312297-e28b-4185-8694-55f8078c94b1', false, NULL, true, 0, '15 minutes', 'average start time', 'Flexible', 'order completion', 'Skip Gunsmith pain with our EFT Mechanic Quests Boost on misti.services. Pros finish tech tasks, unlock weapon mods, ammo and fast progress toward Bitcoin Farm.', 'EFT Mechanic quests boost, Escape from Tarkov Mechanic quests, Mechanic questline boost, EFT Gunsmith quests carry, Gunsmith series completion, EFT weapon build quests, Tarkov technical quests, EFT rare tech item farm, Mechanic loyalty level boost, EFT LL4 Mechanic, EFT weapon mods unlock, Tarkov suppressor unlock service, EFT high capacity magazines, Bitcoin Farm unlock help, EFT Hideout upgrade boost, Escape from Tarkov trader boosting, EFT barters and crafts, EFT meta weapon parts, Tarkov cost effective builds, EFT questline completion service, EFT piloted boost, EFT selfplay boost, EFT stream option boost, misti.services Tarkov, buy Tarkov boosts, EFT secure manual boosting, Tarkov professional boosters, EFT Rouble efficient builds, EFT progression service, Escape from Tarkov account services, EFT complex weapon preset help, Tarkov item hunt boost, EFT fast quest completion', 'https://kdjlhibxxygfdmlvdfcl.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/game-images/eft-mechanic-quests-boost-1765925031888.webp', NULL, 'Eft Mechanic Quests Boost', 'EFT Mechanic Quests Boost | misti.services', NULL);
