s unique gameplay benefits, from crafting powerful gear and consumables to gathering valuable materials.</p><p>Leveling professions manually can be time-consuming due to material farming and recipe requirements. Our <strong>Professions Leveling Boost</strong> service eliminates this grind, providing fast, reliable, and optimized leveling for any chosen profession.</p><h3>Why Choose misti.services</h3><ul><li><p>Fast leveling up to 300 skill</p></li><li><p>Secure, manual service — no bots or third-party tools</p></li><li><p>Full transparency with regular updates</p></li><li><p>Experienced boosters with deep profession knowledge</p></li><li><p>24/7 friendly customer support</p></li></ul><p>Order your <strong>WoW Classic Era Professions Leveling Boost</strong> today at <strong>misti.services</strong> and enjoy fully maxed professions without the grind.</p>', '<ul><li>Select your desired options and complete your order on&nbsp;Misti.Services.</li><li>You’ll receive an order confirmation and tracking number via email.</li><li>Our support manager will contact you through live chat to confirm all details.</li><li>If you’re unavailable, we’ll reach out via email or your preferred contact method.</li><li>When the boost is finished, you’ll receive a completion notification on Discord or another messenger of your choice.</li></ul>', '<ul><li><p>Level 60 character</p></li><li><p>Active World of Warcraft subscription</p></li><li><p>Non-hardcore mode only</p></li></ul><p>Need help reaching level 60? Try our&nbsp;<a target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" href="https://misti.services/game/wow-classic-era/leveling">WoW Power Leveling Boost&nbsp;</a></p>', 0.95, 'https://kdjlhibxxygfdmlvdfcl.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/game-images/professions-1763144227623.webp', NULL, 4.9, 0, true, true, 0, '2025-10-27T02:43:32.754639+00:00', '2026-01-14T22:20:46.039013+00:00', '6d614745-bd60-4cb9-8ae6-3eb89a016056', true, '{"step":5,"end_label":"Desired Profession Skill Level","max_value":300,"min_value":1,"default_end":300,"start_label":"Current Profession Skill Level","default_start":1,"pricing_brackets":[{"end":300,"price":10,"start":1}],"estimated_time_per_step":0.2}', true, 0, '15 minutes', 'average start time', '1 day', 'order completion', 'Buy WoW Classic Fresh Professions Leveling boost from misti.services to get any profession leveled to 300 fast, safely, and hassle-free.', 'wow classic fresh professions, professions leveling boost, wow classic profession 300, buy wow classic professions, misti.services professions, classic wow profession boost, fast professions wow classic, safe professions leveling, hassle-free wow professions, wow classic max profession, level 300 profession boost, classic wow crafting boost, professional wow leveling, cheap wow professions boost', 'https://kdjlhibxxygfdmlvdfcl.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/game-images/professions-1763144227623.webp', NULL, 'Professions', 'WoW Classic Professions Boost | misti.services', NULL);
INSERT INTO public.products (id, name, slug, short_description, description, how_it_works, requirements, base_price, image_url, badge_text, trust_score, total_reviews, is_active, is_featured, sort_order, created_at, updated_at, category_id, is_slider_product, slider_config, is_manually_popular, total_sales, start_time_text, start_time_value, delivery_text, delivery_value, meta_description, meta_keywords, og_image, canonical_url, image_alt_text, meta_title, parent_link) VALUES ('e27aa70f-b220-4727-a440-28721d60c0b4', 'Terror of the Wastes', 'terror-of-the-wastes', 'The Terror of the Wastes is the ultimate flying mount reward for dedicated champions in The War Within Patch 11.2. This menacing, insectoid void flyer is the pinnacle of the K''aresh Trust faction rewards, requiring players to reach the near-maximum Renown Rank 19.', '<h1><strong>Terror of the Wastes Mount Boost</strong></h1><p><strong>Tame the void-touched sky. Unlock the Terror of the Wastes and master the K''aresh Trust faction without the months-long reputation grind.</strong></p><p>The <strong>Terror of the Wastes</strong> is the ultimate flying mount reward for dedicated champions in <em>The War Within</em> Patch 11.2. This menacing, insectoid void flyer is the pinnacle of the <strong>K''aresh Trust</strong> faction rewards, requiring players to reach the near-maximum <strong>Renown Rank 19</strong>.</p><p>Achieving this high rank is a massive time commitment, often taking 3-4 months of consistent weekly gameplay, daily quests, and world events. On top of the reputation, you must also farm <strong>11,375 Resonance Crystals</strong> to purchase the mount from the quartermaster.</p><p>With <strong>misti.services</strong>, you can skip the time-gating. Our professional team will handle the entire reputation progression and currency farming process, ensuring you reach Renown 19 and add this exclusive void flyer to your collection efficiently.</p><h2><strong>Service Includes</strong></h2><p>When you purchase the <strong>Terror of the Wastes Carry</strong>, we handle the complete Renown and currency farming process. The service guarantees:</p><ul><li><strong>The Mount:</strong> Terror of the Wastes permanently added to your collection.</li><li><strong>The Reputation:</strong> Reaching <strong>Renown Rank 19</strong> with the <strong>K''aresh Trust</strong> faction.</li><li><strong>The Currency:</strong> Farming of <strong>11,375 Resonance Crystals</strong> required to purchase the mount.</li><li><strong>Bonus Unlocks:</strong> Access to other high-value rewards along the way, including the <strong>Ruby Void Creeper</strong> (Renown 15) and the <strong>Ethereal Augment Rune</strong> (Renown 18).</li><li><strong>Loot Rights:</strong> You keep all gold, gear, and resources looted during the farming process.</li><li><strong>Manual Service:</strong> 100% hand-played by experienced boosters.</li></ul><h2><strong>Terror of the Wastes: All Information</strong></h2><p>The Terror of the Wastes is a unique flying mount that utilizes dynamic flight mechanics. It is sold by <strong>Om''sirik</strong> in Tazavesh but is strictly locked behind <strong>Renown 19</strong> with the K''aresh Trust.</p><p><strong>The Grind:</strong> The K''aresh Trust reputation is time-gated, meaning you can only earn a limited amount of Renown per week through "Warrants" and the "Ecological Succession" weekly quests. This makes the mount a long-term goal that cannot be rushed by normal means.</p><p><strong>Why choose our boost?</strong> Our team maximizes every possible source of reputation daily, including rare spawns, world quests, and contract bonuses. We optimize the route to shorten the completion time significantly compared to casual play. By reaching Renown 19, you not only get the Terror of the Wastes but also unlock the ability to purchase the <strong>Ruby Void Creeper</strong> (Renown 15) and the permanent <strong>Ethereal Augment Rune</strong> (Renown 18), making this boost incredibly high value for your character''s power and collection.</p><h2><strong>Boost Options Explained</strong></h2><p>We offer two secure methods to deliver your mount:</p><ul><li><strong>Piloted:</strong> Our professional player logs into your account to complete the boost. We utilize strict security protocols, including VPNs matching your country, to ensure your account remains safe and flagged as a local login.</li><li><strong>Remote Control:</strong> For the highest level of security, our booster connects to your PC via a secure application like Parsec. They play the game using your mouse and keyboard while you watch the stream live. Your login credentials are never shared.</li></ul>', '<ul><li><strong>Select Options:</strong> Choose your preferred boost method (Piloted or Remote Control).</li><li><strong>Order Confirmation:</strong> After payment, you will receive an order number and email confirmation.</li><li><strong>Contact:</strong> Our support manager will reach out via Live Chat or Discord to verify your details.</li><li><strong>Assignment:</strong> We assign a professional booster specializing in K''aresh reputation farming.</li><li><strong>Completion:</strong> The booster farms the required Renown and Resonance Crystals until the Terror of the Wastes is purchased and added to your collection.</li><li><strong>Enjoy:</strong> We notify you immediately upon completion.</li></ul>', '<ul><li><strong>Level:</strong> Level 80 Character.</li><li><strong>Expansion:</strong> The War Within active.</li><li><strong>Account:</strong> Active World of Warcraft subscription.</li></ul>', 50.15, 'https://kdjlhibxxygfdmlvdfcl.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/game-images/terror-of-the-wastes-1763928587514.webp', NULL, 4.9, 0, true, true, 0, '2025-11-22T19:19:14.786045+00:00', '2025-12-16T07:22:37.63089+00:00', 'b4c0ccaf-a937-4b30-9ab4-7dacee8f739b', false, NULL, true, 0, '15 minutes', 'average start time', 'Flexible', 'order completion', 'Dominate the dunes on the Terror of the Wastes mount. Avoid tedious farming and get a pro-handled carry from misti.services.', 'terror of the wastes mount, war within patch 11.2 mount, insectoid void flyer, k''aresh trust renown 19, war within flying mount, terror of the wastes farm, wow 11.2 mounts, k''aresh trust rewards, terror of the wastes boost, war within renown farm, insect void mount, terror of the wastes buy, wow void flyer, war within ultimate mount, terror of the wastes service', 'https://kdjlhibxxygfdmlvdfcl.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/game-images/terror-of-the-wastes-1763928587514.webp', NULL, 'Game gaming service - Terror of the Wastes', 'Terror of Wastes Mount - War Within | misti.services', NULL);
INSERT INTO public.products (id, name, slug, short_description, description, how_it_works, requirements, base_price, image_url, badge_text, trust_score, total_reviews, is_active, is_featured, sort_order, created_at, updated_at, category_id, is_slider_product, slider_config, is_manually_popular, total_sales, start_time_text, start_time_value, delivery_text, delivery_value, meta_description, meta_keywords, og_image, canonical_url, image_alt_text, meta_title, parent_link) VALUES ('58004f5d-799a-43da-92d7-23994c13f4ff', 'Ragman Quests', 'eft-ragman-quests-boost', 'Increase your survivability in Tarkov with the EFT Ragman Quests Boost from misti.services. Instead of grinding through awkward “found in raid” clothing tasks and risky close-quarters fights on Interchange, our experts complete Ragman’s quests for you. This service is designed to unlock class 5 and 6 armor, premium rigs and huge backpacks so you can stop dying in budget gear and start winning fights.', '<h1><strong>Escape from Tarkov Ragman Quests Completion Boost</strong></h1><p>Increase your survivability in Tarkov with the <strong>EFT Ragman Quests Boost</strong> from <strong>misti.services</strong>. Instead of grinding through awkward “found in raid” clothing tasks and risky close-quarters fights on Interchange, our experts complete Ragman’s quests for you. This service is designed to unlock class 5 and 6 armor, premium rigs and huge backpacks so you can stop dying in budget gear and start winning fights.</p><h2><strong>Service Includes</strong></h2><ul><li>Any Ragman quest completion, from simple delivery tasks to advanced combat missions</li><li>Progress toward unlocking the best class 5 and 6 armor, top helmets and meta tactical rigs</li><li>All difficult “found in raid” clothing quests and gear-restricted PMC kill tasks handled for you</li><li>Significant survivability boost and progress toward Kappa requirements</li><li>A professional service run by Tarkov veterans familiar with every dangerous corner of Interchange</li></ul><h3><strong>Boost Options Explained</strong></h3><ul><li><strong>Piloted</strong> – Our booster logs into your account and completes the selected Ragman quests for you.</li><li><strong>Selfplay</strong> – You join our booster in a squad while they guide you through the objectives.</li><li><strong>Stream</strong> – Optional live stream so you can watch how each quest is completed.</li></ul><h3><strong>About EFT Ragman Quests</strong></h3><p>The <strong>Ragman questline</strong> is focused on apparel, armor and tactical gear. As Tarkov’s outfitter, Ragman sends you on missions to secure specific clothing, armor sets and equipment, often deep inside the Interchange mall where PvP is constant.</p><p>The <strong>EFT Ragman Quests Boost</strong> from misti.services is the safest and most efficient way to clear this questline so you can focus on playing with top-tier protection instead of endlessly chasing jackets and mannequins.</p><h3><strong>Why Ragman Quests Are Vital for Survival</strong></h3><p>In Tarkov, survival often comes down to the armor you are wearing. Ragman controls access to:</p><ul><li>Class 4, 5 and 6 body armor including popular meta vests</li><li>High-end helmets with strong protection and attachment options</li><li>Tactical rigs with many slots and smart layouts</li><li>Massive backpacks that let you extract far more loot per raid</li></ul><p>Without a leveled Ragman, you are stuck with weaker options and constantly outmatched in gunfights. His quests can be time-consuming and risky, especially when you are forced to fight in the cramped shops and hallways of Interchange.</p><h3><strong>What You Get with Our Ragman Boost</strong></h3><ul><li>Any Ragman quest completed, from collecting specific outfits for “The Stylish One” to multi-stage combat missions</li><li>Interchange and other high-risk missions done safely by experienced players who know the map and its spawns</li><li>Fast increase in Ragman loyalty, moving you toward Loyalty Level 4 and his best armor and rigs</li><li>All quest rewards kept on your account: XP, roubles, reputation, clothing and any extra loot gained during the quests</li></ul><h3><strong>Why Choose misti.services for Tarkov Boosting</strong></h3><ul><li>Our boosters are Interchange specialists who know every route, flank and safe approach inside ULTRA mall</li><li>All quests are completed one hundred percent manually with no cheats, bots or unsafe tools</li><li>Responsive 24/7 support via chat or Discord, ready to help design a custom package for any Ragman quests you are stuck on</li><li>With thousands of successful quest completions across multiple wipes, misti.services is a trusted partner for leveling traders and upgrading your account</li></ul><p>Let <strong>misti.services</strong> handle your <strong>Ragman quests</strong> so you can quickly unlock top-tier armor, rigs and backpacks, dramatically improving your chances of surviving and profiting from every raid.</p>', '<ul><li>Select the Ragman quests you want completed, from fashion-style tasks to Interchange missions, and place your order on misti.services.</li><li>We assign a Tarkov veteran who knows exactly where to find rare clothing, armor and rigs, and who understands Interchange inside and out.</li><li>The booster equips the required gear, completes kill and survival objectives, and retrieves or plants all required items in ULTRA mall and other locations.</li><li>Your chosen Ragman quests are completed, unlocking access to stronger armor, tactical rigs and large backpacks.</li><li>You receive a notification when the boost is finished and the new items become available from Ragman’s inventory.</li><li>You log in geared for success, with better protection and storage options for future raids.</li></ul>', '<ul><li>Escape from Tarkov purchased and accessible on your account</li><li>Desired Ragman quests must be unlocked and available</li></ul>', 1.99, 'https://kdjlhibxxygfdmlvdfcl.supabase.co/storage/v1