ong>Boost Options Explained</strong></h3><ul><li><strong>Piloted</strong> – Our booster plays on your account and completes selected Skier quests for you.</li><li><strong>Selfplay</strong> – You squad up with our booster while they guide you through each objective.</li><li><strong>Stream</strong> – Optional live stream so you can watch how your quests are completed.</li></ul><h3><strong>About EFT Skier Quests</strong></h3><p>The <strong>Skier questline</strong> is a core part of early and mid-game progression in Escape from Tarkov. His jobs revolve around:</p><ul><li>Delivering rare items</li><li>Eliminating specific targets</li><li>Completing secret stashing missions in contested areas</li></ul><p>Because Skier operates in the shadows, many of his tasks involve risky zones and awkward gear or reputation choices. The <strong>EFT Skier Quests Boost</strong> from misti.services is designed to push you through these hurdles quickly so you can focus on playing with upgraded gear.</p><h3><strong>Why Skier Quests Are Essential</strong></h3><p>Skier is crucial for anyone serious about building meta weapons. Completing his quests:</p><ul><li>Unlocks a wide range of Western and Russian weapon attachments, suppressors and mounts</li><li>Opens access to popular armor and useful combat equipment</li><li>Progresses “Friend from the West,” which is required to unlock the Peacekeeper trader and his entire inventory</li><li>Removes major roadblocks such as the notorious <strong>Stirrup</strong> pistol quest and the hunt for “found in raid” flash drives</li></ul><p>Without Skier, your weapon modding options stay limited, and your wipe progression slows dramatically.</p><h3><strong>What You Get with Our Skier Boost</strong></h3><ul><li>Any Skier quest completed, from Stirrup to late-game contracts like “What’s on the Flash Drive”</li><li>All “found in raid” items sourced by our pros, including flash drives, chemicals and other rare quest items</li><li>Fast increase in Skier loyalty and access to his full inventory, plus unlock of the Peacekeeper questline when applicable</li><li>All rewards stay on your account: roubles, euros, XP, items and reputation from every completed quest</li></ul><h3><strong>Why Choose misti.services for Tarkov Boosting</strong></h3><ul><li>Our boosters are versatile Tarkov players, equally skilled at farming rare loot and completing high-pressure combat scenarios</li><li>Every service is performed one hundred percent manually with safe methods only—no cheats, bots or third-party software</li><li>24/7 live support via chat or Discord to help you build a custom package for any Skier quests blocking your progress</li><li>misti.services has a proven history of helping thousands of players break through major quest walls and fully unlock their traders</li></ul><p>Let <strong>misti.services</strong> handle your <strong>Skier quests</strong> so you can unlock elite weapon mods, expand your stash and focus on playing Tarkov with fully optimized gear.</p>', '<ul><li>Choose the Skier quests you want to skip, from flash drive hunts to reputation-sensitive jobs, and place your order on misti.services.</li><li>We assign an experienced Tarkov operative who knows all high-value loot routes, stash spots and safe rotations.</li><li>The booster secures rare items such as flash drives, completes stash and delivery objectives in high-traffic areas and eliminates required targets to fulfill Skier’s contracts.</li><li>Your selected Skier quests are completed, unlocking his exclusive inventory of high-end weapon mods, suppressors and firearms.</li><li>You receive a notification when your deal with Skier is finished and the boost is fully complete.</li><li>Log in and start building powerful, fully-modded weapons without being blocked by annoying quests.</li></ul><p><br></p>', '<ul><li>Escape from Tarkov purchased and accessible on your account</li><li>Desired Skier quests must be unlocked and available</li></ul><p><br></p>', 1.99, 'https://kdjlhibxxygfdmlvdfcl.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/game-images/eft-skier-quests-boost-1765926136511.webp', NULL, 4.9, 0, true, true, 0, '2025-12-13T17:42:44.40952+00:00', '2025-12-16T23:08:38.810792+00:00', 'ad312297-e28b-4185-8694-55f8078c94b1', false, NULL, true, 0, '15 minutes', 'average start time', 'Flexible', 'order completion', 'Unlock meta weapons fast with our EFT Skier Quests Boost on misti.services. Pros clear stash missions, farm flash drives and unlock Peacekeeper and top mods safely.', 'EFT Skier quests boost, Escape from Tarkov Skier quests, Skier questline boost, Tarkov Skier carry, Stirrup quest help, What’s on the Flash Drive boost, EFT flash drive farm, EFT found in raid items, Skier reputation boost, Skier loyalty level 4, EFT LL4 Skier, Peacekeeper unlock quest, Friend from the West boost, EFT weapon case unlock, THICC weapon case unlock, EFT meta weapon builds, best weapon attachments Tarkov, EFT suppressor unlock, EFT Western weapon mods, EFT Russian weapon mods, Tarkov stash organization, EFT early game progression, EFT mid game progression, Escape from Tarkov quest boosting, misti.services Tarkov, EFT piloted boost, EFT selfplay boost, EFT express boost, EFT secure manual service, Tarkov stash missions, EFT secret stashing quests, Skier contracts completion, EFT rare item farming', 'https://kdjlhibxxygfdmlvdfcl.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/game-images/eft-skier-quests-boost-1765926136511.webp', NULL, 'Eft Skier Quests Boost', 'EFT Skier Quests Boost - Fast | misti.services', NULL);
