ecute the necessary heroic dungeon and raid runs, focusing on reaching your target badge count and securing potential pre-BiS gear.</p></li><li><p>You will receive a notification once the target badge count is achieved and your currency is ready for vendor purchases.</p></li><li><p>Enjoy your stacked Badges of Justice and optimized character, ready for epic gear upgrades.</p></li></ul><p></p>', '<ul>
