kers and retrieval of quest items in high-risk zones</li><li>Fast and secure boosting focused on early- and mid-wipe progression</li></ul><h3><strong>Boost Options Explained</strong></h3><ul><li><strong>Piloted</strong> – Our booster plays on your account and completes the selected Therapist quests for you.</li><li><strong>Selfplay</strong> – You join our booster in a squad while they guide you and help complete the objectives.</li><li><strong>Stream</strong> – Optional live stream so you can watch the entire process in real time.</li></ul><h3><strong>About EFT Therapist Quests</strong></h3><p>The <strong>Therapist questline</strong> is one of the core progress paths in Escape from Tarkov. Her tasks focus on medical supplies, intelligence gathering and humanitarian support, and many of them depend heavily on RNG with strict “found in raid” requirements. Completing these quests is essential for:</p><ul><li>Unlocking the strongest healing items and surgical kits</li><li>Gaining access to high-capacity containers</li><li>Progressing the main quest storyline and other trader chains</li></ul><p>The <strong>EFT Therapist Quests Boost</strong> from misti.services is built to bypass the worst of the RNG and repetition so you can quickly move on to more important parts of the wipe.</p><h3><strong>Why Therapist Quests Are Essential</strong></h3><p>No matter how you play Tarkov, completing Therapist’s quests is almost mandatory. Raising her Loyalty Level is the only reliable way to:</p><ul><li>Buy top-tier medical supplies such as Grizzly medical kits and Surv12 surgical kits</li><li>Purchase Items Cases, Meds Cases and the THICC Items Case to fix your stash space problems</li><li>Unlock quests and requirements for other traders and endgame progression</li></ul><p>Skipping or delaying her chain slows down your entire account. Getting it done early through a professional boost gives you a major advantage for the rest of the wipe.</p><h3><strong>What You Get with Our Therapist Boost</strong></h3><ul><li>Any Therapist quest completed, from basic “Shortage” tasks to complex late-chain objectives</li><li>All “found in raid” items sourced by our pros using efficient routes and high-value locations</li><li>Rapid increase in Therapist loyalty, with a clear path toward Loyalty Level 4</li><li>You keep all quest rewards, including XP, roubles, reputation and valuable items gained along the way</li></ul><h3><strong>Why Choose misti.services for Tarkov Boosting</strong></h3><ul><li>Our boosters have deep knowledge of loot tables, medical spawns and key locations needed for every Therapist quest</li><li>All services are one hundred percent manual, with no cheats, bots or third-party programs involved</li><li>Responsive support via chat or Discord, with the option to create custom packages for specific quests you are stuck on</li><li>misti.services is built on years of experience completing the hardest grinds in online games, making us a reliable choice for EFT quest boosting</li></ul><p>Let the misti.services team handle your <strong>Therapist questline</strong>, while you enjoy the benefits of top-tier meds, bigger containers and clean progression through Tarkov.</p>', '<ul><li>Select the Therapist quests you need completed, from simple item deliveries to tasks in high-risk areas, and place your order on misti.services.</li><li>We assign a seasoned EFT specialist who knows the best spawn locations for rare medical items and the safest routes.</li><li>The booster farms all necessary meds and quest items, completes planting tasks in contested locations such as Shoreline Resort, and turns everything in.</li><li>Your selected Therapist quests are finished, unlocking better medical items, character health bonuses and further questlines.</li><li>You receive a notification once the boost is complete and all rewards are ready to claim.</li><li>You log in to enjoy permanent character upgrades, stronger meds, more stash space and smoother progression.</li></ul>', '<ul><li>Escape from Tarkov purchased on your account</li><li>Desired Therapist quests must be unlocked and available</li></ul>', 1.99, 'https://kdjlhibxxygfdmlvdfcl.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/game-images/eft-therapist-quests-boost-1765926217656.webp', NULL, 4.9, 0, true, true, 0, '2025-12-10T18:15:34.080662+00:00', '2025-12-16T23:08:43.028202+00:00', 'ad312297-e28b-4185-8694-55f8078c94b1', false, NULL, true, 0, '15 minutes', 'average start time', 'Flexible', 'order completion', 'Skip the medical grind with our EFT Therapist Quests Boost on misti.services. We complete found in raid tasks, level Therapist and unlock stash upgrades.', 'EFT Therapist quests boost, Escape from Tarkov Therapist quests, Therapist questline boost, EFT early wipe boost, Tarkov medical quests carry, EFT found in raid items, Therapist loyalty level boost, EFT LL4 Therapist, Tarkov items case unlock, Tarkov THICC items case boost, EFT meds case unlock, Escape from Tarkov quest boosting, misti.services Tarkov, EFT piloted boost, EFT selfplay boost, EFT stream boost, EFT secure boosting service, Tarkov stash space upgrade, EFT medical items farm, EFT shoreline resort quests, Therapist Shortage quest help, EFT early game progression, Tarkov humanitarian supplies quests, EFT medical containers unlock, Tarkov Surv12 kit unlock, Grizzly kit unlock service, EFT questline completion, EFT trader reputation boost, Tarkov early wipe progression, EFT RNG quest help, Escape from Tarkov services, EFT marker placement tasks, Tarkov high danger zones carry, EFT safe quest completion', 'https://kdjlhibxxygfdmlvdfcl.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/game-images/eft-therapist-quests-boost-1765926217656.webp', NULL, 'Eft Therapist Quests Boost', 'EFT Therapist Quests Boost | misti.services', NULL);
