hallenge is completed.</li></ul><h3><strong>About Jaeger Quests</strong></h3><p>The <strong>Jaeger questline</strong> is one of the most demanding sets of tasks in Escape from Tarkov. Designed to test survival skills, it frequently forces you to:</p><ul><li>Play with handicaps such as tremors, broken limbs or no armor</li><li>Use specific weapons, ammo types or ranges</li><li>Take long, high-risk fights in open maps like Woods</li></ul><p>The <strong>EFT Jaeger Quests Boost</strong> from misti.services lets you bypass these punishing requirements while still unlocking everything Jaeger has to offer.</p><h3><strong>Why Jaeger Quests Matter</strong></h3><p>Jaeger’s quests are infamous, especially the <strong>Tarkov Shooter</strong> chain and other condition-heavy tasks involving dehydration, low health or restricted loadouts. Despite their difficulty, they are crucial because they:</p><ul><li>Are required for leveling Jaeger’s loyalty and unlocking top-tier ammunition, including .338 Lapua Magnum and other late-game rounds</li><li>Provide important hideout upgrade items and barter components</li><li>Unlock valuable trades for meta gear, scopes and survival tools</li><li>Form a major part of the quest count needed for the <strong>Kappa Secure Container</strong></li></ul><p>Completing Jaeger’s chain early through a professional boost gives you a strong edge for the rest of the wipe.</p><h3><strong>What You Get with Our Jaeger Quests Boost</strong></h3><ul><li>Any Jaeger quest completed, including the full Tarkov Shooter series if desired</li><li>All awkward conditions handled for you, such as tremor kills, long-range requirements and gear restrictions</li><li>Significant increase in Jaeger loyalty, moving you toward his best ammo and barter offers</li><li>All rewards kept on your account: XP, roubles, reputation and items from every completed quest</li></ul><h3><strong>Why Choose misti.services for Tarkov Boosting</strong></h3><ul><li>Our boosters are experienced survival-focused Tarkov players with the patience and skill to clear Jaeger’s most specific challenges</li><li>Every service is performed one hundred percent manually without cheats, bots or unsafe software</li><li>Fast, friendly support via chat or Discord, with custom orders available for any combination of Jaeger quests</li><li>misti.services has years of experience closing out Tarkov’s most hated and time-consuming quests, making us a dependable partner for finishing Jaeger’s line</li></ul><p>Let <strong>misti.services</strong> handle the <strong>Jaeger quests</strong> so you can enjoy the rewards—powerful ammo, better barters, hideout upgrades and real progress toward Kappa—without enduring the most frustrating tasks yourself.</p>', '<ul><li>Choose the Jaeger quests you want to skip, such as tremor kills or Tarkov Shooter parts, and place your order on misti.services.</li><li>We assign a Tarkov professional who specializes in hardcore, condition-based challenges.</li><li>The booster heads into Woods and other maps, completing tasks under difficult conditions, including tremors, long-range kills and restricted gear setups.</li><li>Your selected Jaeger quests are completed, unlocking important hideout items, valuable barters and stronger gear.</li><li>You receive a notification as soon as the boost is finished and all rewards are ready to claim.</li><li>You log in to enjoy better equipment, more hideout options and clean progress toward Kappa without the stress.</li></ul><p><br></p>', '<ul><li>Escape from Tarkov purchased and accessible on your account</li><li>Desired Jaeger quests must be unlocked and available</li></ul><p><br></p>', 1.99, 'https://kdjlhibxxygfdmlvdfcl.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/game-images/Jaeger-quests-eft-boost-1765924892738.webp', NULL, 4.9, 0, true, true, 0, '2025-12-10T19:00:12.940597+00:00', '2025-12-16T23:08:45.85193+00:00', 'ad312297-e28b-4185-8694-55f8078c94b1', false, NULL, true, 0, '15 minutes', 'average start time', 'Flexible', 'order completion', 'Beat Tarkov’s hardest challenges with our EFT Jaeger Quests Boost on misti.services. Veterans clear Tarkov Shooter, tremor kills and push your account toward Kappa.', 'EFT Jaeger quests boost, Escape from Tarkov Jaeger quests, Jaeger questline boost, Tarkov Shooter series boost, EFT Tarkov Shooter carry, Jaeger Kappa requirement, Kappa container progression, EFT tremor kills quest, EFT broken limb kills, Jaeger loyalty level boost, Jaeger LL4 unlock, EFT Red Rebel barter, Red Rebel ice pick boost, EFT SICC case unlock, Tarkov THICC items case access, EFT survival quests, EFT hardcore quests help, Tarkov Woods quests boost, EFT long range kills service, EFT bolt action sniper quests, EFT top tier ammo unlock, .338 Lapua Magnum unlock, EFT hideout upgrade items, Jaeger barter trades, Escape from Tarkov quest boosting, misti.services Tarkov, EFT piloted boost, EFT selfplay boost, EFT express boosting, EFT manual boosting service, Tarkov endgame quests, EFT elite gear unlock, Jaeger inventory unlock, EFT frustrating quests completion', 'https://kdjlhibxxygfdmlvdfcl.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/game-images/Jaeger-quests-eft-boost-1765924892738.webp', NULL, 'Jaeger Quests Eft Boost', 'EFT Jaeger Quests - Fast & Cheap | misti.services', NULL);
