focused rewards, including a highly sought-after pet, unique profession recipes, and situationally useful items.</p><p>Earning <strong>Exalted</strong> status with the Sporeggar is required for the <em>Seeker</em> title and unlocks access to the quartermaster''s full inventory, which uses <strong>Glowcaps</strong> instead of Gold as its currency.</p><h2><strong>Gaining Reputation</strong></h2><p>The Sporeggar grind is unique because it starts at <strong>Unfriendly</strong> and relies almost entirely on repeatable material turn-ins and efficient dungeon farming, making it very straightforward for a dedicated booster.</p><h3><strong>Unfriendly to Friendly</strong></h3><p>The initial reputation stages are covered by completing a few key introductory quests which later become repeatable turn-ins:</p><ul><li><strong>Natural Enemies / More Tendrils!</strong>: Requires <strong>Bog Lord Tendrils</strong> (from Bog Lords and Bog Giants).</li><li><strong>The Sporelings'' Plight / More Spore Sacs</strong>: Requires <strong>Mature Spore Sacs</strong>.</li></ul><p><em>Recommendation:</em> Our service prioritizes these initial quests to gain the maximum benefit before they stop providing reputation at the Friendly milestone.</p><h3><strong>Friendly to Exalted</strong></h3><p>Reputation past Friendly is achieved primarily through a combination of grinding and repeatable turn-ins:</p><ol><li><strong>Repeatable Turn-Ins:</strong> We focus on highly efficient turn-ins from <strong>Fahssn</strong> and <strong>Gshaff</strong>, including:</li></ol><ul><li class="ql-indent-1"><strong>More Fertile Spores (750 Rep)</strong>: Requires <strong>Fertile Spores</strong> from Sporebats and Marshwalkers.</li><li class="ql-indent-1"><strong>Now That We''re Still Friends... (750 Rep)</strong>: Requires defeating Bloodscale Slavedrivers and Enchantresses near Marshtide Lake.</li><li class="ql-indent-1"><strong>Bring Me Another Shrubbery! (250 Rep)</strong>: Requires farming <strong>Sanguine Hibiscuses</strong> in The Underbog.</li></ul><ol><li><strong>Dungeon &amp; Mob Grinding:</strong> We utilize targeted mob farming routes:</li></ol><ul><li class="ql-indent-1"><strong>The Underbog Runs</strong>: Mobs inside the dungeon grant <strong>20 reputation per kill</strong> and bosses grant <strong>250 reputation</strong> all the way to <strong>Exalted</strong> (Normal and Heroic).</li><li class="ql-indent-1"><strong>Open-World Grinding</strong>: Marsh Dredgers and Marsh Lurkers grant 15 reputation per kill up to Exalted.</li></ul><h2><strong>Reputation Rewards</strong></h2><p>The Sporeggar Quartermaster, <strong>Mycah</strong>, uses <strong>Glowcap</strong> as currency, which is gathered from the ground in Zangarmarsh or obtained as quest rewards. Our service inherently gathers the necessary <strong>Glowcaps</strong> during the farming process.</p><p>Reputation LevelKey Rewards &amp; Items<strong>Friendly</strong>Tallstalk Mushroom<strong>Honored</strong>Muck-Covered Drape (Cape), Petrified Lichen Guard (Shield)<strong>ReveredRecipe: Transmute Primal Earth to Water</strong>, Pattern: Mycah''s Botanical Bag (Tailoring), Sporeling''s Firestick<strong>ExaltedTiny Sporebat Pet</strong>, <strong>Sporeggar Tabard</strong>, Recipe: Shrouding Potion</p><h2><strong>Why Choose Our Sporeggar Reputation Boost</strong></h2><p>The Sporeggar farm is one of the most tedious and repetitive grinds in Outland, requiring players to spend hours collecting small quantities of rare materials. Misti.Services offers the solution:</p><ul><li><strong>Glowcap Acquisition Included:</strong> We farm and utilize the required <strong>Glowcaps</strong> to purchase the final rewards.</li><li><strong>Optimal Dungeon Rotation:</strong> We efficiently clear <strong>The Underbog</strong> and rotate mob turn-ins for the fastest possible path to Exalted.</li><li><strong>Guaranteed Pet &amp; Recipe Unlock:</strong> Secure the popular <strong>Tiny Sporebat</strong> battle pet and valuable profession recipes without the tedious collection process.</li></ul><h3><strong>Service Includes</strong></h3><ul><li>Full Sporeggar reputation farm from your current standing (Unfriendly, Neutral, etc.) up to <strong>Exalted</strong>.</li><li>Completion of all repeatable turn-in quests for maximum daily gains.</li><li>Efficient farming and clearing of <strong>The Underbog</strong> dungeon (Normal/Heroic).</li><li>Acquisition of the required <strong>Glowcap</strong> currency.</li><li>Guaranteed unlock of the <strong>Tiny Sporebat</strong> pet and <strong>Sporeggar Tabard</strong>.</li></ul><p><strong>Skip the monotonous mushroom hunting. Order your Sporeggar Reputation Boost and get your Tiny Sporebat today!</strong></p>', '<ul><li>Select your desired options and complete your order on&nbsp;Misti.Services.</li><li>You’ll receive an order confirmation and tracking number via email.</li><li>Our support manager will contact you through live chat to confirm all details.</li><li>If you’re unavailable, we’ll reach out via email or your preferred contact method.</li><li>When the boost is finished, you’ll receive a completion notification on Discord or another messenger of your choice.</li></ul>', '<ul><li><strong>Level 70</strong></li><li><strong>Active WoW Subscription</strong></li></ul>', 0, 'https://kdjlhibxxygfdmlvdfcl.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/game-images/nb6bsdvb7f.webp', NULL, 4.9, 0, true, true, 0, '2025-11-19T08:13:20.741597+00:00', '2026-02-16T10:52:54.903711+00:00', '9464d1fe-6c00-412a-8ebb-896a4f575b4e', false, NULL, true, 0, '15 minutes', 'average start time', 'Flexible', 'order completion', 'Buy the Sporeggar Exalted boost! Get the Tiny Sporebat pet, Transmute recipes, and Sporeggar Tabard fast. We farm Glowcaps and The Underbog for you.', 'Sporeggar reputation boost, Tiny Sporebat pet farm, WoW TBC rep carry, Zangarmarsh reputation, Sporeggar Exalted, Underbog reputation farm, Glowcap currency farm, Recipe: Transmute Primal Earth to Water, Sporeggar Tabard, Mature Spore Sacs turn-in, Sporeggar boosting service', NULL, NULL, 'Sporeggar', 'WoW TBC Sporeggar Rep Boost | misti.services', NULL);
