le in-game challenges designed to grant access to powerful Ascendancy subclasses. Each trial features intricate trap layouts, unique environmental mechanics, and a formidable final boss encounter that demands mastery of both your build and combat skills. Successfully navigating these trials awards critical Ascendancy Points, which are indispensable for developing potent passive abilities within your chosen subclass, significantly enhancing your character''s power and versatility.</p><h3><strong>Why Choose Our Service</strong></h3><ul><li><strong>Instant Power:</strong> Quickly unlock game-changing Ascendancy points to drastically improve your build.</li><li><strong>Skip Frustration:</strong> Avoid countless deaths and wasted time on challenging traps and bosses.</li><li><strong>Expert Execution:</strong> Rely on professional Path of Exile 2 players to efficiently clear trials for you.</li><li><strong>Full Rewards:</strong> Keep all valuable loot, gear, and currency accumulated during the boost.</li><li><strong>Time Saving:</strong> Focus on enjoying other aspects of the game while we handle the grind.</li></ul><p>At misti.services, we are dedicated to providing premium gaming boosts that enhance your experience. Opt for our PoE 2 Ascension Trials Boost today and elevate your gameplay to new heights, ensuring your character is fully optimized and ready for any challenge that awaits.</p>', '<ul><li><strong>Place Your Order:</strong> Select the desired Ascension Trials and your preferred delivery method.</li><li><strong>Contact and Confirmation:</strong> Our team will reach out to confirm details and assign an expert booster.</li><li><strong>Self-Play (Optional):</strong> Join your booster in-game if you choose Self-Play, remaining inactive while they perform the service.</li><li><strong>Piloted (Optional):</strong> For Piloted, the booster securely logs into your account to complete the trials.</li><li><strong>Claim Your Rewards:</strong> Receive full Ascendancy Points and all loot directly to your character.</li><li><strong>Enjoy Your Power:</strong> Experience your newly enhanced character with powerful subclass abilities.</li></ul>', '<ul><li><strong>Trial Progression:</strong> The specific Ascension Trial you wish to complete must be unlocked in your game.</li><li><strong>Character Level:</strong>Character level 22 for the 1st Ascendancy Trial.</li><li>Character level 40 for the 2nd Ascendancy Trial.</li><li>Character level 50 for the 3rd and 4th Ascendancy Trials.</li></ul>', 1.99, 'https://kdjlhibxxygfdmlvdfcl.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/game-images/poe-2-ascension-trials-boost-1767199181346.webp', NULL, 4.9, 0, true, true, 0, '2025-12-31T16:24:27.813368+00:00', '2025-12-31T16:52:59.722568+00:00', 'dbe672b1-3654-491f-bdbc-f174d61eea75', false, NULL, true, 0, '15 minutes', 'average start time', 'Flexible', 'order completion', 'Unlock powerful Ascendancy points in PoE 2 quickly and safely. Buy Ascension Trials Boost to get up to 8 points and enhance your character''s subclass now.', 'poe 2 ascension trials boost, buy poe 2 trials, poe 2 ascension price, path of exile 2 ascension service, poe 2 ascendancy points, poe 2 power boost, poe 2 leveling, poe 2 boost, buy poe 2 boost, poe 2 services, poe 2 trial completion, poe 2 cheap boost, poe 2 fast boost, poe 2 build power, poe 2 subclass unlock, poe 2 carry, poe 2 help, gaming service, fast delivery, professional', 'https://kdjlhibxxygfdmlvdfcl.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/game-images/poe-2-ascension-trials-boost-1767199181346.webp', NULL, 'Poe 2 Ascension Trials Boost', 'Buy PoE 2 Ascension Trials Boost | misti.services', NULL);
