"end":4,"price":120,"start":1},{"end":8,"price":200,"start":5},{"end":12,"price":330,"start":9},{"end":14,"price":890,"start":12}],"estimated_time_per_step":5}', true, 0, '15 minutes', 'average start time', 'Flexible', 'order completion', 'Buy WoW Classic PvP Rank 1-14 Boost at misti.services to reach any PvP rank fast, earn Honor Points, and unlock elite rewards safely.', 'wow classic fresh pvp rank boost, buy classic pvp rank, classic wow honor points farm, elite pvp rewards classic, fast wow classic rank up, safe classic pvp boost, classic era pvp boosting service, wow classic rank 14 boost, season of mastery pvp rank, classic era pvp farming, wow classic pvp grinding, buy classic pvp honor, professional wow classic pvp boost, classic wow pvp rank service', 'https://kdjlhibxxygfdmlvdfcl.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/game-images/pvp-rank-boost-1763224059979.webp', NULL, 'Pvp Rank Boost', 'WoW Era Classic PvP Rank Boost | misti.services', NULL);
INSERT INTO public.products (id, name, slug, short_description, description, how_it_works, requirements, base_price, image_url, badge_text, trust_score, total_reviews, is_active, is_featured, sort_order, created_at, updated_at, category_id, is_slider_product, slider_config, is_manually_popular, total_sales, start_time_text, start_time_value, delivery_text, delivery_value, meta_description, meta_keywords, og_image, canonical_url, image_alt_text, meta_title, parent_link) VALUES ('3fa30cd5-d960-4897-ac45-b53c6e988e9c', 'Void-Scarred Gryphon', 'void-scarred-gryphon-1227', 'The Void-Scarred Gryphon is a special flying mount added in Patch 11.1.5, highly valued by collectors for its shadowy appearance and striking void-themed wings. Obtaining this mount is complex and time-gated: you must enter the Stormwind Vision during its active week, activate at least two Faceless Masks to increase difficulty, and successfully complete a unique feeding ritual to summon the gryphon as a fightable enemy. ', '<h1><strong>WoW Void-Scarred Gryphon Flying Mount Boost (Patch 11.1.5)</strong></h1><p>Securing the Void-Scarred Gryphon is a true test of patience and intellect in <em>The War Within</em>. This unique flying mount is locked behind the weekly rotation of the <strong>Revisited Horrific Vision: Stormwind</strong>, requiring you to master complex mask mechanics and solve a cryptic feeding puzzle just to fight the boss. If you want to bypass the weekly waiting game and the intricate challenge, <strong>misti.services</strong> provides the guaranteed solution to add this stylish, void-themed aerial mount to your collection.</p><h2><strong>Overview: The Void-Scarred Gryphon</strong></h2><p>The <strong>Void-Scarred Gryphon</strong> is a special flying mount added in Patch 11.1.5, highly valued by collectors for its shadowy appearance and striking void-themed wings. Obtaining this mount is complex and time-gated: you must enter the Stormwind Vision during its active week, activate at least two Faceless Masks to increase difficulty, and successfully complete a unique feeding ritual to summon the gryphon as a fightable enemy. This multi-step process can take up to 10 hours of dedicated effort to complete manually.</p><h2><strong>Service Includes</strong></h2><p>When you choose <strong>misti.services</strong>, you are investing in a seamless, guaranteed path to this complex reward. Our service provides:</p><ul><li>The unique flying mount <strong>Reins of the Void-Scarred Gryphon</strong> obtained.</li><li>Full completion of the hidden feeding ritual challenge within the Stormwind Vision.</li><li>Activation of the necessary two+ Faceless Masks.</li><li>You keep all gold, loot, and potential bonus cosmetic items/transmog gear earned during the service.</li></ul><h2><strong>More About the Void-Scarred Gryphon</strong></h2><p>This mount is a true badge of honor, representing mastery over one of the game''s toughest solo challenges. The unlock sequence is particularly complex: after activating the necessary masks and defeating the main boss in the Trade District, players must <strong>decipher a hidden note</strong> to determine which specific food item (such as Chopped Mycobloom or Fresh Fillet) must be placed in a nearby bowl to summon the gryphon for a final fight. Our expert team navigates the sanity drain, defeats the boss, cracks the food puzzle, and secures the drop, eliminating all frustration and guesswork for you.</p><h2><strong>Why You Should Try the misti.services Boost</strong></h2><p>The Void-Scarred Gryphon boost is the best choice for players who want the reward without the high risk of failure or the intense time commitment:</p><ul><li><strong>Puzzle Solved:</strong> We eliminate the need for you to decipher the cryptic note or waste currency guessing the correct food item required for the ritual.</li><li><strong>Guaranteed Mask Clear:</strong> We guarantee the successful clear of the vision while running with at least two Faceless Masks active, a crucial, high-difficulty requirement.</li><li><strong>Avoid Time-Gating:</strong> We handle the coordination and schedule the run for the required Stormwind Vision week, ensuring you don''t miss the opportunity.</li><li><strong>Skip the Grind:</strong> We save you hours of failed attempts and tedious farming, letting you immediately enjoy one of the most stylish gryphons in the game.</li></ul><h2><strong>Boost Options Explained</strong></h2><p>You have control over how we deliver your mount, focusing on your comfort and security:</p><ul><li><strong>Account Sharing (Piloted):</strong> Our professional player logs in to your account. We use strict security protocols, including VPNs matching your country of residence, to ensure the login appears local.</li><li><strong>Remote Control:</strong> Our player connects securely to your desktop via a remote application (like Parsec). They execute the game actions live while you watch, ensuring your login credentials are never shared.</li></ul>', '<ul><li><strong>Order Confirmation:</strong> Once your payment is processed, our support manager will contact you immediately via chat or email.</li><li><strong>Scheduling:</strong> We coordinate a time window that aligns with the active Stormwind Vision rotation and our expert booster''s schedule.</li><li><strong>Execution:</strong> The assigned booster logs in securely, enters the vision, activates the masks, completes the feeding ritual, and secures the mount drop.</li><li><strong>Completion:</strong> The service is complete the moment the mount drops and is learned by your character. You receive an immediate notification, and the account is ready for your use.</li></ul>', '<ul><li><strong>Level 80 Character:</strong> Required for optimal performance in the latest Horrific Vision content.</li><li><strong>The War Within Expansion:</strong> Access to the current expansion content is necessary.</li><li><strong>Active WoW Subscription:</strong> You must maintain an active subscription throughout the service duration.</li></ul>', 5.09, 'https://kdjlhibxxygfdmlvdfcl.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/game-images/void-scarred-gryphon-1227-1764184439958.webp', NULL, 4.9, 0, true, true, 0, '2025-11-24T21:06:24.817157+00:00', '2025-12-16T07:22:52.745083+00:00', 'b4c0ccaf-a937-4b30-9ab4-7dacee8f739b', false, NULL, true, 0, '15 minutes', 'average start time', 'Flexible', 'order completion', 'Buy the Void-Scarred Gryphon mount! We guarantee completion of the high-difficulty Stormwind Vision feeding ritual and the two-mask requirement (Patch 11.1.5).', 'Void-Scarred Gryphon mount, Horrific Visions Stormwind, Void-Scarred Gryphon feeding ritual, Patch 11.1.5 flying mount, The War Within mount boost, rare gryphon mount, Void-Scarred Gryphon carry', 'https://kdjlhibxxygfdmlvdfcl.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/game-images/void-scarred-gryphon-1227-1764184439958.webp', NULL, 'Void Scarred Gryphon 1227', 'War Within Void-Scarred Gryphon Mount | misti.services', NULL);
