is finished, you’ll receive a completion notification on Discord or another messenger of your choice.</li></ul>', '<ul><li>Level 60 character</li><li>Minimum 215 item level gear</li><li>Access to the <strong>Shadowlands: Chains of Domination</strong> expansion</li><li>Need help reaching level 60? Try our&nbsp;<a href="https://misti.services/game/warwithin/leveling/wow-the-war-within-leveling" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">WoW Power Leveling Boost</a>&nbsp;</li></ul>', 56.81, 'https://kdjlhibxxygfdmlvdfcl.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/game-images/glory-of-the-dominant-raider-boost-1762457533955.webp', NULL, 4.9, 35, true, true, 0, '2025-10-25T15:51:47.892908+00:00', '2025-12-16T07:19:30.716077+00:00', '1f34fa28-c062-44c5-87c5-312aba1ee6a9', false, NULL, true, 0, '15 minutes', 'average start time', '3 week', 'order completion', 'Complete Glory of the Dominant Raider fast and unlock the Hand of Hrestimorak mount with expert boosters from Misti.Services safely and easily.', 'glory of the dominant raider boost, hand of hrestimorak mount boost, dominant raider achievement service, buy glory of the dominant raider, fast glory of the dominant raider, misti.services raid boost, hand of hrestimorak unlock, glory of dominant raider carry, expert raid boosters, safe raid boosting service, cheap glory of dominant raider, game raid achievement, game mount unlock service', 'https://kdjlhibxxygfdmlvdfcl.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/game-images/glory-of-the-dominant-raider-boost-1762457533955.webp', NULL, 'Glory Of The Dominant Raider Boost', 'War Within Glory of Dominant Raider | misti.services', NULL);
