Wraps</strong> cloak unlocked.</li><li><strong>Level 80</strong> character.</li><li><strong>Fresh raid cooldown</strong> for selected difficulty.</li></ul>', 0, 'https://kdjlhibxxygfdmlvdfcl.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/game-images/manaforge-omega-heroic-lootshare-1762361919090.webp', NULL, 4.9, 0, true, true, 0, '2025-10-21T20:44:31.249831+00:00', '2026-02-15T11:36:17.774781+00:00', '4f633dbe-f718-4715-8ae9-19258b733a22', false, NULL, true, 13, '15 minutes', 'average start time', 'Flexible', 'order completion', 'Manaforge Omega Heroic Get a Heroic run through Manaforge Omega and conquer all 8 bosses of the new raid on Heroic difficulty.', 'manaforge omega heroic lootshare, game manaforge omega lootshare, buy manaforge omega heroic, manaforge omega boost, game lootshare service, heroic lootshare game, manaforge omega farm, game heroic gear, manaforge omega carry, game dungeon lootshare, manaforge omega run, fast manaforge omega loot, professional game lootshare', 'https://kdjlhibxxygfdmlvdfcl.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/game-images/manaforge-omega-heroic-lootshare-1762361919090.webp', NULL, 'Manaforge Omega Heroic Lootshare', 'War Within Heroic Manaforge Lootshare | misti.services', NULL);
