Greater Affixes.</li><li>Mythic Items: 2/4 Greater Affixes.</li><li>Masterwork: Masterworking 12/12.</li><li>Tempering: All Items Tempered.</li><li>Aspects: Max Roll Aspects.</li><li>Glyphs: 5x Glyphs level 100.</li><li>Gems: Grand Gems.</li><li>Runewords: x2 Runewords.</li><li>Optimized Skill Tree and Paragon Board.</li></ul><h3>About the Diablo 4 Druid Builds Service</h3><p>The Druid class is known for its deep connection with nature, offering players the freedom to shapeshift, summon companions, or command the elements. Each build focuses on a different playstyle—ranged casting, melee combat, or summoning allies.</p><p>At <strong>misti.services</strong>, our team constantly updates Diablo 4 Druid builds to match the latest balance changes and seasonal updates. Whether you’re preparing for endgame content or looking for a meta-defining setup, our Druid Builds Boost ensures your character is optimized for maximum performance.</p><h3>Druid Class Overview</h3><p>The Druid in Diablo 4 is a hybrid powerhouse. Players can mix spellcasting with melee combat, or rely on shapeshifting and summoning to adapt to any situation. Using the Druid’s Class Mechanic, you can choose boons from four Spirit Animals—each offering unique bonuses that shape your combat style. Druids can equip both melee weapons and totems, giving them flexibility and power in every encounter.</p><h3>Why an Optimized Diablo 4 Druid Build Matters</h3><p>Without the right setup, advancing through Diablo 4’s endgame can be difficult. A fully optimized build with precise skill tree paths, enhanced glyphs, and key unique items can drastically improve performance. With our <strong>Diablo 4 Druid Builds Boost</strong>, you’ll gain a perfectly tuned build to handle any content with confidence.</p><h3>Why Choose misti.services for Your Druid Build</h3><p>Creating a powerful Druid takes dedication and time. Our <strong>Diablo 4 Druid Builds Boost</strong> service saves you both, letting you experience the best of Diablo 4 without the grind.</p><p><strong>Here’s why players choose misti.services:</strong></p><ul><li>Customizable Druid builds tailored to your playstyle.</li><li>Fast, efficient leveling and build preparation.</li><li>Experienced boosters with over a decade of ARPG expertise.</li><li>Secure, confidential service with strict privacy standards.</li><li>24/7 support and live progress updates.</li></ul><p>Our boost services are available on <strong>PC, Xbox, and PlayStation</strong>, for both <strong>Eternal and Seasonal realms</strong>.</p><h3>Create Your Ideal Druid Build</h3><p>Didn’t find the Druid build you want? No problem—choose the <strong>Custom Build</strong> option, and we’ll craft a personalized setup that fits your exact preferences and playstyle.</p>', '<ul><li>Select your desired options and complete your order on&nbsp;Misti.Services.</li><li>You’ll receive an order confirmation and tracking number via email.</li><li>Our support manager will contact you through live chat to confirm all details.</li><li>If you’re unavailable, we’ll reach out via email or your preferred contact method.</li><li>When the boost is finished, you’ll receive a completion notification on Discord or another messenger of your choice.</li></ul>', '<ul><li>Active Diablo 4 account</li><li>Vessel of Hatred expansion</li></ul>', 0, 'https://kdjlhibxxygfdmlvdfcl.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/game-images/druid-builds-1762545304973.webp', NULL, 4.9, 350, true, true, 0, '2025-11-05T05:01:51.316698+00:00', '2025-12-16T00:24:35.188739+00:00', '2468b6cf-4682-449e-9911-cd76e69afb21', false, NULL, true, 0, '15 minutes', 'average start time', 'Flexible', 'order completion', 'Unlock your full potential with Diablo 4 Druid Builds Boost from misti.services. Get a powerful, fully optimized Druid ready for endgame content.', 'diablo 4 druid builds, d4 druid build boost, diablo 4 druid endgame build, optimized d4 druid build, powerful diablo 4 druid, misti services d4 druid, buy diablo 4 druid build, d4 druid best builds, diablo 4 druid class boost, custom diablo 4 druid build, fast d4 druid build, professional diablo 4 druid build, cheap diablo 4 druid build, diablo 4 druid max potential, ultimate d4 druid build', 'https://kdjlhibxxygfdmlvdfcl.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/game-images/druid-builds-1762545304973.webp', NULL, 'Druid Builds', 'Diablo 4 Druid Builds - Pro Optimized | misti.services', NULL);
INSERT INTO public.products (id, name, slug, short_description, description, how_it_works, requirements, base_price, image_url, badge_text, trust_score, total_reviews, is_active, is_featured, sort_order, created_at, updated_at, category_id, is_slider_product, slider_config, is_manually_popular, total_sales, start_time_text, start_time_value, delivery_text, delivery_value, meta_description, meta_keywords, og_image, canonical_url, image_alt_text, meta_title, parent_link) VALUES ('91c957d5-def7-4cf8-9fe2-e65fa1a9ca55', 'The Big G Mount ', 'the-big-g-mount', 'The Big G Mount is a spectacular flying mount that visually represents the iconic goblin leader, Gallywix, complete with mounted weaponry. It is a guaranteed drop from the final boss of the Liberation of Undermine raid, Chrome King Gallywix, but only when the boss is defeated on the game''s highest difficulty: Mythic. ', '<h1><strong>WoW The Big G Mount Boost: Mythic Gallywix</strong></h1><p>Ready to fly around Azeroth on a giant, gun-toting goblin head? The <strong>Big G Mount</strong> is one of the most prestigious rewards of <em>The War Within</em> Season 2, but earning it requires defeating <strong>Chrome King Gallywix on Mythic difficulty</strong>—the final boss of the Liberation of Undermine raid. This is an extreme challenge that only the top guilds manage. If you want this unique mount, the <strong>Liberator of Undermine</strong> title, and the prestigious <strong>Cutting Edge</strong> Feat of Strength, <strong>misti.services</strong> provides the guaranteed Mythic kill you need.</p><h2><strong>Overview: The Big G Mount</strong></h2><p>The Big G Mount is a spectacular flying mount that visually represents the iconic goblin leader, Gallywix, complete with mounted weaponry. It is a guaranteed drop from the final boss of the <strong>Liberation of Undermine</strong> raid, <strong>Chrome King Gallywix</strong>, but <em>only</em> when the boss is defeated on the game''s highest difficulty: <strong>Mythic</strong>. Obtaining this mount is highly time-sensitive, as the Cutting Edge Feat of Strength is removed upon the release of the next raid tier.</p><h2><strong>Service Includes</strong></h2><p>When you purchase the Big G Mount Boost from <strong>misti.services</strong>, we guarantee your success and prestige:</p><ul><li>Guaranteed <strong>Keys to the Big G</strong> flying mount.</li><li>Defeat of <strong>Chrome King Gallywix</strong> on Mythic difficulty.</li><li>Earn the <strong>Mythic: Chrome King Gallywix</strong> achievement.</li><li>Unlock the unique <strong>Liberator of Undermine</strong> title.</li><li>Unlock the prestigious <strong>Cutting Edge: Chrome King Gallywix</strong> Feat of Strength (if completed before the next raid tier).</li><li>Chance to obtain high item level gear (671–678 ilvl) and the rare <strong>Prototype A.S.M.R.</strong> mount.</li><li>Receipt of <strong>Gilded Undermine Crests</strong> and <strong>Valorstones</strong> for upgrading Season 1 gear.</li></ul><h2><strong>More About Big G and Our Service</strong></h2><p>The Big G Mount was introduced in Patch 11.1, marking the release of Season 2 and the <strong>Liberation of Undermine</strong> raid. Defeating the final boss, Gallywix, on Mythic difficulty is exponentially more challenging than lower difficulties, requiring flawless execution and coordination across 20 players. This difficulty is why Mythic Gallywix completion often separates the elite from the general player base. Understanding this gap, <strong>misti.services</strong> offers a direct path to this unique reward. Our professional raid team guarantees success by navigating the most complex boss mechanics, ensuring your character is present for the kill and secures the mount and all associated achievements.</p><h2><strong>Why You Should Choose misti.services</strong></h2><p>Acquiring a Mythic end-of-tier mount is the ultimate prestige, and our service ensures you get it without spending weeks or months wiping in organized raids:</p><ul><li><strong>Guaranteed Mythic Kill:</strong> We eliminate the frustration of relying on PUGs or developing complex boss strategies yourself. Our expert teams guarantee the kill.</li><li><strong>Prestige Unlocked:</strong> Secure both the rare mount and the time-limited <strong>Cutting Edge</strong> Feat of Strength achievement before it''s gone forever.</li><li><strong>Dual Mount Chance:</strong> Not only do you get the Big G Mount, but you also have a chance to loot the highly desirable <strong>Prototype A.S.M.R.</strong> mount.</li><li><strong>Flexible Options:</strong> We offer both Piloted and Selfplay options to suit your security and playstyle preferences.</li></ul><h2><strong>Boost Options Explained</strong></h2><p>You have several ways to complete the raid with us, based on your preference for security and participation:</p><ul><li><strong>Account Sharing (Piloted):</strong> Our professional player logs in to your account to complete the boost.</li><li><strong>Selfplay:</strong> Join our raid team and play your character during the boost. You must hit the boss at least once to be eligible for loot.</li><li><strong>Remote Control:</strong> Our player securely connects to your desktop via a remote control app (like Parsec) and plays the game while you watch, ensuring your login credentials remain private.</li></ul><h2><strong>How It Works</strong></h2><p>We ensure a smooth, professional raiding experience:</p><ol><li><strong>Order Confirmation:</strong> After payment, our support manager contacts you immediately via chat or email.</li><li><strong>Raid Scheduling:</strong> A suitable raid time is coordinated based on your availability and the weekly lockout reset.</li><li><strong>Execution:</strong> If <strong>Selfplay</strong> is chosen, you are invited and summoned to the raid at the scheduled time. If <strong>Account Sharing</strong> or <strong>Remote Control</strong> is chosen, the booster handles the raid completion.</li><li><strong>Completion:</strong> Once Chrome King Gallywix is defeated and the mount is secured, you receive the reward and a final notification.</li></ol>', '<ul><li><strong>Raid Scheduling:</strong> A suitable raid time is coordinated based on your availability and the weekly lockout reset.</li><li><strong>Execution:</strong> If <strong>Selfplay</strong> is chosen, you are invited and summoned to the raid at the scheduled time. If <strong>Account Sharing</strong> or <strong>Remote Control</strong> is chosen, the booster handles the raid completion.</li><li><strong>Completion:</strong> Once Chrome King Gallywix is defeated and the mount is secured, you receive the reward and a final notification.</li></ul>', '<ul><li><strong>Level 80 Character:</strong> Required for entry into the Mythic Liberation of Undermine raid. (If you don''t have one, we offer power leveling services.)</li><li><strong>Active WoW Subscription:</strong> You must maintain an active subscription throughout the service duration.</li></ul>', 139, 'https://kdjlhibxxygfdmlvdfcl.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/game-images/the-big-g-mount-1764170212848.webp', NULL, 4.9, 0, true, true, 0, '2025-11-24T21:01:31.380941+00:00', '2026-01-29T22:48:25.093115+00:00', 'b4c0ccaf-a937-4b30-9ab4-7dacee8f739b', false, NULL, true, 0, '15 minutes', 'average start time', 'Flexible', 'order completion', 'Buy The Big G Mount boost for a guaranteed Mythic Gallywix kill in Liberation of Undermine. Unlock the mount, ''Liberator of Undermine'' title, and Cutting Edge FoS.', 'WoW Big G Mount boost, Mythic Gallywix kill, Liberation of Undermine mount, Chrome King Gallywix, Cutting Edge Gallywix, Liberator of Undermine title, Prototype A.S.M.R. mount, WoW Season 2 mount', 'https://kdjlhibxxygfdmlvdfcl.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/game-images/the-big-g-mount-1764170212848.webp', NULL, 'The Big G Mount', 'Big G Mount WoW: War Within | misti.services', NULL);
INSERT INTO public.products (id, name, slug, short_description, description, how_it_works, requirements, base_price, image_url, badge_text, trust_score, total_reviews, is_active, is_featured, sort_order, created_at, updated_at, category_id, is_slider_product, slider_config, is_manually_popular, total_sales, start_time_text, start_time_value, delivery_text, delivery_value, meta_description, meta_keywords, og_image, canonical_url, image_alt_text, meta_title, parent_link) VALUES ('9f51600a-64d9-495f-b196-109ff0626d4e', 'Cenarion Expedition', 'cenarion-expedition', 'The Cenarion Expedition is a vital faction of explorers located primarily in Zangarmarsh, with their main base at Cenarion Refuge. This reputation is mandatory for endgame progression, offering some of the most powerful and necessary unlocks in The Burning Crusade Classic.', '<h1><strong>Cenarion Expedition Reputation Farm Boost – WoW TBC Classic</strong></h1><p>Looking to unlock the crucial <strong>Coilfang Reservoir Heroic Keys</strong>, secure the iconic <strong>Cenarion War Hippogryph</strong>, and obtain one of the best Physical DPS head enchants? Misti.Services offers a fast, secure, and professional <a href="https://www.icy-veins.com/tbc-classic/cenarion-expedition-reputation-and-rewards-guide" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank"><strong>Cenarion Expedition Reputation</strong></a><strong> Farm Boost</strong>, eliminating the tedious grind of farming <strong>Unidentified Plant Parts</strong> and clearing dungeons endlessly.</p><p>Our expert boosters execute the optimal strategy—maximizing turn-ins before Honored and efficiently running <strong>The Steamvault</strong> to deliver guaranteed reputation gains from Neutral to Exalted.</p><h2><strong>Overview</strong></h2><p>The <strong>Cenarion Expedition</strong> is a vital faction of explorers located primarily in <strong>Zangarmarsh</strong>, with their main base at <strong>Cenarion Refuge</strong>. This reputation is mandatory for endgame progression, offering some of the most powerful and necessary unlocks in <em>The Burning Crusade Classic</em>.</p><p>Earning <strong>Exalted</strong> status with the Cenarion Expedition provides:</p><ul><li><strong>Heroic Dungeon Keys:</strong> The <strong>Reservoir Key</strong> to unlock Heroic difficulty for <strong>Slave Pens</strong>, <strong>The Underbog</strong>, and <strong>The Steamvault</strong>.</li><li><strong>Best-in-Slot Enchants:</strong> Including the powerful Physical DPS head enchant, <strong>Glyph of Ferocity</strong>.</li><li><strong>Unique Mount:</strong> The prestigious <strong>Cenarion War Hippogryph</strong>, the only Hippogryph mount available.</li><li><strong>Essential Profession Recipes:</strong> Patterns for Alchemy (Flasks, Transmutes), Blacksmithing, Leatherworking, and Jewelcrafting.</li></ul><h2><strong>Gaining Reputation</strong></h2><p>The Cenarion Expedition reputation grind is complex, requiring a specific strategic sequence of quests, material turn-ins, and dungeon farming for maximum efficiency.</p><h3><strong>Optimal Strategy (Neutral to Exalted)</strong></h3><p>Our boosters follow the proven, fastest strategy:</p><ol><li><strong>Turn-In Maxing (Up to Honored):</strong> We prioritize farming and turning in <strong>Unidentified Plant Parts</strong> via the repeatable <em>Identify Plant Parts</em> quest (250 rep per turn-in) up until the <strong>Honored</strong> threshold is reached. We also save all found <strong>Uncatalogued Species</strong>.</li><li><strong>Reputation Dumps (Honored to Revered):</strong> Once Honored is reached, we immediately turn in all saved <strong>Uncatalogued Species</strong> (500 rep per turn-in, works to Exalted) and complete all available Cenarion Expedition quests across Outland (totaling ~11,800 reputation).</li><li><strong>Dungeon Grinding (Revered to Exalted):</strong> The final push involves dedicated dungeon clears:</li></ol><ul><li class="ql-indent-1"><strong>Heroic Dungeons:</strong> Daily runs of <strong>The Steamvault</strong>, <strong>Slave Pens</strong>, and <strong>The Underbog</strong>.</li><li class="ql-indent-1"><strong>Normal Steamvault:</strong> Repeated runs of <strong>The Steamvault</strong> (Normal mobs give reputation all the way to Exalted).</li></ul><h3><strong>Grind Efficiency</strong></h3><p>Reputation is gained by killing Naga in Zangarmarsh and mobs in the Coilfang Reservoir dungeons. We also handle the quest chain required to unlock the repeatable <strong>Coilfang Armaments</strong> turn-ins for extra reputation.</p><h2><strong>Reputation Rewards</strong></h2><p>The Quartermaster, <strong>Fedryen Swiftspear</strong>, is located in Cenarion Refuge. Our boost ensures you have the reputation necessary to purchase all the most coveted items.</p><h2><strong>Why Choose Our Cenarion Expedition Reputation Boost</strong></h2><p>The key to the Cenarion grind is efficiency—knowing <em>when</em> to turn in quests and <em>which</em> dungeons to spam. Our service provides a clean, fast path to Exalted:</p><ul><li><strong>Strategically Optimized:</strong> We prevent accidental quest completions or early dungeon runs that waste valuable reputation gains.</li><li><strong>BiS Enchants Secured:</strong> Guaranteeing the <strong>Glyph of Ferocity</strong> for your Physical DPS characters.</li><li><strong>Heroic Access:</strong> Guaranteed unlocking of the <strong>Reservoir Key</strong> so you can jump straight into Heroic dungeons.</li><li><strong>Unique Mount Acquisition:</strong> We complete the final grind and ensure you have the required Gold to purchase the<a href="https://wowclassicdb.com/tbc/item/33999" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank"> <strong>Cenarion War Hippogryph</strong>.</a></li></ul><h3><strong>Service Includes</strong></h3><ul><li>Full Cenarion Expedition reputation farm from your current standing up to <strong>Exalted</strong>.</li><li><strong>Unidentified Plant Parts</strong> and <strong>Uncatalogued Species</strong> farming and strategic turn-ins.</li><li>Full completion of all Cenarion Expedition quests across Outland.</li><li>Daily and repeatable clears of <strong>The Steamvault</strong>, <strong>Slave Pens</strong>, and <strong>The Underbog</strong>.</li><li>Guaranteed unlock of the <strong>Reservoir Key</strong> at Revered.</li><li>Guaranteed Exalted status to purchase the <strong>Cenarion War Hippogryph</strong>.</li></ul><p><strong>Stop debating the strategy. Order your Cenarion Expedition Boost and fly into Heroics today!</strong></p>', '<ul><li>Select your desired options and complete your order on&nbsp;Misti.Services.</li><li>You’ll receive an order confirmation and tracking number via email.</li><li>Our support manager will contact you through live chat to confirm all details.</li><li>If you’re unavailable, we’ll reach out via email or your preferred contact method.</li><li>When the boost is finished, you’ll receive a completion notification on Discord or another messenger of your choice.</li></ul>', '<ul><li><strong>Level 70</strong></li><li><strong>Active WoW Subscription</strong></li></ul>', 0, 'https://kdjlhibxxygfdmlvdfcl.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/game-images/4snoi8sn46v.webp', NULL, 4.9, 0, true, true, 0, '2025-11-19T08:21:09.784001+00:00', '2026-02-16T10:52:54.685219+00:00', '9464d1fe-6c00-412a-8ebb-896a4f575b4e', false, NULL, true, 0, '15 minutes', 'average start time', 'Flexible', 'order completion', 'Buy Cenarion Expedition Exalted boost! Unlock the Reservoir Key, Glyph of Ferocity, and the unique Cenarion War Hippogryph mount. Fast Zangarmarsh farm.', 'Cenarion Expedition reputation boost, Cenarion War Hippogryph mount, Reservoir Key unlock, buy Cenarion Exalted, Glyph of Ferocity enchant, Unidentified Plant Parts farm, WoW TBC rep carry, Slave Pens farm, The Steamvault boost, Zangarmarsh reputation, Formula: Enchant Cloak - Stealth, Recipe: Flask of Distilled Wisdom', NULL, NULL, ' Cenarion Expedition', 'WoW TBC Cenarion Expedition Boost | misti.services', NULL);
