yer completes it securely through Parsec</li></ul><h3>About Glory of the Omega Raider</h3><p>The <strong>Glory of the Omega Raider</strong> is a prestigious meta-achievement introduced in Patch 11.2 of <em>The War Within</em>. It requires completing a series of unique challenges inside the <strong>Manaforge Omega raid</strong>. Each encounter demands coordination and precision, making this achievement one of the toughest to complete during current content.</p><p>By choosing Misti.Services, you skip the time-consuming grind and avoid repeated failures. Our experienced raiders will handle every mechanic, ensuring you unlock the <strong>Umbral K’arroc mount</strong> and all related achievements quickly and safely.</p><h3>Order Your Glory of the Omega Raider Boost</h3><p>Get your <strong>Glory of the Omega Raider</strong> achievement today. Enjoy your new mount, exclusive rewards, and full completion credit — all handled professionally by Misti.Services.</p>', '<ul><li>Select your desired options and complete your order on&nbsp;Misti.Services.</li><li>You’ll receive an order confirmation and tracking number via email.</li><li>Our support manager will contact you through live chat to confirm all details.</li><li>If you’re unavailable, we’ll reach out via email or your preferred contact method.</li><li>When the boost is finished, you’ll receive a completion notification on Discord or another messenger of your choice.</li></ul>', '<ul><li>Level 80 character</li><li>Access to <em>The War Within</em> expansion</li><li>Active World of Warcraft subscription</li><li>Don’t have a max-level character? Use our <a href="https://misti.services/game/warwithin/leveling/wow-the-war-within-leveling" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank"><strong>WoW Power Leveling Boost</strong></a> service</li></ul>', 96.87, 'https://kdjlhibxxygfdmlvdfcl.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/game-images/glory-of-the-omega-raider-boost-1762532930284.webp', NULL, 4.9, 350, true, true, 0, '2025-10-25T02