he boost</li></ul><h2><strong>Why Choose misti.services?</strong></h2><p><strong> We’re built for speed, reliability, and clean communication:</strong></p><ul><li><strong>Verified, experienced boosters</strong> only</li><li><strong>24/7 support</strong> to help before, during, and after the service</li><li><strong>Fast &amp; secure delivery</strong> with careful handling and consistent updates</li></ul><h2><strong>PoE 2 Leveling Milestones (Recommended Path to Endgame)</strong></h2><p><strong> If you’re planning your progression, these milestones are a great target:</strong></p><ul><li><strong>Level 30</strong> - complete early Trials + key side quests</li><li><strong>Level 50</strong> - complete next Trial stage + relevant side quests</li><li><strong>Level 60</strong> - finish another Trial and reach endgame access</li><li><strong>Level 70+</strong> - complete the final Trial stage and progress through the Atlas</li></ul><h3><strong>Start Your PoE 2 Leveling Boost Today</strong></h3><p><strong> Choose your target level</strong>, add Trials / side quests / build options if needed, and checkout. We’ll contact you shortly and get your character moving toward endgame - fast.</p>', '<ul><li><strong>Place your order:</strong> Pick your target level and any add-ons, then complete checkout.</li><li><strong>Set the schedule:</strong> Our support team will message you within minutes to confirm the start time.</li><li><strong>We run the boost:</strong> Choose <strong>Piloted</strong> (we play on your account) or <strong>Self-play</strong>. Your booster handles the leveling safely and efficiently.</li><li><strong>Get your rewards:</strong> When it’s done, you keep all loot, items, and currency earned during the run.</li></ul>', '<ul><li>Path of Exile 2 Character</li></ul>', 1.5, 'https://kdjlhibxxygfdmlvdfcl.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/game-images/pnbjjh480nr.webp', NULL, 4.9, 0, true, true, 0, '2025-12-29T22:50:38.486668+00:00', '2026-01-20T23:42:45.4586+00:00', 'dbe