t in real time.</p><p><strong>Selfplay:</strong> Join our booster’s team and play alongside them during the RBG matches.</p><h3>About RBG Boosting</h3><p>Rated Battlegrounds in <strong>Mists of Pandaria Classic</strong> are one of the most competitive PvP formats, requiring strong coordination, strategy, and skill. Progress can be slow without the right team — but with <strong>misti.services</strong>, you can skip the frustration and focus on results.</p><p>Our RBG Boost ensures efficient rating gains and full safety. Every session is handled manually by experienced PvP players who know how to maximize performance and secure your rewards.</p><h3>Why Choose misti.services</h3><ul><li>Expert RBG teams with proven track records</li><li>Fast and secure rating progress</li><li>100% manual boosting — no automation or risks</li><li>Constant updates and transparent communication</li><li>Trusted service used by hundreds of satisfied players</li></ul><h3>Get Your RBG Rating Fast</h3><p>Stop wasting hours in frustrating battleground queues. With <strong>misti.services</strong>, you can reach your desired <strong>Rated Battleground rating</strong>, unlock elite PvP gear, and earn prestigious titles faster than ever.</p><p>Order your <strong>WoW Pandaria Classic RBG Boost</strong> today and take your PvP experience to the next level.</p>', '<ul><li>Select your desired options and complete your order on&nbsp;Misti.Services.</li><li>You’ll receive an order confirmation and tracking number via email.</li><li>Our support manager will contact you through live chat to confirm all details.</li><li>If you’re unavailable, we’ll reach out via email or your preferred contact method.</li><li>When the boost is finished, you’ll receive a completion notification on Discord or another messenger of your choice.</li></ul>', '<ul><li>Level 90 character in Mists of Pandaria Classic</li><li>Honor gear for lower-tier ratings</li><li>Conquest gear for higher-tier ratings</li></ul><p>Need help reaching