Choose your desired quantity of Badges.</p></li><li><p><strong>Place Your Order:</strong> Complete the secure checkout process.</p></li><li><p><strong>Account Creation/Login:</strong> If you checked out as a guest, an account will be created for you. Log in to your misti.services account.</p></li><li><p><strong>Booster Assignment:</strong> A skilled booster will be assigned to your order. They will contact you via chat to confirm details and start the service.</p></li><li><p><strong>Account Piloting:</strong> For piloted services, provide account access details to your booster. You must not log into the character during the boost.</p></li><li><p><strong>Service Completion:</strong> You will receive an email notification once your Earthstrike trinket boost is successfully completed.</p></li></ul><p></p>', '<ul>
