ablo IV Leveling Boost</a></p>', 0, 'https://kdjlhibxxygfdmlvdfcl.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/game-images/paragon-level-boost-1762897622991.webp', NULL, 4.9, 350, true, true, 0, '2025-11-05T01:43:51.002272+00:00', '2025-12-16T00:24:22.024931+00:00', 'd69ac67d-532d-4d2e-aa92-e326579125b8', true, '{"step":1,"end_label":"Desired Level","max_value":300,"min_value":1,"default_end":300,"start_label":"Current Level","default_start":1,"pricing_brackets":[{"end":50,"price":5.69,"start":1},{"end":100,"price":5.69,"start":51},{"end":150,"price":12.16,"start":101},{"end":200,"price":12.16,"start":151},{"end":250,"price":50.86,"start":201},{"end":300,"price":331.76,"start":251}],"estimated_time_per_step":0.1}', true, 0, '15 minutes', 'average start time', 'Flexible', 'order completion', 'Boost Paragon levels fast in Diablo 4. Save time, skip the grind, and unlock full power with Misti Services.', 'diablo 4 paragon level boost, d4 paragon leveling service, fast d4 paragon boost, buy diablo 4 paragon levels, d4 skip grind paragon, unlock d4 full power, misti services diablo 4 boost, cheap d4 paragon leveling, professional d4 level boost, d4 character power boost, diablo 4 xp farm service, d4 max paragon level, d4 end game boost, diablo 4 account power up', 'https://kdjlhibxxygfdmlvdfcl.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/game-images/paragon-level-boost-1762897622991.webp', NULL, 'Paragon Level Boost', 'Diablo 4 Paragon Level Boost | misti.services', NULL);
INSERT INTO public.products (id, name, slug, short_description, description, how_it_works, requirements, base_price, image_url, badge_text, trust_score, total_reviews, is_active, is_featured, sort_order, created_at, updated_at, category_id, is_slider_product, slider_config, is_manually_popular, total_sales, start_time_text, start_time_value, delivery_text, delivery_value, meta_description, meta_keywords, og_image, canonical_url, image_alt_text, meta_title, parent_link) VALUES ('1212f14d-2e3d-480b-954f-64eb8757adbc', 'Void-Forged Stallion', 'void-forged-stallion', 'The Void-Forged Stallion is a rare and visually impressive ground mount introduced in Patch 11.1.5, noted for its darkened body, glowing purple veins, and overall eerie void aesthetic. Accessing the mount requires players to complete a secret challenge inside the Revisited Horrific Vision of Stormwind (during its active week), which involves extensive exploration and a final tough encounter. ', '<h1><strong>WoW Void-Forged Stallion Ground Mount Boost</strong></h1><p>Tired of hunting down hidden items in a sanity-draining nightmare? The <strong>Void-Forged Stallion</strong> is one of the most striking ground mounts in <em>The War Within</em>, but unlocking it means successfully locating four hidden Cursed Horseshoes in the revisited Stormwind Vision and defeating the resulting powerful summoned boss. This is a complex, time-sensitive puzzle, but with <strong>misti.services</strong>, you can skip the tedious search and the demanding final fight, securing this shadowy steed efficiently.</p><h2><strong>Overview: The Void-Forged Stallion</strong></h2><p>The <strong>Void-Forged Stallion</strong> is a rare and visually impressive ground mount introduced in Patch 11.1.5, noted for its darkened body, glowing purple veins, and overall eerie void aesthetic. Accessing the mount requires players to complete a secret challenge inside the <strong>Revisited Horrific Vision of Stormwind</strong> (during its active week), w