imer. <strong>misti.services</strong> offers the fastest and most secure solution:</p><ul><li><strong>Hidden Item Mastery:</strong> We eliminate the time wasted searching for the four highly hidden Cursed Horseshoes, leveraging expert knowledge for an optimized route.</li><li><strong>Guaranteed Boss Kill:</strong> We ensure the summoned Stallion is defeated efficiently, avoiding catastrophic failures caused by sanity drain or mechanical errors.</li><li><strong>Rapid Completion:</strong> Our average completion time is minimal (up to 2 hours per attempt), saving you valuable time and effort.</li><li><strong>Security:</strong> We handle the difficult execution entirely, guaranteeing a successful unlock without the risk of failed runs or wasted attempts.</li></ul><h2><strong>Boost Options Explained</strong></h2><p>You have control over how we deliver your mount, focusing on your comfort and security:</p><ul><li><strong>Account Sharing (Piloted):</strong> Our professional player logs in to your account. We use strict security protocols, including VPNs matching your country of residence, to ensure the login appears local.</li><li><strong>Remote Control:</strong> Our player connects securely to your desktop via a remote application (like Parsec). They execute the game actions live while you watch, ensuring your login credentials are never shared.</li></ul>', '<ul><li><strong>Order Confirmation:</strong> Once your payment is processed, our support manager will contact you immediately via chat or email.</li><li><strong>Scheduling:</strong> We coordinate a time window that suits the active Stormwind Vision rotation and our expert booster''s schedule.</li><li><strong>Execution:</strong> The assigned booster logs in securely, enters the vision, locates the horseshoes, melts them at the forge, and defeats the summoned boss.</li><li><strong>Completion:</strong> The service is complete the moment the mount item, <strong>Void-Forged Stallion''s Reins</strong>, is obtained. You receive an immediate notification, and the account is ready for your use.</li></ul>', '<ul><li><strong>Level 80 Character:</strong> Required for successful solo or group navigation and combat within the vision.</li><li><strong>The War Within Expansion:</strong> Access to the current expansion content is necessary.</li><li><strong>Mask Unlock:</strong> At least <strong>one Horrific Visions Faceless Mask must be unlocked</strong> on your account (required to trigger the mount event).</li><li><strong>Active WoW Subscription:</strong> You must maintain an active subscription throughout the service duration.</li></ul>', 4.24, 'https://kdjlhibxxygfdmlvdfcl.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/game-images/void-forged-stallion-1764171905863.webp', NULL, 4.9, 0, true, true, 0, '2025-11-24T21:03:28.647194+00:00', '2025-12-16T07:23:57.502797+00:00', 'b4c0ccaf-a937-4b30-9ab4-7dacee8f739b', false, NULL, true, 0, '15 minutes', 'average start time', 'Flexible', 'order completion', 'Buy the Void-Forged Stallion mount! We complete the challenging horseshoe collection and summoned boss fight in the Revisited Horrific Vision of Stormwind (11.1.5).', 'Void-Forged Stallion mount, Horrific Visions Stormwind, Void-Forged Stallion Reins, Patch 11.1.5 mount, The War Within mount boost, rare void horse, Cursed Horseshoes challenge', 'https://kdjlhibxxygfdmlvdfcl.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/game-images/void-forged-stallion-1764171905863.webp', NULL, 'Void Forged Stallion', 'War Within Void-Forged Mount | misti.services', NULL);
