uos.</li><li><strong>Secure Exclusive Reward:</strong> Lock in this potentially exclusive mount before the Dastardly Duos event leaves the rotation</li></ul>', '<ul><li><strong>Order &amp; Scheduling:</strong> After placing your order, our support team contacts you to confirm details and coordinate the schedule based on the in-game Dastardly Duos event rotation.</li><li><strong>Execution:</strong> The assigned booster logs in at the scheduled times to defeat the weekly boss duos, ensuring the "Another Amazing Week!" achievement progress is secured consistently.</li><li><strong>Completion:</strong> The service concludes once the 5th week''s challenge is defeated and the <strong>Tyrannotort''s Treat</strong> mount is delivered to your inventory.</li><li><strong>Notification:</strong> You are notified immediately upon completion via your preferred contact method.</li></ul>', '<ul><li><strong>Expansion:</strong> Access to <strong>The War Within</strong> expansion content.</li><li><strong>Level:</strong> A <strong>Level 80</strong> character.</li><li><strong>Subscription:</strong> An active WoW subscription.</li></ul>', 33.15, 'https://kdjlhibxxygfdmlvdfcl.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/game-images/tyrannotort-1764171086467.webp', NULL, 4.9, 0, true, true, 0, '2025-11-24T21:13:03.337227+00:00', '2025-12-16T07:23:58.986908+00:00', 'b4c0ccaf-a937-4b30-9ab4-7dacee8f739b', false, NULL, true, 0, '15 minutes', 'average start time', 'Flexible', 'order completion', 'Buy the time-limited Tyrannotort mount! We guarantee completion of the Dastardly Duos event (5th week) on your Level 80 character. Exclusive Albino Turtle.', 'WoW Tyrannotort mount, Dastardly Duos boost, Another Amazing Week achievement, Patch 11.1.5 mount, The War Within mount boost, rare albino turtle, time-limited WoW reward, WoW mount carry', 'https://kdjlhibxxygfdmlvdfcl.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/game-images/tyrannotort-1764171086467.webp', NULL, 'Tyrannotort', 'Get Tyrannotort Mount - War Withi