conquering TBC''s ultimate raid content.</li></ul>', '<ul><li><strong>Character Level:</strong> Your character must be level 70 in WoW TBC Anniversary Classic.</li></ul>', 75, 'https://kdjlhibxxygfdmlvdfcl.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/game-images/wow-tbc-anniversary-sunwell-plateau-boost-1768952138185.webp', NULL, 4.9, 0, true, true, 0, '2026-01-10T21:00:20.901051+00:00', '2026-01-20T23:43:01.567445+00:00', '542d3f01-5eb4-4572-bd18-75dea239ed84', false, NULL, true, 0, '15 minutes', 'average start time', 'Flexible', 'order completion', 'Conquer Sunwell Plateau in WoW TBC Anniversary with a guaranteed 6/6 clear. Get ilvl 146-154 gear, Tier 6.5 items, and defeat Kil''jaeden today.', 'wow tbc sunwell plateau boost buy, sunwell plateau carry, tbc anniversary raid boost, kil''jaeden kill, tier 6.5 gear tbc, tbc sunwell plateau price, wow tbc raid service, 6/6 sunwell clear, tbc phase 4 gear, wow tbc anniversary boost, buy tbc sunwell boost, wow tbc sunwell gear, tbc sunwell plateau farmed, sunwell plateau run, tbc sunwell plateau service, wow tbc pve boost, tbc endgame gear, wow tbc anniversary raid, sunwell plateau raid, gaming service', 'https://kdjlhibxxygfdmlvdfcl.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/game-images/wow-tbc-anniversary-sunwell-plateau-boost-1768952138185.webp', NULL, 'Wow Tbc Anniversary Sunwell Plateau Boost', 'Buy WoW TBC Sunwell Plateau Boost | misti.services', NULL);
