PvE item levels stay lower. This boost is available only as a <strong>piloted service</strong>.</p>', '<h3>How PvP Gear Upgrades Work in The War Within</h3><p>PvP gear starts at a lower base item level but can be improved using upgrade materials:</p><ul><li><strong>Valorstones</strong> – obtained from PvP strongboxes</li><li><strong>Drake’s Crests</strong> – earned by reaching higher rated brackets (around 1600+ rating)</li></ul><p>Gear ranks progress through stages such as Unranked, Challenger, and Elite. Upgrades affect your open-world and PvE stats only, as PvP item level remains the same.</p><p>To upgrade, visit <strong>Ledonir in Dornogal</strong> at coordinates roughly (59.8, 69.9). Conquest gear scales to mythic-raid equivalent item level within PvP environments, providing a significant advantage in stamina, versatility, and damage output.</p><p>Our professional PvP boosters, all <strong>multi Rank-1 players</strong>, use the fastest methods to farm Conquest efficiently:</p><ul><li><strong>Rated Arenas</strong> with optimized meta compositions</li><li><strong>Solo Shuffle</strong> for quick queue times</li><li><strong>Weekly PvP quests</strong> and Bloody Coin turn-ins</li></ul><p>The service also includes <strong>class tier set pieces</strong> for additional bonuses. Our experts focus on gearing builds with optimal <strong>Versatility sockets</strong> and relevant trophy upgrades, ensuring your character is fully optimized for competitive PvP.</p><p>Take control of the battlefield with <strong>misti.services</strong> — where top-tier pros turn your WoW PvP goals into reality.</p>', '<ul><li>Character level 80 or higher</li></ul>', 0, 'https://kdjlhibxxygfdmlvdfcl.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/game-images/full-pvp-gear-1762439642727.webp', NULL, 4.9, 350, true, true, 0, '2025-10-23T14:41:03.860135+00:00', '2025-12-16T07:54:58.106997+00:00', '31441b65-4762-40ea-b89f-9fd09aebe8ba', false, NULL, true, 0, '15 minutes', 'average start time', 'Flexible', 'order completion', 'WoW PvP Gear Boost – Get Full Conquest or Honor Gear Fast | misti.', 'wow gladiator title boost, buy pvp gear wow, wow pvp gear farm, gladiator title service, world of warcraft pvp boost, fast wow pvp gear, cheap gladiator boost, wow competitive pvp gear, skip pvp grind wow, gladiator achievement service, wow arena title boost, buy wow arena gear, professional wow pvp boosting', 'https://kdjlhibxxygfdmlvdfcl.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/game-images/full-pvp-gear-1762439642727.webp', NULL, 'Full Pvp Gear', 'War Within PvP Gear - Instant & Maxed | misti.services', NULL);
