<li>Increased Intelligence</li><li>Enhanced Pyromancy Damage</li><li>Hydra becomes a Core Skill, always summoning a 3-headed Hydra whose attacks explode on impact</li><li>Each extra head increases size and damage by up to 100%</li></ul><h3>Boost Options Explained</h3><ul><li><strong>Greater Affixes:</strong> Receive the amulet with enhanced affix bonuses for optimal performance</li><li><strong>High Roll Stats:</strong> Item stats are rolled near maximum values</li><li><strong>High Roll Unique Power:</strong> Unique effect scaled to 70% of the maximum potential</li></ul><h3>About Ophidian Iris</h3><p><strong>Ophidian Iris</strong> is a Unique Amulet designed for Sorcerers in Diablo 4. It completely redefines Hydra gameplay by transforming it into a Core Skill with a single, powerful summon. Instead of summoning multiple Hydras, each additional head boosts its size and damage, creating a devastating fire serpent that dominates the battlefield.</p><p>This item’s bonuses to Pyromancy Damage, Critical Strike Chance, and Devouring Blaze make it a top-tier pick for any fire-focused Sorcerer build. Whether you’re clearing dungeons or burning through elite bosses, Ophidian Iris ensures your Hydra becomes an unstoppable force.</p><h3>Why Buy Ophidian Iris from Misti.Services</h3><p>Farming Ophidian Iris can be frustrating due to low drop rates and random rolls. <strong>Misti.Services</strong> offers a fast, secure way to obtain the perfect version of this item — no grinding, no guesswork.</p><h4>Benefits of Choosing Misti.Services</h4><ul><li>Guaranteed delivery with optional Greater Affix and High Roll upgrades</li><li>Safe manual trade process with zero third-party tools</li><li>Fast turnaround and 24/7 live support</li><li>Experienced Diablo 4 boosters who ensure secure, professional service</li><li>Perfect solution for Pyromancer and Hydra-based Sorcerer builds</li></ul><h3>Who Should Use Ophidian Iris</h3><p>The <strong>Ophidian Iris</strong> is ideal for:</p><ul><li>Sorcerers focusing on Hydra-based or Pyromancy builds</li><li>Players seeking massive AoE fire damage and scaling Intellect</li><li>Endgame and seasonal builds utilizing Fire and Blaze synergies</li><li>Those wanting a single, powerful Hydra instead of multiple weaker summons</li></ul><p>Unleash true elemental power — buy your <strong>Diablo 4 Ophidian Iris</strong> today from <strong>Misti.Services</strong> and let your Hydra become the centerpiece of your Sorcerer’s might.</p>', '<ul><li>Select your desired options and complete your order on&nbsp;Misti.Services.</li><li>You’ll receive an order confirmation and tracking number via email.</li><li>Our support manager will contact you through live chat to confirm all details.</li><li>If you’re unavailable, we’ll reach out via email or your preferred contact method.</li><li>When the boost is finished, you’ll receive a completion notification on Discord or another messenger of your choice.</li></ul>', '<ul><li>Active Diablo 4 account.</li><li>Character at appropriate level and build to access Torment I or higher.</li></ul><p>Need help leveling? Check our&nbsp;<a href="https://misti.services/game/buy-diablo-iv-boost/leveling" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank" style="color: rgb(250, 250, 250);">Diablo IV Leveling Boost</a></p>', 5.72, 'https://kdjlhibxxygfdmlvdfcl.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/game-images/ophidian-iris-1762727356056.webp', NULL, 4.9, 350, true, true, 0, '2025-11-04T04:19:57.32225+00:00', '2025-12-16T00:24:37.959753+00:00', '1661c892-50ee-4f2c-8d96-f31f6e81c787', false, NULL, true, 0, '15 minutes', 'average start time', 'Flexible', 'order completion', 'Buy Diablo 4 Ophidian Iris at Misti.Services. Transform Hydra into your Sorcerer’s ultimate Core Skill with massive firepower and bonus Pyromancy damage.', 'diablo 4 ophidian iris, buy ophidian iris, ophidian iris sorcerer, hydra core skill d4, pyromancy damage d4, ophidian iris misti.services, diablo 4 unique focus, sorcerer build item d4, hydra transformation item, d4 legendary focus, buy d4 unique gear, ophidian iris price, best sorcerer focus diablo 4', 'https://kdjlhibxxygfdmlvdfcl.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/game-images/ophidian-iris-1762727356056.webp', NULL, 'Ophidian Iris', 'Get D4 Ophidian Iris Item | misti.services', NULL);
INSERT INTO public.products (id, name, slug, short_description, description, how_it_works, requirements, base_price, image_url, badge_text, trust_score, total_reviews, is_active, is_featured, sort_order, created_at, updated_at, category_id, is_slider_product, slider_config, is_manually_popular, total_sales, start_time_text, start_time_value, delivery_text, delivery_value, meta_description, meta_keywords, og_image, canonical_url, image_alt_text, meta_title, parent_link) VALUES ('0d02bc5d-a73e-4372-9ac4-b55fe2fd8893', 'Battlefield 6 Profile Rank Level Boost', 'battlefield-6-profile-rank-level-boost', 'Boost your Battlefield 6 career with our professional Battlefield 6 Profile Leveling service. Skip the slow grind and unlock powerful weapons, gadgets, vehicles, and specializations at top speed. Our expert Battlefield players will safely level your account, helping you reach any desired rank quickly, securely, and efficiently.', '<h1><strong>Battlefield 6 Profile Rank Level Boost</strong></h1><p>Boost your Battlefield 6 career with our professional <a href="https://misti.services/game/buy-battlefield-6-boost" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank"><strong>Battlefield 6 Profile Leveling</strong></a><strong> service</strong>. Skip the slow grind and unlock powerful weapons, gadgets, vehicles, and specializations at top speed. Our expert Battlefield players will safely level your account, helping you reach any desired rank quickly, securely, and efficiently.</p><p>Perfect for players who want to gain full access to the battlefield arsenal, stay competitive, and start playing at peak power instantly.</p><h2><strong>Service Includes</strong></h2><ul><li>Battlefield 6 Career Rank boosted to your desired level</li><li>All weapons, gadgets, and vehicles unlocked through rank progression</li><li>Fast XP farming in objective-based game modes</li><li>Access to all base gameplay systems and class equipment</li><li>100% manual gameplay from skilled Battlefield players</li></ul><h2><strong>What Is Profile Leveling in Battlefield 6?</strong></h2><p>Profile Leveling is the core progression system in Battlefield 6. As you play matches and complete in-game actions such as capturing objectives, eliminating enemies, assisting teammates, and supporting your squad, you earn XP that increases your Career Rank. This progression unlocks new weapons, gadgets, vehicles, and tactical upgrades. Without leveling your profile, your access to essential gear and gameplay tools remains limited.</p><h2><strong>Why Is Profile Leveling Important in Battlefield 6?</strong></h2><p>Your Profile Level directly determines how much equipment and combat flexibility you have. Higher levels unlock key weapons, advanced gadgets, class tools, and vehicle upgrades that are critical for competitive gameplay. A fully leveled account gives you:</p><ul><li>A complete arsenal of powerful weapons</li><li>Access to key support and tactical gadgets</li><li>More strategic options in every combat scenario</li></ul><p>If you want to compete at the highest level from the start, profile leveling is essential.</p><h2><strong>Profile Level vs Weapon Level: What’s the Difference?</strong></h2><p>These two progression systems work together but serve different purposes in Battlefield 6:</p><ul><li><strong>Profile Level</strong> unlocks new base weapons, gadgets, and equipment for your soldier</li><li><strong>Weapon Level</strong> upgrades individual weapons you already unlocked, adding attachments and performance improvements</li></ul><p>To fully optimize your loadout, you first level your profile to unlock weapons, then level the weapons themselves to maximize their effectiveness.</p><h2><strong>What Is the Fastest Way to Level Up in Battlefield 6?</strong></h2><p>The most efficient way to level up your profile is through objective-focused gameplay, not just kills. Battlefield rewards teamwork and tactical play, so to earn XP as fast as possible, players focus on:</p><ul><li>Capturing and defending objectives in modes like Conquest</li><li>Providing medical and ammo support to teammates</li><li>Destroying vehicles and holding strategic points</li><li>Reviving, spotting, and assisting squad members</li></ul><p>Structured objective play generates significantly more XP than standard kill-focused gameplay, making it the fastest leveling method.</p><h2><strong>What You Get</strong></h2><ul><li>Your requested Battlefield 6 rank delivered</li><li>All unlockable weapons and gadgets available at the new rank</li><li>Efficient XP farming and objective-play focus</li><li>Fully upgraded, combat-ready profile</li></ul><h2><strong>Why Choose misti.services</strong></h2><ul><li>Experienced Battlefield pro players handle your boost</li><li>100% secure and manual gameplay</li><li>Confidential account handling and guaranteed safety</li><li>24/7 support and real-time updates</li><li>Proven premium boosting experience since 2013</li></ul><h2><strong>Order Battlefield 6 Level Boosting</strong></h2><p>Dominate the battlefield with full access to weapons, gadgets, vehicles, and specialist perks. Let our experts handle the grind — you log in ready to win.</p><p>Unlock your soldier’s true potential with fast, safe, professional <strong>Battlefield 6 level boosting</strong> at <strong>misti.services</strong>.</p>', '<ul><li>Select your desired Battlefield 6 Profile Level and place your order</li><li>We assign an expert Battlefield booster to maximize XP gains efficiently</li><li>The booster completes matches in objective-focused modes for fastest leveling</li><li>Your profile reaches the selected rank and unlocks all associated gear</li><li>You receive confirmation and can immediately enjoy your upgraded soldier</li></ul>', '<ul><li>Battlefield 6 game account</li></ul>', 0, 'https://kdjlhibxxygfdmlvdfcl.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/game-images/battlefield-6-profile-rank-level-boost-1762812051276.webp', NULL, 4.9, 0, true, true, 0, '2025-10-31T20:25:15.559353+00:00', '2025-12-16T00:22:09.405864+00:00', '73c36c9a-6b04-4027-92d2-c1579897738c', true, '{"step":1,"end_label":"Desired Level","max_value":500,"min_value":1,"default_end":100,"start_label":"Current Level","default_start":1,"pricing_brackets":[{"end":500,"price":2250,"start":1}],"estimated_time_per_step":0.09}', true, 0, '1 hour', 'average start time', 'Flexible', 'order completion', 'Battlefield 6 Profile Rank Level Boost Boost your Battlefield 6 career with our professional Battlefield 6 Profile Leveling service .', 'battlefield 6 rank boost, bf6 profile leveling service, buy battlefield 6 level, fast bf6 rank up, unlock bf6 weapons quickly, professional battlefield 6 boosting, secure bf6 account leveling, skip bf6 grind service, battlefield 6 specialization unlock, expert bf6 rankers, cheap battlefield 6 level boost, efficient bf6 profile boost, high rank battlefield 6, instant bf6 progress', 'https://kdjlhibxxygfdmlvdfcl.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/game-images/battlefield-6-profile-rank-level-boost-1762812051276.webp', NULL, 'Battlefield 6 Profile Rank Level Boost', 'Boost Battlefield 6 Profile Level | misti.services', NULL);
