p>Tempest Keep stands as a pinnacle of challenges in The Burning Crusade Anniversary content, offering discerning players some of the most sought-after Tier 5 gear and the iconic Ashes of Al''ar mount. Our specialized Tempest Keep boost service is designed to navigate the complexities of this 25-player raid, ensuring a smooth, efficient, and successful run. It''s the perfect solution for players looking to complete their Tier 5 sets, acquire powerful upgrades, and experience this classic raid without the hassle of organizing a full team.</p><h2><strong>Why Choose Our Service</strong></h2><ul><li><strong>Expert Teams:</strong> Play with or be carried by highly experienced raid teams proficient in fast and efficient Tempest Keep clears.</li><li><strong>Guaranteed Progression:</strong> Secure essential Tier 5 tokens and gear, vital for advancing your character in TBC Anniversary.</li><li><strong>Flexible Options:</strong> Choose between Piloted or Selfplay modes to best suit your preferences and schedule.</li><li><strong>Loot Assurance:</strong> Benefit from options like guaranteed items or full loot priority for optimal gear acquisition.</li><li><strong>Time-Saving:</strong> Bypass the long group finding and coordination efforts, getting straight to the rewards.</li></ul><p>Empower your journey through The Burning Crusade Anniversary by securing your Tempest Keep triumphs with misti.services. Experience seamless raiding and claim your rightful rewards today.</p>', '<ul><li><strong>Place Your Order:</strong> Select your desired options and complete your purchase for the WoW TBC Anniversary Tempest Keep Boost.</li><li><strong>Team Assignment:</strong> We will assign a professional 25-player raid team specializing in swift Tempest Keep clears on Anniversary realms.</li><li><strong>Raid Execution:</strong> The team will perform a full 4/4 raid clear, adhering to your chosen loot priority to acquire Tier 5 shoulder and chest tokens and high-ilvl gear.</li><li><strong>Confirmation:</strong> You will receive notification upon the successful defeat of Kael''thas and confirmation of your secured Tier 5 loot, along with any chance at the Ashes of Al''ar mount.</li><li><strong>Enjoy Rewards:</strong> Equip your powerful Tier 5 set pieces and continue your progression through TBC Anniversary content.</li></ul>', '<ul><li><strong>Character Level:</strong> Your character must be level 70 in WoW TBC Anniversary Classic.</li><li><strong>Tempest Key Attunement:</strong> Your character needs to possess The Tempest Key, signifying attunement completion.</li></ul>', 79.99, 'https://kdjlhibxxygfdmlvdfcl.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/game-images/wow-tbc-anniversary-tempest-keep-boost-1768952347416.webp', NULL, 4.9, 0, true, true, 0, '2026-01-10T20:54:09.663324+00:00', '2026-01-20T23:43:03.300889+00:00', '542d3f01-5eb4-4572-bd18-75dea239ed84', false, NULL, true, 0, '15 minutes', 'average start time', 'Flexible', 'order completion', 'Secure your WoW TBC Anniversary Tempest Keep raid boost, guarantee a full 4/4 clear, Tier 5 loot, and a chance at Ashes of Al''ar mount via misti.services.', 'wow tbc tempest keep boost buy, tempest keep carry price, wow tbc raid boost, wow tbc tempest keep, tbc anniversary raid, tbc tier 5 boost, tbc ashes of al''ar, kael''thas kill boost, buy wow tbc raid, wow tbc boost, tbc classic boost, tbc raid carry, wow tbc power leveling, wow tbc gear boost, tbc attunement, tempest keep full clear, tbc 25 player raid, tbc loot priority, wow tbc dungeon, wow tbc gold, tbc anniversary', 'https://kdjlhibxxygfdmlvdfcl.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/game-images/wow-tbc-anniversary-tempest-keep-boost-1768952347416.webp', NULL, 'Wow Tbc Anniversary Tempest Keep Boost', 'Buy WoW TBC Tempest Keep Boost | misti.services', NULL);
INSERT INTO public.products (id, name, slug, short_description, description, how_it_works, requirements, base_price, image_url, badge_text, trust_score, total_reviews, is_active, is_featured, sort_order, created_at, updated_at, category_id, is_slider_product, slider_config, is_manually_popular, total_sales, start_time_text, start_time_value, delivery_text, delivery_value, meta_description, meta_keywords, og_image, canonical_url, image_alt_text, meta_title, parent_link) VALUES ('362c6ec5-1a9f-4cc4-9099-7e890d08c803', 'Shoreline Raid', 'escape-from-tarkov-shoreline-raid-boost', 'Shoreline is one of Tarkov’s most profitable and dangerous maps, dominated by the Azure Coast Health Resort. It’s a hotspot for high-stakes PvP, rare medical loot, and the Scav boss Sanitar. Pushing into the Resort without experience often ends in quick, expensive deaths.', '<h1><strong>Escape from Tarkov Shoreline Raid Boost</strong></h1><p>Shoreline is one of Tarkov’s most profitable and dangerous maps, dominated by the Azure Coast Health Resort. It’s a hotspot for high-stakes PvP, rare medical loot, and the Scav boss Sanitar. Pushing into the Resort without experience often ends in quick, expensive deaths.</p><p>With the <strong>Escape from Tarkov Shoreline Raid Boost from misti.services</strong>, you get an experienced Tarkov pro who knows every hallway, room, and angle in the Health Resort. We help you secure LEDX, rare keys, and medical loot while dealing with Sanitar and hostile players, turning risky raids into consistent progress and profit.</p><h2><strong>Service Includes</strong></h2><p>When you order the Shoreline Raid Boost from misti.services, you get:</p><ul><li>Tarkov Shoreline raid completion according to your selected package</li><li>Help looting the Health Resort and surviving its high-stakes PvP environment</li><li>Ideal conditions for farming LEDX, rare keys, medical items, and other valuable loot</li><li>Focused support for hunting and killing Sanitar and his guards</li><li>A fast and secure service designed to help you master the deadly Resort and surrounding area</li><li>All extracted loot, quest items, and progress kept on your account</li></ul><h2><strong>Boost Options Explained</strong></h2><ul><li><strong>Piloted</strong> – A professional Tarkov player logs into your account and runs Shoreline raids on your PMC, focusing on your chosen goals (LEDX, keys, Sanitar, quests, or general progression).</li><li><strong>Selfplay</strong> – You join our booster as part of the team while playing on your own account. They guide you through the Resort, handle the most dangerous angles, and help you win fights and extract safely.</li><li><strong>Stream</strong> – You can request that the service is streamed so you can watch every raid live, learn routes, angles, and key room paths, and see exactly how your loot and kills are secured.</li></ul><h2><strong>About EFT Shoreline Raid Boost</strong></h2><p>Shoreline is a large coastal map, but the real action is concentrated in the Health Resort:</p><ul><li>The resort is one of the <strong>best places in the game to find LEDX</strong>, rare keys, and high-value medical loot</li><li>It’s a <strong>major PvP hotspot</strong>, attracting geared squads and solo players looking for fast profit</li><li>It is home to <strong>Sanitar</strong>, a Scav boss backed by guards and dangerous positioning</li></ul><p>The <strong>Shoreline Raid Boost</strong> from misti.services is designed to help you:</p><ul><li>Access and control the Health Resort without getting instantly wiped</li><li>Secure LEDX and other rare items needed for hideout upgrades and quests</li><li>Progress Shoreline-related questlines without endless trial and error</li></ul><p>Instead of guessing room paths or learning the map through repeated deaths, you benefit from a structured approach guided by someone who already knows every corner.</p><h3><strong>Common Objectives on the Shoreline Map</strong></h3><p>We can tailor your boost around multiple common goals, including:</p><ul><li><strong>Farming High-Value Loot</strong></li><li> The Health Resort is the prime location for LEDX, rare keycards, and valuable medical supplies. We focus on high-value rooms and known spawn locations to maximize your profit per raid.</li><li><strong>Hunting Sanitar</strong></li><li> We help you track down and eliminate Sanitar and his guards so you can secure his medical items, keycard, and other valuable gear for quests or resale.</li><li><strong>Winning Resort PvP</strong></li><li> Instead of pushing into the Resort alone, you enter with an expert who knows the common angles, push timings, and defensive setups. Whether piloted or selfplay, this dramatically increases your chances of surviving and clearing enemy teams.</li></ul><h3><strong>Why Choose misti.services for Shoreline?</strong></h3><ul><li><strong>Resort Masters</strong> – Our boosters know the Health Resort inside and out: every room, key spawn, loot hotspot, flank route, and tactical angle.</li><li><strong>Flexible Service Style</strong> – Choose between piloted for maximum convenience or selfplay if you want to experience the action and learn alongside a pro.</li><li><strong>100% Manual and Secure</strong> – All services are performed by hand, with a strong focus on account safety, privacy, and transparent communication.</li><li><strong>24/7 Live Support</strong> – Our support team is always available to help you plan your Shoreline objectives and keep you updated on order progress.</li><li><strong>Proven Reliability</strong> – misti.services is a trusted choice for high-stakes loot farming and quest completion on Tarkov’s most profitable and contested locations.</li></ul><p>With the <strong>Escape from Tarkov Shoreline Raid Boost</strong> from misti.services, you turn dangerous trips to the coast into consistent, profitable runs filled with rare loot, completed quests, and successful extractions.</p><p><br></p>', '<ul><li><strong>Select Your Shoreline Options</strong></li><li>Choose piloted or selfplay, specify your goals (LEDS farming, key hunting, Sanitar, or quest completion), and place your order on misti.services.</li><li><strong>We Assign a Shoreline Specialist</strong></li><li>A Tarkov veteran who has mastered the Health Resort and Shoreline’s rotations is assigned to your order. They review your current progress, key set, and objectives.</li><li><strong>Guided or Piloted Shoreline Raids</strong></li><li><br></li><li class="ql-indent-1">In <strong>piloted</strong> mode, the booster runs raids on your PMC, heading straight for the best loot rooms, key spawns, and Sanitar’s territory while managing PvP threats.</li><li class="ql-indent-1">In <strong>selfplay</strong>, you follow their lead as they clear corridors, hold angles, and secure rooms so you can safely loot and complete quests.</li><li><strong>Raids Completed, Loot Extracted</strong></li><li>LEDX, keycards, rare medical items, and any agreed objectives (Sanitar kills, quest steps, or general loot runs) are prioritized. All successful extractions stay on your account.</li><li><strong>Notification and Handover</strong></li><li>Once your requested raids or goals are completed, you are notified. You log back in to a richer stash, more completed tasks, and a much better relationship with Shoreline.</li></ul><p><br></p>', '<ul><li>Escape from Tarkov purchased and accessible on your account</li><li>For piloted service: login details so our booster can play on your PMC</li><li>Enough stash space to store weapons, armor, medical loot, and keys obtained during the raids</li></ul><p><br></p>', 9, 'https://kdjlhibxxygfdmlvdfcl.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/game-images/escape-from-tarkov-shoreline-raid-boost-1765387028676.webp', NULL, 4.9, 0, true, true, 0, '2025-12-08T21:50:52.295232+00:00', '2025-12-16T00:26:55.424433+00:00', '13095953-1c23-4cc6-9101-986220a1c75e', true, '{"step":1,"max_value":10,"min_value":1,"slider_type":"single","value_label":"Level","default_value":5,"pricing_brackets":[{"end":10,"price":0,"start":1}],"estimated_time_per_step":0}', true, 0, '15 minutes', 'average start time', 'Flexible', 'order completion', 'Dominate Shoreline’s Health Resort with a professional Tarkov raid boost from misti.services. Farm LEDX, rare keys, and hunt Sanitar!', 'escape from tarkov shoreline, tarkov shoreline raid boost, eft shoreline carry, tarkov shoreline map boost, shoreline health resort boost, tarkov resort loot farm, eft ledx farm shoreline, shoreline rare keys farming, tarkov sanitar hunt, eft sanitar carry, shoreline boss quest help, tarkov resort pvp boost, azure coast health resort, tarkov shoreline quest help, eft shoreline high value loot, shoreline medical loot farm, tarkov keycard farming, escape from tarkov raid carry, tarkov selfplay shoreline boost, tarkov piloted shoreline boost, eft stream shoreline runs, shoreline raid completion service, tarkov secure loot extraction, eft eu shoreline boost, eft us shoreline boost, safe tarkov boosting service, best tarkov shoreline carry, misti services tarkov shoreline, tarkov endgame loot runs, shoreline kappa prep, tarkov shoreline learning service, shoreline high stakes pvp, eft coastline map boost, tarkov questline completion shoreline, shoreline sanitar and guards runs, eft medical item farming, tarkov ledx and keycards farm, shoreline resort domination, escape from tarkov boosting services', 'https://kdjlhibxxygfdmlvdfcl.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/game-images/escape-from-tarkov-shoreline-raid-boost-1765387028676.webp', NULL, 'Escape From Tarkov Shoreline Raid Boost', 'Shoreline Raid EFT - Pro Carriers | misti.services', NULL);
INSERT INTO public.products (id, name, slug, short_description, description, how_it_works, requirements, base_price, image_url, badge_text, trust_score, total_reviews, is_active, is_featured, sort_order, created_at, updated_at, category_id, is_slider_product, slider_config, is_manually_popular, total_sales, start_time_text, start_time_value, delivery_text, delivery_value, meta_description, meta_keywords, og_image, canonical_url, image_alt_text, meta_title, parent_link) VALUES ('508c21cb-fdf6-4d24-9401-48293946102d', 'Translocated Gorger', 'translocated-gorger', NULL, '<h1><strong>Translocated Gorger Mount Boost</strong></h1><p><strong>Tame the horror of K''aresh. Secure this grotesque Void beast without chasing Devourer Swarms for days.</strong></p><p>The <strong>Translocated Gorger</strong> is a terrifying addition to the mount roster in <em>The War Within</em> Patch 11.2. Hailing from the ethereal homeworld of K''aresh, this beast is a product of the Void''s corruption. With its unsettling design and raw power, it is a perfect mount for players who want to instill fear on the battlefield.</p><p>However, capturing this creature is a logistical nightmare. It requires participating in chaotic <strong>Devourer Swarm</strong> events and farming <strong>Devoured Energy-Pods</strong>. The drop rate is low, and the mechanics require coordination and patience that most solo players simply do not have time for.</p><p>With <strong>misti.services</strong>, you can skip the swarm grind entirely. Our professional team will handle the farming of K''aresh''s elite mobs, ensuring you get the mount without the headache of daily camping.</p><h2><strong>Service Includes</strong></h2><p>When you purchase the <strong>Translocated Gorger Carry</strong>, we handle the repetitive farming process. The service guarantees:</p><ul><li><strong>The Mount:</strong> Translocated Gorger added to your collection.</li><li><strong>The Grind:</strong> Farming of <strong>Devoured Energy-Pods</strong> from Devourer Swarms on K''aresh.</li><li><strong>Loot Rights:</strong> You keep all gold, gear, and resources looted during the farming process.</li><li><strong>Manual Service:</strong> 100% hand-played by experienced boosters.</li></ul><h2><strong>More About the Translocated Gorger</strong></h2><p>The Translocated Gorger is a rare ground mount introduced in the K''aresh zone update. Unlike standard reputation mounts, this creature is tied to specific world events known as Devourer Swarms. To obtain it, players must engage with these high-density mob spawns and collect specific items like <strong>Devoured Energy-Pods</strong>.</p><p>For a casual player, this means interrupting your gameplay loop to chase events across the map, often competing with other players for tags. Our service removes this friction. We assign a booster to patrol K''aresh and complete the swarm events efficiently, gathering the necessary 20 Energy-Pods (or the required amount for the drop) so you don''t have to.</p><h2>Boost Options Explained</h2><p>We offer two secure methods to deliver your mount:</p><ul><li><strong>Piloted:</strong> Our professional player logs into your account to complete the boost. We utilize strict security protocols, including VPNs matching your country, to ensure your account remains safe and flagged as a local login.</li><li><strong>Remote Control:</strong> For the highest level of security, our booster connects to your PC via a secure application like Parsec. They play the game using your mouse and keyboard while you watch the stream live. Your login credentials are never shared.</li></ul>', '<ul><li><strong>Select Options:</strong> Choose your preferred boost method (Piloted or Remote Control).</li><li><strong>Order Confirmation:</strong> After payment, you will receive an order number and email confirmation.</li><li><strong>Contact:</strong> Our support manager will reach out via Live Chat or Discord to verify your details.</li><li><strong>Assignment:</strong> We assign a professional booster to your order.</li><li><em>For Piloted:</em> The booster logs in securely to begin farming Devourer Swarms.</li><li><em>For Remote Control:</em> We set up the connection so the booster can play on your PC.</li><li><strong>Completion:</strong> We notify you immediately via your preferred messenger once the mount is secured.</li><li><strong>Enjoy:</strong> Log in and summon your Translocated Gorger!</li></ul>', '<ul><li><strong>Level:</strong> Level 80 Character.</li><li><strong>Expansion:</strong> The War Within active.</li><li><strong>Account:</strong> Active World of Warcraft subscription.</li></ul>', 17, 'https://kdjlhibxxygfdmlvdfcl.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/game-images/translocated-gorger-1763929466460.webp', NULL, 4.9, 0, true, true, 0, '2025-11-22T19:25:57.271259+00:00', '2025-12-16T07:22:23.328216+00:00', 'b4c0ccaf-a937-4b30-9ab4-7dacee8f739b', false, NULL, true, 0, '15 minutes', 'average start time', 'Flexible', 'order completion', 'Unlock the rare Translocated Charger mount. We repeatedly farm the required currency or phase-diving source for a guaranteed drop.', 'translocated gorger game, buy translocated gorger, translocated gorger pet, game gorger mount, translocated gorger price, get translocated gorger, translocated gorger for sale, game monster pet, rare game pet, translocated gorger acquisition, game unique pet, translocated gorger drop, buy rare game pet, translocated gorger in game, game cosmetic pet', 'https://kdjlhibxxygfdmlvdfcl.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/game-images/translocated-gorger-1763929466460.webp', NULL, 'Game gaming service - Translocated Gorger', 'War Within Translocated Gorger Mount | misti.services', NULL);
