ased on your chosen options.</li><li>You will receive confirmation once the raid is completed and all your guaranteed loot has been secured.</li><li>Enjoy your powerful new Tier 4 gear and seamless progression into the next raid tiers.</li></ul>', '<ul><li><strong>Character Level:</strong> Your character must be level 70 in WoW TBC Anniversary Classic.</li><li><strong>Karazhan Attunement:</strong> Your character must have completed the attunement questline for Karazhan.</li></ul>', 50, 'https://kdjlhibxxygfdmlvdfcl.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/game-images/wow-tbc-anniversary-karazhan-boost-1768778648985.webp', NULL, 4.9, 0, true, true, 0, '2026-01-10T20:44:00.588862+00:00', '2026-01-20T23:42:59.645235+00:00', '542d3f01-5eb4-4572-bd18-75dea239ed84', false, NULL, true, 0, '15 minutes', 'average start time', 'Flexible', 'order completion', 'Buy a WoW TBC Anniversary Karazhan Boost for a full 11/11 raid clear. Secure Tier 4 gear, Badges of Justice, and Fiery Warhorse mount chance.', 'wow tbc anniversary karazhan boost buy, tbc karazhan boost price, tbc karazhan carry, wow tbc raid boost, tbc classic raid carry, karazhan tier 4 gear, tbc fiery warhorse mount, wow tbc anniversary loot, tbc classic 20th anniversary boost, wow tbc anniversary realms, buy tbc anniv karazhan, tbc karazhan raid carry, gaming service, fast delivery, professional, reliable, secure, boosting, carry, account', 'https://kdjlhibxxygfdmlvdfcl.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/game-images/wow-tbc-anniversary-karazhan-boost-1768778648985.webp', NULL, 'Wow Tbc Anniversary Karazhan Boost', 'WoW TBC Anniversary Karazhan Boost | misti.services', NULL);
