loot, you will receive confirmation of the completed Mount Hyjal defense.</li><li>Enjoy your newly acquired powerful Tier 6 set pieces and advanced progression through TBC Phase 3 content.</li></ul>', '<ul><li><strong>Character Level:</strong> Your character must be level 70 in WoW TBC Anniversary Classic.</li><li><strong>Attunement:</strong> Your character needs to be attuned to Hyjal Summit.</li></ul>', 75, 'https://kdjlhibxxygfdmlvdfcl.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/game-images/2a9yu3lldkf.webp', NULL, 4.9, 0, true, true, 0, '2026-01-10T20:48:44.721025+00:00', '2026-01-20T23:42:56.499023+00:00', '542d3f01-5eb4-4572-bd18-75dea239ed84', false, NULL, true, 0, '15 minutes', 'average start time', 'Flexible', 'order completion', 'Secure your WoW TBC Anniversary Hyjal Summit Boost for a guaranteed 5/5 raid clear, Tier 6 gear, and Archimonde defeat.', 'wow tbc anniversary hyjal summit boost buy, tbc hyjal summit boost price, wow tbc hyjal summit carry, wow tbc hyjal summit full clear, tbc hyjal summit raid, wow tbc hyjal summit archimonde kill, tbc tier 6 head hands boost, tbc phase 3 gear, wow tbc raid service, buy tbc hyjal summit, hyjal summit boost tbc, wow tbc anniversary raid, tbc classic raids, wow tbc mount hyjal, wow tbc dungeon, wow tbc power leveling, wow tbc character boost, tbc classic boost, tbc classic carry, wow tbc gear farm, wow tbc gold, tbc leveling service, wow tbc pvp, wow tbc profession boost, cheap tbc boost, fast tbc raid clear', 'https://kdjlhibxxygfdmlvdfcl.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/game-images/wow-tbc-anniversary-hyjal-summit-boost-1768778491326.webp', NULL, 'Wow Tbc Anniversary Hyjal Summit Boost', 'Buy TBC Anniversary Hyjal Summit Boost | misti.services', NULL);
