li>Your character emerges <strong>powerful, prepared, and ready for endgame</strong></li></ul><p>Reach level 60 the smart way — without the grind, stress, or fear of losing hours of progress.</p><p>Purchase your <strong>WoW Classic Hardcore Power Leveling Boost</strong> today, sit back, and watch your character rise to glory on Classic Era realms.</p>', '<p>Leveling in <strong>WoW Classic</strong> has always tested skill, patience, and determination. And on <strong>Hardcore</strong>, the stakes are higher than ever — one misstep can cost you your character forever. Our service removes the risk and stress, letting you enjoy the result without fearing permanent loss.</p><p>At <strong>misti.services</strong>, we’ve built a power leveling solution designed for Hardcore safety. Our expert players understand Classic Era progression down to the finest details, ensuring:</p><ul><li>Safe and careful leveling routes</li><li>Maximum efficiency</li><li>Zero-death guarantee</li></ul><p>You can enjoy peace of mind knowing your character is in the hands of professionals who play Classic at the highest level.</p>', '<ul><li>Active WoW subscription</li><li>Account access (login and password required).</li><li><strong>Your account security is fully protected.</strong></li></ul>', 0, 'https://kdjlhibxxygfdmlvdfcl.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/game-images/hardcore-power-leveling-boost-1762811044950.webp', NULL, 4.9, 0, true, true, 0, '2025-11-03T08:54:43.254981+00:00', '2025-12-21T16:20:33.828899+00:00', 'af996091-6134-4a47-b755-6c0ac7f3b65b', true, '{"step":1,"end_label":"Desired Level","max_value":60,"min_value":1,"default_end":60,"start_label":"Current Level","default_start":1,"pricing_brackets":[{"end":50,"price":180,"start":1},{"end":60,"price":160,"start":51}],"estimated_time_per_step":0.3}', true, 0, '15 minutes', 'average start time', 'Flexible', 'order completion', 'WoW Classic Hardcore Power Leveling Boost Looking to conquer the unforgiving world of WoW Classic Hardcore and reach level 60 without a single death.', 'wow classic hardcore power leveling, hardcore wow 1-60 boost, classic hardcore leveling service, wow hardcore no death leveling, buy hardcore wow boost, fast hardcore leveling, safe wow hardcore boost, professional hardcore leveling, wow hardcore max level boost, classic hardcore character leveling, cheap hardcore wow boost, hardcore wow level 60 service', 'https://kdjlhibxxygfdmlvdfcl.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/game-images/hardcore-power-leveling-boost-1762811044950.webp', NULL, 'Hardcore Power Leveling Boost', 'WoW Classic Hardcore Leveling Boost | misti.services', NULL);
