 completes the boost.</p><h3>Assembly of the Deeps Renown Rewards</h3><p>The <strong>Assembly of the Deeps</strong> is a new faction in <em>The War Within</em>, located in The Ringing Deeps. Players can earn unique rewards by increasing renown through quests, events, and activities. Each level requires <strong>2,500 reputation points</strong>, with a maximum renown level of <strong>25</strong>.</p><h3>Key Rewards</h3><ul><li><strong>Mounts:</strong> Crimson Mudnose, Cyan Glowmite</li><li><strong>Companion:</strong> Guacamole</li><li><strong>Profession Notes:</strong> Mining, Engineering, and Inscription knowledge boosts</li><li><strong>Armor Sets:</strong> Slag-Accruing, Noncandescent Smithing, Unmelting Ironworker, and Inflammable Forging gear (571–584 item level)</li><li><strong>Cosmetics &amp; Misc Items:</strong> Restored Coffer Key, crafting materials, and resonance crystal gear</li></ul><p>All rewards are available from <strong>Waxmonger Squick</strong> in The Ringing Deeps. Instead of spending countless hours farming reputation, Misti.Services can handle everything for you — fast, safe, and hassle-free.</p><h3>Why Choose Misti.Services for Assembly of the Deeps Boost</h3><ul><li><strong>Fast Completion:</strong> Reach your target renown level quickly and efficiently.</li><li><strong>All Rewards Secured:</strong> Unlock mounts, profession notes, and cosmetics without farming.</li><li><strong>Expert Team:</strong> Experienced boosters handle every quest and event with precision.</li><li><strong>Secure &amp; Private:</strong> We use trusted, safe methods to protect your account.</li><li><strong>No Grind Required:</strong> Skip the repetitive gameplay and enjoy your rewards instantly.</li></ul><p>Max out your <strong>Assembly of the Deeps Renown</strong> easily with Misti.Services and unlock every reward, profession upgrade, and collectible The War Within has to offer — all without the effort.</p>', '<ol><li>Choose your desired renown rank and make your purchase.</li><li>Receive confirmation via email and your order number.</li><li>Our support manager will contact you through live chat or email.</li><li>Once a booster is assigned, the service begins shortly.</li><li>After completion, you’ll be notified via Discord or your preferred messenger.</li></ol><p>Enjoy all your new rewards and skip the time-consuming grind.</p>', '<ul><li>Level 80 character</li><li>The War Within expansion</li><li>(Optional) Use our&nbsp;<a href="https://misti.services/game/warwithin/leveling/wow-the-war-within-leveling" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">WoW Power Leveling Boost</a>&nbsp;if you’re not yet level 80</li></ul>', 0.81, 'https://kdjlhibxxygfdmlvdfcl.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/game-images/assembly-of-the-deeps-renown-boost-1762441543732.webp', NULL, 4.9, 350, true, true, 0, '2025-10-24T23:37:07.571716+00:00', '2025-12-16T07:48:46.90253+00:00', '312870ae-4c42-440f-8510-5704a1c5f333', true, '{"step":1,"end_label":"Desired renown","max_value":25,"min_value":1,"default_end":25,"start_label":"Current renown","default_start":1,"pricing_brackets":[{"end":25,"price":33.66,"start":1}],"estimated_time_per_step":0.5}', true, 0, '15 minutes', 'average start time', 'Flexible', 'order completion', 'Boost your Assembly of the Deeps Renown fast with Misti.Services. Unlock mounts, cosmetics, gear, and profession rewards without the grind.', 'assembly of the deeps renown boost, buy deeps renown, assembly of the deeps renown farming service, fast assembly of the deeps renown, misti.services renown boost, unlock deeps mounts, deeps cosmetics farm, deeps gear unlock service, profession rewards assembly of the deeps, skip renown grind, cheap deeps renown boost, professional renown boosting, game renown boost, best renown service', 'https://kdjlhibxxygfdmlvdfcl.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/game-images/assembly-of-the-deeps-renown-boost-1762441543732.webp', NULL, 'Assembly Of The Deeps Renown Boost', 'War Within Renown Boost - Fast | mi