tandard completion speed</p></li><li><p><strong>Express Priority:</strong> Accelerated completion with higher priority</p></li></ul><h3>About the Tier 0.5 Set</h3><p>In <strong>WoW Classic Era</strong>, the Tier 0.5 set — also known as Dungeon Set 2 — is a powerful upgrade to the original dungeon gear. Each class has a unique version of the set, offering better stats, improved visuals, and valuable bonuses. The upgrade process involves completing an extensive questline that requires dungeon runs, materials, and faction reputation.</p><h3>Benefits of the Tier 0.5 Set</h3><ul><li><p>Significantly improved stats and performance boosts</p></li><li><p>Unique class-specific armor designs</p></li><li><p>Valuable set bonuses enhancing gameplay</p></li><li><p>Ideal for players who prefer dungeon progression over raids</p></li></ul><h3>Why Choose misti.services</h3><ul><li><p>Professional boosters with extensive dungeon and quest experience</p></li><li><p>Safe, manual completion — no automation or shortcuts</p></li><li><p>Fast, reliable service with guaranteed completion</p></li><li><p>Real-time progress updates and customer support</p></li><li><p>Save time while getting one of the best non-raid gear upgrades</p></li></ul><h3>Why Get the Tier 0.5 Boost</h3><p>Earning the full Tier 0.5 set manually requires rare materials, extensive questing, and multiple dungeon runs — often taking weeks of effort. With <strong>misti.services</strong>, you can bypass the grind and receive your complete upgraded armor fast and safely.</p><p>Get your <strong>Tier 0.5 Dungeon Set 2</strong> today and enhance your power for all upcoming challenges in WoW Classic Era. Order your boost from <strong>misti.services</strong> and enjoy the game — we’ll handle the rest.</p>', '<ul><li>Select your desired options and complete your order on&nbsp;Misti.Services.</li><li>You’ll receive an order confirmation and tracking number via email.</li><li>Our support manager will contact you through live chat to confirm all details.</li><li>If you’re unavailable, we’ll reach out via email or your preferred contact method.</li><li>When the boost is finished, you’ll receive a completion notification on Discord or another messenger of your choice.</li></ul>', '<ul><li>Level 60 character</li><li>Active World of Warcraft subscription</li><li>Non-hardcore mode only</li></ul><p>Need help reaching level 60? Try our&nbsp;<a href="https://misti.services/game/wow-classic-20th-anniversary/leveling/power-leveling" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank" style="color: rgb(60, 113, 221);">WoW Power Leveling Boost</a>&nbsp;</p>', 167.16, 'https://kdjlhibxxygfdmlvdfcl.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/game-images/tier-05-set-1762694504331.webp', NULL, 4.9, 350, true, true, 0, '2025-10-26T23:26:43.749654+00:00', '2026-01-14T22:06:46.234254+00:00', 'c8f7f940-3d2e-4aa9-9667-723bf93a444a', false, NULL, true, 0, '15 minutes', 'average start time', 'Flexible', 'order completion', 'Buy WoW Classic Tier 0.5 Set Boost at misti.services. Get your full Dungeon Set 2 fast, safely, and without the long grind or quest farming.', 'wow classic tier 0.5 set boost, buy dungeon set 2 classic, classic wow t0.5 farm, skip tier 0.5 grind, fast classic dungeon set 2, wow classic tier 0.5 questing service, professional t0.5 boost, cheap classic wow tier 0.5, secure dungeon set 2 classic, classic wow tier 0.5 gear, buy t0.5 set classic, wow classic t0.5 gear farm, dungeon set 2 classic no grind', 'https://kdjlhibxxygfdmlvdfcl.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/game-images/tier-05-set-1762694504331.webp', NULL, 'Tier 05 Set', 'WoW Classic T0.5 Set Boost | misti.services', NULL);
