y:</strong> All gold, gear, and unrelated loot dropped during the boost stays in your bags.</p></li><li><p><strong>100% Manual Gameplay:</strong> No bots, no scripts. Just skilled players.</p></li></ul><h2><strong>Choose Your Boost Method</strong></h2><p>We offer two secure ways to deliver your mount:</p><ul><li><p><strong>Piloted (Most Popular):</strong> Our professional booster logs into your account using a <strong>VPN matches to your country</strong> to ensure maximum security. They complete the quest while you sleep or work.</p></li><li><p><strong>Remote Control:</strong> Maximum security for paranoid players. Our booster connects to your PC via a secure remote app (like Parsec or TeamViewer). You watch the screen live as they play using your mouse and keyboard. No account sharing required.</p></li></ul><h2><strong>The Challenge: Why Buy a Paladin Mount Boost?</strong></h2><p>On <strong>WoW Classic Fresh</strong> servers, the economy is tough and groups can be hard to find. The Level 60 Paladin quest is not just a simple purchase—it is a complex chain involving:</p><ol><li><p><strong>Expensive Materials:</strong> You need Arcanite Bars, Arthas'' Tears, and Runecloth, which are incredibly expensive on fresh economies.</p></li><li><p><strong>Specific Dungeon Runs:</strong> You must defeat <strong>Tendris Warpwood</strong> in Dire Maul West and clear the Rattlegore room in Scholomance to summon the Death Knight Darkreaver.</p></li><li><p><strong>Travel &amp; Logistics:</strong> The quest sends you across Azeroth, from Stormwind to the Western Plaguelands.</p></li></ol><p>At <strong>misti.services</strong>, we have optimized the route. We have the groups ready for the dungeons, and we know the most efficient way to gather the materials, saving you days of gameplay.</p><h2><strong>Why Choose misti.services?</strong></h2><ul><li><p><strong>Experienced Paladin Boosters:</strong> We know every shortcut in Dire Maul and Scholomance.</p></li><li><p><strong>Fair Pricing:</strong> Competitive rates specifically adjusted for the Fresh server economy.</p></li><li><p><strong>24/7 Support:</strong> Have a question? Our live chat is always open.</p></li></ul><p><strong>Ready to ride? Order your WoW Classic Era Paladin Epic Mount Boost today and summon your Charger tomorrow!</strong></p>', '<ul><li>Select your desired options and complete your order on&nbsp;Misti.Services.</li><li>You’ll receive an order confirmation and tracking number via email.</li><li>Our support manager will contact you through live chat to confirm all details.</li><li>If you’re unavailable, we’ll reach out via email or your preferred contact method.</li><li>When the boost is finished, you’ll receive a completion notification on Discord or another messenger of your choice.</li></ul>', '<ul><li><p>Level 60 for the Charger</p></li><li><p>Level 40 for the Warhorse</p></li><li><p>Active WoW Classic subscription</p></li><li><p>Non-hardcore mode</p></li></ul><p><span style="color: rgb(250, 250, 250);">Need help reaching level 60? Try our&nbsp;</span><a target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" href="https://misti.services/game/wow-classic-era/leveling">WoW Power Leveling Boost<span style="color: rgb(250, 250, 250);">&nbsp;</span></a></p>', 0, 'https://kdjlhibxxygfdmlvdfcl.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/game-images/paladin-epic-mount-1763133113716.webp', NULL, 4.9, 350, true, true, 0, '2025-10-27T02:36:42.973652+00:00', '2026-01-14T22:18:22.056136+00:00', '235f9a00-b3fe-4786-8ca1-0edbe7d69a55', false, NULL, true, 0, '15 minutes', 'average start time', '1 day', 'order completion', 'Skip the dungeon grind! Get your Paladin Epic Mount (Charger) fast on WoW Classic Era servers. We handle the full questline. Safe, handmade & secure.', 'WoW Classic Fresh Paladin Epic Mount Boost, Paladin Charger Carry, Buy Paladin Mount WoW Classic, Summon Charger Questline Service, Paladin Epic Mount Boost Fresh Servers, misti.services Paladin Boost, WoW Classic Fresh Mount Carry, Paladin Level 60 Mount Boost, Dire Maul West Paladin Run, Scholomance Paladin Quest Service', 'https://kdjlhibxxygfdmlvdfcl.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/game-images/paladin-epic-mount-1763133113716.webp', NULL, 'Paladin Epic Mount', 'WoW Classic Paladin Epic Mount Boost | misti.services', NULL);
INSERT INTO public.products (id, name, slug, short_description, description, how_it_works, requirements, base_price, image_url, badge_text, trust_score, total_reviews, is_active, is_featured, sort_order, created_at, updated_at, category_id, is_slider_product, slider_config, is_manually_popular, total_sales, start_time_text, start_time_value, delivery_text, delivery_value, meta_description, meta_keywords, og_image, canonical_url, image_alt_text, meta_title, parent_link) VALUES ('c133602b-b733-402b-86de-b1360c656c5a', 'Nesting Swarmite', 'nesting-swarmite', 'The Nesting Swarmite is a highly sought-after mount for players who love unusual, slightly unsettling designs. Its nest-like body structure and layered colors give it a look that feels perfectly at home in Old God–themed or Void-touched environments.', '<h1><strong>WoW Nesting Swarmite Mount Boost</strong></h1><p>Add a rare, creepy-cool insect mount to your collection without spending weeks inside Horrific Visions.</p><p>The Nesting Swarmite is a distinctive bug-like mount with a nest-inspired design and vibrant, eerie colors that stand out in any zone. It drops from content tied to <strong>Horrific Visions of Stormwind and Orgrimmar</strong>, which means you’ll be running those scenarios over and over if you try to farm it yourself.</p><p>The drop chance is low, and each run takes time and focus. For many players, that quickly turns into a frustrating grind.</p><p>With misti.services, you can skip all of that. Our experienced boosters handle the Horrific Visions farming for you, so you simply log in and enjoy your new Nesting Swarmite once it’s obtained.</p><h2><strong>Service Includes</strong></h2><p>When you buy the Nesting Swarmite Mount Boost from misti.services, we take care of everything needed to secure the mount:</p><ul><li><strong>Nesting Swarmite mount obtained</strong> and added to your collection once it drops.</li><li><strong>Multiple Horrific Visions runs in Stormwind and Orgrimmar</strong>, focused