 and Weekly Challenges completed for maximum progression speed</li><li>XP earned for your account, weapons, profile, and vehicles during the boost</li><li>Fully manual boosting by experienced Battlefield players</li></ul><h2><strong>About Battlefield 6 Battle Pass Boost</strong></h2><p>Battlefield 6 introduces a seasonal Battle Pass system with <strong>120 tiers</strong> of unlockable content. Progressing through all tiers naturally requires significant time, consistent gameplay, and completing Weekly Challenges — otherwise, reaching tier 120 before the season ends is unlikely.</p><p>Our Battlefield 6 Battle Pass Boost solves this by handling the entire grind for you. Whether you’re starting late, have limited time, or simply want instant access to all seasonal cosmetics, our team ensures fast completion without gameplay interruptions or missed rewards.</p><h2><strong>Why Battle Pass Boosting Matters</strong></h2><p>Seasonal rewards are permanently time-locked, meaning once the season ends, exclusive skins and blueprints cannot be obtained again. Completing 120 tiers requires hundreds of matches and perfect weekly challenge consistency.</p><p>Our boost guarantees:</p><ul><li>Completion before the season ends</li><li>Access to every limited-time cosmetic</li><li>No wasted hours grinding XP</li><li>Additional natural progression to weapons, vehicles, and profile</li></ul><h2><strong>What You Gain With This Service</strong></h2><ul><li>Your chosen Battle Pass tier fully completed</li><li>All cosmetics unlocked from completed tiers</li><li>Daily and Weekly missions handled by pros</li><li>Accelerated XP gain across all progression systems</li><li>No stress, no grind, guaranteed results</li></ul><h2><strong>Why Choose misti.services</strong></h2><ul><li>Expert Battlefield boosters with deep progression knowledge</li><li>Safe, manual boosting only — no cheats, bots, or automation</li><li>Stealth and security priority for your account</li><li>Live order tracking and support available 24/7</li><li>Long-term reputation and proven success with competitive games</li></ul>', '<ul><li>Select your current and desired Battle Pass tier (up to 120)</li><li>A dedicated Battlefield booster is assigned to your order</li><li>Booster plays high-XP modes and completes Weekly Challenges for maximum speed</li><li>Your account progresses safely to the requested tier</li><li>We notify you as soon as your Battle Pass boost is fully complete</li></ul>', '<ul><li>Battlefield 6 or RedSec access</li></ul>', 0, 'https://kdjlhibxxygfdmlvdfcl.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/game-images/battlefield-6-battle-pass-boost-1762811818795.webp', NULL, 4.9, 0, true, false, 0, '2025-10-31T20:50:50.822175+00:00', '2025-12-16T00:22:07.708393+00:00', '73c36c9a-6b04-4027-92d2-c1579897738c', true, '{"step":1,"end_label":"Desired Level","max_value":120,"min_value":1,"default_end":50,"start_label":"Current Level","default_start":1,"pricing_brackets":[{"end":120,"price":485,"start":1}],"estimated_time_per_step":0.9}', false, 0, '1 hour', 'average start time', 'Flexible', 'order completion', 'Battlefield 6 Battle Pass Boost – Complete All 120 Tiers Fast Max Your Battlefield 6 Seasonal Battle Pass With Ease Skip the long XP grind and secure every....', 'battlefield 6 battle pass boost, battlefield 6 profile leveling service, buy battlefield 6 battle pass, fast battlefield 6 rank up, professional battlefield 6 boosting, unlock battlefield 6 weapons faster, battlefield 6 account leveling, cheap battlefield 6 battle pass boost, secure battlefield 6 leveling, battlefield 6 gadget unlock service, battlefield 6 specialization boost, expert battlefield 6 players, skip battlefield 6 grind, battlefield 6 vehicle unlock, boost battlefield 6 career', 'https://kdjlhibxxygfdmlvdfcl.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/game-images/battlefield-6-battle-pass-boost-1762811818795.webp', NULL, 'Battlefield 6 Battle Pass Boost', 'BF6 Battle Pass Boost - Fast Leveling | misti.services', NULL);
