notifications as soon as the ordered wins are completed</li><li>Log in and enjoy the improved stats, unlocks, and account progress</li></ul>', '<ul><li>Access to Battlefield 6 RedSec mode</li></ul>', 0, 'https://kdjlhibxxygfdmlvdfcl.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/game-images/battlefield-6-redsec-battle-royale-wins-boost-1762538915385.webp', NULL, 4.9, 0, true, false, 0, '2025-11-02T20:18:45.523592+00:00', '2025-12-16T00:22:12.579702+00:00', 'ce5de8f0-3401-4023-8972-b6a53717a35b', true, '{"step":1,"max_value":20,"min_value":1,"price_label":"Price","slider_type":"single","value_label":"Number of  wins","default_value":10,"pricing_brackets":[{"end":20,"price":18,"start":1}],"estimated_time_per_step":0.2}', false, 0, '15 minutes', 'average start time', 'Flexible', 'order completion', 'Battlefield 6 RedSec Battle Royale Wins Boost Secure guaranteed victories in the Battlefield 6 RedSec Battle Royale mode with our professional boosting service.', 'battlefield 6 redsec wins boost, redsec battle royale boosting service, guaranteed bf6 redsec wins, professional battlefield 6 redsec booster, fast redsec battle royale wins, reliable bf6 redsec boosting, boost battlefield 6 stats, battlefield 6 battle pass progress boost, redsec competitive edge, buy redsec battle royale wins, bf6 redsec win farm, misti.services battlefield 6 boost', 'https://kdjlhibxxygfdmlvdfcl.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/game-images/battlefield-6-redsec-battle-royale-wins-boost-1762538915385.webp', NULL, 'Battlefield 6 Redsec Battle Royale Wins Boost', 'BF6 RedSec Wins Boost - Guaranteed | misti.services', NULL);
