cking number via email.</li><li>Our support manager will contact you through live chat to confirm all details.</li><li>If you’re unavailable, we’ll reach out via email or your preferred contact method.</li><li>When the boost is finished, you’ll receive a completion notification on Discord or another messenger of your choice.</li></ul><p><br></p>', '<ul><li>Active Diablo 4 account.</li><li>Character at appropriate level and build to access Torment I or higher.</li></ul><p>Need help leveling? Check our&nbsp;<a href="https://misti.services/game/buy-diablo-iv-boost/leveling" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank" style="color: rgb(250, 250, 250);">Diablo IV Leveling Boost</a></p>', 35.2, 'https://kdjlhibxxygfdmlvdfcl.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/game-images/shroud-of-false-death-1762729613435.webp', NULL, 4.9, 350, true, true, 0, '2025-11-04T04:06:34.192995+00:00', '2025-12-16T00:24:46.679793+00:00', '1661c892-50ee-4f2c-8d96-f31f6e81c787', false, NULL, true, 0, '15 minutes', 'average start time', 'Flexible', 'order completion', 'Buy Diablo 4 Shroud of False Death from Misti.Services. Secure this Mythic Unique Chest Armor fast and safe to boost stealth, damage, and movement speed.', 'diablo 4 shroud of false death, buy shroud of false death, mythic unique chest armor d4, d4 stealth boost armor, diablo 4 damage boost chest, movement speed armor diablo 4, shroud of false death misti.services, secure d4 unique armor, fast diablo 4 chest, buy mythic unique d4, shroud of false death price, best d4 stealth armor, diablo 4 unique chest buy, misti.services d4 unique', 'https://kdjlhibxxygfdmlvdfcl.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/game-images/shroud-of-false-death-1762729613435.webp', NULL, 'Shroud Of False Death', 'Buy D4 Shroud of False Death | misti.services', NULL);
