lable only from this faction.</li><li><strong>Daily Efficiency:</strong> A structured daily routine across two zones for efficient reputation accumulation.</li><li><strong>Unique Rewards:</strong> Various pre-raid items and utility gear from the quartermaster.</li></ul><h2><strong>Gaining Reputation</strong></h2><p>The Sha''tari Skyguard grind involves a significant amount of daily questing, combined with repeatable turn-ins and continuous mob farming in Skettis.</p><h3><strong>1. Quest Chain Unlocks</strong></h3><p>The service begins by completing the initial, multi-step quest chains to unlock the full daily routine:</p><ul><li><strong>Skyguard Chain:</strong> We start with <em>Threat from Above</em> in Shattrath and follow the chain to unlock daily quests (<em>Fires Over Skettis</em>, <em>Escape from Skettis</em>) and the repeatable <strong>More Shadow Dust</strong> turn-in.</li><li><strong>Ogri''la Chain:</strong> We complete the <em>Speak with the Ogre</em> chain (which requires a 5-person group) to unlock the Ogri''la hub, which provides additional quests and the two Skyguard dailies (<em>Bomb Them Again!</em> and <em>Wrangle More Aether Rays!</em>).</li></ul><h3><strong>2. Daily Routine &amp; Repeatable Turn-ins</strong></h3><p>Reputation is accrued daily through a combined effort:</p><ul><li><strong>Daily Quests:</strong> Completion of all unlocked Sha''tari Skyguard and relevant Ogri''la dailies.</li><li><strong>Shadow Dust Turn-ins:</strong> We farm <strong>Shadow Dust</strong> from Skettis mobs and turn it in repeatedly until Exalted, providing a consistent source of reputation.</li><li><strong>Adversarial Blood:</strong> We farm for <strong>Time-Lost Scrolls</strong> to summon the named bosses in Skettis. Killing these bosses and turning in their respective Beaks or Claws provides significant one-time reputation boosts.</li></ul><h3><strong>3. Skettis Mob Grinding</strong></h3><p>Unlike many other factions, killing all <strong>Skettis mobs</strong> grants