nfirm all details.</li><li>If you’re unavailable, we’ll reach out via email or your preferred contact method.</li><li>When the boost is finished, you’ll receive a completion notification on Discord or another messenger of your choice.</li></ul>', '<ul><li><strong>Level 70</strong></li><li><strong>Active WoW Subscription</strong></li><li><strong>Flying</strong></li></ul>', 0, 'https://kdjlhibxxygfdmlvdfcl.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/game-images/shatari-skyguard-1763586672508.webp', NULL, 4.9, 0, true, true, 0, '2025-11-19T20:37:41.112269+00:00', '2026-02-16T10:52:53.995662+00:00', '9464d1fe-6c00-412a-8ebb-896a4f575b4e', false, NULL, true, 0, '15 minutes', 'average start time', 'Flexible', 'order completion', 'Buy Sha''tari Skyguard Exalted boost! Unlock the unique Nether Ray Mounts, all Skyguard daily quests, and Shadow Dust farming without the tedious grind.', 'Sha''tari Skyguard reputation boost, Nether Ray mounts farm, Skettis farming, Shadow Dust turn-in, TBC daily quests boost, Ogri''la reputation, Blackwind Landing, Skyguard Exalted, Time-Lost Scrolls, Buy WoW flying mount', 'https://kdjlhibxxygfdmlvdfcl.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/game-images/shatari-skyguard-1763586672508.webp', NULL, 'Shatari Skyguard', 'WoW TBC Sha''tari Skyguard Rep Boost | misti.services', NULL);
