ance player</strong> and complete the introductory questline from your faction’s hub in the Shrine of Seven Stars. This unlocks the Operation: Shieldwall base camp and its daily missions.</p><p>As you progress through the reputation ranks, new story chapters and campaign quests become available, revealing deeper parts of the Pandaria War Campaign. These missions also grant reputation boosts and unique rewards unavailable from standard dailies.</p><h3>Reputation Boosting Tips</h3><p>Earning reputation with Operation: Shieldwall can take time due to daily quest limits, but you can maximize your progress with event bonuses and perks:</p><ul><li><strong>Darkmoon Faire – WHEE!</strong> (+10% reputation for 1 hour)</li><li><strong>Hallow’s End – Unburdened or Grim Visage</strong> (+10% for 2 hours)</li><li><strong>Pilgrim’s Bounty – Spirit of Sharing</strong> (+10% for 1 hour)</li><li><strong>Guild Perk – Mr. Popularity</strong> (+10% reputation bonus)</li></ul><p>Completing all daily missions each day and participating in storyline quests ensures faster advancement toward Exalted status.</p><h3>Operation: Shieldwall Rewards</h3><p>Operation: Shieldwall offers powerful rewards designed for dedicated Alliance heroes:</p><ul><li><strong>Honored:</strong> Profession recipes, trinkets, and upgraded gear</li><li><strong>Revered:</strong> Advanced equipment, vanity items, and additional questlines</li><li><strong>Exalted:</strong> Mounts such as the <em>Grand Armored Gryphon</em>, unique tabards, and elite-quality weapons</li></ul><p>Completing the full campaign also unlocks achievements tied to the Pandaria War Campaign, advancing the Alliance’s story in Mists of Pandaria Classic.</p><h3>Why Choose Misti Services for Your Operation: Shieldwall Boost</h3><p>Misti Services provides a safe, professional, and efficient way to earn reputation with Operation: Shieldwall in WoW Mists of Pandaria Classic. Our expert boosters complete all daily and story quests, ensuring you reach Exalted quickly and effortlessly. Enjoy the mounts, epic gear, and full storyline without the repetitive grind.</p>', '<ul><li>Select your desired options and complete your order on&nbsp;Misti.Services.</li><li>You’ll receive an order confirmation and tracking number via email.</li><li>Our support manager will contact you through live chat to confirm all details.</li><li>If you’re unavailable, we’ll reach out via email or your preferred contact method.</li><li>When the boost is finished, you’ll receive a completion notification on Discord or another messenger of your choice.</li></ul>', '<ul><li>Active World of Warcraft subscription</li><li>Level 90 character</li></ul><p>Need help reaching level 90? Try our&nbsp;<a href="https://misti.services/game/wow-mistsofpandaria-classic" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank" style="color: rgb(60, 113, 221);">WoW Power Leveling Boost</a>&nbsp;</p>', 0, 'https://kdjlhibxxygfdmlvdfcl.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/game-images/operation-shieldwall-1763231760804.webp', NULL, 4.9, 350, true, true, 0, '2025-11-02T20:50:48.503371+00:00', '2025-12-16T07:51:11.457956+00:00', 'eef98e08-1b65-4858-859f-5418bbab5fa2', false, NULL, true, 0, '15 minutes', 'average start time', 'Flexible', 'order completion', 'Boost your Operation: Shieldwall reputation fast in WoW Mists of Pandaria Classic with Misti Services and unlock mounts, gear, and rewards.', 'operation shieldwall reputation boost, wow mop classic shieldwall farm, mists of pandaria shieldwall rewards, operation shieldwall mount unlock, mop classic reputation farming service, shieldwall gear boost wow, fast operation shieldwall rep, wow mop shieldwall quartermaster, buy operation shieldwall reputation, operation shieldwall reputation guide, mop classic shieldwall vendor, professional wow rep boost, shieldwall achievement help, cheap mop classic shieldwall boost', 'https://kdjlhibxxygfdmlvdfcl.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/game-images/operation-shieldwall-1763231760804.webp',