li><li>Guaranteed loot or loot priority options depending on your selection</li><li>Boss-specific achievements unlocked automatically</li><li>The prestigious Delver of the Vaults title from a full Heroic clear</li></ul><p>If no raiding team is currently available on your realm, our team may suggest transferring your character to one of our active raid servers. We cover the round-trip transfer cost through Mmonster coins for your convenience.</p><h3>Boost Options</h3><p><strong>Piloted Boost</strong></p><p>A professional player logs into your account and completes the full raid while keeping your character completely secure.</p><p><strong>Selfplay Boost</strong></p><p>Join our raid group and participate directly in the run alongside our expert team.</p><p><strong>Remote Control Boost</strong></p><p>Our booster connects securely through a trusted remote desktop app such as Parsec, allowing you to observe the entire raid live.</p><p><strong>Guaranteed Loot</strong></p><p>Choose this option to receive a specific amount of loot drops for your character.</p><p><strong>Loot Priority Run</strong></p><p>Select this option to receive all item drops suitable for your class and specialization.</p><h3>About the Mogu’shan Vaults Raid</h3><p>The <strong>Mogu’shan Vaults</strong> are located in <strong>Kun-Lai Summit</strong> and serve as the entrance to Pandaria’s ancient secrets. This six-boss raid challenges players to face powerful constructs, ancient rulers, and the celestial dragon Elegon.</p><p>Each encounter requires coordination, teamwork, and precise execution. Our experienced team knows every strategy and mechanic, ensuring you complete the raid quickly and safely.</p><p><strong>Raid Bosses Overview</strong></p><ul><li>The Stone Guard: A fight requiring coordination against animated statues.</li><li>Feng the Accursed: A sorcerer who commands multiple elemental phases.</li><li>Gara’jal the Spiritbinder: A battle across both physical and spiritual realms.</li><li>The Spirit Kings: Four ancient rulers with unique abilities and phases.</li><li>Elegon: A celestial dragon who guards the vault with powerful energy attacks.</li><li>Will of the Emperor: The final test of endurance and coordination within the vault.</li></ul><h3>Loot and Rewards</h3><p>Each boss in Mogu’shan Vaults drops high-value loot, including weapons, armor, and class-specific items. Heroic Mode offers even greater rewards, while Elegon has a rare chance to drop the <strong>Astral Cloud Serpent mount</strong>.</p><p>Completing the raid also grants achievements and the <strong>Delver of the Vaults</strong> title, marking your success as one of Pandaria’s elite raiders.</p><h3>Why Choose Misti Services</h3><ul><li>Fast and reliable raid completion on any difficulty</li><li>Guaranteed gear and achievement unlocks</li><li>100% manual, secure, and professional service</li><li>Flexible scheduling that fits your availability</li><li>Experienced raid leaders and dedicated support team</li></ul><h3>Skip the Grind and Conquer the Vaults Today</h3><p>The <strong>WoW Pandaria Classic Mogu’shan Vaults Boost</strong> is your shortcut to high-end loot, achievements, and exclusive titles. Avoid the frustration of raid wipes and gear farming — let <strong>misti.services</strong> handle everything.</p><p>Join hundreds of satisfied players who’ve already cleared Pandaria’s first major raid with our help. Order your Mogu’shan Vaults Boost today and step into the next chapter of your WoW Classic journey fully prepared.</p>', '<ul><li>Select your desired options and complete your order on&nbsp;Misti.Services.</li><li>You’ll receive an order confirmation and tracking number via email.</li><li>Our support manager will contact you through live chat to confirm all details.</li><li>If you’re unavailable, we’ll reach out via email or your preferred contact method.</li><li>When the boost is finished, you’ll receive a completion notification on Discord or another messenger of your choice.</li></ul>', '<ul><li>Active World of Warcraft subscription</li><li>Level 90 character</li></ul><p>Need help reaching level 90? Try our&nbsp;<a href="https://misti.services/game/wow-mistsofpandaria-classic" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank" style="color: rgb(60, 113, 221);">WoW Power Leveling Boost</a>&nbsp;</p>', 0, 'https://kdjlhibxxygfdmlvdfcl.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/game-images/mogushan-vaults-1763228880379.webp', NULL, 4.9, 350, true, true, 0, '2025-10-31T17:25:23.563595+00:00', '2025-12-16T07:51:12.516766+00:00', 'ce7082cb-9422-40a0-bda1-cd009133aeda', false, NULL, true, 0, '1 day', 'average start time', '7 days', 'order completion', 'Defeat all bosses in Pandaria Classic Mogu’shan Vaults and earn top-tier loot, titles, and achievements fast with misti.services.', 'mogu''shan vaults boost, pandaria classic raid service, mogu''shan vaults loot run, wow mists of pandaria raid, classic mop mogu''shan, buy mogu''shan vaults run, mogu''shan vaults achievement farm, fast mogu''shan vaults clear, mogu''shan vaults title unlock, misti.services mogu''shan vaults, pandaria classic boss kill, mogu''shan vaults gear farm, cheap mogu''shan vaults boost, professional mogu''shan vaults run', 'https://kdjlhibxxygfdmlvdfcl.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/game-images/mogushan-vaults-1763228880379.webp', NULL, 'Mogushan Vaults', 'Mogu''shan Vaults Raid Boost - WoW MoP | misti.services', NULL);
