ptions below)</li></ul><p><strong>Note:</strong> If your Paladin is already level 60 or partially progressed, you can select the appropriate option and receive a <strong>discount based on your current progress</strong>.</p><h2><strong>Starter Paladin Build</strong></h2><ul><li><strong>Build Capability:</strong> Up to Pit Tier 10 clear</li><li><strong>Paragon Level:</strong> 75</li><li><strong>Glyphs:</strong> 1× Level 25</li><li><strong>Gear:</strong> 750 GS Legendary items</li><li><strong>Aspects:</strong> Basic setup</li><li><strong>Tempering:</strong> Useful affixes on every possible item</li><li><strong>Masterworking:</strong> 10 / 25</li><li><strong>Gems:</strong> Flawless gems for weapons and armor</li><li><strong>Runewords:</strong> 2×</li></ul><h2><strong>Ancestral Paladin Build</strong></h2><ul><li><strong>Build Capability:</strong> Up to Pit Tier 55 clear</li><li><strong>Paragon Level:</strong> 150</li><li><strong>Glyphs:</strong> 5× Level 46</li><li><strong>Gear:</strong> 800 GS Legendary items with 1/4 Greater Affix</li><li><strong>Aspects:</strong> High-roll aspects</li><li><strong>Tempering:</strong> Useful affixes on every possible item</li><li><strong>Uniques:</strong> With 1/4 Greater Affix</li><li><strong>Masterworking:</strong> 20 / 25</li><li><strong>Gems:</strong> Royal gems for weapons and armor</li><li><strong>Runewords:</strong> 2×</li></ul><h2><strong>Mythic Paladin Build</strong></h2><ul><li><strong>Build Capability:</strong> Up to Pit Tier 90 clear</li><li><strong>Paragon Level:</strong> 200</li><li><strong>Glyphs:</strong> 5× Level 80</li><li><strong>Gear:</strong> 800 GS Legendary items with 2/4 Greater Affixes</li><li><strong>Aspects:</strong> High-roll aspects</li><li><strong>Tempering:</strong> Affixes on every possible item</li><li><strong>Uniques:</strong> With 2/4 Greater Affixes</li><li><strong>Mythic Items:</strong> With 1/4 Greater Affix</li><li><strong>Masterworking:</strong> 25 / 25</li><li><strong>Gems:</strong> Grand gems for weapons and armor</li><li><strong>Runewords:</strong> 2×</li></ul><h2><strong>Tormented Paladin Build</strong></h2><ul><li><strong>Build Capability:</strong> Up to Pit Tier 100 clear</li><li><strong>Paragon Level:</strong> 250</li><li><strong>Glyphs:</strong> 5× Level 100</li><li><strong>Gear:</strong> 800 GS Legendary items with 3/4 Greater Affixes</li><li><strong>Aspects:</strong> Max-roll aspects</li><li><strong>Tempering:</strong> Affixes on every possible item</li><li><strong>Uniques:</strong> With 3/4 Greater Affixes</li><li><strong>Mythic Items:</strong> With 2/4 Greater Affixes</li><li><strong>Masterworking:</strong> 25 / 25</li><li><strong>Gems:</strong> Grand gems for weapons and armor</li><li><strong>Runewords:</strong> 2×</li></ul><h2><strong>Top D4 Paladin Builds in Season 11</strong></h2><p>Season 11’s combat overhaul rewards builds that balance <strong>Toughness</strong> with explosive damage. Enemies hit harder and spread wider, making survivability more important than ever. The strongest Paladin builds now take full advantage of the <strong>Fortify-as-life-pool system</strong> and <strong>Tempering’s no-reroll advantage</strong> for precise stat customization.</p><p><strong>Top Season 11 Paladin builds include:</strong></p><ul><li><strong>Hammerdin</strong> – Destroys dense packs with spinning holy projectiles. Still the king of clear speed, now far tankier against boss stagger bursts.</li><li><strong>Fist of the Heavens</strong> – Safe, ranged lightning nukes that chain between elites. Ideal for players avoiding Season 11’s punishing melee threats.</li><li><strong>Avenger Shield</strong> – Converts armor into damage, turning defense into offense. Exceptional in deceptive Pit layouts and add-heavy boss fights.</li><li><strong>Holy Fire Aura</strong> – Passive AoE damage with self-healing, perfect for fast leveling before transitioning into push builds.</li><li><strong>Zealot Charge</strong> – High-risk, high-reward mobility build for elite and boss hunting. Demands precision but delivers the fastest boss kills.</li></ul><p>We can craft <strong>any of these Paladin builds</strong> to match your exact playstyle. Simply choose your preferred setup during checkout, and <strong>misti.services</strong> will handle the complex Masterworking, stat tuning, and leaderboard-ready optimization.</p><p>No more gambling on affixes. No wasted materials. Just a <strong>Season 11 Paladin built to dominate endgame content</strong>.</p>', '<ul><li>Select your desired options and complete your order on&nbsp;Misti.Services.</li><li>You’ll receive an order confirmation and tracking number via email.</li><li>Our support manager will contact you through live chat to confirm all details.</li><li>If you’re unavailable, we’ll reach out via email or your preferred contact method.</li><li>When the boost is finished, you’ll receive a completion notification on Discord or another messenger of your choice.</li></ul><p><br></p>', '<ul><li><strong>Lord of Hatred</strong> expansion pre-ordered</li><li><strong>Main Campaign</strong> completed</li></ul><p><br></p>', 1.99, 'https://kdjlhibxxygfdmlvdfcl.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/game-images/d4-paladin-build-season-11-1766169987288.webp', NULL, 4.9, NULL, true, true, 0, '2025-12-19T17:56:14.868842+00:00', '2025-12-21T21:20:25.82643+00:00', '2468b6cf-4682-449e-9911-cd76e69afb21', false, NULL, true, 0, '15 minutes', 'average start time', 'Flexible', 'order completion', 'Get a fully optimized D4 Season 11 Paladin build for Pit and Tower clears. Skip the grind with a meta-ready setup by misti.services.
