ction like Parsec.</li></ul><h3>About the Loremaster of Pandaria Achievement</h3><p>The <strong>Loremaster of Pandaria</strong> is a major meta-achievement in <em>Mists of Pandaria Classic</em> that requires finishing all key storyline quests in Pandaria. This includes six main zones, each filled with unique lore, memorable characters, and epic story arcs. Completing this achievement also contributes toward the larger <strong>Loremaster</strong> title, one of the most prestigious exploration rewards in <em>World of Warcraft</em>.</p><h3>Zones Required for Completion</h3><ul><li><strong>The Jade Forest</strong> – Begin your Pandaria adventure and meet the Pandaren people.</li><li><strong>Valley of the Four Winds</strong> – Aid farmers and uncover the beauty of Pandaria’s heartlands.</li><li><strong>Krasarang Wilds</strong> – Explore dense jungles and coastal battles.</li><li><strong>Kun-Lai Summit</strong> – Climb the towering mountains and assist the Shado-Pan monks.</li><li><strong>Townlong Steppes</strong> – Help in the war against the mantid threat.</li><li><strong>Dread Wastes</strong> – Face the Klaxxi and uncover the mysteries of ancient Pandaria.</li></ul><h3>Why Choose misti.services for Loremaster of Pandaria Boost</h3><ul><li><strong>Comprehensive Completion:</strong> Every main storyline and side requirement finished for full achievement credit.</li><li><strong>Fast and Secure:</strong> Save time with professional boosters who complete quests efficiently and safely.</li><li><strong>Experienced Team:</strong> Our experts know every questline and phase of Pandaria’s lore.</li><li><strong>Guaranteed Results:</strong> Your achievement and title are fully secured upon completion.</li><li><strong>Live Progress Updates:</strong> Stay informed about your boost every step of the way.</li></ul><h3>Experience the Full Story of Pandaria</h3><p>The <strong>Loremaster of Pandaria</strong> achievement is perfect for players who want to experience the complete lore and world of <em>Mists of Pandaria Classic</em> without spending weeks questing. Let <strong>misti.services</strong> handle the work — you’ll enjoy the story, rewards, and prestige of being a true Loremaster.</p><p>Order your <strong>WoW Pandaria Classic Loremaster of Pandaria Boost</strong> today and claim your place among Azeroth’s most dedicated adventurers.</p>', '<ul><li>Select your desired options and complete your order on&nbsp;Misti.Services.</li><li>You’ll receive an order confirmation and tracking number via email.</li><li>Our support manager will contact you through live chat to confirm all details.</li><li>If you’re unavailable, we’ll reach out via email or your preferred contact method.</li><li>When the boost is finished, you’ll receive a completion notification on Discord or another messenger of your choice.</li></ul>', '<ul><li>Active World of Warcraft subscription</li><li>Level 90 character</li></ul><p>Need help reaching level 90? Try our&nbsp;<a href="https://misti.services/game/wow-mistsofpandaria-classic" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank" style="color: rgb(60, 113, 221);">WoW Power Leveling Boost</a>&nbsp;</p>', 0, 'https://kdjlhibxxygfdmlvdfcl.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/game-images/loremaster-of-pandaria-achievement-1764191259125.webp', NULL, 4.9, 350, true, true, 0, '2025-11-02T03:02:33.31313+00:00', '2025-12-16T07:50:45.003207+00:00', '403bbc9e-7076-45b3-8734-4cad84441be2', false, NULL, true, 0, '15 minutes', 'average start time', 'Flexible', 'order completion', 'Buy WoW Pandaria Classic Loremaster of Pandaria Boost at misti.services to complete all main zone storylines and earn the Loremaster title quickly and securely.', 'loremaster of pandaria boost, wow pandaria classic loremaster, buy loremaster achievement, pandaria loremaster title, wow classic pandaria storyline boost, loremaster of pandaria service, fast loremaster pandaria, secure loremaster boost, mists of pandaria loremaster guide, wow pandaria classic achievements, buy pandaria achievements, loremaster title unlock pandaria, affordable loremaster pandaria, pandaria zone storylines boost', 'https://kdjlhibxxygfdmlvdfcl.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/game-images/loremaster-of-pandaria-achievement-1764191259125.webp', NULL, 'Loremaster Of Pandaria Achievement', 'WoW MoP Loremaster Boost | misti.services', NULL);
INSERT INTO public.products (id, name, slug, short_description, description, how_it_works, requirements, base_price, image_url, badge_text, trust_score, total_reviews, is_active, is_featured, sort_order, created_at, updated_at, category_id, is_slider_product, slider_config, is_manually_popular, total_sales, start_time_text, start_time_value, delivery_text, delivery_value, meta_description, meta_keywords, og_image, canonical_url, image_alt_text, meta_title, parent_link) VALUES ('304d1194-987a-464c-8906-24e44831f0e1', 'Kurenai', 'kurenai', 'The Kurenai are the Broken Draenei faction exclusive to the Alliance in The Burning Crusade Classic, found primarily in Nagrand. Achieving Exalted status is highly desirable for players seeking a unique, prestigious mount collection and valuable profession blueprints.', '<h1><strong>Kurenai Reputation Farm Boost – WoW TBC Classic</strong></h1><p>Are you an Alliance player seeking the beautiful, unique <strong>Talbuk Mounts</strong> and essential Leatherworking and Alchemy recipes? Misti.Services offers a fast, secure, and professional <a href="https://www.icy-veins.com/tbc-classic/kurenai-reputation-and-rewards-guide" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank"><strong>Kurenai </strong></a><strong>Reputation Farm Boost</strong>, handling the extensive quest chains and the long grind of farming Ogres and <strong>Obsidian Warbeads</strong> in Nagrand.</p><p>Our expert boosters execute the optimal combination of zone quests and efficient mob grinding to deliver guaranteed reputation gains from Unfriendly to Exalted.</p><h2><strong>Overview</strong></h2><p>The <strong>Kurenai</strong> are the Broken Draenei faction exclusive to the <strong>Alliance</strong> in <em>The Burning Crusade Classic</em>, found primarily in <strong>Nagrand</strong>. Achieving Exalted status is highly desirable for players seeking a unique, prestigious mount collection and valuable profession blueprints.</p><p>Earning <strong>Exalted</strong> status with the Kurenai provides access to:</p><ul><li><strong>Talbuk Mounts:</strong> The highly coveted <strong>Talbuk</strong> mounts, available in both ground and riding skill variations.</li><li><strong>Profession Recipes:</strong> Valuable patterns for Leatherworking (e.g., mail/leather items) and Alchemy (utility elixirs).</li><li><strong>Powerful Pre-Raid Gear:</strong> A variety of strong gear pieces useful for early raiding and dungeon clearing.</li></ul><h2><strong>Gaining Reputation</strong></h2><p>The Kurenai reputation grind begins at <strong>Unfriendly</strong> and is achieved through a multi-stage process involving initial quests, followed by intense open-world grinding and repeatable item turn-ins in Nagrand.</p><h3><strong>1. Questing (Unfriendly to Neutral/Revered Push)</strong></h3><p>Our service begins by clearing all available quests in Zangarmarsh and Nagrand to secure a rapid initial reputation gain:</p><ul><li><strong>Zangarmarsh (Orebor Harborage):</strong> We complete the initial quests available at <strong>Unfriendly</strong> to quickly reach Neutral (e.g., <em>Ango''rosh Encroachment</em>, <em>Daggerfen Deviance</em>).</li><li><strong>Nagrand Quests:</strong> Once Neutral, our boosters move to Nagrand to clear the extensive list of quests offered by the Kurenai, providing a large burst of reputation that typically pushes the player near or past <strong>Revered</strong> standing.</li></ul><h3><strong>2. Mob Grinding &amp; Repeatable Turn-Ins (Neutral to Exalted)</strong></h3><p>To reach the final rank of <strong>Exalted</strong>, grinding Ogres and Kil''sorrow agents is required, combined with repeatable turn-ins.</p><ul><li><strong>Ogre Farming:</strong> We efficiently kill Ogres and Kil''sorrow NPCs throughout Nagrand (at locations like Sunspring Post, The Burning Blade Ruins, Warmaul Hill), which grant <strong>10 reputation per kill</strong> all the way to Exalted.</li><li><strong>Obsidian Warbeads Turn-in:</strong> Ogres often drop <strong>Obsidian Warbeads</strong>. Once Friendly, we turn in these Warbeads to <strong>Warden Moi''bff Jill</strong> in batches of 10 for <strong>500 reputation</strong> via the repeatable <em>More Warbeads</em> quest, supplementing the daily grind.</li><li class="ql-indent-1"><em>Note:</em> We ensure Warbeads are used exclusively for Kurenai rep unless otherwise instructed (as they can also be used for The Consortium).</li></ul><h2><strong>Reputation Rewards</strong></h2><p>The Quartermaster, <strong>Trader Narasu</strong>, is located inside the inn at Telaar in Nagrand. This service guarantees you the standing necessary to purchase the full Talbuk mount collection.</p><p>Key RewardCost/DetailsFaction Rank<strong>Talbuk Mounts</strong> (Six variations)Requires ExaltedExaltedLeatherworking PatternsVariousRevered / ExaltedAlchemy RecipesVariousRevered / ExaltedPowerful Pre-Raid GearVariousRevered</p><h2><strong>Why Choose Our Kurenai Reputation Boost</strong></h2><p>The Kurenai grind is time-intensive, requiring players to spend dozens of hours farming Ogres and managing the Warbead turn-ins in the highly contested zones of Nagrand. Misti.Services offers the most straightforward path for Alliance players:</p><ul><li><strong>Full Quest Clearance:</strong> We guarantee completion of all 20+ reputation-giving quests for maximum initial gains.</li><li><strong>Efficient Ogre Grinding:</strong> Our boosters utilize optimal farming routes to maximize the acquisition of <strong>Obsidian Warbeads</strong> and kills per hour.</li><li><strong>Talbuk Mount Guarantee:</strong> Secure access to the full stable of unique, Alliance-exclusive <strong>Talbuk Mounts</strong>.</li></ul><h3><strong>Service Includes</strong></h3><ul><li>Full Kurenai reputation farm from your current standing (Unfriendly, Neutral, etc.) up to <strong>Exalted</strong>.</li><li>Full completion of all Kurenai quests in Zangarmarsh and Nagrand.</li><li>Targeted farming of Ogres for <strong>Obsidian Warbeads</strong> and kill reputation.</li><li>Guaranteed access to the <strong>Talbuk Mounts</strong> from Trader Narasu.</li></ul><p><strong>Secure your unique Talbuks! Order your Kurenai Reputation Boost today.</strong></p>', '<ul><li>Select your desired options and complete your order on&nbsp;Misti.Services.</li><li>You’ll receive an order confirmation and tracking number via email.</li><li>Our support manager will contact you through live chat to confirm all details.</li><li>If you’re unavailable, we’ll reach out via email or your preferred contact method.</li><li>When the boost is finished, you’ll receive a completion notification on Discord or another messenger of your choice.</li></ul>', '<ul><li><strong>Level 70</strong></li><li><strong>Active WoW Subscription</strong></li></ul>', 0, 'https://kdjlhibxxygfdmlvdfcl.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/game-images/kurenai-1763586372127.webp', NULL, 4.9, 0, true, true, 0, '2025-11-19T20:30:36.690296+00:00', '2026-02-16T10:52:54.164748+00:00', '9464d1fe-6c00-412a-8ebb-896a4f575b4e', false, NULL, true, 0, '15 minutes', 'average start time', 'Flexible', 'order completion', 'Kurenai Exalted boost for Alliance players. Unlock your unique, prestigious Talbuk Mount collection and valuable profession blueprints with fast Warbead farming.', 'Kurenai reputation boost, Talbuk mount farm, Obsidian Warbeads grind, TBC Alliance rep carry, Nagrand reputation, Kurenai Exalted, Trader Narasu, Telaar reputation, Ogre farming service, Kurenai Leatherworking recipes, Fierce Enemies quest', 'https://kdjlhibxxygfdmlvdfcl.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/game-images/kurenai-1763586372127.webp', NULL, 'Kurenai', 'WoW TBC Kurenai Rep Boost | misti.services', NULL);
