onfirm all details.</li><li>If you’re unavailable, we’ll reach out via email or your preferred contact method.</li><li>When the boost is finished, you’ll receive a completion notification on Discord or another messenger of your choice.</li></ul>', '<ul><li>Active World of Warcraft subscription</li><li>Level 90 character</li></ul><p>Need help reaching level 90? Try our&nbsp;<a href="https://misti.services/game/wow-mistsofpandaria-classic" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank" style="color: rgb(60, 113, 221);">WoW Power Leveling Boost</a>&nbsp;</p>', 359.88, 'https://kdjlhibxxygfdmlvdfcl.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/game-images/glorious-tyranny-achievement-1762696139681.webp', NULL, 4.9, 350, true, true, 0, '2025-11-02T02:52:41.574675+00:00', '2025-12-16T07:50:46.60544+00:00', '403bbc9e-7076-45b3-8734-4cad84441be2', false, NULL, true, 0, '15 minutes', 'average start time', 'Flexible', 'order completion', 'Buy WoW MoP Glorious Tyranny Boost at misti.services to unlock the elite PvP enchant and 2200 arena rating quickly, safely, and efficiently.', 'wow mop glorious tyranny boost, glorious tyranny achievement buy, mop 2200 arena rating boost, elite pvp enchant service, buy glorious tyranny wow, mists of pandaria pvp boost, wow mop achievement unlock, fast glorious tyranny, safe wow arena boost, efficient mop rating, pvp enchant mop, glorious tyranny carry, wow 2200 rating farm', 'https://kdjlhibxxygfdmlvdfcl.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/game-images/glorious-tyranny-achievement-1762696139681.webp', NULL, 'Glorious Tyranny Achievement', 'WoW MoP Glorious Tyranny Boost | misti.services', NULL);
