and smoother raid progression</li><li>Optional <strong>quest / project completion</strong> support when it improves XP and unlock flow</li><li>Everything earned during the run stays on your character (loot, materials, currency)</li></ul><h2><strong>Boost Options Explained</strong></h2><ul><li><strong>Piloted:</strong> Our booster plays on your character to complete the ARC Raiders leveling service efficiently.</li><li><strong>Self-play:</strong> You play with our Raider in your team (carry-style leveling) while we help you maximize XP per hour.</li><li><strong>Stream:</strong> You can watch the run live for transparency and peace of mind.</li></ul><h2><strong>About ARC Raiders Power Leveling (Why It Matters)</strong></h2><p>In ARC Raiders, your level directly affects how fast you can become “endgame-ready.” Higher levels mean more room to shape your build, more flexibility in raids, and less time stuck in the early grind. If you want an <strong>ARC Raiders XP boost</strong> without wasting weeks on repetition, a manual leveling boost is the cleanest shortcut.</p><p><strong>What you unlock faster:</strong></p><ul><li><strong>Skill points</strong> for meaningful power spikes</li><li>Better progression flow into tougher raids and contracts</li><li>A smoother path toward your preferred playstyle and weapon progression</li></ul><h2><strong>Why Choose misti.services</strong></h2><ul><li><strong>100% manual service:</strong> no bots, no shady shortcuts</li><li><strong>Efficient leveling strategy:</strong> focused on XP-per-hour and consistent extracts</li><li><strong>Flexible delivery:</strong> piloted or self-play carry options</li><li>Clear, human communication and progress updates when you need them</li></ul>', '<ul><li><strong>Pick your level range (1–75)</strong> and place the order on misti.services.</li><li>We assign a veteran Raider and confirm your preferred method: <strong>piloted</strong> or <strong>self-play</strong>.</li><li>We run efficient XP routes: mission