ng process.</li><li><strong>Manual Service:</strong> 100% hand-played by experienced boosters.</li></ul><h2><strong>More About Sthaarbs''s Last Lunch</strong></h2><p>This mount is a standout reward from the K''aresh zone content in <em>The War Within</em>. Unlike vendor mounts or achievement rewards, Sthaarbs''s Last Lunch is pure RNG (Random Number Generation). It drops from a specific rare elite mob that has a variable respawn timer.</p><p>For a solo player, this is a nightmare. You might wait hours for a spawn only to have the mount not drop, forcing you to start the cycle all over again. Our service eliminates this frustration. We assign a booster to camp the spawn location, ensuring that every possible kill window is utilized until the mount is yours.</p><h2><strong>Boost Options Explained</strong></h2><p>We offer two secure methods to deliver your mount:</p><ul><li><strong>Piloted:</strong> Our professional player logs into your account to complete the boost. We utilize strict security protocols, including VPNs matching your country, to ensure your account remains safe and flagged as a local login.</li><li><strong>Remote Control:</strong> For the highest level of security, our booster connects to your PC via a secure application like Parsec. They play the game using your mouse and keyboard while you watch the stream live. Your login credentials are never shared.</li></ul><h1><br></h1>', '<ul><li><strong>Select Options:</strong> Choose your preferred boost method (Piloted or Remote Control).</li><li><strong>Order Confirmation:</strong> After payment, you will receive an order number and email confirmation.</li><li><strong>Contact:</strong> Our support manager will reach out via Live Chat or Discord to verify your details.</li><li><strong>Assignment:</strong> We assign a professional booster to your order.</li><li><em>For Piloted:</em> The booster logs in securely to begin camping the rare spawn.</li><li><em>For Remote Control:</em> We set up the connection so the booster can play on your PC.</li><li><strong>Completion:</strong> We notify you immediately via your preferred messenger once the mount drops.</li><li><strong>Enjoy:</strong> Log in and summon Sthaarbs''s Last Lunch!</li></ul>', '<ul><li><strong>Level:</strong> Level 80 Character.</li><li><strong>Expansion:</strong> The War Within active.</li><li><strong>Account:</strong> Active World of Warcraft subscription.</li></ul>', 92.65, 'https://kdjlhibxxygfdmlvdfcl.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/game-images/sthaarbss-last-lunch-1763926053075.webp', NULL, 4.9, 0, true, true, 0, '2025-11-22T19:27:09.525676+00:00', '2025-12-16T07:22:26.936597+00:00', 'b4c0ccaf-a937-4b30-9ab4-7dacee8f739b', false, NULL, true, 0, '15 minutes', 'average start time', 'Flexible', 'order completion', 'Obtain Shalrath''s Last Lunch without weeks of tedious farming. Our pros at misti.services handle everything while you enjoy the rewards.', 'sthaarbs''s last lunch game, buy sthaarbs''s last lunch, sthaarbs''s last lunch pc, sthaarbs''s last lunch download, sthaarbs''s last lunch cheapest, sthaarbs''s last lunch official, sthaarbs''s last lunch price, sthaarbs''s last lunch review, game sthaarbs''s last lunch, sthaarbs''s last lunch digital key', 'https://kdjlhibxxygfdmlvdfcl.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/game-images/sthaarbss-last-lunch-1763926053075.webp', NULL, 'Game gaming service - Sthaarbs''s Last Lunch', 'War Within Mounts - Sthaarbs''s Last Lunch | misti.services', NULL);
INSERT INTO public.products (id, name, slug, short_description, description, how_it_works, requirements, base_price, image_url, badge_text, trust_score, total_reviews, is_active, is_featured, sort_order, created_at, updated_at, category_id, is_slider_product, slider_config, is_manually_popular, total_sales, start_time_text, start_time_value, delivery_text, delivery_value, meta_description, meta_keywords, og_image, canonical_url, image_alt_text, meta_title, parent_link) VALUES ('8f370df4-346f-472c-a439-ddb7d7c9e792', 'Urivar', 'urivar', 'Defeat Urivar fast with Misti Services. Unlock Mythic loot, Runes, and Urivar’s Hoard safely and efficiently in Diablo 4.', '<h1><strong>Diablo 4 Urivar Boost</strong></h1><p>Defeat one of Diablo 4’s toughest Season 8 bosses with Misti Services. Our <a href="https://www.wowhead.com/diablo-4/guide/zones/urivar-boss-guide" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank"><strong>Urivar</strong></a><strong> </strong>Boost helps you secure his Hoard filled with Mythic loot, Runes, and class-specific Uniques. Skip the grind, avoid the frustration, and let professionals handle the kill and farming while you enjoy the rewards.</p><h3>What’s Included</h3><ul><li>Urivar defeated on Torment difficulty by experienced boosters</li><li>Lair Boss Key provided or farmed during the service</li><li>Access to Urivar’s Hoard containing Mythic and Unique loot</li><li>Up to six Unique items and three Runes from the loot pool</li><li>All gold, materials, and resources remain on your account</li></ul><h3>Boost Options Explained</h3><ul><li>You have Lair Boss Keys – discounted price available</li><li>Unlock Torment difficulty for better rewards</li><li>Optional live stream available to watch your Urivar kill</li></ul><h3>About Diablo 4 Urivar Boost Service</h3><p>Urivar, the Fanatic High Priest, is one of Diablo 4’s most challenging Greater Lair Bosses introduced in Season 8. Located in the Temple of Flesh in Scosglen, he commands powerful zealots and deadly blade mechanics. Defeating Urivar grants access to his Hoard, a special loot chest offering Mythic and Unique items tied to your class. To unlock this Hoard, twelve Judicator’s Masks are required, which our team will farm for you during the boost.</p><p>This fight is designed for high-level players and can be punishing without help. Misti Services ensures a smooth, guaranteed kill so you can enjoy the rewards without the difficulty.</p><h3>Why You Should Defeat Urivar</h3><p>Killing Urivar offers access to some of the best loot in Diablo 4’s Season 8. His Hoard can drop Mythic Uniques, several Runes, and the Abhorrent Heart used to summon The Harbinger. Each completion increases your chances to collect high-tier items and strengthen your endgame build. It’s the ideal service for players who value efficiency and rewards.</p><h3>What You Get with the Urivar Boost</h3><p>Our professional boosters take care of the entire process — from summoning and key farming to the final kill and loot collection. You can participate directly or let our team complete it on your behalf. Either way, your account remains safe, and every reward stays with you.</p><h3>Unlocking Urivar’s Hoard</h3><p>Urivar’s Hoard requires twelve Judicator’s Masks, which are obtained from endgame activities such as World Bosses, elite events, and Whispers. These are included in the service, so you can open the Hoard immediately after the kill. Expect guaranteed Uniques, with a high chance of Mythic items and Runes.</p><h3>Why Choose Misti Services for Urivar Boost</h3><ul><li>Fast and efficient Urivar kills</li><li>Secure and manual boosting across all platforms</li><li>Experienced Diablo 4 boosters with deep knowledge</li><li>Flexible options for self-play or piloted mode</li><li>No farming or setup required — we provide everything</li><li>Reliable support and full transparency throughout the service</li></ul><p>Trust Misti Services to deliver quick, safe, and rewarding Urivar kills that elevate your endgame experience.</p>', '<ul><li>Select your desired options and complete your order on&nbsp;Misti.Services.</li><li>You’ll receive an order confirmation and tracking number via email.</li><li>Our support manager will contact you through live chat to confirm all details.</li><li>If you’re unavailable, we’ll reach out via email or your preferred contact method.</li><li>When the boost is finished, you’ll receive a completion notification on Discord or another messenger of your choice.</li></ul>', '<ul><li>Level 60 character.</li><li>Torment IV difficulty unlocked.</li><li>Main campaign or Vessel of Hatred completed.</li></ul><p>Need help leveling? Check our&nbsp;<a href="https://misti.services/game/buy-diablo-iv-boost/leveling" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank" style="color: rgb(250, 250, 250);">Diablo IV Leveling Boost</a></p>', 0, 'https://kdjlhibxxygfdmlvdfcl.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/game-images/urivar-1762543288360.webp', NULL, 4.9, 350, true, true, 0, '2025-11-05T02:39:19.206865+00:00', '2025-12-16T00:24:42.686367+00:00', 'c75b3391-ab33-45c3-8a4d-dae85a5a6e7c', true, '{"step":1,"max_value":100,"min_value":5,"slider_type":"single","value_label":"Numbers of Kills","default_value":5,"pricing_brackets":[{"end":100,"price":0.88,"start":1}],"estimated_time_per_step":0.5}', true, 0, '15 minutes', 'average start time', 'Flexible', 'order completion', 'Defeat Urivar fast with Misti Services. Unlock Mythic loot, Runes, and Urivar’s Hoard safely and efficiently in Diablo 4.', 'urivar kill service, diablo 4 urivar boost, mythic urivar loot, urivar''s hoard d4, buy urivar clear, fast urivar defeat, urivar runes farm, safe diablo 4 urivar, efficient urivar kill, misti services urivar, d4 urivar boss, unlock urivar rewards, cheap urivar boost', 'https://kdjlhibxxygfdmlvdfcl.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/game-images/urivar-1762543288360.webp', NULL, 'Urivar', 'Defeat Urivar D4 Boss Fast | misti.services', NULL);
