ing <strong>Renown 14</strong> with the Manaforge Vandals faction.</li><li><strong>The Unlocks:</strong> Access to all other vendor rewards unlocked along the path to Renown 14.</li><li><strong>Loot Rights:</strong> You keep all gold, gear, and resources looted during the farming process.</li><li><strong>Manual Service:</strong> 100% hand-played by experienced boosters.</li></ul><h2><strong>More About The Bone Freezer</strong></h2><p>The Bone Freezer is one of the most prestigious faction rewards in <em>The War Within</em>. Unlike random drops, this mount is a deterministic reward—but the barrier to entry is high. It is sold exclusively by the Quartermaster <strong>Zo''turu</strong>, and he will only speak to champions who have reached the pinnacle of the faction''s hierarchy.</p><p>Achieving Renown 14 requires a mix of raiding and open-world content. It is designed to take weeks of consistent gameplay. Our service compresses this timeline. We assign dedicated players who know the optimal routes for reputation gains, ensuring your character hits the required rank in the shortest time possible.</p><h2><strong>Boost Options Explained</strong></h2><p>We offer two secure methods to deliver your mount:</p><ul><li><strong>Piloted:</strong> Our professional player logs into your account to complete the boost. We utilize strict security protocols, including VPNs matching your country, to ensure your account remains safe and flagged as a local login.</li><li><strong>Remote Control:</strong> For the highest level of security, our booster connects to your PC via a secure application like Parsec. They play the game using your mouse and keyboard while you watch the stream live. Your login credentials are never shared.</li></ul>', '<ul><li><strong>Select Options:</strong> Choose your preferred boost method (Piloted or Remote Control).</li><li><strong>Order Confirmation:</strong> After payment, you will receive an order number and email confirmation.</li><li><strong>Contact:</strong> Our support manager will reach out via Live Chat or Discord to verify your details.</li><li><strong>Assignment:</strong> We assign a professional booster to your order.</li><li><em>For Piloted:</em> The booster logs in securely to begin farming reputation.</li><li><em>For Remote Control:</em> We set up the connection so the booster can play on your PC.</li><li><strong>Completion:</strong> We notify you immediately via your preferred messenger once Renown 14 is reached and the mount is secured.</li><li><strong>Enjoy:</strong> Log in and summon The Bone Freezer!</li></ul>', '<ul><li><strong>Level:</strong> Level 80 Character.</li><li><strong>Expansion:</strong> The War Within active.</li><li><strong>Account:</strong> Active World of Warcraft subscription.</li></ul>', 33.15, 'https://kdjlhibxxygfdmlvdfcl.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/game-images/the-bone-freezer-mount-1763929295309.webp', NULL, 4.9, 0, true, true, 0, '2025-11-22T19:24:56.480779+00:00', '2025-12-16T07:23:58.27156+00:00', 'b4c0ccaf-a937-4b30-9ab4-7dacee8f739b', false, NULL, true, 0, '15 minutes', 'average start time', 'Flexible', 'order completion', 'Unlock the chilling Bone Freezer Mount with a smooth, hassle-free carry. Save time and let misti.services farm all requirements for you.', 'the bone freezer mount, buy the bone freezer mount, game the bone freezer mount, the bone freezer mount service, the bone freezer mount for sale, get the bone freezer mount, game mount the bone freezer, the bone freezer boost, fast the bone freezer mount, mount acquisition service, game rare mount, the bone freezer farming, unlock the bone freezer mount, the bone freezer mount delivery', 'https://kdjlhibxxygfdmlvdfcl.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/game-images/the-bone-freezer-mount-1763929295309.webp', NULL, 'Game mount - The Bone Freezer Mount', 'Get The Bone Freezer Mount War Within | misti.services', NULL);
