ur next spell after a direct heal, significantly boosting mana sustainability during intense raid encounters. This makes it an indispensable tool for healers who provide consistent high-frequency healing, transforming costly AoE rotations into efficient throughput, and remaining viable throughout the expansion.</p><h3><strong>Why Choose Our Service</strong></h3><ul><li><strong>Reliable Acquisition:</strong> We remove the randomness of raid drops by guaranteeing repeated access until the trinket is yours.</li><li><strong>Expert Teams:</strong> Our dedicated TBC raid teams are highly experienced, ensuring clean and swift clears.</li><li><strong>Tailored for Healers:</strong> Specifically designed to help healing classes secure this best-in-slot item with minimal effort.</li><li><strong>Convenient Options:</strong> Choose between Pilot for a hands-off experience or Self-Play to actively participate in the raid.</li><li><strong>No Competition:</strong> Enjoy full loot priority for the Eye of Gruul, ensuring it goes directly to you.</li></ul><p>Secure your Eye of Gruul today and experience a new level of healing efficiency in WoW TBC Classic. misti.services is committed to providing seamless and guaranteed acquisition of your desired in-game items.</p>', '<ul><li>Select your preferred region (EU or US) for the service.</li><li>Choose your raid participation method: Pilot (we play your character) or Selfplay (you join our raid team).</li><li>Our team will schedule weekly runs of Gruul''s Lair.</li><li>We will continue running Gruul''s Lair until the Eye of Gruul drops and is secured for your character.</li></ul>', '<ul><li><strong>Active World of Warcraft: The Burning Crusade Classic account.</strong></li><li><strong>Level 70 character.</strong></li><li><strong>Account details if opting for Pilot mode.</strong></li><li><strong>Availability for raid times if opting for Selfplay mode.</strong></li></ul>', 399, 'https://kdjlhibxxygfdmlvdfcl.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/game-images/wow-tbc-classic-eye-of-gruul-boost-1768599330450.webp', NULL, 4.9, 0, true, true, 0, '2026-01-12T16:53:48.665537+00:00', '2026-01-16T21:43:20.686396+00:00', 'd2c3bb86-72be-4345-8f78-3c62edc8e30d', false, NULL, true, 0, '15 minutes', 'average start time', 'Flexible', 'order completion', 'Acquire the powerful WoW TBC Classic Eye of Gruul healing trinket with our guaranteed boost service. Enhance mana efficiency for top raid performance in TBC.', 'wow tbc classic eye of gruul buy, tbc eye of gruul price, wow tbc eye of gruul boost, tbc classic gearing service, tbc classic trinket farm, wow tbc healer gear, tbc classic raid service, buy wow tbc gear, eye of gruul acquisition, tbc classic WoW, gruul''s lair boost, tbc gruul loot, best in slot tbc healer trinket, tbc classic dps boost, wow tbc carry, wow tbc classic item farm, gaming service, fast delivery, professional, reliable', 'https://kdjlhibxxygfdmlvdfcl.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/game-images/wow-tbc-classic-eye-of-gruul-boost-1768599330450.webp', NULL, 'Wow Tbc Classic Eye Of Gruul Boost', 'Buy WoW TBC Classic Eye of Gruul Boost | misti.services', NULL);
INSERT INTO public.products (id, name, slug, short_description, description, how_it_works, requirements, base_price, image_url, badge_text, trust_score, total_reviews, is_active, is_featured, sort_order, created_at, updated_at, category_id, is_slider_product, slider_config, is_manually_popular, total_sales, start_time_text, start_time_value, delivery_text, delivery_value, meta_description, meta_keywords, og_image, canonical_url, image_alt_text, meta_title, parent_link) VALUES ('f815015e-5bfb-41a4-b1fa-9f8475798acd', 'The Dominance Offensive', 'the-dominance-offensive', 'Boost your Dominance Offensive reputation fast in WoW Mists of Pandaria Classic with Misti Services and unlock mounts, gear, and Horde rewards.', '<h1><strong>The Dominance Offensive Reputation Boost</strong></h1><p><a href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/guide/reputation/dominance-offensive-quests-quartermaster-rewards" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank"><strong>The Dominance Offensive</strong></a> is the Horde’s mighty military campaign in Pandaria, led by Garrosh Hellscream and his top generals. Gaining reputation with this faction unlocks powerful gear, exclusive mounts, and storyline quests that advance the Horde’s presence in Pandaria. With Misti Services, you can reach Exalted quickly and enjoy all the rewards without the daily grind.</p><h3>How to Earn Reputation with The Dominance Offensive</h3><p>Reputation with The Dominance Offensive in World of Warcraft: Mists of Pandaria Classic is earned through daily quests and story missions centered around the Krasarang Wilds. Players aid the Horde’s war effort against the Alliance, assist top-ranking officers, and engage in key battles to secure strategic positions along the Pandarian coast.</p><p>Completing these daily quests provides reputation, Valor Points, and campaign progression, gradually unlocking new story chapters and cinematic events.</p><h3>Unlocking The Dominance Offensive Dailies</h3><p>To begin your reputation journey, you must be a <strong>Horde player</strong> and complete the introductory questline from the Shrine of Two Moons in the Vale of Eternal Blossoms. This unlocks access to the Dominance Offensive base and daily quest hub in Krasarang Wilds.</p><p>As your reputation increases, additional questlines unfold, revealing deeper parts of the Pandaria War Campaign and granting bonus reputation and exclusive rewards.</p><h3>Reputation Boosting Tips</h3><p>Earning reputation with The Dominance Offensive can be time-consuming, but you can speed up your progress using temporary buffs and bonuses:</p><ul><li><strong>Darkmoon Faire – WHEE!</strong> (+10% reputation for 1 hour)</li><li><strong>Hallow’s End – Unburdened or Grim Visage</strong> (+10% for 2 hours)</li><li><strong>Pilgrim’s Bounty – Spirit of Sharing</strong> (+10% for 1 hour)</li><li><strong>Guild Perk – Mr. Popularity</strong> (+10% reputation bonus)</li></ul><p>Completing every daily and campaign quest available each day, combined with these buffs, ensures steady and efficient reputation gains.</p><h3>The Dominance Offensive Rewards</h3><p>The Dominance Offensive rewards loyal Horde players with some of the most striking faction gear and mounts in Pandaria:</p><ul><li><strong>Honored:</strong> Profession recipes, trinkets, and improved equipment</li><li><strong>Revered:</strong> Advanced armor pieces, cosmetic items, and storyline quests</li><li><strong>Exalted:</strong> Mounts such as the <em>Grand Armored Wyvern</em>, powerful weapons, and the Dominance Offensive Tabard</li></ul><p>Completing the entire campaign also grants achievements tied to the Pandaria War Campaign, strengthening your legacy as a Horde champion.</p><h3>Why Choose Misti Services for Your Dominance Offensive Boost</h3><p>Misti Services provides a safe, fast, and professional way to earn reputation with The Dominance Offensive in WoW Mists of Pandaria Classic. Our expert boosters handle all campaign quests and daily missions, ensuring you reach Exalted efficiently and without the grind. Enjoy the mounts, epic rewards, and complete storyline while we handle the hard work.</p>', '<ul><li>Select your desired options and complete your order on&nbsp;Misti.Services.</li><li>You’ll receive an order confirmation and tracking number via email.</li><li>Our support manager will contact you through live chat to confirm all details.</li><li>If you’re unavailable, we’ll reach out via email or your preferred contact method.</li><li>When the boost is finished, you’ll receive a completion notification on Discord or another messenger of your choice.</li></ul>', '<ul><li>Active World of Warcraft subscription</li><li>Level 90 character</li></ul><p>Need help reaching level 90? Try our&nbsp;<a href="https://misti.services/game/wow-mistsofpandaria-classic" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank" style="color: rgb(60, 113, 221);">WoW Power Leveling Boost</a>&nbsp;</p>', 0, 'https://kdjlhibxxygfdmlvdfcl.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/game-images/the-dominance-offensive-1763232886816.webp', NULL, 4.9, 350, true, true, 0, '2025-11-02T21:02:22.405053+00:00', '2025-12-16T07:51:21.670895+00:00', 'eef98e08-1b65-4858-859f-5418bbab5fa2', false, NULL, true, 0, '15 minutes', 'average start time', 'Flexible', 'order completion', 'Boost your Dominance Offensive reputation fast in WoW Mists of Pandaria Classic with Misti Services and unlock mounts, gear, and Horde rewards.', 'dominance offensive reputation boost, wow mists of pandaria classic, misti services dominance offensive, fast dominance offensive rep, unlock dominance offensive mounts, dominance offensive gear farm, horde rewards mop classic, buy dominance offensive boost, cheap mop classic rep farm, professional wow rep services, mists of pandaria classic reputation guide, dominance offensive reputation grind, mop classic horde reputation, wow mop classic dominance offensive', 'https://kdjlhibxxygfdmlvdfcl.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/game-images/the-dominance-offensive-17