3>Boost Options</h3><ul><li><strong>Piloted</strong> – Our professional booster controls your character and completes all necessary steps</li><li><strong>Remote Control</strong> – Connect securely via remote app such as Parsec to watch the boost live</li><li><strong>Self-Play</strong> – Join our team and play yourself during the boost</li></ul><p>All boosts are performed by top-rated PvP players with years of experience. We ensure full account safety using secure and proven methods.</p><h3>WoW 3v3 Arena Rankings – The War Within Season 3</h3><ul><li>Unranked: 0-999</li><li>Combatant: 1000-1399</li><li>Challenger: 1400-1799</li><li>Rival: 1800-2100</li><li>Duelist: 2100-2399</li><li>Elite: 2400+</li><li>Gladiator: 50 wins above 2400</li><li>Astral Gladiator: Top 0.1% of the ladder</li></ul><h3>Why Choose This Boost</h3><p>Climbing the Arena ladder requires skill, time, and coordination. This service lets you skip the grind and reach your desired rank quickly and safely. Benefits include:</p><ul><li><strong>Guaranteed Rating</strong> – Reach your target rank from Challenger to Gladiator</li><li><strong>PvP Gear and Rewards</strong> – Unlock high-level Conquest gear, Elite PvP sets, and unique transmogs</li><li><strong>Professional Service</strong> – Boosts completed by experienced Gladiators with account safety ensured</li></ul><p>Reach top Arena ranks and unlock exclusive rewards, titles, and achievements with ease.</p><p><strong>Secure Your WoW 3v3 Arena Boost Today</strong></p><p>Achieve your desired 3v3 rating and collect all Season 3 rewards. Choose your boost method, leave the grind to our professional team, and enjoy all the benefits of high-level PvP without stress or hassle.</p>', '<ul><li>Select your current and desired rating, preferred boost method, and any extra options</li><li>Complete your payment and our team will contact you to schedule the boost</li><li>If self-play, join the sessions; if piloted, relax while our team completes the boost</li><li>Receive your rating, titles, achievements, and rewards</li></ul><h2><br></h2>', '<ul><li>Must have The War Within expansion and active WoW subscription</li><li>Level 80 character</li><li>Honor gear required for rating up to Rival</li><li>Conquest gear required for rating above Rival</li><li>BiS PvP Combat Kit required for rating above Duelist</li></ul>', 0.81, 'https://kdjlhibxxygfdmlvdfcl.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/game-images/arena-3vs3-1762439983286.webp', NULL, 4.9, 350, true, true, 0, '2025-10-23T20:03:01.760879+00:00', '2026-01-03T08:04:59.243629+00:00', '31441b65-4762-40ea-b89f-9fd09aebe8ba', true, '{"step":50,"end_label":"Desired Rating","max_value":2400,"min_value":0,"default_end":2400,"start_label":"Current Rating","default_start":0,"pricing_brackets":[{"end":1800,"price":55.25,"start":0},{"end":1900,"price":63.75,"start":1801},{"end":2000,"price":63.75,"start":1901},{"end":2100,"price":63.75,"start":2001},{"end":2200,"price":119,"start":2101},{"end":2300,"price":119,"start":2201},{"end":2400,"price":119,"start":2301}],"estimated_time_per_step":0.00005}', true, 0, '15 minutes', 'average start time', 'Flexible', 'order completion', 'WoW Arena 3v3 Rating Boost Climb the WoW 3v3 Arena ladder effortlessly.', 'wow 3v3 arena boost, buy wow 3v3 carry, season 3 pvp rewards, wow arena rating climb, professional 3v3 boosters, elite pvp gear unlock, wow arena titles achievements, safe wow 3v3 boosting, efficient wow arena carry, avoid toxic teammates wow, wow rating drops solution, cheap wow 3v3 boost, fast wow arena climb, wow 3v3 selfplay, wow 3v3 piloted', 'https://kdjlhibxxygfdmlvdfcl.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/game-images/arena-3vs3-1762439983286.webp', NULL, 'Arena 3vs3', 'War Within 3v3 Arena Boost | misti.services', NULL);
INSERT INTO public.products (id, name, slug, short_description, description, how_it_works, requirements, base_price, image_url, badge_text, trust_score, total_reviews, is_active, is_featured, sort_order, created_at, updated_at, category_id, is_slider_product, slider_config, is_manually_popular, total_sales, start_time_text, start_time_value, delivery_text, delivery_value, meta_description, meta_keywords, og_image, canonical_url, image_alt_text, meta_title, parent_link) VALUES ('00a71e88-7632-4d78-b708-421317aafe14', 'Mythic Unique Items', 'mythic-unique-items', 'Buy Diablo 4 Mythic Unique Items safely with misti.services. Get guaranteed Uber Unique drops or crafted Mythic Uniques without grinding Tormented Bosses.', '<h1><strong>Diablo 4 Mythic Unique Items for Sale</strong></h1><p><strong>Mythic Uniques</strong> (also known as <em>Uber Uniques</em>) are the most powerful items in Diablo 4. Each Mythic Unique comes with 800 Item Power and at least one Greater Affix, making them the pinnacle of endgame equipment. Currently, twelve Mythic Uniques are available, obtainable through Torment-level gameplay, crafting, or rare world drops.</p><p>Their extremely low drop rate makes farming them time-consuming. That’s why <strong>misti.services</strong> offers a reliable and efficient Mythic Unique Item Boost — letting you skip the grind and obtain these legendary pieces fast and safely.</p><h3>Service Includes</h3><ul><li>Guaranteed acquisition of selected <strong>Mythic Unique Item(s)</strong>.</li><li>All gold, loot, and materials collected during the boost remain on your account.</li><li>Optional farming or crafting assistance depending on the item.</li><li>Professional completion by experienced Diablo 4 boosters.</li></ul><h3>Boost Options</h3><p><strong>Account Sharing:</strong> Our booster logs into your account to complete the service.</p><p><strong>Normal:</strong> Standard service speed.</p><p><strong>Express:</strong> Priority completion, up to twice as fast.</p><p><strong>Super Express:</strong> Highest priority, up to three times faster delivery.</p><h3>What Are Mythic Unique Items in Diablo 4?</h3><p><strong>Mythic Uniques</strong>, or <strong>Uber Uniques</strong>, are ultra-rare, top-tier items that define the endgame in Diablo 4. Each one features:</p><ul><li>800 base Item Power.</li><li>At least one Greater Affix for enhanced stats.</li><li>Unique powers tied to each item.</li></ul><p>These items drop from high-level enemies and bosses, or can be crafted using <strong>Resplendent Sparks</strong> and runes at the Blacksmith or Jeweler.</p><h3>How to Get Mythic Unique Items</h3><p>There are four main ways to obtain Mythic Uniques in Diablo 4:</p><p><strong>Tormented Boss Fights:</strong></p><p>Defeat Tormented Bosses starting on Torment I difficulty. Andariel and Duriel have the highest Mythic drop rates, making them the most efficient to farm.</p><p><strong>Crafting with Resplendent Sparks:</strong></p><p>Collect two Resplendent Sparks to craft Mythic Unique Caches or specific Uniques. Sparks are obtained from salvaging Mythic Uniques or defeating major bosses such as Echo of Lilith.</p><p><strong>Open World Drops:</strong></p><p>Once you’ve unlocked Torment I, Mythic Uniques can rarely drop from elite monsters or chests in the open world.</p><p><strong>Buy Mythic Unique Boost:</strong></p><p>Skip the lengthy farming and secure guaranteed Mythic Uniques through misti.services.</p><h3>Mythic Unique Crafting Recipes</h3><p>Each Mythic Unique requires two Resplendent Sparks, 5,000 gold, and a combination of six of three rune types.</p><p>ItemRequired RunesAndariel’s VisageTam, Qax, ZanHeir of PerditionJax, Que, GarMelted Heart of SeligVex, Thul, TunNesekem, the HeraldYul, Wat, TalRing of Starless SkiesOhm, Tzic, CemShattered VowXan, Ner, TebShroud of False DeathBac, Kry, MoniTyrael’s MightLith, Feo, TecHarlequin CrestEom, Lac, TonAhavarion, Spear of LycanderYom, Poc, CirDoombringerAhu, Neo, LumThe GrandfatherXol, Kaa, Yax<