 grind and unlocks the mount via a secure remote connection.</p><h3>About Reins of the Azure Water Strider</h3><p>The <strong>Azure Water Strider</strong> is a unique ground mount in Mists of Pandaria Classic. It allows players to walk across water surfaces without sinking, making it highly useful for exploring aquatic zones. To obtain it, players must reach Exalted reputation with <strong>The Anglers</strong> and purchase the mount from Nat Pagle at Anglers Wharf in Krasarang Wilds.</p><h3>Reputation with The Anglers</h3><p>Exalted reputation requires completing daily quests, delivering rare fish, and using reputation-boosting items like <strong>Commendations of the Anglers</strong> and the <strong>Grand Commendation of the Anglers</strong>. These methods significantly speed up the grind and ensure you reach Exalted efficiently.</p><h3>Why Choose misti.services</h3><ul><li>Fast and efficient Anglers reputation farming</li><li>Professional boosters handle all daily quests and rare fish turn-ins</li><li>Manual and safe gameplay with no bots</li><li>Live updates during the boost</li><li>Guaranteed mount acquisition</li></ul><h3>Benefits of the Azure Water Strider</h3><ul><li>Walk on water without special buffs or mounts</li><li>Reach fishing spots and quest areas faster</li><li>Unique insect-like mount design for your collection</li><li>Progress toward The Anglers achievement</li><li>Save time and enjoy fast travel across Pandaria</li></ul><p>Unlock the <strong>Reins of the Azure Water Strider</strong> safely and efficiently with the <strong>misti.services</strong> boost service. Your mount, reputation, and achievements are all completed by hand for maximum safety and convenience.</p>', '<ul><li>Select your desired options and complete your order on&nbsp;Misti.Services.</li><li>You’ll receive an order confirmation and tracking number via email.</li><li>Our support manager will contact you through live chat to confirm all details.</li><li>If you’re unavailable, we’ll reach out via email or your preferred contact method.</li><li>When the boost is finished, you’ll receive a completion notification on Discord or another messenger of your choice.</li></ul>', '<ul><li>Active World of Warcraft subscription</li><li>Level 85 character</li></ul><p>Need help reaching level 90? Try our&nbsp;<a href="https://misti.services/game/wow-mistsofpandaria-classic" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank" style="color: rgb(60, 113, 221);">WoW Power Leveling Boost</a>&nbsp;</p>', 42.2, 'https://kdjlhibxxygfdmlvdfcl.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/game-images/reins-of-the-azure-water-strider-1763138114838.webp', NULL, 4.9, 350, true, true, 0, '2025-11-02T04:50:50.115397+00:00', '2025-12-16T07:50:56.497995+00:00', 'ebcd9386-0643-4a05-b31a-68729907aee7', false, NULL, true, 0, '15 minutes', 'average start time', 'Flexible', 'order completion', 'Get the Pandaria Classic Azure Water Strider mount boost at misti.services with safe, hand-played Anglers reputation farming.', 'reins of the azure water strider boost, pandaria classic azure water strider, wow classic anglers reputation farm, mists of pandaria mount boost, azure water strider hand-played, classic wow anglers rep grind, buy azure water strider mount, fast pandaria classic mount, safe wow classic anglers boost, reins of the azure water strider service, mop classic azure strider, anglers reputation farming service, professional azure water strider boost', 'https://kdjlhibxxygfdmlvdfcl.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/game-images/reins-of-the-azure-water-strider-1763138114838.webp', NULL, 'Reins Of The Azure Water Strider', 'WoW MoP Classic Azure Water Strider | misti.services', NULL);
INSERT INTO public.products (id, name, slug, short_description, description, how_it_works, requirements, base_price, image_url, badge_text, trust_score, total_reviews, is_active, is_featured, sort_order, created_at, updated_at, category_id, is_slider_product, slider_config, is_manually_popular, total_sales, start_time_text, start_time_value, delivery_text, delivery_value, meta_description, meta_keywords, og_image, canonical_url, image_alt_text, meta_title, parent_link) VALUES ('4ff6f70b-8c48-4ec5-a866-753bdb028ae7', 'Destiny Rising Legendary Campaign Boost', 'destiny-rising-legendary-campaign-boost', 'Conquer the toughest missions in Destiny Rising without the grind. Our Legendary Campaign Boost allows you to clear Heroic or Challenge difficulty missions efficiently, securing weekly high-value rewards and a strong chance at Exotic weapons and catalyst materials. Let our expert team handle the high-difficulty content so you can focus on enjoying the endgame.', '<h1><strong>Destiny Rising Legendary Campaign Boost</strong></h1><p>Conquer the toughest missions in <a href="https://www.gameshub.com/news/reviews/destiny-rising-review-2805187/" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank"><strong>Destiny Rising </strong></a>without the grind. Our Legendary Campaign Boost allows you to clear Heroic or Challenge difficulty missions efficiently, securing weekly high-value rewards and a strong chance at Exotic weapons and catalyst materials. Let our expert team handle the high-difficulty content so you can focus on enjoying the endgame.</p><h2><strong>What You Get</strong></h2><ul><li>Selected Legendary Campaign missions completed on your chosen difficulty</li><li>Random Mythic Weapon or Mythic Weapon Fragment obtained</li><li>Exotic Weapon Infusion Cores and Superposed Photons from weekly or Pinnacle rewards</li><li>Chance at Exotic Weapon drops from weekly completions</li><li>Significant amount of Glimmer and additional crafting materials</li><li>All loot and gear earned during the service delivered to your account</li></ul><h2><strong>Boosting Options</strong></h2><p><strong>Piloted Service</strong> — A professional booster completes the selected missions on your account</p><p><strong>Max First-Attempt Rewards</strong> — Missions completed within the required time to secure maximum first-clear rewards</p><h2><strong>About the Destiny Rising Legendary Campaign</strong></h2><p>The Legendary Campaign represents the pinnacle of solo PvE challenge in Destiny Rising. It features a significantly harder retuned version of the main story missions and serves as a top-tier source for Exotic weapons, catalyst materials, and weekly high-value loot. Completing these missions efficiently each week is essential for maximizing endgame progression.</p><h2><strong>Why the Legendary Campaign Matters</strong></h2><ul><li><strong>Top-Tier Solo Loot Source</strong> – Earn Exotic weapons, catalyst materials, and powerful upgrade resources</li><li><strong>Heroic &amp; Challenge Difficulties</strong> – Heroic offers tough encounters, while Challenge provides the highest reward tier available</li><li><strong>Weekly High-Value Rewards</strong> – First three weekly completions with Pinnacle Energy deliver maximum loot value</li><li><strong>Power Progression</strong> – Contributes to Team Level and Reward Level advancement for long-term growth</li></ul><p>Challenge-tier clears are the only path to the rarest catalysts and top materials such as Exotic Weapon Fragments and Mobius Cluster components.</p><h2><strong>How Rewards Work</strong></h2><p>The system prioritizes your first weekly clears:</p><ul><li>First three Pinnacle Energy spends grant <strong>Weekly High-Value Rewards</strong></li><li>Additional runs still reward Pinnacle loot, though at standard value</li><li>Reward quality scales with your overall Reward Level and Team Level</li></ul><p>This makes each weekly Legendary Campaign reset a core endgame progression cycle.</p><h2><strong>Why Choose misti.services</strong></h2><ul><li>Highly skilled boosters with deep Legendary Campaign expertise</li><li>Guaranteed completion of three weekly high-value runs</li><li>Fast start times with 24/7 progress support</li><li>Established, trusted boosting service with years of experience and thousands of completed orders</li></ul><p>Skip the frustration and secure your Exotic drops, catalysts, and progression — misti.services delivers fast, secure, and reliable Legendary Campaign clears in Destiny Rising.</p>', '<ul><li>Select your desired missions and difficulty, then place your order</li><li>A dedicated booster is assigned and your schedule is confirmed</li><li>We complete your selected Legendary missions on your behalf</li><li>You receive completion confirmation and can log back in</li><li>Enjoy your new rewards and progress in Destiny Rising</li></ul>', '<ul><li>Legendary Campaign unlocked</li><li>Character must meet Team Level and Power requirements</li><li>Sufficient Pinnacle Energy to claim Pinnacle Rewards</li></ul>', 0, 'https://kdjlhibxxygfdmlvdfcl.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/game-images/destiny-rising-legendary-campaign-boost-1762208075564.webp', NULL, 4.9, 0, true, false, 0, '2025-11-02T21:14:53.009335+00:00', '2025-12-16T00:22:53.785351+00:00', '80676051-c2a4-4c90-b126-2782bce3ea2e', true, '{"step":1,"max_value":10,"min_value":1,"price_label":"Price","slider_type":"single","value_label":"Number of Runs","default_value":5,"pricing_brackets":[{"end":10,"price":8,"start":1}],"estimated_time_per_step":0}', false, 0, '15 minutes', 'average start time', 'Flexible', 'order completion', 'Destiny Rising Legendary Campaign Boost Conquer the toughest missions in Destiny Rising without the grind.', 'destiny rising legendary campaign boost, destiny rising heroic difficulty boost, destiny rising challenge difficulty boost, destiny rising exotic weapons farm, destiny rising catalyst materials farm, destiny rising high-value rewards service, buy destiny rising legendary boost, fast destiny rising campaign clear, professional destiny rising mission help, destiny rising endgame boost, destiny rising hardest missions complete, destiny rising no grind service, destiny rising high difficulty content clear', 'https://kdjlhibxxygfdmlvdfcl.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/game-images/destiny-rising-legendary-campaign-boost-1762208075564.webp', NULL, 'Destiny Rising Legendary Campaign Boost', 'Destiny Rising Legendary Campaign Boost | misti.services', NULL);
