s</strong> – Pick between piloted for pure convenience or selfplay to learn the map alongside an expert.</li><li><strong>Secure and Manual Service</strong> – Every raid is played by hand with a strong focus on account safety and privacy.</li><li><strong>Responsive Support</strong> – Our support team is available to answer questions and keep you updated on the progress of your order.</li></ul><p>With the <strong>Escape from Tarkov Woods Raid Boost</strong> from misti.services, you turn one of the game’s most intimidating maps into a reliable source of loot, quest progress, and confidence in long-range combat.</p>', '<ul><li><strong>Select Your Options and Place the Order</strong></li><li>Choose piloted or selfplay, set your goals (Shturman hunts, quests, loot runs), select priority, and confirm your order on misti.services.</li><li><strong>We Assign a Woods Specialist</strong></li><li>A Tarkov veteran with deep knowledge of Woods’ terrain, angles, and spawns is assigned to your service. They review your account status and objectives.</li><li><strong>Guided or Piloted Woods Raids</strong></li><li class="ql-indent-1">In <strong>piloted</strong> mode, the booster runs raids on your PMC, focusing on survival, loot, and your chosen tasks.</li><li class="ql-indent-1">In <strong>selfplay</strong>, you join their group and follow their guidance as they secure positions, mark threats, and help you win engagements.</li><li><strong>Objectives and Loot Secured</strong></li><li>Shturman kills, quest areas, stashes, and high-value zones are prioritized based on your goals. All extracted loot and progress stay on your account.</li><li><strong>Completion and Notification</strong></li><li>As soon as your agreed number of raids or objectives are completed, you are notified and can log in to enjoy the results: a more confident presence on Woods, better loot, and completed tasks.</li></ul>', '<ul><li>Escape from Tarkov purchased and accessible on your account</li><li>For piloted service