ail or your preferred contact method.</li><li>When the boost is finished, you’ll receive a completion notification on Discord or another messenger of your choice.</li></ul><p><br></p>', '<ul><li>Active World of Warcraft subscription</li><li>Level 85 character in Pandaria Classic</li></ul><p><span style="background-color: rgba(23, 32, 48, 0.9); color: rgb(250, 250, 250);">Need help reaching level 90? Try our&nbsp;</span><a href="https://misti.services/game/wow-mistsofpandaria-classic" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank" style="background-color: rgba(23, 32, 48, 0.9); color: rgb(60, 113, 221);">WoW Power Leveling Boost</a><span style="background-color: rgba(23, 32, 48, 0.9); color: rgb(250, 250, 250);">&nbsp;</span></p>', 123.16, 'https://kdjlhibxxygfdmlvdfcl.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/game-images/reins-of-the-grand-expedition-yak-1763138344963.webp', NULL, 4.9, 350, true, true, 0, '2025-11-02T04:57:16.758634+00:00', '2025-12-16T07:50:57.200093+00:00', 'ebcd9386-0643-4a05-b31a-68729907aee7', false, NULL, true, 0, '1 hour', 'average start time', '12 hours', 'order completion', 'Get the Pandaria Classic Grand Expedition Yak mount boost at misti.services with safe, hand-played gold farming for instant acquisition.', 'reins of the grand expedition yak boost, grand expedition yak mount service, pandaria classic grand expedition yak, wow pandaria yak farm, buy grand expedition yak, fast grand expedition yak acquisition, hand-played gold farming wow, instant grand expedition yak, mists of pandaria yak mount, classic wow yak boost, safe grand expedition yak, mop classic mount farm, grand expedition yak for sale, wow pandaria mount boost', 'https://kdjlhibxxygfdmlvdfcl.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/game-images/reins-of-the-grand-expedition-yak-1763138344963.webp', NULL, 'Reins Of The Grand Expedition Yak', 'WoW Grand Expedition Yak Mount | misti.services', NULL);
