ry our&nbsp;<a href="https://misti.services/game/wow-mistsofpandaria-classic" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank" style="color: rgb(250, 250, 250);">WoW Power Leveling Boost</a>&nbsp;</p><p>Need help with gear? Try our&nbsp;<a href="https://misti.services/game/wow-mistsofpandaria-classic/gear/gear-boost" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank" style="color: rgb(250, 250, 250);">WoW Gear Boost</a></p>', 0, 'https://kdjlhibxxygfdmlvdfcl.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/game-images/arena-5v5-boost-1763151052028.webp', NULL, 4.9, 350, true, true, 0, '2025-11-02T02:10:12.718532+00:00', '2025-12-16T07:51:24.346793+00:00', 'bccf784b-6919-4020-9a70-5da0b4c0119c', true, '{"step":200,"end_label":"Desired Rating","max_value":2200,"min_value":0,"default_end":2200,"start_label":"Current Rating","default_start":0,"pricing_brackets":[{"end":1000,"price":36.76,"start":1},{"end":1600,"price":47.96,"start":1001},{"end":2200,"price":539.16,"start":1601}],"estimated_time_per_step":0.5}', true, 0, '15 minutes', 'average start time', 'Flexible', 'order completion', 'Buy WoW Pandaria Classic Arena 5v5 Boost at misti.services to reach your target PvP rating, earn elite gear, and unlock Arena titles fast and safely.', 'wow pandaria classic arena 5v5 boost, buy mop classic 5v5 arena rating, pandaria classic pvp boost, fast wow classic arena titles, mop classic elite pvp gear, wow classic arena rating boost, safe wow pandaria 5v5 boost, professional mop classic arena service, buy pandaria classic pvp rating, cheap wow classic arena boost, misti.services arena 5v5 boost, mop classic pvp rating farm, wow pandaria classic arena carry, arena 5v5 win boost mop classic', 'https://kdjlhibxxygfdmlvdfcl.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/game-images/arena-5v5-boost-1763151052028.webp', NULL, 'Arena 5v5 Boost', 'WoW MoP Arena 5v5 Boost | misti.services', NULL);
INSERT INTO public.products (id, name, slug, short_description, description, how_it_works, requirements, base_price, image_url, badge_text, trust_score, total_reviews, is_active, is_featured, sort_order, created_at, updated_at, category_id, is_slider_product, slider_config, is_manually_popular, total_sales, start_time_text, start_time_value, delivery_text, delivery_value, meta_description, meta_keywords, og_image, canonical_url, image_alt_text, meta_title, parent_link) VALUES ('923bb47a-49e7-4b86-becc-6dbdb343374b', 'Thrallmar', 'thrallmar', 'Skip the Hellfire Peninsula grind! Buy our Thrallmar Reputation Boost to unlock Heroic dungeon keys, BiS head enchants, and profession patterns.', '<h1><strong>Thrallmar Reputation Farm Boost – WoW TBC Classic</strong></h1><p>Looking to reach <strong>Exalted with </strong><a href="https://www.icy-veins.com/tbc-classic/thrallmar-reputation-and-rewards-guide" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank"><strong>Thrallmar</strong> </a>quickly and unlock your Hellfire Citadel Heroic attunement? <strong>Misti.Services</strong> offers a fast, secure, and professional <strong>Thrallmar Reputation Farm Boost</strong>, helping you obtain the <strong>Flamewrought Key</strong>, powerful pre-raid items, profession recipes, Helmet enchantments, and more — without spending weeks grinding quests and dungeons.</p><p>Our boosters efficiently complete all required dungeon runs in <strong>Hellfire Ramparts</strong>, <strong>The Blood Furnace</strong>, and <strong>The Shattered Halls</strong>, delivering guaranteed reputation gains from Neutral to Exalted.</p><h2><strong>Overview</strong></h2><p><strong>Thrallmar</strong> is the first Horde expedition basecamp players encounter upon entering Outland through the Dark Portal. Located in Hellfire Peninsula, it serves as the primary starting point for Horde adventurers and features numerous profession trainers, vendors, and questlines.</p><p>Thrallmar is also a reputation faction that Horde players can progress all the way to <strong>Exalted</strong>, unlocking valuable rewards, recipes, access to Heroic dungeons, and the highly sought-after Thrallmar Tabard.</p><h2><strong>Gaining Reputation</strong></h2><p>Players can increase Thrallmar reputation through a mix of questing and dungeon farming, with dungeon runs being the most efficient way to reach Exalted.</p><h3>Questing</h3><p>Completing all Thrallmar-related quests offers a significant initial boost. However, since the majority are one-time quests, questing alone isn’t enough to reach Exalted, necessitating dungeon farming to supplement your progress.</p><h3>Dungeon Farming</h3><p>Reputation farming continues in the three Hellfire Citadel dungeons:</p><ul><li><strong>Hellfire Ramparts</strong></li><li><strong>The Blood Furnace</strong></li><li><strong>The Shattered Halls</strong></li></ul><p>Normal Ramparts and Blood Furnace grant reputation up to <strong>Honored</strong>, while <strong>Heroic versions</strong> can be farmed all the way to <strong>Exalted</strong>.</p><p><strong>The Shattered Halls</strong>, available after completing the <em>Entry Into the Citadel</em> questline at level 68, gives reputation in both Normal and Heroic modes all the way to Exalted, making it the most efficient dungeon for maxing the faction.</p><h2><strong>Reputation Rewards</strong></h2><p>Thrallmar offers some of the most powerful pre-raid items in <em>The Burning Crusade Classic</em>, alongside an extremely powerful healing Helmet enchant and unique crafting patterns for:</p><ul><li>Enchanting</li><li>Jewelcrafting</li><li>Leatherworking</li><li>Alchemy</li><li>Blacksmithing</li></ul><p>To purchase these items, visit the Thrallmar Quartermaster: <strong>Quartermaster Urgronn</strong> — located right outside the Main Hall, west of the inn in Thrallmar.</p><p>Key Reputation RewardTier Unlocked<strong>Flamewrought Key</strong> (Heroic Dungeon Access)Honored<strong>Glyph of Renewal</strong> (Healing Head Enchant)ReveredFormula: Enchant Chest - Exceptional StatsReveredPattern: Nethercobra Leg ArmorExaltedEpic Weapons (Warbringer, Marksman''s Bow, Stormcaller)Exalted</p><h2><strong>Why Choose Our Thrallmar Reputation Boost</strong></h2><p>Misti.Services ensures a hassle-free experience with our experienced <em>TBC Classic</em> boosters, guaranteeing:</p><ul><li><strong>Quick Delivery:</strong> Fastest route planning ensures minimal time spent achieving Exalted.</li><li><strong>Secure Account Handling:</strong> We use trusted VPNs to secure your account during the piloted service.</li><li><strong>Professional and Efficient Farming:</strong> Guaranteed maximum reputation gains per hour through optimized dungeon runs (Ramparts, Blood Furnace, Shattered Halls).</li></ul><p>Your Thrallmar reputation will be increased quickly and securely with minimal downtime.</p><h3>Service Includes</h3><ul><li>Full Thrallmar reputation farm from your current standing up to <strong>Exalted</strong>.</li><li>Efficient dungeon runs in: <em>Hellfire Ramparts</em>, <em>The Blood Furnace</em>, and <em>The Shattered Halls</em>.</li><li>Unlocking the <strong>Flamewrought Key</strong> for Hellfire Citadel Heroic Dungeons.</li><li>Access to all Thrallmar rewards: powerful pre-raid gear, profession recipes, Helmet enchant, and more.</li><li>Chance to receive additional rare-quality loot suitable for your class and specialization.</li></ul><h3>Fastest Way to Reach Exalted With Thrallmar</h3><p>Achieving Exalted with Thrallmar unlocks essential pre-raid items and allows you to access Heroic versions of Hellfire Citadel dungeons. Manually farming this reputation requires dozens of dungeon runs and lengthy questlines. Our boosting team handles everything:</p><ul><li>Ramparts farming</li><li>Blood Furnace farming</li><li>Shattered Halls runs (Normal / Heroic)</li><li>Full completion of efficient rep routes</li></ul><p>Sit back and relax while our professional boosters bring your character to <strong>Exalted</strong>, unlocking every Thrallmar reward along the way.</p>', '<ul><li>Select your desired options and complete your order on&nbsp;Misti.Services.</li><li>You’ll receive an order confirmation and tracking number via email.</li><li>Our support manager will contact you through live chat to confirm all details.</li><li>If you’re unavailable, we’ll reach out via email or your preferred contact method.</li><li>When the boost is finished, you’ll receive a completion notification on Discord or another messenger of your choice.</li></ul>', '<ul><li>Level 70 character</li><li>Active WoW Subscription</li></ul>', 0, 'https://kdjlhibxxygfdmlvdfcl.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/game-images/61jw4qrryzg.webp', NULL, 4.9, 0, true, true, 0, '2025-11-19T07:49:50.281538+00:00', '2026-02-16T10:52:55.349958+00:00', '9464d1fe-6c00-412a-8ebb-896a4f575b4e', false, NULL, true, 0, '15 minutes', 'average start time', 'Flexible', 'order completion', 'Skip the Hellfire Peninsula grind! Buy our Thrallmar Reputation Boost to unlock Heroic dungeon keys, BiS head enchants, and profession patterns.', 'WoW TBC Reputation Boost, TBC Classic Rep Carry, WoW TBC Boosting Service, Horde Reputation Farm, Outland Reputation Carry, Thrallmar Exalted, Thrallmar Reputation Farm, Thrallmar Rep Boost Horde, Get Flamewrought Key, Hellfire Citadel Heroic Unlock, Thrallmar Quartermaster Rewards, Quartermaster Urgronn, Shattered Halls Rep Farm, Hellfire Ramparts Boost, Blood Furnace Carry, Entry Into the Citadel Questline, Glyph of Renewal Head Enchant, Formula: Enchant Chest - Exceptional Stats, Pattern: Nethercobra Leg Armor, Recipe: Transmute Skyfire Diamond, Buy Marksman''s Bow TBC, Thrallmar Warbringer sword, Thrallmar Exalted Items, How to get Thrallmar Exalted fast, Fastest way to get Flamewrought Key TBC, Can you farm Shattered Halls to Exalted?, How long does Thrallmar reputation take?', NULL, NULL, 'Thrallmar reputation wow', 'WoW TBC Thrallmar Rep Boost | misti.services', NULL);
