</strong></h2><ul><li><strong>Piloted:</strong> We play on your account to level Scrappy and complete the needed farming</li></ul><h2><strong>About Scrappy Leveling</strong></h2><p>Scrappy is a Workshop companion that periodically returns with materials during your playtime. <strong>Higher Scrappy levels improve both quantity and quality</strong> of what he brings back—making every session more profitable without extra effort from you.</p><h3><strong>Why leveling Scrappy matters</strong></h3><ul><li><strong>More materials over time:</strong> better passive output while you play</li><li><strong>Better materials:</strong> improved chance of useful crafting components</li><li><strong>More value from your time:</strong> topside minutes become more rewarding</li></ul><h2><strong>Why misti.services</strong></h2><ul><li><strong>Experienced Raiders</strong> with optimized farming routes</li><li><strong>Manual service only</strong> (no bots, no shortcuts)</li><li><strong>Clear progress updates</strong> and reliable completion standards</li></ul>', '<ul><li><strong>Choose your target Scrappy level</strong> and place an order.</li><li>We assign a Raider who knows the <strong>exact item sources and upgrade requirements</strong>.</li><li>We run <strong>focused loot routes</strong> to collect everything needed for Scrappy upgrades.</li><li>Your Scrappy level is increased to the selected tier, improving his passive material returns.</li><li>You get notified when the upgrade is complete.</li></ul>', '<ul><li>An ARC Raiders character with access to gameplay (topside sessions)</li></ul>', 1.99, 'https://kdjlhibxxygfdmlvdfcl.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/game-images/scrappy-the-rooster-leveling-boost-1766612085820.webp', NULL, 4.9, 0, true, true, 0, '2025-12-24T16:53:53.469712+00:00', '2026-01-04T18:07:17.6347+00:00', '1e289898-c4fe-4644-b067-e80319ab1b0f', true, '{"step":1,"end_label":"Desired Level","max_value":5,"min_value":1,"default_end":5,"start_label":"Current Level","default_start":1,"pricing_brackets":[{"end":5,"price":25,"start":1}],"estimated_time_per_step":0.05}', true, 0, '15 minutes', 'average start time', 'Flexible', 'order completion', 'Level up Scrappy the Rooster fast with a manual piloted boost. Improve Workshop passive materials while you play topside. Choose your target tier today.', 'arc raiders scrappy the rooster boost, scrappy the rooster leveling, arc raiders workshop companion, scrappy upgrade service, scrappy leveling boost, arc raiders passive materials, workshop materials farm, topside farming arc raiders, scrappy companion upgrade, arc raiders item farming, arc raiders material generation, scrappy tier upgrade, workshop resource boost, arc raiders crafting components, arc raiders loot runs, scrappy passive income, arc raiders workshop upgrades, scrappy materials return, arc raiders progression service, piloted boost arc raiders, manual boost service, safe piloted leveling, express priority boost, default priority boost, targeted loot routes, arc raiders resource farm help, scrappy upgrade items, arc raiders companion leveling, workshop rooster scrappy, scrappy better materials, scrappy more materials, arc raiders grinding help, arc raiders boosting service, misti services arc raiders, arc raiders workshop farming', 'https://kdjlhibxxygfdmlvdfcl.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/game-images/scrappy-the-rooster-leveling-boost-1766612085820.webp', NULL, 'Scrappy The Rooster Leveling Boost', 'ARC Raiders Scrappy the Rooster Boost | misti.services', NULL);
INSERT INTO public.products (id, name, slug, short_description, description, how_it_works, requirements, base_price, image_url, badge_text, trust_score, total_reviews, is_active, is_featured, sort_order, created_at, updated_at, category_id, is_slider_product, slider_config, is_manually_popular, total_sales, start_time_text, start_time_value, delivery_text, delivery_value, meta_description, meta_keywords, og_image, canonical_url, image_alt_text, meta_title, parent_link) VALUES ('194bd666-bd14-491f-9dd1-97380dd212b1', 'G-99 Breakneck ', 'g-99-breakneck', 'G-99 Breakneck is more than just another mount – it is the centerpiece of the D.R.I.V.E. system in Undermine. Once unlocked, this mount offers unmatched speed and a suite of tuning options that let you tailor its performance and appearance to your playstyle.', '<h1><strong>G-99 Breakneck Mount Boost</strong></h1><p>Take the streets of Undermine at full throttle while we handle the slow part for you.</p><p>G-99 Breakneck is a ground mount introduced in patch 11.1 during The War Within Season 2. It is designed to be the ultimate “street racer” mount in World of Warcraft, combining top-end speed with deep customization. With the D.R.I.V.E. system unlocked, G-99 can move several times faster than a normal ground mount and even edge ahead of Dragonriding’s top speed, making it the fastest ground mount currently available.</p><p>The downside? Unlocking it on your own means working through Goblin Cartel renown, reputation farming, and multiple systems tied to Undermine. That process can easily turn into a long, repetitive grind.</p><p>With misti.services, you can skip the busywork. Our boosters handle all the steps required to unlock D.R.I.V.E. and the G-99 Breakneck mount for you, so you can focus on enjoying the rush of speed instead of chasing renown bars.</p><h2><strong>Service Includes</strong></h2><p>When you purchase the G-99 Breakneck Mount Boost from misti.services, we take care of every requirement tied to this mount. The service includes:</p><ul><li><strong>Unlocking the D.R.I.V.E. system and G-99 Breakneck mount</strong>, so you can immediately start using your new ride.</li><li><strong>Boosting your Goblin Cartel renown level</strong> to the point required for the mount and related features.</li><li><strong>Access to additional cosmetics, transmogs, and valuable items</strong> obtained naturally while progressing the Cartel and D.R.I.V.E. system.</li><li><strong>All loot and gold earned during the boost</strong> kept on your account, with nothing withheld.</li><li><strong>Manual service only</strong>, with experienced human players completing every step by hand.</li></ul><h2><strong>How to Get the D.R.I.V.E. Mount?</strong></h2><p>G-99 Breakneck is more than just another mount – it is the centerpiece of the D.R.I.V.E. system in Undermine. Once unlocked, this mount offers unmatched speed and a suite of tuning options that let you tailor its performance and appearance to your playstyle.</p><p>The mount is obtained by working with the new Goblin Cartel faction in Undermine and progressing through their renown track. As you climb the ranks, you unlock:</p><ul><li>The <strong>D.R.I.V.E. system</strong> itself and the G-99 Breakneck mount.</li><li>A variety of <strong>performance customizations</strong>, such as handling, acceleration, and top speed tweaks.</li><li><strong>Visual customization options</strong>, including color schemes and style choices.</li><li>Potential <strong>future features</strong>, like a goblin companion riding along as part of your cartel crew.</li></ul><p>This level of personalization is a first for WoW mounts, which makes G-99 Breakneck a top priority for players who care about both speed and individuality.</p><p>To fully unlock it on your own, you need to:</p><ul><li>Progress the Undermine storyline to gain access to the Goblin Cartel.</li><li>Farm Cartel renown through daily and weekly activities, events, and other faction content.</li><li>Unlock D.R.I.V.E. and its upgrades by consistently investing time into the faction and its systems.</li></ul><p>For many players, that investment is more time than they can realistically spare. That’s where our boost steps in.</p><h2><strong>Additional Features and Details</strong></h2><p><strong>Racing in Undermine</strong></p><p> Undermine is built with high-speed racing in mind, and G-99 Breakneck is the perfect mount to take advantage of it. With D.R.I.V.E. unlocked, you can:</p><ul><li>Compete in <strong>timed racing challenges</strong> throughout Undermine’s streets.</li><li>Create <strong>custom races with friends</strong>, choosing your own landmarks and checkpoints.</li><li>Experience race routes designed specifically around G-99’s acceleration, handling, and raw speed.</li></ul><p>It turns Undermine into your personal racetrack and transforms mount travel into a full mini-game.</p><h2><strong>Limitations and Future Potential</strong></h2><p> At the moment, G-99 Breakneck is limited to ground travel and cannot fly. While developers have joked about inspirations from certain “future cars,” flying is not planned for this system right now. Even so, its unparalleled speed, handling, and tuning options make it a game-changer for ground-based content and city travel.</p><h2><strong>Conclusion</strong></h2><p> G-99 Breakneck is one of the most interesting mounts World of Warcraft has ever added: incredibly fast, highly customizable, and deeply integrated into Undermine’s systems. By working with the Goblin Cartel and the D.R.I.V.E. system, you gain a mount that feels like a true endgame toy.</p><p>If you would rather drive than grind, misti.services can bridge that gap. Our G-99 Breakneck Mount Boost service takes care of the renown, tasks, and unlock requirements, leaving you with WoW’s fastest ground mount ready to go.</p><h2><strong>Boost Options Explained</strong></h2><p>To deliver your G-99 Breakneck mount in the safest and most convenient way, we offer two execution methods:</p><ul><li><strong>Piloted:</strong></li><li> A professional booster logs into your account and completes all the required activities – Goblin Cartel renown farming, D.R.I.V.E. unlocks, and mount acquisition. We follow strict safety practices, including using VPNs aligned with your region when needed, to help keep your login activity looking natural.</li><li><strong>Remote Control:</strong></li><li> For maximum transparency and control, our booster connects to your PC via a secure remote app such as Parsec. They play using your own mouse and keyboard while you watch the gameplay live. Your login credentials never leave your hands, and you can monitor every step of the boost.</li></ul><p><br></p>', '<ul><li><strong>Place Order:</strong> Place your order for the WoW Xy Trustee''s Gearglider Mount Boost on our site.</li><li><strong>Contact:</strong> Our support manager will contact you asap via the website''s online chat to clarify all order details and scheduling.</li><li><strong>Assignment:</strong> We assign an experienced booster skilled in unlocking rare mounts efficiently.</li><li><strong>Completion:</strong> The booster completes all required steps to secure the Xy Trustee''s Gearglider mount for you.</li><li><strong>Enjoy:</strong> You receive confirmation once the mount is delivered to your account.</li></ul><p><br></p>', '<ul><li><strong>Level:</strong> Level 80 Character.</li><li><strong>Expansion:</strong> The War Within active.</li><li><strong>Account:</strong> Active World of Warcraft subscription.</li></ul><p><br></p>', 5.1, 'https://kdjlhibxxygfdmlvdfcl.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/game-images/g-99-breakneck-1764152319890.webp', NULL, 4.9, 0, true, true, 0, '2025-11-24T21:31:27.262622+00:00', '2025-12-16T07:22:34.314663+00:00', 'b4c0ccaf-a937-4b30-9ab4-7dacee8f739b', false, NULL, true, 0, '15 minutes', 'average start time', 'Flexible', 'order completion', 'G-99 Breakneck Mount Boost Take the streets of Undermine at full throttle while we handle the slow part for you.', 'g-99 breakneck mount, undermine d.r.i.v.e. system, g-99 breakneck unlock, undermine mount speed boost, g-99 breakneck tuning options, customize g-99 breakneck, buy g-99 breakneck, undermine g-99 mount, fast undermine mount, g-99 breakneck performance, d.r.i.v.e. system mount, undermine vehicle customization, g-99 breakneck appearance, unique undermine mount', 'https://kdjlhibxxygfdmlvdfcl.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/game-images/g-99-breakneck-1764152319890.webp', NULL, 'Game gaming service - G-99 Breakneck', 'War Within G-99 Breakneck Mount | misti.services', NULL);
