ndary Cloak Questline</strong> in <em>Mists of Pandaria Classic</em> is a multi-stage journey given by Wrathion, the Black Prince. It spans all five phases of the expansion, requiring raid completions, world boss kills, and reputation gains. Completing it grants a powerful cloak with unique visuals and class-specific effects.</p><h3>Legendary Cloak Effects by Role</h3><ul><li><strong>Tanks</strong> – Absorbs killing blows for survival</li><li><strong>Casters</strong> – Unleashes jade dragonflame AOE</li><li><strong>Healers</strong> – Converts overhealing into smart heals</li><li><strong>Agility DPS</strong> – Triggers a flurry attack for massive damage</li><li><strong>Strength DPS</strong> – Boosts melee burst power</li></ul><h3>Why Choose This Boost</h3><ul><li><strong>Fast Completion</strong> – Skip months of grind and get your cloak quickly</li><li><strong>Expert Boosters</strong> – Experienced raiders handle all mechanics and phases</li><li><strong>Safe and Secure</strong> – 100% manual service with account safety guaranteed</li><li><strong>All Rewards Included</strong> – Reputation, title, and legendary items delivered</li><li><strong>Regular Updates</strong> – Stay informed throughout your boost</li></ul><h3>Get Your Legendary Cloak Today</h3><p>Unlock the <strong>Legendary Cloak of Pandaria</strong> faster than ever with <strong>misti.services</strong>. Our professional team ensures full completion of this epic questline safely and efficiently — no grind, no stress, just guaranteed results.</p>', '<ul><li>Select your desired options and complete your order on&nbsp;Misti.Services.</li><li>You’ll receive an order confirmation and tracking number via email.</li><li>Our support manager will contact you through live chat to confirm all details.</li><li>If you’re unavailable, we’ll reach out via email or your preferred contact method.</li><li>When the boost is finished, you’ll receive a completion notification on Discord or another messenger of your choice.</li></ul><p><br></p>', '<ul><li>Active World of Warcraft subscription</li><li>Level 90 character</li></ul><p>Need help reaching level 90? Try our&nbsp;<a href="https://misti.services/game/wow-mistsofpandaria-classic" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank" style="color: rgb(60, 113, 221);">WoW Power Leveling Boost</a>&nbsp;</p>', 0, 'https://kdjlhibxxygfdmlvdfcl.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/game-images/legendary-cloak-1762690796732.webp', NULL, 4.9, 350, true, true, 0, '2025-11-01T04:59:58.60931+00:00', '2025-12-16T07:50:57.924233+00:00', 'af2a9cdb-9bf6-444c-b4e1-97ad8c383155', false, NULL, true, 0, '15 minutes', 'average start time', 'Flexible', 'order completion', 'Buy WoW MoP Classic Legendary Cloak Boost at misti.services. Get your full legendary cloak questline done fast, safely, and without endless grinding.', 'wow mop classic legendary cloak, buy legendary cloak mop classic, mop classic legendary cloak boost, fast mop cloak questline, safe wow mop legendary, no grind mop cloak, wow mop legendary cloak service, misti.services mop cloak, pandaria legendary cloak boost, mop full cloak quest, cheap mop legendary cloak, professional wow mop boost, mop classic gear upgrade, legendary cloak farming skip', 'https://kdjlhibxxygfdmlvdfcl.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/game-images/legendary-cloak-1762690796732.webp', NULL, 'Legendary Cloak', 'MoP Classic Legendary Cloak Boost | misti.services', NULL);
