evel 90? Try our&nbsp;<a href="https://misti.services/game/wow-mistsofpandaria-classic" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank" style="color: rgb(250, 250, 250);">WoW Power Leveling Boost</a>&nbsp;</p><p>Need help with gear? Try our&nbsp;<a href="https://misti.services/game/wow-mistsofpandaria-classic/gear/gear-boost" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank" style="color: rgb(250, 250, 250);">WoW Gear Boost</a></p>', 2399.96, 'https://kdjlhibxxygfdmlvdfcl.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/game-images/gladiator-boost-1763152123661.webp', NULL, 4.9, 350, true, true, 0, '2025-11-02T02:32:04.356897+00:00', '2025-12-16T07:51:28.302857+00:00', 'bccf784b-6919-4020-9a70-5da0b4c0119c', false, NULL, true, 0, '15 minutes', 'average start time', 'Flexible', 'order completion', 'Buy WoW Pandaria Classic Gladiator Boost at misti.services to earn the Gladiator title, mount, and elite PvP rewards quickly and securely.', 'wow pandaria classic gladiator boost, buy mop classic gladiator, pandaria classic gladiator title, mop classic gladiator mount, wow pandaria elite pvp rewards, fast mop classic gladiator, secure pandaria classic pvp boost, mop classic gladiator service, buy wow classic pvp rating, pandaria classic arena boost, cheap mop classic gladiator, professional wow classic pvp boost, gladiator title mop classic, elite pvp gear pandaria classic', 'https://kdjlhibxxygfdmlvdfcl.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/game-images/gladiator-boost-1763152123661.webp', NULL, 'Gladiator Boost', 'WoW MoP Classic Gladiator Boost | misti.services', NULL);
INSERT INTO public.products (id, name, slug, short_description, description, how_it_works, requirements, base_price, image_url, badge_text, trust_score, total_reviews, is_active, is_featured, sort_order, created_at, updated_at, category_id, is_slider_product, slider_config, is_manually_popular, total_sales, start_time_text, start_time_value, delivery_text, delivery_value, meta_description, meta_keywords, og_image, canonical_url, image_alt_text, meta_title, parent_link) VALUES ('0ef10f78-1361-4857-a55a-4a05f9a134aa', 'The Lorewalkers', 'the-lorewalkers', 'Get The Lorewalkers reputation boost in WoW Mists of Pandaria Classic fast and hassle-free with Misti Services.', '<h1><strong>The Lorewalkers Reputation Boost</strong></h1><p>Looking forward to World of Warcraft: Mists of Pandaria Classic but not to the grind for <a href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/guide/reputation/the-lorewalkers-quests-quartermaster-rewards" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank"><strong>The Lorewalkers</strong></a> reputation? Misti Services makes it easy. Our team helps you reach Exalted quickly so you can enjoy the rewards without the repetitive effort.</p><h3>How to Earn Reputation with The Lorewalkers</h3><p>The Lorewalkers faction in WoW Mists of Pandaria Classic is different from most factions. Instead of daily quests, players earn reputation by exploring Pandaria and collecting Lore Objects. You can begin the process early, but full engagement starts at level 90. The entire grind can be completed in a few hours with proper guidance.</p><h3>Completing the Lorewalkers Questline</h3><p>Start your journey by visiting Tan Shin Tiao, the Lorewalkers Quartermaster, at the Seat of Knowledge in the Vale of Eternal Blossoms. Pick up the quest <strong>“Your Private Collection”</strong> to unlock the ability to turn in Lore Objects. Completing this introduction ensures that all future turn-ins grant reputation.</p><h3>Collecting Lore Objects</h3><p>Lore Objects such as scrolls, books, and artifacts are scattered across Pandaria. Each item you collect and turn in grants a significant reputation boost. These items are found in various zones, including the Jade Forest, Valley of the Four Winds, Krasarang Wilds, Kun-Lai Summit, Townlong Steppes, Dread Wastes, and Vale of Eternal Blossoms.</p><p>Each zone features several objects tied to specific Pandaren stories. With a flying mount, the entire collection process can be finished in a single session. Using an online guide or coordinates can help locate all Lore Objects efficiently.</p><h3>Bonus Reputation from Quests</h3><p>After turning in Lore Objects, you can complete brief quests offered by Lorewalkers NPCs like Lorewalker Cho. These quests typically involve watching a short cinematic or dialogue sequence and provide additional reputation. Completing all of them contributes to achievements such as <strong>The Seven Burdens of Shaohao</strong>.</p><h3>Extra Reputation Sources</h3><p>Zandalari Warbringers and Warscouts across Pandaria occasionally drop <strong>Stolen Lorewalkers Insignia</strong>, which grants additional reputation when used. The <strong>Hozen Peace Pipe</strong>, dropped by the rare elite Scritch in Kun-Lai Summit, provides a one-time boost to all Pandaria faction reputations, including The Lorewalkers.</p><h3>Reputation Buffs</h3><p>Increase your reputation gains with temporary event buffs such as:</p><ul><li><strong>Darkmoon Faire – WHEE!</strong> (+10% reputation for 1 hour)</li><li><strong>Hallow’s End – Unburdened or Grim Visage</strong> (+10% for 2 hours)</li><li><strong>Pilgrim’s Bounty – Spirit of Sharing</strong> (+10% for 1 hour)</li></ul><p>Guild members also benefit from the <strong>Mr. Popularity</strong> perk, adding an extra 10% to all reputation gains.</p><h3>Lorewalkers Rewards</h3><p>Reputation with The Lorewalkers unlocks valuable rewards:</p><ul><li><strong>Honored:</strong> Access to profession patterns and archaeology-related items</li><li><strong>Revered:</strong> Additional crafting patterns and unique trinkets</li><li><strong>Exalted:</strong> Mount – <em>Disc of the Red Flying Cloud</em>, Lorewalkers Tabard, and more exclusive trinkets</li></ul><p>You’ll also earn achievements like <strong>Loremaster of Pandaria</strong>, <strong>The Seven Burdens of Shaohao</strong>, and <strong>Ballad of Liu Lang</strong>.</p>', '<ul><li>Select your desired options and complete your order on&nbsp;Misti.Services.</li><li>You’ll receive an order confirmation and tracking number via email.</li><li>Our support manager will contact you through live chat to confirm all details.</li><li>If you’re unavailable, we’ll reach out via email or your preferred contact method.</li><li>When the boost is finished, you’ll receive a completion notification on Discord or another messenger of your choice.</li></ul>', '<ul><li>Active World of Warcraft subscription</li><li>Level 90 character</li></ul><p>Need help reaching level 90? Try our&nbsp;<a href="https://misti.services/game/wow-mistsofpandaria-classic" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank" style="color: rgb(60, 113, 221);">WoW Power Leveling Boost</a>&nbsp;</p>', 0, 'https://kdjlhibxxygfdmlvdfcl.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/game-images/the-lorewalkers-1763234743800.webp', NULL, 4.9, 350, true, true, 0, '2025-11-02T20:26:28.259998+00:00', '2025-12-16T07:51:32.161584+00:00', 'eef98e08-1b65-4858-859f-5418bbab5fa2', false, NULL, true, 0, '15 minutes', 'average start time', 'Flexible', 'order completion', 'Get The Lorewalkers reputation boost in WoW Mists of Pandaria Classic fast and hassle-free with Misti Services.', 'lorewalkers rep boost, wow mop classic lorewalkers, mists of pandaria lorewalkers reputation, fast lorewalkers rep, buy lorewalkers reputation, mop classic lorewalkers farm, lorewalkers rep grind service, wow classic pandaria lorewalkers, misti services lorewalkers, secure lorewalkers boost, cheap lorewalkers rep boost, lorewalkers reputation farming, mop lorewalkers unlock, wow lorewalkers faction boost', 'https://kdjlhibxxygfdmlvdfcl.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/game-images/the-lorewalkers-1763234743800.webp', NULL, 'The Lorewalkers', 'WoW MoP Classic Lorewalkers Rep | misti.services', NULL);
