gh the objectives.</li><li><strong>Stream</strong> – Optionally watch the whole process live via stream for full transparency.</li></ul><h3><strong>About EFT Lightkeeper Quests</strong></h3><p>The <strong>Lightkeeper questline</strong> is the peak of Escape from Tarkov’s endgame – a long, expensive and punishing chain designed for the most dedicated players. It requires:</p><ul><li>Dozens of prerequisite quests from other traders</li><li>Extremely rare and pricey items, including special keys and encoded items</li><li>Surviving repeated runs to his heavily defended island on Lighthouse</li></ul><p>Our <strong>EFT Lightkeeper Quests Boost</strong> at misti.services is built to carry you through all of that with minimal risk and maximum value.</p><h3><strong>Why the Lightkeeper Quests Boost Matters</strong></h3><p>Unlocking Lightkeeper is one of the most prestigious milestones in Tarkov. With him unlocked, you gain:</p><ul><li>Access to unique barters and crafts unavailable anywhere else</li><li>A reliable source of high-tier gear, ammo and utilities</li><li>A huge advantage for the rest of the wipe in both PvP and economy</li></ul><p>Instead of burning weeks of time and millions of roubles, you let our pros handle the hardest part while you enjoy the payoff.</p><h3><strong>What You Get with Our Lightkeeper Boost</strong></h3><ul><li>Full Lightkeeper questline coverage, from early prerequisites to late-game tasks (according to your selection)</li><li>All required quest items handled by our team, saving you time and roubles</li><li>Guaranteed progression toward Lightkeeper; the boost is complete only when agreed quests are done and rewards collected</li><li>Extra loot and natural progression; you keep all gear, valuables and skill gains obtained during the raids</li></ul><h3><strong>Why Choose misti.services for Tarkov Boosting</strong></h3><ul><li>Tarkov veterans only – our boosters have deep knowledge of every quest route, extract and spawn</li><li>One hundred percent manual and secure service with no cheats or third-party tools</li><li>Fast communication via live chat or Discord so you always know the status of your order</li><li>Since 2013 in boosting, misti.services is built on years of experience completing the hardest content in online games, including Tarkov’s most brutal challenges</li></ul><p>Let us handle the Lightkeeper grind while you enjoy the power, rewards and prestige that come with unlocking Tarkov’s secretive in-raid trader.</p>', '<ul><li>Select the Lightkeeper quests you need and place your order on misti.services.</li><li>We assign an EFT veteran who knows every map, spawn and Lightkeeper requirement.</li><li>The booster completes the complex objectives, dangerous routes and item turn-ins.</li><li>Your selected quests are finished, progressing or fully unlocking Lightkeeper.</li><li>You receive a notification once the boost is done and the questline goals are achieved.</li><li>You enjoy Lightkeeper’s trades, gear and crafts for the rest of the wipe.</li></ul>', '<ul><li>Escape from Tarkov game account</li><li>Desired Lightkeeper quest(s) must be unlocked and available on your profile</li></ul>', 1.99, 'https://kdjlhibxxygfdmlvdfcl.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/game-images/eft-lightkeeper-quests-boost-1765924085976.webp', NULL, 4.9, 0, true, true, 0, '2025-12-10T17:59:19.926886+00:00', '2025-12-16T23:08:30.394679+00:00', 'ad312297-e28b-4185-8694-55f8078c94b1', false, NULL, true, 0, '15 minutes', 'average start time', 'Flexible', 'order completion', 'Skip Tarkov’s hardest grind with our EFT Lightkeeper Quests Boost on misti.services. Veterans unlock Lightkeeper, handle rare items and secure endgame rewards.', 'EFT Lightkeeper quests boost, Lightkeeper questline boost, Escape from Tarkov Lightkeeper, EFT endgame quests carry, Tarkov quest boost, EFT boosting service, misti.services Tarkov, Lightkeeper unlock service, EFT Lighthouse island carry, EFT Encoded V-Ex quest, Escape from Tarkov endgame boost, Tarkov trader unlock boost, EFT piloted boost, EFT selfplay boost, Lightkeeper access service, EFT secure quest boost, Tarkov professional boosters, Escape from Tarkov services, Lightkeeper tasks completion, EFT wipe progression boost, EFT rare items farm, Tarkov meta gear unlock, EFT high tier gear boost, Lightkeeper PMC carry, EFT questline completion, Tarkov exclusive trader unlock, EFT express boost, EFT normal boost, EFT stream boost, EFT Lighthouse quest boost, Escape from Tarkov gear carry, EFT late game progression, Tarkov hardcore quests help', 'https://kdjlhibxxygfdmlvdfcl.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/game-images/eft-lightkeeper-quests-boost-1765924085976.webp', NULL, 'Eft Lightkeeper Quests Boost', 'EFT Lightkeeper Quests Boost | misti.services', NULL);
INSERT INTO public.products (id, name, slug, short_description, description, how_it_works, requirements, base_price, image_url, badge_text, trust_score, total_reviews, is_active, is_featured, sort_order, created_at, updated_at, category_id, is_slider_product, slider_config, is_manually_popular, total_sales, start_time_text, start_time_value, delivery_text, delivery_value, meta_description, meta_keywords, og_image, canonical_url, image_alt_text, meta_title, parent_link) VALUES ('570804c3-3ff2-4326-b791-2339d538630b', 'The Scale of the Sands', 'the-scale-of-the-sands', 'The Scale of the Sands is a specialized sub-faction of the Keepers of Time, based entirely around the Battle for Mount Hyjal (Hyjal Summit) raid instance.', '<h1><strong>The Scale of the Sands Reputation Farm Boost – WoW TBC Classic</strong></h1><p>Ready to secure the Best-in-Slot <strong>Band of the Eternal</strong> rings and the game''s most powerful Jewelcrafting recipes without the weekly struggle of Hyjal Summit PUGs? Misti.Services offers a fast, secure, and professional <a href="https://www.icy-veins.com/tbc-classic/the-scale-of-the-sands-reputation-and-rewards-guide" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank"><strong>The Scale of the Sands </strong></a><strong>Reputation Farm Boost</strong>, handling the complex attunement and weekly raid clears for you.</p><p>Our expert raid teams execute efficient <strong>Battle for Mount Hyjal</strong> clears, managing the Vials of Eternity attunement and delivering guaranteed reputation gains from Neutral to Exalted.</p><h2><strong>Overview</strong></h2><p><strong>The Scale of the Sands</strong> is a specialized sub-faction of the Keepers of Time, based entirely around the <strong>Battle for Mount Hyjal (Hyjal Summit)</strong> raid instance (Phase 3). This reputation is mandatory for every serious raider, as it provides access to powerful, upgradable epic rings that are often Best-in-Slot for the remainder of the expansion.</p><p>Earning <strong>Exalted</strong> status with The Scale of the Sands provides access to:</p><ul><li><strong>Band of the Eternal Rings:</strong> A choice of four unique rings (Tank, Healer, Caster, Physical DPS) that upgrade in power at every reputation tier.</li><li><strong>Best-in-Slot Jewelcrafting Recipes:</strong> Essential patterns for cutting the highest quality epic gems.</li><li><strong>Unique Ammunition:</strong> Access to powerful arrows and bullets for Hunters.</li></ul><h2><strong>Gaining Reputation</strong></h2><p>Reputation with The Scale of the Sands is gained exclusively through raid progression. It requires a strict attunement followed by weekly farming of the Hyjal Summit instance.</p><h3><strong>1. Attunement: The Vials of Eternity</strong></h3><p>Before reputation farming can begin, access to the instance is required.</p><ul><li><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> You must complete both <strong>Serpentshrine Cavern</strong> and <strong>Tempest Keep</strong>.</li><li><strong>The Quest:</strong> We complete <em>The Vials of Eternity</em> quest, which immediately boosts your standing to <strong>Friendly</strong> and grants access to the raid.</li></ul><h3><strong>2. Hyjal Summit Raid Clears</strong></h3><p>Once inside, reputation is gained solely by killing enemies within the raid.</p><ul><li><strong>Mob Farming:</strong> Most trash mobs grant 12 reputation, while Frost Wyrms grant 60.</li><li><strong>Boss Kills:</strong> Each boss grants <strong>375 reputation</strong>.</li><li><strong>Archimonde:</strong> The final boss grants a massive <strong>1,500 reputation</strong> per kill.</li></ul><p>Our service maximizes these gains by ensuring a full clear of the instance every lockout, including the difficult Archimonde encounter.</p><h2><strong>Reputation Rewards</strong></h2><p>The primary reward for this faction is the <strong>Band of the Eternal</strong>, a ring chosen at <strong>Friendly</strong> that upgrades as you reach Honored, Revered, and Exalted.</p><h2><strong>Why Choose Our Scale of the Sands Boost</strong></h2><p>Farming Hyjal Summit requires a coordinated 25-man raid team capable of defeating Archimonde weekly. Relying on PUGs can result in missed lockouts and slow reputation progress. Misti.Services guarantees consistent results:</p><ul><li><strong>Guaranteed Archimonde Kills:</strong> We ensure the final boss is down every week for that massive 1,500 reputation bonus.</li><li><strong>Attunement Handling:</strong> If you haven''t finished the Vials of Eternity, we can help you clear the prerequisite SSC and TK raids.</li><li><strong>BiS Ring Guarantee:</strong> We ensure you reach the necessary reputation tiers to upgrade your <strong>Band of the Eternal</strong> to its maximum potential.</li></ul><h3><strong>Service Includes</strong></h3><ul><li>Full Scale of the Sands reputation farm from your current standing up to <strong>Exalted</strong>.</li><li>Completion of <strong>The Vials of Eternity</strong> attunement quest (if selected).</li><li>Weekly full clears of the <strong>Battle for Mount Hyjal</strong> raid.</li><li>Guaranteed upgrades for your <strong>Band of the Eternal</strong> ring at every tier.</li><li>Access to all Exalted Jewelcrafting and Ammunition rewards.</li></ul><p><strong>Upgrade your ring to legendary power levels! Order your Scale of the Sands Reputation Boost today.</strong></p>', '<ul><li>Select your desired options and complete your order on&nbsp;Misti.Services.</li><li>You’ll receive an order confirmation and tracking number via email.</li><li>Our support manager will contact you through live chat to confirm all details.</li><li>If you’re unavailable, we’ll reach out via email or your preferred contact method.</li><li>When the boost is finished, you’ll receive a completion notification on Discord or another messenger of your choice.</li></ul>', '<ul><li><strong>Level 70</strong></li><li><strong>Active WoW Subscription</strong></li><li><strong>Attuned to Serpentshrine Cavern</strong> and <strong>Tempest Keep</strong></li></ul>', 0, 'https://kdjlhibxxygfdmlvdfcl.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/game-images/the-scale-of-the-sands-1763847121727.webp', NULL, 4.9, 0, true, true, 0, '2025-11-20T12:27:49.845422+00:00', '2026-02-16T10:52:52.135256+00:00', '9464d1fe-6c00-412a-8ebb-896a4f575b4e', false, NULL, true, 0, '15 minutes', 'average start time', 'Flexible', 'order completion', 'Buy Scale of the Sands Exalted boost! Unlock the BiS Band of the Eternal rings, epic Jewelcrafting recipes, and Hyjal Summit access with weekly raid clears.', 'Scale of the Sands reputation boost, Hyjal Summit farm, Band of the Eternal ring, Vials of Eternity attunement, Battle for Mount Hyjal boost, Archimonde kill carry, TBC Phase 3 reputation, Jewelcrafting epic recipes', 'https://kdjlhibxxygfdmlvdfcl.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/game-images/the-scale-of-the-sands-1763847121727.webp', NULL, 'The Scale Of The Sands', 'WoW TBC Scale of the Sands Reputation | misti.services', NULL);
INSERT INTO public.products (id, name, slug, short_description, description, how_it_works, requirements, base_price, image_url, badge_text, trust_score, total_reviews, is_active, is_featured, sort_order, created_at, updated_at, category_id, is_slider_product, slider_config, is_manually_popular, total_sales, start_time_text, start_time_value, delivery_text, delivery_value, meta_description, meta_keywords, og_image, canonical_url, image_alt_text, meta_title, parent_link) VALUES ('492e6763-5aa9-4fc4-bc2c-675b7a1f7eb0', 'Heart of Fear', 'heart-of-fear', 'Defeat all bosses in Pandaria Classic Heart of Fear and earn rare gear, mounts, and achievements fast with misti.services.', '<h1><strong>WoW Pandaria Classic Heart of Fear Boost</strong></h1><h3>Conquer Pandaria’s Second Tier Fourteen Raid Effortlessly</h3><p>Buy the <strong>WoW Pandaria Classic </strong><a href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/guide/raids/heart-of-fear/overview" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank"><strong>Heart of Fear</strong></a><strong> Boost</strong> from <strong>misti.services</strong> and defeat one of Pandaria’s most challenging raids with ease. Our professional team will clear all bosses, secure high-level loot, and help you earn prestigious achievements and rewards without the stress of raiding with random groups.</p><p>The Heart of Fear is the second Tier Fourteen raid in <strong>World of Warcraft: Mists of Pandaria Classic</strong>, set deep within the Dread Wastes. Players must battle through the mantid empire and face the corrupted Grand Empress Shek’zeer. With our expert boosters, you’ll complete this raid efficiently, collect powerful gear, and progress toward the <strong>Glory of the Pandaria Raider</strong> meta-achievement for the <strong>Heavenly Crimson Cloud Serpent mount</strong>.</p><h3>What’s Included</h3><ul><li>Full <strong>Heart of Fear</strong> raid cleared on selected difficulty</li><li>Access to high-level loot from all six bosses</li><li>Normal and Heroic difficulty gear rewards</li><li>Raid achievements including <strong>Ahead of the Curve: Grand Empress Shek’zeer</strong> and <strong>Cutting Edge: Grand Empress Shek’zeer</strong></li><li>Guaranteed loot or loot priority options depending on your selection</li><li>Boss-related achievements and progression toward <strong>Glory of the Pandaria Raider</strong></li></ul><p>If there’s no available raiding team on your realm, we may suggest transferring your character to one of our active raid teams. We cover round-trip transfer costs with <strong>Mmonster coins</strong> to make the process smooth and secure.</p><h3>Boost Options</h3><p><strong>Piloted Boost</strong></p><p>A professional player securely logs into your character and completes the raid for you.</p><p><strong>Selfplay Boost</strong></p><p>Join our raiding team and participate directly in the raid alongside professionals.</p><p><strong>Remote Control Boost</strong></p><p>Our booster connects through a secure remote desktop app such as Parsec, allowing you to watch the entire raid live.</p><p><strong>Guaranteed Loot Option</strong></p><p>Choose a guaranteed number of item drops for your character.</p><p><strong>Loot Priority Option</strong></p><p>Receive all drops for your class and specialization during the run.</p><h3>About the Heart of Fear Raid</h3><p>The <strong>Heart of Fear</strong> is a massive hive complex located in the Dread Wastes. It serves as the home of the mantid empire and their corrupted queen, <strong>Grand Empress Shek’zeer</strong>, who has fallen under the influence of the <strong>Sha of Fear</strong>. Players must purge the corruption and defeat her to restore balance to Pandaria.</p><p>The raid features six bosses, each with unique mechanics and challenges that require teamwork and precision.</p><p><strong>Raid Boss Overview</strong></p><ul><li><strong>Imperial Vizier Zor''lok:</strong> Uses sound-based attacks that test player awareness and movement.</li><li><strong>Blade Lord Ta''yak:</strong> A fast and dangerous foe who commands wind and blade-based abilities.</li><li><strong>Garalon:</strong> A towering mantid whose pheromones and stomps demand coordination.</li><li><strong>Wind Lord Mel’jarak:</strong> Controls multiple adds that must be managed carefully during the fight.</li><li><strong>Amber-Shaper Un’sok:</strong> Transforms players into amber constructs that must be used strategically.</li><li><strong>Grand Empress Shek’zeer:</strong> The corrupted ruler and final boss who uses devastating shadow and sonic powers.</li></ul><h3>Loot and Achievements</h3><p>Each boss in Heart of Fear drops high-quality loot, weapons, and armor suited for various classes and roles. Completing the raid also advances progress toward <strong>Glory of the Pandaria Raider</strong>, which rewards the <strong>Reins of the Heavenly Crimson Cloud Serpent mount</strong>.</p><p>Our boosting service guarantees you get the rewards you’re after without hours of failed attempts or scheduling conflicts.</p><h3>Why Choose Misti Services</h3><ul><li>Fast and reliable Heart of Fear raid completion</li><li>Guaranteed gear and achievement unlocks</li><li>Secure and professional boosting by experienced raiders</li><li>Flexible scheduling that fits your playtime</li><li>Dedicated support throughout your order</li></ul><h3>Defeat the Grand Empress with Ease</h3><p>Skip the frustration of raid wipes and long gear grinds. With <strong>misti.services</strong>, you’ll conquer the <strong>Heart of Fear</strong> quickly and earn powerful loot, achievements, and rare rewards. Join hundreds of players who trust our professional boosting services and make your Pandaria Classic journey smoother than ever.</p>', '<ul><li>Select your desired options and complete your order on&nbsp;Misti.Services.</li><li>You’ll receive an order confirmation and tracking number via email.</li><li>Our support manager will contact you through live chat to confirm all details.</li><li>If you’re unavailable, we’ll reach out via email or your preferred contact method.</li><li>When the boost is finished, you’ll receive a completion notification on Discord or another messenger of your choice.</li></ul>', '<ul><li>Active World of Warcraft subscription</li><li>Level 90 character</li></ul><p>Need help reaching level 90? Try our&nbsp;<a href="https://misti.services/game/wow-mistsofpandaria-classic" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank" style="color: rgb(60, 113, 221);">WoW Power Leveling Boost</a>&nbsp;</p>', 0, 'https://kdjlhibxxygfdmlvdfcl.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/game-images/heart-of-fear-1763228636401.webp', NULL, 4.9, 350, true, true, 0, '2025-10-31T17:45:56.512716+00:00', '2025-12-16T07:51:00.526642+00:00', 'ce7082cb-9422-40a0-bda1-cd009133aeda', false, NULL, true, 0, '1 day', 'average start time', '7 days', 'order completion', 'Defeat all bosses in Pandaria Classic Heart of Fear and earn rare gear, mounts, and achievements fast with misti.services.', 'heart of fear boost, pandaria classic raid service, heart of fear carry, wow classic pandaria raid, heart of fear misti.services, pandaria classic gear farm, heart of fear achievement run, buy heart of fear boost, pandaria classic mount farm, heart of fear boss kill service, fast pandaria raid clear, heart of fear loot run, wow classic pandaria full clear, heart of fear glory run, cheap heart of fear boost', 'https://kdjlhibxxygfdmlvdfcl.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/game-images/heart-of-fear-1763228636401.webp', NULL, 'Heart Of Fear', 'WoW HoF Raid Boost - MoP Classic | misti.services', NULL);
INSERT INTO public.products (id, name, slug, short_description, description, how_it_works, requirements, base_price, image_url, badge_text, trust_score, total_reviews, is_active, is_featured, sort_order, created_at, updated_at, category_id, is_slider_product, slider_config, is_manually_popular, total_sales, start_time_text, start_time_value, delivery_text, delivery_value, meta_description, meta_keywords, og_image, canonical_url, image_alt_text, meta_title, parent_link) VALUES ('da557acb-1717-46f1-ab2e-674389ec3758', 'Honor Hold', 'honor-hold', 'Boost your Honor Hold reputation fast with our TBC Classic service. We handle all Ramparts, Blood Furnace, and Shattered Halls dungeon runs needed to reach Exalted and unlock the Flamewrought Key for Hellfire Citadel Heroics. Get top-tier pre-raid gear, profession recipes, and powerful enchants — quickly, safely, and professionally.', '<h1><strong>Honor Hold Reputation Farm Boost – WoW TBC Classic</strong></h1><p>Looking to reach Exalted with <a href="https://www.icy-veins.com/tbc-classic/honor-hold-reputation-and-rewards-guide" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">Honor Hold</a> quickly and unlock your Hellfire Citadel Heroic attunement? Misti.Services offers a fast, secure, and professional Honor Hold Reputation Farm Boost, helping you obtain the Flamewrought Key, powerful pre-raid items, profession recipes, Helmet enchantments, and more — without spending weeks grinding quests and dungeons.</p><p>Our boosters efficiently complete all required dungeon runs in Hellfire Ramparts, The Blood Furnace, and The Shattered Halls, delivering guaranteed reputation gains from Neutral to Exalted.</p><h1><strong>Overview</strong></h1><p>Honor Hold is the first Alliance questing hub players encounter upon entering Outland through the Dark Portal. Located in Hellfire Peninsula, it serves as the primary starting point for Alliance adventurers and features numerous profession trainers, vendors, and questlines.</p><p>Honor Hold is also a reputation faction that Alliance players can progress all the way to Exalted, unlocking valuable rewards, recipes, and access to Heroic dungeons.</p><h1><strong>Gaining Reputation</strong></h1><p>Players can increase Honor Hold reputation through a mix of questing and dungeon farming, with dungeon runs being the most efficient way to reach Exalted.</p><h3><strong>Questing</strong></h3><p>Completing all Honor Hold–related quests provides approximately 11,000 reputation. Since the majority are one-time quests, questing alone isn’t enough to reach Exalted.</p><h3><strong>Dungeon Farming</strong></h3><p>Reputation farming continues in the three Hellfire Citadel dungeons:</p><ul><li><strong>Hellfire Ramparts</strong></li><li><strong>The Blood Furnace</strong></li><li><strong>The Shattered Halls</strong></li></ul><p>Normal Ramparts and Blood Furnace grant reputation up to Honored, while Heroic versions can be farmed all the way to Exalted.</p><p>The Shattered Halls, available after completing the <em>Entry Into the Citadel</em> questline at level 68, gives reputation in both Normal and Heroic modes all the way to Exalted, making it the most efficient dungeon for maxing the faction.</p><h1><strong>Reputation Rewards</strong></h1><p>Honor Hold offers some of the best pre-raid items in The Burning Crusade Classic, alongside an extremely powerful healing Helmet enchant, multiple profession recipes, and unique crafting patterns for:</p><ul><li>Enchanting</li><li>Jewelcrafting</li><li>Leatherworking</li><li>Alchemy</li><li>Blacksmithing</li></ul><p>To purchase these items, visit the Honor Hold Quartermaster:</p><p><strong>Logistics Officer Ulrike</strong> — located inside the walls of Honor Hold near the northeastern exit.</p><h1><strong>Why Choose Our Honor Hold Reputation Boost</strong></h1><p>Misti.Services has been a trusted boosting provider since 2013, supporting thousands of players across EU and US regions. With our experienced TBC Classic boosters, you get:</p><ul><li>Quick delivery</li><li>Safe account handling</li><li>Professional and efficient dungeon clearing</li></ul><p>Your Honor Hold reputation will be increased quickly and securely with minimal downtime.</p><h1><strong>Service Includes</strong></h1><ul><li>Full Honor Hold reputation farm from your current standing up to <strong>Exalted</strong></li><li>Efficient dungeon runs in:</li><li><strong>Hellfire Ramparts, The Blood Furnace, The Shattered Halls</strong></li><li>Unlocking the <strong>Flamewrought Key</strong> for Hellfire Citadel Heroic Dungeons</li><li>Access to Honor Hold rewards: powerful pre-raid gear, profession recipes, Helmet enchant, patterns, and more</li><li>Chance to receive additional rare-quality loot suitable for your class and specialization</li><li>Account access handled securely by trusted Misti.Services boosters</li></ul><h1><strong>Fastest Way to Reach Exalted With Honor Hold</strong></h1><p>The Honor Hold faction plays a central role in your early Burning Crusade Classic progression. Achieving Exalted unlocks important pre-raid items and allows you to access Heroic versions of Hellfire Citadel dungeons.</p><p>Manually farming this reputation requires dozens of dungeon runs and lengthy questlines. Our boosting team handles everything:</p><ul><li>Ramparts farming</li><li>Blood Furnace farming</li><li>Shattered Halls runs (Normal / Heroic)</li><li>Full completion of efficient rep routes</li></ul><p>Sit back and relax while our professional boosters bring your character to Exalted, unlocking every Honor Hold reward along the way.</p>', '<ul><li>Select your desired options and complete your order on&nbsp;Misti.Services.</li><li>You’ll receive an order confirmation and tracking number via email.</li><li>Our support manager will contact you through live chat to confirm all details.</li><li>If you’re unavailable, we’ll reach out via email or your preferred contact method.</li><li>When the boost is finished, you’ll receive a completion notification on Discord or another messenger of your choice.</li></ul>', '<ul><li>Level 70 character</li><li>Active WoW Subscription</li></ul>', 0, 'https://kdjlhibxxygfdmlvdfcl.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/game-images/honor-hold-1763239988970.webp', NULL, 4.9, 0, true, true, 0, '2025-11-15T20:45:36.610418+00:00', '2026-02-16T10:52:55.559213+00:00', '9464d1fe-6c00-412a-8ebb-896a4f575b4e', false, NULL, true, 0, '15 minutes', 'average start time', 'Flexible', 'order completion', 'Buy Honor Hold Reputation Boost in WoW TBC Classic. Fast Exalted farm, Flamewrought Key unlock, Shattered Halls runs, and top pre-raid rewards. Safe & professional.', 'Honor Hold reputation boost, Honor Hold rep farm, WoW TBC Honor Hold, Honor Hold exalted fast, Flamewrought Key boost, Hellfire Citadel rep farm, Shattered Halls reputation, Alliance reputation boost TBC, WoW Burning Crusade rep service, Honor Hold reputation guide, Honor Hold exalted service, Ramparts rep farm, Blood Furnace rep farm, TBC Classic boosting, Misti Services WoW boost', 'https://kdjlhibxxygfdmlvdfcl.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/game-images/honor-hold-1763239988970.webp', NULL, 'Honor Hold', 'WoW TBC Honor Hold Rep Boost | misti.services', NULL);
INSERT INTO public.products (id, name, slug, short_description, description, how_it_works, requirements, base_price, image_url, badge_text, trust_score, total_reviews, is_active, is_featured, sort_order, created_at, updated_at, category_id, is_slider_product, slider_config, is_manually_popular, total_sales, start_time_text, start_time_value, delivery_text, delivery_value, meta_description, meta_keywords, og_image, canonical_url, image_alt_text, meta_title, parent_link) VALUES ('9691f18a-f7dd-4dab-a8d9-212be4b9faa1', 'Challenge Mode', 'challenge-mode', 'Achieve Gold in WoW Pandaria Classic Challenge Modes fast. Unlock exclusive transmog, mounts, and titles with safe, professional boosting.', '<h1><strong>WoW Pandaria Classic Challenge Mode Boost</strong></h1><h3>Conquer Challenge Modes and Unlock Exclusive Rewards</h3><p>Buy the <strong>WoW Pandaria Classic </strong><a href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/guide/dungeons/challenge-modes-overview" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank"><strong>Challenge Mode</strong></a> <strong>Boost</strong> from Misti Services to complete all Challenge Mode dungeons and earn exclusive Gold rewards. Our expert team will handle every run efficiently, ensuring you secure the highest rating and all unique cosmetic and achievement rewards without the grind.</p><p>Challenge Modes in Mists of Pandaria Classic feature timed five-player dungeons with normalized gear, focusing purely on skill, teamwork, and precision. Completing all nine dungeons within the Gold time limits grants access to class-specific transmog sets, rare mounts, and prestigious titles.</p><h3>What’s Included</h3><ul><li>Completion of selected Pandaria Challenge Mode dungeons</li><li>Guaranteed Gold, Silver, or Bronze rating based on your choice</li><li>Full completion of all nine Challenge Mode dungeons for Gold rewards</li><li>Achievement progress for each completed dungeon</li><li>Teleports to finished dungeons</li><li>Access to exclusive class transmog sets, titles, and mounts</li></ul><h3>Boost Options</h3><p><strong>Piloted Boost</strong></p><p>Our professional booster securely logs into your character and completes all Challenge Mode dungeons on your behalf.</p><p><strong>Selfplay Boost</strong></p><p>Join our experienced team and participate in the runs yourself. Our players will guide you through every step to ensure success.</p><p><strong>Remote Control Boost</strong></p><p>Our booster connects securely via a remote control app such as Parsec, allowing you to watch all in-game actions live as your character completes the Challenge Modes.</p><h3>About WoW Pandaria Classic Challenge Modes</h3><p>Challenge Modes are designed to test coordination, speed, and mastery of your class. All gear is normalized, meaning every player competes on equal footing. Success depends entirely on teamwork, strategy, and execution.</p><p>The available dungeons include Temple of the Jade Serpent, Stormstout Brewery, Shado-Pan Monastery, Gate of the Setting Sun, Mogu’shan Palace, Siege of Niuzao Temple, Scarlet Halls, Scarlet Monastery, and Scholomance. Completing these dungeons under time pressure rewards Bronze, Silver, or Gold medals, with Gold offering the most exclusive rewards.</p><h3>Rewards for Gold Completion</h3><p>Players who earn Gold across all Challenge Mode dungeons receive class-specific transmog sets with unique visual effects, such as demonic wings for warlocks or flaming totems for shamans. You can also earn exclusive mounts, teleports to each dungeon, and the prestigious “The Undaunted” title.</p><h3>Why Players Choose Challenge Modes</h3><p>Challenge Modes provide one of the most exciting and skill-based activities in Mists of Pandaria Classic. They test player coordination, timing, and execution while offering visually stunning rewards and recognition for top performance.</p><h3>Why Choose Misti Services</h3><p><strong>Guaranteed Gold Completion</strong> – Our experienced team ensures all Challenge Modes are completed efficiently.</p><p><strong>Exclusive Rewards</strong> – Unlock unique transmog sets, mounts, and titles without the stress of timed runs.</p><p><strong>Safe and Secure</strong> – Your account and data are always protected throughout the process.</p><p><strong>Flexible Options</strong> – Choose piloted, selfplay, or remote control boosting to match your preference.</p><p><strong>Professional Support</strong> – Dedicated assistance from start to finish for a smooth and transparent experience.</p>', '<ul><li>Select your desired options and complete your order on&nbsp;Misti.Services.</li><li>You’ll receive an order confirmation and tracking number via email.</li><li>Our support manager will contact you through live chat to confirm all details.</li><li>If you’re unavailable, we’ll reach out via email or your preferred contact method.</li><li>When the boost is finished, you’ll receive a completion notification on Discord or another messenger of your choice.</li></ul>', '<ul><li>Active World of Warcraft subscription</li><li>Level 90 character</li></ul><p><span style="background-color: rgba(23, 32, 48, 0.9);">Need help reaching level 90? Try our&nbsp;</span><a href="https://misti.services/game/wow-mistsofpandaria-classic" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank" style="background-color: rgba(23, 32, 48, 0.9); color: rgb(60, 113, 221);">WoW Power Leveling Boost</a><span style="background-color: rgba(23, 32, 48, 0.9);">&nbsp;</span></p>', 0, 'https://kdjlhibxxygfdmlvdfcl.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/game-images/challenge-mode-1762548513684.webp', NULL, 4.9, 350, true, true, 0, '2025-10-31T14:58:53.89725+00:00', '2025-12-16T07:51:03.231147+00:00', 'cfe09cfd-59e3-467e-bbcd-f3b0373cdc84', false, NULL, true, 0, '1 hour', 'average start time', '3 hours', 'per 1 challenge', 'Achieve Gold in WoW Pandaria Classic Challenge Modes fast. Unlock exclusive transmog, mounts, and titles with safe, professional boosting.', 'challenge mode gold wow pandaria classic, wow pandaria classic challenge mode boost, buy pandaria classic challenge mode, pandaria classic transmog unlock, pandaria classic mounts boost, pandaria classic titles boost, safe wow challenge mode boost, professional wow challenge mode service, fast pandaria classic gold challenge, wow pandaria classic challenge mode carry, achieve gold challenge mode wow, pandaria classic exclusive rewards, mop classic challenge mode boost, buy mop classic challenge mode gold', 'https://kdjlhibxxygfdmlvdfcl.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/game-images/challenge-mode-1762548513684.webp', NULL, 'Challenge Mode', 'WoW MoP Challenge Mode Gold Boost | misti.services', NULL);
