ep: The Eye, acquiring this magnificent phoenix signifies mastery over one of TBC''s most challenging boss encounters. Unlike later expansions, the TBC Classic environment demands a fully coordinated raid group for Kael''thas, making the Ashes of Al''ar a genuinely rare and powerful possession, also providing critical 310% flying speed for unparalleled efficiency across Outland.</p><h3>Why Choose Our Service</h3><ul><li><p><strong>Dedicated Teams:</strong> Our specialists focus solely on Ashes of Al''ar farm runs, ensuring efficiency.</p></li><li><p><strong>Consistent Schedules:</strong> Benefit from reliable weekly raid attempts to maximize your chances.</p></li><li><p><strong>Player-Focused:</strong> We prioritize your swift acquisition of the mount, avoiding unnecessary boss clears.</p></li><li><p><strong>Experienced Boosters:</strong> Rely on our Kael''thas experts for smooth and effective raid execution.</p></li><li><p><strong>Long-Term Guarantee:</strong> We commit to weekly runs until the coveted Ashes of Al''ar becomes yours.</p></li></ul><p>Achieve the pinnacle of TBC Classic mount collecting with misti.services. Our commitment to excellence ensures a seamless and successful journey towards owning the Ashes of Al''ar.</p>', '<ul><li><p>Select your preferred region: EU or US.</p></li><li><p>Choose your service type: Piloted (we play your character) or Selfplay (you join our team).</p></li><li><p>Our professional team will schedule and perform weekly Kael''thas Sunstrider raids.</p></li><li><p>Continue weekly runs until the Ashes of Al''ar drops for your character.</p></li><li><p>Once obtained, the legendary 310% flying mount is yours to command.</p></li></ul><p></p>', '<ul>
