ete Zul''Aman within a strict time limit. Owning the War Bear signifies mastery of one of TBC''s most demanding DPS and mechanical encounters, making it a visible badge of honor. As a limited-era collectible, its value and prestige will only grow before the transition to Wrath of the Lich King Classic.</p><h3>Why Choose Our Service</h3><ul><li><p><strong>Expert ZA Teams:</strong> Our professional players are highly experienced in Zul''Aman speed runs and optimizing routes.</p></li><li><p><strong>Consistent Availability:</strong> We offer regular weekly ZA Bear Runs to ensure timely mount acquisition.</p></li><li><p><strong>Proven Success Rate:</strong> Our teams boast high success rates in beating the Zul''Aman timer.</p></li><li><p><strong>Flexible Options:</strong> Choose between playing yourself (Selfplay) or account sharing (Piloted) for convenience.</p></li><li><p><strong>Region Support:</strong> Services available for both EU and US servers.</p></li></ul><p>Let misti.services help you add this legendary mount to your collection. Purchase your TBC Classic Amani War Bear boost today and stand out in Azeroth.</p>', '<ul><li><p><strong>Select Options:</strong> Choose your region (EU or US), desired play mode (Piloted or Selfplay), and preferred completion speed.</p></li><li><p><strong>Secure Your Order:</strong> Complete your purchase through our secure platform.</p></li><li><p><strong>Coordination:</strong> Our team will contact you promptly via Discord to arrange the Zul''Aman run schedule.</p></li><li><p><strong>Raid Completion:</strong> Our expert team will perform a timed Zul''Aman clear.</p></li><li><p><strong>Mount Delivery:</strong> Upon successful completion of the timed event, the Amani War Bear will be awarded from the final tribute chest.</p></li></ul><p></p>', '<ul>
