etails.</li><li>If you’re unavailable, we’ll reach out via email or your preferred contact method.</li><li>When the boost is finished, you’ll receive a completion notification on Discord or another messenger of your choice.</li></ul>', '<ul><li>Active World of Warcraft subscription</li><li>Level 90 character</li></ul><p>Need help reaching level 90? Try our&nbsp;<a href="https://misti.services/game/wow-mistsofpandaria-classic" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank" style="color: rgb(60, 113, 221);">WoW Power Leveling Boost</a>&nbsp;</p>', 359.88, 'https://kdjlhibxxygfdmlvdfcl.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/game-images/glorious-tyranny-boost-1762696166281.webp', NULL, 4.9, 350, true, true, 0, '2025-11-02T01:24:37.547114+00:00', '2025-12-16T07:51:04.113344+00:00', 'bccf784b-6919-4020-9a70-5da0b4c0119c', false, NULL, true, 0, '15 minutes', 'average start time', 'Flexible', 'order completion', 'Buy WoW MoP Glorious Tyranny Boost at misti.services to unlock the elite PvP enchant and 2200 arena rating quickly, safely, and efficiently.', 'glorious tyranny boost, wow mop glorious tyranny, mop elite pvp enchant, 2200 arena rating boost, mists of pandaria pvp carry, wow mop enchant unlock, buy glorious tyranny, fast wow arena rating, safe mop pvp boost, efficient wow mop carry, glorious tyranny service, mists of pandaria 2200 rating', 'https://kdjlhibxxygfdmlvdfcl.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/game-images/glorious-tyranny-boost-1762696166281.webp', NULL, 'Glorious Tyranny Boost', 'WoW MoP Glorious Tyranny Boost | misti.services', NULL);
INSERT INTO public.products (id, name, slug, short_description, description, how_it_works, requirements, base_price, image_url, badge_text, trust_score, total_reviews, is_active, is_featured, sort_order, created_at, updated_at, category_id, is_slider_product, slider_config, is_manually_popular, total_sales, start_time_text, start_time_value, delivery_text, delivery_value, meta_description, meta_keywords, og_image, canonical_url, image_alt_text, meta_title, parent_link) VALUES ('0538bef4-3fd6-415a-814b-4a052ba7284c', 'The Tillers', 'the-tillers', 'Boost your Tillers reputation fast in WoW Mists of Pandaria Classic with Misti Services and unlock farm upgrades, mounts, and rewards.', '<h1><strong>The Tillers Reputation Boost</strong></h1><p><a href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/guide/reputation/the-tillers-quests-quartermaster-rewards" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank"><strong>The Tillers</strong></a> are a hardworking farming community in the Valley of the Four Winds, devoted to cultivating the land and celebrating Pandaren agriculture. Gaining their favor unlocks unique mounts, profession recipes, and a personal farm at Halfhill. With Misti Services, you can reach Exalted with The Tillers quickly and skip the daily farming grind.</p><h3>How to Earn Reputation with The Tillers</h3><p>Reputation with The Tillers in World of Warcraft: Mists of Pandaria Classic is earned by completing daily farming and cooking quests around Halfhill Market. Players plant crops, harvest vegetables, and help the local farmers improve their land.</p><p>In addition to daily quests, players can grow specific crops that yield reputation tokens and items for individual Tillers NPCs. Building friendships with these NPCs also provides extra rewards and customizations for your personal farm.</p><h3>Unlocking The Tillers Dailies</h3><p>To begin, travel to Halfhill in the Valley of the Four Winds and speak with <strong>Farmer Yoon</strong> at the Sunsong Ranch. Completing the introductory questline unlocks your first farm plots and access to The Tillers’ daily quests.</p><p>As you gain reputation, additional farm plots become available, allowing you to plant more crops, earn more items, and increase your standing with The Tillers faster. You can also interact with other farmers around Halfhill to unlock personal friendship reputations.</p><h3>Friendship Reputation System</h3><p>In addition to the main Tillers faction reputation, each farmer in Halfhill has their own friendship level. You can earn their trust by giving them favorite crops and completing personal quests. Reaching maximum friendship with all Tillers NPCs provides cosmetic upgrades for your farm and special vanity items.</p><h3>Reputation Boosting Tips</h3><p>Earning reputation with The Tillers can be made faster by using temporary buffs and event bonuses:</p><ul><li><strong>Darkmoon Faire – WHEE!</strong> (+10% reputation for 1 hour)</li><li><strong>Hallow’s End – Unburdened or Grim Visage</strong> (+10% for 2 hours)</li><li><strong>Pilgrim’s Bounty – Spirit of Sharing</strong> (+10% for 1 hour)</li><li><strong>Guild Perk – Mr. Popularity</strong> (+10% reputation bonus)</li></ul><p>Planting crops that yield rare materials or gifts also helps build reputation with specific Tillers faster, reducing the grind time significantly.</p><h3>The Tillers Rewards</h3><p>The Tillers reward dedicated farmers with a range of valuable and cosmetic items:</p><ul><li><strong>Honored:</strong> Access to new seeds, farming tools, and cooking ingredients</li><li><strong>Revered:</strong> Profession recipes, cooking supplies, and expanded farm plots</li><li><strong>Exalted:</strong> The <em>Reins of the Great Red Dragon Turtle</em> mount, full farm upgrades, and unique achievements</li></ul><p>Reaching Exalted with The Tillers also unlocks a fully upgraded Sunsong Ranch, serving as your personal farming base in Pandaria.</p><h3>Why Choose Misti Services for Your Tillers Boost</h3><p>Misti Services offers a fast, safe, and professional way to earn reputation with The Tillers in WoW Mists of Pandaria Classic. Our expert boosters handle all farming, daily quests, and reputation tasks, ensuring you reach Exalted efficiently. Enjoy all the rewards of Pandaria’s premier farming faction—without the grind.</p>', '<ul><li>Select your desired options and complete your order on&nbsp;Misti.Services.</li><li>You’ll receive an order confirmation and tracking number via email.</li><li>Our support manager will contact you through live chat to confirm all details.</li><li>If you’re unavailable, we’ll reach out via email or your preferred contact method.</li><li>When the boost is finished, you’ll receive a completion notification on Discord or another messenger of your choice.</li></ul>', '<ul><li>Active World of Warcraft subscription</li><li>Level 90 character</li></ul><p>Need help reaching level 90? Try our&nbsp;<a href="https://misti.services/game/wow-mistsofpandaria-classic" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank" style="color: rgb(60, 113, 221);">WoW Power Leveling Boost</a>&nbsp;</p>', 0, 'https://kdjlhibxxygfdmlvdfcl.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/game-images/the-tillers-1763238804043.webp', NULL, 4.9, 350, true, true, 0, '2025-11-02T20:48:15.026489+00:00', '2025-12-16T07:51:35.976445+00:00', 'eef98e08-1b65-4858-859f-5418bbab5fa2', false, NULL, true, 0, '15 minutes', 'average start time', 'Flexible', 'order completion', 'Boost your Tillers reputation fast in WoW Mists of Pandaria Classic with Misti Services and unlock farm upgrades, mounts, and rewards.', 'tillers reputation boost, wow mists of pandaria classic tillers, mists of pandaria tillers farm, fast tillers rep, buy tillers reputation, mop classic tillers rewards, tillers farm upgrades unlock, wow mop classic mounts, tillers reputation service, misti services tillers, mop classic tillers guide, cheap tillers boost', 'https://kdjlhibxxygfdmlvdfcl.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/game-images/the-tillers-1763238804043.webp', NULL, 'The Tillers', 'WoW MoP Tillers Rep Boost | misti.services', NULL);
