 messenger of your choice.</li></ul>', '<ul><li>Active Diablo 4 account.</li><li>Character at appropriate level and build to access Torment I or higher.</li></ul><p>Need help leveling? Check our&nbsp;<a href="https://misti.services/game/buy-diablo-iv-boost/leveling" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank" style="color: rgb(250, 250, 250);">Diablo IV Leveling Boost</a></p>', 0, 'https://kdjlhibxxygfdmlvdfcl.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/game-images/glyph-leveling-1762814267089.webp', NULL, 4.9, 350, true, true, 0, '2025-11-05T01:57:26.098107+00:00', '2025-12-16T00:24:57.122451+00:00', 'd69ac67d-532d-4d2e-aa92-e326579125b8', true, '{"step":20,"end_label":"Desired Level","max_value":100,"min_value":0,"default_end":20,"start_label":"Current Level","default_start":0,"pricing_brackets":[{"end":40,"price":8.58,"start":0},{"end":80,"price":10.34,"start":41},{"end":100,"price":19.14,"start":81}],"estimated_time_per_step":0.2}', true, 0, '15 minutes', 'average start time', 'Flexible', 'order completion', 'Boost your Diablo 4 Glyphs fast and unlock full Paragon power. Safe, manual leveling by Misti Services—no grind, just results.', 'diablo 4 glyph leveling service, d4 glyph power boost, buy diablo 4 glyph levels, fast d4 glyph upgrade, manual diablo 4 glyph leveling, misti services d4 glyphs, unlock d4 paragon power, safe diablo 4 glyph boost, cheap d4 glyph leveling, professional diablo 4 glyph service, no grind d4 glyphs, diablo 4 glyph rank up, max d4 glyph levels, d4 glyph experience farm', 'https://kdjlhibxxygfdmlvdfcl.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/game-images/glyph-leveling-1762814267089.webp', NULL, 'Glyph Leveling', 'Diablo 4 Glyph Leveling - Fast & Safe | misti.services', NULL);
