 number via email.</li><li>Our support manager will contact you through live chat to confirm all details.</li><li>If you’re unavailable, we’ll reach out via email or your preferred contact method.</li><li>When the boost is finished, you’ll receive a completion notification on Discord or another messenger of your choice.</li></ul>', '<ul><li>Active Diablo 4 account.</li><li>Character at appropriate level and build to access Torment I or higher.</li></ul><p>Need help leveling? Check our&nbsp;<a href="https://misti.services/game/buy-diablo-iv-boost/leveling" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank" style="color: rgb(250, 250, 250);">Diablo IV Leveling Boost</a></p>', 5.72, 'https://kdjlhibxxygfdmlvdfcl.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/game-images/gospel-of-the-devotee-9709-1762725725154.webp', NULL, 4.9, 350, true, true, 0, '2025-11-04T04:46:45.673702+00:00', '2025-12-16T00:24:57.974723+00:00', '1661c892-50ee-4f2c-8d96-f31f6e81c787', false, NULL, true, 0, '15 minutes', 'average start time', 'Flexible', 'order completion', 'Buy Diablo 4 Gospel of the Devotee from Misti.Services to boost your Necromancer with enhanced Basic Skills, faster attacks, and safe instant delivery.', 'diablo 4 gospel of the devotee, buy d4 devotee, necromancer basic skill boost, diablo 4 faster attack speed, gospel of the devotee instant delivery, d4 necromancer unique amulet, buy d4 necro amulet, devotee amulet misti.services, diablo 4 necromancer build, gospel of the devotee price, necromancer enhanced basic skills, d4 unique item delivery, buy diablo 4 unique amulet', 'https://kdjlhibxxygfdmlvdfcl.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/game-images/gospel-of-the-devotee-9709-1762725725154.webp', NULL, 'Gospel Of The Devotee 9709', 'Diablo 4 Gospel of the Devotee | misti.services', NULL);
INSERT INTO public.products (id, name, slug, short_description, description, how_it_works, requirements, base_price, image_url, badge_text, trust_score, total_reviews, is_active, is_featured, sort_order, created_at, updated_at, category_id, is_slider_product, slider_config, is_manually_popular, total_sales, start_time_text, start_time_value, delivery_text, delivery_value, meta_description, meta_keywords, og_image, canonical_url, image_alt_text, meta_title, parent_link) VALUES ('c403358d-a790-479e-b7d1-15844225da81', 'Pandaren Ambassador', 'pandaren-ambassador', 'Get the WoW Pandaria Classic Pandaren Ambassador boost to reach Exalted with all Pandaren factions and unlock the prestigious title and mount.', '<h1><strong>Pandaren Ambassador Boost</strong></h1><p>The <strong>WoW Pandaria Classic </strong><a href="https://www.wowhead.com/achievement=6828/pandaren-ambassador" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank"><strong>Pandaren Ambassador</strong></a><strong> Boost</strong> helps players earn the highly respected Pandaren Ambassador achievement in <em>World of Warcraft: Mists of Pandaria Classic</em>. This achievement requires reaching Exalted reputation with all Pandaren factions, proving your dedication and mastery of Pandaria’s world.</p><p>At <strong>misti.services</strong>, our professional boosters will handle the entire reputation grind, helping you achieve Exalted status across every required faction quickly and efficiently. You’ll unlock the Pandaren Ambassador title, earn the Pandaren Kite mount, and collect many exclusive faction rewards—all without the time-consuming grind.</p><h3>What’s Included</h3><p>This boost includes:</p><ul><li>The Pandaren Ambassador achievement or specific parts of it</li><li>The Pandaren Kite String flying mount</li><li>Exalted reputation with all major Pandaria factions</li><li>Achievement points and exclusive rewards including mounts, transmogs, pets, toys, and valuable items</li></ul><h3>About the Pandaren Ambassador Achievement</h3><p>The Pandaren Ambassador achievement is a symbol of prestige in <em>WoW Pandaria Classic</em>. To earn it, players must reach Exalted reputation with key factions across Pandaria, including the Golden Lotus, The August Celestials, The Klaxxi, The Shado-Pan, The Anglers, The Tillers, The Lorewalkers, The Order of the Cloud Serpent, and either the Tushui Pandaren or Huojin Pandaren, depending on faction alignment.</p><p>Each of these groups has its own lore, challenges, and daily tasks. From protecting the Vale of Eternal Blossoms with the Golden Lotus to training flying serpents with the Order of the Cloud Serpent, these reputations showcase the diversity and depth of Pandaria’s world.</p><h3>Benefits of the Pandaren Ambassador Boost</h3><p>Choosing <strong>misti.services</strong> for your Pandaren Ambassador boost provides:</p><ul><li>A guaranteed Exalted reputation with all Pandaren factions</li><li>Access to rare rewards, including the Pandaren Kite mount</li><li>A faster, hassle-free way to complete one of WoW’s most time-consuming achievements</li><li>Progress toward larger reputation goals and meta achievements</li><li>A deeper connection to Pandaria’s lore and world-building</li></ul><h3>Why Choose misti.services</h3><p>Our expert team delivers fast, secure, and reliable boosting services. We value your account’s safety and your time, providing transparent communication and professional gameplay assistance. Whether you’re looking to complete achievements, unlock mounts, or explore Pandaria’s rich storylines, we ensure you get the results you deserve.</p>', '<ul><li>Select your desired options and complete your order on&nbsp;Misti.Services.</li><li>You’ll receive an order confirmation and tracking number via email.</li><li>Our support manager will contact you through live chat to confirm all details.</li><li>If you’re unavailable, we’ll reach out via email or your preferred contact method.</li><li>When the boost is finished, you’ll receive a completion notification on Discord or another messenger of your choice.</li></ul>', '<ul><li>Active World of Warcraft subscription</li><li>Level 90 character</li></ul><p>Need help reaching level 90? Try our&nbsp;<a href="https://misti.services/game/wow-mistsofpandaria-classic" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank" style="color: rgb(60, 113, 221);">WoW Power Leveling Boost</a>&nbsp;</p>', 0, 'https://kdjlhibxxygfdmlvdfcl.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/game-images/pandaren-ambassador-1763231990253.webp', NULL, 4.9, 350, true, true, 0, '2025-11-02T22:19:55.635563+00:00', '2025-12-16T07:51:13.378629+00:00', 'eef98e08-1b65-4858-859f-5418bbab5fa2', false, NULL, true, 0, '15 minutes', 'average start time', 'Flexible', 'order completion', 'Get the WoW Pandaria Classic Pandaren Ambassador boost to reach Exalted with all Pandaren factions and unlock the prestigious title and mount.', 'pandaren ambassador boost, wow pandaria classic pandaren ambassador, exalted pandaren factions, pandaria classic ambassador title, pandaria ambassador mount unlock, buy pandaren ambassador boost, fast pandaren ambassador service, cheap pandaren ambassador wow, pandaria classic reputation boost, wow pandaren factions exalted, pandaren ambassador title boost, pandaria classic mount unlock service, professional pandaren ambassador boost', 'https://kdjlhibxxygfdmlvdfcl.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/game-images/pandaren-ambassador-1763231990253.webp', NULL, 'Pandaren Ambassador', 'WoW Pandaren Ambassador Boost | misti.services', NULL);
INSERT INTO public.products (id, name, slug, short_description, description, how_it_works, requirements, base_price, image_url, badge_text, trust_score, total_reviews, is_active, is_featured, sort_order, created_at, updated_at, category_id, is_slider_product, slider_config, is_manually_popular, total_sales, start_time_text, start_time_value, delivery_text, delivery_value, meta_description, meta_keywords, og_image, canonical_url, image_alt_text, meta_title, parent_link) VALUES ('2cdb211d-2957-404f-8cf3-cdc89d7680d5', 'Siege of Orgrimmar', 'siege-of-orgrimmar', 'Complete Siege of Orgrimmar fast with misti.services. Earn heroic loot, titles, and mounts safely with our professional WoW Pandaria Classic boost.', '<h1><strong>WoW Pandaria Classic Siege of Orgrimmar Boost</strong></h1><h2>Conquer Garrosh Hellscream and Earn Epic Rewards</h2><p>Buy the <strong>WoW Pandaria Classic Siege of Orgrimmar Boost</strong> at <strong>misti.services</strong> to complete the final Tier 16 raid in <em>Mists of Pandaria Classic</em> quickly and efficiently. Our expert raiding team will clear all bosses, unlock top achievements, and secure powerful rewards including the <strong>Kor’kron War Wolf</strong> mount and <strong>Hellscream’s Downfall</strong> title.</p><p>Skip the grind, save time, and enjoy a safe, fast, and guaranteed boost experience.</p><h3>What’s Included</h3><ul><li>Full <a href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/zone=6738/siege-of-orgrimmar" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank"><strong>Siege of Orgrimmar </strong></a>raid clear on selected difficulty</li><li><strong>553+ ilvl gear</strong> from Normal and <strong>566+ ilvl gear</strong> from Heroic</li><li>Chance for <strong>Warforged gear</strong> with higher item levels</li><li>All <strong>14 bosses</strong> defeated, including <strong>Garrosh Hellscream</strong></li><li><strong>Ahead of the Curve</strong> or <strong>Cutting Edge</strong> Garrosh achievements</li><li><strong>Reins of the Kor’kron War Wolf</strong> mount included</li><li>Optional <strong>Kor’kron Juggernaut</strong> mount available</li><li>Boss-related achievements and Feats of Strength unlocked</li><li><strong>Hellscream’s Downfall</strong> title earned on Heroic clear</li></ul><h3>Boost Options</h3><p><strong>Piloted Boost</strong> – Our professional player securely logs into your account and completes the raid for you.</p><p><strong>Selfplay Boost</strong> – Join our raiding team and play your character during the boost.</p><p><strong>Remote Control Boost</strong> – Watch the boost live as our player securely controls your character using a remote connection.</p><p><strong>Guaranteed Loot Option</strong> – Choose how many guaranteed drops you wish to receive.</p><p><strong>Loot Priority Run</strong> – Receive all gear drops suited for your class and specialization.</p><h3>About the Siege of Orgrimmar Raid</h3><p>The <strong>Siege of Orgrimmar</strong> marks the epic conclusion of <em>Mists of Pandaria Classic</em>. Players face <strong>Garrosh Hellscream</strong>, the corrupted Warchief who seeks to dominate Azeroth using the power of the Old Gods. The raid features <strong>14 bosses</strong> across diverse environments, from the <strong>Vale of Eternal Blossoms</strong> to the fiery depths of <strong>Ragefire Chasm</strong>.</p><p>It’s a large-scale, story-rich raid filled with powerful enemies, intense mechanics, and legendary rewards.</p><h3>Tier 16 Gear and Legendary Loot</h3><p>The <strong>Siege of Orgrimmar</strong> offers some of the most powerful rewards in Pandaria Classic, including <strong>Tier 16 class sets</strong> that grant valuable performance bonuses. The raid also features rare and sought-after trinkets such as:</p><ul><li><strong>Thok’s Tail Tip</strong> – top-tier DPS trinket</li><li><strong>Nazgrim’s Burnished Insignia</strong> – strong mana regeneration for healers</li><li><strong>Purified Bindings of Immerseus</strong> – excellent for casters</li></ul><p>Heroic mode offers even higher item levels and exclusive Warforged versions of gear, providing the best progression path in the expansion.</p><h3>Rare Mounts, Pets, and Achievements</h3><p>Defeating <strong>Garrosh Hellscream</strong> on Heroic difficulty rewards the rare <strong>Kor’kron War Wolf</strong> mount, a symbol of prestige among Pandaria raiders. Players can also unlock the <strong>Kor’kron Juggernaut</strong> as an optional reward.</p><p>Several bosses drop collectible <strong>battle pets</strong>, including <strong>Gooey Sha-ling</strong>, <strong>Droplet of Y’Shaarj</strong>, and <strong>Blackfuse Bombling</strong>. Completing the raid also contributes to the <strong>Glory of the Orgrimmar Raider</strong> meta-achievement, unlocking even more titles and rewards.</p><h3>Why Choose misti.services</h3><ul><li>Fast, efficient, and fully manual raid boosting</li><li>Secure and confidential service — no bots or automation</li><li>Experienced professional teams with proven expertise</li><li>Guaranteed achievements, gear, and mounts</li><li>Real-time communication and support throughout your order</li></ul><h3>Why You Should Try the Siege of Orgrimmar Boost</h3><ul><li>Complete all 14 bosses quickly and safely</li><li>Collect powerful Tier 16 class gear</li><li>Secure rare mounts, pets, and achievements</li><li>Earn the Kor’kron War Wolf and Hellscream’s Downfall title</li><li>Skip raid organization stress and enjoy guaranteed results</li></ul><h3>Claim Victory in the Siege of Orgrimmar</h3><p>Experience the final battle of <em>Mists of Pandaria Classic</em> with <strong>misti.services</strong>. Defeat Garrosh Hellscream, earn your <strong>Kor’kron War Wolf</strong>, and collect heroic gear — all without the grind.</p><p>Order your <strong>WoW Pandaria Classic Siege of Orgrimmar Boost</strong> today and enjoy fast, safe, and professional results.</p>', '<ul><li>Select your desired options and complete your order on&nbsp;Misti.Services.</li><li>You’ll receive an order confirmation and tracking number via email.</li><li>Our support manager will contact you through live chat to confirm all details.</li><li>If you’re unavailable, we’ll reach out via email or your preferred contact method.</li><li>When the boost is finished, you’ll receive a completion notification on Discord or another messenger of your choice.</li></ul><p><br></p>', '<ul><li>Active World of Warcraft subscription</li><li>Level 90 character</li></ul><p>Need help reaching level 90? Try our&nbsp;<a href="https://misti.services/game/wow-mistsofpandaria-classic" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank" style="color: rgb(60, 113, 221);">WoW Power Leveling Boost</a>&nbsp;</p>', 0, 'https://kdjlhibxxygfdmlvdfcl.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/game-images/siege-of-orgrimmar-1763229180794.webp', NULL, 4.9, 350, true, true, 0, '2025-10-31T18:35:16.901003+00:00', '2025-12-16T07:51:14.313422+00:00', 'ce7082cb-9422-40a0-bda1-cd009133aeda', false, NULL, true, 0, '1 day', 'average start time', '7 days', 'order completion', 'Complete Siege of Orgrimmar fast with misti.services. Earn heroic loot, titles, and mounts safely with our professional WoW Pandaria Classic boost.', 'siege of orgrimmar boost, wow pandaria classic soo, siege of orgrimmar heroic loot, soo title boost, pandaria classic mount carry, wow soo raid service, buy siege of orgrimmar boost, fast soo clear, professional wow pandaria boost, soo heroic carry, mists of pandaria raid boost, siege of orgrimmar achievements, wow classic soo run, pandaria classic raid completion', 'https://kdjlhibxxygfdmlvdfcl.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/game-images/siege-of-orgrimmar-1763229180794.webp', NULL, 'Siege Of Orgrimmar', 'WoW SoO Raid Boost - Classic MoP | misti.services', NULL);
