i>All extracted loot, quest items, and progress kept on your account</li></ul><h2><strong>Boost Options Explained</strong></h2><ul><li><strong>Piloted</strong> – A professional Tarkov player logs into your account and completes Customs raids on your PMC, focusing on your chosen goals (quests, Reshala, loot, or general progression).</li><li><strong>Selfplay</strong> – You play on your account as part of our team. Our booster leads the way, calls out enemies, and helps you survive fights while you stay in full control of your character.</li><li><strong>Stream</strong> – You can request the service to be streamed so you can watch each raid live, learn routes, angles, and how to handle key areas like Dorms and Stronghold.</li></ul><h2><strong>About EFT Customs Raid Boost</strong></h2><p>Customs is a core part of Tarkov’s progression:</p><ul><li>It hosts a large number of <strong>early and mid-game quests</strong></li><li>It is full of <strong>PvP hotspots</strong> like the three-story and two-story Dorms, the river crossings, and Stronghold</li><li>It attracts both new players and geared veterans, making every raid unpredictable</li></ul><p>The <strong>Customs Raid Boost</strong> from misti.services is designed to help you:</p><ul><li>Get through critical quest chains without endless trial and error</li><li>Survive PvP-heavy areas long enough to complete your tasks</li><li>Learn safer routes and smart ways to approach high-conflict zones</li></ul><p>Instead of repeatedly losing gear and progress, you benefit from the experience of someone who already knows the map in depth.</p><h3><strong>Common Objectives on the Customs Map</strong></h3><p>With our service, we can help you achieve:</p><ul><li><strong>Surviving PvP Hotspots</strong></li><li>We guide you through or help you dominate the most dangerous zones on Customs, especially the three-story and two-story Dorms where many quests and fights take place.</li><li><strong>Hunting Reshala</strong></li><li>We assist in locating and eliminating the Scav boss Reshala and his four guards, securing his Golden TT pistol, key loot, and other valuable rewards you may need for quests or your collection.</li><li><strong>Completing Key Quests</strong></li><li>Many early and mid-game tasks from traders send you repeatedly to Customs. Our pros can help you safely complete item stashes, kills, and survival requirements.</li></ul><h3><strong>Why Choose misti.services for Customs?</strong></h3><ul><li><strong>Customs Experts</strong> – Our boosters know every spawn point, angle, and flank route on this classic map, from Warehouse and Construction to Dorms and Stronghold.</li><li><strong>Flexible Playstyles</strong> – Choose piloted for maximum convenience or selfplay to learn alongside an expert while still benefiting from strong backup.</li><li><strong>100% Manual and Secure</strong> – All services are performed by hand with a strong focus on account safety and privacy.</li><li><strong>Responsive Support</strong> – Our support team is available to help you plan your Customs progression and keep you updated on your order.</li><li><strong>Proven Progression Help</strong> – misti.services has helped thousands of players push through the crucial early and mid-game segments tied to Customs.</li></ul><p>With the <strong>Escape from Tarkov Customs Raid Boost</strong> from misti.services, you turn Tarkov’s most iconic battleground from a frustrating roadblock into a reliable source of quest progress, loot, and confidence.</p>', '<ul><li><strong>Select Your Customs Options</strong></li><li>Choose between piloted or selfplay, define your goals (quests, Reshala hunts, PvP practice, loot runs), select your desired priority and streaming options, and place your order on misti.services.</li><li><strong>We Assign a Customs Specialist</strong></li><li>A Tarkov veteran who has mastered Customs’ chokepoints and hot spots is assigned to your order and reviews your current account status and objectives.</li><li><strong>Guided or Piloted Customs Raids</strong></li><li class="ql-indent-1">In <strong>piloted</strong> mode, the booster runs raids on your PMC, tackling Dorms, Stronghold, and other high-traffic areas while completing your quests or boss hunts.</li><li class="ql-indent-1">In <strong>selfplay</strong>, you join them in a squad, following their lead through the most dangerous zones while they handle the hardest engagements.</li><li><strong>Raids Completed, Loot Extracted</strong></li><li>Reshala kills, quest objectives, and valuable loot are prioritized based on your order details. All successful extractions stay on your account.</li><li><strong>Notification and Handover</strong></li><li>When your agreed raids or objectives are completed, you are notified. You log in to find your Customs progression advanced, your stash richer, and the map far less intimidating.</li></ul>', '<ul><li>Escape from Tarkov purchased and installed on your account</li><li>For piloted service: login details so our booster can play on your PMC</li><li>Enough stash space for weapons, loot, and quest items gained during the runs</li></ul>', 9, 'https://kdjlhibxxygfdmlvdfcl.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/game-images/escape-from-tarkov-customs-raid-boost-1765385074879.webp', NULL, 4.9, 0, true, true, 0, '2025-12-08T21:41:29.496813+00:00', '2025-12-16T00:26:57.789047+00:00', '13095953-1c23-4cc6-9101-986220a1c75e', true, '{"step":1,"max_value":10,"min_value":1,"slider_type":"single","value_label":"Number of Runs","default_value":5,"pricing_brackets":[{"end":10,"price":0,"start":1}],"estimated_time_per_step":0}', true, 0, '15 minutes', 'average start time', 'Flexible', 'order completion', 'Survive Customs with a professional Escape from Tarkov raid boost from misti.services. Complete early quests, farm PvP hotspots, and hunt Reshala safely!', 'escape from tarkov customs, tarkov customs raid boost, eft customs carry, tarkov customs map boost, customs early quest help, eft dorms pvp boost, tarkov dorms fights, hunt reshala boost, eft reshala carry, tarkov reshala quest help, customs stronghold loot, tarkov early game quests, eft mid game quests customs, tarkov pvp hotspot boost, customs three story dorms, customs two story dorms, tarkov new player help, eft customs learning service, customs map progression, escape from tarkov raid carry, tarkov selfplay customs boost, tarkov piloted customs boost, eft stream customs runs, customs raid completion service, tarkov secure loot extraction, eft eu customs boost, eft us customs boost, safe tarkov boosting service, cheap customs raid boost, best tarkov customs carry, misti services tarkov customs, tarkov xp farm customs, customs pmc kill farm, eft kappa prep customs, tarkov choke point domination, customs boss and loot runs, escape from tarkov boosting services, customs early wipe progression, tarkov questline carry customs', 'https://kdjlhibxxygfdmlvdfcl.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/game-images/escape-from-tarkov-customs-raid-boost-1765385074879.webp', NULL, 'Escape From Tarkov Customs Raid Boost', 'EFT Customs Raid Boost - Fast & Safe | misti.services', NULL);
