used hunts for the boss Kaban</li><li>Guidance through high-value areas, locked rooms, and profitable buildings</li><li>A fast and secure service designed to help you survive the most complex map in Tarkov</li><li>All extracted loot and rewards kept on your account</li></ul><h2><strong>Boost Options Explained</strong></h2><ul><li><strong>Piloted</strong> – A professional Tarkov player logs into your account and completes Streets of Tarkov raids on your PMC, focusing on your chosen goals (loot runs, Kaban hunts, quests, or XP farming).</li><li><strong>Selfplay</strong> – You join our booster as part of the same squad. They lead you through the city, handle the most dangerous engagements, and guide you to your objectives while you stay in full control of your character.</li><li><strong>Stream</strong> – If requested, the service can be livestreamed so you can watch every raid, learn routes, angles, and BTR usage, and see exactly how your loot and objectives are secured.</li></ul><h2><strong>About EFT Streets of Tarkov Raid Boost</strong></h2><p>Streets of Tarkov is a massive urban labyrinth that pushes both map knowledge and mechanical skill to the limit:</p><ul><li>Multi-level buildings, balconies, courtyards, and underground routes create constant danger from every angle</li><li>Kaban and his guards, plus heavily geared PMCs, turn certain areas into deadly killzones</li><li>High-value loot is spread across offices, stores, apartments, and locked rooms throughout the city</li></ul><p>The <strong>Streets of Tarkov Raid Boost</strong> from misti.services is built to help you:</p><ul><li>Survive in one of the most chaotic and complex environments in Tarkov</li><li>Complete quests that send you deep into the heart of the city</li><li>Secure high-value loot and keys buried in dangerous locations</li><li>Learn safe paths, strong positions, and smart rotations if you choose selfplay</li></ul><p>Instead of spending wipe after wipe trying to learn Streets by trial and error, you leverage the experience of someone who already knows every corner.</p><h3><strong>Challenges on Streets of Tarkov</strong></h3><p>We can help you overcome the toughest parts of this map, including:</p><ul><li><strong>Navigating the Urban Maze</strong></li><li> Our boosters know every shortcut, ambush spot, rooftop angle, and underground passage. Whether you need quick routes to objectives or safer rotations between hot zones, they guide you efficiently and safely.</li><li><strong>Hunting the Boss Kaban</strong></li><li> Streets is home to the boss Kaban at the Lexos dealership. We assist in locating, engaging, and eliminating Kaban and his guards so you can secure their valuable loot and complete related tasks.</li><li><strong>Farming the Best Loot</strong></li><li> Streets is rich with rare keys, valuables, and high-tier items hidden in its many locked rooms and buildings. We prioritize profitable routes and high-value locations to maximize your returns.</li><li><strong>Using the BTR</strong></li><li> The armored BTR vehicle is a unique feature of Streets, offering mobile fire support, safer transport, and stashing options. Our pros show you when and how to use it effectively as part of your runs.</li></ul><h3><strong>What You Get with Our Streets of Tarkov Boost</strong></h3><ul><li><strong>Your Objective Completed</strong> – Whether you want a specific quest done, a boss kill, or a loot-focused run, we build the service around your goals.</li><li><strong>Expert Guidance</strong> – In selfplay, you gain first-hand experience running with a Streets expert who explains routes, positions, and tactics.</li><li><strong>High Survival Rate</strong> – Our players specialize in urban combat and know how to reduce unnecessary risks while keeping raids profitable.</li><li><strong>All Loot is Yours</strong> – Every valuable item discovered and extracted during the boost stays on your account.</li></ul><h3><strong>Why Choose misti.services for Streets of Tarkov?</strong></h3><ul><li><strong>Map Specialists</strong> – Our boosters are Streets experts who know the best routes, power positions, and risk-reward spots across the entire city.</li><li><strong>Secure Piloted and Selfplay Options</strong> – Choose the experience that suits you best, with all services performed manually and with your account’s safety as a priority.</li><li><strong>24/7 Live Support</strong> – Our team is always ready to help you plan your Streets objectives and update you on order progress.</li><li><strong>Proven Track Record</strong> – misti.services has a strong reputation for mastering the newest and most complex content in Escape from Tarkov.</li></ul><p>With the <strong>Escape from Tarkov Streets of Tarkov Raid Boost</strong> from misti.services, you turn the game’s biggest and most complex map into a controlled, profitable, and genuinely enjoyable experience instead of an overwhelming urban nightmare.</p><p><br></p>', '<ul><li><strong>Select Your Streets Options</strong></li><li>Choose piloted or selfplay, define your goals (Kaban kills, PvP practice, loot runs, quests, or BTR usage), pick your priority and optional streaming, then place your order on misti.services.</li><li><strong>We Assign a Streets of Tarkov Specialist</strong></li><li>A Tarkov PRO who has mastered Streets’ multi-level layout, underground routes, and combat hotspots is assigned to your order and reviews your current progress and objectives.</li><li><strong>Guided or Piloted City Raids</strong></li><li class="ql-indent-1">In <strong>piloted</strong> mode, the booster runs raids on your PMC, moving efficiently through key locations, triggering fights on their terms, and securing high-value loot.</li><li class="ql-indent-1">In <strong>selfplay</strong>, you follow their lead as they navigate streets, interiors, rooftops, and underground passages while managing PvP threats and guiding you to your objectives.</li><li><strong>Objectives and Loot Secured</strong></li><li>Boss hunts, quests, rare key farms, BTR uses, and profit runs are completed according to your order. All extracted items and progress stay on your account.</li><li><strong>Notification and Handover</strong></li><li>Once your requested raids or objectives are completed, you are notified. You log in to a richer stash, more completed tasks, and a far better understanding of the city.</li></ul><p><br></p>', '<ul><li>Escape from Tarkov purchased and accessible on your account</li><li>For piloted service: login details so our booster can play on your PMC</li><li>Enough stash space to store valuable items, keys, and gear obtained during the runs</li></ul><p><br></p>', 9, 'https://kdjlhibxxygfdmlvdfcl.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/game-images/escape-from-tarkov-streets-of-tarkov-raid-boost-1765387059112.webp', NULL, 4.9, 0, true, true, 0, '2025-12-08T21:58:23.339916+00:00', '2025-12-16T00:26:56.149977+00:00', '13095953-1c23-4cc6-9101-986220a1c75e', true, '{"step":1,"max_value":10,"min_value":1,"slider_type":"single","value_label":"Number of Runs","default_value":5,"pricing_brackets":[{"end":10,"price":0,"start":1}],"estimated_time_per_step":0}', true, 0, '15 minutes', 'average start time', 'Flexible', 'order completion', 'Conquer Streets of Tarkov with a professional raid boost from misti.services. Farm high-value loot, hunt Kaban, complete quests, and survive intense urban PvP!', 'escape from tarkov streets of tarkov, tarkov streets raid boost, eft streets carry, streets of tarkov map boost, tarkov city map boost, hunt kaban boost, eft kaban boss carry, tarkov kaban quest help, streets high xp pvp, tarkov streets loot farm, streets rare keys farming, tarkov btr support, eft btr extraction help, streets urban warfare boost, tarkov city center raids, streets lexos dealership boss, escape from tarkov raid carry, tarkov selfplay streets boost, tarkov piloted streets boost, eft stream streets runs, streets raid completion service, tarkov secure loot extraction, eft eu streets boost, eft us