mpletion (approx. <strong>3 hours</strong> per 500 badges).</li></ul><h2><strong>Boost Options</strong></h2><p>We offer two secure ways to complete your service:</p><ul><li><strong>Piloted (Account Sharing):</strong> Our professional player logs into your account using a <strong>VPN matching your country</strong> to ensure maximum safety. They grind the dungeons while you are away.</li><li><strong>Remote Control (Selfplay Alternative):</strong> For maximum security, our booster connects to your PC via a secure app like <strong>Parsec</strong>. They play using your mouse and keyboard while you watch the screen. No account sharing is required.</li></ul><h2><strong>Why Farm Timewarped Badges?</strong></h2><p><strong>Timewarped Badges</strong> are the universal currency for Timewalking events. You can only earn them during specific event weeks, and they are the only way to purchase exclusive rewards from event vendors.</p><p>However, a typical dungeon run only drops <strong>40-50 badges</strong>. To buy a single mount (which usually costs 5,000 badges), you would need to run over <strong>100 dungeons</strong>.</p><p><strong>With misti.services, you can skip the grind and instantly access rewards like:</strong></p><ul><li><strong>Mounts:</strong> Ironbound Wraithcharger, Eclipse Dragonhawk, Yu''lei, Daughter of Jade.</li><li><strong>Reputation:</strong> Commendations to hit Exalted with factions like The Anglers or Sons of Hodir instantly.</li><li><strong>Heirlooms:</strong> Upgrade tokens to scale your heirlooms to the max level.</li><li><strong>Transmog:</strong> Unique weapon and armor appearances from past expansions.</li></ul>', '<ul><li><strong>Select Amount:</strong> Choose how many Timewarped Badges you need using the slider/dropdown.</li><li><strong>Order &amp; Contact:</strong> Once paid, our support team will contact you via Live Chat or Discord to confirm details.</li><li><strong>The Boost:</strong> We assign a pro player to your order.</li><li class="ql-indent-1"><em>For Piloted:</em> We log in via VPN.</li><li class="ql-indent-1"><em>For Remote:</em> We connect via Parsec.</li><li><strong>Completion:</strong> We notify you immediately once the farming is done. You log back in and spend your badges!</li></ul>', '<ul><li><strong>Level 30+:</strong> The Burning Crusade &amp; WotLK Timewalking.</li><li><strong>Level 35+:</strong> Cataclysm &amp; Mists of Pandaria Timewalking.</li><li><strong>Level 40+:</strong> Warlords of Draenor Timewalking.</li><li><strong>Level 45+:</strong> Legion Timewalking.</li><li><strong>Expansion:</strong> Active subscription and access to <em>The War Within</em>.</li></ul>', 0.02, 'https://kdjlhibxxygfdmlvdfcl.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/game-images/timewarped-badge-1763405974822.webp', NULL, 4.9, 0, true, true, 0, '2025-11-17T12:23:13.765337+00:00', '2026-01-19T09:59:19.672465+00:00', '1f0b9195-2e81-4380-8315-539e1ce3d834', true, '{"step":10,"max_value":9999,"min_value":300,"slider_type":"single","value_label":"Badges","default_value":1000,"pricing_brackets":[{"end":9999,"price":0,"start":1}],"estimated_time_per_step":0.05}', true, 0, '15 minutes', 'average start time', 'Flexible', 'order completion', 'Buy WoW Timewarped Badges at misti.services. Skip the dungeon grind. Get mounts, reputation tokens, and 580+ ilvl gear fast. Safe & manual boosting.', 'WoW Timewarped Badge Farm, Buy Timewarped Badges, Timewalking Boost Service, Farm Timewarped Badges Fast, misti.services Timewalking,Infinite Timereaver Farm, Timewalking Mount Carry, Buy WoW Reputation Tokens, The War Within Timewalking Boost, Timewalking Dungeon Carry, WoW Heirloom Upgrade Tokens', 'https://kdjlhibxxygfdmlvdfcl.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/game-images/timewarped-badge-1763405974822.webp', NULL, 'Timewarped Badge', 'WoW War Within Timewarped Badge | misti.services', NULL);
