li>You receive notification once all ordered wins are completed</li><li>Log in and enjoy your improved stats, account upgrades, and exclusive rewards</li></ul><p><br></p>', '<ul><li>Access to Battlefield 6 Gauntlet / RedSec mode</li></ul><p><br></p>', 0, 'https://kdjlhibxxygfdmlvdfcl.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/game-images/battlefield-6-gauntlet-guaranteed-wins-boost-1762687879527.webp', NULL, 4.9, 0, true, true, 0, '2025-11-02T20:27:30.208067+00:00', '2025-12-16T00:22:11.888346+00:00', 'b6ed2a6d-1027-4b40-ae17-78362628e035', true, '{"step":1,"max_value":20,"min_value":1,"slider_type":"single","value_label":"Level","default_value":10,"pricing_brackets":[{"end":20,"price":18,"start":1}],"estimated_time_per_step":0.2}', true, 0, '15 minutes', 'average start time', 'Flexible', 'order completion', 'Battlefield 6 Gauntlet Guaranteed Wins Boost Secure guaranteed wins in the Battlefield 6 Gauntlet mode with our professional boosting service.', 'battlefield 6 gauntlet boost, bf6 gauntlet wins boost, battlefield 6 gauntlet guaranteed wins, bf6 gauntlet professional boosting, battlefield 6 gauntlet elimination mode, bf6 gauntlet tournament wins, battlefield 6 squad coordination boost, bf6 objective mastery service, battlefield 6 adaptable play boost, buy bf6 gauntlet boost, cheap battlefield 6 gauntlet wins, fast bf6 gauntlet boost, battlefield 6 gauntlet first place, bf6 gauntlet no grind boost, battlefield 6 reliable teammates service', 'https://kdjlhibxxygfdmlvdfcl.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/game-images/battlefield-6-gauntlet-guaranteed-wins-boost-1762687879527.webp', NULL, 'Battlefield 6 Gauntlet Guaranteed Wins Boost', 'Battlefield 6 Gauntlet Wins Boost | misti.services', NULL);
