ricate challenge efficiently, ensuring they reap the maximum benefits from the Anniversary event. This service is your definitive way to secure top-tier loot and experience one of WoW''s most iconic raids.</p><h3><strong>Why Choose Our Service</strong></h3><ul><li><strong>Elite Raid Specialists:</strong> Our teams comprise seasoned Black Temple experts, guaranteeing a smooth and successful run.</li><li><strong>Optimized Clear Speed:</strong> We prioritize fast and effective clears, allowing you to quickly secure rewards on the competitive Anniversary realms.</li><li><strong>Legendary Item Potential:</strong> Significantly increase your chances of acquiring highly sought-after items like the Warglaives of Azzinoth and complete your Tier 6 set.</li><li><strong>Flexible Options:</strong> Choose between Piloted or Selfplay to fit your preferred playstyle.</li><li><strong>Transparent Progress:</strong> Option to add a private stream allows you to monitor your boost in real-time.</li></ul><p>Secure your legacy within the Black Temple and claim the rewards you''ve always desired. With misti.services, your journey through TBC Anniversary''s most formidable raid is destined for success.</p>', '<ul><li><strong>Place Your Order:</strong> Select your desired options and complete the purchase for the WoW TBC Anniversary Black Temple Boost.</li><li><strong>Team Assignment:</strong> We will connect you with a skilled 25-player raid team specializing in rapid and efficient Black Temple clears for Anniversary realms.</li><li><strong>Raid Execution:</strong> The team will perform a full 9/9 Black Temple clear, focusing on your chosen loot priority and securing valuable Tier 6 tokens and high-ilvl gear.</li><li><strong>Completion Confirmation:</strong> Upon the defeat of Illidan and the securing of your loot, you''ll receive confirmation that your service is complete.</li><li><strong>Enjoy Your Rewards:</strong> Equip your powerful Tier 6 set pieces and proudly progress through Phase 3 content.</li></ul>', '<ul><li><strong>Character Level:</strong> Your character must be level 70 in WoW TBC Anniversary Classic.</li><li><strong>Black Temple Attunement:</strong> Your character must be fully attuned to enter the Black Temple raid.</li></ul>', 99.99, 'https://kdjlhibxxygfdmlvdfcl.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/game-images/wow-tbc-anniversary-black-temple-boost-1768232340864.webp', NULL, 4.9, 0, true, true, 0, '2026-01-10T20:56:43.649686+00:00', '2026-01-12T15:43:10.584698+00:00', '542d3f01-5eb4-4572-bd18-75dea239ed84', false, NULL, true, 0, '15 minutes', 'average start time', 'Flexible', 'order completion', 'Purchase your WoW TBC Anniversary Black Temple boost for a guaranteed 9/9 clear, Tier 6 gear, and a chance at Warglaives. Fast, secure, and professional!', 'wow tbc black temple boost buy, tbc black temple raid service, wow tbc anniversary boost, black temple carry, tbc illidan kill, warglaives of azzinoth farm, tier 6 gear tbc, wow tbc raid boost price, black temple full clear, tbc anniversary raids, buy wow tbc boost, wow classic tbc boost, gaming service, fast delivery, professional, reliable, secure, boosting, carry, account', 'https://kdjlhibxxygfdmlvdfcl.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/game-images/wow-tbc-anniversary-black-temple-boost-1768232340864.webp', NULL, 'Wow Tbc Anniversary Black Temple Boost', 'Buy WoW TBC Anniversary Black Temple Boost | misti.services', NULL);
INSERT INTO public.products (id, name, slug, short_description, description, how_it_works, requirements, base_price, image_url, badge_text, trust_score, total_reviews, is_active, is_featured, sort_order, created_at, updated_at, category_id, is_slider_product, slider_config, is_manually_popular, total_sales, start_time_text, start_time_value, delivery_text, delivery_value, meta_description, meta_keywords, og_image, canonical_url, image_alt_text, meta_title, parent_link) VALUES ('02d6f9ea-cb93-40bc-a87d-9d2e36fc715e', 'The Kirin Tor Offensive', 'the-kirin-tor-offensive', 'Boost your Kirin Tor Offensive reputation fast in WoW Mists of Pandaria Classic with Misti Services and unlock mounts, gear, and rewards.', '<h1><strong>The Kirin Tor Offensive Reputation Boost</strong></h1><p><a href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/faction=1387/kirin-tor-offensive" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank"><strong>The Kirin Tor Offensive</strong></a> is the Alliance’s elite magical strike force in Pandaria, dedicated to reclaiming the Isle of Thunder and confronting the Thunder King. Gaining reputation with this faction unlocks powerful gear, unique mounts, and story-driven quests. With Misti Services, you can reach Exalted quickly and enjoy every reward without the tedious grind.</p><h3>How to Earn Reputation with The Kirin Tor Offensive</h3><p>Reputation with The Kirin Tor Offensive in World of Warcraft: Mists of Pandaria Classic is earned through daily quests and scenarios located on the Isle of Thunder. Players assist the Kirin Tor in establishing footholds, fighting mogu and Zandalari forces, and uncovering the secrets of Lei Shen’s empire.</p><p>Daily quests are divided into several types—assault missions, resource gathering, and area control. Completing these tasks grants reputation and contributes to the overall progress of the Isle of Thunder campaign.</p><h3>Unlocking The Kirin Tor Offensive Dailies</h3><p>To begin, Alliance players must complete the introductory questline leading to the Isle of Thunder. This unlocks the Kirin Tor Offensive base camp and access to daily missions.</p><p>As you progress through the campaign, additional areas and quests open, providing new opportunities for reputation gains and story advancement. Each new stage of the assault adds fresh objectives and higher reputation rewards.</p><h3>Reputation Boosting Tips</h3><p>Maximize your Kirin Tor Offensive reputation gains with event bonuses and guild perks:</p><ul><li><strong>Darkmoon Faire – WHEE!</strong> (+10% reputation for 1 hour)</li><li><strong>Hallow’s End – Unburdened or Grim Visage</strong> (+10% for 2 hours)</li><li><strong>Pilgrim’s Bounty – Spirit of Sharing</strong> (+10% for 1 hour)</li><li><strong>Guild Perk – Mr. Popularity</strong> (+10% reputation bonus)</li></ul><p>Completing all available daily quests and participating in the island’s special events ensures consistent reputation progress toward Exalted.</p><h3>The Kirin Tor Offensive Rewards</h3><p>The Kirin Tor Offensive offers valuable rewards to those who support their magical war effort:</p><ul><li><strong>Honored:</strong> Profession recipes, blue-quality gear, and Kirin Tor-themed items</li><li><strong>Revered:</strong> Epic-quality gear, vanity items, and rare crafting materials</li><li><strong>Exalted:</strong> The <em>Reins of the Golden Kirin</em> mount, tabard, and unique achievements tied to the Isle of Thunder campaign</li></ul><p>Reaching Exalted also grants access to exclusive vendors selling high-level items ideal for endgame progression.</p><h3>Why Choose Misti Services for Your Kirin Tor Offensive Boost</h3><p>Misti Services provides a reliable, professional, and efficient way to earn reputation with The Kirin Tor Offensive in WoW Mists of Pandaria Classic. Our expert boosters complete all dailies and campaign quests, ensuring you reach Exalted quickly. Enjoy all the rewards, mounts, and story content without the grind.</p>', '<ul><li>Select your desired options and complete your order on&nbsp;Misti.Services.</li><li>You’ll receive an order confirmation and tracking number via email.</li><li>Our support manager will contact you through live chat to confirm all details.</li><li>If you’re unavailable, we’ll reach out via email or your preferred contact method.</li><li>When the boost is finished, you’ll receive a completion notification on Discord or another messenger of your choice.</li></ul>', '<ul><li>Active World of Warcraft subscription</li><li>Level 90 character</li></ul><p>Need help reaching level 90? Try our&nbsp;<a href="https://misti.services/game/wow-mistsofpandaria-classic" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank" style="color: rgb(60, 113, 221);">WoW Power Leveling Boost</a>&nbsp;</p>', 0, 'https://kdjlhibxxygfdmlvdfcl.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/game-images/the-kirin-tor-offensive-1763233459396.webp', NULL, 4.9, 350, true, true, 0, '2025-11-02T21:23:01.800908+00:00', '2025-12-16T07:51:26.050612+00:00', 'eef98e08-1b65-4858-859f-5418bbab5fa2', false, NULL, true, 0, '15 minutes', 'average start time', 'Flexible', 'order completion', 'Boost your Kirin Tor Offensive reputation fast in WoW Mists of Pandaria Classic with Misti Services and unlock mounts, gear, and rewards.', 'kirin tor offensive rep boost, wow mop classic reputation farm, kirin tor offensive exalted, mists of pandaria kirin tor unlock, mop kirin tor offensive mounts, wow classic kirin tor gear, mists of pandaria reputation service, buy kirin tor offensive rep, fast kirin tor offensive boost, mop classic reputation rewards, kirin tor offensive reputation farming, wow mop kirin tor grind, misti services kirin tor, kirin tor offensive unlock service', 'https://kdjlhibxxygfdmlvdfcl.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/game-images/the-kirin-tor-offensive-1763233459396.webp', NULL, 'The Kirin Tor Offensive', 'WoW MoP Kirin Tor Offensive Rep Boost | misti.services', NULL);
INSERT INTO public.products (id, name, slug, short_description, description, how_it_works, requirements, base_price, image_url, badge_text, trust_score, total_reviews, is_active, is_featured, sort_order, created_at, updated_at, category_id, is_slider_product, slider_config, is_manually_popular, total_sales, start_time_text, start_time_value, delivery_text, delivery_value, meta_description, meta_keywords, og_image, canonical_url, image_alt_text, meta_title, parent_link) VALUES ('33e3b5a1-e6f1-4c9e-b314-470b18a4f0ee', 'The Scryers', 'the-scryers', 'The Scryers is a faction of Blood Elf magisters located in Shattrath City (Scryer''s Tier). This reputation is typically the preferred choice for Caster DPS and Healers due to the critical strike and spell hit nature of their shoulder enchants, as well as specific Alchemy and Jewelcrafting recipes.', '<h1><strong>The Scryers Reputation Farm Boost – WoW TBC Classic</strong></h1><p>Looking to secure the <strong>Best-in-Slot Caster/DPS Shoulder Enchants</strong> and unique profession patterns without farming hundreds of Sunfury Signets? Misti.Services offers a fast, secure, and professional <a href="https://www.wowhead.com/tbc/faction=934/the-scryers" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank"><strong>The Scryers</strong></a><strong> Reputation Farm Boost</strong>, handling the expensive turn-ins and extensive quest chains in Shattrath and Netherstorm.</p><p>Our expert boosters manage the entire process—from the initial "City of Light" allegiance choice to the final push for Exalted—delivering guaranteed reputation gains and plenty of <strong>Arcane Runes</strong> for your enchants.</p><h2><strong>Overview</strong></h2><p><strong>The Scryers</strong> is a faction of Blood Elf magisters located in <strong>Shattrath City</strong> (Scryer''s Tier). This reputation is typically the preferred choice for Caster DPS and Healers due to the critical strike and spell hit nature of their shoulder enchants, as well as specific Alchemy and Jewelcrafting recipes.</p><p><strong>Important:</strong> The Scryers is mutually exclusive with <strong>The Aldor</strong>. You must choose one.</p><ul><li><em>If you choose Scryers, you become Hostile with Aldor.</em></li><li><em>If you are already Aldor, switching to Scryers is a massive grind. Our service can handle this "Betrayal" grind if needed.</em></li></ul><p>Earning <strong>Exalted</strong> status with The Scryers provides access to:</p><ul><li><strong>BiS Shoulder Enchants:</strong> Powerful shoulder inscriptions (Crit/Defense/Mana Regen) available in Phase 1 &amp; 2.</li><li><strong>Profession Patterns:</strong> Unique recipes for Alchemy (Elixir of Major Firepower), Jewelcrafting, and Leatherworking.</li><li><strong>Arcane Runes:</strong> A special currency required to purchase the shoulder inscriptions.</li></ul><h2><strong>Gaining Reputation</strong></h2><p>The Scryers reputation grind involves a specific mix of mob grinding, item turn-ins, and high-level questing across Outland.</p><h3><strong>1. The Choice (Neutral)</strong></h3><p>If you haven''t chosen a faction yet, we complete the <em>City of Light</em> questline initiated by the <strong>Haggard War Veteran</strong> in Shattrath to officially align you with The Scryers.</p><h3><strong>2. Item Turn-Ins (The Grind)</strong></h3><p>The bulk of reputation comes from turning in items dropped by the Firewing and Sunfury Blood Elves. Our boosters efficiently farm and turn these in:</p><ul><li><strong>Firewing Signets (Up to Honored):</strong> We farm these from Firewing mobs in Terokkar Forest.</li><li><strong>Sunfury Signets (Honored to Exalted):</strong> The primary method for high-level reputation. We farm these from high-level Blood Elves throughout Outland (Netherstorm/Shadowmoon Valley).</li><li><strong>Arcane Tomes (Bonus Rep &amp; Currency):</strong> We farm and turn in these rare drops to <strong>Voren''thal the Seer</strong>. Each turn-in grants 350 reputation and <strong>Arcane Runes</strong>, which you will need to buy your shoulder enchants.</li></ul><h3><strong>3. Questing</strong></h3><p>To supplement the grind and save on material costs, we complete all available Scryer-specific quests in:</p><ul><li><strong>Netherstorm:</strong> <em>Shutting Down Manaforges</em>, <em>Turning Point</em>, and <em>A Gift for Voren''thal</em>.</li><li><strong>Shadowmoon Valley:</strong> <em>The Ashtongue Corruptors</em>, <em>Tablets of Baa''ri</em>, etc.</li><li><strong>Nagrand:</strong> <em>Varedis Must Be Stopped</em>.</li></ul><h2><strong>Reputation Rewards</strong></h2><p>The Scryers offer two distinct types of rewards from two different vendors on the Scryer''s Tier.</p><h3><strong>Shoulder Enchants (Inscriber Veredis)</strong></h3><p>Purchased using <strong>Arcane Runes</strong> (obtained from Arcane Tome turn-ins).</p><ul><li><strong>Greater Inscription of the Orb</strong> (Caster DPS/Hit/Crit)</li><li><strong>Greater Inscription of the Blade</strong> (Physical DPS/Crit)</li><li><strong>Greater Inscription of the Knight</strong> (Tank/Defense)</li><li><strong>Greater Inscription of the Oracle</strong> (Healer/Mana Regen)</li></ul><h3><strong>Quartermaster Rewards (Quartermaster Enuril)</strong></h3><ul><li><strong>Profession Patterns:</strong> Enchanting formulas, Jewelcrafting designs (Pendant of Withering), and Alchemy recipes.</li><li><strong>Gear:</strong> A variety of weapons and armor (e.g., <em>Scryer''s Blade of Focus</em>, <em>Seer''s Cane</em>).</li></ul><h2><strong>Why Choose Our Scryers Reputation Boost</strong></h2><p>Farming <strong>Sunfury Signets</strong> is incredibly expensive if bought, or incredibly slow if farmed manually in highly contested areas like Netherstorm. Misti.Services offers the cost-effective solution:</p><ul><li><strong>Material Management:</strong> We handle the acquisition of hundreds of Sunfury and Firewing Signets required for the boost.</li><li><strong>Arcane Rune Accumulation:</strong> By turning in <strong>Arcane Tomes</strong>, we ensure you have a stock of Arcane Runes ready to buy your enchants immediately upon reaching Exalted.</li><li><strong>Quest Efficiency:</strong> We clear the specific Scryer quest hubs to maximize "free" reputation and gold.</li></ul><h3><strong>Service Includes</strong></h3><ul><li>Full <strong>The Scryers</strong> reputation farm from your current standing up to <strong>Exalted</strong>.</li><li>Completion of the <em>City of Light</em> allegiance quest (if not done).</li><li>Farming and turn-in of <strong>Firewing Signets</strong> and <strong>Sunfury Signets</strong>.</li><li>Farming of <strong>Arcane Tomes</strong> for reputation and <strong>Arcane Runes</strong>.</li><li>Guaranteed access to BiS <strong>Greater Inscriptions</strong> (Shoulder Enchants).</li></ul><p><strong>Unlock the best Caster shoulder enchants! Order your Scryers Reputation Boost today.</strong></p>', '<ul><li>Select your desired options and complete your order on&nbsp;Misti.Services.</li><li>You’ll receive an order confirmation and tracking number via email.</li><li>Our support manager will contact you through live chat to confirm all details.</li><li>If you’re unavailable, we’ll reach out via email or your preferred contact method.</li><li>When the boost is finished, you’ll receive a completion notification on Discord or another messenger of your choice.</li></ul>', '<ul><li>Level 70 character</li><li>Active WoW Subscription</li></ul>', 0, 'https://kdjlhibxxygfdmlvdfcl.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/game-images/the-scryers-1763848602861.webp', NULL, 4.9, 0, true, true, 0, '2025-11-20T19:40:35.341689+00:00', '2026-02-17T10:00:39.628462+00:00', '9464d1fe-6c00-412a-8ebb-896a4f575b4e', false, NULL, true, 0, '15 minutes', 'average start time', 'Flexible', 'order completion', 'Buy The Scryers Exalted boost! Unlock BiS Shoulder Enchants, Arcane Runes, and Alchemy recipes. We farm Sunfury Signets so you don''t have to', 'The Scryers reputation boost, Scryer shoulder enchant, Sunfury Signet farm, Arcane Tomes, Arcane Runes farm, Shattrath reputation, Scryers Exalted, Aldor vs Scryers, Greater Inscription of the Orb, Firewing Signets', 'https://kdjlhibxxygfdmlvdfcl.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/game-images/the-scryers-1763848602861.webp', NULL, 'The Scryers', 'WoW TBC The Scryers Rep Boost | misti.services', NULL);
