trong>Recovery Speed:</strong> Upgrading the Medstation, Nutrition Unit, and Resting Space drastically reduces the time it takes for your PMC to heal, hydrate, and recover energy between raids.</li><li><strong>Stash Size:</strong> For players without the "Unheard" or "Edge of Darkness" editions, upgrading the Stash is the only way to increase inventory space without spending real money.</li></ul><p><strong>Why Choose Misti Services?</strong></p><ul><li><strong>Loot Knowledge:</strong> Our boosters know exactly where to find every bolt, wire, and rare electronic component, making the process significantly faster than doing it yourself.</li><li><strong>Account Safety:</strong> We do not use bots or cheats. All items are found in-raid or purchased via the Flea Market using legitimately earned currency.</li><li><strong>Turnkey Solution:</strong> You don''t need to worry about tracking complex requirements. We handle the logistics, the looting, and the building.</li></ul><pre class="ql-syntax" spellcheck="false">Upgrade Details:
