ail. After confirming details, we’ll assign a suitable booster for your order. The boost will begin soon after confirmation.</li><li>Once completed, you’ll be notified via Discord or your chosen messenger. Sit back, relax, and enjoy watching your character rise to the top.</li><li>⭐ We’d love your feedback! Please leave a review on Trustpilot – your opinion helps us continue delivering the most trusted WoW boosting services.</li></ul>', '<ul><li>The War Within expansion.</li></ul>', 0, 'https://kdjlhibxxygfdmlvdfcl.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/game-images/wow-the-war-within-leveling-1762359864824.webp', NULL, 4.9, 0, true, true, 0, '2025-10-21T13:33:16.165804+00:00', '2026-01-21T18:05:44.919039+00:00', 'e485ce45-0002-4703-b770-7329e3621434', true, '{"step":1,"end_label":"End Value","max_value":80,"min_value":1,"default_end":60,"start_label":"Start Value","default_start":1,"pricing_brackets":[{"end":70,"price":21.25,"start":1},{"end":80,"price":10.2,"start":71}],"estimated_time_per_step":0.01}', true, 5, '15 minutes', 'average start time', 'Flexible', 'order completion', 'Buy The War Within Leveling Boost from Misti.Services — the ultimate solution for players who want to progress faster in World of Warcraft.', 'wow the war within leveling boost, buy tww leveling, the war within power leveling, wow fastest leveling service, dragonflight to tww leveling, world of warcraft war within boost, misti.services wow leveling, cheap tww leveling, professional wow leveling, wow character level up, war within level cap boost, acquire tww levels, wow expansion leveling, buy wow levels the war within', 'https://kdjlhibxxygfdmlvdfcl.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/game-images/wow-the-war-within-leveling-1762359864824.webp', NULL, 'Wow The War Within Leveling', 'Buy WoW War Within Leveling Boost | Fast 1–80', NULL);
INSERT INTO public.products (id, name, slug, short_description, description, how_it_works, requirements, base_price, image_url, badge_text, trust_score, total_reviews, is_active, is_featured, sort_order, created_at, updated_at, category_id, is_slider_product, slider_config, is_manually_popular, total_sales, start_time_text, start_time_value, delivery_text, delivery_value, meta_description, meta_keywords, og_image, canonical_url, image_alt_text, meta_title, parent_link) VALUES ('2afcf3ba-cdaf-4f04-af02-5654b99959fd', 'The Klaxxi', 'the-klaxxi', 'Boost your Klaxxi reputation fast in WoW Mists of Pandaria Classic with Misti Services and unlock powerful gear, mounts, and rewards.', '<h1><strong>The Klaxxi Reputation Boost</strong></h1><p><a href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/faction=1337/the-klaxxi" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank"><strong>The Klaxxi</strong></a> are the ancient mantid paragons who protect the Dread Wastes and stand against corruption spreading through Pandaria. Gaining their favor unlocks unique mounts, high-level gear, and powerful quest rewards. With Misti Services, you can reach Exalted with The Klaxxi quickly and skip the repetitive daily grind entirely.</p><h3>How to Earn Reputation with The Klaxxi</h3><p>Reputation with The Klaxxi in World of Warcraft: Mists of Pandaria Classic is earned through questing and daily missions in the Dread Wastes. Players assist the Klaxxi Paragons in cleansing their lands of the corrupted Mantid Swarm and uncovering the mysteries of the ancient insect empire.</p><p>The grind begins with the main Dread Wastes questline, which unlocks the Klaxxi hub at Klaxxi’vess. Completing these story quests provides a large initial reputation boost and opens up the daily quests needed to continue progression.</p><h3>Unlocking the Klaxxi Dailies</h3><p>To start daily quests for The Klaxxi, players must complete the introductory storyline in the Dread Wastes, beginning with <strong>“The Klaxxi”</strong> quest. Once finished, Klaxxi’vess becomes your main hub for daily missions.</p><p>Daily quests involve aiding awakened Paragons in their war against the Sha-corrupted Mantid. These tasks vary from slaying elite enemies to gathering rare resources across the Dread Wastes.</p><h3>Reputation Boosting Tips</h3><p>The Klaxxi reputation grind is faster than most Pandaria factions, but you can still enhance your progress with reputation bonuses and event perks:</p><ul><li><strong>Darkmoon Faire – WHEE!</strong> (+10% reputation for 1 hour)</li><li><strong>Hallow’s End – Unburdened or Grim Visage</strong> (+10% for 2 hours)</li><li><strong>Pilgrim’s Bounty – Spirit of Sharing</strong> (+10% for 1 hour)</li><li><strong>Guild Perk – Mr. Popularity</strong> (+10% reputation bonus)</li></ul><p>You can also earn additional reputation by completing special Klaxxi Paragon quests and turning in items dropped by powerful enemies throughout the Dread Wastes.</p><h3>The Klaxxi Rewards</h3><p>The Klaxxi offer some of the most valuable faction rewards in Pandaria for both leveling and endgame players:</p><ul><li><strong>Honored:</strong> Profession patterns, weapons, and trinkets</li><li><strong>Revered:</strong> High-level armor upgrades, epic recipes, and gear enhancements</li><li><strong>Exalted:</strong> The <em>Amber Scorpion</em> mount, epic-quality gear, and unique story achievements</li></ul><p>Completing The Klaxxi questline also reveals deeper lore about the Mantid empire and the Old Gods’ influence over Pandaria.</p><h3>Why Choose Misti Services for Your Klaxxi Boost</h3><p>Misti Services provides a secure, fast, and professional way to earn reputation with The Klaxxi in WoW Mists of Pandaria Classic. Our expert boosters complete the quests and dailies on your behalf, ensuring you reach Exalted quickly and without the grind. Enjoy the rewards, mounts, and storylines of The Klaxxi while we handle the hard work for you.</p>', '<ul><li>Select your desired options and complete your order on&nbsp;Misti.Services.</li><li>You’ll receive an order confirmation and tracking number via email.</li><li>Our support manager will contact you through live chat to confirm all details.</li><li>If you’re unavailable, we’ll reach out via email or your preferred contact method.</li><li>When the boost is finished, you’ll receive a completion notification on Discord or another messenger of your choice.</li></ul>', '<ul><li>Active World of Warcraft subscription</li><li>Level 90 character</li></ul><p>Need help reaching level 90? Try our&nbsp;<a href="https://misti.services/game/wow-mistsofpandaria-classic" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank" style="color: rgb(60, 113, 221);">WoW Power Leveling Boost</a>&nbsp;</p>', 0, 'https://kdjlhibxxygfdmlvdfcl.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/game-images/the-klaxxi-1763233696882.webp', NULL, 4.9, 350, true, true, 0, '2025-11-02T20:42:36.802435+00:00', '2025-12-16T07:51:30.2043+00:00', 'eef98e08-1b65-4858-859f-5418bbab5fa2', false, NULL, true, 0, '15 minutes', 'average start time', 'Flexible', 'order completion', 'Boost your Klaxxi reputation fast in WoW Mists of Pandaria Classic with Misti Services and unlock powerful gear, mounts, and rewards.', 'klaxxi reputation boost, wow klaxxi farm, mists of pandaria classic klaxxi, mop classic klaxxi vendor, buy klaxxi rep, fast klaxxi exalted, klaxxi mounts wow, klaxxi gear mop classic, klaxxi rewards guide, misti services klaxxi, wow classic klaxxi boost, pandaria classic reputation farming, cheap klaxxi reputation, professional klaxxi farm', 'https://kdjlhibxxygfdmlvdfcl.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/game-images/the-klaxxi-1763233696882.webp', NULL, 'The Klaxxi', 'WoW MoP Classic Klaxxi Rep Boost | misti.services', NULL);
