nd your guaranteed Tier 5 loot is secured.</li><li>Enjoy your powerful new Tier 5 set pieces and prepare for further progression into Black Temple and Mount Hyjal.</li></ul>', '<ul><li><strong>Level 70 Character:</strong> Your character must be level 70 in WoW TBC 20th Anniversary Classic.</li><li><strong>Serpentshrine Cavern Attunement:</strong> Your character needs to have completed the attunement questline, obtaining The Mark of Vashj buff.</li></ul>', 99.99, 'https://kdjlhibxxygfdmlvdfcl.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/game-images/serpentshrine-cavern-1768865500243.webp', NULL, 4.9, 0, true, true, 0, '2026-01-10T20:51:31.557981+00:00', '2026-01-20T23:42:47.029498+00:00', '542d3f01-5eb4-4572-bd18-75dea239ed84', false, NULL, true, 0, '15 minutes', 'average start time', 'Flexible', 'order completion', 'Buy WoW TBC Serpentshrine Cavern Anniversary boost for a full 6/6 clear, Lady Vashj defeat, and guaranteed Tier 5 helm, gloves, and leg tokens.', 'wow tbc serpentshrine cavern boost, tbc ssc anniversary, tbc ssc boost, serpentshrine cavern carry, tbc serpentshrine cavern full clear, tbc tier 5 gear, lady vashj kill, tbc raid boost, wow tbc anniversary boost, buy tbc ssc boost, tbc ssc boost price, serpentshrine cavern loot, wow tbc ssc carry, tbc classic ssc, serpentshrine cavern raid, tbc anniversary raid, tbc anniversary ssc, tbc ssc service, wow tbc raid carry, tbc classic raid boost, buy wow tbc ssc, wow tbc anniversary ssc, ssc farm tbc, tbc serpentshrine cavern gear, tbc ssc tier 5, serpentshrine cavern tier 5 tokens', 'https://kdjlhibxxygfdmlvdfcl.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/game-images/serpentshrine-cavern-1768865500243.webp', NULL, 'Serpentshrine Cavern', 'WoW TBC SSC Anniversary Boost & Tier 5 Gear | misti.services', NULL);
INSERT INTO public.products (id, name, slug, short_description, description, how_it_works, requirements, base_price, image_url, badge_text, trust_score, total_reviews, is_active, is_featured, sort_order, created_at, updated_at, category_id, is_slider_product, slider_config, is_manually_popular, total_sales, start_time_text, start_time_value, delivery_text, delivery_value, meta_description, meta_keywords, og_image, canonical_url, image_alt_text, meta_title, parent_link) VALUES ('11bcebb3-dcc6-468a-810a-b387769c68a5', 'Crimson Armored Growler', 'crimson-armored-growler', 'The Crimson Armored Growler stands out thanks to its aggressive hyena model and bold crimson armor, making it an excellent fit for characters with a brutal, warlike aesthetic. It’s obtained by collecting a large amount of Resonance Crystals and then buying the mount from Rocco Razzboom.', '<h1><strong>Crimson Armored Growler Mount Boost</strong></h1><p>Add a vicious hyena in crimson armor to your collection while we handle all the farming.</p><p>The Crimson Armored Growler is a striking World of Warcraft mount that looks like a battle-ready hyena wrapped in deep red plate. To get it, you need to collect 6,500 Resonance Crystals and then purchase the mount from the vendor <strong>Rocco Razzboom</strong>. The grind itself isn’t mechanically hard, but it demands a lot of time and repetition across multiple activities.</p><p>If you don’t feel like turning this mount into a long-term side job, misti.services can take over. Our team will farm the required Resonance Crystals and buy the Crimson Armored Growler for you, so you simply log in and enjoy your new mount.</p><h2><strong>Service Includes</strong></h2><p>When you order the Crimson Armored Growler boost from misti.services, we take care of everything needed to secure the mount:</p><ul><li><strong>Crimson Armored Growler mount obtained</strong> and added to your collection.</li><li><strong>Farming 6,500 Resonance Crystals</strong> required to purchase the mount from Rocco Razzboom.</li><li><strong>All loot, gold, and extra rewards</strong> obtained along the way kept on your account.</li><li><strong>Manual completion only</strong>, handled by experienced boosters without bots or scripts.</li></ul><h2><strong>About Crimson Armored Growler</strong></h2><p>The Crimson Armored Growler stands out thanks to its aggressive hyena model and bold crimson armor, making it an excellent fit for characters with a brutal, warlike aesthetic. It’s obtained by collecting a large amount of <strong>Resonance Crystals</strong> and then buying the mount from <strong>Rocco Razzboom</strong>.</p><p>Resonance Crystals can be earned from a variety of in-game content, such as:</p><ul><li>Participating in Skyriding races</li><li>Completing Delves</li><li>Earning one-time Renown rewards</li><li>Finishing quests and weekly dungeon objectives</li><li>Defeating rare enemies and other relevant activities</li></ul><p>Individually, these tasks are manageable, but pushing all the way to 6,500 crystals takes a lot of repeat playtime. Our Crimson Armored Growler boost lets you skip that repetitive grind entirely. We handle the farming and purchase, so you get the mount with none of the time sink.</p><h2><strong>Boost Options Explained</strong></h2><p>To deliver your mount in the most comfortable and secure way for you, we offer two execution methods:</p><ul><li><strong>Account Sharing (Piloted):</strong></li><li> A professional booster logs into your account and completes all required Resonance Crystal farming and the purchase of the mount. We follow strict safety practices and treat your account with care.</li><li><strong>Remote Control:</strong></li><li> For maximum control and transparency, our booster connects to your PC via a secure remote app such as Parsec and plays using your own mouse and keyboard. You watch everything live, your login credentials never leave your hands, and you see every step of the boost.</li></ul><p><br></p>', '<ul><li>You choose your options for the Crimson Armored Growler boost on misti.services and complete the purchase.</li><li>You receive an order number and an email confirming that your boost has been created.</li><li>Our support team contacts you via the website chat; if needed, we also follow up via email or your preferred contact method.</li><li>You provide any additional details (character info, schedule, chosen boost method), and we assign a suitable booster to your order.</li><li>For <strong>Account Sharing</strong>, the booster logs into your account at the agreed time, farms the 6,500 Resonance Crystals, and buys the Crimson Armored Growler from Rocco Razzboom.</li><li>For <strong>Remote Control</strong>, the booster connects securely to your PC and completes the entire process while you watch.</li><li>Once the WoW Crimson Armored Growler carry is finished, you receive a notification via Discord or another messenger of your choice.</li></ul>', '<ul><li><strong>Level:</strong> Level 80 Character.</li><li><strong>Expansion:</strong> The War Within active.</li><li><strong>Account:</strong> Active World of Warcraft subscription.</li></ul><p><br></p>', 50.15, 'https://kdjlhibxxygfdmlvdfcl.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/game-images/crimson-armored-growler-1764151878517.webp', NULL, 4.9, 0, true, true, 0, '2025-11-24T21:30:37.574791+00:00', '2025-12-16T07:22:36.043155+00:00', 'b4c0ccaf-a937-4b30-9ab4-7dacee8f739b', false, NULL, true, 0, '15 minutes', 'average start time', 'Flexible', 'order completion', 'Skip the Resonance Crystal grind and unlock the Crimson Armored Growler mount with misti.services. We farm 6,500 Resonance Crystals and buy the mount from Rocco Razzboom ', 'Crimson Armored Growler boost, WoW Crimson Armored Growler carry, Resonance Crystals farm, Rocco Razzboom mount, War Within mount boost, WoW hyena mount, buy WoW mounts, WoW mount boosting service, misti.services WoW boosts', 'https://kdjlhibxxygfdmlvdfcl.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/game-images/crimson-armored-growler-1764151878517.webp', NULL, 'Crimson Armored Growler', 'Crimson Armored Growler - War Within Mount | misti.services', NULL);
INSERT INTO public.products (id, name, slug, short_description, description, how_it_works, requirements, base_price, image_url, badge_text, trust_score, total_reviews, is_active, is_featured, sort_order, created_at, updated_at, category_id, is_slider_product, slider_config, is_manually_popular, total_sales, start_time_text, start_time_value, delivery_text, delivery_value, meta_description, meta_keywords, og_image, canonical_url, image_alt_text, meta_title, parent_link) VALUES ('0725d1ad-cc34-4b43-922a-91a1f013ab57', 'Platinum Challenge Mode', 'mop-platinum-challenge-mode', 'In MoP Classic, Blizzard has introduced a tier of rewards exclusive to Platinum achievers. These aren''t just cosmetic; many of these toys offer powerful utility effects (like Bloodlust, Invisibility, or crowd control) that can be used by any class inside Challenge Mode dungeons.', '<h1><strong>MoP Classic Platinum Challenge Mode Boost</strong></h1><p>Platinum Challenge Modes are the ultimate test of skill in World of Warcraft: Mists of Pandaria Classic. While Gold rating was previously the standard for prestige, Platinum difficulty pushes dungeon running to an entirely new level. These runs require absolute perfection, coordinated team compositions, and specific consumable usage to beat significantly tighter timers.</p><p>For most players, achieving a Platinum rating is a daunting task that requires weeks of practice and frustration. By choosing the <strong>misti.services</strong> Platinum Challenge Mode Boost, you skip the stress of finding a capable group and jump straight to the rewards. Our elite teams manage the complex pulls and cooldown rotations, guaranteeing you the specific loot, coins, and achievements you need.</p><h2><strong>Rewards:</strong></h2><ul><li>Selected dungeons completed with <strong>Platinum </strong>result;</li><li>Platinum Coins to exchange for class themed transmogs, as well as toys, mounts, and more;</li><li><a href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/achievement=61991/challenge-conqueror-platinum-season-3" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">Challenge Conqueror: Platinum (Season 3)</a> achievement;</li><li>Mount <a href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=90045/ancestral-phoenix-egg#" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">Ancestral Phoenix Egg</a>;</li><li>Title <a href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/title/the-undaunted-314#" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">the Undaunted</a>;</li><li>Teleport to all dungeons.</li></ul><h2><strong>Why Purchase a Platinum CM Carry?</strong></h2><p>Platinum runs are unforgiving. A single accidental death or a missed interrupt can ruin a timer, forcing the group to reset the entire dungeon. Organizing a group that has the gear, patience, and skill to hit these times can be nearly impossible in the Group Finder.</p><p>Our service eliminates the headache. We provide a professional, wipe-free experience that secures your rewards before the season ends. Whether you are looking to unlock rare utility toys or farm Platinum Coins for prestige cosmetics, we handle the execution so you can enjoy the results.</p><h2><strong>Exclusive Platinum Challenge Mode Toys</strong></h2><p>In MoP Classic, Blizzard has introduced a tier of rewards exclusive to Platinum achievers. These aren''t just cosmetic; many of these toys offer powerful utility effects (like Bloodlust, Invisibility, or crowd control) that can be used by any class inside Challenge Mode dungeons.</p><p>When you complete specific dungeons with us, you unlock their corresponding rewards:</p><ul><li><strong>Temple of the Jade Serpent:</strong> Unlocks <strong>Platinum Boots of Expeditious Retreat</strong>. This gives non-Engineers a massive speed boost similar to Nitro Boosts.</li><li><strong>Stormstout Brewery:</strong> Unlocks <strong>Platinum "Little Ale"</strong>. This provides a 30% Haste buff (Drunken Inspiration) for 40 seconds, effectively giving you a personal Heroism/Bloodlust.</li><li><strong>Gate of the Setting Sun:</strong> Unlocks <strong>Platinum Rod of Ambershaping</strong>. Allows any class to encase a target in amber, serving as a powerful crowd control tool.</li><li><strong>Shado-Pan Monastery:</strong> Unlocks <strong>Platinum Potion of Invisibility</strong>. Grants 18 seconds of invisibility, perfect for skipping trash packs.</li><li><strong>Siege of Niuzao Temple:</strong> Unlocks <strong>Platinum Amber</strong>. A massive restorative item that heals health and mana rapidly, acting like a personal Lay on Hands.</li><li><strong>Mogu’shan Palace:</strong> Unlocks <strong>Platinum Battle Horn</strong>. Pulls enemies within 40 yards, essential for speed-clearing and gathering mobs quickly.</li><li><strong>Scholomance:</strong> Unlocks <strong>Platinum Vial of Polyformic Acid</strong>. Transforms you and provides a damage buff for the duration of the dungeon.</li><li><strong>Scarlet Halls:</strong> Unlocks <strong>Platinum Battle Banner</strong>. Summons a Crusader to take aggro and then vanish, saving you from death.</li><li><strong>Scarlet Monastery:</strong> Unlocks <strong>Platinum Sacrificial Dagger</strong>. A unique cosmetic item tied to the lore of the Isle of Thunder.</li></ul><h2><strong>Platinum Coins and Prestige Rewards</strong></h2><p>Beyond the dungeon-specific toys, completing runs on Platinum difficulty awards you with Platinum Coins. This is a prestige currency used at the Shrine of Two Moons or Shrine of Seven Stars.</p><p>You can exchange these coins for high-end collectibles, including exclusive transmog sets, unique tabards, and rare mounts. Every timed Platinum run increases your coin count, bringing you closer to completing your collection.</p><h2><strong>Seasonal Mounts and Titles</strong></h2><p>Challenge Modes operate on a seasonal basis, and rewards are time-sensitive. Completing all dungeons at Platinum level Rank 1 grants you unique titles and mounts that may become unobtainable once the season concludes.</p><ul><li><strong>Season 1:</strong> Title "The Mistwalker" and the Reins of the Celestial Tiger.</li><li><strong>Season 2:</strong> Title "Mistborne" and the Reins of the Celestial Serpent for Realm Best Timer.</li></ul><p>With <strong>misti.services</strong>, you ensure that you don''t miss out on these limited-time bragging rights.</p><h2><strong>Platinum Timer Targets</strong></h2><p>To achieve Platinum, our teams must beat the following specific time thresholds for Season 1:</p><ul><li><strong>Temple of the Jade Serpent</strong>: 8m 30s</li><li><strong>Stormstout Brewery</strong>: 6m 30s</li><li><strong>Gate of the Setting Sun</strong>: 5m 30s</li><li><strong>Shado-Pan Monastery</strong>: 10m 30s</li><li><strong>Siege of Niuzao Temple</strong>: 10m 15s</li><li><strong>Mogu’shan Palace</strong>: 6m 45s</li><li><strong>Scholomance</strong>: 7m 15s</li><li><strong>Scarlet Halls</strong>: 4m 15s</li><li><strong>Scarlet Monastery</strong>: 5m 30s</li></ul><h2><strong>Why Choose misti.services?</strong></h2><p>We prioritize security and efficiency. Our roster consists of top-tier Classic players who know every skip and mechanic required to beat the Platinum clock. We do not use bots, scripts, or automation. All gameplay is 100% manual. If you choose a piloted service, we utilize VPNs to match your local region, ensuring the safety of your account.</p><p>Don''t waste time wiping in pug groups. Buy your Platinum Challenge Mode boost today and dominate the leaderboards with <strong>misti.services</strong>.</p>', '<ul><li>Select your desired options (Full 9/9 clear or specific dungeons).</li><li>Choose between Piloted (we play your character) or Self-Play (you play your character).</li><li>After payment, we will contact you to schedule your run.</li><li>Our team completes the dungeons within the Platinum timer.</li><li>You receive all toys, achievements, Valor, and Platinum Coins associated with the service.</li></ul>', '<ul><li>Active World of Warcraft subscription</li><li>Level 90 character</li><li>463 item level gear gemmed and enchanted</li></ul>', 0.8, 'https://kdjlhibxxygfdmlvdfcl.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/game-images/lmcyizkt2ch.webp', NULL, 4.9, 0, true, true, 0, '2025-11-25T20:13:57.369428+00:00', '2025-12-16T20:05:21.176486+00:00', 'cfe09cfd-59e3-467e-bbcd-f3b0373cdc84', false, NULL, true, 0, '15 minutes', 'average start time', 'Flexible', 'order completion', 'Secure your Platinum Challenge Mode rewards in MoP Classic. Get exclusive toys, Platinum Coins, and seasonal mounts with our professional boost.', 'MoP Classic Platinum Challenge Mode boost, buy WoW Platinum CM carry, Platinum challenge mode rewards, MoP Classic platinum toys, platinum coins farm, misti.services challenge mode, Mistborne boost, Mistborne carry,Mistborne mop boost ,Mistborne title , wow Mistborne season 2', NULL, NULL, ' Platinum Challenge Mode ', 'MoP Classic Platinum Challenge | misti.services', NULL);
INSERT INTO public.products (id, name, slug, short_description, description, how_it_works, requirements, base_price, image_url, badge_text, trust_score, total_reviews, is_active, is_featured, sort_order, created_at, updated_at, category_id, is_slider_product, slider_config, is_manually_popular, total_sales, start_time_text, start_time_value, delivery_text, delivery_value, meta_description, meta_keywords, og_image, canonical_url, image_alt_text, meta_title, parent_link) VALUES ('0be7b565-bae7-460f-94ad-035458d010d3', 'Beast in the Ice', 'beast-in-the-ice', 'Defeat the Beast in the Ice in Diablo 4 with Misti Services. Get Mythics, Uniques, and exclusive mount trophies quickly and safely.', '<h1><strong>Diablo 4 Beast in the Ice Boost</strong></h1><p>Defeat the <a href="https://www.wowhead.com/diablo-4/guide/world-boss-beast-in-ice" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank"><strong>Beast in the Ice</strong></a>, one of Diablo 4’s toughest endgame bosses, with Misti Services. This boost guarantees a full Torment kill and instant access to all rewards, including Mythic and Ancestral Uniques, gold, and mount cosmetics like the Skull Torch and Fell Steed Trophies. Our expert team handles all summoning, preparation, and mechanics, allowing you to enjoy the loot without the grind.</p><p>Ideal for players farming Mythics, Distilled Fear, or rare cosmetics tied to high-tier encounters.</p><h3>What’s Included</h3><ul><li>Complete Beast in the Ice kill on Torment difficulty</li><li>Lair Boss Key provided for guaranteed loot access</li><li>Chance to obtain Mythic and Ancestral Unique items</li><li>Up to six Uniques and multiple Runes per encounter</li><li>Chance to unlock Skull Torch and Fell Steed mount trophies</li><li>All gold, gems, and crafting materials remain on your account</li></ul><h3>Boost Options Explained</h3><ul><li>Discount available if you already own Lair Boss Keys</li><li>Unlock Torment difficulty for enhanced drop chances</li><li>Option to stream your full Beast in the Ice carry</li></ul><h3>About the Diablo 4 Beast in the Ice Boost Service</h3><p>The Beast in the Ice is a key Lair Boss in Diablo 4’s endgame, found within the Glacial Fissure in the Fractured Peaks. This frost-infused monster drops some of the game’s most powerful Uniques and Mythics, as well as exclusive mount cosmetics. It’s also an essential step for collecting materials required for summoning Uber Andariel.</p><p>Our Beast in the Ice Boost service eliminates the need for farming Tier 30+ Nightmare Dungeons or collecting Distilled Fear manually. We handle everything — from sigil crafting to summoning — ensuring a clean, efficient kill and maximum loot.</p><h3>Beast in the Ice Location</h3><p>The Beast in the Ice resides inside the Glacial Fissure dungeon, located in the Desolate Highlands of the Fractured Peaks, south of Kyovashad. Once you reach a Torment World Tier, you can challenge this boss directly.</p><p>With Misti Services, you skip travel and setup — we teleport you straight to the fight.</p><h3>How to Summon the Beast in the Ice</h3><p>To summon the Beast, enter the Glacial Fissure and activate the altar to begin the battle. To unlock the Beast’s Hoard afterward, you need twelve Distilled Fear — a material obtained from high-tier Nightmare Dungeons.</p><p>All summoning items, Distilled Fear, and setup are included in our boost, so you can jump straight into the rewards.</p><h3>Why Buy a Diablo 4 Beast in the Ice Boost</h3><p>Farming and summoning the Beast solo demands advanced gear, resistances, and resource management. With Misti Services, you skip these requirements and get guaranteed results. Enjoy fast kills, premium loot, and full account safety — without any farming or stress.</p><h3>Why Choose Misti Services for Beast Carries</h3><ul><li>Fast and reliable Beast in the Ice kills</li><li>Secure service across all platforms</li><li>Selfplay and piloted options available</li><li>All materials and Distilled Fear provided</li><li>Trusted by thousands of Diablo 4 players</li></ul><p>Misti Services delivers safe, efficient, and fully optimized Beast in the Ice runs — letting you claim Mythics, cosmetics, and rare loot in record time.</p>', '<ul><li>Select your desired options and complete your order on&nbsp;Misti.Services.</li><li>You’ll receive an order confirmation and tracking number via email.</li><li>Our support manager will contact you through live chat to confirm all details.</li><li>If you’re unavailable, we’ll reach out via email or your preferred contact method.</li><li>When the boost is finished, you’ll receive a completion notification on Discord or another messenger of your choice.</li></ul><p><br></p>', '<ul><li>Level 60 character.</li><li>Torment IV difficulty unlocked.</li><li>Main campaign or Vessel of Hatred completed.</li></ul><p>Need help leveling? Check our&nbsp;<a href="https://misti.services/game/buy-diablo-iv-boost/leveling" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank" style="color: rgb(250, 250, 250);">Diablo IV Leveling Boost</a></p>', 0, 'https://kdjlhibxxygfdmlvdfcl.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/game-images/beast-in-the-ice-1762540712871.webp', NULL, 4.9, 350, true, true, 0, '2025-11-05T03:17:35.035409+00:00', '2025-12-16T00:25:11.904935+00:00', 'c75b3391-ab33-45c3-8a4d-dae85a5a6e7c', true, '{"step":1,"max_value":100,"min_value":5,"slider_type":"single","value_label":"Numbers of Kills","default_value":5,"pricing_brackets":[{"end":100,"price":0.88,"start":1}],"estimated_time_per_step":0.5}', true, 0, '15 minutes', 'average start time', 'Flexible', 'order completion', 'Defeat the Beast in the Ice in Diablo 4 with Misti Services. Get Mythics, Uniques, and exclusive mount trophies quickly and safely.', 'diablo 4 beast in the ice, d4 beast in the ice boost, beast in the ice carry service, diablo 4 mythics farming, d4 uniques farming, beast in the ice mount trophies, diablo 4 boss defeat service, fast beast in the ice kill, safe d4 boss farming, buy beast in the ice boost, diablo 4 misti services, beast in the ice professional help', 'https://kdjlhibxxygfdmlvdfcl.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/game-images/beast-in-the-ice-1762540712871.webp', NULL, 'Beast In The Ice', 'Defeat Beast in the Ice D4 Boss | misti.services', NULL);
INSERT INTO public.products (id, name, slug, short_description, description, how_it_works, requirements, base_price, image_url, badge_text, trust_score, total_reviews, is_active, is_featured, sort_order, created_at, updated_at, category_id, is_slider_product, slider_config, is_manually_popular, total_sales, start_time_text, start_time_value, delivery_text, delivery_value, meta_description, meta_keywords, og_image, canonical_url, image_alt_text, meta_title, parent_link) VALUES ('9dd3bb46-dfed-46cd-b180-bf9d52fdf206', 'Delves Boost', 'delves-boost', 'Buy WoW Delves Boost from Misti Services to complete The War Within Delves quickly and earn top gear and rewards with professional boosters.', '<h1><strong>WoW Delves Boost</strong></h1><p>Buy the WoW Delves Boost service from Misti Services to conquer <a href="https://www.wowhead.com/guide/the-war-within/delves-overview" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank"><strong>The War Within Delves</strong></a> effortlessly. Our professional boosters complete any Delve at any difficulty tier, helping you earn the highest item level gear, rare rewards, and valuable currencies without the grind.</p><h3>What’s Included</h3><ul><li>Completion of any number of Delves on your selected difficulty tier</li><li>High-level gear from Bountiful Delves and weekly Great Vault rewards</li><li>A chance to obtain Delver’s Bounty, extra gear, gold, cosmetics, and other valuable items</li><li>All loot and drops collected during the boost</li></ul><h3>Boost Options</h3><p><strong>Piloted:</strong> A professional player logs into your account and completes the Delve.</p><p><strong>Selfplay:</strong> Join our team and play alongside experienced boosters.</p><p><strong>Remote Control:</strong> Our player connects securely through a remote control app so you can watch the entire run live.</p><p>You can also choose the specific Delve, tier, and run type you want completed.</p><h3>About Delves in The War Within</h3><p>Delves are a new form of endgame content in The War Within expansion. Designed for solo players or small groups, each Delve offers a fast, action-packed adventure that rewards gear, currency, and cosmetics. You’ll also be joined by an NPC companion, such as Brann Bronzebeard, who assists as a Tank, Healer, or Combat ally depending on your group setup.</p><p>Each Delve provides unique scenarios and objectives that rotate weekly, keeping gameplay fresh and rewarding. Completing them unlocks powerful loot, achievements, and progression for your companion.</p><h3>Delve Tiers and Progression</h3><p>Delves increase in difficulty across multiple tiers. As you progress, you unlock higher tiers, better loot, and more challenging encounters. Misti Services can help you clear any tier quickly so you can focus on gearing up and enjoying the game rather than grinding.</p><h3>Delve Locations</h3><p>Delves take place across several zones, each with its own story and challenges. You’ll explore areas such as the Isle of Dorn, the Ringing Deeps, Hallowfall, Azj-Kahet, Undermine, and K’aresh. Each location offers distinct enemies, bosses, and rewards.</p><h3>Companions and Rewards</h3><p>Your Delve companion grows stronger as you progress. Companions can equip Curios found in end chests, gather materials, and support your team in combat. Rewards include class-specific high-level gear, Undercoin, Resonance Crystals, cosmetics, and mounts. Higher tiers yield even greater rewards, making them worth completing with our boost service.</p><h3>The Great Vault and Weekly Rewards</h3><p>Completing Delves contributes to your Great Vault progress, unlocking world activity reward slots each week. With our WoW Delves Boost, you can reach the maximum Vault potential quickly and secure top-tier gear every reset.</p><h3>Why Choose Misti Services</h3><p>Misti Services offers fast, safe, and professional WoW Delves Boosting. Our team consists of expert players who ensure efficient completion of any tier or zone. Whether you prefer piloted, selfplay, or remote boosting, we guarantee smooth communication, full transparency, and complete satisfaction.</p><p>Skip the grind and enjoy the rewards—order your WoW Delves Boost today from Misti Services and take your gameplay to the next level.</p>', '<ol><li>Choose your desired reputation level and place your order.</li><li>Receive a confirmation email and your order number.</li><li>Our support manager contacts you via chat or email to confirm details.</li><li>A professional booster is assigned and begins the process immediately.</li><li>Once complete, you’ll be notified through your preferred messenger, such as Discord.</li></ol><p>Afterward, enjoy your new Venture Co. reputation level and the exclusive rewards that come with it.</p>', '<p>Before starting your boost, make sure you have:</p><ul><li>An active&nbsp;<em>World of Warcraft</em>&nbsp;account.</li><li>A character at level 80.</li><li>The chosen tier must be unlocked for completion</li></ul><p>If you’re not at the required level, Misti Services can help you prepare quickly with our&nbsp;<a href="https://misti.services/game/warwithin/leveling/wow-the-war-within-leveling" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank" style="color: rgb(250, 250, 250);">WoW Power Leveling Boost</a><a href="https://misti.services/game/warwithin/leveling/wow-the-war-within-leveling" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank" style="color: rgb(60, 113, 221);">.</a></p>', 0, 'https://kdjlhibxxygfdmlvdfcl.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/game-images/delves-boost-1762640495711.webp', NULL, 4.9, 350, true, true, 0, '2025-10-28T19:35:39.235597+00:00', '2025-12-16T07:20:36.418694+00:00', '4aafc243-7ee4-4ce1-9bd9-7f08e98d3b67', false, NULL, true, 0, '15 minutes', 'average start time', '30 min', 'order completion', 'Buy WoW Delves Boost from Misti Services to complete The War Within Delves quickly and earn top gear and rewards with professional boosters.', 'wow delves boost, buy delves boost, the war within delves carry, fast wow delves completion, delves top gear boost, professional wow delves service, misti services delves, delves rewards boost, war within delves farm, cheap wow delves run, buy tww delves, delves power leveling, wow delves professional boosters', 'https://kdjlhibxxygfdmlvdfcl.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/game-images/delves-boost-1762640495711.webp', NULL, 'Delves Boost', 'War Within Delves Boost - Fast & Easy | misti.services', NULL);
