rong></h2><p>The Battle Pass is the main seasonal progression system in Destiny Rising, packed with exclusive materials, cosmetics, and the featured Seasonal Exotic weapon. Maximizing your pass early provides a competitive advantage and ensures you don’t miss limited-time rewards before the Act ends.</p><h2><strong>Why the Battle Pass Matters</strong></h2><ul><li><strong>Seasonal Exotic Weapon Access</strong> – Earn the powerful Exotic of the season</li><li><strong>Essential Upgrade Materials</strong> – Ascension Cells, Incandescence Tufts, Ribbons, and more</li><li><strong>Exclusive Cosmetics</strong> – Time-limited ornaments, skins, and premium visuals</li></ul><p>The seasonal Battle Pass is the most reliable and consolidated source of power, style, and progression materials.</p><h2><strong>Efficient Battle Pass Leveling Strategy</strong></h2><p>The most effective approach to Battle Pass leveling is to consistently reach the weekly XP cap. Prioritizing Weekly Quests while simultaneously progressing long-term Act Quests creates stacking XP gains and ensures full completion before the season ends. Our experts follow this optimized method for maximum speed and efficiency.</p><h2><strong>Why Choose misti.services</strong></h2><ul><li>Proven XP-optimized routes and progression specialists</li><li>Guaranteed completion of selected Battle Pass tiers</li><li>Fast start times and 24/7 customer support</li><li>Trusted boosting provider with years of industry experience and thousands of satisfied customers</li></ul><p>Dominate the season without the grind—misti.services delivers fast, secure, and guaranteed Battle Pass leveling for Destiny Rising.</p>', '<ul><li>Choose your current and target Battle Pass level and place your order</li><li>A pro booster is assigned and your order is confirmed</li><li>We complete Battle Pass progression and objectives</li><li>You receive an update and can log back in once finished</li><li>Enjoy your seasonal rewards and continue your journey fully geared</li></ul>', '<ul><li>Active Destiny Rising account</li><li>Purchased Premium Battle Pass to receive premium tier rewards</li></ul>', 0, 'https://kdjlhibxxygfdmlvdfcl.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/game-images/destiny-rising-battle-pass-leveling-service-1762208071423.webp', NULL, 4.9, 0, true, true, 0, '2025-11-02T20:56:58.139021+00:00', '2025-12-16T00:22:55.767644+00:00', 'eae13024-9541-478f-9b37-504aff915c1a', true, '{"step":1,"end_label":"Desired Level","max_value":50,"min_value":1,"default_end":20,"start_label":"Start Level","default_start":1,"pricing_brackets":[{"end":50,"price":159,"start":1}],"estimated_time_per_step":0.2}', true, 0, '15 minutes', 'average start time', 'Flexible', 'order completion', 'Destiny Rising Battle Pass Leveling Service Skip the grind and unlock every Destiny Rising Battle Pass reward with our professional leveling service.', 'destiny rising battle pass boost, destiny rising battle pass levels, destiny rising xp cap service, destiny rising exotic weapon unlock, destiny rising cosmetic unlock, destiny rising progression materials, destiny rising weekly quests boost, destiny rising act quests service, buy destiny rising battle pass, cheap destiny rising boost, fast destiny rising battle pass, professional destiny rising leveling, destiny rising season rewards, destiny rising tier skip', 'https://kdjlhibxxygfdmlvdfcl.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/game-images/destiny-rising-battle-pass-leveling-service-1762208071423.webp', NULL, 'Destiny Rising Battle Pass Leveling Service', 'Destiny Rising Battle Pass Leveling | misti.services', NULL);
INSERT INTO public.products (id, name, slug, short_description, description, how_it_works, requirements, base_price, image_url, badge_text, trust_score, total_reviews, is_active, is_featured, sort_order, created_at, updated_at, category_id, is_slider_product, slider_config, is_manually_popular, total_sales, start_time_text, start_time_value, delivery_text, delivery_value, meta_description, meta_keywords, og_image, canonical_url, image_alt_text, meta_title, parent_link) VALUES ('35de5914-0bf3-4035-ac09-e3d53bacca41', 'The Shado-Pan', 'the-shado-pan', 'Boost your Shado-Pan reputation fast in WoW Mists of Pandaria Classic with Misti Services and unlock elite mounts, gear, and faction rewards.', '<h1><strong>The Shado-Pan Reputation Boost</strong></h1><p><a href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/guide/reputation/shado-pan-quests-quartermaster-rewards" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank"><strong>The Shado-Pan</strong></a> are Pandaria’s elite defenders, sworn to protect the land from the Sha and other dark threats. Gaining their trust unlocks powerful mounts, high-level gear, and exclusive achievements. With Misti Services, you can skip the repetitive daily grind and reach Exalted with The Shado-Pan quickly and safely.</p><h3>How to Earn Reputation with The Shado-Pan</h3><p>Reputation with The Shado-Pan in World of Warcraft: Mists of Pandaria Classic is primarily gained through daily quests at the Shado-Pan Garrison in the Townlong Steppes. These dailies focus on battling the Sha, defeating mantid enemies, and assisting elite Shado-Pan members in dangerous missions across Pandaria.</p><p>Completing these daily quests rewards reputation, gold, and Valor Points. As you progress, additional questlines and companions become available, offering variety and lore-rich experiences.</p><h3>Unlocking the Shado-Pan Dailies</h3><p>To unlock The Shado-Pan daily quests, players must first reach Revered with the <strong>Golden Lotus</strong> faction. Once this requirement is met, you’ll gain access to the Shado-Pan Garrison and its daily quest board.</p><p>Each day, you can choose one of three elite Shado-Pan companions to accompany you on your missions. Each companion has unique dialogue, skills, and challenges that make the grind more engaging.</p><h3>Reputation Boosting Tips</h3><p>Since Shado-Pan reputation relies on daily quests, using temporary buffs and perks is essential for faster progress. Popular options include:</p><ul><li><strong>Darkmoon Faire – WHEE!</strong> (+10% reputation for 1 hour)</li><li><strong>Hallow’s End – Unburdened or Grim Visage</strong> (+10% for 2 hours)</li><li><strong>Pilgrim’s Bounty – Spirit of Sharing</strong> (+10% for 1 hour)</li><li><strong>Guild Perk – Mr. Popularity</strong> (+10% reputation bonus)</li></ul><p>Combining these bonuses with all available daily quests ensures steady and efficient reputation gains.</p><h3>Shado-Pan Rewards</h3><p>Earning reputation with The Shado-Pan grants access to some of the most prestigious rewards in Pandaria:</p><ul><li><strong>Honored:</strong> Access to profession patterns, gear upgrades, and trinkets</li><li><strong>Revered:</strong> High-level armor, weapons, and unique tabards</li><li><strong>Exalted:</strong> The <em>Reins of the Onyx Cloud Serpent</em> and <em>Blue Shado-Pan Riding Tiger</em>, as well as cosmetic helmets and exclusive titles</li></ul><p>Reaching Exalted with The Shado-Pan also contributes to Pandaria’s faction achievements and unlocks storylines tied to Taran Zhu and the defense of the Vale.</p><h3>Why Choose Misti Services for Your Shado-Pan Boost</h3><p>Misti Services offers a safe, fast, and professional way to earn reputation with The Shado-Pan in WoW Mists of Pandaria Classic. Our expert boosters handle the daily quests and companion rotations so you can reach Exalted without the grind. Enjoy exclusive mounts, elite gear, and achievements with minimal effort and maximum efficiency.</p>', '<ul><li>Select your desired options and complete your order on&nbsp;Misti.Services.</li><li>You’ll receive an order confirmation and tracking number via email.</li><li>Our support manager will contact you through live chat to confirm all details.</li><li>If you’re unavailable, we’ll reach out via email or your preferred contact method.</li><li>When the boost is finished, you’ll receive a completion notification on Discord or another messenger of your choice.</li></ul>', '<ul><li>Active World of Warcraft subscription</li><li>Level 90 character</li></ul><p>Need help reaching level 90? Try our&nbsp;<a href="https://misti.services/game/wow-mistsofpandaria-classic" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank" style="color: rgb(60, 113, 221);">WoW Power Leveling Boost</a>&nbsp;</p>', 0, 'https://kdjlhibxxygfdmlvdfcl.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/game-images/the-shado-pan-1763237213129.webp', NULL, 4.9, 350, true, true, 0, '2025-11-02T20:40:13.713497+00:00', '2025-12-16T07:51:32.88196+00:00', 'eef98e08-1b65-4858-859f-5418bbab5fa2', false, NULL, true, 0, '15 minutes', 'average start time', 'Flexible', 'order completion', 'Boost your Shado-Pan reputation fast in WoW Mists of Pandaria Classic with Misti Services and unlock elite mounts, gear, and faction rewards.', 'shado-pan reputation boost, mists of pandaria classic shado-pan, wow mop classic shado-pan, buy shado-pan rep, fast shado-pan reputation, shado-pan faction rewards, unlock shado-pan mounts, shado-pan gear boost, mop classic reputation farm, misti services shado-pan, wow classic pandaria reputation, shado-pan exalted, buy mop classic rep, shado-pan reputation farm service', 'https://kdjlhibxxygfdmlvdfcl.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/game-images/the-shado-pan-1763237213129.webp', NULL, 'The Shado Pan', 'Shado-Pan Rep Boost WoW MoP Classic | misti.services', NULL);
