ers of Malevolence in Kurast, this powerful projection of Mephisto requires Torment difficulty and multiple Abhorrent Hearts to summon. Defeating him grants access to the Hoard of Hatred—a loot chest with guaranteed Uniques, Mythic chances, and valuable crafting materials.</p><p>Our service eliminates the need to grind for Hearts or keys, letting you skip straight to the fight and enjoy top-tier rewards.</p><h3>Why You Should Defeat the Harbinger</h3><p>The Hoard of Hatred offers some of the best loot in Diablo 4. Each completion provides guaranteed Uniques, a chance for Mythic Uniques, Runes, and rare crafting resources. The chest also drops Abhorrent Hearts used for future summons and seasonal upgrades. This makes the Harbinger one of the most rewarding bosses for endgame progression.</p><h3>What You Get with the Harbinger Boost</h3><p>Misti Services handles everything: summoning, boss kill, and Hoard unlock. We supply the Lair Key and required Hearts, so there’s no need to farm beforehand. You can play alongside our team or let us complete the task safely on your account. The process is secure, fast, and leaves all rewards intact on your profile.</p><h3>Unlocking the Hoard of Hatred</h3><p>Opening the Hoard requires Abhorrent Hearts, typically obtained from Urivar’s Hoard or endgame events. These are included in our boost, ensuring you access your rewards immediately. Inside, you’ll find multiple Uniques, Mythic drop chances, and endgame gear tied to your chosen loot table.</p><h3>Why Choose Misti Services for Harbinger Boost</h3><ul><li>Fast and reliable Harbinger kills</li><li>Secure manual boosting with VPN protection</li><li>Guaranteed loot and included keys and Hearts</li><li>Flexible options for self-play or piloted runs</li><li>No farming or setup required</li><li>Experienced boosters with thousands of successful completions</li></ul><p>Misti Services delivers a professional, safe, and efficient Harbinger boost that saves time while maximizing your loot and progression.</p>', '<ul><li>Select your desired options and complete your order on&nbsp;Misti.Services.</li><li>You’ll receive an order confirmation and tracking number via email.</li><li>Our support manager will contact you through live chat to confirm all details.</li><li>If you’re unavailable, we’ll reach out via email or your preferred contact method.</li><li>When the boost is finished, you’ll receive a completion notification on Discord or another messenger of your choice.</li></ul>', '<ul><li>Level 60 character.</li><li>Torment IV difficulty unlocked.</li><li>Main campaign or Vessel of Hatred completed.</li></ul><p>Need help leveling? Check our&nbsp;<a href="https://misti.services/game/buy-diablo-iv-boost/leveling" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank" style="color: rgb(250, 250, 250);">Diablo IV Leveling Boost</a></p>', 0, 'https://kdjlhibxxygfdmlvdfcl.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/game-images/diablo-harbinger-of-hatred-boost-1762542235457.webp', NULL, 4.9, 350, true, true, 0, '2025-11-05T02:47:48.861801+00:00', '2025-12-16T00:25:11.156703+00:00', 'c75b3391-ab33-45c3-8a4d-dae85a5a6e7c', true, '{"step":1,"max_value":100,"min_value":5,"slider_type":"single","value_label":"Numbers of Kills","default_value":5,"pricing_brackets":[{"end":100,"price":0.88,"start":1}],"estimated_time_per_step":0.5}', true, 0, '15 minutes', 'average start time', 'Flexible', 'order completion', 'Defeat the Harbinger of Hatred fast with Misti Services. Unlock Mythic loot and the Hoard of Hatred safely and efficiently in Diablo 4.', 'harbinger of hatred boost, diablo 4 harbinger of hatred, hoard of hatred unlock, mythic loot diablo 4, misti services harbinger, defeat harbinger of hatred, diablo 4 boss defeat service, fast harbinger of hatred, efficient harbinger of hatred, buy harbinger of hatred boost, safe diablo 4 service, harbinger of hatred farming, diablo 4 hoard of hatred, professional diablo 4 boost', 'https://kdjlhibxxygfdmlvdfcl.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public