st complete the introductory questline from the Shrine of Two Moons, which leads to the Isle of Thunder. This unlocks the Sunreaver Onslaught base and daily quests.</p><p>As the campaign progresses, new areas and objectives become available, expanding the types of missions you can complete for additional reputation. Each new phase offers better rewards and deeper story content.</p><h3>Reputation Boosting Tips</h3><p>You can speed up your Sunreaver Onslaught reputation gains using event bonuses and guild perks:</p><ul><li><strong>Darkmoon Faire – WHEE!</strong> (+10% reputation for 1 hour)</li><li><strong>Hallow’s End – Unburdened or Grim Visage</strong> (+10% for 2 hours)</li><li><strong>Pilgrim’s Bounty – Spirit of Sharing</strong> (+10% for 1 hour)</li><li><strong>Guild Perk – Mr. Popularity</strong> (+10% reputation bonus)</li></ul><p>Completing all available daily quests each day and participating in the island’s scenario events helps reach Exalted status faster.</p><h3>The Sunreaver Onslaught Rewards</h3><p>Reaching higher reputation levels with the Sunreaver Onslaught grants access to valuable items and collectibles:</p><ul><li><strong>Honored:</strong> Profession recipes, trinkets, and improved gear</li><li><strong>Revered:</strong> Epic-quality armor, vanity items, and crafting materials</li><li><strong>Exalted:</strong> The <em>Reins of the Crimson Primal Direhorn</em> mount, Sunreaver Tabard, and achievements from the Isle of Thunder campaign</li></ul><p>Players who reach Exalted can also purchase unique mounts and unlock vendors offering elite-quality equipment.</p><h3>Why Choose Misti Services for Your Sunreaver Onslaught Boost</h3><p>Misti Services provides a fast, professional, and secure way to earn reputation with The Sunreaver Onslaught in WoW Mists of Pandaria Classic. Our expert team handles all daily quests and campaign progress, ensuring you reach Exalted efficiently. Enjoy the mounts, storylines, and powerful rewards while we take care of the grind.</p>', '<ul><li>Select your desired options and complete your order on&nbsp;Misti.Services.</li><li>You’ll receive an order confirmation and tracking number via email.</li><li>Our support manager will contact you through live chat to confirm all details.</li><li>If you’re unavailable, we’ll reach out via email or your preferred contact method.</li><li>When the boost is finished, you’ll receive a completion notification on Discord or another messenger of your choice.</li></ul>', '<ul><li>Active World of Warcraft subscription</li><li>Level 90 character</li></ul><p>Need help reaching level 90? Try our&nbsp;<a href="https://misti.services/game/wow-mistsofpandaria-classic" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank" style="color: rgb(60, 113, 221);">WoW Power Leveling Boost</a>&nbsp;</p>', 0, 'https://kdjlhibxxygfdmlvdfcl.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/game-images/the-sunreaver-onslaught-1763238028949.webp', NULL, 4.9, 350, true, true, 0, '2025-11-02T21:25:36.567417+00:00', '2025-12-16T07:51:34.467411+00:00', 'eef98e08-1b65-4858-859f-5418bbab5fa2', false, NULL, true, 0, '15 minutes', 'average start time', 'Flexible', 'order completion', 'Boost your Sunreaver Onslaught reputation fast in WoW Mists of Pandaria Classic with Misti Services and unlock epic mounts, gear, and rewards.', 'sunreaver onslaught reputation boost, wow mop classic sunreaver onslaught, mists of pandaria classic sunreaver rep farm, buy sunreaver onslaught boost, fast sunreaver onslaught rep, wow classic mop sunreaver rewards, unlock sunreaver onslaught mounts, sunreaver onslaught gear farm, mop classic reputation services, professional sunreaver onslaught boost, cheap sunreaver onslaught rep, misti services sunreaver boost, wow mop classic rep grind, sunreaver onslaught reputation farm', 'https://kdjlhibxxygfdmlvdfcl.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/game-images/the-sunreaver-onslaught-1763238028949.webp', NULL, 'The Sunreaver Onslaught', 'WoW MoP Sunreaver Onslaught Rep Boost | misti.servic