nly</p></li></ul><p>Need help reaching level 60? Try our&nbsp;<a target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" href="https://misti.services/game/wow-classic-era/leveling">WoW Power Leveling Boost&nbsp;</a></p>', 125.36, 'https://kdjlhibxxygfdmlvdfcl.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/game-images/pre-raid-gear-1762693539226.webp', NULL, 4.9, 350, true, true, 0, '2025-10-26T23:39:23.785708+00:00', '2026-01-14T22:04:09.444455+00:00', 'c8f7f940-3d2e-4aa9-9667-723bf93a444a', false, NULL, true, 0, '15 minutes', 'average start time', 'Flexible', 'order completion', 'Buy WoW Classic Pre-Raid Gear Boost at misti.services and get full 55+ ilvl dungeon gear fast and safely for your class and specialization.', 'wow classic pre-raid gear, buy wow classic pre-raid gear, wow classic 55+ ilvl gear boost, classic wow dungeon gear, pre-raid gear service wow classic, fast wow classic gear, safe wow classic gear boost, wow classic gear by class, wow classic gear by specialization, misti.services wow classic gear, classic wow pre-raid gear farm, buy classic wow dungeon gear, pre-raid gear boost classic, wow classic gear for sale, professional wow classic gear', 'https://kdjlhibxxygfdmlvdfcl.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/game-images/pre-raid-gear-1762693539226.webp', NULL, 'Pre Raid Gear', 'WoW Pre-Raid Gear Boost | misti.services', NULL);
