creatures. Examples include catching rare fish, collecting fishing bait, or defeating elite sea creatures. Each completed daily grants reputation, and with all quests available, you can reach Exalted status in a few weeks of steady play.</p><p>Players who wish to speed up the process can use reputation buffs and tokens or choose a professional boosting service like Misti Services for a faster, hassle-free experience.</p><h3>Nat Pagle Friendship Reputation</h3><p>In addition to standard faction reputation, Nat Pagle has his own friendship system that unlocks exclusive rewards. You can increase your friendship level with him by turning in rare fish such as <strong>Flying Tiger Gourami</strong>, <strong>Spinefish Alpha</strong>, and <strong>Swamphead Loach</strong>. These fish are found across Pandaria and can be turned in daily for extra standing with Nat.</p><h3>Extra Reputation Boosts</h3><p>Several items and event buffs can help increase reputation gains:</p><ul><li><strong>Darkmoon Faire – WHEE!</strong> (+10% reputation for 1 hour)</li><li><strong>Hallow’s End – Unburdened or Grim Visage</strong> (+10% for 2 hours)</li><li><strong>Pilgrim’s Bounty – Spirit of Sharing</strong> (+10% for 1 hour)</li><li><strong>Guild Perk – Mr. Popularity</strong> (+10% reputation)</li></ul><p>Using these bonuses together can significantly reduce the time required to reach Exalted.</p><h3>The Anglers Rewards</h3><p>Reputation with The Anglers unlocks a range of fishing-themed rewards and exclusive mounts:</p><ul><li><strong>Honored:</strong> Access to new fishing lures, bait, and consumables</li><li><strong>Revered:</strong> Unique fishing poles and related gear upgrades</li><li><strong>Exalted:</strong> Mounts such as the <em>Reins of the Azure Water Strider</em> and <em>Crimson Water Strider</em>, plus Nat Pagle’s fishing hat and vanity items</li></ul><p>Players who build friendship with Nat Pagle gain access to additional rewards and fishing-themed achievements.</p><h3>Why Choose Misti Services for Your Anglers Boost</h3><p>Misti Services provides a safe, efficient, and professional way to earn The Anglers reputation without the grind. Our experienced boosters handle the daily quests and fishing tasks, letting you enjoy the benefits, achievements, and mounts without the repetitive effort.</p>', '<ul><li>Select your desired options and complete your order on&nbsp;Misti.Services.</li><li>You’ll receive an order confirmation and tracking number via email.</li><li>Our support manager will contact you through live chat to confirm all details.</li><li>If you’re unavailable, we’ll reach out via email or your preferred contact method.</li><li>When the boost is finished, you’ll receive a completion notification on Discord or another messenger of your choice.</li></ul>', '<ul><li>Active World of Warcraft subscription</li><li>Level 90 character</li></ul><p>Need help reaching level 90? Try our&nbsp;<a href="https://misti.services/game/wow-mistsofpandaria-classic" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank" style="color: rgb(60, 113, 221);">WoW Power Leveling Boost</a>&nbsp;</p>', 0, 'https://kdjlhibxxygfdmlvdfcl.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/game-images/the-anglers-1763232376489.webp', NULL, 4.9, 350, true, true, 0, '2025-11-02T20:31:36.181549+00:00', '2025-12-16T07:51:35.218392+00:00', 'eef98e08-1b65-4858-859f-5418bbab5fa2', false, NULL, true, 0, '15 minutes', 'average start time', 'Flexible', 'order completion', 'Boost your Anglers reputation fast in WoW Mists of Pandaria Classic with Misti Services and unlock exclusive fishing rewards easily.', 'wow mists of pandaria classic the anglers reputation boost, mists of pandaria the anglers reputation farm, mop classic anglers rep service, fast anglers reputation mop classic, buy anglers rep boost wow classic, misti services anglers reputation, unlock anglers fishing rewards mop, anglers reputation guide wow classic, cheap anglers rep farming, mop classic anglers reputation vendor unlocks, professional anglers rep boost, wow mop classic fishing reputation, the anglers faction boost, the anglers exalted wow classic', 'https://kdjlhibxxygfdmlvdfcl.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/game-images/the-anglers-1763232376489.webp', NULL, 'The Anglers', 'WoW MoP Classic Anglers Rep Boost | misti.services', NULL);
