the Order of the Cloud Serpent Dailies</h3><p>To start, head to the Arboretum in the Jade Forest and speak with Instructor Skyserpent. You must have a minimum of <strong>225 Riding skill</strong> and be at least level 90. Accept the questline that introduces your personal serpent hatchling—choosing from jade, azure, or golden colors.</p><p>Once your serpent is hatched, you’ll unlock a variety of daily quests focused on training, feeding, racing, and defending your serpent from hostile mobs. Completing these dailies gradually builds reputation until you achieve Exalted status.</p><h3>Reputation Boosting Tips</h3><p>Progressing through The Order of the Cloud Serpent is fun but can take time. To make it faster, use reputation-boosting events and perks:</p><ul><li><strong>Darkmoon Faire – WHEE!</strong> (+10% reputation for 1 hour)</li><li><strong>Hallow’s End – Unburdened or Grim Visage</strong> (+10% for 2 hours)</li><li><strong>Pilgrim’s Bounty – Spirit of Sharing</strong> (+10% for 1 hour)</li><li><strong>Guild Perk – Mr. Popularity</strong> (+10% reputation bonus)</li></ul><p>You can also gain additional reputation by turning in Onyx Eggs found around Windward Isle. These rare items provide a significant boost and can greatly reduce your grind time.</p><h3>The Order of the Cloud Serpent Rewards</h3><p>The Order of the Cloud Serpent rewards players with some of the most iconic mounts and collectibles in Pandaria:</p><ul><li><strong>Honored:</strong> Profession recipes and serpent-related vanity items</li><li><strong>Revered:</strong> Additional serpent customization options and armor patterns</li><li><strong>Exalted:</strong> Mounts such as the <em>Reins of the Azure Cloud Serpent</em>, <em>Golden Cloud Serpent</em>, and <em>Jade Cloud Serpent</em></li></ul><p>Reaching Exalted also unlocks achievements tied to your serpent’s growth and mastery as a dragonrider.</p><h3>Why Choose Misti Services for Your Cloud Serpent Boost</h3><p>Misti Services provides a fast, safe, and reliable way to earn reputation with The Order of the Cloud Serpent in WoW Mists of Pandaria Classic. Our professional boosters handle all daily quests, egg farming, and training tasks so you can enjoy your Cloud Serpent mounts without the effort. Experience the joy of flight and prestige of the Pandaren sky—without the grind.</p>', '<ul><li>Select your desired options and complete your order on&nbsp;Misti.Services.</li><li>You’ll receive an order confirmation and tracking number via email.</li><li>Our support manager will contact you through live chat to confirm all details.</li><li>If you’re unavailable, we’ll reach out via email or your preferred contact method.</li><li>When the boost is finished, you’ll receive a completion notification on Discord or another messenger of your choice.</li></ul>', '<ul><li>Active World of Warcraft subscription</li><li>Level 90 character</li></ul><p>Need help reaching level 90? Try our&nbsp;<a href="https://misti.services/game/wow-mistsofpandaria-classic" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank" style="color: rgb(60, 113, 221);">WoW Power Leveling Boost</a>&nbsp;</p>', 0, 'https://kdjlhibxxygfdmlvdfcl.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/game-images/the-order-of-the-cloud-serpent-1763235318830.webp', NULL, 4.9, 350, true, true, 0, '2025-11-02T20:45:58.360713+00:00', '2025-12-16T07:51:36.703356+00:00', 'eef98e08-1b65-4858-859f-5418bbab5fa2', false, NULL, true, 0, '15 minutes', 'average start time', 'Flexible', 'order completion', 'Boost your Order of the Cloud Serpent reputation fast in WoW Mists of Pandaria Classic with Misti Services and unlock cloud serpent mounts.', 'order of the cloud serpent reputation boost, wow mists of pandaria classic cloud serpent, fast cloud serpent rep farm, buy cloud serpent reputation, mop classic cloud serpent mounts, unlock cloud serpent mounts wow, misti services cloud serpent, wow classic pandaria reputation, cloud serpent exalted boost, cheap cloud serpent rep farm, wow cloud serpent farming service, mop cloud serpent vendor unlock, grind cloud serpent reputation, wow cloud serpent rep guide', 'https://kdjlhibxxygfdmlvdfcl.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/game-images/the-order-of-the-cloud-serpent-1763235318830.webp', NULL, 'The Order Of The Cloud Serpent', 'WoW MoP Cloud Serpent Rep Boost | misti.services', NULL);
