ft subscription</p></li><li><p>Non-hardcore mode only</p></li></ul><p>Need help reaching level 60? Try our&nbsp;<a target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" href="https://misti.services/game/wow-classic-era/leveling">WoW Power Leveling Boost&nbsp;</a></p>', 1086.76, 'https://kdjlhibxxygfdmlvdfcl.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/game-images/sulfuras-hand-of-ragnaros-1762693733116.webp', NULL, 4.9, 350, true, true, 0, '2025-10-26T23:47:58.118836+00:00', '2026-01-14T22:05:09.01273+00:00', 'c8f7f940-3d2e-4aa9-9667-723bf93a444a', false, NULL, true, 0, '15 minutes', 'average start time', 'Flexible', 'order completion', 'Buy WoW Classic Era Sulfuras Boost at misti.services to get the legendary Hand of Ragnaros fast, safe, and guaranteed from Ragnaros boss kills.', 'sulfuras hand of ragnaros buy, wow classic fresh sulfuras boost, hand of ragnaros legendary acquisition, sulfuras farming service, ragnaros boss kill service, wow classic legendary weapon, buy sulfuras fast safe, hand of ragnaros guaranteed, classic wow legendary boost, sulfuras acquire service, world of warcraft classic legendary, sulfuras farming wow classic, buy hand of ragnaros, ragnaros kill boost, wow classic sulfuras legendary', 'https://kdjlhibxxygfdmlvdfcl.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/game-images/sulfuras-hand-of-ragnaros-1762693733116.webp', NULL, 'Sulfuras Hand Of Ragnaros', 'Get Sulfuras WoW Classic Era Gear | misti.services', NULL);
