on and tracking number via email.</li><li>Our support manager will contact you through live chat to confirm all details.</li><li>If you’re unavailable, we’ll reach out via email or your preferred contact method.</li><li>When the boost is finished, you’ll receive a completion notification on Discord or another messenger of your choice.</li></ul>', '<ul><li>Active World of Warcraft subscription</li><li>Level 90 character</li></ul><p>Need help reaching level 90? Try our&nbsp;<a href="https://misti.services/game/wow-mistsofpandaria-classic" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank" style="color: rgb(60, 113, 221);">WoW Power Leveling Boost</a>&nbsp;</p>', 33.56, 'https://kdjlhibxxygfdmlvdfcl.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/game-images/celestial-hero-achievement-1764187389496.webp', NULL, 4.9, 350, true, true, 0, '2025-11-02T03:21:50.631682+00:00', '2025-12-16T07:50:49.744234+00:00', '403bbc9e-7076-45b3-8734-4cad84441be2', false, NULL, true, 0, '15 minutes', 'average start time', 'Flexible', 'order completion', 'Buy WoW Pandaria Classic Celestial Hero Boost at misti.services to unlock the Celestial Hero achievement and complete all 9 Heroic+ dungeons fast and safely.', 'wow pandaria classic celestial hero boost, celestial hero achievement unlock, pandaria classic heroic+ dungeons boost, buy celestial hero wow, fast celestial hero achievement, safe wow pandaria boost, mop classic celestial hero, wow classic celestial hero service, all 9 heroic+ dungeons completion, pandaria classic achievement boost, wow celestial hero carry, mop heroic+ dungeons farm, buy wow mop classic boost', 'https://kdjlhibxxygfdmlvdfcl.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/game-images/celestial-hero-achievement-1764187389496.webp', NULL, 'Celestial Hero Achievement', 'WoW Pandaria Celestial Hero Achiev | misti.services', NULL);
INSERT INTO public.products (id, name, slug, short_description, description, how_it_works, requirements, base_price, image_url, badge_text, trust_score, total_reviews, is_active, is_featured, sort_order, created_at, updated_at, category_id, is_slider_product, slider_config, is_manually_popular, total_sales, start_time_text, start_time_value, delivery_text, delivery_value, meta_description, meta_keywords, og_image, canonical_url, image_alt_text, meta_title, parent_link) VALUES ('5661f783-b979-4214-b5b0-88ce9225b819', 'Lord Zir', 'lord-zir', 'Defeat Lord Zir in Diablo 4 with Misti Services. Get Mythics, Uniques, and exclusive loot without farming or prep.', '<h1><strong>Diablo 4 Lord Zir Boost</strong></h1><p>Challenge the Dark Master himself with Misti Services’ Diablo 4 <a href="https://www.wowhead.com/diablo-4/guide/world-boss-lord-zir" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank"><strong>Lord Zir </strong></a>Boost. This service delivers a guaranteed Torment kill, access to Zir’s Hoard, and a chance at Mythic and Unique items, including the exclusive Diadem of the Ancient Helm. Our expert team provides the required Exquisite Blood and manages all fight mechanics for a fast, secure, and fully looted run.</p><p>Perfect for players who want top-tier rewards without farming or setup.</p><h3>What’s Included</h3><ul><li>Full Lord Zir kill on Torment difficulty</li><li>Lair Boss Key and Exquisite Blood included</li><li>Chance to obtain Mythic and Ancestral Unique items</li><li>Up to six Uniques and multiple Runes from Zir’s loot pool</li><li>Chance to get The Diadem of the Ancient Helm</li><li>All gold, crafting materials, and resources remain on your account</li></ul><h3>Boost Options Explained</h3><ul><li>Lower price available if you already have Lair Boss Keys</li><li>Torment unlock option for improved rewards</li><li>Optional live stream of the full Lord Zir boss carry</li></ul><h3>About the Diablo 4 Lord Zir Boost Service</h3><p>Lord Zir, the Bloodborne Vampire, is one of the most dangerous endgame bosses in Diablo 4. His encounter takes place inside the Ancient’s Seat, a corrupted dungeon filled with shadow magic and AoE blood-based attacks. Zir’s fight demands constant movement, high damage output, and survival under pressure — making it one of the toughest challenges for solo players.</p><p>Our Lord Zir Boost service lets you skip the preparation entirely. We summon, kill, and unlock Zir’s Hoard for you, ensuring you get guaranteed rewards and high-value materials without the grind.</p><h3>Lord Zir Location</h3><p>Lord Zir resides in the Ancient’s Seat within The Darkened Way, located in the Fractured Peaks east of Kyovashad. The dungeon becomes available after unlocking the Lair Boss system at World Tier 1 or higher.</p><p>Misti Services teleports you directly into the fight, no searching or setup required.</p><h3>How to Summon Lord Zir in Diablo 4</h3><p>To summon Lord Zir, activate the Bloodied Altar inside the Ancient’s Seat. No materials are needed to start the fight, but you’ll need twelve Exquisite Blood to open the Hoard afterward. These can be obtained from Helltides, Legion Events, and elite enemies.</p><p>Our team provides all required materials and completes the full process from start to finish.</p><h3>Why Buy a Diablo 4 Lord Zir Boost</h3><p>Lord Zir’s fight features overlapping AoE waves, minion spawns, and heavy burst phases — making it one of the more complex Lair Boss battles. Farming him solo takes time and coordination, especially when collecting Exquisite Blood. With Misti Services, you skip the grind, save resources, and secure every reward instantly.</p><h3>Why Choose Misti Services for Lord Zir Carries</h3><ul><li>Fast and secure Torment kills</li><li>100% safe and legitimate methods</li><li>Selfplay or Piloted modes available</li><li>All materials and keys included</li><li>Trusted by thousands of Diablo 4 players</li></ul><p>With Misti Services, defeating Lord Zir is quick, efficient, and optimized for maximum loot.</p>', '<ul><li>Select your desired options and complete your order on&nbsp;Misti.Services.</li><li>You’ll receive an order confirmation and tracking number via email.</li><li>Our support manager will contact you through live chat to confirm all details.</li><li>If you’re unavailable, we’ll reach out via email or your preferred contact method.</li><li>When the boost is finished, you’ll receive a completion notification on Discord or another messenger of your choice.</li></ul>', '<ul><li>Level 60 character.</li><li>Torment IV difficulty unlocked.</li><li>Main campaign or Vessel of Hatred completed.</li></ul><p>Need help leveling? Check our&nbsp;<a href="https://misti.services/game/buy-diablo-iv-boost/leveling" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank" style="color: rgb(250, 250, 250);">Diablo IV Leveling Boost</a></p>', 0, 'https://kdjlhibxxygfdmlvdfcl.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/game-images/lord-zir-1762543048000.webp', NULL, 4.9, 350, true, true, 0, '2025-11-05T03:21:34.736612+00:00', '2025-12-16T00:25:20.600471+00:00', 'c75b3391-ab33-45c3-8a4d-dae85a5a6e7c', true, '{"step":1,"max_value":100,"min_value":5,"slider_type":"single","value_label":"Numbers of Kills","default_value":5,"pricing_brackets":[{"end":100,"price":0.88,"start":1}],"estimated_time_per_step":0.5}', true, 0, '15 minutes', 'average start time', 'Flexible', 'order completion', 'Defeat Lord Zir in Diablo 4 with Misti Services. Get Mythics, Uniques, and exclusive loot without farming or prep.', 'diablo 4 lord zir kill, buy d4 lord zir service, lord zir unique loot, d4 lord zir mythic gear, diablo 4 lord zir carry, lord zir boss defeat service, fast d4 lord zir kill, professional lord zir boost, lord zir no farming, acquire lord zir uniques, d4 lord zir misti services, lord zir prep-free kill, lord zir exclusive drops, diablo 4 boss services, buy d4 mythics', 'https://kdjlhibxxygfdmlvdfcl.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/game-images/lord-zir-1762543048000.webp', NULL, 'Lord Zir