re</p></li></ul><h2>About Thunderfury, Blessed Blade of the Windseeker</h2><p>Thunderfury is one of the most iconic weapons in <strong>WoW Classic</strong>, known for its lightning-infused appearance and exceptional abilities. It’s a legendary sword that provides unique effects and top-tier performance in both PvE and PvP content. Forging Thunderfury requires dedication, luck, and a strong raid team — which our experts take care of for you.</p><h3>How Thunderfury Is Obtained</h3><p>To forge the weapon, players must collect several rare materials and components:</p><ul><li><p><strong>Bindings of the Windseeker:</strong> Left Binding drops from Garr, and Right Binding from Baron Geddon in Molten Core</p></li><li><p><strong>Elementium Bar:</strong> Crafted from Elementium Ore gathered in Blackwing Lair</p></li><li><p><strong>Sulfuras’ Shard:</strong> Dropped by Golemagg the Incinerator in Molten Core</p></li></ul><p>Once all pieces are collected, they are combined to create Thunderfury, Blessed Blade of the Windseeker.</p><h2>Why Choose misti.services Thunderfury Boost</h2><ul><li><p><strong>Fast and Efficient:</strong> Our team farms all rare items and components swiftly</p></li><li><p><strong>Guaranteed Results:</strong> You receive every required item to forge Thunderfury</p></li><li><p><strong>Safe and Secure:</strong> 100% manual boosting with account protection</p></li><li><p><strong>Available on All Servers:</strong> Accessible for all WoW Classic players</p></li><li><p><strong>Stress-Free Experience:</strong> Skip raid coordination and complex boss fights</p></li></ul><h2>Why Thunderfury Is Special</h2><ul><li><p><strong>Legendary Power:</strong> One of the strongest weapons in WoW Classic</p></li><li><p><strong>Iconic Appearance:</strong> Recognized symbol of achievement and prestige</p></li><li><p><strong>Versatile Performance:</strong> Perfect for both PvE and PvP content</p></li></ul><h2>Who Should Get This Boost</h2><ul><li><p><strong>Raiders:</strong> Increase damage output and dominance in endgame raids</p></li><li><p><strong>Collectors:</strong> Add this rare legendary sword to your weapon collection</p></li><li><p><strong>PvP Players:</strong> Gain a competitive edge in battle</p></li><li><p><strong>Busy Gamers:</strong> Save time and effort while getting a top-tier reward</p></li></ul><p>Own one of the most legendary weapons ever forged in World of Warcraft. Order your <strong>WoW Classic Era Thunderfury Boost</strong> from <strong>misti.services</strong> and let our team handle every step of the journey so you can wield Thunderfury without the grind.</p>', '<ul><li>Select your desired options and complete your order on&nbsp;Misti.Services.</li><li>You’ll receive an order confirmation and tracking number via email.</li><li>Our support manager will contact you through live chat to confirm all details.</li><li>If you’re unavailable, we’ll reach out via email or your preferred contact method.</li><li>When the boost is finished, you’ll receive a completion notification on Discord or another messenger of your choice.</li></ul>', '<ul><li><p>Level 60 character</p></li><li><p>Active World of Warcraft subscription</p></li><li><p>Non-hardcore mode only</p></li></ul><p>Need help reaching level 60? Try our&nbsp;<a target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" href="https://misti.services/game/wow-classic-era/leveling">WoW Power Leveling Boost&nbsp;</a></p>', 0.95, 'https://kdjlhibxxygfdmlvdfcl.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/game-images/thunderfury-1762693909485.webp', NULL, 4.9, 350, true, true, 0, '2025-10-26T23:29:47.776672+00:00', '2026-01-14T22:05:57.951763+00:00', 'c8f7f940-3d2e-4aa9-9667-723bf93a444a', false, NULL, true, 0, '15 minutes', 'average start time', 'Flexible', 'order completion', 'Buy WoW Classic Era Thunderfury Boost at misti.services and get the legendary Blessed Blade of the Windseeker fast, safe, and hassle-free.', 'wow classic thunderfury boost, buy thunderfury classic, blessed blade of the windseeker service, classic wow legendary weapon, thunderfury farm classic, acquire thunderfury wow, windseeker legendary boost, classic thunderfury fast, safe thunderfury boost, hassle-free thunderfury, wow classic legendary weapon service, thunderfury acquisition classic, best thunderfury boost, wow classic windseeker farm, buy blessed blade of the windseeker', 'https://kdjlhibxxygfdmlvdfcl.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/game-images/thunderfury-1762693909485.webp', NULL, 'Thunderfury', 'Get Thunderfury WoW Classic Era Boost | misti.services', NULL);
INSERT INTO public.products (id, name, slug, short_description, description, how_it_works, requirements, base_price, image_url, badge_text, trust_score, total_reviews, is_active, is_featured, sort_order, created_at, updated_at, category_id, is_slider_product, slider_config, is_manually_popular, total_sales, start_time_text, start_time_value, delivery_text, delivery_value, meta_description, meta_keywords, og_image, canonical_url, image_alt_text, meta_title, parent_link) VALUES ('7f6f39dd-cacd-4bde-b000-3f323f70ca5e', 'Severed Threads Renown Boost', 'severed-threads-renown-boost', 'Boost your Severed Threads Renown fast with Misti.Services. Unlock mounts, cosmetics, and trinkets without grinding.', '<h1><strong>Severed Threads Renown Boost</strong></h1><p>Reach any <a href="https://www.wowhead.com/guide/the-war-within/renown/the-severed-threads" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank"><strong>Severed Threads Renown</strong></a><strong> level</strong> fast with Misti.Services and unlock unique mounts, trinkets, and cosmetics from <em>The War Within</em> expansion. Our professional boosters handle the entire process so you can enjoy all the rewards without spending hours farming reputation.</p><h3>What’s Included</h3><ul><li>Desired renown level with the <strong>Severed Threads faction</strong></li><li>Access to <strong>Ferocious Jawcrawler</strong> and <strong>Aquamarine Swarmite</strong> mounts</li><li>Obtain powerful <strong>571–584 ilvl trinkets</strong></li><li>Unlock <strong>Heritage, Royal Court, and Widow’s Undercrawlers</strong> through Conspirator rank</li><li>Gain cosmetics, companions, and collectibles</li><li>All gold and items earned during the boost are yours</li></ul><h3>Boost Options</h3><p><strong>Account Sharing:</strong> A trusted booster logs into your account to complete the renown leveling.</p><p><strong>Remote Control:</strong> Our player connects via a secure app (like Parsec) so you can watch progress live while keeping full visibility.</p><h3>Severed Threads Renown Explained</h3><p>The <strong>Severed Threads</strong> are one of four major factions introduced in <em>The War Within</em>. Unlike other reputations, you can’t farm renown directly — instead, you earn it by allying with one of three leaders: the <strong>General</strong>, <strong>Vizier</strong>, or <strong>Weaver</strong>. Gaining a reputation rank with any leader grants one renown level with the faction.</p><p>You can form a pact with only one leader each week, making this progression slower than most. Each leader offers different rewards and storyline branches, making the Severed Threads faction one of the most rewarding and unique in <em>The War Within</em>.</p><h3>Rewards Overview</h3><ul><li><strong>Mounts:</strong> Ferocious Jawcrawler, Aquamarine Swarmite, Heritage Undercrawler, Royal Court Undercrawler, Widow’s Undercrawler</li><li><strong>Gear:</strong> Powerful trinkets and crafted enhancements</li><li><strong>Currency:</strong> Kej and Resonance Crystals for special vendor items</li><li><strong>Collectibles:</strong> Toys, transmog sets, and companions</li><li><strong>Achievements:</strong> Earn the “Thread-Spinner” title at max renown</li></ul><h3>Notable NPCs</h3><ul><li><strong>Lady Vinazian</strong> – Main faction leader and vendor in Azj-Kahet</li><li><strong>Y’thekhi</strong> – Mount vendor for Severed Threads</li><li><strong>Yamas the Provider</strong>, <strong>Tulumun</strong>, <strong>Bobbin</strong> – Sell special Undercralwer mounts tied to faction leaders</li></ul><p>If you prefer not to spend weeks farming reputation or switching pacts manually, Misti.Services offers a quick and safe way to max your renown and unlock all available rewards.</p><h3>WoW Severed Threads Renown Boosting Includes</h3><p>Our <strong>Severed Threads Renown Boost</strong> guarantees your chosen rank with efficient completion of all required tasks. Our professional boosters handle every quest, event, and faction interaction needed to earn reputation safely.</p><p>Order today and skip the endless grind. With <strong>Misti.Services</strong>, you’ll unlock every Severed Threads mount, trinket, and cosmetic faster than ever.</p>', '<ol><li>Choose your desired renown rank and complete your order.</li><li>Receive confirmation by email along with your order number.</li><li>Our support manager will contact you through live chat or email.</li><li>Once a booster is assigned, the process begins immediately.</li><li>You’ll be notified through Discord or your preferred messenger when complete.</li></ol><p>Enjoy your new renown rank and rewards without the repetitive grind.</p>', '<ul><li>Level 80 character</li><li>The War Within expansion</li><li>(Optional) Use our&nbsp;<a href="https://misti.services/game/warwithin/leveling/wow-the-war-within-leveling" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">WoW Power Leveling Boost</a>&nbsp;if you’re not yet level 80</li></ul>', 0.81, 'https://kdjlhibxxygfdmlvdfcl.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/game-images/severed-threads-renown-boost-1762453605254.webp', NULL, 4.9, 350, true, true, 0, '2025-10-25T00:17:04.15272+00:00', '2025-12-16T07:48:50.831438+00:00', '312870ae-4c42-440f-8510-5704a1c5f333', true, '{"step":1,"end_label":"Desired renown","max_value":25,"min_value":1,"default_end":25,"start_label":"Current renown","default_start":1,"pricing_brackets":[{"end":25,"price":33.66,"start":1}],"estimated_time_per_step":0.5}', true, 0, '15 minutes', 'average start time', 'Flexible', 'order completion', 'Boost your Severed Threads Renown fast with Misti.Services. Unlock mounts, cosmetics, and trinkets without grinding.', 'severed threads renown boost, buy severed threads renown, fast severed threads renown, misti.services severed threads, severed threads mount unlock, severed threads cosmetic boost, severed threads trinket farm, severed threads reputation grind skip, professional severed threads boost, acquire severed threads renown, cheap severed threads boost, severed threads renown service, boost severed threads reputation, no grind severed threads', 'https://kdjlhibxxygfdmlvdfcl.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/game-images/severed-threads-renown-boost-1762453605254.webp', NULL, 'Severed Threads Renown Boost', 'Severed Threads Renown Boost - War Within | misti.services', NULL);
