login activity look as natural as possible.</li><li><strong>Remote Control:</strong> For maximum control and transparency, our booster connects to your PC through a secure application like Parsec. They play using your mouse and keyboard while you watch the gameplay live. Your login credentials are never shared, and you see every step of the service as it happens.</li></ul>', '<ul><li><strong>Place Order:</strong> Place your order for the WoW Xy Trustee''s Gearglider Mount Boost on our site.</li><li><strong>Contact:</strong> Our support manager will contact you asap via the website''s online chat to clarify all order details and scheduling.</li><li><strong>Assignment:</strong> We assign an experienced booster skilled in unlocking rare mounts efficiently.</li><li><strong>Completion:</strong> The booster completes all required steps to secure the Xy Trustee''s Gearglider mount for you.</li><li><strong>Enjoy:</strong> You receive confirmation once the mount is delivered to your account.</li></ul><p><br></p>', '<ul><li><strong>Level:</strong> Level 80 Character.</li><li><strong>Expansion:</strong> The War Within active.</li><li><strong>Account:</strong> Active World of Warcraft subscription.</li></ul><p><br></p>', 58.65, 'https://kdjlhibxxygfdmlvdfcl.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/game-images/darkfuse-spy-eye-1764152088838.webp', NULL, 4.9, 0, true, true, 0, '2025-11-24T21:34:51.623547+00:00', '2025-12-16T07:22:36.896713+00:00', 'b4c0ccaf-a937-4b30-9ab4-7dacee8f739b', false, NULL, true, 0, '15 minutes', 'average start time', 'Flexible', 'order completion', 'Skip the grind and secure the Darkfuse Spy-Eye mount with misti.services. We farm the Darkfuse Precipitant World Quest and rares for you, delivering this rare mechanical ', 'Darkfuse Spy-Eye mount boost, WoW Darkfuse Spy-Eye carry, Darkfuse Precipitant World Quest, War Within mount boost, WoW rare mechanical mount, Darkfuse mount service, buy WoW mounts, WoW mount boosting, misti.services WoW boosts', 'https://kdjlhibxxygfdmlvdfcl.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/game-images/darkfuse-spy-eye-1764152088838.webp', NULL, 'Darkfuse Spy Eye', 'War Within Spy-Eye Mount | misti.services', NULL);
