This service requires temporary account sharing.</li><li><strong>Level 55-60 Character:</strong> Your character must be between level 55 and 60 to efficiently complete the service.</li><li><strong>Active WoW Subscription:</strong> A current World of Warcraft subscription is necessary.</li></ul>', 1.99, 'https://kdjlhibxxygfdmlvdfcl.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/game-images/flight-paths-unlock-boost-1766938811586.webp', NULL, 4.9, 0, true, true, 0, '2025-12-28T16:03:23.703586+00:00', '2026-01-02T17:41:22.346998+00:00', 'af996091-6134-4a47-b755-6c0ac7f3b65b', false, NULL, true, 0, '15 minutes', 'average start time', 'Flexible', 'order completion', 'Unlock all WoW Classic Flight Paths for Kalimdor, Eastern Kingdoms, or Azeroth. Fast, secure, and professional boosting service to save your time. ', 'wow classic flight paths buy, wow classic flight paths service, classic flight paths unlock, wow classic boost, buy wow classic boost, wow classic leveling, wow classic travel, wow classic flight points, classic flight master, wow classic price, classic wow service, gaming service, fast delivery, professional, reliable, secure, boosting, carry, account, safe', 'https://kdjlhibxxygfdmlvdfcl.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/game-images/flight-paths-unlock-boost-1766938811586.webp', NULL, 'Flight Paths Unlock Boost', 'WoW Classic Flight Paths Service | misti.services', NULL);
