st</strong> – Join the team and participate in the raid yourself while our experts lead you through each encounter.</p><p><strong>Remote Boost</strong> – Watch the boost live while our player controls your character remotely in a safe and private session.</p><h3>About Glory of the Orgrimmar Raider</h3><p>The <strong>Glory of the Orgrimmar Raider</strong> meta-achievement is the ultimate challenge in <em>Mists of Pandaria Classic’s</em> final raid — <em>Siege of Orgrimmar</em>. Completing it rewards the <strong>Reins of Galakras</strong>, a majestic drake mount symbolizing victory over Garrosh Hellscream and his corrupted Horde forces.</p><p>Each achievement within the raid requires precise teamwork, coordination, and knowledge of boss mechanics. With our boost, you skip the struggle — our experienced team completes all objectives smoothly, ensuring you receive every reward in record time.</p><h3>Why Choose misti.services</h3><ul><li>Fast, safe, and 100% manual raid completion</li><li>No bots or automated systems</li><li>Professional team with proven raid expertise</li><li>Secure handling of your account and data</li><li>Guaranteed achievements, mount, and loot</li><li>Friendly customer support and progress updates</li></ul><h3>Why You Need the Glory of the Orgrimmar Raider Boost</h3><ul><li>Unlock the <strong>Reins of Galakras</strong> mount instantly</li><li>Earn every raid achievement without effort</li><li>Save weeks of repetitive farming and coordination</li><li>Enjoy full raid completion with trusted pros</li><li>Keep all rewards, titles, and gear earned</li></ul><h3>Conquer Siege of Orgrimmar with misti.services</h3><p>Skip the grind and let <strong>misti.services</strong> handle your <em>Glory of the Orgrimmar Raider Boost</em>. Secure your <strong>Reins of Galakras</strong>, complete all achievements, and enjoy your new rewards — fast, safe, and completely stress-free.</p><p><br></p>', '<ul><li>Select your desired options and complete your order on&nbsp;Misti.Services.</li><li>You’ll receive an order confirmation and tracking number via email.</li><li>Our support manager will contact you through live chat to confirm all details.</li><li>If you’re unavailable, we’ll reach out via email or your preferred contact method.</li><li>When the boost is finished, you’ll receive a completion notification on Discord or another messenger of your choice.</li></ul><p><br></p>', '<ul><li>Active World of Warcraft subscription</li><li>Level 90 character</li></ul><p>Need help reaching level 90? Try our&nbsp;<a href="https://misti.services/game/wow-mistsofpandaria-classic" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank" style="color: rgb(60, 113, 221);">WoW Power Leveling Boost</a>&nbsp;</p>', 399.96, 'https://kdjlhibxxygfdmlvdfcl.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/game-images/glory-of-the-orgrimmar-raider-1764187682945.webp', NULL, 4.9, 350, true, true, 0, '2025-11-01T03:14:50.16736+00:00', '2025-12-16T07:51:48.942578+00:00', 'ce7082cb-9422-40a0-bda1-cd009133aeda', false, NULL, true, 0, '1 day', 'average start time', '7 days', 'order completion', 'Unlock the Reins of Galakras mount fast with misti.services. Complete Glory of the Orgrimmar Raider and earn all Siege of Orgrimmar achievements easily.', 'glory of the orgrimmar raider boost, reins of galakras mount unlock, siege of orgrimmar achievements service, soo meta-achievement carry, glory of orgrimmar raider fast completion, buy galakras mount, wow soo achievement run, professional wow raid boost, acquire reins of galakras, orgrimmar raider meta-achievement, easy siege of orgrimmar achievements, wow mount acquisition service', 'https://kdjlhibxxygfdmlvdfcl.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/game-images/glory-of-the-orgrimmar-raider-1764187682945.webp', NULL, 'Glory Of The Orgrimmar Raider', 'WoW MoP Glory of Orgrimmar Raider | misti.services', NULL);
INSERT INTO public.products (id, name, slug, short_description, description, how_it_works, requirements, base_price, image_url, badge_text, trust_score, total_reviews, is_active, is_featured, sort_order, created_at, updated_at, category_id, is_slider_product, slider_config, is_manually_popular, total_sales, start_time_text, start_time_value, delivery_text, delivery_value, meta_description, meta_keywords, og_image, canonical_url, image_alt_text, meta_title, parent_link) VALUES ('9784a2eb-d405-4bfd-8727-44713d203edf', 'Merits Farm', 'merits-farm', 'Merits are a temporary event currency earned through gameplay XP, and they’re used to progress your event reward track. If you don’t have time to grind contracts, clear ARC encounters, and extract run after run, misti.services will handle the farming for you—so you can claim your rewards without burning your week on repetition.', '<h1><strong>ARC Raiders Merits Farm Service</strong></h1><p><strong>Unlock limited-time event rewards before the track ends.</strong></p><p>Merits are a temporary event currency earned through gameplay XP, and they’re used to progress your event reward track. If you don’t have time to grind contracts, clear ARC encounters, and extract run after run, <strong>misti.services</strong> will handle the farming for you—so you can claim your rewards without burning your week on repetition.</p><h2><strong>What This Service Is</strong></h2><p><strong>ARC Raiders Merits Farm</strong> is a piloted farming service where our Raider plays on your character to generate the Merits you need through efficient XP routes. The goal is simple: <strong>get the Merits, finish the track, and unlock your rewards</strong>—fast and safely.</p><h2><strong>Service Includes</strong></h2><ul><li><strong>Your chosen amount of Merits farmed</strong> (small top-ups or full track completion)</li><li><strong>Event progression</strong> to help you unlock limited-time cosmetics and items</li><li><strong>Optimized XP farming</strong> focused on consistent Merit generation</li><li><strong>All rewards earned during the grind</strong> (event unlocks + your regular loot)</li><li><strong>100% manual play</strong> (no bots, no cheats—just experienced Raiders)</li></ul><h2><strong>About Merits</strong></h2><p><strong>Merits come from XP earned during the event.</strong> In most event formats, Merits are generated by consistently gaining experience—meaning the best way to farm them is to <strong>play smart, survive, and extract</strong>.</p><p>Because event balancing can change, the exact XP-to-Merit pace may vary slightly, but the strategy stays the same: <strong>maximize XP per run and avoid waste</strong>.</p><h2><strong>Event Rewards You Can Unlock</strong></h2><p>Depending on your progress, farming Merits can unlock things like:</p><ul><li><strong>Exclusive cosmetics</strong> (outfits, color variants, face styles)</li><li><strong>Utility rewards</strong> (for example stimulants, Door Blockers, and similar track items)</li><li><strong>Raider Tokens</strong> and other progression resources</li></ul><p>If you’re not sure what you need to finish the track, message support and we’ll help you estimate the remaining grind.</p><h2><strong>Why Choose misti.services</strong></h2><ul><li><strong>Efficient XP routes</strong> from players who understand repeatable value loops</li><li><strong>Manual, secure service</strong> focused on account safety and consistency</li><li><strong>Fast completion options</strong> (Default or Express)</li><li><strong>Support that actually helps</strong> (we can help you figure out the Merits target, not just sell you a package)</li></ul>', '<ul><li><strong>Pick the amount of Merits</strong> you want (or tell us your target reward tier).</li><li>Place your order and we <strong>assign a veteran Raider</strong> with strong XP routes.</li><li>We farm XP efficiently by running <strong>high-value activities</strong>: contracts, ARC encounters, loot/extract cycles, and consistent successful extractions.</li><li>Your Merits are secured, your <strong>event track progresses</strong>, and rewards unlock as we go.</li><li>You get a completion update as soon as the farming is finished.</li></ul>', '<ul><li><strong>ARC Raiders character available</strong></li><li>Access details needed for <strong>Piloted</strong> service (we’ll guide you through the safest way to share access)</li></ul>', 0.04, 'https://kdjlhibxxygfdmlvdfcl.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/game-images/merits-farm-1766940868716.webp', NULL, 4.9, 0, true, true, 0, '2025-12-27T22:49:19.367629+00:00', '2025-12-28T17:28:31.180427+00:00', '1e289898-c4fe-4644-b067-e80319ab1b0f', true, '{"step":100,"max_value":9999,"min_value":100,"slider_type":"single","value_label":"Merits","default_value":100,"pricing_brackets":[{"end":9999,"price":0,"start":1}],"estimated_time_per_step":0.05}', true, 0, '15 minutes', 'average start time', 'Flexible', 'order completion', 'Farm ARC Raiders Merits fast and unlock limited-time event rewards. Safe manual piloted service, any amount of Merits, Raider Tokens, cosmetics & more.', 'ARC Raiders Merits farm, ARC Raiders Merits boost, Merits farming service, ARC Raiders event currency, Staking Our Claim, Breaking New Ground, ARC Raiders event track, unlock event rewards, Striker Outfit, Hiker Backpack, Raider Tokens, ARC Raiders XP farm, XP to Merits, Stella Montis XP farm, Contracts farming, ARC machines farm, extraction XP, ARC Raiders cosmetics unlock, limited-time rewards, event cosmetics, ARC Raiders carry service, ARC Raiders piloted boost, safe manual boosting, fast Merits per hour, ARC Raiders boosters, ARC Raiders grind skip, farm Raider Tokens, Door Blockers reward, Combat Mk.2 stimulants, ARC Raiders progression service, ARC Raiders support, misti.services ARC Raiders', 'https://kdjlhibxxygfdmlvdfcl.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/game-images/merits-farm-1766940868716.webp', NULL, 'Merits Farm', 'ARC Raiders Merits Farm Service | Unlock Event Rewards Fa