ices for a trusted and efficient way to acquire WoW Classic Era Gold, allowing you to truly enjoy your adventures in Azeroth without the financial stress.</p>', '<ul><li><p><strong>Place Your Order:</strong> Select your desired amount of WoW Classic Era Gold and complete the purchase.</p></li><li><p><strong>Provide Character Details:</strong> Our team will contact you for your character name, server, and faction.</p></li><li><p><strong>Coordinate Delivery:</strong> We will arrange a safe and convenient in-game delivery method, which may include face-to-face trade, mail, or Auction House transactions.</p></li><li><p><strong>Receive Your Gold:</strong> Log into your game and collect your newly acquired gold.</p></li><li><p><strong>Enjoy Azeroth:</strong> Spend your gold on mounts, gear, or anything else you desire to enhance your Classic Era journey!</p></li></ul><p></p>', '<ul>
INSERT INTO public.products (id, name, slug, short_description, description, how_it_works, requirements, base_price, image_url, badge_text, trust_score, total_reviews, is_active, is_featured, sort_order, created_at, updated_at, category_id, is_slider_product, slider_config, is_manually_popular, total_sales, start_time_text, start_time_value, delivery_text, delivery_value, meta_description, meta_keywords, og_image, canonical_url, image_alt_text, meta_title, parent_link) VALUES ('8e664ef0-fdf7-4514-adb4-1dc575e51125', 'Factory Raid', 'escape-from-tarkov-factory-raid-boost', 'Factory is the most intense “meat grinder” in Escape from Tarkov. Tight corridors, constant footsteps, shotgun blasts around every corner, and the ever-present threat of Tagilla make it a brutal arena for anyone who is not fully comfortable with close-quarters combat.', '<h1><strong>Escape from Tarkov Factory Raid Boost</strong></h1><p>Factory is the most intense “meat grinder” in Escape from Tarkov. Tight corridors, constant footsteps, shotgun blasts around every corner, and the ever-present threat of Tagilla make it a brutal arena for anyone who is not fully comfortable with close-quarters combat.</p><p>With the <strong>Escape from Tarkov Factory Raid Boost from misti.services</strong>, you get help from a professional player who thrives in this environment. Whether you want to farm PMC kills, complete Factory quests, or hunt Tagilla, we turn chaotic raids into controlled, profitable runs.</p><h2><strong>Service Includes</strong></h2><p>When you order the Factory Raid Boost from misti.services, you get:</p><ul><li>Guaranteed completion of one or more Factory raids, based on your selected package</li><li>High-survival, close-quarters combat support to help you dominate the map</li><li>Ideal conditions for farming PMC kills or focusing on Tagilla boss hunts</li><li>A fast, secure service designed to make Factory feel manageable instead of overwhelming</li><li>All loot, gear, and quest items extracted during the runs kept on your account</li></ul><h3><strong>Boost Options Explained</strong></h3><ul><li><strong>Piloted</strong> – A professional Tarkov player logs into your account and runs Factory raids on your PMC. This is the most efficient option for pure results, such as Tagilla kills or quest completion.</li><li><strong>Selfplay</strong> – You play alongside our booster in a squad. They guide your movements, secure angles, and help you survive and win fights while you stay in full control of your character.</li><li><strong>Stream</strong> – You can request a live stream of the service so you can watch how the booster plays Factory, learn angles, timings, and routes, and see exactly how your goals are being completed.</li></ul><h3><strong>About EFT Factory Raid Carry</strong></h3><p>Factory is a compact, indoor map where:</p><ul><li>There is almost no room for mistakes</li><li>Fights happen quickly and at very close range</li><li>Audio awareness and angle knowledge matter more than anywhere else</li></ul><p>Our <strong>Factory Raid Boost</strong> focuses on turning this high-pressure environment into an opportunity:</p><ul><li>You complete important quests that send you to Factory under punishing conditions</li><li>You farm PMC kills for quests like <strong>“Stirrup”</strong> or the <strong>“Punisher”</strong> series</li><li>You gain large amounts of XP in short, action-packed raids</li><li>You get help hunting <strong>Tagilla</strong>, whose unique items and gear are needed for collections and certain tasks</li></ul><p>Instead of repeatedly dying to ambushes and shotguns, you get structured, guided runs that push your account forward.</p><h3><strong>What You Get with Our Factory Boost</strong></h3><ul><li><strong>High Survival Rate</strong> – An expert player maximizes your survival chances and protects your progress and stats.</li><li><strong>Flexible Options</strong> – Choose whether you want a full piloted experience or to queue as selfplay with a strong teammate watching your back.</li><li><strong>All Loot is Yours</strong> – Any gear, dogtags, quest items, and valuables extracted during the boost are kept on your account.</li></ul><h3><strong>Why Choose misti.services for Factory?</strong></h3><ul><li><strong>CQC Specialists</strong> – Our boosters are highly skilled at close-quarters combat and have deep experience on the Factory layout, spawns, and timings.</li><li><strong>Secure and Manual Play</strong> – All services are done by hand, with VPN coverage and safe practices to protect your account.</li><li><strong>24/7 Support</strong> – Our support team is available around the clock to help set up your order, answer questions, and keep you updated.</li><li><strong>Proven Experience</strong> – misti.services has a long-standing reputation for handling some of the hardest and most skill-intensive tasks in Escape from Tarkov.</li></ul><p>With the <strong>Escape from Tarkov Factory Raid Boost</strong> from misti.services, you can finally turn Tarkov’s most chaotic map into a reliable source of progress, XP, and confidence instead of a constant source of frustration.</p>', '<ul><li><strong>Select Your Factory Options</strong></li><li>Choose piloted or selfplay, your goals (PMC kills, quests, Tagilla, or general raid completion), pick your priority, and place the order on misti.services.</li><li><strong>We Assign a Factory Specialist</strong></li><li>An expert who specializes in Factory’s fast-paced combat and tight angles is assigned to your order. They review your current progress and objectives.</li><li><strong>High-Intensity Factory Raids</strong></li><li class="ql-indent-1">In <strong>piloted</strong> mode, the booster runs raids for you, playing aggressively but intelligently to secure kills, loot, and objectives.</li><li class="ql-indent-1">In <strong>selfplay</strong>, you join them in a squad while they lead, call out enemies, and help you survive and complete your tasks.</li><li><strong>Loot and Objectives Secured</strong></li><li>Quest items, PMC kills, Tagilla eliminations, and extracted gear are stacked on your account as agreed in the order details.</li><li><strong>Completion and Notification</strong></li><li>Once your requested raids or objectives are finished, you are notified. You log in to find your Factory goals completed, your stash upgraded, and your character strengthened.</li></ul>', '<ul><li>An Escape from Tarkov account with the game purchased and accessible</li><li>For piloted service: login details so our booster can play on your PMC</li><li>Enough stash space for weapons, gear, and loot acquired during Factory runs</li></ul>', 9, 'https://kdjlhibxxygfdmlvdfcl.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/game-images/escape-from-tarkov-factory-raid-boost-1765385355500.webp', NULL, 4.9, 0, true, true, 0, '2025-12-08T21:27:28.291816+00:00', '2025-12-16T00:26:58.494435+00:00', '13095953-1c23-4cc6-9101-986220a1c75e', true, '{"step":1,"max_value":10,"min_value":1,"slider_type":"single","value_label":"Number of Runs","default_value":5,"pricing_brackets":[{"end":10,"price":0,"start":1}],"estimated_time_per_step":0}', true, 0, '15 minutes', 'average start time', 'Flexible', 'order completion', 'Dominate Factory in Escape from Tarkov with a professional raid boost from misti.services. Farm PMC kills, complete quests, and hunt Tagilla safely on Tarkov’s!', 'escape from tarkov factory raid, tarkov factory raid boost, eft factory carry, tarkov factory map boost, factory cqc boost, hunt tagilla boost, eft tagilla carry, tarkov tagilla quest help, tarkov pmc kills farm, eft punisher quests factory, stirrup quest boost, tarkov factory quest help, eft high xp factory runs, tarkov power leveling factory, escape from tarkov raid carry, eft close quarters combat boost, tarkov indoor map boost, factory rush tactics boost, tarkov fast raids service, eft factory wipe start boost, tarkov selfplay factory boost, tarkov piloted factory boost, eft stream factory carry, factory raid completion service, tarkov secure loot extraction, eft account leveling factory, tarkov boss farm service, eft hardcore quest boost, tarkov eu factory boost, tarkov us factory boost, safe tarkov boosting service, cheap factory raid boost, best tarkov factory carry, misti services tarkov factory, factory map learning service, tarkov kd protection boost, eft pmc stats friendly boost, factory xp farm service, tarkov aggressive playstyle boost, escape from tarkov boosting services', 'https://kdjlhibxxygfdmlvdfcl.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/game-images/escape-from-tarkov-factory-raid-boost-1765385355500.webp', NULL, 'Escape From Tarkov Factory Raid Boost', 'Tarkov Factory Raid - Fast & Brutal | misti.services', NULL);
