he Collector" to meet Prestige eligibility.</li><li><strong>Endgame Leveling:</strong> We boost your PMC to the required high-level threshold (Level 55+) to access the system.</li><li><strong>Boss Figurine Collection:</strong> We complete the "A New Beginning" quest by collecting all required boss figurines.</li><li><strong>Secure &amp; Manual:</strong> This is a long-term service handled by our most trusted veterans using strict security protocols and VPNs.</li></ul><h3><strong>Boost Options Explained</strong></h3><ul><li><strong>Piloted:</strong> A professional Misti booster logs into your account to complete the Prestige grind.</li><li><strong>Stream:</strong> The booster will live stream the gameplay, allowing you to watch the high-level gameplay and boss hunting in real-time.</li><li><strong>Normal Speed:</strong> Your order is placed in the standard queue and completed within the estimated timeframe.</li><li><strong>Express Speed:</strong> Your order receives "High Priority" status, ensuring the fastest possible start and completion time for this extensive service.</li></ul><h3><strong>About Tarkov Prestige Boost</strong></h3><p><strong>The Ultimate Achievement in Escape from Tarkov</strong> The Prestige system is the true endgame of Tarkov. It allows players who have fully "beaten" the current wipe to reset their progress in exchange for powerful, permanent rewards. This is the most difficult undertaking in the game, requiring total mastery of PVP, PvE, and quest mechanics.</p><p><strong>Prestige Requirements</strong> To unlock Prestige, a player must prove they have conquered the wipe by meeting specific, difficult criteria:</p><ul><li><strong>High PMC Level:</strong> Reaching Level 55 or higher.</li><li><strong>Quest Completion:</strong> Finishing the majority of questlines, including the fence quest "The Collector" (Kappa Container unlock).</li><li><strong>Capstone Quest:</strong> Completing "A New Beginning," which requires finding and handing in figurines of every boss in the game.</li></ul><p><strong>Why the Grind is Worth It</strong> Prestige is the only way to gain advantages that do not reset when the game wipes:</p><ul><li><strong>Permanent Skill Buffs:</strong> You receive a permanent bonus (e.g., +5%) to all character skills and weapon masteries. This gives you a significant statistical advantage at the start of every future wipe.</li><li><strong>Exclusive Cosmetics:</strong> Unlock unique armbands, clothing, and hideout customizations that act as a permanent badge of honor.</li></ul><h3><strong>Why Choose Misti Services?</strong></h3><ul><li><strong>Security is Paramount:</strong> A Prestige boost is a significant investment of time. We treat your account with extreme care, utilizing premium VPNs and 100% manual gameplay.</li><li><strong>Top 1% Players:</strong> Only our most experienced boosters are assigned to Prestige orders. These are players who have completed Kappa and Lightkeeper tasks multiple times.</li><li><strong>Transparency:</strong> We provide regular progress updates throughout the boost, ensuring you are always informed about your journey to the top.</li></ul>', '<ul><li><strong>Place Your Order:</strong> Select the Prestige Boost service to begin the journey toward permanent mastery.</li><li><strong>Elite Assignment:</strong> Due to the difficulty of this service, we assign a dedicated team of our top-tier EFT experts to manage your account.</li><li><strong>The Wipe Conquest:</strong> Our team methodically clears every requirement: grinding XP to Level 55+, finishing main questlines, and securing the Collector quest.</li><li><strong>Final Requirements:</strong> We complete the capstone tasks, such as the "A New Beginning" quest, to finalize eligibility.</li><li><strong>Prestige Activation:</strong> Once unlocked, we notify you immediately. You can then enjoy your permanent rewards and status symbol for all future wipes.</li></ul>', '<ul><li><strong>Game Copy:</strong> Escape from Tarkov must be purchased and active on your account.</li><li><strong>Account Access:</strong> We require temporary account access (Piloted mode) to perform this comprehensive service.</li></ul>', 1, 'https://kdjlhibxxygfdmlvdfcl.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/game-images/eft-prestige-leveling-boost-1765387179550.webp', NULL, 4.9, 0, true, true, 0, '2025-12-06T16:17:31.027656+00:00', '2025-12-16T07:55:03.741325+00:00', '5a461f21-24b8-47e5-afe0-b350cf414cb0', true, '{"step":1,"end_label":"Desired Prestige","max_value":4,"min_value":0,"default_end":3,"start_label":"Current Prestige","default_start":1,"pricing_brackets":[{"end":4,"price":5000,"start":0}],"estimated_time_per_step":20}', true, 0, '15 minutes', 'average start time', 'Flexible', 'order completion', 'Don''t just play the wipe, conquer it. Buy Escape from Tarkov Prestige Leveling to earn permanent rewards and elite status. 100% safe and piloted by veterans.', 'Escape from Tarkov prestige boost, EFT prestige leveling, buy tarkov prestige service, unlock eft prestige, tarkov permanent rewards, eft level 55 boost, tarkov kappa service, the collector quest boost, a new beginning quest tarkov, eft endgame boost, tarkov wipe progression, buy tarkov account boost, tarkov prestige rewards, eft skill mastery boost, tarkov manual leveling, safe tarkov boosting, misti services eft, tarkov boss figurine farm, escape from tarkov carry, tarkov prestige carry, eft power leveling, tarkov account reset reward, buy tarkov kappa container, tarkov veteran boost, eft elite service, tarkov streamer boost, escape from tarkov achievements, tarkov permanent stats, eft prestige system guide, tarkov high level boosting.', 'https://kdjlhibxxygfdmlvdfcl.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/game-images/eft-prestige-leveling-boost-1765387179550.webp', NULL, 'Eft Prestige Leveling Boost', 'Tarkov Prestige Leveling | misti.services', NULL);
