age phases, he is a key target for players seeking Mythic gear and high-value materials. His loot table includes some of the most powerful Uniques in the game and the exclusive Smoldering Brimstone Mount.</p><p>Our professional team handles every step, from summoning Duriel to collecting rewards, ensuring a safe and efficient farming experience.</p><h3>Duriel’s Location in Diablo 4</h3><p>Duriel is located in the Gaping Crevasse, a dungeon south of Gea Kul in the Kehjistan region. The area becomes available after unlocking Torment difficulty. With our Duriel Boost, you skip all the searching and preparation and go directly to the fight.</p><h3>How to Summon Duriel</h3><p>Duriel can be summoned without complex requirements, but his Hoard requires three Shards of Agony to access the loot. These shards drop from other endgame bosses such as Varshan and Grigoire. Our service provides all the shards and manages the entire setup, so you get immediate access to Duriel’s rewards without additional farming.</p><h3>Duriel’s Hoard Rewards</h3><p>Duriel’s Hoard offers top-tier loot for endgame players. You receive guaranteed Unique items per run, a chance at Mythic Uniques, and exclusive drops such as the Smoldering Brimstone Mount. The Hoard also provides Runes, gold, gems, and valuable crafting resources that support endgame progression.</p><h3>Why Choose a Duriel Boost</h3><p>Repeated Duriel runs are often needed to secure the rarest items or mount drops. Farming shards and coordinating summons takes significant time and effort. Misti Services eliminates that grind by providing instant access to professional teams that guarantee clean, efficient kills and full loot every time.</p><h3>Why Choose Misti Services for Duriel Kills</h3><ul><li>Fast and reliable Duriel kills handled by experts</li><li>Secure and safe delivery across all platforms</li><li>Self-play or piloted options for your convenience</li><li>All shards, keys, and materials included</li><li>Thousands of successful runs completed</li></ul><p>Misti Services ensures a smooth, risk-free Duriel experience with maximum rewards and no wasted time.</p>', '<ul><li>Select your desired options and complete your order on&nbsp;Misti.Services.</li><li>You’ll receive an order confirmation and tracking number via email.</li><li>Our support manager will contact you through live chat to confirm all details.</li><li>If you’re unavailable, we’ll reach out via email or your preferred contact method.</li><li>When the boost is finished, you’ll receive a completion notification on Discord or another messenger of your choice.</li></ul><p><br></p>', '<ul><li>Level 60 character.</li><li>Torment IV difficulty unlocked.</li><li>Main campaign or Vessel of Hatred completed.</li></ul><p>Need help leveling? Check our&nbsp;<a href="https://misti.services/game/buy-diablo-iv-boost/leveling" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank" style="color: rgb(250, 250, 250);">Diablo IV Leveling Boost</a></p>', 0, 'https://kdjlhibxxygfdmlvdfcl.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/game-images/duriel-1762541538193.webp', NULL, 4.9, 350, true, true, 0, '2025-11-05T02:53:12.476447+00:00', '2025-12-16T00:25:23.215362+00:00', 'c75b3391-ab33-45c3-8a4d-dae85a5a6e7c', true, '{"step":1,"max_value":100,"min_value":5,"slider_type":"single","value_label":"Numbers of Kills","default_value":5,"pricing_brackets":[{"end":100,"price":0.88,"start":1}],"estimated_time_per_step":0.5}', true, 0, '15 minutes', 'average start time', 'Flexible', 'order completion', 'Defeat Duriel, King of Maggots, with Misti Services. Unlock Mythic loot, Runes, and the Smoldering Brimstone Mount in Diablo 4.', 'duriel kill service, diablo 4 duriel boost, king of maggots defeat, d4 duriel mythic loot, smoldering brimstone mount d4, diablo 4 runes farm, duriel boss fight help, misti services diablo 4, buy duriel clear, d4 duriel professional, fast duriel kill, diablo 4 boss services', 'https://kdjlhibxxygfdmlvdfcl.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/game-images/duriel-1762541538193.webp', NULL, 'Duriel', 'Defeat Duriel D4 Boss - Loot! | misti.services', NULL);
