bark ID. This allows our team to add you in-game without requiring any account access or login sharing.</li><li><strong>Select Your Desired Coins:</strong> Choose the specific amount of Raider Coins you wish to acquire. This determines the duration of the farming session and the focus of our booster.</li><li><strong>Confirmation and Schedule:</strong> Following payment, please contact us via Live Chat. Our team will confirm your order, establish a suitable start window, and coordinate all session specifics before initiating the boost.</li><li><strong>Enjoy Your Enhanced Balance:</strong> Once the session concludes, you will find your Raider Coins balance increased, along with any additional loot acquired during the farming process. No further action is required on your part.</li></ul>', '<ul><li><strong>Game Access:</strong> An active ARC Raiders game account.</li><li><strong>Embark ID:</strong> You will need to provide your in-game Embark ID for team coordination.</li><li><strong>In-Game Cooperation:</strong> Willingness to join raids and play alongside our booster team for the duration of the service.</li></ul>', 0, 'https://kdjlhibxxygfdmlvdfcl.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/game-images/arc-raiders-coins-boost-1768168186395.webp', NULL, 4.9, 0, true, true, 0, '2026-01-11T08:33:46.262333+00:00', '2026-02-17T10:09:42.862927+00:00', 'dea1f612-3aec-429d-a14f-436bb0012601', true, '{"step":10,"max_value":50000,"min_value":100,"slider_type":"single","value_label":"K / Coins","default_value":500,"pricing_brackets":[{"end":5000,"price":0.0125,"start":100}],"estimated_time_per_step":0}', true, 0, '15 minutes', 'average start time', 'Flexible', 'order completion', 'Secure your ARC Raiders Coins Boost and stabilize your in-game progression. Our safe, manual service provides essential Raider Coins so you can thrive.', 'ARC Raiders Coins Boost buy, ARC Raiders Coins price, ARC Raiders currency farming, ARC Raiders boost service, buy ARC Raiders currency, ARC Raiders Coin farming, fast ARC Raiders Coins, ARC Raiders service, Raider Coins boost, ARC Raiders money boost, gaming service, fast delivery, professional, reliable, secure, boosting, carry, account, safe, trusted', 'https://kdjlhibxxygfdmlvdfcl.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/game-images/arc-raiders-coins-boost-1768168186395.webp', NULL, 'Arc Raiders Coins Boost', 'Buy ARC Raiders Coins Boost | misti.services', NULL);
