 killing Killa for his unique armor, helmet, and RPK-16</li><li>The ideal setup for farming “Found in Raid” items for your hideout and quests</li><li>A fast, safe, and structured service to help you control the most contested parts of the ULTRA mall</li><li>All extracted loot, quest items, and progress remain on your account</li></ul><h3><strong>Boost Options Explained</strong></h3><ul><li><strong>Piloted</strong> – A professional EFT player logs into your account and completes Interchange raids on your PMC, focusing on your chosen goals (Killa, loot, quests, or general progression).</li><li><strong>Selfplay</strong> – You queue up with our booster and play on your own account while they lead you through the map, direct your movements, and help you survive and win fights.</li><li><strong>Stream</strong> – You can request that the service be streamed so you can watch every raid live, learn routes and angles, and see exactly how your loot and kills are secured.</li></ul><h3><strong>About EFT Interchange Raid Boost</strong></h3><p>Interchange is a huge indoor shopping complex known for:</p><ul><li>Tight, dark corridors where audio and visibility are difficult</li><li>High-value tech stores that attract geared PMCs and chads</li><li>A dangerous boss, <strong>Killa</strong>, who aggressively patrols and hits hard</li></ul><p>Our <strong>Interchange Raid Boost</strong> is designed to turn this high-risk environment into a high-reward opportunity:</p><ul><li>You gain access to some of the best tech loot in the game</li><li>You farm GPUs and key hideout items for your Bitcoin Farm and other upgrades</li><li>You get help completing Interchange-heavy quests and progression steps</li><li>You receive support in hunting Killa for his unique gear and quest requirements</li></ul><p>Instead of wandering lost in the dark mall and getting ambushed, you follow or trust a pro who knows every angle, shortcut, and danger.</p><h3><strong>Common Objectives on the Interchange Map</strong></