ur current progress, gear, and goals and plan the most efficient route through the mall.</li><li><strong>Guided or Piloted Interchange Raids</strong></li><li><br></li><li class="ql-indent-1">In <strong>piloted</strong> mode, the booster runs raids on your PMC, heading straight to the best tech stores and key boss areas.</li><li class="ql-indent-1">In <strong>selfplay</strong>, you follow the booster’s lead through dark corridors, escalators, and high-traffic stores while they handle the most dangerous engagements.</li><li><strong>Raids Completed, Loot Extracted</strong></li><li>GPUs, high-value tech items, quest objectives, and Killa kills are prioritized based on your order. All loot that successfully extracts stays on your account.</li><li><strong>Notification and Handover</strong></li><li>Once your requested raids or objectives are completed, you are notified. You log back in to a stronger account with more loot, more progress, and more confidence on Interchange.</li></ul>', '<ul><li>Escape from Tarkov purchased and accessible on your account</li><li>For piloted service: login details so our booster can play on your PMC</li><li>Sufficient stash space for weapons, gear, and rare loot gained during the runs</li></ul>', 9, 'https://kdjlhibxxygfdmlvdfcl.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/game-images/escape-from-tarkov-interchange-raid-boost-1765386324396.webp', NULL, 4.9, 0, true, true, 0, '2025-12-08T21:30:49.531478+00:00', '2025-12-16T00:26:53.91716+00:00', '13095953-1c23-4cc6-9101-986220a1c75e', true, '{"step":1,"max_value":10,"min_value":1,"slider_type":"single","value_label":"Number of Runs","default_value":5,"pricing_brackets":[{"end":10,"price":0,"start":1}],"estimated_time_per_step":0}', true, 0, '15 minutes', 'average start time', 'Flexible', 'order completion', 'Dominate Interchange in Escape from Tarkov with a professional raid boost from misti.services. Farm GPUs and rare tech loot, complete quests, and hunt Killa!', 'escape from tarkov interchange, tar