Stream (optional):</strong> watch the run(s) live while progress is being made.</li></ul><h2><strong>About ARC Raiders Workshop Leveling</strong></h2><p>Workshop upgrades can require a long list of specific items and rare drops across multiple stations/modules (Gear Bench, Gunsmith, Medical Lab, Refiner, Utility, etc.).</p><p>Instead of spending weeks chasing one missing piece, we focus on what your upgrades need and farm it efficiently.</p><h2><strong>Why Upgrading the Workshop Matters</strong></h2><ul><li><strong>Better crafting options:</strong> higher modules/benches unlock more advanced crafting paths (by station).</li><li><strong>Smoother progression loop:</strong> you keep more useful items for upgrades and avoid recycling something you’ll need later.</li><li><strong>Scrappy upgrades help long-term:</strong> Scrappy can passively bring back materials as you upgrade him.</li></ul><h2><strong>What You Get</strong></h2><ul><li><strong>Chosen Workshop upgrades completed</strong> (single module path or broader leveling)</li><li><strong>Required materials collected</strong> through normal gameplay routes</li><li><strong>A ready-to-use upgraded Workshop</strong> so you can focus on raids, builds, and progression</li></ul><h2><strong>Why Choose misti.services</strong></h2><ul><li><strong>Veteran farmers</strong> who understand item sources and upgrade requirements</li><li><strong>Manual and careful execution</strong> focused on safe extractions and consistent progress</li><li><strong>Custom orders</strong> for specific modules/items you’re missing</li></ul>', '<ul><li><strong>Pick your goal</strong> (target Workshop level or specific upgrades/modules).</li><li>We assign a Raider who knows efficient loot routes for Workshop materials.</li><li>We run <strong>targeted loot raids</strong> to collect the required upgrade items.</li><li>We <strong>apply the upgrades</strong> and confirm what’s unlocked.</li><li>You get a message when your Workshop hits the requested milestone.</li></ul>', '<ul><li><strong>ARC Raiders character/account</strong></li></ul>', 1.99, 'https://kdjlhibxxygfdmlvdfcl.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/game-images/arc-raiders-workshop-leveling-boost-1766942882421.webp', NULL, 4.9, 0, true, true, 0, '2025-12-23T20:12:59.965164+00:00', '2025-12-28T17:28:22.667878+00:00', '1e289898-c4fe-4644-b067-e80319ab1b0f', true, '{"step":1,"end_label":"Desired Level","max_value":3,"min_value":0,"default_end":3,"start_label":"Current Level","default_start":0,"pricing_brackets":[{"end":3,"price":27,"start":0}],"estimated_time_per_step":0.5}', true, 0, '15 minutes', 'average start time', 'Flexible', 'order completion', 'Upgrade your ARC Raiders Workshop fast. We farm rare materials, level modules, and unlock crafting recipes & bonuses with 100% safe play on misti.services', 'arc raiders workshop leveling, arc raiders workshop boost, arc raiders workshop upgrades, arc raiders hideout upgrade, arc raiders base upgrade, arc raiders crafting unlock, arc raiders crafting recipes, arc raiders materials farm, arc raiders rare materials, arc raiders components farm, arc raiders scrap farm, arc raiders electronics farm, arc raiders power cables, arc raiders electrical components, arc raiders mechanical components, arc raiders advanced electrical components, arc raiders advanced mechanical components, arc raiders bastion cells, arc raiders hornet drivers, arc raiders wasp drivers, arc raiders tick pods, arc raiders cracked bioscanner, arc raiders durable cloth, arc raiders chemicals farm, arc raiders refiner upgrade, arc raiders gear bench upgrade, arc raiders gunsmith upgrade, arc raiders medical lab upgrade, arc raiders explosives station upgrade, arc raiders utility station upgrade, arc raiders stash upgrade, arc raiders scrappy upgrade, arc raiders coins farm, arc raiders upgrade items', 'https://kdjlhibxxygfdmlvdfcl.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/game-images/arc-raiders-workshop-leveling-boost-1766942882421.webp', NULL, 'Arc 