hange makes them indispensable for maximizing the power of your core abilities. Available in Lesser, Greater, and Perfect variants, they enable a step-by-step increase in gem links, culminating in powerful 5-link setups. While Lesser Orbs are somewhat common, Greater and particularly Perfect versions are exceedingly rare and crucial for top-tier builds, making their acquisition a significant bottleneck for many players.</p><h3><strong>Why Choose Our Service</strong></h3><ul><li><strong>Guaranteed Access:</strong> Obtain Perfect Jeweller’s Orbs reliably.</li><li><strong>Save Time:</strong> Avoid the frustrating and inconsistent grind for rare currency drops.</li><li><strong>Instant Power Boost:</strong> Immediately upgrade your skill gems for enhanced performance.</li><li><strong>Secure Trading:</strong> All transactions are conducted safely, prioritizing your account''s integrity.</li><li><strong>Expert Assistance:</strong> Benefit from an experienced team dedicated to efficient service delivery.</li></ul><p>Choose misti.services for a seamless and secure experience in acquiring your Path of Exile 2 Jeweller’s Orbs. Focus on enjoying the game''s challenging content with your enhanced build, rather than endless currency farming.</p>', '<ul><li><strong>Place Your Order:</strong> Select your desired quantity and type of PoE 2 Jeweller’s Orbs and complete the checkout process.</li><li><strong>Order Confirmation:</strong> We will contact you within 10-15 minutes via chat or email to confirm your order details.</li><li><strong>In-Game Trade:</strong> Our booster will add you in-game and initiate a secure trade.</li><li><strong>Receive Orbs:</strong> For safety, place any Rare (non-Unique or non-Magic) item in the trade window, and you will instantly receive your Jeweller’s Orbs.</li><li><strong>Enjoy Your Upgrade:</strong> Experience the benefits of your newly acquired currency.</li></ul>', '<ul><li><strong>Game Access:</strong> You must own Path of Exile 2.</li><li><strong>Trade Item:</strong> Be prepared to trade any Rare item for currency delivery.</li><li><strong>Communication:</strong> Limit in-game chat to essential greetings for account security.</li></ul>', 0, 'https://kdjlhibxxygfdmlvdfcl.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/game-images/poe-2-perfect-jewellers-orbs-1767886476123.webp', NULL, 4.9, 0, true, false, 0, '2026-01-07T10:29:23.115502+00:00', '2026-02-17T10:09:43.855555+00:00', '82b5f114-f1d2-41a5-9f5a-d02323795dfc', true, '{"step":1,"max_value":10000,"min_value":1,"slider_type":"single","value_label":"Number of Orbs","default_value":100,"pricing_brackets":[{"end":10000,"price":0.010961,"start":1}],"estimated_time_per_step":0}', false, 0, '15 minutes', 'average start time', 'Flexible', 'order completion', 'Secure your PoE 2 Perfect Jeweller’s Orbs from misti.services. Unlock skill gem support sockets with Lesser, Greater, or Perfect Orbs for optimal builds.', 'poe 2 jewellers orb buy, poe 2 jewellers orb price, poe 2 currency, poe 2 support sockets, poe 2 gem links, path of exile 2 orbs, poe 2 lesser jeweller, poe 2 greater jeweller, poe 2 perfect jeweller, poe 2 currency farming, poe 2 currency service, buy poe 2 currency, poe 2 items, poe 2 crafting, poe 2 trade, poe 2 fast delivery, poe 2 secure trade, gaming service, fast delivery, professional', 'https://kdjlhibxxygfdmlvdfcl.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/game-images/poe-2-perfect-jewellers-orbs-1767886476123.webp', NULL, 'Poe 2 Perfect Jewellers Orbs', 'Buy PoE 2 Jeweller’s Orbs Fast and Secure | misti.services', NULL);
INSERT INTO public.products (id, name, slug, short_description, description, how_it_works, requirements, base_price, image_url, badge_text, trust_score, total_reviews, is_active, is_featured, sort_order, created_at, updated_at, category_id, is_slider_product, slider_config, is_manually_popular, total_sales, start_time_text, start_time_value, delivery_text, delivery_value, meta_description, meta_keywords, og_image, canonical_url, image_alt_text, meta_title, parent_link) VALUES ('5fe1ac9c-7383-4cda-81c3-53f8baa62cab', 'Lighthouse Raid', 'escape-from-tarkov-lighthouse-raid-boost', 'ighthouse is one of Escape from Tarkov’s most dangerous endgame locations. Packed with deadly USEC Rogues, frequent Goon Squad spawns, long sightlines, and heavily contested loot, it demands both map knowledge and mechanical skill. For many players, this map can feel like a brick wall.', '<h1><strong>Escape from Tarkov Lighthouse Raid Boost</strong></h1><p>Lighthouse is one of Escape from Tarkov’s most dangerous endgame locations. Packed with deadly USEC Rogues, frequent Goon Squad spawns, long sightlines, and heavily contested loot, it demands both map knowledge and mechanical skill. For many players, this map can feel like a brick wall.</p><p>With the <strong>Escape from Tarkov Lighthouse Raid Boost from misti.services</strong>, you get help from elite Tarkov players who specialize in clearing Rogues, dealing with the Goons, and navigating the sniper-filled coastline. We turn chaotic, punishing raids into controlled, profitable runs so you can focus on enjoying the rewards.</p><h2><strong>Service Includes</strong></h2><p>When you order the Lighthouse Raid Boost from misti.services, you get:</p><ul><li>Tarkov Lighthouse raid completion according to your chosen package</li><li>Help defeating USEC Rogues and extracting with high-tier loot from their camp</li><li>The option to focus on Rogue farming, Goon Squad hunts, or general endgame progression</li><li>A fast, secure service designed to help you control the treacherous coastline and Water Treatment Plant</li><li>All extracted gear, rare items, and quest progress kept on your account</li></ul><h2><strong>Boost Options Explained</strong></h2><ul><li><strong>Piloted</strong> – A professional Tarkov player logs into your account and completes Lighthouse raids on your PMC, focusing on your chosen goals (Rogues, Goons, quests, loot, etc.).</li><li><strong>Selfplay</strong> – You queue with our booster as part of the same squad. They lead the way through Rogues, sniper lines, and chalets while you stay in full control of your character.</li><li><strong>Stream</strong> – You can request that the service is streamed so you can watch the entire process live, learn Rogue clearing routes, Goon hunting patterns, and safe rotations.</li></ul><h2><strong>About EFT Lighthouse Raid Boost</strong></h2><p>Lighthouse is designed for experienced players and packed with threats:</p><ul><li><strong>USEC Rogues</strong> with mounted guns, strong positions, and deadly accuracy</li><li><strong>The Goon Squad</strong>, a roaming trio of bosses that can appear and wipe entire squads</li><li>Long-range sniper angles, exposed rotations, and contested loot areas</li></ul><p>The <strong>Lighthouse Raid Boost</strong> from misti.services helps you turn these threats into opportunity:</p><ul><li>You gain access to some of the best endgame loot in Tarkov</li><li>You get help progressing difficult Lighthouse-related quests and tasks</li><li>You learn or benefit from safe and efficient routes through one of the game’s most complex maps</li></ul><p>Instead of repeatedly getting cut down by Rogues or ambushed by Goons, you get structured, guided raids with a clear plan.</p><h3><strong>Common Objectives on the Lighthouse Map</strong></h3><p>We can support you with multiple goals on Lighthouse, including:</p><ul><li><strong>Clearing the USEC Rogues</strong></li><li> The Water Treatment Plant is heavily guarded by Rogues using mounted guns and strong positions. Our pros know how to safely approach, isolate, and eliminate them while maximizing loot.</li><li><strong>Hunting the Goon Squad</strong></li><li> Lighthouse is a frequent spawn location for the three-man Goon Squad. We can help you track and take them down so you can secure unique loot and progress related tasks.</li><li><strong>Farming Endgame Loot</strong></li><li> Lighthouse is one of the best maps for high-tier Western weapons, armor, and rare items. We focus on the most lucrative areas, including chalets and Rogue-controlled zones, to maximize your profit per raid.</li><li><strong>Supporting Lightkeeper-Related Progress</strong></li><li> If you are working on complex late-game tasks or preparations involving the in-raid trader Lightkeeper, our service can be tailored to help gather items and safely navigate the map.</li></ul><h3><strong>Why Choose misti.services for Lighthouse?</strong></h3><ul><li><strong>Rogue and Boss Specialists</strong> – Our boosters are experienced at clearing Rogues, dealing with the Goons, and handling the harsh conditions of Lighthouse’s coastline and industrial areas.</li><li><strong>Safe and Flexible Options</strong> – Pick between piloted or selfplay depending on whether you want pure convenience or want to learn the map alongside a pro. All services are manual and security-focused.</li><li><strong>24/7 Live Support</strong> – Our team is always available to help plan your Lighthouse runs, adjust goals, and keep you updated on progress.</li><li><strong>Trusted Endgame Partner</strong> – misti.services is a reliable choice for completing some of Tarkov’s toughest and most rewarding endgame content.</li></ul><p>With the <strong>Escape from Tarkov Lighthouse Raid Boost</strong> from misti.services, you turn one of the game’s most unforgiving maps into a consistent source of endgame loot, quest progress, and high-level experience—without the usual frustration and constant wipes.</p><p><br></p>', '<ul><li><strong>Select Your Lighthouse Options</strong></li><li>Choose piloted or selfplay, define your focus (Rogue farming, Goon Squad hunts, Lightkeeper-related quests, or general loot runs), select priority and optional streaming, then place your order on misti.services.</li><li><strong>We Assign a Lighthouse Specialist</strong></li><li>A Tarkov veteran who has mastered Lighthouse’s terrain, sniping angles, and AI behavior is assigned to your order and reviews your current progress and objectives.</li><li><strong>Guided or Piloted Lighthouse Raids</strong></li><li class="ql-indent-1">In <strong>piloted</strong> mode, the booster runs raids on your PMC, clearing Rogues at the Water Treatment Plant, contesting chalets and key loot spots, and hunting bosses as requested.</li><li class="ql-indent-1">In <strong>selfplay</strong>, you join the booster’s squad while they handle the most dangerous engagements and guide you safely through the map.</li><li><strong>Raids Completed, Loot Extracted</strong></li><li>Endgame weapons, armor, rare items, and any agreed objectives (Rogues, Goons, or quest progress) are secured and extracted. Everything stays on your account.</li><li><strong>Notification and Handover</strong></li><li>Once your requested raids or goals are complete, you are notified. You log in to find your stash richer, your character stronger, and Lighthouse far less intimidating.</li></ul><p><br></p>', '<ul><li>Escape from Tarkov purchased and accessible on your account</li><li>For piloted service: login details so our booster can play on your PMC</li><li>Enough stash space to store weapons, armor, and rare loot obtained during the runs</li></ul><p><br></p>', 9, 'https://kdjlhibxxygfdmlvdfcl.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/game-images/escape-from-tarkov-lighthouse-raid-boost-1765386769798.webp', NULL, 4.9, 0, true, true, 0, '2025-12-08T21:45:49.628832+00:00', '2025-12-16T00:26:54.598441+00:00', '13095953-1c23-4cc6-9101-986220a1c75e', true, '{"step":1,"max_value":10,"min_value":1,"slider_type":"single","value_label":"Number of Runs","default_value":5,"pricing_brackets":[{"end":10,"price":0,"start":1}],"estimated_time_per_step":0}', true, 0, '15 minutes', 'average start time', 'Flexible', 'order completion', 'Dominate Lighthouse in Escape from Tarkov with a professional raid boost from misti.services. Farm USEC Rogues, hunt the Goon Squad! ', 'escape from tarkov lighthouse, tarkov lighthouse raid boost, eft lighthouse carry, tarkov lighthouse map boost, hunt rogues boost, eft usec rogues farm, tarkov rogue camp runs, lighthouse water treatment plant, tarkov goon squad hunt, eft goons carry, tarkov lightkeeper quests help, lighthouse endgame map, tarkov high tier loot farm, eft western weapons loot, lighthouse chalets loot runs, tarkov shoreline style map, escape from tarkov raid carry, eft endgame pve boost, tarkov difficult ai farming, lighthouse sniper hill routes, tarkov selfplay lighthouse boost, tarkov piloted lighthouse boost, eft stream lighthouse runs, lighthouse raid completion service, tarkov secure loot extraction, eft eu lighthouse boost, eft us lighthouse boost, safe tarkov boosting service, best tarkov lighthouse carry, misti services tarkov lighthouse, tarkov rogue reputation farm, eft coastal map learning, lighthouse quest progression, tarkov kappa prep lighthouse, lighthouse rare item farming, escape from tarkov boosting services, tarkov rogues and goons runs, lighthouse high risk high reward, eft late game content boost', 'https://kdjlhibxxygfdmlvdfcl.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/game-images/escape-from-tarkov-lighthouse-raid-boost-1765386769798.webp', NULL, 'Escape From Tarkov Lighthouse Raid Boost', 'Tarkov Lighthouse Raid Boost | misti.services', NULL);
INSERT INTO public.products (id, name, slug, short_description, description, how_it_works, requirements, base_price, image_url, badge_text, trust_score, total_reviews, is_active, is_featured, sort_order, created_at, updated_at, category_id, is_slider_product, slider_config, is_manually_popular, total_sales, start_time_text, start_time_value, delivery_text, delivery_value, meta_description, meta_keywords, og_image, canonical_url, image_alt_text, meta_title, parent_link) VALUES ('9f115b8a-64b4-45a5-95f9-85aea7558495', 'Expedition Project', 'expedition-project-boost', 'Expedite your ARC Raiders endgame with our Expedition Project Boost. Our expert team will meticulously farm all essential rare materials to construct your caravan, securing valuable permanent skill bonuses for your future characters. Achieve this pinnacle endgame objective effortlessly.', '<h1><strong>ARC Raiders Expedition Project Boost</strong></h1><p>Unlock the ultimate endgame achievement in ARC Raiders with our specialized Expedition Project Boost. This service provides the fastest and most efficient way to complete all six stages of your caravan construction, guaranteeing your Raider''s departure and earning crucial bonus skill points for subsequent characters.</p><h2><strong>Service Includes</strong></h2><ul><li><strong>Selected Expeditions:</strong> Completion of your chosen ARC Raiders Expedition Project stage(s).</li><li><strong>Raider Retirement Bonus:</strong> Secure the retirement of your Raider, granting permanent skill bonuses for your next character''s journey.</li><li><strong>Material Acquisition:</strong> Comprehensive farming of all necessary rare materials required for caravan construction from start to finish.</li><li><strong>Expedited Service:</strong> A secure and efficient solution for conquering this significant endgame objective.</li></ul><h2><strong>About ARC Raiders Expedition Project Boost</strong></h2><p>The Expedition Project in ARC Raiders represents the pinnacle of character progression, a multi-stage endeavor culminating in your Raider''s permanent departure from the Rust Belt aboard a meticulously constructed and stocked caravan. This system serves as a prestige mechanic, allowing you to contribute the accumulated value of your current Raider''s progress to empower your next character with a distinct advantage. It''s a monumental material grind, demanding vast quantities of common and extremely rare resources.</p><h3><strong>Why Choose Our Service</strong></h3><ul><li><strong>Expert Material Farming:</strong> Our professional boosters are masters of resource acquisition, employing optimal routes and strategies to efficiently gather every component, from everyday parts to elusive items like Exodus Modules and Leaper Pulse Units.</li><li><strong>Guaranteed Security:</strong> We uphold the highest standards of account security, ensuring a 100% manual service. Your privacy and safety are paramount throughout this extensive boost.</li><li><strong>Consistent Updates:</strong> Benefit from our 24/7 live support, providing real-time progress updates for each stage of your caravan’s construction, keeping you informed every step of the way.</li><li><strong>Endgame Specialization:</strong> misti.services excels in handling the most complex and time-consuming endgame challenges across various online titles, making us the premier choice for your ARC Raiders Expedition Project.</li></ul><p>Elevate your ARC Raiders experience and secure a powerful legacy for your future characters. Choose misti.services for a seamless and secure Expedition Project completion.</p>', '<ul><li>Place your order for the ARC Raiders Expedition Project Boost and customize your desired stages.</li><li>A veteran ARC Raiders professional will be assigned to your account, ready to begin the material farming process.</li><li>Our expert will efficiently gather all required materials to construct and progress your Caravan through each specified stage.</li><li>Upon the complete construction of your Caravan and fulfillment of the Expedition Project, you will be notified.</li><li>Enjoy your permanent character rewards and prepare your next Raider for their journey with a significant advantage.</li></ul>', '<ul><li><strong>Valid Game Account:</strong> An active ARC Raiders account is required.</li><li><strong>Character Level:</strong> Your ARC Raiders character must be level 20 or higher to begin the Expedition Project.</li></ul>', 0.1, 'https://kdjlhibxxygfdmlvdfcl.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/game-images/expedition-project-boost-1766940744795.webp', NULL, 4.9, 0, true, true, 0, '2025-12-26T22:37:19.496836+00:00', '2026-01-04T18:25:12.191474+00:00', '1e289898-c4fe-4644-b067-e80319ab1b0f', false, NULL, true, 0, '15 minutes', 'average start time', 'Flexible', 'order completion', 'Conquer the ARC Raiders Expedition Project with our boost. Secure permanent skill points for future characters by completing all caravan stages.', 'arc raiders expedition project boost buy, arc raiders expedition project price, arc raiders project service, arc raiders caravan construction, arc raiders character retirement, arc raiders skill points boost, arc raiders endgame boost, arc raiders materials farm, arc raiders carry, buy arc raiders boost, arc raiders services, gaming service, fast delivery, professional, reliable, secure, boosting, carry, account, safe', 'https://kdjlhibxxygfdmlvdfcl.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/game-images/expedition-project-boost-1766940744795.webp', NULL, 'Expedition Project Boost', 'ARC Raiders Expedition Project Boost | misti.services', NULL);
INSERT INTO public.products (id, name, slug, short_description, description, how_it_works, requirements, base_price, image_url, badge_text, trust_score, total_reviews, is_active, is_featured, sort_order, created_at, updated_at, category_id, is_slider_product, slider_config, is_manually_popular, total_sales, start_time_text, start_time_value, delivery_text, delivery_value, meta_description, meta_keywords, og_image, canonical_url, image_alt_text, meta_title, parent_link) VALUES ('031c3929-d439-4985-bcc2-521e7cfd205a', 'WSG Marks of Honor', 'tbc-fresh-warsong-gulch-marks-of-honor-boost', 'The WoW Classic 20th Anniversary progression is moving steadily toward The Burning Crusade (2026), and Warsong Gulch is one of the most valuable battlegrounds for players planning ahead. With the modernized TBC honor system returning, Honor Points + specific Battleground Marks of Honor will once again be required for multiple pieces of blue-quality PvP gear, weapons, and trinkets available at level 70.', '<h1><strong>Warsong Gulch Marks of Honor – WoW TBC Anniversary</strong></h1><p><strong>Secure Early PvP Advantage for the TBC 2026 Launch</strong></p><p>The WoW Classic 20th Anniversary progression is moving steadily toward <strong>The Burning Crusade (2026)</strong>, and Warsong Gulch is one of the most valuable battlegrounds for players planning ahead. With the modernized TBC honor system returning, <strong>Honor Points + specific Battleground Marks of Honor</strong> will once again be required for multiple pieces of blue-quality PvP gear, weapons, and trinkets available at level 70.</p><p>Players who enter the expansion with a full stack of <strong>Warsong Gulch Marks of Honor</strong> gain immediate access to early PvP purchases that everyone else must farm later. Coming prepared means you’re competitive in Arenas and battlegrounds on day one.</p><p>At <strong>misti.services</strong>, we deliver professionally executed, hand-played WSG mark farming for players who value safety, consistency, and efficiency during the Anniversary progression.</p><h2><strong>The Value of Warsong Gulch Marks in TBC 2026</strong></h2><p>Warsong Gulch isn’t just a classic 10v10 battleground—it’s tied directly to some of the most powerful early-game PvP advantages in Burning Crusade:</p><h3>✔ Required for Early PvP Item Costs</h3><p>TBC’s honor vendors use WSG marks alongside Honor Points to purchase numerous items, including:</p><ul><li>Level 70 blue PvP armor pieces</li><li>Trinkets and off-hands</li><li>PvP-oriented cloaks and rings</li><li>WSG reputation gear</li></ul><p>Having marks pre-farmed lets you buy these pieces instantly rather than grinding during the chaotic launch period.</p><h3>✔ Major Boost Through “For Great Honor”</h3><p>The well-known repeatable quest <strong>“For Great Honor”</strong> rewards a sizeable chunk of Honor Points when you turn in:</p><ul><li>3 Warsong Gulch Marks</li><li>3 Arathi Basin Marks</li><li>3 Alterac Valley Marks</li></ul><p>Pre-stocking WSG marks allows you to <strong>chain-turn these quests</strong> for burst Honor right when the TBC honor economy begins.</p><h3>✔ Reputation Progress for Unique Rewards</h3><p>Every activity in WSG contributes to either:</p><ul><li><strong>Silverwing Sentinels (Alliance)</strong></li><li><strong>Warsong Outriders (Horde)</strong></li></ul><p>Higher ranks open access to:</p><ul><li>Exclusive WSG weapons</li><li>Blue and epic reputation gear</li><li>Faction tabards</li><li>PvP consumables and utility items</li></ul><p>Marks accelerate these gains, especially when combined with reputation turn-ins.</p><h3>✔ Fastest Marks Through Performance</h3><p>In WSG:</p><ul><li><strong>Winning grants 3 marks</strong></li><li><strong>Losing grants 1 mark</strong></li></ul><p>Experienced boosters who play for coordinated flag control will always produce more marks/hour than random groups.</p><h2><strong>Why Players Trust misti.services for Warsong Gulch Farming</strong></h2><p>Our WSG boosting process is tailored specifically for Anniversary realms, where account safety and consistency matter more than ever.</p><h3>100% Manual Flagplay</h3><p>We never use bots or automated software. Every mark is earned through:</p><ul><li>Real flag captures</li><li>Midfield pressure</li><li>Base defense</li><li>Match objectives</li></ul><p>Your account activity looks exactly like that of a skilled human PvPer.</p><h3>Region-Matched Login Profiles</h3><p>We use premium VPN routing to match your home region. This makes logins appear routine and minimizes any unusual activity.</p><h3>Objective-Based Strategies</h3><p>Our boosters don’t farm mid mindlessly—they play optimal WSG tactics for:</p><ul><li>Shorter game durations</li><li>Higher win rates</li><li>Faster mark gains</li><li>More Honor earned passively along the way</li></ul><h3>Real-Time Progress Support</h3><p>Our support team is online 24/7. You can request:</p><ul><li>Mark totals</li><li>Reputation updates</li><li>Schedule changes</li><li>Order adjustments</li></ul><h2><strong>Stay Ahead of the TBC 2026 Competition</strong></h2><p>The Burning Crusade launch will create intense PvP pressure from day one. Players who prepare now with full battleground currencies start the expansion geared, competitive, and dominating Arenas before others even understand the new system.</p><p>Warsong Gulch marks are one of the simplest ways to build that advantage—<strong>if you secure them before the crowd.</strong></p><p>Stop wasting time in uncoordinated queues.</p><p><strong>Prepare properly with misti.services.</strong></p>', '<ul><li>Select your desired options and complete your order on&nbsp;Misti.Services.</li><li>You’ll receive an order confirmation and tracking number via email.</li><li>Our support manager will contact you through live chat to confirm all details.</li><li>If you’re unavailable, we’ll reach out via email or your preferred contact method.</li><li>When the boost is finished, you’ll receive a completion notification on Discord or another messenger of your choice.</li></ul>', '<ul><li>Active WoW Subscription</li><li>Level 70 Character</li></ul>', 1.33, 'https://kdjlhibxxygfdmlvdfcl.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/game-images/tbc-fresh-warsong-gulch-marks-of-honor-boost-1764691923001.webp', NULL, 4.9, 0, true, true, 0, '2025-12-02T15:36:59.143818+00:00', '2026-02-16T15:42:20.590916+00:00', 'd3e97c55-a89f-439d-aa5a-00f87f713e07', true, '{"step":1,"max_value":100,"min_value":1,"slider_type":"single","value_label":"Marks","default_value":50,"dynamic_options":[{"action":"apply_discount","message":"Add 50 More for Full Discount !","option_name":"","trigger_value":50,"discount_percent":1},{"action":"apply_discount","message":"","option_name":"","trigger_value":100,"discount_percent":2}],"pricing_brackets":[{"end":100,"price":0,"start":1}],"estimated_time_per_step":0.5}', true, 1, '15 minutes', 'average start time', 'Flexible', 'order completion', 'Prepare for WoW TBC 2026 with pre-farmed Warsong Gulch Marks of Honor. misti.services hand-farms WSG marks safely so you start the expansion geared and ready.', 'warsong gulch marks of honor, buy wsg marks, wsg marks boost, warsong gulch boost tbc, warsong marks of honor farm, tbc 2026 warsong gulch, warsong outriders boost, silverwing sentinels reputation, for great honor warsong marks, warsong gulch honor farming, buy warsong gulch marks tbc, warsong gulch pvp gear, warsong gulch 2026 prep, misti.services warsong boost', 'https://kdjlhibxxygfdmlvdfcl.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/game-images/tbc-fresh-warsong-gulch-marks-of-honor-boost-1764691923001.webp', NULL, 'Tbc Fresh Warsong Gulch Marks Of Honor Boost', 'WoW TBC WSG Marks of Honor | misti.services', NULL);
INSERT INTO public.products (id, name, slug, short_description, description, how_it_works, requirements, base_price, image_url, badge_text, trust_score, total_reviews, is_active, is_featured, sort_order, created_at, updated_at, category_id, is_slider_product, slider_config, is_manually_popular, total_sales, start_time_text, start_time_value, delivery_text, delivery_value, meta_description, meta_keywords, og_image, canonical_url, image_alt_text, meta_title, parent_link) VALUES ('7ed9c712-1ffc-4460-ab87-09573dd48e42', 'Peacekeeper Quests', 'peacekeeper-quests', 'Unlock the best Western gear in Tarkov with the EFT Peacekeeper Quests Boost from misti.services. Instead of struggling through risky missions in bright blue UNTAR armor, our Tarkov experts complete Peacekeeper’s combat-focused tasks for you. This service fast-tracks your access to top-tier NATO weapons, armor, premium 5.56mm ammo and meaningful Kappa progress.', '<h1><strong>Escape from Tarkov Peacekeeper Quests Completion Boost</strong></h1><p>Unlock the best Western gear in Tarkov with the <strong>EFT Peacekeeper Quests Boost</strong> from <strong>misti.services</strong>. Instead of struggling through risky missions in bright blue UNTAR armor, our Tarkov experts complete Peacekeeper’s combat-focused tasks for you. This service fast-tracks your access to top-tier NATO weapons, armor, premium 5.56mm ammo and meaningful Kappa progress.</p><h2><strong>Service Includes</strong></h2><ul><li>Any Peacekeeper quest completion to maximize trader loyalty</li><li>Progress toward unlocking and buying the best NATO weapons, armor and ammunition</li><li>All difficult PMC elimination tasks handled, including those requiring specific UNTAR or UN gear</li><li>Completion of high-risk missions in Shoreline Resort and other PvP-heavy locations</li><li>A professional, combat-focused boost managed by experienced PvP players</li></ul><h3><strong>Boost Options Explained</strong></h3><ul><li><strong>Piloted</strong> – Our booster logs into your account and completes selected Peacekeeper quests for you.</li><li><strong>Selfplay</strong> – You squad up with our booster while they guide you through the tasks.</li><li><strong>Stream</strong> – Optional live stream so you can watch each mission and see how objectives are completed.</li></ul><h3><strong>About EFT Peacekeeper Quests</strong></h3><p>The <strong>Peacekeeper questline</strong> is your path to Western and NATO equipment in Escape from Tarkov. As the UN-connected trader, his missions revolve around combat, infiltration and operations in high-traffic PvP zones such as Shoreline, Interchange and Lighthouse.</p><p>The <strong>EFT Peacekeeper Quests Boost</strong> from misti.services provides a reliable way to clear these difficult missions without repeatedly risking your own gear.</p><h2><strong>Why Peacekeeper Quests Are Crucial</strong></h2><p>Finishing Peacekeeper’s quests is essential if you want access to:</p><ul><li>Meta Western rifles such as the M4A1, HK 416 and other NATO platforms</li><li>High-performance ammo like top-tier 5.56 and .308 rounds</li><li>A wide range of NATO optics, suppressors and attachments purchasable for US Dollars</li><li>Important quest chains that feed into your overall Kappa progress</li></ul><p>Many of his tasks push you into crowded areas or force you to use inefficient UNTAR setups, making them a serious roadblock for a lot of players. A professional boost removes that barrier.</p><h2><strong>What You Get with Our Peacekeeper Boost</strong></h2><ul><li>Any Peacekeeper quest completed, from early “Friend from the West” to the multi-part “Wet Job” chain</li><li>All loadout and gear requirements covered by our team, including specific UN helmets and armor</li><li>Rapid gain in Peacekeeper reputation and loyalty, with a direct path toward Loyalty Level 4</li><li>All rewards remain on your account: US Dollars, XP, reputation and items from every completed quest</li></ul><h3><strong>Why Choose misti.services for Tarkov Boosting</strong></h3><ul><li>Our boosters are PvP specialists comfortable fighting in intense areas like Shoreline Resort, Interchange and Lighthouse</li><li>All boosts are completed one hundred percent manually by experienced players using safe methods only</li><li>Responsive support via chat or Discord, available around the clock to help with standard or fully custom Peacekeeper packages</li><li>misti.services has years of experience clearing full trader questlines for thousands of players each wipe, making us a trusted partner for Tarkov progression</li></ul><p>Let <strong>misti.services</strong> handle your <strong>Peacekeeper quests</strong> so you can skip the risky grind, unlock elite NATO gear, and push your account closer to Kappa with minimal hassle.</p>', '<ul><li>Select the Peacekeeper quests you want completed and place your order on misti.services.</li><li>We assign a skilled PMC who specializes in high-conflict areas and objective-heavy missions.</li><li>The booster equips the required UNTAR or UN gear, enters hotspots like Shoreline Resort, Interchange and Lighthouse, eliminates PMCs and completes all mission objectives.</li><li>Your chosen Peacekeeper quests are finished, unlocking better NATO weapons, attachments and ammunition as they become available.</li><li>You receive a notification as soon as the objectives are met and the boost is done.</li><li>Log in and kit your PMC with powerful Western gear, using Peacekeeper’s upgraded inventory to dominate raids.</li></ul>', '<ul><li>Escape from Tarkov purchased on your account</li><li>Desired Peacekeeper quests must be unlocked and available</li></ul>', 1.99, 'https://kdjlhibxxygfdmlvdfcl.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/game-images/peacekeeper-quests-1765925559712.webp', NULL, 4.9, 0, true, true, 0, '2025-12-11T21:44:49.319526+00:00', '2025-12-16T23:08:48.576872+00:00', 'ad312297-e28b-4185-8694-55f8078c94b1', false, NULL, true, 0, '15 minutes', 'average start time', 'Flexible', 'order completion', 'Unlock elite NATO gear with our EFT Peacekeeper Quests Boost on misti.services. Pros clear Friend from the West to Wet Job and push your Kappa progression safely.', 'EFT Peacekeeper quests boost, Escape from Tarkov Peacekeeper quests, Peacekeeper questline boost, Friend from the West boost, Wet Job quest boost, EFT NATO weapons unlock, EFT M4A1 meta build, HK 416 quest unlock, SA-58 quest boost, MP7 meta loadout, EFT M855A1 ammo unlock, EFT M61 ammo unlock, EFT 5.56 NATO ammo, EFT trader loyalty boost, Peacekeeper loyalty level 4, EFT LL4 Peacekeeper, Tarkov Shoreline resort quests, EFT Interchange PvP quests, Lighthouse missions boost, UNTAR gear quests, Tarkov UN armor kills, EFT Kappa progression, Escape from Tarkov quest boosting, misti.services Tarkov, EFT piloted boosting, EFT selfplay boost, EFT express boost service, EFT manual safe boosting, Tarkov PMC elimination tasks, EFT high risk missions, EFT USD rewards quests, NATO attachments unlock, EFT Western gear boost', 'https://kdjlhibxxygfdmlvdfcl.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/game-images/peacekeeper-quests-1765925559712.webp', NULL, 'Peacekeeper Quests', 'Tarkov Peacekeeper Quests Boost | misti.services', NULL);
INSERT INTO public.products (id, name, slug, short_description, description, how_it_works, requirements, base_price, image_url, badge_text, trust_score, total_reviews, is_active, is_featured, sort_order, created_at, updated_at, category_id, is_slider_product, slider_config, is_manually_popular, total_sales, start_time_text, start_time_value, delivery_text, delivery_value, meta_description, meta_keywords, og_image, canonical_url, image_alt_text, meta_title, parent_link) VALUES ('177a0913-f605-44c7-a967-d4e433a12fd2', 'Mount Hyjal Attunement', 'mount-hyjal-attunement', 'Hyjal Summit (Battle for Mount Hyjal) is the major 25-man raid instance for Phase 3 of TBC Classic. The attunement process, known as The Vials of Eternity, serves as the final gateway, proving you have mastered the challenges of Phase 2 by defeating its two most difficult final bosses.', '<h1><strong>Hyjal Summit Attunement Boost – The Vials of Eternity</strong></h1><p>Are Lady Vashj or Kael''thas Sunstrider blocking your path to Phase 3 content? Misti.Services offers a fast, secure, and professional <strong>Hyjal Summit Attunement Boost</strong>. We guarantee the required kills of the two most notorious bosses in TBC, ensuring you receive <strong>The Vials of Eternity</strong> credit from Soridormi.</p><p>Our expert 25-man raid teams clear both <strong>Serpentshrine Cavern</strong> and <strong>Tempest Keep</strong> in a single service, granting you permanent access to the <strong>Battle for Mount Hyjal</strong> raid.</p><h2><strong>Overview</strong></h2><p><strong>Hyjal Summit (Battle for Mount Hyjal)</strong> is the major 25-man raid instance for Phase 3 of TBC Classic. The attunement process, known as <strong>The Vials of Eternity</strong>, serves as the final gateway, proving you have mastered the challenges of Phase 2 by defeating its two most difficult final bosses.</p><ul><li><strong>Primary Reward:</strong> Permanent access to the <strong>Hyjal Summit</strong> raid instance.</li><li><strong>The Task:</strong> You must kill <strong>Lady Vashj</strong> and <strong>Kael''thas Sunstrider</strong> in their respective 25-man raids and collect their Vial Remnants.</li></ul><h2><strong>The Attunement Process: The Vials of Eternity</strong></h2><p>Our service covers the entire sequence of the quest, beginning with the pickup from Soridormi in the Caverns of Time.</p><h3><strong>1. Vashj''s Vial Remnant (Serpentshrine Cavern)</strong></h3><ul><li><strong>The Challenge:</strong> We take your character into <strong>Serpentshrine Cavern</strong> 25-man raid.</li><li><strong>The Goal:</strong> We defeat the final boss, <strong>Lady Vashj</strong>, a technically demanding fight, and loot <strong>Vashj''s Vial Remnant</strong> from her corpse.</li></ul><h3><strong>2. Kael''s Vial Remnant (Tempest Keep)</strong></h3><ul><li><strong>The Challenge:</strong> We take your character into <strong>Tempest Keep</strong> 25-man raid.</li><li><strong>The Goal:</strong> We defeat the final boss, <strong>Kael''thas Sunstrider</strong>, a long, multi-stage fight, and loot <strong>Kael''s Vial Remnant</strong> from his corpse.</li></ul><h3><strong>3. Completion (Hyjal Summit Access)</strong></h3><ul><li><strong>The Final Step:</strong> With both remnants secured, we return your character to <strong>Soridormi</strong> in the Caverns of Time to complete <em>The Vials of Eternity</em>, unlocking <strong>Hyjal Summit</strong> entrance.</li></ul><h2><strong>Why Choose Our Hyjal Summit Attunement Boost</strong></h2><p>Vashj and Kael''thas are infamous for their complexity, difficulty, and high wipe rates, especially with PUGs. Misti.Services guarantees the necessary kills without the frustration:</p><ul><li><strong>Guaranteed Double Kill:</strong> We eliminate the risk of late-week wipe-fests by placing you in proven, highly competent raid teams that guarantee both crucial boss kills.</li><li><strong>Skip the Learning Curve:</strong> No need to spend hours learning the intricate mechanics of Kael''thas''s five phases or Vashj''s frustrating trash/coilfang elite phases.</li><li><strong>Efficient Unlock:</strong> We consolidate the two hardest attunement requirements into one smooth, fast service, unlocking Phase 3 access immediately.</li></ul><p><strong>Unlock the path to Mount Hyjal! Order your Vials of Eternity Boost today.</strong></p>', '<ul><li><strong>Place Your Order:</strong> Select the service and confirm your prerequisites (especially the Revered reputation) are met.</li><li><strong>Coordination &amp; Scheduling:</strong> We contact you to schedule the raid slots. Since both SSC and TK kills are required, we coordinate runs for both instances in a single week or across two consecutive lockouts, based on team availability.</li><li><strong>The Boost:</strong> Our professional booster logs into your account using a VPN matching your country for maximum security. They will ensure your character is present for and receives credit for both the <strong>Lady Vashj</strong> and <strong>Kael''thas Sunstrider</strong> kills.</li><li><strong>Completion:</strong> Once both items are looted and the quest is turned in to <strong>Soridormi</strong>, we notify you. You are now fully attuned to Hyjal Summit!</li></ul><p><br></p>', '<ul><li><strong>Level 70 Character:</strong> Required for both 25-man raid entries.</li><li><strong>Revered with Keepers of Time:</strong> This quest cannot be started until you are <strong>Revered</strong> with the <strong>Keepers of Time</strong> faction.</li><li><strong>Serpentshrine Cavern Attunement:</strong> You must have the <strong>Mark of Vashj</strong> to enter SSC.</li><li><strong>Tempest Keep Attunement:</strong> You must have <strong>The Tempest Key</strong> to enter TK.</li><li><strong>Account Sharing:</strong> This is a Piloted service. We will need access to your account to complete the raids and quests.</li></ul><p><br></p>', 127.71, 'https://kdjlhibxxygfdmlvdfcl.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/game-images/mount-hyjal-attunement-1764017171066.webp', NULL, 4.9, 0, true, true, 0, '2025-11-24T11:24:51.201106+00:00', '2026-02-16T10:51:03.38385+00:00', '116b15ba-d76a-44a3-b1be-5bcb88c71693', false, NULL, true, 0, '15 minutes', 'average start time', 'Flexible', 'order completion', 'Buy Hyjal Summit Attunement! We kill Lady Vashj and Kael''thas to complete The Vials of Eternity quest and unlock the Mount Hyjal raid.', 'Hyjal Summit attunement, The Vials of Eternity quest, Lady Vashj kill service, Kael''thas Sunstrider kill, SSC TK attunement, Mount Hyjal raid unlock, Soridormi quest, Keepers of Time revered, mount hyjal attunement boost', 'https://kdjlhibxxygfdmlvdfcl.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/game-images/mount-hyjal-attunement-1764017171066.webp', NULL, 'Mount Hyjal Attunement', 'WoW TBC Hyjal Attunement Boost | misti.services', NULL);
