or order updates.</p><h3>About Diablo 4 Gold &amp; Delivery</h3><p>Gold is vital to progression in Diablo 4. It’s used to repair, upgrade, craft, respec, unlock stash tabs, and trade with other players. Without enough gold, your progression slows dramatically, especially in endgame content where costs rise sharply.</p><p>With our <strong>Diablo 4 Gold Delivery Service</strong>, you can bypass endless farming and focus on the content that matters—Nightmare Dungeons, boss fights, or crafting the perfect build.</p><h3>Best Ways to Farm Gold in Diablo 4</h3><p>If you prefer to earn gold naturally, these are the most effective farming methods:</p><ul><li><strong>Helltides and Tree of Whispers:</strong> Offer gold caches and sellable loot, perfect for group farming.</li><li><strong>Infernal Hordes:</strong> Excellent gold source—always select Spoils of Gold at the end.</li><li><strong>Loot Selling:</strong> Vendor or salvage dungeon drops; even rares add up quickly.</li><li><strong>Greed Shrines:</strong> Activate these during dungeon runs for massive gold bonuses.</li><li><strong>Trading:</strong> Exchange rare items or materials with players for large gold amounts.</li></ul><p>While these methods work, they’re time-consuming. Buying gold from <strong>misti.services</strong> is the fastest, most convenient alternative.</p><h3>Buy Diablo 4 Gold</h3><p>Purchasing gold is the simplest way to get ahead in Diablo 4. Whether you need to <strong>respec</strong>, <strong>upgrade your gear</strong>, or <strong>prepare for a boss run</strong>, buying D4 Gold gives you instant access to the resources you need.</p><p>At <strong>misti.services</strong>, we provide:</p><ul><li>Flexible gold amounts for all budgets.</li><li>Instant delivery, often within 15 minutes.</li><li>Secure and discreet trade methods.</li><li>Affordable pricing with no hidden fees.</li></ul><h3>Why Choose misti.services</h3><ul><li><strong>Fast delivery:</strong> Most orders completed in under 15 minutes.</li><li><strong>Trusted by players:</strong> Thousands of verified positive reviews.</li><li><strong>Safe and secure trades:</strong> Confidential delivery with proven safety measures.</li><li><strong>Multiple payment options:</strong> Global methods accepted.</li><li><strong>24/7 support:</strong> Friendly and responsive help anytime.</li></ul>', '<ol><li>Place your order on <strong>misti.services</strong> and confirm payment.</li><li>Our support team will contact you via live chat or email.</li><li>You’ll receive a BattleTag friend request from our supplier.</li><li>Once accepted, you’ll be invited to a group for an in-game trade.</li><li>Confirm delivery and enjoy your Diablo 4 Gold instantly.</li></ol>', '<ul><li>Active Diablo 4 account</li></ul>', 0, 'https://kdjlhibxxygfdmlvdfcl.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/game-images/gold-1762636599699.webp', NULL, 4.9, 350, true, true, 0, '2025-11-05T05:16:04.971546+00:00', '2026-02-17T10:09:51.618944+00:00', '1ad9eafb-4e37-4f9b-9cee-bdc984d903e6', true, '{"step":5000,"max_value":100000,"min_value":10000,"slider_type":"single","value_label":"Mil / Gold","default_value":10000,"pricing_brackets":[{"end":100000,"price":0.000126,"start":10000}],"estimated_time_per_step":0}', true, 13, '15 minutes', 'average start time', 'Flexible', 'order completion', 'Buy Diablo 4 Gold at misti.services for fast, safe delivery. Skip the grind and get your D4 Gold within minutes to upgrade, craft, and progress faster.', 'diablo 4 gold, d4 gold buy, cheap diablo 4 gold, fast d4 gold delivery, diablo iv gold, buy d4 gold online, instant diablo 4 gold, diablo 4 gold for sale, d4 gold farming alternative, skip grind d4 gold, d4 gold upgrade, d4 gold crafting, diablo 4 currency, safe d4 gold, misti.services d4 gold', 'https://kdjlhibxxygfdmlvdfcl.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/game-images/gold-1762636599699.webp', NULL, 'Gold', 'Buy Diablo 4 Gold - Fast & Safe | misti.services', NULL);
INSERT INTO public.products (id, name, slug, short_description, description, how_it_works, requirements, base_price, image_url, badge_text, trust_score, total_reviews, is_active, is_featured, sort_order, created_at, updated_at, category_id, is_slider_product, slider_config, is_manually_popular, total_sales, start_time_text, start_time_value, delivery_text, delivery_value, meta_description, meta_keywords, og_image, canonical_url, image_alt_text, meta_title, parent_link) VALUES ('8c08ce5c-a5d4-4e5a-8d9d-b1ddc6545415', 'Prototype A.S.M.R.', 'prototype-asmr', 'Prototype A.S.M.R is a rare mount introduced in Patch 11.1 alongside Season 2 of The War Within and the Liberation of Undermine raid. As a peak goblin creation, it combines flashy engineering with premium bragging rights, making it a highly sought-after reward for collectors and raiders alike.', '<h1><strong>WoW Prototype A.S.M.R. Mount Boost</strong></h1><p>Prototype A.S.M.R. is the crown jewel of goblin engineering in The War Within, a rare flying mount that drops from Chrome King Gallywix in the Liberation of Undermine raid. It is available on any difficulty, but the drop rate is low, which means that getting it through regular raiding can take weeks or even months of repeated kills.</p><p>If you do not have the time or the static raid group to farm Gallywix consistently, misti.services is here to help. Our professional raid teams handle all the wipes, mechanics, and weekly reclears for you, focusing entirely on securing the Prototype A.S.M.R. mount as efficiently and safely as possible.</p><h2><strong>Service Includes</strong></h2><p>When you order the Prototype A.S.M.R. Mount Boost from misti.services, we take care of the whole process from start to finish. The service includes:</p><ul><li><strong>Guaranteed acquisition of the Prototype A.S.M.R. mount</strong> on your account once it finally drops.</li><li><strong>Multiple Chrome King Gallywix kills</strong> in the Liberation of Undermine raid on the chosen difficulty, repeated as needed until the mount drops according to your selected service terms.</li><li><strong>A chance to obtain 645–665 item level gear and tier pieces</strong> from the raid, depending on the difficulty and loot rules during the runs.</li><li><strong>All gold and additional loot</strong> gained on your character during the service kept on your account.</li><li>100% <strong>manual raiding</strong>, performed by experienced players who understand the mechanics and respect your account.</li></ul><h2><strong>About Prototype A.S.M.R</strong></h2><p>Prototype A.S.M.R is a rare mount introduced in Patch 11.1 alongside Season 2 of The War Within and the Liberation of Undermine raid. As a peak goblin creation, it combines flashy engineering with premium bragging rights, making it a highly sought-after reward for collectors and raiders alike.</p><p>The mount drops from <strong>Chrome King Gallywix</strong>, the final boss of Liberation of Undermine, on any difficulty. While the encounter itself is manageable for an organized group, the low drop chance means that even skilled raiders can go many resets without seeing the mount. Over time, this can turn into a heavy time commitment and a lot of scheduling around raid timers.</p><p>By using the Prototype A.S.M.R. boost from misti.services, you avoid:</p><ul><li>The stress of building or maintaining a raid group every week.</li><li>The pressure of progression, wipes, and learning curves if you are not an active raider.</li><li>The frustration of bad luck on a low-drop mount after multiple clears.</li></ul><p>Instead, you get a streamlined, organized approach run by a professional team whose only goal is to secure your mount.</p><h2><strong>Prototype A.S.M.R. Mount Boosting Includes</strong></h2><p>Our Prototype A.S.M.R. boosting service is built around consistent, efficient Gallywix kills:</p><ul><li><strong>Focused raid clears</strong> aimed at defeating Gallywix on the chosen difficulty as many times as necessary within the agreed service structure.</li><li><strong>Ongoing attempts over multiple lockouts</strong> if the mount does not drop right away, depending on the selected package and terms.</li><li><strong>Opportunities to pick up raid gear and tier items</strong> along the way, helping improve your character while we chase the mount.</li></ul><p>For you, this turns a long, uncertain grind into a clear, managed process with a dedicated team behind it.</p><h2><strong>Boost Options Explained</strong></h2><p>We offer several secure and flexible execution modes so you can choose how involved you want to be during the boost:</p><ul><li><strong>Piloted (Account Sharing):</strong></li><li> A professional raider logs into your account and joins our raid group to clear Liberation of Undermine and kill Gallywix for you. We follow strict safety practices and treat your account with care, focusing solely on the tasks required for the mount.</li><li><strong>Selfplay:</strong></li><li> You join our team on your own character and participate in the raid personally. Our raid leaders handle strategy and coordination; you just follow their guidance. This is the best option if you want to be present for the kills and enjoy the content while we handle the organization.</li><li><strong>Remote Control:</strong></li><li> For maximum transparency, our booster connects to your PC via a secure remote app such as Parsec and plays using your mouse and keyboard while you watch everything live. Your login credentials never leave your hands, and you see each pull and kill as it happens.</li></ul><p>Each option is designed to be as safe and convenient as possible, so you can pick the method that best matches your comfort level.</p>', '<ul><li>You select your preferred options for the Prototype A.S.M.R. Mount Boost on misti.services and complete the purchase.</li><li>You receive an order number and an email confirmation that your boost has been created.</li><li>Our support team contacts you via the website chat; if needed, we also follow up via email or your preferred messenger to finalize details such as schedule, region, and chosen boost method.</li><li>We assign a suitable raid team or booster to your order and confirm the first raid time with you.</li><li>For <strong>Piloted</strong> or <strong>Remote Control</strong>, the booster joins the raid on your character and clears Liberation of Undermine, focusing on Gallywix kills and repeating them weekly as required by the service.</li><li>For <strong>Selfplay</strong>, you receive an in-game invite at the arranged time, get summoned to the raid, and participate in the Gallywix kills under the guidance of the raid leader.</li><li>We continue performing Gallywix kills according to your chosen package until the Prototype A.S.M.R. mount is obtained.</li><li>Once the boost is complete, you are notified via Discord or another messenger of your choice if you used Piloted or Remote Control. In Selfplay, you see the results directly in-game as you loot the mount.</li></ul>', '<ul><li><strong>Level:</strong> Level 80 Character.</li><li><strong>Expansion:</strong> The War Within active.</li><li><strong>Account:</strong> Active World of Warcraft subscription.</li></ul><p><br></p>', 254.15, 'https://kdjlhibxxygfdmlvdfcl.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/game-images/prototype-asmr-1764155627324.webp', NULL, 4.9, 0, true, true, 0, '2025-11-24T21:27:39.269719+00:00', '2025-12-16T07:22:43.232408+00:00', 'b4c0ccaf-a937-4b30-9ab4-7dacee8f739b', false, NULL, true, 0, '15 minutes', 'average start time', 'Flexible', 'order completion', 'Unlock the Prototype A.S.M.R. mount quickly with misti.services. Our team farms Chrome King Gallywix kills in Liberation of Undermine and handles all the raid work so you', 'Prototype A.S.M.R. mount boost, WoW Prototype A.S.M.R. carry, Liberation of Undermine raid boost, Gallywix mount farm, War Within Season 2 mount, goblin engineering mount, WoW raid mount service, buy WoW mounts, misti.services WoW boosts', 'https://kdjlhibxxygfdmlvdfcl.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/game-images/prototype-asmr-1764155627324.webp', NULL, 'Prototype Asmr', 'Get Prototype A.S.M.R. Mount | misti.services', NULL);
INSERT INTO public.products (id, name, slug, short_description, description, how_it_works, requirements, base_price, image_url, badge_text, trust_score, total_reviews, is_active, is_featured, sort_order, created_at, updated_at, category_id, is_slider_product, slider_config, is_manually_popular, total_sales, start_time_text, start_time_value, delivery_text, delivery_value, meta_description, meta_keywords, og_image, canonical_url, image_alt_text, meta_title, parent_link) VALUES ('3394c522-8d04-4e09-bcee-060ee937b52b', 'EFT Achievements', 'escape-from-tarkov-achievements-boost', 'Some achievements in Escape from Tarkov are simply brutal. Long quest chains, strict conditions, specific weapons, or rare items can turn a simple objective into weeks of grind. If you want the rewards and recognition without burning out, misti.services offers a dedicated Escape from Tarkov Achievements Boost to handle the hardest parts for you.', '<h1><strong>Escape from Tarkov Achievements Boost</strong></h1><p>Some achievements in Escape from Tarkov are simply brutal. Long quest chains, strict conditions, specific weapons, or rare items can turn a simple objective into weeks of grind. If you want the rewards and recognition without burning out, <strong>misti.services</strong> offers a dedicated <strong>Escape from Tarkov Achievements Boost</strong> to handle the hardest parts for you.</p><p>You choose the achievements you want. We handle the difficult tasks, challenging raids, and strict requirements, while you enjoy the progress, rewards, and a stronger, more impressive EFT account.</p><h2><strong>Service Includes</strong></h2><p>When you order the EFT Achievements Boost from misti.services, you get:</p><ul><li>The ability to <strong>choose any achievement</strong> or a set of achievements you want to unlock</li><li>Large amounts of <strong>Roubles and unique loot</strong> obtained naturally while working toward your goals</li><li><strong>Character experience</strong> gained during the service to help level your PMC</li><li><strong>Skill experience</strong> for your character as we complete raids, survive, and perform high-impact actions</li></ul><p>This service is flexible: it can be tailored around specific achievements or broader progress goals, depending on what you want to unlock.</p><h3><strong>Boost Options Explained</strong></h3><ul><li><strong>Account Sharing (Piloted)</strong> – A professional Tarkov booster logs into your account and directly works on the achievements you selected. This is the fastest and most efficient method.</li><li><strong>Selfplay (Where Possible)</strong> – You stay on your account and play together with a booster guiding you, helping you complete certain achievement conditions in co-op where applicable.</li><li><strong>Stream</strong> – If you wish, the booster can stream the gameplay, allowing you to watch how each achievement is completed step by step.</li></ul><h3><strong>How to Get Achievements in Escape from Tarkov</strong></h3><p>Achievements in EFT generally revolve around three core areas:</p><p><strong>1. Completing Quests</strong></p><p>Many achievements are tied to trader questlines. These can require:</p><ul><li>Surviving specific raids</li><li>Killing certain enemies with particular weapons or calibers</li><li>Collecting rare items or quest items under strict conditions</li></ul><p>These chains can be long and unforgiving, especially if you play solo.</p><p><strong>2. Leveling Your PMC and Skills</strong></p><p>Some achievements depend on:</p><ul><li>Reaching certain PMC levels</li><li>Leveling particular weapon skills, physical skills, or mental skills</li><li>Maintaining consistent success across multiple raids</li></ul><p>This demands both time and consistent performance, which many players struggle to maintain every day.</p><p><strong>3. Performing Special Actions</strong></p><p>Other achievements require more unique conditions, such as:</p><ul><li>Securing a specific number of kills in one raid</li><li>Extracting under difficult conditions or with rare items</li><li>Finding high-value or rare loot in specific locations</li></ul><p>These achievements often blend game knowledge, patience, and mechanical skill.</p><p>With misti.services, you do not have to navigate all of this alone. Our boosters know the fastest, safest paths to each type of achievement and can take on the hardest parts for you.</p><h3><strong>Benefits of Escape from Tarkov Achievements</strong></h3><p>Unlocking achievements in EFT is not just about bragging rights. They can impact your gameplay and enjoyment in several ways:</p><ul><li><strong>Recognition and Prestige</strong> – Visible achievements and completed challenges showcase your account’s progress and experience.</li><li><strong>Additional Rewards</strong> – Many achievements tie into quests and progression that grant items, weapons, gear, and currencies.</li><li><strong>Access to New Opportunities</strong> – Completed milestones may lead to new quests, better trader loyalty levels, and broader gameplay options.</li><li><strong>Motivation and Structure</strong> – Working on achievements gives your play sessions a clear goal and structure, making Tarkov feel more rewarding and less random.</li></ul><p>Our boost helps you reach the point where these benefits become part of your everyday experience in Tarkov, without spending weeks stuck on one frustrating requirement.</p><h3><strong>Why Buy Escape from Tarkov Achievements Boost from misti.services</strong></h3><p>Choosing misti.services for your EFT Achievements Boost means focusing on results, safety, and comfort:</p><ul><li><strong>Save Time and Energy</strong></li><li>Some achievements can demand dozens of hours of focused grinding. We take care of the heavy lifting so you can spend your time actually enjoying the game rather than struggling with a single task.</li><li><strong>Experienced EFT Specialists</strong></li><li>Our boosters are seasoned Tarkov players who know the maps, quests, and achievement conditions by heart. They follow optimized strategies that minimize risk and maximize progress.</li><li><strong>Better Gameplay Sooner</strong></li><li>Many achievements unlock gear, rewards, or progress that makes the rest of the game more enjoyable. Instead of waiting weeks to access these benefits, you can leverage them much earlier.</li><li><strong>Flexible, Customizable Service</strong></li><li>Whether you want one specific achievement, a group of them, or broad milestone progress, we tailor the boost to your exact goals and current account status.</li><li><strong>Security and Professionalism</strong></li><li>misti.services treats your account with care. All services are performed manually with a strong focus on safety, discretion, and clear communication throughout the process.</li></ul><p>By letting <strong>misti.services</strong> handle your Escape from Tarkov achievements, you turn frustrating grinds into completed milestones, valuable rewards, and a more satisfying Tarkov journey overall.</p>', '<ul><li><strong>Choose Your Achievements and Options</strong></li><li>Pick the achievements or overall goals you want to reach, select piloted or selfplay where available, and choose your desired priority and streaming options on misti.services.</li><li><strong>Confirm Your Order</strong></li><li>Once payment is completed, your order is confirmed. You will receive a summary of the service and any additional information needed.</li><li><strong>We Get in Touch</strong></li><li>Our support team contacts you via your preferred channel to clarify details such as your current progress, specific achievements, and any preferences you may have.</li><li><strong>Booster Assignment</strong></li><li>A seasoned Escape from Tarkov expert is assigned to your order. They analyze your account status and plan the most efficient route to completing your selected achievements.</li><li><strong>Achievement Progression</strong></li><li>The booster completes the necessary raids, quests, and special conditions to unlock your chosen achievements. During this process, your account gains loot, Roubles, and character experience.</li><li><strong>Completion and Handover</strong></li><li>Once all agreed achievements are completed, you will be notified. You log back into an account with new achievements unlocked, extra rewards in your stash, and improved stats.</li></ul>', '<ul><li>An Escape from Tarkov account with the game purchased and accessible</li><li>Login details for piloted service so our booster can complete the achievements on your behalf</li><li>Some stash space for rewards, loot, and items obtained during the boosting process</li><li>Your account security and privacy are treated as a top priority throughout the entire service.</li></ul>', 1, 'https://kdjlhibxxygfdmlvdfcl.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/game-images/escape-from-tarkov-achievements-boost-1765385162078.webp', NULL, 4.9, 0, true, true, 0, '2025-12-07T17:04:38.527883+00:00', '2025-12-16T00:27:11.967106+00:00', '5a461f21-24b8-47e5-afe0-b350cf414cb0', false, NULL, true, 0, '15 minutes', 'average start time', 'Flexible', 'order completion', 'Unlock any Escape from Tarkov achievement faster with misti.services. Choose specific EFT achievements, gain Roubles, loot, and character XP!', 'escape from tarkov achievements, eft achievements boost, tarkov achievement unlock, buy tarkov achievements, escape from tarkov services, eft milestone boost, tarkov rare achievements, tarkov quest achievements, eft high rank boost, tarkov stats boost, eft kappa preparation, tarkov hardcore tasks, eft pve achievements, tarkov pmc progress, tarkov character experience, eft skills leveling, tarkov rouble farming, tarkov loot farming, eft piloted boost, tarkov selfplay boost, eft express boost, tarkov super express, tarkov eu us boosting, misti services tarkov, tarkov grind skip, eft endgame unlocks, tarkov rare item achievements, eft questline completion, tarkov challenge achievements,