ount Sharing:</strong> Our booster securely accesses your character to complete the service efficiently.</p><p><strong>Stream Option:</strong> Watch the progress live through a secure streaming setup.</p><h3>About Zandalar Tribe Reputation</h3><p>The <strong>Zandalar Tribe</strong>, located on Yojamba Isle in Stranglethorn Vale, is tied to the <strong>Zul’Gurub raid</strong> in WoW Classic. Gaining reputation unlocks valuable rewards like <strong>enchants, gear upgrades, crafting recipes, and class-specific set pieces</strong>.</p><p>You earn reputation by completing Zul’Gurub runs, defeating bosses, and turning in <strong>Bijous and Coins</strong> for extra points. Each rank unlocks new progression rewards — from trinkets and bracers at Friendly to full class sets and a fully upgraded necklace at Exalted.</p><p>Farming this reputation manually takes significant time and effort due to limited raid resets and rare item drops. With <strong>misti.services</strong>, you can skip the grind and get all rewards quickly and securely.</p><h3>Why Choose misti.services</h3><ul><li><p><strong>Fast reputation farm:</strong> Reach Exalted quickly with no manual effort</p></li><li><p><strong>Powerful rewards:</strong> Unlock exclusive enchants, recipes, and gear upgrades</p></li><li><p><strong>Safe and private:</strong> 100% secure account handling by verified professionals</p></li><li><p><strong>No grind required:</strong> We handle raids, turn-ins, and farming</p></li><li><p><strong>Live updates:</strong> Stay informed through every step of the process</p></li></ul><p>Unlock all the <strong>Zandalar Tribe rewards</strong> and enhance your character’s power without hours of grinding.</p><p>Order your <strong>WoW Classic Era Zandalar Tribe Reputation Boost</strong> today at <strong>misti.services</strong> for a fast, safe, and guaranteed reputation boost.</p>', '<ul><li>Select your desired options and complete your order on&nbsp;Misti.Services.</li><li>You’ll receive an order confirmation and tracking number via email.</li><li>Our support manager will contact you through live chat to confirm all details.</li><li>If you’re unavailable, we’ll reach out via email or your preferred contact method.</li><li>When the boost is finished, you’ll receive a completion notification on Discord or another messenger of your choice.</li></ul>', '<h3>Requirements</h3><ul><li><p>Level 60 character</p></li><li><p>Active World of Warcraft subscription</p></li><li><p>Non-hardcore mode only</p></li></ul><p>Need help reaching level 60? Try our&nbsp;<a target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" href="https://misti.services/game/wow-classic-era/leveling">WoW Power Leveling Boost&nbsp;</a></p>', 0, 'https://kdjlhibxxygfdmlvdfcl.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/game-images/zandalar-tribe-reputation-1763332143230.webp', NULL, 4.9, 350, true, true, 0, '2025-10-27T01:07:50.183021+00:00', '2026-02-11T21:58:52.794148+00:00', '171d961b-f413-4d56-b885-d3acd3a18722', false, NULL, true, 0, '15 minutes', 'average start time', 'Flexible', 'order completion', 'Buy WoW Classic Fresh Zandalar Tribe Reputation Boost at misti.services to reach Exalted fast, unlock powerful gear, enchants, and exclusive recipes.', 'wow classic fresh zandalar tribe exalted, zandalar tribe reputation boost, buy zandalar tribe rep, fast zandalar tribe reputation, classic wow zandalar tribe gear, zandalar tribe enchants, zandalar tribe recipes, wow classic fresh reputation farming, buy wow classic reputation, misti.services zandalar tribe, classic wow zandalar exalted, zandalar tribe reputation service, wow classic fresh rep grind', 'https://kdjlhibxxygfdmlvdfcl.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/game-images/zandalar-tribe-reputation-1763332143230.webp', NULL, 'Zandalar Tribe Reputation', 'WoW Zandalar Tribe Rep Boost | misti.services', NULL);
INSERT INTO public.products (id, name, slug, short_description, description, how_it_works, requirements, base_price, image_url, badge_text, trust_score, total_reviews, is_active, is_featured, sort_order, created_at, updated_at, category_id, is_slider_product, slider_config, is_manually_popular, total_sales, start_time_text, start_time_value, delivery_text, delivery_value, meta_description, meta_keywords, og_image, canonical_url, image_alt_text, meta_title, parent_link) VALUES ('4de0d82a-dffd-4fed-9a9b-7f4ce6dbda6d', 'Challenge Mode Bronze Pack', 'challenge-mode-bronze-pack', 'Complete all MoP Challenge Modes with Bronze medals and earn the Undaunted title. Safe, fast, and professional boosting service.', '<h1><strong>MoP Classic Challenge Mode Bronze Pack</strong></h1><h3>Earn the Undaunted Title and Conquer Pandaria’s Challenge Dungeons</h3><p>Buy the <strong>WoW Pandaria Classic Challenge Mode Bronze Pack</strong> from Misti Services and complete all nine Challenge Mode dungeons with guaranteed Bronze medals. Our professional team ensures quick, secure completion, earning you the <strong>Challenge Conqueror: Bronze</strong> achievement and the <strong>Undaunted</strong> title without the stress or grind.</p><p>Challenge Modes in <strong>Mists of Pandaria Classic</strong> test skill, timing, and coordination. Your gear is scaled to item level 463, meaning success depends entirely on your group’s execution and teamwork. With our experienced boosters, you can enjoy smooth, efficient runs and unlock exclusive rewards safely.</p><h3>What’s Included</h3><ul><li>9/9 Challenge Mode dungeons completed with Bronze rating</li><li><strong>Challenge Conqueror: Bronze</strong> achievement</li><li><strong>“the Undaunted”</strong> title</li></ul><h3>Boost Options</h3><p><strong>Piloted Boost</strong></p><p>A professional player logs into your account and completes all Bronze Challenge Modes on your behalf.</p><p><strong>Selfplay Boost</strong></p><p>Join our expert team directly and participate in the runs yourself, guided by experienced players who ensure Bronze completion.</p><p><strong>Remote Control Boost</strong></p><p>Our booster connects securely through a trusted remote app such as Parsec, letting you watch the boost live while retaining full control over your account.</p><h3>About the Bronze Pack</h3><p>The <strong>WoW Pandaria Classic Challenge Mode Bronze Pack</strong> focuses on completing timed five-player dungeons with Bronze-level performance. These dungeons are harder, faster-paced versions of standard dungeons designed to reward efficient teamwork and precise play.</p><p>Each group includes one tank, one healer, and three damage dealers. All equipment is scaled down to item level 463, ensuring equal footing for every player. Victory depends on coordination, smart pathing, and effective use of class abilities.</p><p>Completing all nine Challenge Mode dungeons within the Bronze time limits earns the <strong>Challenge Conqueror: Bronze</strong> achievement and the <strong>Undaunted</strong> title — your mark of determination and teamwork in Pandaria Classic.</p><h3>The Nine Bronze Dungeons</h3><ul><li>Temple of the Jade Serpent</li><li>Stormstout Brewery</li><li>Shado-Pan Monastery</li><li>Gate of the Setting Sun</li><li>Mogu’shan Palace</li><li>Siege of Niuzao Temple</li><li>Scarlet Halls</li><li>Scarlet Monastery</li><li>Scholomance</li></ul><p>Each dungeon features unique layouts, boss mechanics, and time requirements. Bronze medals offer generous completion windows, making them ideal for new players learning routes and strategies before moving on to Silver or Gold difficulties.</p><h3>Why Choose the Bronze Pack</h3><p><strong>Unlock the Undaunted Title</strong> – Earn your first Challenge Mode achievement and exclusive character title.</p><p><strong>Fair, Scaled Gameplay</strong> – Gear normalization ensures skill and teamwork matter more than item power.</p><p><strong>Perfect for Beginners</strong> – Learn every dungeon, route, and mechanic at an accessible difficulty.</p><p><strong>Preparation for Silver and Gold</strong> – Build the confidence and experience to advance to higher tiers.</p><p><strong>Safe and Reliable Service</strong> – 100% completion guarantee, account protection, and responsive support.</p><h3>Why Choose Misti Services</h3><p>Misti Services delivers trusted World of Warcraft boosting solutions with a 99.3% positive review score across thousands of satisfied customers. Our experienced boosters, secure methods, and efficient coordination guarantee your success in Challenge Modes.</p><p>Get your <strong>MoP Classic Challenge Mode Bronze Pack</strong> today and start your journey toward Silver, Gold, and ultimate mastery in Pandaria’s most demanding dungeons.</p>', '<ul><li>Select your desired options and complete your order on&nbsp;Misti.Services.</li><li>You’ll receive an order confirmation and tracking number via email.</li><li>Our support manager will contact you through live chat to confirm all details.</li><li>If you’re unavailable, we’ll reach out via email or your preferred contact method.</li><li>When the boost is finished, you’ll receive a completion notification on Discord or another messenger of your choice.</li></ul>', '<ul><li>Active World of Warcraft subscription</li><li>Level 90 character</li></ul><p>Need help reaching level 90? Try our&nbsp;<a href="https://misti.services/game/wow-mistsofpandaria-classic" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank" style="color: rgb(60, 113, 221);">WoW Power Leveling Boost</a>&nbsp;</p>', 49, 'https://kdjlhibxxygfdmlvdfcl.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/game-images/challenge-mode-bronze-pack-1762549083395.webp', NULL, 4.9, 350, true, true, 0, '2025-10-31T16:58:39.918344+00:00', '2025-12-16T07:51:43.513299+00:00', 'cfe09cfd-59e3-467e-bbcd-f3b0373cdc84', false, NULL, true, 0, '15 minutes', 'average start time', 'Flexible', 'order completion', 'Complete all MoP Challenge Modes with Bronze medals and earn the Undaunted title. Safe, fast, and professional boosting service.', 'mop challenge mode bronze, undaunted title boost, mop bronze medal service, challenge mode boosting game, buy mop challenge mode, fast challenge mode boost, professional mop boost, game challenge mode carry, bronze mop farm, cheap challenge mode boost, mop undaunted title, challenge mode achievement game, game mop bronze medals', 'https://kdjlhibxxygfdmlvdfcl.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/game-images/challenge-mode-bronze-pack-1762549083395.webp', NULL, 'Challenge Mode Bronze Pack', 'WoW MoP Bronze Challenge Mode | misti.services', NULL);
INSERT INTO public.products (id, name, slug, short_description, description, how_it_works, requirements, base_price, image_url, badge_text, trust_score, total_reviews, is_active, is_featured, sort_order, created_at, updated_at, category_id, is_slider_product, slider_config, is_manually_popular, total_sales, start_time_text, start_time_value, delivery_text, delivery_value, meta_description, meta_keywords, og_image, canonical_url, image_alt_text, meta_title, parent_link) VALUES ('f8fbcbf5-4891-4734-9eba-2d55561d33b3', 'Honor Farming', 'honor-farming', 'Honor points are the cornerstone of PvP progression in World of Warcraft: The Burning Crusade Classic. Whether you''re gearing up for Arena Season competition or looking to complete your PvP set, our professional honor farming service delivers the results you need without the exhausting grind.', '<h1><strong>TBC Classic Honor Farming Service</strong></h1><h2>Dominate the Battlegrounds with Professional Honor Farming</h2><p>Honor points are the cornerstone of PvP progression in World of Warcraft: The Burning Crusade Classic. Whether you''re gearing up for Arena Season competition or looking to complete your PvP set, our professional honor farming service delivers the results you need without the exhausting grind.</p><h2><strong>Why Honor Matters in TBC Classic</strong></h2><p>Honor serves as the primary currency for acquiring essential PvP equipment, including:</p><ul><li><strong>Complete PvP Armor Sets</strong> - Full 5-piece sets with resilience for all classes</li><li><strong>PvP Jewelry</strong> - Rings, necklaces, and trinkets (including the crucial Medallion of Alliance/Horde)</li><li><strong>Epic Weapons</strong> - One-handed and two-handed weapons to maximize your damage output</li><li><strong>Off-Pieces</strong> - Bracers, cloaks, belts, and boots to round out your gear</li><li><strong>Gems and Enhancements</strong> - Specialized gems that can only be purchased with honor</li></ul><p>A complete PvP gear setup can require over 200,000 honor points plus numerous battleground marks, making honor farming one of the most time-intensive activities in TBC Classic.</p><h2><strong>Service Features</strong></h2><h3>Flexible Honor Packages</h3><ul><li><strong>Minimum Order</strong>: 10,000 Honor Points</li><li><strong>Maximum Order</strong>: 75,000 Honor Points (full cap)</li><li><strong>Custom Amounts</strong>: Choose exactly how much honor you need for specific items</li></ul><h3>Professional Boosting Team</h3><p>Our experienced players specialize in efficient honor farming strategies:</p><ul><li>High win-rate battleground specialists</li><li>Strategic gameplay focused on maximizing honor per hour</li><li>Knowledge of optimal battleground rotations</li><li>Coordination for quick and decisive victories</li></ul><h3>Estimated Completion Time</h3><p>Standard farming rate: 4,500 - 6,500 honor points per day</p><h3>Transparency &amp; Communication</h3><ul><li><strong>Progress Updates</strong>: Regular screenshots or live streams available upon request</li><li><strong>Real-Time Tracking</strong>: Know exactly how your boost is progressing</li><li><strong>24/7 Support</strong>: Our team is available to answer questions throughout the service</li></ul><h3>Account Security</h3><ul><li>Professional, discrete service</li><li>No communication with other players from your account</li><li>Secure handling of all account information</li><li>VPN protection matching your location</li></ul><h2><strong>Why Choose Misti Services?</strong></h2><h3>Experienced Professionals</h3><p>Our boosters are veteran PvP players who understand:</p><ul><li>Optimal battleground strategies for each map</li><li>How to maximize honor gain per hour</li><li>Team coordination for consistent victories</li><li>Faction-specific advantages and challenges</li></ul><h3>Time-Efficient Solution</h3><p>Without professional help, farming a complete blue PvP set requires a grind comparable to the infamous Rank 14 system from Classic WoW. Save yourself weeks of repetitive gameplay and let our experts handle the grind.</p><h3>Safe &amp; Secure</h3><ul><li>Strict privacy protocols</li><li>No botting or automation - 100% manual gameplay</li><li>Clean account history maintenance</li><li>Discrete service with no in-game communication</li></ul>', '<ul><li>Select your desired options and complete your order on&nbsp;Misti.Services.</li><li>You’ll receive an order confirmation and tracking number via email.</li><li>Our support manager will contact you through live chat to confirm all details.</li><li>If you’re unavailable, we’ll reach out via email or your preferred contact method.</li><li>When the boost is finished, you’ll receive a completion notification on Discord or another messenger of your choice.</li></ul>', '<ul><li>Level 70 Character</li><li>Active TBC Classic Subscription</li><li>Account Sharing</li></ul>', 0.0023, 'https://i.ibb.co/YTczPBYp/tbc-honor-farm-boost.png', NULL, 4.9, 0, true, true, 0, '2025-11-12T19:59:54.868984+00:00', '2026-02-17T16:54:31.237516+00:00', 'd3e97c55-a89f-439d-aa5a-00f87f713e07', true, '{"step":1000,"max_value":75000,"min_value":5000,"slider_type":"single","value_label":"Honor","default_value":25000,"pricing_brackets":[{"end":75000,"price":0,"start":5000}],"estimated_time_per_step":0.05}', true, 2, '15 minutes', 'average start time', 'Flexible', 'order completion', 'Professional TBC Classic Honor farming service. Get 10,000-75,000 honor points for PvP gear. Fast delivery, secure piloted service. 4,500-6,500 honor daily. Order now!', 'TBC honor farm, TBC Classic honor farming, buy TBC honor, TBC honor boost, TBC PvP boost, WoW TBC honor service, TBC battleground boost, TBC Classic honor grinding, TBC honor farming service, TBC honor points boost, WoW TBC Classic honor, TBC PvP gear farming, buy honor points TBC, TBC honor farm service, professional honor farming TBC, TBC battleground farming, how to farm honor fast in TBC Classic, TBC honor farming guide, buy TBC Classic honor points, TBC honor boost safe, fastest way to farm honor TBC, TBC honor cap boost, TBC 75000 honor farming, TBC honor and marks service, TBC honor farm EU, TBC honor boost US, TBC honor farming service NA, TBC honor boost Europe', 'https://kdjlhibxxygfdmlvdfcl.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/game-images/tbc-honor-farm-1762980552694.webp', NULL, 'Tbc Honor Farm', 'WoW TBC Honor Farming - PvP Boost | misti.services', NULL);
INSERT INTO public.products (id, name, slug, short_description, description, how_it_works, requirements, base_price, image_url, badge_text, trust_score, total_reviews, is_active, is_featured, sort_order, created_at, updated_at, category_id, is_slider_product, slider_config, is_manually_popular, total_sales, start_time_text, start_time_value, delivery_text, delivery_value, meta_description, meta_keywords, og_image, canonical_url, image_alt_text, meta_title, parent_link) VALUES ('a1e0aff6-9564-4018-9de6-06cc389889c0', 'Corruption of the Aspects', 'corruption-of-the-aspects', 'This mount represents a dark alternate reality where the Dragon Aspects fell to the Void. It is a unique reward linked to the War Within pre-patch festivities. The primary barrier to entry is the cost: Displaced Corrupted Mementos.', '<h1><strong>Corruption of the Aspects Mount Boost</strong></h1><p><strong>Unleash the Void. Secure one of the most visually striking dragons in The War Within without the endless currency grind.</strong></p><p>The <strong>Corruption of the Aspects</strong> is a terrifyingly beautiful mount, twisting the majesty of the dragonflights with the chaotic energy of the Void. With its shadowy wings, corrupted scale textures, and pulsating glow, it is the ultimate status symbol for players who want to stand out in Azeroth.</p><p>However, obtaining this beast is no simple task. It is tied to the War Within pre-patch event and requires a staggering <strong>40,000 Displaced Corrupted Mementos</strong>. Farming this currency typically involves running repetitive content like Horrific Visions over and over again. The drop rates are low, and the event is time-limited.</p><p>With <strong>misti.services</strong>, you do not have to spend your limited free time grinding mobs. Our team will farm the mementos efficiently and unlock this prestigious mount for your collection.</p><h2><strong>Service Includes</strong></h2><p>When you order the <strong>Corruption of the Aspects Carry</strong>, we handle the entire farming process from start to finish. The service guarantees:</p><ul><li><strong>The Mount:</strong> Corruption of the Aspects added to your collection.</li><li><strong>The Grind:</strong> Farming of <strong>40,000 Displaced Corrupted Mementos</strong> required for purchase.</li><li><strong>Loot Rights:</strong> You keep all gold, items, and resources that drop during the farming process.</li><li><strong>Manual Service:</strong> 100% hand-played by experienced boosters.</li></ul><h2><strong>About Corruption of the Aspects Mount</strong></h2><p>This mount represents a dark alternate reality where the Dragon Aspects fell to the Void. It is a unique reward linked to the War Within pre-patch festivities. The primary barrier to entry is the cost: <strong>Displaced Corrupted Mementos</strong>.</p><p>These mementos are a special event currency. Earning 40,000 of them is a massive undertaking that forces players to grind specific event activities repeatedly. Since the event is not permanent, there is a high risk of missing out if you cannot play daily. Our boost ensures you get the mount before it becomes unobtainable.</p><h2><strong>Boost Options</strong></h2><p>We offer two secure methods to complete your service:</p><ul><li><strong>Account Sharing (Piloted):</strong> Our professional booster logs into your account to complete the farm. We use strict security measures, including a VPN matching your country, to ensure your account remains safe.</li><li><strong>Remote Control:</strong> For maximum security, our booster connects to your PC via a secure app like Parsec. They play using your mouse and keyboard while you watch the screen. Your login details are never shared.</li></ul>', '<ul><li><strong>Select Options:</strong> Choose your preferred boost method (Account Sharing or Remote Control).</li><li><strong>Order Confirmation:</strong> After payment, you will receive an order number and email confirmation.</li><li><strong>Contact:</strong> Our support manager will reach out via Live Chat or Discord to verify your details.</li><li><strong>Assignment:</strong> We assign a professional booster to your order.</li><li><em>For Account Sharing:</em> The booster logs in securely to begin the farm.</li><li><em>For Remote Control:</em> We set up the connection so the booster can play on your PC.</li><li><strong>Completion:</strong> We notify you immediately via your preferred messenger once the 40,000 mementos are farmed and the mount is secured.</li><li><strong>Enjoy:</strong> Log in and ride your new Corruption of the Aspects mount!</li></ul>', '<ul><li><strong>Level:</strong> Level 80 Character.</li><li><strong>Expansion:</strong> The War Within active.</li><li><strong>Account:</strong> Active World of Warcraft subscription.</li></ul>', 24.65, 'https://kdjlhibxxygfdmlvdfcl.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/game-images/corruption-of-the-aspects-1763850815929.webp', NULL, 4.9, 0, true, true, 0, '2025-11-22T19:30:31.192764+00:00', '2025-12-16T07:22:44.881955+00:00', 'b4c0ccaf-a937-4b30-9ab4-7dacee8f739b', false, NULL, true, 0, '15 minutes', 'average start time', 'Flexible', 'order completion', 'Buy the Corruption of the Aspects mount. We grind 40,000 Displaced Corrupted Mementos from Horrific Visions fast. Guaranteed unlock at misti.services.', 'corruption of the aspects mount, war within pre-patch mount, displaced corrupted mementos farm, dragon aspects void mount, wow pre-patch exclusive mount, buy corruption of the aspects, cheap corruption of the aspects, fast corruption of the aspects, corruption of the aspects service, acquire corrupted dragon mount, war within mount reward, rare wow pre-patch mount', 'https://kdjlhibxxygfdmlvdfcl.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/game-images/corruption-of-the-aspects-1763850815929.webp', NULL, 'Game gaming service - Corruption of the Aspects', 'Get Corruption of Aspects Mount | misti.services', NULL);
