ne</strong> are a key currency in <em>Mists of Pandaria Classic</em>. They can be exchanged for <strong>Elder Charms of Good Fortune</strong>, which provide bonus rolls on raid and world boss loot. These charms are primarily earned through daily quests, rare mob kills, and dungeon or scenario completions.</p><p>Our boosting team uses optimized routes and strategies across Pandaria — from Golden Lotus and Shado-Pan dailies to elite mob hunts — ensuring maximum charm yield in minimal time.</p><h3>Why Choose This Service</h3><ul><li><strong>Bonus Loot Access</strong> – Use charms to earn more rewards from raids and world bosses.</li><li><strong>Reputation Boost</strong> – Gain faction reputation while farming charms.</li><li><strong>Multiple Farming Methods</strong> – Includes dailies, rares, and dungeon activities.</li><li><strong>Time Efficiency</strong> – Skip the grind and enjoy faster progression.</li><li><strong>Safe and Reliable</strong> – Professional boosters ensure a secure, stress-free experience.</li></ul><h3>Enhance Your Pandaria Experience</h3><p>Get your <strong>Lesser Charms of Good Fortune</strong> efficiently with <strong>misti.services</strong>. Our team ensures you collect the currency needed for bonus rolls, faster gear upgrades, and reputation rewards — all without the endless grind.</p>', '<ul><li>Select your desired options and complete your order on&nbsp;Misti.Services.</li><li>You’ll receive an order confirmation and tracking number via email.</li><li>Our support manager will contact you through live chat to confirm all details.</li><li>If you’re unavailable, we’ll reach out via email or your preferred contact method.</li><li>When the boost is finished, you’ll receive a completion notification on Discord or another messenger of your choice.</li></ul>', '<ul><li>Level 90 character in Pandaria Classic</li><li>Vale of Eternal Blossoms daily hub unlocked</li><li>Active WoW subscription</li></ul><p><span style="color: rgb(250, 250, 250); background-color: rgba(23, 32, 48, 0.9);">Need help reaching level 90? Try our&nbsp;</span><a href="https://misti.services/game/wow-mistsofpandaria-classic" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank" style="color: rgb(60, 113, 221); background-color: rgba(23, 32, 48, 0.9);">WoW Power Leveling Boost</a><span style="color: rgb(250, 250, 250); background-color: rgba(23, 32, 48, 0.9);">&nbsp;</span></p>', 0, 'https://kdjlhibxxygfdmlvdfcl.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/game-images/lesser-charms-of-good-fortune-1762690977999.webp', NULL, 4.9, 350, true, true, 0, '2025-11-01T04:53:45.392357+00:00', '2025-12-16T07:51:44.322769+00:00', 'af2a9cdb-9bf6-444c-b4e1-97ad8c383155', true, '{"step":30,"max_value":630,"min_value":0,"slider_type":"single","value_label":"Amount of Lesser Charm of Good Fortune","default_value":30,"pricing_brackets":[{"end":630,"price":0.234,"start":0}],"estimated_time_per_step":0.02}', true, 0, '15 minutes', 'average start time', '1 hour', 'per 30 charms farmed', 'Buy MoP Classic Lesser Charms of Good Fortune Farm at misti.services. Get charms fast for bonus rolls, reputation, and efficient gearing in Pandaria Classic.', 'mop classic lesser charms of good fortune, buy lesser charms mop classic, fast mop classic charms farm, pandaria classic bonus rolls, mop classic reputation farm, efficient pandaria gearing, wow mop classic charms service, buy mop classic charms online, cheap lesser charms mop, mop classic charms for gearing, pandaria classic bonus roll farm, mop classic lesser charms guide', 'https://kdjlhibxxygfdmlvdfcl.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/game-images/lesser-charms-of-good-fortune-1762690977999.webp', NULL, 'Lesser Charms Of Good Fortune', 'WoW MoP Lesser Charms Farm | misti.services', NULL);
INSERT INTO public.products (id, name, slug, short_description, description, how_it_works, requirements, base_price, image_url, badge_text, trust_score, total_reviews, is_active, is_featured, sort_order, created_at, updated_at, category_id, is_slider_product, slider_config, is_manually_popular, total_sales, start_time_text, start_time_value, delivery_text, delivery_value, meta_description, meta_keywords, og_image, canonical_url, image_alt_text, meta_title, parent_link) VALUES ('174e5a48-de41-4350-9eae-491571e5ea1a', 'Challenge Mode Silver Pack', 'challenge-mode-silver-pack', 'Complete all MoP Challenge Modes with Silver medals. Earn exclusive mounts, titles, and achievements safely with expert boosters.', '<h1><strong>MoP Classic Challenge Mode Silver Pack</strong></h1><h3>Earn Silver Medals and Unlock Unique Mounts</h3><p>Buy the <strong>WoW Pandaria Classic </strong><a href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/guide/dungeons/challenge-modes-overview" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank"><strong>Challenge Mode</strong></a><strong> Silver Pack</strong> from Misti Services to complete all Challenge Mode dungeons with guaranteed Silver times. Our professional boosting team helps you earn the <strong>Challenge Conqueror: Silver</strong> achievement, the <strong>Ancestral Phoenix Egg</strong> mount reward, and the <strong>Undaunted</strong> title — quickly, safely, and stress-free.</p><p>Challenge Modes in Mists of Pandaria Classic test player coordination and mastery. Gear is normalized for fairness, meaning every victory depends on your group’s skill and precision. Let our experts handle the complex mechanics so you can enjoy your rewards without the grind.</p><h3>What’s Included</h3><ul><li>Completion of all nine Challenge Mode dungeons with Silver rating</li><li>Challenge Conqueror: Silver achievement</li><li>The Undaunted title</li><li>Ancestral Phoenix Egg, which can be exchanged for one of four Pandaren Phoenix mounts: Ashen, Emerald, Violet, or Crimson</li></ul><h3>Boost Options</h3><p><strong>Piloted Boost</strong></p><p>A professional booster logs into your account and completes all Silver Challenge Modes for you.</p><p><strong>Selfplay Boost</strong></p><p>Join our experienced team and complete the runs yourself, guided by skilled players who ensure every dungeon is finished within the Silver time.</p><p><strong>Remote Control Boost</strong></p><p>Our booster connects securely through a remote control app such as Parsec, allowing you to watch all progress live while we handle the gameplay.</p><h3>About the MoP Classic Challenge Mode Silver Pack</h3><p>Challenge Modes are timed five-player dungeons that scale your gear to a fixed level, emphasizing teamwork and execution. The Silver Pack includes completion of all nine dungeons with Silver medals. This difficulty level provides a balance of challenge and accessibility — perfect for players who want rewarding gameplay without the extreme precision required for Gold.</p><p>The nine Challenge Mode dungeons include Gate of the Setting Sun, Mogu’shan Palace, Scarlet Halls, Scarlet Monastery, Scholomance, Shado-Pan Monastery, Siege of Niuzao Temple, Stormstout Brewery, and Temple of the Jade Serpent. Each features unique mechanics and requires efficient teamwork to complete within the time limit.</p><h3>Rewards for Silver Completion</h3><p>Earning Silver medals in all Challenge Mode dungeons grants the <strong>Challenge Conqueror: Silver</strong> achievement and the <strong>Ancestral Phoenix Egg</strong>. This rare reward can be exchanged for one of four stunning Pandaren Phoenix mounts: Ashen, Emerald, Violet, or Crimson. You’ll also receive the <strong>Undaunted</strong> title and all Bronze-tier rewards.</p><h3>Why Choose the Silver Pack</h3><p><strong>Exclusive Mounts</strong> – Unlock one of four unique Pandaren Phoenix flying mounts.</p><p><strong>Skill Development</strong> – Improve teamwork, awareness, and speed in coordinated dungeon runs.</p><p><strong>Prestigious Rewards</strong> – Earn the Challenge Conqueror: Silver achievement and The Undaunted title.</p><p><strong>Preparation for Gold</strong> – Gain valuable experience to prepare for the Gold Challenge Mode difficulty.</p><p><strong>Safe and Reliable</strong> – Your account and data are protected throughout the process.</p><h3>Why Choose Misti Services</h3><p>Misti Services delivers professional World of Warcraft boosting solutions trusted by thousands of players worldwide. We prioritize account safety, transparent communication, and high-quality performance.</p><p>Get your <strong>MoP Classic Challenge Mode Silver Pack</strong> today and unlock exclusive rewards, rare mounts, and achievements with ease.</p>', '<ul><li>Select your desired options and complete your order on&nbsp;Misti.Services.</li><li>You’ll receive an order confirmation and tracking number via email.</li><li>Our support manager will contact you through live chat to confirm all details.</li><li>If you’re unavailable, we’ll reach out via email or your preferred contact method.</li><li>When the boost is finished, you’ll receive a completion notification on Discord or another messenger of your choice.</li></ul>', '<ul><li>Active World of Warcraft subscription</li><li>Level 90 character</li></ul><p>Need help reaching level 90? Try our&nbsp;<a href="https://misti.services/game/wow-mistsofpandaria-classic" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank" style="color: rgb(60, 113, 221);">WoW Power Leveling Boost</a>&nbsp;</p>', 59, 'https://kdjlhibxxygfdmlvdfcl.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/game-images/challenge-mode-silver-pack-1762549624085.webp', NULL, 4.9, 350, true, true, 0, '2025-10-31T16:55:53.83645+00:00', '2025-12-16T07:51:46.945457+00:00', 'cfe09cfd-59e3-467e-bbcd-f3b0373cdc84', false, NULL, true, 0, '15 minutes', 'average start time', '3 days', 'order completion', 'Complete all MoP Challenge Modes with Silver medals. Earn exclusive mounts, titles, and achievements safely with expert boosters.', 'challenge mode silver pack, mop challenge modes silver, mop challenge mode boost, game challenge mode carry, mop silver medal service, game silver challenge mode, exclusive mop mounts, challenge mode titles unlock, mop achievements boost, expert mop boosters, fast challenge mode completion, safe mop boosting, buy mop silver run, professional challenge mode service', 'https://kdjlhibxxygfdmlvdfcl.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/game-images/challenge-mode-silver-pack-1762549624085.webp', NULL, 'Challenge Mode Silver Pack', 'WoW MoP Classic Challenge Mode Silver | misti.services', NULL);
INSERT INTO public.products (id, name, slug, short_description, description, how_it_works, requirements, base_price, image_url, badge_text, trust_score, total_reviews, is_active, is_featured, sort_order, created_at, updated_at, category_id, is_slider_product, slider_config, is_manually_popular, total_sales, start_time_text, start_time_value, delivery_text, delivery_value, meta_description, meta_keywords, og_image, canonical_url, image_alt_text, meta_title, parent_link) VALUES ('f8768457-209c-490d-9fcf-82041dc85e16', 'WoW Gladiator', 'wow-gladiator', 'Skip the months of frustrating grind and immense time investment required for top-tier competitive play. Secure the most prestigious PvP achievement in World of Warcraft with our guaranteed Gladiator Title Boost service.  This offer ensures your character reaches the necessary top ladder position in the elite arena bracket by the season''s end, rewarding you with unique, permanent glory.', '<h1><strong>WoW Gladiator Boost</strong></h1><p>The <a href="https://www.wowhead.com/achievement=2091/gladiator" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">Gladiator </a>title is the most prestigious and honorable PvP achievement in World of Warcraft. It is awarded for winning a substantial number of games in the elite arena bracket at an extremely high rating. Our service allows you to secure the Gladiator title, equip your character in high item level PvP gear, and unlock the unique epic PvP set appearance.</p><p>This offer guarantees you a top ladder position by the end of the current PvP season, rewarding you with this unique and permanent title. Buy your Gladiator title boost from Misti.services today and bypass the immense time investment required to master this challenge alone.</p><h3>Gladiator Boost Rewards</h3><p>This is a complete package that ensures maximum prestige and gear for your character:</p><ul><li><a href="https://www.wowhead.com/achievement=2091/gladiator" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank"><strong>Gladiator </strong></a><strong>Title:</strong> The coveted, permanent Feat of Strength title for the current <em>The War Within</em> season.</li><li><strong>Elite Seasonal Mount:</strong> The unique, seasonal mount (e.g., the <strong>Astral Gladiator''s Fel Bat</strong>).</li><li><strong>Full Elite Transmog Set:</strong> Unlock the complete <strong>Elite PvP transmog set</strong> appearance.</li><li><strong>Vicious Mount:</strong> The seasonal <strong>Vicious mount</strong> reward.</li><li><strong>High-Rating Achievements:</strong> All related high-rating arena achievements.</li></ul><h3>Why Is the Gladiator Title So Prestigious?</h3><p>Anyone who has competed in WoW PvP knows how difficult it is to get the Gladiator title. This difficulty is precisely what makes the achievement so prestigious. To obtain it, players must demonstrate masterful skill and a deep understanding of the game, as reaching this rating is an impossible feat for most.</p><p>Players with this title truly stand out from the crowd. They ride their elite Gladiator mounts, which are now account-wide, and enjoy their well-earned glory! Today, Misti.services gives you the opportunity to become one of them. Choose us and skip all the stress and frustration of the competitive ladder.</p>', '<ul><li><strong>Purchase the Service:</strong> You buy our guaranteed Gladiator title boost for the current PvP season.</li><li><strong>We Do the Work:</strong> Our service ensures your character reaches a <strong>top ladder position</strong> in the elite arena bracket and secures the necessary high-rating wins.</li><li><strong>Claim Your Rewards:</strong> You receive the <strong>Gladiator title</strong> and all associated seasonal items without lifting a finger.</li></ul>', '<ul><li>Level 80</li><li>Full Conquest Gear</li></ul>', 545.06, 'https://kdjlhibxxygfdmlvdfcl.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/game-images/wow-gladiator-1762439334939.webp', NULL, 4.9, 350, true, false, 0, '2025-10-23T15:16:52.307719+00:00', '2025-12-16T07:55:09.818455+00:00', '31441b65-4762-40ea-b89f-9fd09aebe8ba', false, NULL, true, 0, '15 minutes', 'average start time', 'Flexible', 'order completion', 'WoW Gladiator Boost The Gladiator title is the most prestigious and honorable PvP achievement in World of Warcraft.', 'wow gladiator boost, world of warcraft gladiator title, buy wow gladiator, gladiator achievement wow, wow pvp boost service, elite arena gladiator wow, guaranteed gladiator title, fast wow gladiator, wow gladiator carry, pvp rank boost wow, wow arena top ladder, gladiator title wow season, cheap wow gladiator boost, professional wow gladiator service', 'https://kdjlhibxxygfdmlvdfcl.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/game-images/wow-gladiator-1762439334939.webp', NULL, 'Wow Gladiator', 'War Within Gladiator Boost | misti.services', NULL);
INSERT INTO public.products (id, name, slug, short_description, description, how_it_works, requirements, base_price, image_url, badge_text, trust_score, total_reviews, is_active, is_featured, sort_order, created_at, updated_at, category_id, is_slider_product, slider_config, is_manually_popular, total_sales, start_time_text, start_time_value, delivery_text, delivery_value, meta_description, meta_keywords, og_image, canonical_url, image_alt_text, meta_title, parent_link) VALUES ('2083c85e-8ea9-4018-9d70-e5844dca7936', 'EFT Powerleveling', 'eft-pmc-leveling-boost', 'Accelerate your gameplay with the Misti Services EFT Leveling Boost. This service is the most efficient method to bypass the grueling early-game grind and secure a competitive edge immediately. Our veteran players will manually pilot your account to unlock the Flea Market, max out your traders, and complete difficult entry-level quests. All leveling is performed 100% manually and safely by Tarkov experts. ', '<h1><strong>Escape from Tarkov PMC Leveling Boost</strong></h1><h2><strong>Fast-Track Your Wipe Progression</strong></h2><p>Accelerate your gameplay with the Misti Services EFT Leveling Boost. This service is the most efficient method to bypass the grueling early-game grind and secure a competitive edge immediately. Our veteran players will manually pilot your account to unlock the Flea Market, max out your traders, and complete difficult entry-level quests. All leveling is performed 100% manually and safely by Tarkov experts. Trust Misti Services to boost your PMC to the top.</p><h3><strong>Service Includes</strong></h3><ul><li><strong>Custom Level Targets:</strong> Fast PMC leveling boost to any specific level you desire.</li><li><strong>Trader Unlocks:</strong> Unlock high-tier trader inventory and quests by meeting level requirements efficiently.</li><li><strong>Flea Market Access:</strong> Rapidly reach Level 15 to access the global player market and economy.</li><li><strong>XP Maximization:</strong> Our experts utilize optimal routes and quest completion strategies to maximize XP gain per hour.</li><li><strong>Loot Retention:</strong> All Roubles, gear, keys, and valuable items found during the service remain in your stash.</li><li><strong>100% Safe Service:</strong> We use strict security protocols, including VPNs, and perform all leveling manually without bots or cheats.</li></ul><h3><strong>Boost Options Explained</strong></h3><ul><li><strong>Piloted:</strong> A professional booster logs into your account to complete the leveling process.</li><li><strong>Stream:</strong> The booster will live stream the gameplay on Discord or Twitch so you can watch the progress in real-time.</li><li><strong>Normal:</strong> Your order is placed in the standard queue with standard task execution priority.</li><li><strong>Express:</strong> Your order receives high-priority status for an accelerated start time and faster completion.</li></ul><h3><strong>About Escape from Tarkov Leveling</strong></h3><p><strong>Why Misti Services is Your Best Choice</strong> Our EFT Leveling Boost is the fastest way to increase your PMC level and unlock the critical features of Escape from Tarkov. Your character level is the primary gatekeeper for trader loyalty, the Flea Market, and high-tier quests. This power leveling service helps you bypass the dangerous and slow early-wipe grind, giving you immediate access to the best parts of the game.</p><p><strong>Why Leveling is Everything in Tarkov</strong> In Escape from Tarkov, a higher PMC level gives you a massive competitive advantage. It is the key to unlocking:</p><ul><li><strong>Trader Loyalty Levels:</strong> You cannot buy meta armor, weapons, and ammo until you meet the level requirements for each trader''s higher tiers (LL2, LL3, LL4).</li><li><strong>The Flea Market:</strong> Unlocked at Level 15, this gives you access to the player-driven economy, fundamentally changing how you can build kits and generate wealth.</li><li><strong>Advanced Quests:</strong> The most rewarding and important quests from all traders are locked behind level prerequisites.</li><li><strong>Hideout Upgrades:</strong> Many of the best hideout modules, like high-level workstations and the Bitcoin farm, require a specific character level to be constructed.</li></ul><p><strong>What You Get with Our Tarkov Leveling Boost</strong></p><ul><li><strong>Your Desired PMC Level:</strong> Choose your target level, whether it is Level 15 to unlock the Flea Market or Level 42 for max traders.</li><li><strong>Quest-Based Leveling:</strong> Our boosters focus on completing quests in the most efficient order, as this is the absolute fastest way to gain XP.</li><li><strong>Keep All Loot:</strong> You keep 100% of the Roubles, valuable items, and quest rewards acquired during the leveling process.</li></ul><h3><strong>Why Choose Misti Services?</strong></h3><ul><li><strong>Expert Boosters:</strong> Our team consists of wipe progression experts who know the most efficient questing routes to maximize XP per hour.</li><li><strong>Security First:</strong> We perform all leveling 100% manually and securely. Our high survival rate ensures your character progresses safely and legitimately.</li><li><strong>24/7 Support:</strong> Our live support team is always available to provide updates on your character''s level progression.</li></ul>', '<ul><li><strong>Select Your Range:</strong> Choose your current level and your desired target level (e.g., Level 1 to 15 for Flea Market unlock) and place your order.</li><li><strong>Expert Assignment:</strong> We assign a veteran EFT operator to your order who has mastered the optimal questing routes for the fastest XP gain.</li><li><strong>The Grind:</strong> Our pro completes quests in an efficient order, eliminates targets, and ensures a high survival rate to maximize all XP bonuses.</li><li><strong>Unlock Content:</strong> Your PMC reaches the target level, unlocking access to new trader tiers, better gear, the Flea Market, and advanced quests.</li><li><strong>Completion:</strong> The boost is complete once your character hits the desired level. You can then log back in to enjoy your head start.</li></ul>', '<ul><li><strong>Game Copy:</strong> Escape from Tarkov must be purchased and active on your account.</li><li><strong>Account Access:</strong> We require temporary account access (Piloted mode) to perform the leveling service.</li></ul>', 1, 'https://kdjlhibxxygfdmlvdfcl.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/game-images/xm2zqawvs5f.webp', NULL, 4.9, 0, true, true, 0, '2025-12-05T13:33:49.620208+00:00', '2025-12-16T00:27:09.210869+00:00', '5a461f21-24b8-47e5-afe0-b350cf414cb0', true, '{"step":1,"end_label":"Desired Level","max_value":55,"min_value":1,"default_end":32,"start_label":"Start Level","default_start":1,"pricing_brackets":[{"end":20,"price":65,"start":1},{"end":30,"price":69,"start":21},{"end":40,"price":139,"start":31},{"end":55,"price":605,"start":41}],"estimated_time_per_step":0.5}', true, 0, '15 minutes', 'average start time', 'Flexible', 'order completion', 'Get the ultimate head start in EFT. Our Leveling Boost service gets you to Level 15 and beyond quickly and safely. Keep all loot. Order now at Misti Services.', 'Escape from Tarkov leveling boost, EFT power leveling, buy tarkov level boost, fast PMC leveling, EFT flea market unlock, tarkov level 15 boost, escape from tarkov xp farm, EFT trader leveling service, tarkov wipe progression, cheap eft boost, tarkov piloted leveling, buy tarkov exp, tarkov quest boosting, level up fast tarkov, tarkov carry service, manual eft leveling, safe tarkov boost, misti services tarkov, eft powerleveling service, tarkov max traders boost, tarkov kappa grind, tarkov level 42 boost, escape from tarkov account boost, tarkov rapid leveling, eft experience farm, tarkov level boosting service, eft pmc boost, tarkov loyalty level unlock, buy tarkov levels, eft power leveling carry, tarkov bitcoin farm unlock, tarkov jaeg