el raid gear from these instances</li><li>All achievements required for the meta completed by professionals</li><li>100% hand-played, secure, and confidential service</li><li>All loot, gold, and rewards remain on your account</li></ul><h3>Boost Options</h3><p><strong>Piloted Boost</strong></p><p>A professional player logs into your account and completes the raids safely.</p><p><strong>Selfplay Boost</strong></p><p>Join the booster team and participate in the achievement runs yourself.</p><p><strong>Remote Control Boost</strong></p><p>Our player connects through a secure remote session, allowing you to watch every step live while we play on your screen.</p><h3>About Glory of the Pandaria Raider</h3><p>The <strong>Glory of the Pandaria Raider</strong> meta-achievement challenges players to complete multiple raid-specific achievements across Pandaria’s first three major raids. Finishing it rewards the <strong>Heavenly Crimson Cloud Serpent</strong>, one of the most sought-after mounts in World of Warcraft.</p><p>Each raid contains numerous unique achievements that test coordination, mechanics, and timing. With <strong>misti.services</strong>, you skip the grind while still earning every achievement and reward securely.</p><h3>Why Choose Misti Services</h3><ul><li>Fast and professional raid completion by expert boosters</li><li>Guaranteed achievements and mount unlock</li><li>Safe, confidential, and hand-played service</li><li>Full control over schedule and delivery method</li><li>Trusted by thousands of players worldwide</li></ul><h3>Secure Your Heavenly Crimson Cloud Serpent Today</h3><p>Skip the long grind and unlock the <strong>Glory of the Pandaria Raider</strong> and its exclusive <strong>Heavenly Crimson Cloud Serpent</strong> mount with help from <strong>misti.services</strong>. Enjoy a fast, stress-free experience while professionals handle every raid and achievement for you.</p>', '<ul><li>Select your desired options and complete your order on&nbsp;Misti.Services.</li><li>You’ll receive an order confirmation and tracking number via email.</li><li>Our support manager will contact you through live chat to confirm all details.</li><li>If you’re unavailable, we’ll reach out via email or your preferred contact method.</li><li>When the boost is finished, you’ll receive a completion notification on Discord or another messenger of your choice.</li></ul>', '<ul><li>Active <strong>World of Warcraft: Mists of Pandaria Classic</strong> subscription</li><li>Level 90 character</li><li>Fresh raid lockouts for Mogu’shan Vaults, Heart of Fear, and Terrace of Endless Spring</li></ul><p><span style="background-color: rgba(23, 32, 48, 0.9); color: rgb(250, 250, 250);">Need help reaching level 90? Try our&nbsp;</span><a href="https://misti.services/game/wow-mistsofpandaria-classic" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank" style="background-color: rgba(23, 32, 48, 0.9); color: rgb(60, 113, 221);">WoW Power Leveling Boost</a><span style="background-color: rgba(23, 32, 48, 0.9); color: rgb(250, 250, 250);">&nbsp;</span></p>', 399.96, 'https://kdjlhibxxygfdmlvdfcl.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/game-images/glory-of-the-pandaria-raider-1764189204831.webp', NULL, 4.9, 350, true, true, 0, '2025-10-31T17:58:17.967831+00:00', '2025-12-16T07:51:51.772479+00:00', 'ce7082cb-9422-40a0-bda1-cd009133aeda', false, NULL, true, 0, '1 day', 'average start time', '2 weeks', 'order completion', 'Unlock the Heavenly Crimson Cloud Serpent fast with the Glory of the Pandaria Raider Boost from misti.services. Safe, quick, and achievement-ready.', 'glory of the pandaria raider boost, heavenly crimson cloud serpent unlock, pandaria raider achievement boost, buy glory of the pandaria raider, fast pandaria raider mount, safe pandaria raider boost, wow pandaria raider service, misti.services pandaria raider, dragon soul raid achievements, cataclysm raid mount boost, glory of the pandaria raider cheap, wow achievement boost service, heavenly crimson cloud serpent guaranteed', 'https://kdjlhibxxygfdmlvdfcl.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/game-images/glory-of-the-pandaria-raider-1764189204831.webp', NULL, 'Glory Of The Pandaria Raider', 'WoW MoP Glory of Pandaria Raider | misti.services', NULL);
INSERT INTO public.products (id, name, slug, short_description, description, how_it_works, requirements, base_price, image_url, badge_text, trust_score, total_reviews, is_active, is_featured, sort_order, created_at, updated_at, category_id, is_slider_product, slider_config, is_manually_popular, total_sales, start_time_text, start_time_value, delivery_text, delivery_value, meta_description, meta_keywords, og_image, canonical_url, image_alt_text, meta_title, parent_link) VALUES ('17f71efd-c361-4a06-a229-e8cfb7efb778', 'Ground Zero Raid ', 'escape-from-tarkov-ground-zero-raid-boost', 'Starting a new wipe in Escape from Tarkov can feel overwhelming, especially when every mistake is happening on your very first map. Ground Zero is designed for beginners, but the high number of new players, early quests, and constant chaos can make it a real hurdle instead of a gentle introduction.', '<h1><strong>Escape from Tarkov Ground Zero Raid Boost</strong></h1><p>Starting a new wipe in Escape from Tarkov can feel overwhelming, especially when every mistake is happening on your very first map. Ground Zero is designed for beginners, but the high number of new players, early quests, and constant chaos can make it a real hurdle instead of a gentle introduction.</p><p>The <strong>Escape from Tarkov Ground Zero Raid Boost from misti.services</strong> is built to give you a safe, powerful start. Our pros help you complete your first quests, learn the layout, understand the basics of survival, and turn your initial raids into real progress instead of frustration.</p><h2><strong>Service Includes</strong></h2><p>When you order the Ground Zero Raid Boost from misti.services, you get:</p><ul><li>Tarkov Ground Zero raids completed based on your selected package</li><li>Help mastering the beginner map so you can start your journey with confidence</li><li>Support for completing introductory quests and early tasks tied to Ground Zero</li><li>A guided introduction to core Tarkov mechanics like extraction, positioning, basic looting, and questing</li><li>A fast and secure service focused on getting you through the chaotic city center safely</li><li>All loot, quest items, and experience gained during the boost stay on your account</li></ul><h2><strong>Boost Options Explained</strong></h2><ul><li><strong>Piloted</strong> – A Tarkov veteran logs into your account and completes Ground Zero raids on your PMC, focusing on your early quests and fast progression. This is ideal if you mainly want completed tasks and a stronger starting character.</li><li><strong>Selfplay</strong> – You play together with our booster in a squad. They act as your guide and bodyguard, explaining what they’re doing while helping you stay alive and complete your first objectives. Perfect if you want to <em>learn</em> while progressing.</li><li><strong>Stream</strong> – You can request the service to be streamed so you can watch exactly how the booster moves, fights, and completes quests, even if you’re not in the raid with them. It’s a great way to learn routes and basic decision-making.</li></ul><h2><strong>About EFT Ground Zero Raid Boost</strong></h2><p>Ground Zero is the mandatory starting map for all new PMCs. It’s packed with:</p><ul><li>Essential early-game quests</li><li>High traffic from new and low-level players</li><li>A dense city layout that can be confusing at first</li></ul><p>Our <strong>Ground Zero Raid Boost</strong> is designed to remove the painful part of the learning curve:</p><ul><li>You get guided through your first real Tarkov experiences</li><li>You learn extractions, key quest spots, and basic decision-making in live raids</li><li>You avoid getting stuck for hours on simple tasks because of random deaths and confusion</li></ul><p>Instead of stumbling blind through your first wipe hours, you start with a clear introduction and practical help from someone who has done it many times before.</p><h3><strong>Common Objectives on the Ground Zero Map</strong></h3><p>We can tailor the boost around the most important early-game goals:</p><ul><li><strong>Learning the Basics</strong></li><li> Our pro can teach you the fundamentals of Tarkov in real-time: how to move safely, listen to audio, check corners, loot properly, manage health, and extract.</li><li><strong>Surviving the Chaos</strong></li><li> Ground Zero is full of new players, and that unpredictability can be lethal. Having a veteran with you dramatically increases your survival rate and reduces early wipe frustrations.</li><li><strong>Finding Key Quest Locations</strong></li><li> We take you directly to important areas such as the Emercom station, Terragroup building, and other early quest objectives so you know where to go and what to look for.</li></ul><h3><strong>Why Choose misti.services for Ground Zero?</strong></h3><ul><li><strong>Early-Game Specialists</strong> – Our boosters know the most efficient routes and patterns to complete all starting quests on Ground Zero quickly and safely.</li><li><strong>Learn or Let Us Handle It</strong> – With <strong>Selfplay</strong>, you learn alongside a pro; with <strong>Piloted</strong>, we complete everything for you while you relax. Either way, your account ends up ahead.</li><li><strong>100% Manual and Secure</strong> – All services are done by hand, with strong attention paid to safety and privacy so your account stays protected.</li><li><strong>24/7 Support</strong> – Our support team is always ready to help you set up your first Tarkov boost and answer your questions.</li><li><strong>Trusted Starter Boost</strong> – misti.services is a reliable choice for getting a fast and powerful start at the beginning of any Tarkov wipe.</li></ul><p>With the <strong>Escape from Tarkov Ground Zero Raid Boost</strong> from misti.services, your first steps in Tarkov become a guided, productive experience instead of a confusing and punishing trial by fire.</p>', '<ul><li><strong>Select Your Ground Zero Options</strong></li><li>Choose piloted or selfplay, tell us if you want more focus on quests, learning, or simple safe progress, and place your order on misti.services.</li><li><strong>We Assign a Tarkov Veteran</strong></li><li>A Ground Zero specialist is assigned to your order. They review your current account status, what quests you have unlocked, and what you want to achieve.</li><li><strong>Guided or Piloted Ground Zero Raids</strong></li><li class="ql-indent-1">In <strong>piloted</strong> mode, the booster runs raids on your PMC, completing your starting quests, securing loot, and making sure you leave Ground Zero in a much stronger position.</li><li class="ql-indent-1">In <strong>selfplay</strong>, you stay in the action, following the booster through the map while they explain key mechanics and keep you safe.</li><li><strong>Raids Completed, Loot Extracted</strong></li><li>Your early quests are progressed or completed, you gain experience and loot, and you come out of Ground Zero with more knowledge, gear, and confidence.</li><li><strong>Notification and Wrap-Up</strong></li><li>Once your requested raids or goals are completed, you’re notified and can log in to enjoy your boosted start and continue your wipe from a much better position.</li></ul><p><br></p>', '<ul><li>Escape from Tarkov purchased and accessible on your account</li><li>For piloted service: login details so our booster can play on your PMC</li><li>Basic stash space for loot and quest items obtained during the runs</li></ul><p><br></p>', 9, 'https://kdjlhibxxygfdmlvdfcl.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/game-images/escape-from-tarkov-ground-zero-raid-boost-1765386049146.webp', NULL, 4.9, 0, true, true, 0, '2025-12-08T22:00:54.394225+00:00', '2025-12-16T00:26:59.135215+00:00', '13095953-1c23-4cc6-9101-986220a1c75e', true, '{"step":1,"max_value":10,"min_value":1,"slider_type":"single","value_label":"Number of Runs","default_value":5,"pricing_brackets":[{"end":10,"price":0,"start":1}],"estimated_time_per_step":0.5}', true, 0, '15 minutes', 'average start time', 'Flexible', 'order completion', 'Start your Tarkov wipe strong with a Ground Zero Raid Boost from misti.services. Complete early quests, learn the basics, and survive your first raids!', 'escape from tarkov ground zero, tarkov ground zero raid boost, eft ground zero carry, tarkov beginner map boost, ground zero quest help, tarkov starting quests service, eft early game boost, tarkov new player carry, ground zero learning runs, tarkov tutorial style boost, escape from tarkov first raids, tarkov ground zero map guide, eft low level progression, tarkov wipe start boost, ground zero city center map, tarkov intro quests completion, eft safe early game, tarkov pmc starter help, ground zero extraction learning, eft survival basics training, tarkov selfplay ground zero boost, tarkov piloted ground zero boost, eft stream ground zero coaching, ground zero raid completion service, tarkov early stash building, tarkov new player friendly service, eft eu ground zero boost, eft us ground zero boost, safe tarkov boosting service, best tarkov starter boost, misti services tarkov ground zero, tarkov emergence station quest help, ground zero terragroup building quests, eft early xp farm, tarkov low level loot runs, ground zero quest locations, tarkov wipe fresh account help, escape from tarkov boosting services, tarkov intro map carry, ground zero map knowledge boost', 'https://kdjlhibxxygfdmlvdfcl.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/game-images/escape-from-tarkov-ground-zero-raid-boost-1765386049146.webp', NULL, 'Escape From Tarkov Ground Zero Raid Boost', 'EFT Ground Zero Raid Boost | misti.services', NULL);
