ritizing exclusive raid drops, rare items, and endgame gear</li><li>A <strong>fast and secure service</strong>, available both as a carry (you play with us) or a piloted completion (we do it for you)</li><li>All extracted items and rewards kept on <strong>your account</strong></li></ul><h2><strong>Boost Options Explained</strong></h2><ul><li><strong>Piloted</strong> – A professional Tarkov player logs into your account and completes Labyrinth runs on your PMC. They handle puzzles, bosses, and combat while you relax and enjoy the results.</li><li><strong>Selfplay (Carry)</strong> – You join our squad on your own account and play alongside our pros. They lead you through the maze, explain mechanics, and help you survive each encounter while you stay in full control of your character.</li><li><strong>Stream</strong> – You can request that the raid is livestreamed so you can watch your run in real time, learn routes and puzzle solutions, and see exactly how our team handles each fight!</li></ul><h2><strong>About Tarkov The Labyrinth Raid Carry</strong></h2><p>The Labyrinth is designed as the <strong>ultimate test</strong> of a squad’s coordination and skill:</p><ul><li>A <strong>true maze</strong> with multiple levels, dead ends, and disorienting passageways</li><li><strong>Tight, claustrophobic corridors</strong> that demand perfect close-quarters combat</li><li><strong>Complex puzzle mechanics</strong> and security systems that must be solved under pressure</li><li><strong>Exclusive rewards</strong> that only drop inside this raid, making it a key destination for serious endgame players</li></ul><p>Our <strong>Labyrinth Raid Boost</strong> is for players who want:</p><ul><li>A guaranteed clear of the raid without wasting dozens of attempts learning it blind</li><li>A chance to secure unique weapons, attachments, armor, and rare items that are only found here</li><li>Either a <strong>hands-off completion</strong> (piloted) or a <strong>guided endgame experience</strong> (selfplay) with a highly skilled squad</li></ul><h3><strong>Why The Labyrinth Is Tarkov’s Ultimate Challenge</strong></h3><p>Unlike other maps, The Labyrinth:</p><ul><li>Is built specifically as a <strong>multi-layered maze</strong> that is easy to get lost in</li><li>Punishes poor communication and shaky mechanics with quick squad wipes</li><li>Requires knowledge of <strong>puzzle routes, switches, and triggers</strong>, not just gun skill</li><li>Acts as a gatekeeper for some of Tarkov’s <strong>most unique and prestigious rewards</strong></li></ul><p>Success here is not just about gear – it’s about <strong>coordination, game knowledge, and execution</strong>. Our team brings all three.</p><h3><strong>What You Get with Our Labyrinth Raid Boost</strong></h3><p>With misti.services, your Labyrinth experience includes:</p><ul><li><strong>A Guaranteed Full Raid Clear</strong></li><li> Our team leads you from the entrance to the final extraction point, ensuring every key encounter and area is handled correctly.</li><li><strong>All Exclusive Raid Loot</strong></li><li> The Labyrinth is the best source for unique weapon attachments, high-tier armor, rare stims, and other items that stand above regular loot. Everything extracted stays on your account.</li><li><strong>Flexible &amp; Safe Options</strong></li><li> Choose to:</li><li class="ql-indent-1">Play alongside our pros in selfplay for a cooperative, high-end experience, or</li><li class="ql-indent-1">Let our booster run the raid for you in piloted mode if you just want the results.</li></ul><h3><strong>Why Choose misti.services for The Labyrinth?</strong></h3><ul><li><strong>Endgame Experts</strong> – Our boosters are high-level Tarkov players who have already mapped out and mastered The Labyrinth, including its secrets and optimal strategies.</li><li><strong>Selfplay and Piloted Options</strong> – You decide whether you want to participate in the raid or have it fully handled for you. Both methods are performed manually and safely.</li><li><strong>24/7 Live Support</strong> – Our support team is always available to answer questions, schedule runs, and keep you updated on your Labyrinth progress.</li><li><strong>Proven Track Record</strong> – misti.services has a long-standing reputation for clearing the newest and hardest endgame content across multiple games, including Tarkov.</li></ul><p>With the <strong>Escape from Tarkov The Labyrinth Raid Boost</strong> from misti.services, you can turn the game’s most confusing and deadly maze into a safe, controlled, and incredibly rewarding experience—without sacrificing your stash or your sanity.</p>', '<ul><li><strong>Select The Labyrinth Raid and Your Playstyle</strong></li><li>Choose piloted or selfplay, define your goals (full clear, loot-focused, boss-focused), and place your order on misti.services.</li><li><strong>We Assemble an Elite Tarkov Squad</strong></li><li>Your run is assigned to a team of endgame Tarkov specialists who have already mastered The Labyrinth’s puzzles, enemy patterns, and boss mechanics.</li><li><strong>Our Team Enters The Labyrinth</strong></li><li class="ql-indent-1">They solve complex electronic puzzles</li><li class="ql-indent-1">Fight through hordes of Raiders and elite enemies</li><li class="ql-indent-1">Clear special boss encounters and high-threat rooms</li><li><strong>Raid Completed, Loot Secured</strong></li><li>The Labyrinth is fully cleared as agreed, and all high-value loot is extracted and placed safely in your stash.</li><li><strong>Notification and Wrap-Up</strong></li><li>Once your run is complete, you are notified. You log in to enjoy your new exclusive gear, rare items, and the satisfaction of having beaten Tarkov’s deadliest raid.</li></ul><p><br></p>', '<ul><li><strong>Escape from Tarkov purchased</strong> and accessible on your account</li><li><strong>Access to The Labyrinth</strong>, including:</li><li class="ql-indent-1">Labrys Keycard</li><li class="ql-indent-1">Knossos LLC Facili