Guaranteed boost to Level 15 to fully unlock the Flea Market</li><li>Complete access to the player-driven marketplace as soon as the boost is finished</li><li>The ability to buy key quest items instead of endlessly searching in-raid</li><li>Freedom to build strong, meta weapons with the attachments you actually need</li><li>The option to buy keys, keycards and other high-value items for best money-making runs</li><li>The fastest and most efficient route through the early-game grind</li><li>100% safe, manual gameplay – no cheats, bots, or risky software</li><li>All Roubles, items, and quest rewards earned during the boost stay on your account</li></ul><h3><strong>Boost Options Explained</strong></h3><ul><li><strong>Piloted</strong> – A professional EFT booster plays on your PMC, focusing purely on fast leveling and survival to reach Level 15.</li><li><strong>Normal</strong> – Standard priority. Your order is queued and completed in the regular timeframe using safe, efficient routes.</li><li><strong>Express</strong> – High-priority execution. Your Flea Market Unlock is pushed to the front of the queue and completed as quickly as possible.</li></ul><p><strong>About Escape from Tarkov Flea Unlock Service</strong></p><p>The Flea Market is the backbone of Escape from Tarkov’s economy. It allows players to trade almost any item with each other, set their own prices, and bypass the limitations of early traders and low loyalty levels.</p><p>Reaching Level 15 manually can be slow and frustrating, especially at the start of a wipe when gear is limited and every mistake can mean losing a full kit. Our <strong>Flea Market Unlock Boost</strong> is a targeted 1–15 leveling service designed to:</p><ul><li>Maximize your experience gain per hour</li><li>Complete the most efficient early quests</li><li>Keep your death rate low and survival rate high</li><li>Deliver a clean, safe unlock without unnecessary risk</li></ul><p>Once the service is complete, you are not just Level 15 – you are <strong>ready</strong>. You have access to the Flea Market, extra items, Roubles, and the flexibility to decide how you want to play the rest of the wipe.</p><p><strong>Why Unlocking the Flea Market Changes Everything</strong></p><p>Playing Tarkov without the Flea Market:</p><ul><li>You are forced to rely on basic trader inventories</li><li>You may waste hours searching for one quest item</li><li>You are limited in how strong your weapons and armor can be</li></ul><h3><strong>Playing Tarkov with the Flea Market:</strong></h3><ul><li><strong>Maximize your profits</strong> by selling found-in-raid items at real player-driven prices instead of vendor scraps</li><li><strong>Bypass RNG</strong> by buying rare quest items directly rather than hoping they spawn in your raid</li><li><strong>Build meta weapons</strong> with the exact attachments and ammo types you need</li><li><strong>Access high-tier loot</strong> by buying keys and keycards for the most profitable locked rooms</li></ul><p>The difference in comfort and power level is huge, especially early in the wipe. That’s why serious players rush Level 15 as soon as possible – and that’s exactly what this service does for you.</p><h3><strong>Why Choose misti.services for Your EFT Flea Market Unlock?</strong></h3><ul><li><strong>Experienced Early-Wipe Specialists</strong> – Our boosters repeat the 1–15 process every wipe and know the fastest paths, quests, and routes.</li><li><strong>100% Manual and Secure</strong> – No bots, no scripts, no unsafe tools. Your account is treated with maximum care and security.</li><li><strong>Transparent Communication</strong> – Our team keeps you updated on the progress of your order so you always know how close you are to Level 15.</li><li><strong>Proven Track Record</strong> – misti.services has been helping players skip grind and enjoy endgame content across multiple titles since 2013.</li></ul><p>With our <strong>Escape from Tarkov Flea Market Unlock boost</strong>, you skip the worst part of the wipe and jump straight into the good part: gearing up, making money, and playing Tarkov on your own terms.</p>', '<ul><li><strong>Place Your Order</strong></li><li>Choose your options (piloted/stream, normal/express) and complete your order on misti.services.</li><li><strong>We Assign an EFT Specialist</strong></li><li>A Tarkov expert who knows the 1–15 path inside out is assigned to your account. They focus on high-XP tasks, efficient routes, and staying alive.</li><li><strong>Fast Early-Game Progression</strong></li><li>Your booster completes key early quests from Prapor, Therapist, Skier, and other traders, stacking experience from tasks, extractions, and kills to push your PMC quickly to Level 15.</li><li><strong>Flea Market Unlocked</strong></li><li>Once you hit Level 15, the Flea Market is fully available. You can now buy, sell, and flip items with other players instead of relying only on traders.</li><li><strong>You Keep Everything</strong></li><li>All loot, Roubles, quest rewards, and progression earned during the boost remain on your account. You simply log in and enjoy a fully unlocked economy.</li><li><strong>Play the Game Your Way</strong></li><li>With the Flea Market available, you can build any loadout, buy quest items you are missing, and focus on profitable raids instead of grinding for basic progression.</li></ul>', '<ul><li>Escape from Tarkov purchased on your account</li><li>Access details so our booster can log in (for piloted service)</li><li>Basic stash space to store items and rewards gained during the boost</li></ul>', 1, 'https://kdjlhibxxygfdmlvdfcl.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/game-images/escape-from-tarkov-flea-market-unlock-boost-1765385821478.webp', NULL, 4.9, 0, true, true, 0, '2025-12-06T21:11:45.712173+00:00', '2025-12-16T00:27:13.334172+00:00', '5a461f21-24b8-47e5-afe0-b350cf414cb0', true, '{"step":1,"end_label":"Desired Level","max_value":15,"min_value":1,"default_end":10,"start_label":"Start Level","defaul