</strong> Consistent attempts on the Black Temple final boss until your legendary item drops.</li><li><strong>Manual Progression:</strong> All raid activities are performed manually by skilled players, ensuring a clear and efficient farm.</li><li><strong>Full Raid Scheduling:</strong> Our service supports both EU and US regions with flexible raid times.</li></ul><h2><strong>About the TBC Classic Warglaives of Azzinoth</strong></h2><p>The Warglaives of Azzinoth remain the most legendary and instantly recognizable weapons in WoW TBC Classic. They are the ultimate status symbol for Rogues and Warriors, representing the single most valuable loot pieces in the entire Black Temple raid. Even in the competitive 2026 TBC environment, they are considered the peak of melee weapon progression. Each glaive drops exclusively from Illidan Stormrage with an estimated 4–5% drop chance. Our service bypasses this RNG, guaranteeing you will eventually claim your legendary.</p><h3><strong>Why Choose Our Service</strong></h3><ul><li><strong>Guaranteed Acquisition:</strong> We complete weekly Illidan Stormrage kills until your selected glaive(s) drop, removing all reliance on luck.</li><li><strong>Dedicated Farm Teams:</strong> Access to professional, experienced teams specialized in Black Temple legendary farming.</li><li><strong>Secure &amp; Private:</strong> Enjoy a completely secure and discreet service with manual gameplay.</li><li><strong>Efficient System:</strong> Our streamlined process ensures the fastest possible acquisition of your Warglaives.</li><li><strong>Customer Support:</strong> Full 24/7 support throughout your entire service experience for any questions or updates.</li></ul><p>Secure your legacy in Outland with the legendary Warglaives of Azzinoth. Trust misti.services to deliver this iconic gear to your character, enhancing both your power and prestige.</p>', '<ul><li><strong>Choose Your Options:</strong> Select your region (EU or US), preferred play method (Self-play or Piloted), and which Warglaive(s) you wish to acquire.</li><li><strong>Schedule Your Runs:</strong> Our team will coordinate with you to schedule weekly Black Temple raids.</li><li><strong>Participate or Relax:</strong> Join your boost team if you chose self-play, or let our experts handle your character in a piloted session.</li><li><strong>Weekly Attempts:</strong> Your character will be brought to Illidan Stormrage every week until your desired Warglaive(s) drop.</li><li><strong>Receive Your Glaive:</strong> Once the Warglaive(s) drop, the service is complete, and you will receive your legendary item(s).</li></ul>', '<ul><li><strong>Level 70 Character:</strong> Your character must be level 70 in WoW TBC Classic.</li><li><strong>Supported Class:</strong> Only Rogues and Warriors can equip the Warglaives of Azzinoth.</li><li><strong>Account Sharing (Piloted):</strong> If opting for Piloted, you will need to provide account access for our booster.</li><li><strong>Game Time:</strong> Active World of Warcraft game time on your account is required.</li><li><strong>Black Temple Attunement</strong></li></ul>', 99, 'https://kdjlhibxxygfdmlvdfcl.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/game-images/tbc-classic-warglaives-of-azzinoth-boost-1768689247611.webp', NULL, 4.9, 0, true, true, 0, '2026-01-12T16:12:00.800615+00:00', '2026-01-17T22:38:03.165988+00:00', 'd2c3bb86-72be-4345-8f78-3c62edc8e30d', false, NULL, true, 0, 'Flexible', 'average start time', 'Flexible', 'order completion', 'Acquire the legendary Warglaives of Azzinoth in WoW TBC Classic. Guaranteed weekly kills on Illidan until your desired glaive(s) drop.', 'tbc warglaives of azzinoth, tbc warglaives buy, wow tbc warglaives price, tbc classic warglaives service, wow tbc glaives, illidan glaives farm, black temple glaive run, tbc legendary weapons, wow tbc gearing, tbc classic rogue gear, tbc classic warrior gear, buy tbc legendary, tbc warglaive boost, tbc warglaives of azzinoth farm, misti.services tbc glaives,