are completed entirely by professional players, ensuring account safety while delivering the mount quickly and efficiently.</p><h3>Why Choose misti.services</h3><ul><li>Fast, professional mount acquisition</li><li>Secure, manual gameplay with no bots</li><li>Keep all dungeon loot and progress</li><li>Guaranteed results for hard-to-get mounts</li></ul><p>Acquire the <strong>Celestial Riding Tiger mount</strong> without the grind, save time, and enhance your Pandaria Classic collection with <strong>misti.services</strong>.</p>', '<ul><li>Select your desired options and complete your order on&nbsp;Misti.Services.</li><li>You’ll receive an order confirmation and tracking number via email.</li><li>Our support manager will contact you through live chat to confirm all details.</li><li>If you’re unavailable, we’ll reach out via email or your preferred contact method.</li><li>When the boost is finished, you’ll receive a completion notification on Discord or another messenger of your choice.</li></ul>', '<ul><li>Active World of Warcraft subscription</li><li>Level 90 character</li><li>Geared PVE Character</li></ul><p>Need help reaching level 90? Try our&nbsp;<a href="https://misti.services/game/wow-mistsofpandaria-classic" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank" style="color: rgb(60, 113, 221);">WoW Power Leveling Boost</a>&nbsp;</p>', 699, 'https://kdjlhibxxygfdmlvdfcl.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/game-images/celestial-riding-tiger-1763136446913.webp', NULL, 4.9, 350, true, true, 0, '2025-11-02T05:21:24.644042+00:00', '2025-12-16T07:51:54.412474+00:00', 'ebcd9386-0643-4a05-b31a-68729907aee7', false, NULL, true, 0, '15 minutes', 'average start time', 'Flexible', 'order completion', 'Unlock the Celestial Riding Tiger mount in Pandaria Classic fast and safely with professional boosts at misti.services for WoW Mists of Pandaria.', 'celestial riding tiger mount, pandaria classic mount boost, wow mists of pandaria mounts, buy celestial riding tiger, celestial riding tiger fast unlock, mop classic mount service, professional wow mount boost, misti.services wow mounts, pandaria classic tiger mount, wow mop rare mounts, celestial riding tiger safe boost, mists of pandaria mount farming, buy mop classic mounts, wow classic pandaria mount unlock', 'https://kdjlhibxxygfdmlvdfcl.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/game-images/celestial-riding-tiger-1763136446913.webp', NULL, 'Celestial Riding Tiger', 'WoW MoP Celestial Tiger Mount | misti.services', NULL);
INSERT INTO public.products (id, name, slug, short_description, description, how_it_works, requirements, base_price, image_url, badge_text, trust_score, total_reviews, is_active, is_featured, sort_order, created_at, updated_at, category_id, is_slider_product, slider_config, is_manually_popular, total_sales, start_time_text, start_time_value, delivery_text, delivery_value, meta_description, meta_keywords, og_image, canonical_url, image_alt_text, meta_title, parent_link) VALUES ('4a47d637-ebb6-4913-b546-8061acff7ab4', 'Bitcoin Farm', 'escape-from-tarkov-bitcoin-farm-boost', 'A well-built Bitcoin Farm is one of the strongest long-term money makers in Escape from Tarkov. Once it is up and running, it generates in-game Bitcoins that can be turned into Roubles, giving you a steady income even when you are not actively raiding.', '<h1><strong>Escape from Tarkov Bitcoin Farm Boost</strong></h1><p>A well-built Bitcoin Farm is one of the strongest long-term money makers in Escape from Tarkov. Once it is up and running, it generates in-game Bitcoins that can be turned into Roubles, giving you a steady income even when you are not actively raiding.</p><p>At <strong>misti.services</strong>, our <strong>Escape from Tarkov Bitcoin Farm Boost</strong> focuses on building a solid foundation in your hideout: we unlock and set up your Bitcoin Farm, upgrade key modules, and leave you with a powerful passive income engine that keeps working in the background while you play.</p><h2><strong>Service Includes</strong></h2><p>When you order the Tarkov Bitcoin Farm Boost from misti.services, you receive:</p><ul><li>Bitcoin Farm Level 1 unlocked and constructed with 10 empty graphics card slots ready to be filled</li><li>Level 3 upgrades for: Nutrition Unit, Lavatory, Security, Illumination, Medical Station</li><li>Level 2 upgrades for: Intelligence Center, Water Collector, Stash, Generator, Vents</li><li>Significant Roubles and extra loot obtained during the progression process</li><li>A fully prepared hideout structure that allows you to scale your farm as you collect more graphics cards</li></ul><h3><strong>Understanding the Bitcoin Farm</strong></h3><ul><li>The Bitcoin Farm sits in your hideout and produces BTC based on the number of installed graphics cards.</li><li>The more graphics cards you slot in, the faster BTC is generated.</li><li>BTC can then be exchanged for large amounts of Roubles, helping you fund gear, keys, keycards, ammo, and meta builds.</li></ul><h3><strong>Basic Steps to Set Up a Bitcoin Farm</strong></h3><ol><li><strong>Upgrade Your Hideout</strong></li><li>You need to reach certain upgrade levels in other hideout modules, with the Intelligence Center being particularly important. Reaching Intelligence Center Level 2 is a key step in unlocking the Bitcoin Farm construction.</li><li><strong>Gather Required Materials</strong></li><li>You must collect various electronic components and tools, as well as graphics cards. These can be found in raids, looted from tech rooms, purchased from players on the Flea Market, or obtained through barters.</li><li><strong>Construct the Bitcoin Farm</strong></li><li>Once you meet all the prerequisites and have the materials, you can construct Bitcoin Farm Level 1 in your hideout. This initial level allows you to install a limited number of graphics cards, but more slots become available as you upgrade it.</li></ol><h3><strong>Maximizing Your Farm’s Efficiency</strong></h3><ul><li>Your goal is to fill as many graphics card slots as possible to speed up BTC production.</li><li>More cards also mean higher energy usage, so your Generator and fuel management become important.</li><li>A well-managed Bitcoin Farm combined with a stable fuel supply turns into a powerful, long-term Rouble generator that supports every other aspect of your gameplay.</li></ul><p>Our boost is designed to handle all the complex steps and upgrades for you, leaving you with a polished, ready-to-use farm.</p><h3><strong>Why Our Tarkov Bitcoin Farm Boost Is Worth It</strong></h3><p>Upgrading the hideout and setting up a Bitcoin Farm can be extremely time-consuming:</p><ul><li>Farming graphics cards and materials is competitive and RNG-dependent</li><li>Hideout upgrades require a mix of trader levels, quests, and rare items</li><li>Mistakes in upgrade order or resource use can slow you down significantly</li></ul><h3><strong>With misti.services, you:</strong></h3><ul><li>Skip the confusing and grind-heavy part of hideout optimization</li><li>Get a professionally structured, future-proof farm layout</li><li>Start from a solid economic base instead of slowly crawling toward it over weeks</li></ul><p>Instead of wasting time trying to piece together every requirement yourself, you log in to a hideout that is already upgraded and ready to generate value.</p><h3><strong>Why Choose misti.services for Your Bitcoin Farm Boost</strong></h3><ul><li><strong>Specialists in Tarkov Progression</strong> – Our boosters understand hideout synergy, upgrade order, and the fastest route to a functional Bitcoin Farm.</li><li><strong>Time-Efficient Approach</strong> – We focus on the critical path needed to unlock, build, and support your Farm instead of wasting resources on unnecessary upgrades.</li><li><strong>Manual, Safe Service</strong> – All gameplay is done by hand, with no cheats, macros, or software that could risk your account.</li><li><strong>Proven Multi-Game Experience</strong> – misti.services has been providing boosting and progression services across multiple titles for many years, focusing on reliability and customer satisfaction.</li></ul><p>You get a long-term income engine rather than just a one-time reward.</p><h3><strong>Boost Options Explained</strong></h3><ul><li><strong>Account Sharing (Piloted)</strong> – Our professional booster logs into your account and completes all required upgrades and construction steps for you, taking your hideout from its current state to a ready Bitcoin Farm setup.</li><li><strong>Selfplay (Where Possible)</strong> – You stay on the account and play under the booster’s instructions for specific parts of the process. This is more limited but can be arranged depending on your preferences.</li><li><strong>Normal Priority</strong> – Your order enters the standard queue and is completed within the regular timeframe.</li><li><strong>Express Priority</strong> – Your order is placed ahead of standard queue entries for faster completion.</li></ul><p>From that point onward, your game starts paying you back every time a new BTC is generated – and you can focus on playing Tarkov the way you want, supported by a strong, stable in-game economy.</p>', '<ul><li><strong>Place Your Order</strong></li><li>Select your desired options (account sharing or selfplay where available, priority level, streaming if needed) and complete your order on misti.services.</li><li><strong>Order Confirmation and Contact</strong></li><li>You receive an order confirmation. Our support team will reach out to you through your chosen communication channel to confirm details and schedule the boost.</li><li><strong>Booster Assignment</strong></li><li>We assign an experienced Tarkov specialist who focuses on hideout and economic progression. They review your current account status and plan the path to a fully functional Bitcoin Farm.</li><li><strong>Hideout Upgrades and Farm Construction</strong></li><li>Your booster upgrades the required modules, gathers necessary materials, builds Bitcoin Farm Level 1, and prepares your hideout for maximum long-term value.</li><li><strong>Completion and Handover</strong></li><li>Once the service is finished, you are informed that the order is complete. You log in to find your Bitcoin Farm ready and your hideout significantly upgraded.</li></ul>', '<ul><li>An Escape from Tarkov account with access to the hideout feature</li><li>Login details so our booster can access the account for piloted service</li><li>Enough stash space and basic 