raids according to your selected package</li><li>Help navigating and surviving the most dangerous facility in Escape from Tarkov</li><li>Ideal conditions for farming Raiders for top-tier gear, weapons, armor, and valuables</li><li>Focused support for finding injectors, rare stims, military electronics, and other high-value loot</li><li>A fast and secure service tailored for conquering The Lab’s brutal environment</li><li>All extracted loot, quest items, and progress kept on your account</li></ul><h2><strong>Boost Options Explained</strong></h2><ul><li><strong>Piloted</strong> – A professional Tarkov player logs into your account and completes Laboratory raids on your PMC. This is the most efficient option if you want maximum results with minimal effort.</li><li><strong>Selfplay</strong> – You join our booster as part of the squad and play on your own account. They lead you through Labs, handle Raider clears, and help you survive high-stakes fights.</li><li><strong>Stream</strong> – You can request that the service is streamed so you can watch every raid live, learn routes, door controls, and Raider patterns, and see exactly how your loot is secured.</li></ul><h2><strong>About EFT Laboratory Raid Boost</strong></h2><p>The Laboratory is a unique, underground research facility with several special characteristics:</p><ul><li>It requires a <strong>Labs Access Keycard</strong> to enter</li><li>It does <strong>not allow insurance</strong>, so deaths are extremely punishing</li><li>It is filled with <strong>Scav Raiders</strong>, which are far deadlier than normal Scavs</li><li>It contains some of the <strong>best, most consistent loot</strong> in Escape from Tarkov</li></ul><p>Our <strong>Laboratory Raid Boost</strong> is made for players who:</p><ul><li>Want to experience Labs without losing gear every raid</li><li>Need help farming Raiders, injectors, and high-tier valuables</li><li>Are working on the final quests from traders like Mechanic and Peacekeeper</li><li>Want to fight top-end PMCs with a strong team at their side</li></ul><p>Instead of learning Labs by feeding it kit after kit, you benefit from the knowledge and skill of elite Labs operators.</p><h3><strong>Common Objectives in The Laboratory</strong></h3><p>We can tailor your Labs boost around several high-value goals:</p><ul><li><strong>Surviving Against Raiders</strong></li><li> Scav Raiders have better gear, smarter AI, and hit harder than standard enemies. Our pros are experts at triggering, positioning, and clearing Raiders while minimizing risk.</li><li><strong>Farming the Best Loot</strong></li><li> The Labs is one of the most consistent sources of rare stims, injectors, military electronics, and other items worth millions of Roubles. We prioritize high-value rooms and known spawn locations to maximize your profit.</li><li><strong>Completing Endgame Quests</strong></li><li> Some of the final, most difficult trader quests send you into The Labs. Our team can help you complete kills, item deliveries, and survival requirements needed to finish these tasks.</li><li><strong>High-Stakes PvP</strong></li><li> Only the most geared and confident PMCs go into Labs. With misti.services, you are not going in alone. Whether piloted or in selfplay, our boosters help you compete and win against top-end players.</li></ul><h3><strong>Why Choose misti.services for The Laboratory?</strong></h3><ul><li><strong>Elite Labs Players</strong> – Our boosters are experienced CQC and Labs specialists who understand Raider behavior, player tendencies, and optimal routes.</li><li><strong>Flexible Play Options</strong> – Choose piloted for maximum efficiency or selfplay if you want to be in the action and learn as you go.</li><li><strong>Manual and Secure Service</strong> – All gameplay is done by hand, with strong attention to account safety and confidentiality.</li><li><strong>24/7 Live Support</strong> – Our support team is always available to plan your Labs sessions, answer questions, and keep you updated.</li><li><strong>Proven Endgame Expertise</strong> – misti.services has years of experience helping players tackle Tarkov’s toughest endgame content, including The Laboratory.</li></ul><p>With the <strong>Escape from Tarkov Laboratory Raid Boost</strong> from misti.services, you can finally experience Labs as it was meant to be: high risk, massive reward, and under control—rather than a constant drain on your stash.</p>', '<ul><li><strong>Select Your Laboratory Options</strong></li><li>Choose between piloted or selfplay, specify your goals (Raider farm, injector and valuables loot, endgame quests, or general Labs practice), and place your order on misti.services.</li><li><strong>We Assign a Labs Specialist</strong></li><li>A Tarkov PRO with extensive experience in high-stakes Labs gameplay is assigned to your order. They review your current loadout, keycards, and objectives.</li><li><strong>High-Stakes Laboratory Raids</strong></li><li class="ql-indent-1">In <strong>piloted</strong> mode, the booster runs raids on your PMC, triggering Raiders, clearing them, and looting the most valuable tech and medical rooms.</li><li class="ql-indent-1">In <strong>selfplay</strong>, you move with the booster as part of the team while they manage fights, call angles, and guide you through the map’s complex layout.</li><li><strong>Raids Completed, Loot Extracted</strong></li><li>Raiders, PMCs, and loot rooms are prioritized according to your objectives. All gear and valuables extracted during the boost stay on your account.</li><li><strong>Notification and Handover</strong></li><li>Once your requested raids or goals are completed, you are notified. You log back in to a richer stash, new experiences in Labs, and progress on endgame tasks.</li></ul><p><br></p>', '<ul><li>Escape from Tarkov purchased and accessible on your account</li><li><strong>One Labs Access Keycard per raid/run</strong> you want to complete</li><li>For piloted service: login details so our booster