highest level of security, our booster connects to your PC via a secure application like Parsec. They play the game using your mouse and keyboard while you watch the stream live. Your login credentials are never shared.</li></ul>', '<ul><li><strong>Select Options:</strong> Choose your preferred boost method (Piloted or Remote Control).</li><li><strong>Order Confirmation:</strong> After payment, you will receive an order number and email confirmation.</li><li><strong>Contact:</strong> Our support manager will reach out via Live Chat or Discord to verify your details.</li><li><strong>Assignment:</strong> We assign a professional booster to your order.</li><li><em>For Piloted:</em> The booster logs in securely to complete the weekly quests.</li><li><em>For Remote Control:</em> We set up the connection so the booster can play on your PC.</li><li><strong>Completion:</strong> We notify you immediately via your preferred messenger once the 10 Untethered Coins are farmed and the mount is purchased.</li><li><strong>Enjoy:</strong> Log in and summon your new Lavender K''arroc!</li></ul>', '<p><strong>Level:</strong> Level 80 Character.</p><p><strong>Expansion:</strong> The War Within active.</p><p><strong>Account:</strong> Active World of Warcraft subscription.</p>', 12.75, 'https://kdjlhibxxygfdmlvdfcl.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/game-images/lavender-karroc-1763851265915.webp', NULL, 4.9, 0, true, true, 0, '2025-11-22T19:16:44.845082+00:00', '2025-12-16T07:22:28.607755+00:00', 'b4c0ccaf-a937-4b30-9ab4-7dacee8f739b', false, NULL, false, 1, '15 minutes', 'average start time', 'Flexible', 'order completion', 'Secure the Lavender K''arroc mount with no grind or RNG. misti.services delivers a smooth, reliable boosting experience for WoW War Within.', 'lavender k''arroc mount, k''aresh zone mount, untethered coins mount, shad''anis vendor mount, phase diving vendor mount, rare k''arroc mount, buy lavender k''arroc, k''aresh rare mount, untethered coins farming, shad''anis mount vendor, game lavender k''arroc, game rare mount, k''aresh mount farm', 'https://kdjlhibxxygfdmlvdfcl.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/game-images/lavender-karroc-1763851265915.webp', NULL, 'Game gaming service - Lavender K''arroc', 'War Within Lavender K''arroc Mount | misti.services', NULL);
