ement. The service guarantees:</p><ul><li><strong>The Mount:</strong> Phase-Lost Slateback permanently added to your collection.</li><li><strong>The Achievement:</strong> Completion of <strong>Phase-Lost-and-Found</strong>.</li><li><strong>The Collection:</strong> All specific Phase-Lost item appearances required for the achievement found and unlocked.</li><li><strong>Loot Rights:</strong> You keep all gold, gear, and resources looted during the farming process.</li><li><strong>Manual Service:</strong> 100% hand-played by experienced boosters.</li></ul><h2><strong>Phase-Lost Slateback: All Information</strong></h2><p>The Phase-Lost Slateback is the ultimate prize for explorers in the K''aresh zone. It serves as a status symbol showing that you have fully mastered the "Phase-Lost" secrets of the area.</p><p><strong>How is it obtained?</strong> The mount is the final reward for the <strong>Phase-Lost-and-Found</strong> achievement. This requires players to locate and collect a specific list of weapons and armor pieces that have been "lost" in the phases of K''aresh. These items are often hidden in obscure locations or require specific interactions to reveal.</p><p><strong>Why choose our boost?</strong> Tracking down every single item on the list is a massive time sink. Our team utilizes optimized routes to collect these appearances in the most efficient order possible. We handle the navigation and the searching, so you simply log in to find the achievement completed and the mount ready to ride.</p><h2><strong>Boost Options Explained</strong></h2><p>We offer two secure methods to deliver your mount:</p><ul><li><strong>Piloted:</strong> Our professional player logs into your account to complete the boost. We utilize strict security protocols, including VPNs matching your country, to ensure your account remains safe and flagged as a local login.</li><li><strong>Remote Control:</strong> For the highest level of security, our booster connects to your PC via a secure application like Parsec. They play the game using your mouse and keyboard while you watch the stream live. Your login credentials are never shared.</li></ul>', '<ul><li><strong>Place Order:</strong> Place your order for the WoW Phase-Lost Slateback Mount Boost service.</li><li><strong>Contact:</strong> Our support team will contact you via live chat to confirm all details and scheduling.</li><li><strong>Assignment:</strong> We assign a professional booster who specializes in K''aresh collections.</li><li><strong>Completion:</strong> The booster collects all necessary item appearances to trigger the Phase-Lost-and-Found achievement.</li><li><strong>Enjoy:</strong> We notify you immediately upon completion, and you receive the Phase-Lost Slateback Mount on your account.</li></ul>', '<ul><li><strong>Level:</strong> Level 80 Character.</li><li><strong>Expansion:</strong> The War Within active.</li><li><strong>Account:</strong> Active World of Warcraft subscription.</li></ul>', 16.15, 'https://kdjlhibxxygfdmlvdfcl.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/game-images/wow-phase-lost-slateback-1763931037394.webp', NULL, 4.9, 0, true, true, 0, '2025-11-22T19:10:16.816663+00:00', '2025-12-16T07:22:29.510909+00:00', 'b4c0ccaf-a937-4b30-9ab4-7dacee8f739b', false, NULL, true, 1, '15 minutes', 'average start time', 'Flexible', 'order completion', 'Recover the elusive Phase-Lost Slateback mount in record time. misti.services handles every step so you can skip the grind and keep playing.', 'wow phase-lost slateback mount, buy phase-lost slateback, k''aresh zone explorer mount, phase-lost secrets achievement, wow rare k''aresh mount, slateback mount for sale, get phase-lost slateback, wow explorer status symbol, phase-lost slateback farm, k''aresh zone mastery reward, wow unique ground mount, buy wow k''aresh mount, phase-lost slateback acquisition, epic slateback mount', 'https://kdjlhibxxygfdmlvdfcl.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/game-images/wow-phase-lost-slateback-1763931037394.webp', NULL, 'Game gaming service - WoW Phase-Lost Slateback', 'War Within Slateback Mount | misti.services', NULL);
INSERT INTO public.products (id, name, slug, short_description, description, how_it_works, requirements, base_price, image_url, badge_text, trust_score, total_reviews, is_active, is_featured, sort_order, created_at, updated_at, category_id, is_slider_product, slider_config, is_manually_popular, total_sales, start_time_text, start_time_value, delivery_text, delivery_value, meta_description, meta_keywords, og_image, canonical_url, image_alt_text, meta_title, parent_link) VALUES ('aafb9fb1-42ef-4de4-9058-96da93e0e0b7', 'The Consortium', 'the-consortium', 'he Consortium is a prominent, neutral faction of Ethereals found across Outland, specializing in trade and resource acquisition, with hubs in Nagrand and Netherstorm. Gaining reputation with The Consortium is highly rewarding due to their unique benefits and valuable profession patterns.', '<h1><strong>The Consortium Reputation Farm Boost – WoW TBC Classic</strong></h1><p>Looking to secure your monthly gem "salary," unlock valuable Jewelcrafting and Enchanting recipes, and conquer Heroic <strong>Mana Tombs</strong>? Misti.Services offers a fast, secure, and professional <a href="https://www.icy-veins.com/tbc-classic/the-consortium-reputation-and-rewards-guide" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank"><strong>The Consortium</strong></a><strong> Reputation Farm Boost</strong>, handling the complex Ethreal grinding and repeatable turn-ins across Outland.</p><p>Our expert boosters execute the optimal reputation strategy, efficiently farming <strong>Obsidian Warbeads</strong> and <strong>Zaxxis Insignias</strong> to deliver guaranteed reputation gains from Neutral to Exalted.</p><h2><strong>Overview</strong></h2><p><strong>The Consortium</strong> is a prominent, neutral faction of Ethereals found across Outland, specializing in trade and resource acquisition, with hubs in Nagrand and Netherstorm. Gaining reputation with The Consortium is highly rewarding due to their unique benefits and valuable profession patterns.</p><p>Earning <strong>Exalted</strong> status with The Consortium provides access to:</p><ul><li><strong>Monthly Gem Salary:</strong> A unique monthly bag of gems (increasing in quality with reputation) delivered by Gezhe at Aeris Landing.</li><li><strong>Heroic Dungeon Key:</strong> Access to Heroic difficulty for <strong>Mana Tombs</strong>.</li><li><strong>Essential Profession Recipes:</strong> Valuable patterns for <strong>Jewelcrafting</strong>, <strong>Enchanting</strong>, and Leatherworking, including those sold by Ythyar in Karazhan.</li><li><strong>Ethereum Prison Access:</strong> Unlocks a complex system of reputation farming via <strong>Ethereum Prison Keys</strong>.</li></ul><h2><strong>Gaining Reputation</strong></h2><p>Reputation with The Consortium begins at <strong>Neutral</strong> and is achieved through a mix of initial quests, dungeon farming, and several crucial repeatable item turn-ins across Nagrand and Netherstorm.</p><h3><strong>1. Neutral to Friendly</strong></h3><p>The process starts by contacting the <strong>Consortium Recruiter</strong> (near Telaar/Garadar) and completing initial quests in Aeris Landing that unlock repeatable turn-ins:</p><ul><li><strong>More Heads Full of Ivory</strong></li><li><strong>More Crystal Fragments</strong></li></ul><h3><strong>2. The Grind (Friendly to Exalted)</strong></h3><p>To reach Exalted, grinding is required, utilizing several methods our boosters prioritize:</p><ol><li><strong>Repeatable Turn-Ins:</strong></li></ol><ul><li class="ql-indent-1"><strong>More Obsidian Warbeads (250 Rep per 10)</strong>: We efficiently farm Nagrand Ogres and turn in <strong>Obsidian Warbeads</strong> until Exalted (Note: We manage these beads exclusively for The Consortium unless otherwise instructed).</li><li class="ql-indent-1"><strong>A Heap of Ethereals (250 Rep per 10)</strong>: We kill Ethereals in Netherstorm to farm <strong>Zaxxis Insignias</strong>.</li></ul><ol><li><strong>Dungeon Farming:</strong> We run <strong>Mana Tombs</strong>. Mobs in Normal difficulty grant reputation up to Honored, while <strong>Heroic difficulty</strong> grants reputation all the way to <strong>Exalted</strong>.</li><li><strong>Ethereum Prison Key System (Honored+):</strong> We unlock and utilize the complex <strong>Ethereum Prison Key</strong> questline in Netherstorm, which provides bonus reputation via <strong>Ethereum Prisoner I.D. Tag</strong> turn-ins (250 rep each) and unlocks the high-end <strong>Stasis Chamber</strong> elite mobs.</li></ol><h2><strong>Reputation Rewards</strong></h2><p>Quartermasters are located at various Consortium posts, including the main hub at Aeris Landing and the vendor <strong>Ythyar</strong> inside Karazhan.</p><h2><strong>Why Choose Our Consortium Reputation Boost</strong></h2><p>The Consortium grind is highly dispersed and complex, requiring management of multiple turn-ins and quest chains across three different zones. Misti.Services offers the complete, streamlined solution:</p><ul><li><strong>Efficient Farming:</strong> We optimize routes for farming <strong>Obsidian Warbeads</strong> and <strong>Zaxxis Insignias</strong> simultaneously.</li><li><strong>Monthly Salary Unlock:</strong> We ensure you reach the reputation tiers necessary to receive higher-quality gems from your unique monthly salary.</li><li><strong>Full Attunement:</strong> We handle the long quest chain required for the complex <strong>Ethereum Prison Key</strong> and <strong>Stasis Chamber</strong> farming methods.</li></ul><h3><strong>Service Includes</strong></h3><ul><li>Full The Consortium reputation farm from your current standing (Neutral, etc.) up to <strong>Exalted</strong>.</li><li>Completion of all Nagrand and Netherstorm one-time quests.</li><li>Daily and repeatable turn-ins of <strong>Obsidian Warbeads</strong> and <strong>Zaxxis Insignias</strong>.</li><li>Efficient runs of the <strong>Mana Tombs</strong> dungeon (Normal and Heroic).</li><li>Completion of the <strong>Ethereum Prison Key</strong> quest chain.</li></ul><p><strong>Secure your monthly gem income and valuable recipes! Order your Consortium Reputation Boost today.</strong></p>', '<ul><li>Select your desired options and complete your order on&nbsp;Misti.Services.</li><li>You’ll receive an order confirmation and tracking number via email.</li><li>Our support manager will contact you through live chat to confirm all details.</li><li>If you’re unavailable, we’ll reach out via email or your preferred contact method.</li><li>When the boost is finished, you’ll receive a completion notification on Discord or another messenger of your choice.</li></ul>', '<ul><li><strong>Level 70</strong></li><li><strong>Active WoW Subscription</strong></li></ul>', 0, 'https://kdjlhibxxygfdmlvdfcl.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/game-images/the-consortium-1763587060729.webp', NULL, 4.9, 0, true, true, 0, '2025-11-19T20:43:52.971768+00:00', '2026-02-16T10:52:53.723732+00:00', '9464d1fe-6c00-412a-8ebb-896a4f575b4e', false, NULL, true, 0, '15 minutes', 'average start time', 'Flexible', 'order completion', 'Secure your monthly gem salary! Buy The Consortium Exalted boost to unlock valuable Jewelcrafting recipes and Heroic Mana Tombs access fast.', 'The Consortium reputation boost, Mana Tombs farm, Ethereal reputation, Obsidian Warbeads turn-in, Zaxxis Insignias farm, Jewelcrafting recipes TBC, monthly gem salary, Ethereum Prison Key, Nagrand reputation, Netherstorm reputation', 'https://kdjlhibxxygfdmlvdfcl.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/game-images/the-consortium-1763587060729.webp', NULL, 'The Consortium', 'WoW TBC Consortium Rep Boost | misti.services', NULL);
INSERT INTO public.products (id, name, slug, short_description, description, how_it_works, requirements, base_price, image_url, badge_text, trust_score, total_reviews, is_active, is_featured, sort_order, created_at, updated_at, category_id, is_slider_product, slider_config, is_manually_popular, total_sales, start_time_text, start_time_value, delivery_text, delivery_value, meta_description, meta_keywords, og_image, canonical_url, image_alt_text, meta_title, parent_link) VALUES ('a14febbc-49b6-45af-bce6-f1980c081241', 'Glory of the Delver', 'glory-of-the-delver', 'Earn the Glory of the Delver achievement fast with our WoW Glory of the Delver Boost. Unlock the Ivory Goliathus mount and exclusive rewards easily.', '<h1><strong>WoW Glory of the Delver Boost</strong></h1><p>Buy the <strong>WoW Glory of the Delver Boost</strong> to unlock one of <em>The War Within’s</em> most prestigious achievements quickly and effortlessly. Our expert team will complete every required task to help you earn the <strong>Glory of the Delver</strong> achievement and its exclusive rewards, including the <strong>Ivory Goliathus</strong> mount and <strong>Zekvir’s Spine</strong> cosmetic. Skip the grind and enjoy smooth, professional progress in <em>World of Warcraft</em>.</p><h3>Service Includes</h3><ul><li>Completion of the <a href="https://www.wowhead.com/beta/achievement=40438/glory-of-the-war-within-delver" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank"><strong>Glory of the War Within Delver</strong></a> achievement.</li><li>Unlocking the <strong>Ivory Goliathus</strong> mount.</li><li>Unlocking the <strong>Zekvir’s Spine</strong> cosmetic item.</li><li>Possibility to obtain additional <strong>Delves gear</strong> during the boost.</li></ul><h3>Boost Options</h3><p><strong>Piloted:</strong> Our professional booster logs into your account and completes all achievement requirements.</p><p><strong>Remote Control:</strong> Our booster securely connects to your desktop via a trusted remote access app (such as Parsec) so you can watch the progress live.</p><p><strong>Select Boost Option:</strong> Choose to complete either all sub-achievements or specific ones based on your needs.</p><h3>About Glory of the Delver Achievement</h3><p>The <strong>Glory of the Delver</strong> achievement requires completing a series of challenging Delves-related tasks in <em>The War Within</em>. Delves are short adventures lasting about 10–15 minutes each, but mastering them all to meet the achievement’s requirements can be time-consuming.</p><p>To complete <strong>Glory of the Delver</strong>, players must finish ten major sub-achievements, including:</p><ul><li><strong>Leave No Treasure Unfound:</strong> Find and open all Sturdy Chests in Delves.</li><li><strong>Sporesweeper:</strong> Complete a Fungarian delve without being hit by Explosive Spores (Tier 8+).</li><li><strong>Nemesis:</strong> Defeat the Nemesis boss before the next season.</li><li><strong>Daystormer:</strong> Complete an Order of Night delve without being targeted by Artillery fire (Tier 8+).</li><li><strong>Spider Senses:</strong> Complete a Nerubian delve without triggering ambushers from Nerubian Webs (Tier 8+).</li><li><strong>Delve Loremaster: War Within:</strong> Complete all delve story achievements across multiple locations.</li><li><strong>Brann Development:</strong> Level Brann Bronzebeard to 25.</li></ul><p>Completing these objectives can involve over 20 total achievements, making this boost service the most efficient way to secure your rewards without endless repetition.</p><h3>Rewards</h3><ul><li><strong>Ivory Goliathus Mount</strong> – a stunning flying beetle-like companion unique to <em>The War Within</em>.</li><li><strong>Zekvir’s Spine Cosmetic</strong> – a rare transmog reward.</li><li>Various <strong>Delves gear</strong> drops obtained during completion.</li></ul><h3>Benefits of the Glory of the Delver Boost</h3><p><strong>Save Time:</strong> Skip countless hours of repetitive achievement grinding.</p><p><strong>Expert Boosters:</strong> Our team consists of seasoned WoW professionals with over 15 years of experience.</p><p><strong>Account Safety:</strong> All boosts are performed securely with strict privacy and protection standards.</p><p><strong>24/7 Support:</strong> Our dedicated team is available around the clock to assist with your order.</p><p>Complete your <strong>Glory of the Delver</strong> achievement quickly and unlock all its exclusive rewards with the help of our expert boosters. Explore more <strong>Delves Boosts</strong> and <strong>WoW Boosting Services</strong> on <em>misti.services</em> to enhance your <em>War Within</em> experience.</p>', '<ol><li>Choose your desired reputation level and place your order.</li><li>Receive a confirmation email and your order number.</li><li>Our support manager contacts you via chat or email to confirm details.</li><li>A professional booster is assigned and begins the process immediately.</li><li>Once complete, you’ll be notified through your preferred messenger, such as Discord.</li></ol>', '<ul><li>Level 80 character.</li><li><em>The War Within</em> expansion.</li></ul><p>If you’re not at the required level, Misti Services can help you prepare quickly with our&nbsp;<a href="https://misti.services/game/warwithin/leveling/wow-the-war-within-leveling" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank" style="color: rgb(250, 250, 250);">WoW Power Leveling Boost</a><a href="https://misti.services/game/warwithin/leveling/wow-the-war-within-leveling" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank" style="color: rgb(60, 113, 221);">.</a></p>', 0, 'https://kdjlhibxxygfdmlvdfcl.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/game-images/glory-of-the-delver-1762641480431.webp', NULL, 4.9, 350, true, true, 0, '2025-10-29T01:13:20.151211+00:00', '2025-12-16T07:20:46.156671+00:00', '4aafc243-7ee4-4ce1-9bd9-7f08e98d3b67', false, NULL, true, 0, '15 minutes', 'average start time', 'Flexible', 'order completion', 'Earn the Glory of the Delver achievement fast with our WoW Glory of the Delver Boost. Unlock the Ivory Goliathus mount and exclusive rewards easily.', 'glory of the delver boost, wow glory of the delver achievement, buy ivory goliathus mount, glory of the delver achievement service, fast glory of the delver, wow delver achievement unlock, ivory goliathus mount service, glory of the delver rewards, wow achievement boosting, delver achievement carry, buy wow ivory goliathus, glory of the delver professional, fast wow achievement unlock', 'https://kdjlhibxxygfdmlvdfcl.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/game-images/glory-of-the-delver-1762641480431.webp', NULL, 'Glory Of The Delver', 'Get Glory of the Delver Boost | misti.services', NULL);
INSERT INTO public.products (id, name, slug, short_description, description, how_it_works, requirements, base_price, image_url, badge_text, trust_score, total_reviews, is_active, is_featured, sort_order, created_at, updated_at, category_id, is_slider_product, slider_config, is_manually_popular, total_sales, start_time_text, start_time_value, delivery_text, delivery_value, meta_description, meta_keywords, og_image, canonical_url, image_alt_text, meta_title, parent_link) VALUES ('b5c2e65c-503c-423a-8133-717fd3d667af', 'Ny''alothan Shadow', 'nyalothan-shadow', 'he Ny''alothan Shadow Worm is one of the most prestigious and visually impressive flying mounts introduced in Patch 11.1.5, representing the chaos of the Black Empire. It is obtained by earning the Mastering the Visions meta-achievement, which demands two successful full clears of the Revisited Horrific Visions (one in Stormwind, one in Orgrimmar) while deliberately enabling maximum difficulty via all eight Faceless Masks. ', '<h1><strong>WoW Ny''alothan Shadow Worm Mount Boost </strong></h1><p>The <strong>Ny''alothan Shadow Worm</strong> is a flying mount reserved for the absolute masters of solo content. Earning it requires completing the <strong>"Mastering the Visions"</strong> achievement, which means you must fully clear <em>both</em> the Stormwind and Orgrimmar Horrific Visions with <strong>all eight Faceless Masks</strong> active! This is the highest difficulty possible and a true nightmare of a challenge. If you want this prestigious reward and the <strong>Black Serpent of N''Zoth</strong> mount without weeks of trial-and-error, <strong>misti.services</strong> guarantees the 8-mask vision clear you need.</p><h2><strong>Overview: The Ny''alothan Shadow Worm</strong></h2><p>The <strong>Ny''alothan Shadow Worm</strong> is one of the most prestigious and visually impressive flying mounts introduced in Patch 11.1.5, representing the chaos of the Black Empire. It is obtained by earning the <strong>Mastering the Visions</strong> meta-achievement, which demands two successful full clears of the <strong>Revisited Horrific Visions</strong> (one in Stormwind, one in Orgrimmar) while deliberately enabling maximum difficulty via all eight Faceless Masks. This challenge requires expert mechanical skill and perfect sanity management. Due to the weekly rotation of the visions, completion typically takes up to two weeks.</p><h2><strong>Service Includes</strong></h2><p>This service is a major account upgrade, securing multiple rare rewards and account progress:</p><ul><li>The unique flying mount <strong>Ny''alothan Shadow Worm</strong> obtained.</li><li>The bonus flying mount <strong>Black Serpent of N''Zoth</strong> obtained.</li><li><strong>Mastering the Visions</strong> and <strong>Through the Depths of Visions</strong> meta-achievements earned.</li><li><strong>Reeking of Visions</strong> meta-achievement and <strong>Reek battle pet</strong> obtained.</li><li>All <strong>Hourglass of Horrific Visions</strong> talents unlocked (a massive time-saver).</li><li>Access to 658 item level weapons from the vision vendor.</li><li>Large amounts of <strong>Displaced Corrupted Mementos</strong> farmed.</li><li>Chance to obtain the <strong>Mail Muncher</strong> mount.</li><li>Several Horrific Visions Revisited runs completed (totaling 220 achievement points).</li></ul><h2><strong>More About the Mastering the Visions Challenge</strong></h2><p>Clearing a Horrific Vision is difficult; clearing it with all eight Faceless Masks active is arguably one of the hardest solo challenges in WoW history. Each mask introduces a severe penalty—faster sanity drain, stronger enemies, new mechanics, or crippling debuffs. Success requires flawless execution, perfect knowledge of the vision layouts, and often high-end gear. Our expert boosters are specialists in these challenges, fully capable of managing the maximum difficulty level to secure this powerful symbol of victory for your character without the personal grind.</p><h2><strong>Why You Should Try the misti.services Boost</strong></h2><p>The Ny''alothan Shadow Worm represents not just a successful run, but weeks of preparation and practice many players don''t have time for. With <strong>misti.services</strong>, you skip the stress and guarantee the reward:</p><ul><li><strong>Guaranteed 8-Mask Clear:</strong> We handle the most demanding solo content in the game, guaranteeing the two required full clears under maximum difficulty.</li><li><strong>Dual Mount Reward:</strong> You instantly secure two highly respected flying mounts (Shadow Worm and Black Serpent of N''Zoth).</li><li><strong>Major Account Progress:</strong> We unlock all crucial <strong>Hourglass of Horrific Visions</strong> talents, providing permanent power and removing weeks of Displaced Corrupted Memento farming.</li><li><strong>Stress-Free Achievement:</strong> Avoid the countless hours of trial-and-error, failed runs, and frustrating losses of Sanity; let our experts secure your prestige.</li></ul><h2><strong>Boost Options Explained</strong></h2><p>You have control over how we deliver your mount and achievements:</p><ul><li><strong>Account Sharing (Piloted):</strong> Our professional player logs in to your account to complete the boost.</li><li><strong>Remote Control:</strong> Our player securely connects to your desktop via a remote application (like Parsec). They execute the game actions live while you watch, ensuring your login credentials remain private.</li></ul>', '<ul><li><strong>Order Confirmation:</strong> After payment, our support manager will contact you immediately via chat or email.</li><li><strong>Scheduling:</strong> We coordinate the runs based on the weekly vision rotation, ensuring we complete both Stormwind and Orgrimmar at the earliest available time.</li><li><strong>Execution:</strong> The assigned booster logs in securely, activates all eight masks, and completes the full vision clears.</li><li><strong>Completion:</strong> The service is complete once the <strong>Mastering the Visions</strong> achievement pops and both mounts are secured. You receive an immediate notification, and the account is ready for your use.</li></ul>', '<ul><li><strong>Level 80 Character:</strong> Required for successful solo or group navigation and combat within the vision.</li><li><strong>The War Within Expansion:</strong> Access to the current expansion content is necessary.</li><li><strong>Active WoW Subscription:</strong> You must maintain an active subscription throughout the service duration.</li></ul>', 24.65, 'https://kdjlhibxxygfdmlvdfcl.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/game-images/nyalothan-shadow-1764155332926.webp', NULL, 4.9, 0, true, true, 0, '2025-11-24T20:59:57.439075+00:00', '2025-12-16T07:22:45.747444+00:00', 'b4c0ccaf-a937-4b30-9ab4-7dacee8f739b', false, NULL, true, 0, '15 minutes', 'average start time', 'Flexible', 'order completion', 'Buy the Ny''alothan Shadow Worm boost. Guaranteed 8-Mask clear of both Horrific Visions Revisited for the ''Mastering the Visions'' meta-achievement and two flying mounts.', 'Ny''alothan Shadow Worm mount, 8-Mask vision clear, Mastering the Visions achievement, Black Serpent of N''Zoth, Horrific Visions Revisited, Hourglass of Horrific Visions, WoW Patch 11.1.5 mount, highest difficulty WoW', 'https://kdjlhibxxygfdmlvdfcl.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/game-images/nyalothan-shadow-1764155332926.webp', NULL, 'Nyalothan Shadow', 'Get Ny''alothan Shadow Mount | misti.services', NULL);
