erworking, or other necessary crafting skills.</li><li><strong>Guaranteed Delivery:</strong> We handle the complex coordination between multiple crafters, ensuring the final assembly is successful and delivered to your character.</li><li><strong>Prestige without the Pain:</strong> Ride this sought-after, legendary mount and show off its eerie design without having suffered through the complicated acquisition process.</li></ul><h2><strong>Boost Options</strong></h2><p>You have control over how we handle the material gathering and crafting process:</p><ul><li><strong>Account Sharing (Piloted):</strong> Our professional player logs in to your account to complete all necessary gathering and coordinate the final crafting.</li><li><strong>Remote Control:</strong> Our player securely connects to your desktop via a remote application (like Parsec). They execute the game actions live while you watch, completing the complex steps without accessing your personal login credentials.</li></ul>', '<ul><li><strong>Order Confirmation:</strong> After payment, our support manager will contact you immediately via chat or email.</li><li><strong>Coordination:</strong> Our team immediately begins the process of farming the required rare materials and coordinating with our network of max-level crafters.</li><li><strong>Execution:</strong> The booster gathers all materials and performs the necessary crafting steps.</li><li><strong>Completion:</strong> Once the <strong>Voidfire Deathcycle</strong> is successfully crafted and learned by your character, you receive a notification, and the account is ready for your use.</li></ul><p><br></p>', '<ul><li><strong>Level 80 Character:</strong> Required for accessing and interacting with all relevant zones and crafters.</li><li><strong>Active WoW Subscription:</strong> You must maintain an active subscription throughout the service duration.</li></ul><p><br></p>', 24.65, 'https://kdjlhibxxygfdmlvdfcl.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/game-images/vo