s per Mage Tower challenge.</p><h2><strong>Boost Options Explained</strong></h2><p>Choose how you want your boost completed:</p><ol><li><strong>Account Sharing</strong> – Our professional player logs in to your character and completes the boost.</li><li><strong>Remote Control</strong> – Watch the boost live as our player securely connects to your desktop via remote control apps.</li><li><strong>Custom Mage Tower Selection</strong> – Complete all 7 challenges for a discount or select specific challenges.</li></ol><h2><strong>Why Choose Misti.Services for Your Mage Tower Boost</strong></h2><p>The <strong>Soaring Spelltome</strong> is a rare, long-awaited flying book mount introduced in WoW Patch 9.1.5 and brought back in Dragonflight with Legion Timewalking. Completing all <a href="https://www.wowhead.com/guide/legion-mage-tower-class-challenge-weapon-appearances-4991" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">7 Mage Tower</a> Challenges is currently one of the hardest achievements in the game, requiring multiple characters and specific specializations.</p><p>At <strong>misti.services</strong>, our professional players:</p><ul><li>Carry your character through all Mage Tower challenges efficiently.</li><li>Help you unlock the <strong>A Tour of Towers achievement</strong> for completing all challenges.</li><li>Ensure you receive all mounts, rewards, and unique transmog sets fast.</li></ul><h2><strong>Get Your Soaring Spelltome Mount Today!</strong></h2><p>Why wait? Buy the <strong>Soaring Spelltome Mount Boost</strong> now with <strong>account sharing</strong> or <strong>remote control</strong>, and get your <strong>Mage-Bound Spelltome flying mount</strong> quickly and safely. Watch your character grow in power and collect amazing rewards effortlessly.</p>', '<ul><li>Select your desired boost options and complete the order payment.</li><li>Receive your <strong>order number</strong> and email confirmation.</li><li>Our support manager will contact you via website chat. If you’re unavailable, we’ll reach out by email or other contact methods.</li><li>Provide any additional details if required, and we’ll assign a professional booster.</li><li>Boost begins immediately once the booster is assigned.</li><li>Receive notifications when the order is completed via Discord or your preferred messenger.</li><li>Sit back, relax, and enjoy your character collecting rewards, achievements, and power.</li><li><strong>Don’t forget to leave a review on Trustpilot – your feedback helps us provide the best boosting service.</strong></li></ul>', '<ul><li><strong>Level 80 Character</strong> – Don’t have one? Use our WoW Power Leveling Boost to reach max level fast.</li><li><strong>Appropriate Gear</strong> for your class and specialization.</li><li><strong>Account Access</strong> – Login and password required; your account safety is guaranteed.</li></ul>', 0, 'https://kdjlhibxxygfdmlvdfcl.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/game-images/t42gn4kzyfh.webp', NULL, 4.9, 0, true, false, 0, '2025-10-28T19:43:35.353767+00:00', '2025-12-16T07:21:22.554694+00:00', '1f0b9195-2e81-4380-8315-539e1ce3d834', false, NULL, false, 0, '15 minutes', 'average start time', 'Flexible', 'order completion', 'Soaring Spelltome Mount Boost – Fast & Easy Mage Tower Completion Unlock the Mage-Bound Spelltome flying mount quickly with our professional Soaring....', 'soaring spelltome mount boost, mage-bound spelltome unlock, mage tower timewalking challenges boost, game soaring spelltome, buy soaring spelltome mount, fast mage-bound spelltome, professional soaring spelltome service, mage tower 7 challenges completion, soaring spelltome mount farm, game flying mount boost, mage tower rewards boost, soaring spelltome carry, game mount unlock service, mage-bound spelltome quick acquire', NULL, NULL, 'Game gaming service - Soaring Spelltome', 'Soaring Spelltome Boost - War Within | misti.services', NULL);
