Services can help you prepare quickly with our&nbsp;<a href="https://misti.services/game/warwithin/leveling/wow-the-war-within-leveling" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank" style="color: rgb(250, 250, 250);">WoW Power Leveling Boost</a><a href="https://misti.services/game/warwithin/leveling/wow-the-war-within-leveling" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank" style="color: rgb(60, 113, 221);">.</a></p><p><br></p>', 0, 'https://kdjlhibxxygfdmlvdfcl.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/game-images/titan-disc-belt-1762643865794.webp', NULL, 4.9, 350, true, true, 0, '2025-10-28T22:27:27.77721+00:00', '2025-12-16T07:20:52.191222+00:00', '4aafc243-7ee4-4ce1-9bd9-7f08e98d3b67', false, NULL, true, 0, '15 minutes', 'average start time', '1 day', 'order completion', 'Get the WoW Titan Disc Belt fast and upgraded to max level with Misti Services. Skip the grind and power up your character instantly.', 'titan disc belt boost, wow titan disc belt farm, buy titan disc belt, titan disc belt misti services, max level titan disc belt, skip grind titan disc belt, power up character belt, fast wow belt acquisition, titan disc belt upgrade service, instant titan disc belt, wow gear farming service, cheap titan disc belt, professional wow belt boost', 'https://kdjlhibxxygfdmlvdfcl.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/game-images/titan-disc-belt-1762643865794.webp', NULL, 'Titan Disc Belt', 'WarWithin Titan Disc Belt Boost | misti.services', NULL);
INSERT INTO public.products (id, name, slug, short_description, description, how_it_works, requirements, base_price, image_url, badge_text, trust_score, total_reviews, is_active, is_featured, sort_order, created_at, updated_at, category_id, is_slider_product, slider_config, is_manually_popular, total_sales, start_time_text, start_time_value, delivery_text, delivery_value, meta_description, meta_keywords, og_image, canonical_url, image_alt_text, meta_title, parent_link) VALUES ('3cd001f4-71d7-4b45-9778-09a6d3403630', 'Royal Voidwing', 'royal-voidwing', 'The Royal Voidwing is not just a mount; it is a trophy. Forged from the raw energy of the Void and born in the heart of the Manaforge Omega raid, this cosmic dragon is the signature reward for defeating Dimensius on Heroic difficulty.', '<h1><strong>Royal Voidwing Mount Boost</strong></h1><p><strong>Tame the cosmos. Defeat the Void Lord Dimensius and claim the ultimate prize of Season 3.</strong></p><p>The <strong>Royal Voidwing</strong> is not just a mount; it is a trophy. Forged from the raw energy of the Void and born in the heart of the <strong>Manaforge Omega</strong> raid, this cosmic dragon is the signature reward for defeating <strong>Dimensius</strong> on Heroic difficulty.</p><p>In Patch 11.2 of <em>The War Within</em>, this is the mount everyone will be chasing. However, coordinating a group to kill the final boss of a Heroic raid before the season ends is a massive challenge for most players. PUG groups fail, mechanics wipe the raid, and time is wasted.</p><p>With <strong>misti.services</strong>, you can skip the wipes. Join our professional raid team, defeat the Void Lord, and add this majestic creature to your collection today.</p><h2><strong>Service Includes</strong></h2><p>When you buy the <strong>Royal Voidwing Carry</strong>, you receive a complete Heroic raid experience targeting the final boss. The package includes:</p><ul><li><strong>The Mount:</strong> Guaranteed <strong>Royal Voidwing</strong> added to your collection.</li><li><strong>The Kill:</strong> Defeat of <strong>Dimensius</strong> on Heroic difficulty.</li><li><strong>The Achievement:</strong> <strong>Ahead of the Curve: Dimensius, the All-Devouring</strong> (Feat of Strength).</li><li><strong>High-Tier Loot:</strong> A chance to loot <strong>704 ilvl gear</strong> from the boss.</li><li><strong>Upgrade Currency:</strong> <strong>Runed Ethereal Crests</strong> and <strong>Valorstones</strong> to upgrade your seasonal gear.</li></ul><h2><strong>About the Royal Voidwing &amp; Manaforge Omega</strong></h2><p>The Royal Voidwing was introduced in <strong>Patch 11.2 (Season 3)</strong> as the "Curve" mount. Historically, these mounts (like the Violet Spellwing or Grove Warden) become unobtainable once the next major content patch drops, making this a <strong>time-limited reward</strong>.</p><p>To get it, you must conquer <strong>Manaforge Omega</strong>, the latest raid instance in <em>The War Within</em>. The final encounter against Dimensius requires high DPS, perfect coordination, and zero mistakes. Our boosters have mastered every phase of this fight, ensuring a smooth and quick run for you.</p><h2><strong>Boost Options Explained</strong></h2><p>We offer flexible and secure ways to deliver your mount:</p><ul><li><strong>Selfplay (Recommended):</strong> You log into your own character and join our raid group. Experience the fight, hit the boss, and loot the mount yourself. No account sharing required.</li><li><strong>Piloted:</strong> Our pro player logs into your account using a <strong>VPN matching your country</strong> to ensure safety. They complete the raid while you are offline.</li><li><strong>Remote Control:</strong> For maximum security, our booster connects to your PC via <strong>Parsec</strong>. They play using your mouse and keyboard while you watch the screen live.</li></ul>', '<ul><li><strong>Select Options:</strong> Choose your boost method (Piloted/Selfplay/Remote).</li><li><strong>Order Placed:</strong> After payment, you will receive an order ID and email confirmation.</li><li><strong>Contact:</strong> Our support manager will reach out via Live Chat or Discord to schedule your raid slot.</li><li><em>Selfplay:</em> We invite you to the raid group at the scheduled time.</li><li><em>Piloted/Remote:</em> We connect and complete the boss kill.</li><li><strong>Completion:</strong> You receive the Achievement and the Mount. We notify you via your preferred messenger.</li><li><strong>Review:</strong> Enjoy your new Voidwing and please leave us a review on Trustpilot!</li></ul>', '<ul><li><strong>Level:</strong> Level 80 Character.</li><li><strong>Expansion:</strong> <em>The War Within</em> active.</li><li><strong>Account:</strong> Active World of Warcraft subscription.</li></ul>', 5.1, 'https://kdjlhibxxygfdmlvdfcl.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/game-images/royal-voidwing-1763852549777.webp', NULL, 4.9, 0, true, true, 0, '2025-11-22T19:04:26.098221+00:00', '2025-12-16T07:22:30.474636+00:00', 'b4c0ccaf-a937-4b30-9ab4-7dacee8f739b', false, NULL, true, 1, '15 minutes', 'average start time', 'Flexible', 'order completion', 'Claim the Royal Voidwing mount and flex a regal Void drake without grinding. misti.services provides fast, secure carries with guaranteed completion.', 'royal voidwing mount, buy royal voidwing, heroic dimensius mount, manaforge omega raid mount, void energy dragon, cosmic dragon mount, dimensius heroic reward, acquire royal voidwing, royal voidwing service, royal voidwing boost, game rare mount, game dragon mount, voidwing obtain, game royal voidwing', 'https://kdjlhibxxygfdmlvdfcl.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/game-images/royal-voidwing-1763852549777.webp', NULL, 'Game gaming service - Royal Voidwing', 'Get Royal Voidwing Mount - War Within | misti.services', NULL);
