l be notified via Discord or another messenger when it’s done.</p>', '<ul><li>Level 80 character</li><li>Access to&nbsp;<em>The War Within</em>&nbsp;expansion</li><li>Active World of Warcraft subscription</li><li>Don’t have a max-level character? Use our&nbsp;<a href="https://misti.services/game/warwithin/leveling/wow-the-war-within-leveling" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">WoW Power Leveling Boost</a>&nbsp;service</li></ul>', 0.81, 'https://kdjlhibxxygfdmlvdfcl.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/game-images/glory-of-the-delver-boost-1762456973006.webp', NULL, 4.9, 0, true, true, 0, '2025-10-25T14:56:25.374435+00:00', '2025-12-16T07:19:28.542845+00:00', '1f34fa28-c062-44c5-87c5-312aba1ee6a9', false, NULL, true, 0, '15 minutes', 'average start time', '1 week', 'order completion', 'Earn the Glory of the Delver achievement fast with Misti.Services and unlock the Ivory Goliathus mount without the grind.', 'glory of the delver achievement boost, ivory goliathus mount unlock service, delver achievement fast, buy glory of the delver, misti.services delver boost, no grind ivory goliathus, delver achievement professional, glory of the delver carry, ivory goliathus mount boost, delver achievement cheap, speed run delver achievement, glory of the delver farming, ivory goliathus fast unlock, delver achievement guide, misti.services glory of the delver', 'https://kdjlhibxxygfdmlvdfcl.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/game-images/glory-of-the-delver-boost-1762456973006.webp', NULL, 'Glory Of The Delver Boost', 'War Within Delver Boost - Fast Mount | misti.services', NULL);
