eon achievements, misti.services legion boost, earn leyfeather hippogryph, cheap legion hero boost, fast glory of the legion hero, professional legion achievement service, wow legion mythic dungeons, leyfeather hippogryph mount service, legion hero achievement boost, wow legion mount unlock', 'https://kdjlhibxxygfdmlvdfcl.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/game-images/glory-of-the-legion-hero-boost-1762463502844.webp', NULL, 'Glory Of The Legion Hero Boost', 'Glory of Legion Hero Boost - War Within | misti.services', NULL);
INSERT INTO public.products (id, name, slug, short_description, description, how_it_works, requirements, base_price, image_url, badge_text, trust_score, total_reviews, is_active, is_featured, sort_order, created_at, updated_at, category_id, is_slider_product, slider_config, is_manually_popular, total_sales, start_time_text, start_time_value, delivery_text, delivery_value, meta_description, meta_keywords, og_image, canonical_url, image_alt_text, meta_title, parent_link) VALUES ('1bdd2a21-c793-44a5-a878-025698fd72c6', 'Ref Quests', 'ref-trader-quest-boost', 'Bridging the gap between Escape from Tarkov and EFT: Arena is a game-changer, but unlocking the key to that bridge—Ref, the Trader—is one of the most punishing grinds in the game. The Referee’s tasks are designed to test your PvP skills to the absolute limit.  At Misti Services, we take the frustration out of the equation. Whether you are stuck on the initial unlock or trying to max out your loyalty for elite barters, our veteran players will handle the heavy lifting. Secure the connection between your games and start spending those GP coins on gear that actually matters.', '<h1><strong>Escape from Tarkov Ref Quests Completion</strong></h1><p>Bridging the gap between Escape from Tarkov and EFT: Arena is a game-changer, but unlocking the key to that bridge—Ref, the Trader—is one of the most punishing grinds in the game. The Referee’s tasks are designed to test your PvP skills to the absolute limit.</p><p>At Misti Services, we take the frustration out of the equation. Whether you are stuck on the initial unlock or trying to max out your loyalty for elite barters, our veteran players will handle the heavy lifting. Secure the connection between your games and start spending those GP coins on gear that actually matters.</p><h2><strong>What This Service Includes</strong></h2><p>When you order a Ref Quest boost, you aren''t just getting a task marked as "complete." You are opening up a new economy for your PMC.</p><ul><li><strong>Complete Cross-Game Progression:</strong> We handle the specific unique quests required by Ref (The Steward).</li><li><strong>Exclusive Reward Unlocks:</strong> Gain access to rare barters available only through this trader in both EFT and Arena.</li><li><strong>Dual-Game Benefits:</strong> Secure new gear for your Arena loadouts and transfer exclusive items to your main Tarkov stash.</li><li><strong>Veteran Execution:</strong> A strictly professional service handled by players with thousands of hours in high-tier PvP.</li></ul><h2><strong>Boost Options Explained</strong></h2><p>We offer flexible options to suit your comfort level and schedule:</p><ul><li><strong>Piloted:</strong> One of our trusted boosters will log into your account to complete the Ref quests directly. This is the fastest method.</li><li><strong>Streamed:</strong> Want to watch the magic happen? Our booster will livestream the entire process so you can monitor progress in real-time.</li></ul><h2><strong>About Escape from Tarkov Ref Quests</strong></h2><p>Ref, also known as The Steward, is the most unique trader introduced to Tarkov because he acts as the singular link between the main raid experience and the Arena. However, accessing him is not simple. It requires completing a specific chain of quests starting with Skier, and continuing with difficult objectives set by Ref himself.</p><p><strong>Why is Ref Essential?</strong> Ref is currently the only trader who deals in GP Coins. Without him, the currency you earn in Arena is virtually useless in the main game. Unlocking him allows you to:</p><ul><li><strong>Purchase High-Tier Gear:</strong> Buy rare weapon parts, armor plates, and customized weapons using GP coins.</li><li><strong>Access Unique Keys:</strong> Get your hands on keys and secure containers that are not available on the Flea Market or other traders.</li><li><strong>Utilize the Money Sink:</strong> For skilled Arena players, Ref provides a way to convert PvP skill into a massive advantage in normal raids.</li></ul><p><strong>What You Get with Misti Services:</strong></p><ul><li><strong>The Unlock:</strong> We handle "Easy Money Part 1," the critical Skier quest involving planting items across multiple maps to initially reveal Ref.</li><li><strong>The Progression:</strong> We can complete the subsequent, difficult gear-related tasks that Ref assigns.</li><li><strong>The Economy:</strong> You gain the ability to turn Arena victories into PMC power.</li><li><strong>Loot Safety:</strong> You keep every roubles, item, and weapon found during the boost.</li></ul><h2><strong>Why Choose Misti Services?</strong></h2><p>We understand that account safety and reliability are your top concerns.</p><ul><li><strong>Manual Gameplay Only:</strong> We never use cheats, bots, or scripts. Our boosters are simply elite players who know the maps and mechanics inside out.</li><li><strong>Privacy Guaranteed:</strong> Your account details are handled with the highest security standards.</li><li><strong>24/7 Support:</strong> Have a question about your order or a specific quest? Our live support team is always available to help.</li><li><strong>Efficiency:</strong> We know the fastest routes and strategies to clear these quests, saving you dozens of hours of frustration.</li></ul>', '<ul><li><strong>Select Your Quests:</strong> Choose the specific Referee tasks you need help with and place your order.</li><li><strong>Specialist Assignment:</strong> We assign your order to a booster who specializes in PvP and end-game challenges.</li><li><strong>The Grind:</strong> Our pro completes the demanding trials, whether it requires specific kills, objective control, or item transfers.</li><li><strong>Completion &amp; Notification:</strong> Once the objectives are met, we notify you immediately.</li><li><strong>Enjoy the Rewards:</strong> Log back in to find your quests complete and your new trader loyalty ready to go.</li></ul>', '<ul><li>You must own a copy of Escape from Tarkov.</li><li>For specific high-tier tasks, you must own Escape from Tarkov: Arena.</li><li>Your character must have the desired quests available in their log.</li></ul>', 1.99, 'https://kdjlhibxxygfdmlvdfcl.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/game-images/ref-trader-quest-boost-1765925944355.webp', NULL, 4.9, 0, true, true, 0, '2025-12-16T16:43:19.286801+00:00', '2025-12-16T23:08:52.017467+00:00', 'ad312297-e28b-4185-8694-55f8078c94b1', false, NULL, true, 0, '15 minutes', 'average start time', 'Flexible', 'order completion', 'Unlock Ref (The Steward) and transfer your Arena winnings to EFT effortlessly. Our veteran boosters handle the brutal Ref questlines so you can access exclusive barters.', 'Escape from Tarkov Ref Quests, Tarkov Arena Boost, Ref Trader Unlock, The Steward Tarkov, EFT Arena GP Coins, Buy Ref Quest Completion, Tarkov Cross-Game Progression, Unlock Ref Trader EFT, Easy Money Part 1 Guide, Tarkov Arena Trader Services, Legit Tarkov Boosting, EFT Referee Tasks, Tarkov Arena Link, GP Coin Barter Unlock, Ref Loyalty Level Boost, Tarkov PvP Quest Service, EFT Arena Rewards Transfer, The Steward Questline, Tarkov Account Carry, Piloted Tarkov Boost, Arena to Tarkov Transfer, Ref Inventory Unlock, Escape from Tarkov Service, Buy GP Coin Gear, Tarkov Rare Key Unlock, Professional Tarkov Booster, Safe Tarkov Boosting, Ref Trader Rep Boost, EFT Arena Wins Boost, Tarkov High Tier Loot', 'https://kdjlhibxxygfdmlvdfcl.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/game-images/ref-trader-quest-boost-1765925944355.webp', NULL, 'Ref Trader Quest Boost', 'Escape from Tarkov Ref Quests Boost | misti.services', NULL);
