cation on Discord or another messenger of your choice.</li></ul>', '<ul><li>Active World of Warcraft subscription</li><li>Level 90 character</li></ul><p>Need help reaching level 90? Try our&nbsp;<a href="https://misti.services/game/wow-mistsofpandaria-classic" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank" style="color: rgb(60, 113, 221);">WoW Power Leveling Boost</a>&nbsp;</p>', 0, 'https://kdjlhibxxygfdmlvdfcl.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/game-images/pvp-gear-boost-1762689887985.webp', NULL, 4.9, 350, true, true, 0, '2025-11-01T04:27:55.122017+00:00', '2025-12-16T20:06:45.562505+00:00', 'af2a9cdb-9bf6-444c-b4e1-97ad8c383155', false, NULL, true, 0, '15 minutes', 'average start time', 'Flexible', 'order completion', 'Buy WoW Pandaria Classic PvP Gear Boost at misti.services. Get full PvP gear fast and safely to dominate Arenas and Battlegrounds.', 'wow pandaria classic pvp gear boost, buy pandaria pvp gear, fast wow pvp gear, dominate wow arenas, wow battlegrounds gear boost, pandaria classic full pvp gear, cheap wow pvp boost, safe wow pvp gear service, pvp gear acquisition wow, pandaria pvp equipment boost, wow classic pvp item farm, professional wow pvp gear, misti.services pvp boost, pandaria pvp gear for sale, quick wow pvp outfitting', 'https://kdjlhibxxygfdmlvdfcl.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/game-images/pvp-gear-boost-1762689887985.webp', NULL, 'Pvp Gear Boost', 'WoW MoP PvP Gear Boost - Fast | misti.services', NULL);
