 To earn this, players must finish 500 delves—an achievement that demands significant time and dedication.</p><p>Our <strong>WoW Delver Title Boost</strong> service helps you bypass this repetitive grind. Our experienced boosters will handle the entire process efficiently, allowing you to enjoy the reward without the long hours of gameplay. Whether you’re a completionist or simply want to display this title proudly, this service ensures you achieve it quickly and securely.</p><p>Explore more of our <strong>WoW Boosting</strong> and <strong>Delves Boosts</strong> to enhance your gameplay experience.</p>', '<ol><li>Choose your desired reputation level and place your order.</li><li>Receive a confirmation email and your order number.</li><li>Our support manager contacts you via chat or email to confirm details.</li><li>A professional booster is assigned and begins the process immediately.</li><li>Once complete, you’ll be notified through your preferred messenger, such as Discord.</li></ol>', '<ul><li>Level 80 character.</li><li>Active World of Warcraft subscription.</li><li>The War Within expansion.</li></ul><p><span style="background-color: rgba(23, 32, 48, 0.9); color: rgb(250, 250, 250);">If you’re not at the required level, Misti Services can help you prepare quickly with our&nbsp;</span><a href="https://misti.services/game/warwithin/leveling/wow-the-war-within-leveling" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank" style="background-color: rgba(23, 32, 48, 0.9); color: rgb(250, 250, 250);">WoW Power Leveling Boost</a><a href="https://misti.services/game/warwithin/leveling/wow-the-war-within-leveling" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank" style="background-color: rgba(23, 32, 48, 0.9); color: rgb(60, 113, 221);">.</a></p>', 284.21, 'https://kdjlhibxxygfdmlvdfcl.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/game-images/delver-title-1762638345277.webp', NULL, 4.9, 350, true, true, 0, '2025-10-29T01:00:10.399638+00:00', '2025-12-16T07:20:33.652016+00:00', '4aafc243-7ee4-4ce1-9b