through your preferred messenger, such as Discord.</li></ol><p><br></p>', '<h2>Requirements</h2><ul><li><em>World of Warcraft: The War Within</em> expansion</li><li>Level eighty character</li><li>Active game subscription</li></ul><p>If you’re not at the required level, Misti Services can help you prepare quickly with our&nbsp;<a href="https://misti.services/game/warwithin/leveling/wow-the-war-within-leveling" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank" style="color: rgb(250, 250, 250);">WoW Power Leveling Boost</a><a href="https://misti.services/game/warwithin/leveling/wow-the-war-within-leveling" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank" style="color: rgb(60, 113, 221);">.</a></p><p><br></p>', 1598.82, 'https://kdjlhibxxygfdmlvdfcl.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/game-images/silver-coffer-key-transmog-1762643773387.webp', NULL, 4.9, 350, true, true, 0, '2025-10-29T00:50:16.95195+00:00', '2025-12-16T07:20:39.447282+00:00', '4aafc243-7ee4-4ce1-9bd9-7f08e98d3b67', false, NULL, true, 7, '15 minutes', 'average start time', 'Flexible', 'order completion', 'Unlock the Silver Coffer Key transmog fast with our WoW boost. Get rare pets, cosmetics, and treasures from Delves safely and efficiently.', 'silver coffer key transmog boost, wow silver coffer key unlock, fast silver coffer key, buy silver coffer key transmog, silver coffer key delves, wow rare pets delves, wow cosmetics delves, wow treasures delves, efficient silver coffer key farm, game silver coffer key service, safe silver coffer key boost', 'https://kdjlhibxxygfdmlvdfcl.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/game-images/silver-coffer-key-transmog-1762643773387.webp', NULL, 'Silver Coffer Key Transmog', 'WoW War Within Delves Key Transmog | misti.services', NULL);
