 Lorewalkers</strong>. This faction is located at the Seat of Knowledge in the Vale of Eternal Blossoms and values stories and historical scrolls.</p><h3>How to Earn Reputation</h3><ul><li><strong>Collect Lorewalker Scrolls:</strong> Scrolls are hidden across zones like Jade Forest, Krasarang Wilds, and Kun-Lai Summit. Each set of scrolls grants an achievement and reputation points.</li><li><strong>Complete Achievements:</strong> Notable achievements include The Seven Burdens of Shaohao, Hozen in the Mist, Fish Tales, Ballad of Liu Lang, and more.</li><li><strong>Turn in Quests:</strong> After earning an achievement, check your mail for a letter from Lorewalker Cho and complete the quest at the Seat of Knowledge.</li><li><strong>Reach Exalted:</strong> Completing all achievements and quests grants Exalted status with The Lorewalkers.</li><li><strong>Buy the Mount:</strong> Once Exalted, purchase the mount from Tan Shin Tiao for 600 gold.</li></ul><h3>Mount Benefits</h3><ul><li><strong>Small Size:</strong> Great for tight spaces and crowded areas</li><li><strong>Unique Appearance:</strong> A magical disc floating on a red cloud</li><li><strong>Non-Combat Unlock:</strong> No bosses or dungeons required</li><li><strong>Collector’s Item:</strong> Adds a rare flying mount to your collection</li><li><strong>Exploration Utility:</strong> Fast and stylish travel across Pandaria</li></ul><h3>Why Choose misti.services</h3><ul><li>Fast and safe Lorewalkers reputation farming</li><li>Professional boosters complete all achievements manually</li><li>Mount unlocked directly on your account</li><li>Save time while enjoying this unique flying mount</li></ul><p>Unlock the <strong>Disc of the Red Flying Cloud</strong> efficiently with <strong>misti.services</strong> and enjoy a distinctive mount that enhances both your collection and exploration in Pandaria.</p>', '<ul><li>Select your desired options and complete your order on&nbsp;Misti.Services.</li><li>You’ll receive an order confi