firmation and tracking number via email.</li><li>Our support manager will contact you through live chat to confirm all details.</li><li>If you’re unavailable, we’ll reach out via email or your preferred contact method.</li><li>When the boost is finished, you’ll receive a completion notification on Discord or another messenger of your choice.</li></ul>', '<ul><li>Level 90 character in <em>Mists of Pandaria Classic</em></li><li>Active <em>WoW Pandaria Classic</em> subscription</li><li>No previous dungeon progress required</li></ul><p><span style="color: rgb(250, 250, 250); background-color: rgba(23, 32, 48, 0.9);">Need help reaching level 90? Try our&nbsp;</span><a href="https://misti.services/game/wow-mistsofpandaria-classic" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank" style="color: rgb(60, 113, 221); background-color: rgba(23, 32, 48, 0.9);">WoW Power Leveling Boost</a><span style="color: rgb(250, 250, 250); background-color: rgba(23, 32, 48, 0.9);">&nbsp;</span></p>', 0, 'https://kdjlhibxxygfdmlvdfcl.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/game-images/celestial-dungeons-1762685206213.webp', NULL, 4.9, 350, true, true, 0, '2025-11-01T03:19:16.643048+00:00', '2026-01-07T10:53:49.935204+00:00', '97ad74c0-d8ac-4322-a223-725ee7e92792', false, NULL, true, 0, '15 minutes', 'average start time', '30 minutes', 'per 1 dungeon', 'Complete all Celestial Dungeons fast with misti.services. Earn BiS pre-raid gear, achievements, and rewards in WoW Pandaria Classic safely and efficiently.', 'celestial dungeons boost, wow pandaria classic dungeons, bis pre-raid gear pandaria, celestial dungeons achievements, pandaria classic dungeon rewards, buy celestial dungeons run, fast celestial dungeons completion, safe wow pandaria dungeons, efficient dungeon farming wow, misti.services pandaria dungeons, wow classic pandaria dungeon carry, professional celestial dungeons service, pandaria pre-raid gear farm, celestial dungeons loot run, wow pandaria dungeon guide', 'https://kdjlhibxxygfdmlvdfcl.s