future crafting of other Blacksmithing items and gear.</p></li><li><p><strong>Potential Pre-raid Gear:</strong> Chance to obtain early TBC pre-raid quality gear during the service.</p></li><li><p><strong>Reputation Gains:</strong> Accumulate additional reputation with various TBC factions throughout the process.</p></li></ul><h2><strong>About the Lionheart Champion</strong></h2><p>The Lionheart Champion stands as a formidable early-endgame weapon for strength-based melee DPS in The Burning Crusade Classic. This epic two-handed sword boasts high base damage, significant Strength and Agility bonuses, and a potent ''on-hit'' proc that grants a temporary burst of Strength. Its additional feature of resisting Fear effects makes it exceptionally valuable for both PvE and PvP encounters. Crafting this mighty weapon typically requires substantial time investment in Blacksmithing and meticulous farming for rare components, including Primal Nethers.</p><h3>Why Choose Our Service</h3><ul><li><p><strong>Guaranteed Acquisition:</strong> Secure the Lionheart Champion without any reliance on luck or tedious boss farming.</p></li><li><p><strong>Effortless Process:</strong> No need for any prior preparation on your part; we manage all material gathering and profession leveling.</p></li><li><p><strong>Time-Saving:</strong> Bypass the extensive grind associated with maxing out Blacksmithing and sourcing rare crafting components.</p></li><li><p><strong>Profession Bonus:</strong> Gain a fully leveled Blacksmithing profession, opening up further crafting opportunities.</p></li><li><p><strong>Expert Execution:</strong> Our experienced boosters ensure efficient and secure completion of the service.</p></li></ul><p>Opt for misti.services to acquire your Lionheart Champion boost and stand ready for any challenge the Outland presents without the typical grind. Experience the game''s anniversary content with top-tier gear, delivered safely and efficiently.</p>', '<ul><li><p><strong>Select Your Region:</strong> Choose between EU or US servers.</p></li><li><p><strong>Choose Your Playstyle:</strong> Opt for self-play to experience the raid yourself, or piloted for our team to play for you.</p></li></ul><p></p>', '<ul>
INSERT INTO public.products (id, name, slug, short_description, description, how_it_works, requirements, base_price, image_url, badge_text, trust_score, total_reviews, is_active, is_featured, sort_order, created_at, updated_at, category_id, is_slider_product, slider_config, is_manually_popular, total_sales, start_time_text, start_time_value, delivery_text, delivery_value, meta_description, meta_keywords, og_image, canonical_url, image_alt_text, meta_title, parent_link) VALUES ('ca602352-e6de-47ad-bfd0-5726eacdb481', 'Arcanovoid Construct', 'midnight-arcanovoid-construct-mount-carry', 'Secure the exclusive Arcanovoid Construct mechanical mount in WoW Midnight with our professional boosting service. Our experts will navigate the Nullaeus Challenge (Tier 11) to guarantee this stunning steed for your collection.', '<h1><strong>Arcanovoid Construct Mount Carry</strong></h1><p>Obtain the rare<a target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" href="https://www.wowhead.com/item=263222/arcanovoid-construct"> Arcanovoid Construct</a> mount, a truly impressive mechanical steed, through our reliable WoW Midnight boosting service. Many players find acquiring this particular mount challenging, as it demands the successful completion of the Nullaeus Challenge at Tier 11. Our professional carry ensures a guaranteed acquisition, handled efficiently by seasoned players knowledgeable in every step of the process.</p><h2><strong>Service Includes</strong></h2><ul><li><p><strong>Mount Acquisition:</strong> Guaranteed Arcanovoid Construct mount added to your collection.</p></li><li><p><strong>Challenge Completion:</strong> Nullaeus Challenge Tier 11 successfully concluded.</p></li><li><p><strong>Achievements Earned:</strong> My Shady Nemesis, Lighting the Dark, and Let Me Solo Him: Nullaeus.</p></li><li><p><strong>Exclusive Cosmetics:</strong> Nullaeus Domaneye transmog and the prestigious Ominous title.</p></li><li><p><strong>Loot and Resources:</strong> All resources, gold, and loot obtained during the service completion.</p></li></ul><h2><strong>About the Arcanovoid Construct Mount</strong></h2><p>The Arcanovoid Construct is one of Midnight''s most sought-after mechanical ground mounts, renowned for its intricate design and prestigious source. Earning it signifies mastery of the Nullaeus Challenge, a pinnacle of difficulty within the game''s delves content. This service provides a straightforward path to adding this magnificent mount to your collection without the personal grind.</p><h3>Why Choose Our Service</h3><ul><li><p><strong>Expert Players:</strong> Our team consists of top-tier gamers with extensive experience in challenging content.</p></li><li><p><strong>Guaranteed Results:</strong> We offer a 100% guarantee on mount acquisition upon service completion.</p></li><li><p><strong>Time-Saving:</strong> Skip the frustration and hours of attempts, and let us handle the demanding challenge for you.</p></li><li><p><strong>Comprehensive Rewards:</strong> Beyond the mount, you''ll earn valuable achievements, titles, and transmog items.</p></li><li><p><strong>Security &amp; Privacy:</strong> We prioritize your account''s safety with secure methods and respectful handling.</p></li></ul><p>Elevate your Midnight mount collection with this exceptional addition. Trust misti.services to deliver a seamless and rewarding experience for obtaining the Arcanovoid Construct mount.</p>', '<ul><li><p><strong>Initial Contact:</strong> Our dedicated manager reaches out to you to discuss scheduling and any specific preferences.</p></li><li><p><strong>Scheduling:</strong> We set a convenient time for the Nullaeus Challenge run, fitting into your personal schedule.</p></li><li><p><strong>Service Execution:</strong> A professional player logs into your account (for Piloted mode) or guides you (for Self-Play Remote) to complete the challenge.</p></li><li><p><strong>Completion Notification:</strong> Once the mount and associated rewards are secured, we notify you immediately.</p></li><li><p>For Piloted mode, we use Premium VPNs to ensure maximum account security by matching your location. For Self-Play Remote, you maintain full observation of all in-game actions.</p></li></ul><p></p>', '<ul>
INSERT INTO public.products (id, name, slug, short_description, description, how_it_works, requirements, base_price, image_url, badge_text, trust_score, total_reviews, is_active, is_featured, sort_order, created_at, updated_at, category_id, is_slider_product, slider_config, is_manually_popular, total_sales, start_time_text, start_time_value, delivery_text, delivery_value, meta_description, meta_keywords, og_image, canonical_url, image_alt_text, meta_title, parent_link) VALUES ('d5ecf458-6896-482a-8ce3-071d433c6ad6', 'Daily & World Quests', 'wow-daily-world-quests-boost', 'Effortlessly complete your daily and weekly World Quests in Midnight. Gain reputation, gear, and essential currencies without the grind, maximizing your character''s progression and saving you valuable time.', '<h1><strong>WoW Daily &amp; World Quests Boost</strong></h1><p>Elevate your World of Warcraft experience with our comprehensive Daily and World Quests boost service. Skip the repetitive grind and let our expert players secure valuable reputation gains, essential equipment, and crucial currencies from Azeroth''s bustling daily activities. Perfect for players looking to optimize their progression and enjoy the endgame faster.</p><h2><strong>Service Includes</strong></h2><ul><li><p><strong>Daily &amp; World Quests Completed:</strong> All nominated daily and World Quests on your character will be efficiently finished.</p></li><li><p><strong>Faction Reputation:</strong> Earn significant reputation gains with Midnight factions.</p></li><li><p><strong>Gold Acquisition:</strong> A quantity of gold will be obtained during the service.</p></li><li><p><strong>Potential Equipment:</strong> Opportunities to acquire new gear and upgrades for your character.</p></li><li><p><strong>Valuable Currencies:</strong> Possible acquisition of crafting materials.</p></li><li><p><strong>All Loot:</strong> Every item, resource, and piece of loot acquired during the boost remains on your character.</p></li></ul><h2><strong>About World Quests in Midnight</strong></h2><p>World Quests are a cornerstone of endgame progression in World of Warcraft, offering repeatable objectives across Midnight zones that reward players with crucial resources, gear, and reputation. These quests are vital for unlocking new content, strengthening your character, and engaging with the lore. However, consistently completing them can become a demanding and time-consuming daily chore for even the most dedicated players.</p><h3>Why Choose Our Service</h3><ul><li><p><strong>Time-Saving:</strong> Reclaim hours of your day by letting our professionals handle the repetitive tasks.</p></li><li><p><strong>Efficient Progression:</strong> Quickly earn reputation, currencies, and gear to advance your character without the personal effort.</p></li><li><p><strong>Guaranteed Results:</strong> Our experienced boosters ensure all selected objectives are completed promptly and effectively.</p></li><li><p><strong>Secure &amp; Private:</strong> All services are performed with utmost account security and privacy in mind.</p></li><li><p><strong>Flexible Options:</strong> Tailor your boost with additional choices like unlocking World Quests or securing extra gold.</p></li></ul><p>Choose misti.services for a seamless and rewarding World of Warcraft experience. Our commitment to quality and player satisfaction ensures you get the most out of your game time.</p>', '<ul><li><p>Select your desired World Quest duration and any additional options, then complete your purchase.</p></li><li><p>Our customer support team will contact you within 15-30 minutes to confirm details and schedule the service.</p></li><li><p>Provide your account credentials securely. Our booster will log in and begin the World Quest completion process.</p></li><li><p>Your booster will efficiently complete Daily and World Quests, potentially streaming the service for your convenience if selected.</p></li><li><p>Upon completion, you will be notified, and your character will be ready with all earned rewards.</p></li></ul><p></p>', '<ul><li><p>An active World of Warcraft subscription is required.</p></li><li><p>Character must be level 90 to access World Quests.</p></li><li><p>World Quests in Midnight must be unlocked. An optional add-on is available if they are not yet unlocked.</p></li></ul><p></p>', 15, NULL, NULL, 4.9, 0, true, true, 0, '2026-02-10T22:09:37.608868+00:00', '2026-02-17T10:04:39.29594+00:00', 'e485ce45-0002-4703-b770-7329e3621434', true, '{"step":1,"max_value":30,"min_value":1,"slider_type":"single","value_label":"Days","default_value":1,"dynamic_options":[{"action":"apply_discount","message":"","option_name":"","trigger_value":7,"discount_percent":40},{"action":"apply_discount","message":"","option_name":"","trigger_value":20,"discount_percent":10},{"action":"apply_discount","message":"","option_name":"","trigger_value":30,"discount_percent":10}],"pricing_brackets":[{"end":30,"price":0,"start":1}],"estimated_time_per_step":1}', true, 0, '15 minutes', 'average start time', 'Flexible', 'order completion', 'Buy World of Warcraft Daily and World Quests boost. Gain reputation, gold, and gear efficiently with our professional WoW questing service.', 'wow daily world quests buy, wow world quest boost, wow questing service, world of warcraft daily quests price, wow reputation farm, buy wow gear, wow quest completion, fast tww quests, wow progress, wow , gaming service, fast delivery, professional, reliable, secure, boosting, carry, account, safe, trusted', NULL, NULL, 'World of Warcraft The War Within Daily and World Quests being completed by a professional player for rewards', 'WoW Daily & World Quests Boost | misti.services', NULL);
INSERT INTO public.products (id, name, slug, short_description, description, how_it_works, requirements, base_price, image_url, badge_text, trust_score, total_reviews, is_active, is_featured, sort_order, created_at, updated_at, category_id, is_slider_product, slider_config, is_manually_popular, total_sales, start_time_text, start_time_value, delivery_text, delivery_value, meta_description, meta_keywords, og_image, canonical_url, image_alt_text, meta_title, parent_link) VALUES ('c9baf6a3-ea95-41da-a753-faa43e3d3d34', 'Primals Farm', 'wow-tbc-classic-primal-farm', 'Secure all the essential Primal materials you need in WoW TBC Classic without the repetitive grind. Our service makes acquiring critical crafting reagents simple and stress-free.', '<h1><strong>WoW TBC Classic Primal Farm</strong></h1><p>Acquire any quantity of desired Primal materials effortlessly with our WoW TBC Classic Primal Farm service. <a target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" href="https://www.wowhead.com/tbc/guide/farming-primals-burning-crusade-classic-wow">Primals </a>are vital for crafting high-end gear and consumables in The Burning Crusade, and our professional boosters handle the entire farming process for you.</p><h2><strong>Service Includes</strong></h2><ul><li><p><strong>Chosen Primals:</strong> Delivery of your specified type and quantity of Primal materials.</p></li><li><p><strong>Efficient Farming:</strong> Our experienced team will diligently farm the required Motes and convert them into your desired Primals.</p></li><li><p><strong>Time Savings:</strong> Skip the extensive grinding and focus on enjoying other aspects of WoW TBC Classic.</p></li></ul><h2><strong>About WoW TBC Classic Primals</strong></h2><p>Primals are cornerstone reagents for a vast array of crafting recipes across all professions in World of Warcraft: The Burning Crusade Classic. They are indispensable for creating powerful Rare and Epic items, essential enchants, and valuable armor kits. Each Primal element, such as Primal Air, Earth, Fire, Water, Mana, Shadow, and Life, requires ten corresponding Motes to create, making large quantities particularly time-consuming to gather through ordinary gameplay and grinding activities in Outland.</p><h3>Why Choose Our Service</h3><ul><li><p><strong>Professional Boosters:</strong> Our team consists of skilled and verified players who understand efficient farming routes.</p></li><li><p><strong>Flexible Options:</strong> Choose the exact type and amount of Primals you need, tailored to your crafting goals.</p></li><li><p><strong>Secure Process:</strong> We prioritize account safety and use manual boosting methods to ensure a smooth and secure service.</p></li><li><p><strong>Save Time:</strong> Avoid the monotonous grind for Motes and Primals, letting you maximize your gameplay enjoyment.</p></li><li><p><strong>Expert Support:</strong> Our customer service team is available to assist you throughout the process.</p></li></ul><p>Let misti.services take the burden of Primal farming off your shoulders. Purchase our WoW TBC Classic Primal Farm today and power up your crafting without the hassle!</p>', '<ul><li><p>Select the desired quantity and type of Primals and place your order.</p></li><li><p>Our customer support team will contact you via live chat or email to confirm details and schedule the service.</p></li><li><p>A professional booster will securely log into your account at the agreed-upon time.</p></li><li><p>The booster will efficiently farm the necessary Motes and convert them into your chosen Primals.</p></li><li><p>Once the target amount of Primals is acquired, you will be notified of the service completion.</p></li><li><p>Enjoy your newly acquired crafting materials!</p></li></ul><p></p>', '<ul>
INSERT INTO public.products (id, name, slug, short_description, description, how_it_works, requirements, base_price, image_url, badge_text, trust_score, total_reviews, is_active, is_featured, sort_order, created_at, updated_at, category_id, is_slider_product, slider_config, is_manually_popular, total_sales, start_time_text, start_time_value, delivery_text, delivery_value, meta_description, meta_keywords, og_image, canonical_url, image_alt_text, meta_title, parent_link) VALUES ('7c2e589a-e51d-4074-a6d0-1139718e5e21', 'Primal Nether', 'wow-tbc-primal-nether-farm', 'Secure the exact amount of Primal Nethers you need for crafting in WoW TBC without the endless grind. Our service provides a guaranteed farm through efficient Heroic dungeon runs, saving you time and frustration.', '<h1><strong>WoW TBC Primal Nether Farm</strong></h1><p>Acquire your desired quantity of Primal Nethers in WoW Burning Crusade Classic quickly and efficiently. This service ensures you get these crucial crafting reagents for your high-end gear without battling low drop rates and constant dungeon delves, directly boosting your character''s progression.</p><h2><strong>Service Includes</strong></h2><ul><li><p><strong>Desired Primal Nethers:</strong> The specific amount of Primal Nethers you choose will be delivered to your character.</p></li><li><p><strong>Dungeon Gear:</strong> A chance to obtain various rare and epic dungeon items (ilvl 110-115) from the runs.</p></li><li><p><strong>Badges of Justice:</strong> Accumulate 3-5 Badges of Justice per dungeon completed.</p></li><li><p><strong>Reputation Gains:</strong> Earn a substantial amount of reputation with various TBC factions.</p></li></ul><h2><strong>About WoW TBC Primal Nether</strong></h2><p><a target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" href="https://www.wowhead.com/tbc/item=23572/primal-nether">Primal Nether</a> is a highly sought-after Bind on Pick-up crafting reagent in WoW TBC Classic, essential for creating many powerful high-end items. It primarily drops from the final bosses of level 68+ Normal dungeons with a low chance, or as a guaranteed drop from Heroic dungeon end bosses. Acquiring a significant amount can be a time-consuming endeavor, often involving numerous repetitions of challenging dungeons. Our Primal Nether Farm service streamlines this process, ensuring you receive the necessary reagents efficiently and reliably.</p><h3>Why Choose Our Service</h3><ul><li><p><strong>Guaranteed Delivery:</strong> We ensure you receive the precise number of Primal Nethers you order, bypassing the RNG of drops.</p></li><li><p><strong>Efficient Runs:</strong> Our experienced boosters know the optimal routes and strategies for fast Heroic dungeon clears.</p></li><li><p><strong>Flexible Play Options:</strong> Choose between Piloted, Remote Control, or Self-Play to best suit your preferences.</p></li><li><p><strong>Time-Saving:</strong> Skip the repetitive grind and dedicate your play time to other engaging aspects of the game.</p></li></ul><p>Choose misti.services for a reliable and stress-free way to obtain your WoW TBC Primal Nethers, allowing you to craft the gear you need and enjoy the endgame content without the hassle.</p>', '<h4>Piloted (Account Share)</h4><ul><li><p>After placing your order, we''ll reach out via live chat or email to confirm your server, faction, character details, and the best start time.</p></li><li><p>You''ll securely provide your account access information. Our booster connects using safe, region-matched routing.</p></li><li><p>Our expert booster will perform efficient Heroic dungeon runs to acquire your requested Primal Nethers.</p></li><li><p>We''ll keep you updated on progress, and once the target amount is reached, we''ll notify you and hand back your account.</p></li></ul><h4>Remote Control</h4><ul><li><p>We''ll coordinate with you to set up a trusted remote-control solution and schedule your session.</p></li><li><p>You launch WoW on your computer and grant one-time access for the session, retaining full control to pause or stop anytime.</p></li><li><p>Our booster will run Heroic dungeons through your PC, maximizing efficiency and Primal Nether acquisition while you observe.</p></li><li><p>Once your desired amount of Primal Nethers is obtained, you end the session and keep all new items on your character.</p></li></ul><p></p>', '<ul>
INSERT INTO public.products (id, name, slug, short_description, description, how_it_works, requirements, base_price, image_url, badge_text, trust_score, total_reviews, is_active, is_featured, sort_order, created_at, updated_at, category_id, is_slider_product, slider_config, is_manually_popular, total_sales, start_time_text, start_time_value, delivery_text, delivery_value, meta_description, meta_keywords, og_image, canonical_url, image_alt_text, meta_title, parent_link) VALUES ('24b48e17-ab5b-411b-adc0-082b14342534', 'Dungeon Set 3 Gear', 'wow-tbc-classic-anniversary-dungeon-set-3-gear', 'Secure a full Dungeon Set 3 for your character in WoW TBC Classic Anniversary, bypassing the lengthy pre-raid gearing grind. Get raid-ready with powerful blue 115 ilvl gear obtained from efficient dungeon clears, tailored for your class and specification.', '<h1><strong>WoW TBC Classic Anniversary Dungeon Set 3 Gear</strong></h1><p>Jumpstart your Burning Crusade Classic Anniversary journey with our <a target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" href="https://www.wowhead.com/tbc/guide/tier-sets-dungeon-burning-crusade-classic">WoW TBC Classic Anniversary Dungeon Set 3</a> Gear service. This offering secures a complete 115 item level blue Dungeon Set 3 for your character, preparing you for initial raid progression like Karazhan without the usual gear farming hassle. Avoid random groups, frustrating wipes, and loot competition by letting our experts handle your gear acquisition.</p><h2><strong>Service Includes</strong></h2><ul><li><p><strong>Full Dungeon Set 3:</strong> A complete 115 ilvl Dungeon Set 3, chosen specifically for your class and specialization.</p></li><li><p><strong>Dungeon Completions:</strong> Numerous normal and heroic Burning Crusade dungeons will be completed during the service.</p></li><li><p><strong>Additional Loot:</strong> All other tradable items, currencies, and resources obtained during the dungeon runs will be yours.</p></li></ul><h2><strong>About WoW TBC Classic Anniversary Dungeon Set 3 Gearing</strong></h2><p>The Dungeon Set 3 in WoW TBC Classic Anniversary provides a robust foundation for level 70 characters aiming for Karazhan and other early raid content. These sets, featuring 115 item level blue quality gear, are acquired from various level 70 dungeons, including challenging heroic versions. Obtaining a full set typically involves significant time investment, multiple dungeon runs, and often competing with other players for drops. Our service streamlines this process, allowing you to focus on end-game activities faster.</p><h3>Why Choose Our Service</h3><ul><li><p><strong>Skip the Grind:</strong> Avoid the repetitive and time-consuming process of dungeon farming for specific gear pieces.</p></li><li><p><strong>No Random Groups:</strong> Our professional players ensure efficient and smooth runs, free from the pitfalls of pick-up groups.</p></li><li><p><strong>Guaranteed Loot:</strong> Eliminate the uncertainty and frustration of relying on random drops or facing competition for set items.</p></li><li><p><strong>Raid-Ready Fast:</strong> Quickly equip your character with a solid gear base suitable for Karazhan and other entry-level raid encounters.</p></li><li><p><strong>Expert Execution:</strong> Our experienced boosters are highly skilled in running Burning Crusade dungeons efficiently.</p></li></ul><p>Prepare your character effectively for the challenges of Outland with a complete Dungeon Set 3 from misti.services. Experience a smooth and secure gearing process and get ready for adventure.</p>', '<ul><li><p>Select your desired class and any additional options.</p></li><li><p>Complete your purchase securely.</p></li><li><p>Our support team will contact you within 15 minutes to confirm details and schedule the service.</p></li><li><p>A professional booster will log into your account (for piloted services) and begin farming the necessary dungeons.</p></li><li><p>You will receive regular updates on the progress until your full Dungeon Set 3 is acquired.</p></li><li><p>Once completed, you will be notified, and you can enjoy your newly geared character.</p></li></ul><p></p>', '<ul>
INSERT INTO public.products (id, name, slug, short_description, description, how_it_works, requirements, base_price, image_url, badge_text, trust_score, total_reviews, is_active, is_featured, sort_order, created_at, updated_at, category_id, is_slider_product, slider_config, is_manually_popular, total_sales, start_time_text, start_time_value, delivery_text, delivery_value, meta_description, meta_keywords, og_image, canonical_url, image_alt_text, meta_title, parent_link) VALUES ('f011818c-6aff-4fbd-9b03-33afe3546522', 'Preraid Gear', 'wow-tbc-fresh-gear-boost', 'Fast WoW TBC Fresh Gear Boost. Skip rep farming, unlock Heroic keys, and get Pre-Raid BiS/Arena gear safely and efficiently. Piloted & Selfplay options.', '<h1><strong>WoW TBC Classic Fresh Gear Boost</strong></h1><h3>Fast and Safe Gear Upgrade for Your Character</h3><p>At <strong>misti.services</strong>, you can buy the <strong>WoW TBC Classic Fresh Gear Boost</strong> to quickly equip your character with powerful PvE gear. Our professional team will help you secure the best items for your class and spec, saving you from the intense <strong>TBC reputation grind</strong>, the farming required for <strong>TBC Heroic keys</strong>, and the complex <strong>Karazhan attunement</strong> process.</p><p>Whether you’re aiming for specific <strong>Pre-Raid BiS</strong> lists, Tier 4 raid-ready sets, <strong>or basic Normal / Heroic gear</strong>, this service ensures a smooth and efficient gearing experience in <strong>Outland</strong>.</p><h3><strong>What You Get</strong></h3><ul><li><strong>Complete gear upgrade</strong> tailored for TBC PvE.</li><li><strong>TBC Dungeon Farming</strong> and Raid farming for Pre-Raid BiS and Tier sets.</li><li><strong>Reputation Grinds included</strong> where necessary for Heroic Keys and Attunements.</li><li><strong>Fast, manual boosting</strong> with absolutely no automation or bots.</li><li><strong>All loot, gold, and Primal Nethers</strong> drop remain on your account.</li></ul><h3><strong>Boost Options</strong></h3><ul><li><strong>Account Sharing (Piloted):</strong> Our professional booster securely logs in to your account to complete the lengthy <strong>TBC reputation grind</strong> and dungeon runs efficiently while you relax.</li><li><strong>Selfplay:</strong> Group up with our pro team and run the dungeons or arenas yourself with their full support and carry.</li></ul><h2><strong>Gear Options Explained</strong></h2><ul><li>Full Heroic Gear: We will collect random Heroic pieces for your class.</li><li>Full Normal Gear: We will collect random Normal pieces for your class.May include Heroic pieces aswell.</li><li>Specific Gear: You need to send us gear link, and we will inform you about price and delivery time.</li></ul><h2><strong>About WoW TBC Classic Fresh Gear Boost</strong></h2><p>The <strong>WoW TBC Classic Fresh Gear Boost</strong> is designed to help you acquire high-quality equipment without the notorious "TBC grind." On a <strong>TBC fresh server</strong>, speed is essential to stay ahead. Gear progression and <strong>TBC Attunement services</strong> are strictly linked.</p><p>Obtaining the best <strong>level 70 gear</strong> often requires weeks of repetitive <strong>TBC Dungeon farming</strong> just to unlock Heroic difficulty. With this service, professional players handle the heavy lifting for you, allowing you to <strong>boost your TBC character</strong> quickly. Our team ensures your account’s safety while providing a <strong>fast TBC gear</strong> upgrade path.</p><h2><strong>Why Choose the Gear Boost from misti.services</strong></h2><ul><li><strong>Skip the Attunement Grind:</strong> We handle the time-consuming rep farming for <strong>TBC Heroic Keys</strong> and the <strong>Karazhan attunement</strong>.</li><li><strong>Flexible Options:</strong> Packages available for <strong>Pre-Raid BiS.</strong></li><li><strong>Expert Boosters:</strong> Veterans who complete runs smoothly, allowing you to get <strong>fast TBC gear</strong>.</li><li><strong>Be Raid-Ready:</strong> Step into Karazhan, Gruul, or Magtheridon sooner.</li></ul>', '<ul><li><strong>Select Your Package:</strong> Choose between a <strong>PvE Focus</strong> (Pre-Raid BiS, Tier 4 Ready) or a <strong>PvP Focus</strong> (Full Honor Set, Arena Ready). Select your desired boost method (Selfplay or Piloted).</li><li><strong>Secure Checkout:</strong> Complete your purchase through our secure checkout process.</li><li><strong>Contact &amp; Scheduling:</strong> Our dedicated manager will contact you via your preferred method (email/chat) within minutes to confirm your character details, specialization, and scheduling preferences.</li><li><strong>Booster Assignment:</strong> For Piloted accounts, we assign a professional booster who uses a VPN matching your location for added security. For Selfplay, we coordinate the best run times for you.</li><li><strong>Execution &amp; Tracking:</strong> The booster begins the necessary runs, focusing on reputation grinding, heroic key unlocks, and targeted dungeon/raid bosses. You will receive regular progress updates.</li><li><strong>Service Completion:</strong> Once all target gear pieces are secured, we notify you immediately. For Piloted accounts, we confirm that all safety checks are complete.</li><li><strong>Enjoy Outland:</strong> Log back in to your fully geared character, ready to dominate high-level raids or the Arena.</li></ul>', '<ul><li><strong>Character Level:</strong> Your character must be level <strong>70</strong>. (We offer separate<a href="https://misti.services/game/wow-tbc-fresh/leveling" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank"> <strong>Leveling Boosts</strong></a> if you are not yet max level).</li><li><strong>Expansion Access:</strong> You must have access to <strong>The Burning Crusade Classic</strong>.</li><li>You must have Attunements done for Heroic dungeons.</li><li><strong>Access:</strong> We require sufficient gold for basic repairs/consumables during the service (minimal amount only).</li></ul>', 299, 'https://kdjlhibxxygfdmlvdfcl.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/game-images/6mgpab8qcvn.webp', NULL, 4.9, 0, true, true, 0, '2025-11-24T15:36:05.20367+00:00', '2026-02-09T18:34:10.500405+00:00', 'd2c3bb86-72be-4345-8f78-3c62edc8e30d', false, NULL, true, 2, '15 minutes', 'average start time', 'Flexible', 'order completion', 'Fast WoW TBC Fresh Gear Boost. Skip rep farming, unlock Heroic keys, and get Pre-Raid BiS/Arena gear safely and efficiently. Piloted & Selfplay options.', 'TBC gear boost, WoW TBC Classic boost, TBC Fresh boost, Pre-Raid BiS, TBC Heroic key boost, TBC attunement service, TBC reputation grind, TBC PvP gear,', NULL, NULL, 'preraid bis gear for tbc', 'WoW TBC Preraid Gear Boost - Fast | misti.services', NULL);
INSERT INTO public.products (id, name, slug, short_description, description, how_it_works, requirements, base_price, image_url, badge_text, trust_score, total_reviews, is_active, is_featured, sort_order, created_at, updated_at, category_id, is_slider_product, slider_config, is_manually_popular, total_sales, start_time_text, start_time_value, delivery_text, delivery_value, meta_description, meta_keywords, og_image, canonical_url, image_alt_text, meta_title, parent_link) VALUES ('0ab1cfd9-d330-4826-8f8f-0646f70fef25', 'Nether Rays Mounts', 'tbc-anniversary-nether-rays-mounts-carry', 'Enhance your World of Warcraft: TBC collection with five exclusive Nether Ray mounts. Our professional team handles all the reputation grinding, ensuring a stress-free acquisition of these coveted flying mounts for your account.', '<h1><strong>TBC Anniversary Nether Rays Mounts Carry</strong></h1><p>Acquire the complete set of five stunning TBC Anniversary Nether Ray flying mounts for your collection with our dedicated carry service. Our expert players will efficiently grind Sha''tari Skyguard reputation to Exalted, allowing you to bypass tedious farming and add these unique mounts to your WoW: The Burning Crusade Classic account effortlessly.</p><ul><li><p>Service Includes</p></li><li><p><strong>Five Unique Mounts:</strong> You will receive all five TBC Anniversary Nether Ray flying mounts in various colors.</p></li><li><p><a target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" href="https://www.wowhead.com/tbc/item=32319/blue-riding-nether-ray"><strong>Blue Riding Nether Ray</strong></a><strong>:</strong> Add this elegant blue mount to your repertoire.</p></li><li><p><a target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" href="https://www.wowhead.com/tbc/item=32317/red-riding-nether-ray"><strong>Red Riding Nether Ray</strong></a><strong>:</strong> Command the skies with this vibrant red mount.</p></li><li><p><a target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" href="https://www.wowhead.com/tbc/item=32314/green-riding-nether-ray"><strong>Green Riding Nether Ray</strong></a><strong>:</strong> Soar through Outland atop the striking green Nether Ray.</p></li><li><p><a target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" href="https://www.wowhead.com/tbc/item=32318/silver-riding-nether-ray"><strong>Silver Riding Nether Ray</strong></a><strong>:</strong> Flaunt the sophisticated silver variant.</p></li><li><p><a target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" href="https://www.wowhead.com/tbc/item=32316/purple-riding-nether-ray"><strong>Purple Riding Nether Ray</strong></a><strong>:</strong> Ride in style with the distinctive purple Nether Ray.</p></li><li><p><strong>Exalted Reputation:</strong> Attain Exalted standing with the Sha’tari Skyguard faction.</p></li><li><p><strong>All Loot Acquired:</strong> Any items, gold, or rewards obtained during the service completion will remain on your character.</p></li></ul><h2><strong>About TBC Anniversary Nether Rays</strong></h2><p>The TBC Anniversary Nether Rays are prestigious flying mounts introduced during special World of Warcraft events, celebrating the legacy of The Burning Crusade. Earning these mounts typically involves an extensive and repetitive reputation grind with the Sha''tari Skyguard, a task that can consume countless hours of gameplay. Our service bypasses this grind, providing a direct path to owning these iconic mounts.</p><h3>Why Choose Our Service</h3><ul><li><p><strong>Time-Saving:</strong> Eliminate the need for repetitive daily quests and mob farming that are required to reach Exalted reputation.</p></li><li><p><strong>Guaranteed Acquisition:</strong> Our experienced boosters ensure the successful and timely acquisition of all five mounts.</p></li><li><p><strong>Stress-Free Process:</strong> Enjoy the rewards without enduring the grind, allowing you to focus on other aspects of the game.</p></li><li><p><strong>Professional Team:</strong> Benefit from the expertise of seasoned WoW players dedicated to efficient service delivery.</p></li><li><p><strong>Secure &amp; Reliable:</strong> Your account security is our top priority, with all services performed professionally and discreetly.</p></li></ul><p>Choose misti.services for a seamless and efficient way to expand your mount collection with the exclusive TBC Anniversary Nether Rays. Experience the convenience and professionalism that sets us apart.</p>', '<ul><li><p><strong>Select Your Service:</strong> Choose the TBC Anniversary Nether Rays Mounts Carry and any additional options.</p></li><li><p><strong>Provide Account Details:</strong> After purchase, our support team will contact you to arrange account access for the Piloted service.</p></li><li><p><strong>Booster Assignment:</strong> A skilled professional booster will be assigned to your order.</p></li><li><p><strong>Reputation Grinding:</strong> Your booster will diligently work on raising your Sha''tari Skyguard reputation to Exalted.</p></li><li><p><strong>Mount Acquisition:</strong> Once Exalted, all five Nether Ray mounts will be purchased for your character.</p></li><li><p><strong>Service Completion:</strong> We will notify you once the service is complete, and your new mounts are ready for use.</p></li></ul><p></p>', '<ul>
INSERT INTO public.products (id, name, slug, short_description, description, how_it_works, requirements, base_price, image_url, badge_text, trust_score, total_reviews, is_active, is_featured, sort_order, created_at, updated_at, category_id, is_slider_product, slider_config, is_manually_popular, total_sales, start_time_text, start_time_value, delivery_text, delivery_value, meta_description, meta_keywords, og_image, canonical_url, image_alt_text, meta_title, parent_link) VALUES ('70a14b3a-c0e1-4382-b04d-f7a4028530ff', 'Herbalism ', 'wow-tbc-classic-herbalism-boost-1-375', 'Herbalism is the cornerstone of the TBC economy. It is widely regarded as one of the most profitable gathering professions, serving as the direct fuel for Alchemy. Whether you need Mana Thistles for raid flasks or Nightmare Seeds for tank survivability, an Herbalist is always in demand.', '<h1><strong>WoW TBC Classic Herbalism Boost (1-375)</strong></h1><p>Herbalism is the cornerstone of the TBC economy. It is widely regarded as one of the most profitable gathering professions, serving as the direct fuel for Alchemy. Whether you need <strong>Mana Thistles</strong> for raid flasks or <strong>Nightmare Seeds</strong> for tank survivability, an Herbalist is always in demand.</p><p>However, leveling Herbalism requires running in circles around maps for hours, competing with other players for spawns, and traversing dangerous zones. At <strong>Misti.services</strong>, we handle the legwork. We will pilot your character through the wilds of Azeroth and Outland, taking you from skill level 1 to 375 efficiently, so you can enjoy the profits without the grind.</p><h2><strong>Why Choose Herbalism in TBC?</strong></h2><p>Aside from being a primary gold-maker, Herbalism offers unique combat benefits and essential resources that cannot be obtained any other way.</p><ul><li><strong>Gold Generation:</strong> Herbs are consumable, meaning demand never dies. Selling stacks of <strong>Terocone</strong> or <strong>Felweed</strong> is a consistent income source.</li><li><strong>Raid Utility:</strong> You supply the materials for Potions, Elixirs, and Flasks, making you vital to any guild.</li><li><strong>Exclusive Consumables:</strong> Access to bind-on-pickup or rare items like <strong>Flame Caps</strong> (DPS boost) and <strong>Fel Blossoms</strong>.</li><li><strong>Druid Synergy:</strong> If you play a Druid, Herbalism is the ultimate choice, allowing you to gather while remaining in Flight Form.</li></ul><h2><strong>The Leveling Process: Azeroth (1 - 300)</strong></h2><p>The journey begins in the classic zones. Our boosters follow optimized routes to ensure the fastest skill gains.</p><p><strong>Apprentice &amp; Journeyman (1-150)</strong> We start in the starting zones gathering <strong>Peacebloom</strong> and <strong>Silverleaf</strong>. As your skill improves, we move to the foothills to farm <strong>Mageroyal</strong>, <strong>Briarthorn</strong>, and <strong>Bruiseweed</strong>. This stage is tedious due to the low value of herbs, but necessary for progression.</p><p><strong>Expert &amp; Artisan (150-300)</strong> Once we pass the initial hurdles, we travel to mid-level zones like Stranglethorn Vale and the Hinterlands to target <strong>Kingsblood</strong>, <strong>Fadeleaf</strong>, and <strong>Goldthorn</strong>. The final push to 300 takes us to high-level zones such as the Plaguelands, Felwood, and Winterspring. Here, we farm valuable Classic herbs including <strong>Dreamfoil</strong>, <strong>Mountain Silversage</strong>, and the elusive <strong>Black Lotus</strong>, all of which remain in your inventory.</p><h2><strong>The Leveling Process: Outland (300 - 375)</strong></h2><p>Upon reaching level 58+ and skill 300, we cross the Dark Portal. Outland Herbalism is where the real profit begins.</p><p><strong>Hellfire Peninsula &amp; Zangarmarsh (300-350)</strong> We begin by scouring Hellfire Peninsula for <strong>Felweed</strong> and <strong>Dreaming Glory</strong>. These are the most common herbs in the expansion but are required in high quantities for alchemy discoveries. Moving into Zangarmarsh, we target <strong>Ragveil</strong> and the specialized <strong>Flame Cap</strong> mushrooms. If you have dungeon keys or a stealth class, we may also farm <strong>Ancient Lichen</strong> in the Coilfang Reservoir instances.</p><p><strong>Terokkar, Netherstorm &amp; Shadowmoon (350-375)</strong> The final stretch requires visiting the most dangerous areas of Outland. We move to Terokkar Forest for <strong>Terocone</strong> and Netherstorm for <strong>Netherbloom</strong>. At the highest levels, we focus on the premier herbs of the expansion: <strong>Nightmare Vine</strong> and the highly coveted <strong>Mana Thistle</strong>, which are required for all top-tier Flasks.</p><h2><strong>High-Value Herbs You Will Acquire</strong></h2><p>During the boost, your character will gather hundreds of herbs. We do not vendor these; they are yours to keep, sell, or use.</p><ul><li><strong>Mana Thistle:</strong> The most expensive herb in TBC, used for every Flask recipe. Found only in high-level areas and reachable only by flying mount.</li><li><strong>Fel Lotus:</strong> A rare byproduct found in other herb nodes. It is a critical component for Flasks and holds massive value.</li><li><strong>Nightmare Seed:</strong> A consumable that increases health by 2000 for 30 seconds. A "must-have" for raid tanks on heavy hitting bosses.</li><li><strong>Flame Cap:</strong> A gathered item that boosts Fire spell damage and adds fire damage to melee attacks. BiS (Best in Slot) for Fire Mages and Warlocks.</li><li><strong>Ancient Lichen:</strong> Found in dungeons, used for restorative potions and defense elixirs.</li></ul><h2><strong>What Our Service Includes</strong></h2><p>When you purchase an Herbalism boost from <strong>Misti.services</strong>, you are paying for quality, security, and efficiency.</p><ul><li><strong>1-375 Leveling:</strong> Complete manual leveling of the profession.</li><li><strong>Trainer Visits:</strong> We handle all travel to trainers to unlock Apprentice, Journeyman, Expert, Artisan, and Master skill levels.</li><li><strong>Loot Retention:</strong> You keep all herbs, motes of life, and rare items gathered during the service.</li><li><strong>VPN Protection:</strong> We match your country''s IP address to ensure maximum account safety.</li></ul><p><strong>Stop picking flowers and start raiding! Select your current level above and let us handle the harvest.</strong></p>', NULL, NULL, 0, 'https://kdjlhibxxygfdmlvdfcl.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/game-images/wow-tbc-classic-herbalism-boost-1-375-1764546997907.webp', NULL, 4.9, 0, true, true, 0, '2025-11-30T23:50:20.81987+00:00', '2026-02-16T10:51:55.30012+00:00', '1dea78b7-88a7-4056-84fb-9f891ece362c', true, '{"step":1,"end_label":"End Value","max_value":375,"min_value":1,"default_end":300,"start_label":"Start Value","default_start":1,"pricing_brackets":[{"end":300,"price":51,"start":1},{"end":375,"price":68,"start":301}],"estimated_time_per_step":0.0005}', true, 0, '15 minutes', 'average start time', 'Flexible', 'order completion', 'Maximize your gold potential with our TBC Herbalism boost. We manually farm herbs from 1-375, keeping all loot for you.', 'WoW TBC Herbalism boost, buy Herbalism skill 375, TBC Classic gold farming, Mana Thistle farm, Black Lotus farming service, Fel Lotus gathering, WoW profession leveling, Nightmare Seed farm, Druid herbalism boost, Ancient Lichen farming, TBC gathering professions, Flame Cap farm, WoW Classic herbalism guide.', 'https://kdjlhibxxygfdmlvdfcl.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/game-images/wow-tbc-classic-herbalism-boost-1-375-1764546997907.webp', NULL, 'Wow Tbc Classic Herbalism Boost 1 375', 'WoW TBC Herbalism Boost | misti.services', NULL);
