s. Sourcing specific lumber like Fel-Touched from Legion or Dornic Fir from Khaz Algar can be a time-consuming endeavor. Our service is designed to eliminate this repetitive grind, providing you with a complete inventory of materials needed to fully engage with housing decoration crafting and upgrades.</p><h3>Why Choose Our Service</h3><ul><li><p><strong>Skip the Grind:</strong> Effortlessly acquire all necessary lumber without spending your valuable in-game time on repetitive gathering.</p></li><li><p><strong>Comprehensive Collection:</strong> Access lumber from all expansions, ensuring you have the exact types required for every blueprint and decor item.</p></li><li><p><strong>Efficient Methods:</strong> Our experienced gatherers employ optimized routes and techniques for maximum yield and speed.</p></li><li><p><strong>Account Safety:</strong> For Piloted services, we ensure fully manual handling for the security of your account.</p></li><li><p><strong>Guaranteed Stock:</strong> Receive a ready-to-craft stockpile, enabling immediate engagement with housing decor work orders and commissions.</p></li><li><p><strong>Dedicated Support:</strong> Enjoy regular communication and updates throughout the entire process.</p></li></ul><p>Choose misti.services for your World of Warcraft Housing Lumber Farm and transform your player housing experience with a bountiful supply of essential crafting materials, expertly gathered and delivered directly to you.</p>', '<ul><li><p>Order your WoW Housing Lumber Farm service on the misti.services website.</p></li><li><p>A skilled gatherer is promptly assigned to your order.</p></li><li><p>Your assigned professional efficiently farms the requested lumber types during optimal in-game conditions.</p></li><li><p>Receive confirmation once your WoW housing resource lumber farm is successfully completed.</p></li><li><p>Utilize your newly acquired lumber and enhance your player housing decor.</p></li></ul><p></p>', '<ul><li><p><strong>Character Level:</strong> A Level 80 character is required.</p></li><li><p><strong>Active Subscription:</strong> An active World of Warcraft subscription is necessary.</p></li><li><p><strong>Housing Access:</strong> Your character must have access to the Player Housing system.</p></li></ul><p></p>', 0.039, 'https://kdjlhibxxygfdmlvdfcl.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/game-images/wow-housing-lumber-farm-1770844501033.webp', NULL, 4.9, 0, true, true, 0, '2026-02-08T23:45:35.054534+00:00', '2026-02-11T21:20:19.737007+00:00', '6d33d7a2-0bcf-4ecb-9944-00fe3e779340', true, '{"step":200,"max_value":2000,"min_value":200,"slider_type":"single","value_label":"Amount of Lumber","default_value":200,"pricing_brackets":[{"end":2000,"price":0,"start":200}],"estimated_time_per_step":0}', true, 0, '15 minutes', 'average start time', 'Flexible', 'order completion', 'Purchase the WoW Housing Lumber Farm service to get all lumber types for crafting housing decor across all expansions. Fast, reliable, and efficient. ', 'wow housing lumber farm buy, wow lumber farm, housing lumber service, wow housing materials, wow housing decor craft, ashwood lumber, fel-touched lumber, dragonpine lumber, wow lumber farming price, wow housing boost, gaming service, fast delivery, professional, reliable, secure, boosting, carry, account, safe, trusted', 'https://kdjlhibxxygfdmlvdfcl.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/game-images/wow-housing-lumber-farm-1770844501033.webp', NULL, 'Wow Housing Lumber Farm', 'Buy WoW Housing Lumber Farm Service | misti.services', NULL);
INSERT INTO public.products (id, name, slug, short_description, description, how_it_works, requirements, base_price, image_url, badge_text, trust_score, total_reviews, is_active, is_featured, sort_order, created_at, updated_at, category_id, is_slider_product, slider_config, is_manually_popular, total_sales, start_time_text, start_time_value, delivery_text, delivery_value, meta_description, meta_keywords, og_image, canonical_url, image_alt_text, meta_title, parent_link) VALUES ('007a5f84-48af-4788-927e-ac5a0b34216f', 'Leatherworking', 'wow-tbc-classic-leatherworking-boost-drums-specialization', 'Leatherworking is an exceptionally strong and versatile profession in Burning Crusade Classic, catering primarily to Mail and Leather wearers (Druids, Hunters, Rogues, Shamans). Its main appeal is crafting powerful pre-raid gear and, more critically, providing the raid-defining consumable: Drums.', '<h1><strong>WoW TBC Classic Leatherworking Profession Boost</strong></h1><p>Leatherworking is an exceptionally strong and versatile profession in <strong>Burning Crusade Classic</strong>, catering primarily to <strong>Mail</strong> and <strong>Leather</strong> wearers (Druids, Hunters, Rogues, Shamans). Its main appeal is crafting powerful pre-raid gear and, more critically, providing the raid-defining consumable: <strong>Drums</strong>.</p><p>Leveling Leatherworking requires an enormous quantity of hides, particularly the highly demanded <strong>[Knothide Leather]</strong>. <strong>Misti.services</strong> offers a complete 1-375 Leatherworking boost, saving you massive amounts of gold and ensuring you unlock your required specialization and the essential <strong>Drums of Battle</strong> recipe immediately.</p><h2><strong>Why Leatherworking is Essential for Raiding</strong></h2><p>Leatherworking is considered a <strong>mandatory profession</strong> for many raid groups due to the powerful utility it provides, especially in Phases 1 and 2.</p><ul><li><strong>Raid Utility (Drums):</strong> The various <strong>Drums</strong> (<strong>Drums of Battle</strong>, <strong>Drums of War</strong>, etc.) provide essential party-wide buffs. Having multiple Leatherworkers in a group is crucial for maintaining maximum uptime on these buffs, making Leatherworkers a highly recruited class.</li><li><strong>Best-in-Slot (BoP) Gear:</strong> Crafted armor is excellent for the early gearing process and remains viable through multiple phases. The gear sets are designed to cater to specific classes (Rogues, Shamans, Druids, Hunters) based on their chosen specialization.</li><li><strong>Upgraded Drums (Phase 4):</strong> The introduction of <strong>Greater Drums</strong> in Phase 4 (with a 40-yard range and instant cast) solidifies Leatherworking’s position as a top-tier utility profession.</li><li><strong>Synergy with Skinning:</strong> The massive material requirements (<strong>1,400+ [Knothide Leather]</strong> needed) make pairing Leatherworking with Skinning necessary to mitigate costs. Our service handles the material acquisition for you.</li></ul><h3><strong>The Scale of the Grind: Materials Needed</strong></h3><p>Leatherworking uses a high volume of leather and hides across all 375 levels. The sheer quantity needed for TBC materials is daunting:</p><ul><li><strong>Knothide Leather:</strong> You will need approximately <strong>1,400 x [Knothide Leather]</strong> just for the TBC portion of the leveling process.</li><li><strong>Vanilla Hides:</strong> Hundreds of Light, Heavy, Thick, and Rugged Leathers are necessary to bridge the 1-300 gap.</li><li><strong>Endgame Focus:</strong> The final skill-ups rely on costly materials like <strong>[Thick Clefthoof Leather]</strong> and large stacks of <strong>[Heavy Knothide Leather]</strong> for crafting the essential Drums.</li></ul><h3><strong>Leatherworking Specializations</strong></h3><p>At skill level 200, you must choose one of three specializations, each granting access to powerful, unique armor patterns for specific roles. We will complete the complex, material-intensive specialization quest for your choice.</p><h3><strong>Unlock the Drums of Battle Recipe</strong></h3><p>The highest-priority pattern for all Leatherworkers is <strong>[Drums of Battle]</strong>.</p><ul><li><strong>Requirement:</strong> The recipe is unlocked via <strong>[Pattern: Drums of Battle]</strong>, which is purchased from <strong>Almaador</strong> in Shattrath once you achieve <strong>Honored</strong> reputation with <strong>The Sha''tar</strong> faction.</li><li><strong>Service Inclusion:</strong> We ensure your Leatherworking is leveled using this recipe in the final push (365-375), and we can assist in meeting the reputation requirement as an add-on service.</li></ul><h3><strong>Misti.services Leatherworking Boost Guarantee</strong></h3><p>Our comprehensive Leatherworking service is designed to deliver maximum raid utility with minimum personal time investment:</p><ul><li><strong>Full Skill Maxing (1-375):</strong> Guaranteed max skill achievement.</li><li><strong>Specialization Completion:</strong> We source all required items and complete the full quest chain for your choice of <strong>Dragonscale</strong>, <strong>Elemental</strong>, or <strong>Tribal</strong> Leatherworking.</li><li><strong>Material Acquisition:</strong> The massive quantity of leather and hides needed is covered entirely by our service.</li><li><strong>Drums Ready:</strong> You will finish the service with the ability to craft <strong>[Drums of Battle]</strong> and all other core TBC Drums.</li></ul><p><strong>Don''t miss out on mandatory raid utility. Secure your Leatherworking boost today!</strong></p>', '<ul><li>Select your desired options and complete your order on&nbsp;Misti.Services.</li><li>You’ll receive an order confirmation and tracking number via email.</li><li>Our support manager will contact you through live chat to confirm all details.</li><li>If you’re unavailable, we’ll reach out via email or your preferred contact method.</li><li>When the boost is finished, you’ll receive a completion notification on Discord or another messenger of your choice.</li></ul>', '<ul><li>Level 70 character</li><li>Active WoW Subscription</li></ul>', 0, 'https://kdjlhibxxygfdmlvdfcl.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/game-images/wow-tbc-classic-leatherworking-boost-drums-specialization-1764281315051.webp', NULL, 4.9, 0, true, true, 0, '2025-11-27T21:14:59.738305+00:00', '2026-02-16T10:51:57.808254+00:00', '1dea78b7-88a7-4056-84fb-9f891ece362c', true, '{"step":1,"end_label":"End Value","max_value":375,"min_value":1,"default_end":60,"start_label":"Start Value","default_start":1,"pricing_brackets":[{"end":300,"price":76.5,"start":1},{"end":375,"price":127.5,"start":301}],"estimated_time_per_step":0.0005}', true, 0, '15 minutes', 'average start time', 'Flexible', 'order completion', 'Max 1-375 Leatherworking in TBC Classic. Unlock mandatory Drums of Battle/Greater Drums and choose your specialization (Dragonscale, Elemental, Tribal).', 'WoW TBC Leatherworking boost, TBC Drums of Battle, Leatherworking leveling 1-375, Dragonscale Leatherworking, Elemental Leatherworking, Tribal Leatherworking, TBC profession boost', 'https://kdjlhibxxygfdmlvdfcl.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/game-images/wow-tbc-classic-leatherworking-boost-drums-specialization-1764281315051.webp', NULL, 'Wow Tbc Classic Leatherworking Boost Drums Specialization', 'WoW TBC Leatherworking Boost | misti.services', NULL);
INSERT INTO public.products (id, name, slug, short_description, description, how_it_works, requirements, base_price, image_url, badge_text, trust_score, total_reviews, is_active, is_featured, sort_order, created_at, updated_at, category_id, is_slider_product, slider_config, is_manually_popular, total_sales, start_time_text, start_time_value, delivery_text, delivery_value, meta_description, meta_keywords, og_image, canonical_url, image_alt_text, meta_title, parent_link) VALUES ('a69b6c45-f249-4364-a13d-c876cec10ee2', 'Cooking', 'wow-tbc-classic-cooking-boost-1-375-dailies', 'Cooking is a vital secondary profession in Burning Crusade Classic, acting as the primary source of consumable food that provides powerful, necessary buffs for competitive PvE and PvP content. From stat-boosting dishes to raid-essential soups, max-level Cooking is a non-negotiable requirement for serious players.', '<h1><strong>WoW TBC Classic Cooking Profession Boost</strong></h1><p>Cooking is a vital secondary profession in <strong>Burning Crusade Classic</strong>, acting as the primary source of consumable food that provides powerful, necessary buffs for competitive PvE and PvP content. From stat-boosting dishes to raid-essential soups, max-level Cooking is a non-negotiable requirement for serious players.</p><p>While Cooking is technically a "simple" profession, the leveling process from 1 to 375 is heavily gated by quests and scattered vendor recipes, making the material sourcing and travel time tedious. <strong>Misti.services</strong> offers a fast, complete Cooking boost, saving you countless hours of fishing and vendor runs.</p><h2><strong>Why Max-Level Cooking is Required in TBC</strong></h2><p>Cooking provides the primary source of stat buffs for all classes, making it essential for maximizing raid and arena performance.</p><ul><li><strong>Essential Raid Consumables:</strong> Cooked foods provide the single largest non-flask stat buffs (e.g., +20 Strength, +30 Spell Hit, +44 Healing).</li><li><strong>The Cooking Daily Grind:</strong> Max skill unlocks access to the daily quest from <strong>The Rokk</strong> in Shattrath. This is the only source for highly valuable and rare recipes like <strong>[Recipe: Spicy Hot Talbuk]</strong> and <strong>[Recipe: Delicious Chocolate Cake]</strong>.</li><li><strong>Gold Earning:</strong> Selling stacks of high-end raid food (like <strong>[Spicy Crawdad]</strong>) is a consistent source of gold throughout the expansion.</li><li><strong>Easiest Max Skill:</strong> Cooking is often paired with Fishing to make the leveling process manageable, but we handle the entire material acquisition process, eliminating the need to fish yourself.</li></ul><h3><strong>The Leveling Hurdles: Quests and Vendor Runs</strong></h3><p>Unlike primary professions, Cooking leveling requires completing several quests and buying specific books and recipes from vendors scattered across Azeroth and Outland.</p><h4><strong>Key Quest and Book Requirements:</strong></h4><ol><li><strong>Expert Cooking (125+):</strong> Requires purchasing the <strong>[Expert Cookbook]</strong> from a vendor who is usually located in a difficult-to-reach area.</li><li><strong>Artisan Cooking (200+):</strong> Requires completing the quest <strong>Clamlette Surprise</strong> from Dirge Quikcleave in Gadgetzan, which involves delivering <strong>[Giant Egg]</strong>, <strong>[Zesty Clam Meat]</strong>, and <strong>[Alterac Swiss]</strong>.</li><li><strong>Master Cooking (300+):</strong> Requires purchasing the <strong>[Master Cookbook]</strong> in Outland (Thrallmar, Honor Hold, or Cenarion Refuge).</li><li><strong>Final Recipes (285+):</strong> Requires completing the lengthy <strong>Desert Recipe</strong> quest chain in Silithus for the <strong>[Smoked Desert Dumplings]</strong> recipe, which is used extensively.</li></ol><p>Our service handles all necessary travel, vendor purchases, and quest completions for you.</p><h3><strong>TBC End-Game Food &amp; Key Recipes (300-375)</strong></h3><p>The final 75 points involve cooking high-level meats and fish, focusing on the most valuable stat buffs. We select the most cost-effective path, utilizing key recipes sold by vendors in Outland zones like Terokkar Forest and Nagrand.</p><h4><strong>Mid-Level (300-350) Options</strong></h4><p>We choose the cheapest options from a variety of faction-specific recipes:</p><ul><li><strong>[Ravager Dog]</strong> / <strong>[Buzzard Bites]</strong> / <strong>[Blackened Trout]</strong> (300-325)</li><li><strong>[Roasted Clefthoof]</strong> / <strong>[Talbuk Steak]</strong> / <strong>[Warp Burger]</strong> (325-350)</li></ul><h4><strong>High-Level (350-375) Final Stretch</strong></h4><p>The final push is notoriously expensive. We ensure you complete the last 25 points using the most efficient sources:</p><ul><li><strong>[Crunchy Serpent]</strong> / <strong>[Mok''Nathal Shortribs]</strong> (Vendor recipes in Blade''s Edge Mountains).</li><li><strong>[Spicy Crawdad]</strong> (The most common path, requiring rare fish).</li></ul><h3><strong>Cooking Daily Quests and Rare Recipe Farming</strong></h3><p>Maxing your Cooking skill unlocks access to the highly valuable <strong>Shattrath Cooking Dailies</strong> from <strong>The Rokk</strong>. These quests reward you with a choice between a <strong>[Crate of Meat]</strong> or a <strong>[Barrel of Fish]</strong>.</p><ul><li><strong>Reward Importance:</strong> These crates have a small chance to contain extremely rare and high-value recipes:</li><li class="ql-indent-1"><strong>[Recipe: Spicy Hot Talbuk]</strong> (Preferred, as the food is a useful raid consumable).</li><li class="ql-indent-1"><strong>[Recipe: Delicious Chocolate Cake]</strong> (High value cosmetic/utility item).</li></ul><p>Our boost ensures you are 375 and ready to begin farming these dailies immediately upon character completion.</p><h3><strong>Misti.services Cooking Boost Guarantee</strong></h3><p>Take the pain out of preparing for raiding. Our Cooking boost is secure, fast, and comprehensive:</p><ul><li><strong>Full Skill Maxing (1-375):</strong> Guaranteed max skill achievement.</li><li><strong>All Quests &amp; Vendor Runs:</strong> We handle the complex Artisian quest (<strong>Clamlette Surprise</strong>) and all book purchases (<strong>Expert</strong> and <strong>Master Cookbooks</strong>).</li><li><strong>Material Acquisition:</strong> We acquire all meat, fish, spices, and vendor reagents required for the fastest leveling path.</li><li><strong>Daily Quest Ready:</strong> Your character will be 375 and ready to start the valuable Shattrath dailies immediately.</li></ul><p><strong>Stop buying food on the Auction House and start cooking your own!</strong></p>', '<ul><li>Select your desired options and complete your order on&nbsp;Misti.Services.</li><li>You’ll receive an order confirmation and tracking number via email.</li><li>Our support manager will contact you through live chat to confirm all details.</li><li>If you’re unavailable, we’ll reach out via email or your preferred contact method.</li><li>When the boost is finished, you’ll receive a completion notification on Discord or another messenger of your choice.</li></ul>', '<ul><li>Level 70 character</li><li>Active WoW Subscription</li></ul>', 0, 'https://kdjlhibxxygfdmlvdfcl.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/game-images/wow-tbc-classic-cooking-boost-1-375-dailies-1764280916742.webp', NULL, 4.9, 0, true, true, 0, '2025-11-27T21:09:36.755199+00:00', '2026-02-16T10:51:57.983628+00:00', '1dea78b7-88a7-4056-84fb-9f891ece362c', true, '{"step":1,"end_label":"End Value","max_value":375,"min_value":1,"default_end":60,"start_label":"Start Value","default_start":1,"pricing_brackets":[{"end":300,"price":76.5,"start":1},{"end":375,"price":102,"start":301}],"estimated_time_per_step":0.0005}', true, 0, '15 minutes', 'average start time', 'Flexible', 'order completion', 'Get 1-375 Cooking fast in TBC Classic. Unlock the Shattrath Daily Quests for rare recipes like Spicy Hot Talbuk and Delicious Chocolate Cake. ', 'WoW TBC Cooking boost, TBC Cooking leveling, Shattrath Cooking Dailies, Spicy Crawdad, Spicy Hot Talbuk, TBC secondary profession boost, Cooking 1-37', 'https://kdjlhibxxygfdmlvdfcl.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/game-images/wow-tbc-classic-cooking-boost-1-375-dailies-1764280916742.webp', NULL, 'Wow Tbc Classic Cooking Boost 1 375 Dailies', 'WoW TBC Cooking Boost - Fast | misti.services', NULL);
