with the Spellfire specialization, this set presents a unique challenge for many players due to the time and effort required to unlock the specialization and gather materials. Our service streamlines this process, allowing you to bypass the grind and instantly benefit from this formidable gear.</p><h3>Why Choose Our Service</h3><ul><li><p><strong>Expert Crafters:</strong> Our team consists of seasoned WoW professionals specializing in crafting and gearing.</p></li><li><p><strong>Time-Saving:</strong> Skip the lengthy process of unlocking Spellfire Tailoring and material farming.</p></li><li><p><strong>Guaranteed Acquisition:</strong> Receive the complete Wrath of Spellfire set without any hassle or uncertainty.</p></li><li><p><strong>Enhanced Performance:</strong> Instantly boost your character''s spell power, preparing them for end-game content.</p></li><li><p><strong>Secure &amp; Efficient:</strong> All services are delivered safely and with utmost efficiency, respecting your account security.</p></li></ul><p>Let misti.services elevate your WoW: TBC Anniversary experience by providing access to top-tier gear. Purchase your Wrath of Spellfire Boost today and dominate the battlefield!</p>', '<ul><li><p><strong>Place Your Order:</strong> Select your desired options and complete the purchase.</p></li><li><p><strong>Account Coordination:</strong> Our team will contact you within 15-30 minutes to discuss scheduling and account access (for Piloted mode).</p></li><li><p><strong>Service Execution:</strong> A professional booster will log into your account and efficiently complete the crafting, leveling Tailoring and gathering all materials as needed.</p></li><li><p><strong>Completion Notification:</strong> Once the Wrath of Spellfire set is fully acquired and equipped, we will notify you immediately.</p></li><li><p><strong>Enjoy Your New Gear:</strong> Log back into your character and experience the powerful benefits of your new set!</p></li></ul><p></p>', '<ul>
INSERT INTO public.products (id, name, slug, short_description, description, how_it_works, requirements, base_price, image_url, badge_text, trust_score, total_reviews, is_active, is_featured, sort_order, created_at, updated_at, category_id, is_slider_product, slider_config, is_manually_popular, total_sales, start_time_text, start_time_value, delivery_text, delivery_value, meta_description, meta_keywords, og_image, canonical_url, image_alt_text, meta_title, parent_link) VALUES ('63c4879f-0299-4b50-86d6-96604a43ab32', 'Outland Cloth Boost', 'wow-tbc-classic-outland-cloth-boost', 'Acquire essential endgame Tailoring materials in WoW TBC Classic without tedious farming or managing cooldowns. Get Primal Mooncloth, Shadowcloth, or Spellcloth delivered directly in-game.', '<h1><strong>WoW TBC Classic Outland Cloth Boost</strong></h1><p>Streamline your TBC Classic Tailoring with our Outland Cloth Boost, ensuring you receive the critical crafting materials you need. Seamlessly obtain Primal Mooncloth, Shadowcloth, and Spellcloth without the hassle of time-gates or location-bound crafting.</p><h2><strong>Service Includes</strong></h2><ul><li><p><strong>Desired Cloth Type:</strong> Your selected quantity of either Primal Mooncloth, Shadowcloth, or Spellcloth.</p></li><li><p><strong>In-game Delivery:</strong> Secure transfer of your chosen Outland Cloth directly to your character.</p></li></ul><h2><strong>About WoW TBC Outland Cloth</strong></h2><p>Primal Mooncloth, Shadowcloth, and Spellcloth are cornerstone endgame Tailoring materials in WoW TBC Classic, crucial for crafting high-tier gear. Each cloth type requires Tailoring skill 350, specific primal components, and must be crafted at a designated location: Moonwells for Primal Mooncloth, the Altar of Shadows in Shadowmoon Valley for Shadowcloth, and Netherstorm for Spellcloth. These materials are heavily time-gated with separate 92-hour cooldowns, and Tailoring specializations can double their associated cloth output, making consistent acquisition a significant challenge. Our service bypasses these complexities, delivering the exact materials you need.</p><h3>Why Choose Our Service</h3><ul><li><p><strong>Save Time &amp; Effort:</strong> Avoid repetitive farming, tracking cooldowns, or traveling to restricted crafting zones.</p></li><li><p><strong>Guaranteed Delivery:</strong> Receive the precise type and quantity of Outland Cloth you ordered.</p></li><li><p><strong>Expert Handling:</strong> Our team manages all the complexities of acquiring these rare materials.</p></li><li><p><strong>Secure &amp; Reliable:</strong> Your order is handled by experienced professionals following secure in-game practices.</p></li></ul><p>Let misti.services handle the grind so you can focus on enjoying the crafting and endgame content. Get your WoW TBC Classic Outland Cloth Boost today and power up your Tailoring.</p>', '<ul><li><p><strong>Place Your Order:</strong> Select your desired Outland Cloth type and quantity.</p></li><li><p><strong>Secure Payment:</strong> Complete your purchase through our secure system.</p></li><li><p><strong>Fast Preparation:</strong> Our team will gather and prepare the exact cloth you''ve requested.</p></li><li><p><strong>In-game Delivery:</strong> The Outland Cloth will be sent to your character via in-game mail.</p></li><li><p><strong>Enjoy Crafting:</strong> Collect your materials and start creating your powerful gear without delay.</p></li></ul><p></p>', '<ul>
