rdination, and never share sensitive account details. (Always follow the game’s rules and policies.)</li></ul>', '<ul><li>Path of Exile 2 Account</li><li>Some items for trade</li></ul>', 0, 'https://kdjlhibxxygfdmlvdfcl.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/game-images/poe-2-exalted-orbs-1767553144583.webp', NULL, 4.9, 0, true, true, 0, '2026-01-01T22:00:17.340825+00:00', '2026-02-17T10:09:47.359894+00:00', '82b5f114-f1d2-41a5-9f5a-d02323795dfc', true, '{"step":1,"max_value":99999,"min_value":5000,"slider_type":"single","value_label":"Exalted Orbs","default_value":5000,"pricing_brackets":[{"end":99999,"price":0.00006,"start":5000}],"estimated_time_per_step":0}', true, 0, '15 minutes', 'average start time', '10 Minutes', 'order completion', 'Securely buy PoE 2 Exalted Orbs for Path of Exile 2. Instantly enhance gear with new modifiers. Fast and safe in-game delivery by misti.services.', 'poe 2 exalted orbs buy, exalted orb poe 2 price, path of exile 2 currency, poe 2 orbs service, buy poe 2 currency, poe 2 exalted boost, poe 2 currency selling, fast poe 2 currency, secure poe 2 orbs, poe 2 item crafting, poe 2 economy, poe 2 trading, get poe 2 exalted, poe 2 currency farming skip, misti.services poe 2, poe 2 currency exchange, poe 2 rare items, poe 2 crafting orbs, poe 2 instant delivery, poe 2 currency seller, poe 2 game items, poe 2 orb purchase, poe 2 market, poe 2 affixes', 'https://kdjlhibxxygfdmlvdfcl.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/game-images/poe-2-exalted-orbs-1767553144583.webp', NULL, 'Poe 2 Exalted Orbs', 'Buy PoE 2 Exalted Orbs | Fast Delivery | misti.services', NULL);
