pletion notification on Discord or another messenger of your choice.</li></ul>', '<ul><li><p>Level 60 character</p></li><li><p>Active World of Warcraft subscription</p></li><li><p>Non-hardcore mode only</p></li></ul><p>Need help reaching level 60? Try our&nbsp;<a target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" href="https://misti.services/game/wow-classic-20th-anniversary/leveling/power-leveling">W</a><a target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" href="https://misti.services/game/wow-classic-era/leveling">oW Power Leveling Boost&nbsp;</a></p>', 0, 'https://kdjlhibxxygfdmlvdfcl.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/game-images/hydraxian-waterlords-reputation-1763329277930.webp', NULL, 4.9, 350, true, true, 0, '2025-10-27T01:02:37.295369+00:00', '2026-02-11T21:58:53.026282+00:00', '171d961b-f413-4d56-b885-d3acd3a18722', false, NULL, true, 0, '15 minutes', 'average start time', 'Flexible', 'order completion', 'Buy WoW Classic Fresh Hydraxian Waterlords Reputation Boost at misti.services to reach Exalted fast and unlock fire resistance rewards safely.', 'wow classic hydraxian waterlords exalted, buy hydraxian waterlords reputation boost, wow classic fresh waterlords rep, hydraxian waterlords fire resistance rewards, fast hydraxian waterlords rep, safe hydraxian waterlords boost, wow classic hydraxian waterlords service, exalted hydraxian waterlords wow classic, hydraxian waterlords rep farm, wow classic hydraxian waterlords vendor, misti.services hydraxian waterlords, wow classic fire resistance gear, hydraxian waterlords reputation guide, cheap hydraxian waterlords boost', 'https://kdjlhibxxygfdmlvdfcl.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/game-images/hydraxian-waterlords-reputation-1763329277930.webp', NULL, 'Hydraxian Waterlords Reputation', 'Hydraxian Waterlords Rep Boost | misti.services', NULL);
