o secure all necessary currency and items.</p></li><li><p><strong>Additional Rewards:</strong> Any other valuable items or currencies obtained during the service will be kept on your character.</p></li></ul><h2><strong>About WoW TBC Classic PvP Gearing</strong></h2><p>Achieving optimal PvP gear in World of Warcraft: The Burning Crusade Classic requires significant dedication, often involving countless hours of grinding for marks of honor and arena points. The Anniversary event provides a renewed opportunity to gear up, but the time investment remains substantial. Our boost streamlines this process, allowing you to enjoy the competitive aspects of TBC PvP without the repetitive farm.</p><h3>Why Choose Our Service</h3><ul><li><p><strong>Time-Saving:</strong> Bypass the time-consuming grind for honor and arena points, letting you focus on gameplay you enjoy.</p></li><li><p><strong>Top-Tier Gear:</strong> Guarantee your character receives BiS (Best-in-Slot) PvP gear for your chosen class and specialization.</p></li><li><p><strong>Expert Players:</strong> Our professional boosters are skilled and efficient, ensuring speedy and effective completion of your order.</p></li><li><p><strong>Secure &amp; Manual Process:</strong> All services are performed manually, utilizing secure methods like VPN protection to match your region.</p></li><li><p><strong>Dominant Performance:</strong> Equip your character to excel in both battlegrounds and arena combat immediately.</p></li></ul><p>With misti.services, gearing up for PvP in WoW TBC Classic has never been easier. Focus on the thrill of combat, and let our experts handle the preparation, ensuring you receive a premium, reliable service every time.</p>', '<ul><li><p><strong>Service Selection:</strong> Choose your desired gear options and any additional preferences.</p></li><li><p><strong>Account Coordination:</strong> After purchase, we will contact you to arrange account access securely.</p></li><li><p><strong>Expert Gearing:</strong> Our professional booster begins farming the required PvP gear, focusing on efficiency and security.</p></li><li><p><strong>Progress Updates:</strong> Track your order''s status through your personal dashboard and communicate with our support team.</p></li><li><p><strong>Dominate PvP:</strong> Once complete, log in to your fully geared character and enjoy the competitive scene.</p></li></ul><p></p>', '<ul><li><p><strong>Active World of Warcraft Account:</strong> An active subscription is necessary to access the game.</p></li><li><p><strong>Level 70 Character:</strong> Your character must be level 70 in WoW TBC Classic.</p></li><li><p><strong>PvP Honor Set (Optional):</strong> If you select Arena gear options, having the PvP Honor set is beneficial for a smoother process.</p></li></ul><p></p>', 1.39, 'https://kdjlhibxxygfdmlvdfcl.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/game-images/wow-tbc-classic-anniversary-pvp-full-gear-boost-1770844756788.webp', NULL, 4.9, 0, true, true, 0, '2026-02-09T18:54:13.176617+00:00', '2026-02-16T15:42:14.759843+00:00', 'd3e97c55-a89f-439d-aa5a-00f87f713e07', false, NULL, true, 0, '15 minutes', 'average start time', 'Flexible', 'order completion', 'Purchase the WoW TBC Classic Anniversary PvP Full Gear Boost. Get BiS PvP gear including full Honor and Arena sets, weapons, and off-sets. Dominate TBC PvP.', 'WoW TBC PvP Full Gear Boost, TBC Classic PvP Gear Buy, TBC PvP Honor Gear, TBC PvP Arena Gear, WoW TBC Gearing Service, TBC BiS PvP Gear, WoW Classic Anniversary PvP, TBC PvP Boost Price, PvE to PvP Gearing TBC, WoW TBC full gear farming, gaming service, fast delivery, professional, reliable, secure, boosting, carry, account, safe, trusted', 'https://kdjlhibxxygfdmlvdfcl.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/game-images/wow-tbc-classic-anniversary-pvp-full-gear-boost-1770844756788.webp', NULL, 'Wow Tbc Classic Anniversary Pvp Full Gear Boost', 'WoW TBC Classic Anniversary PvP Full Gear | misti.services', NULL);
