es, and coveted cosmetic collections. Earning it typically involves dedicatd grinding activities, which can be time-consuming for many players. Our service provides a convenient solution to bypass this grind and jump straight to enjoying your hard-earned rewards.</p><h3>Why Choose Our Service</h3><ul><li><p><strong>Efficient Farming:</strong> Our seasoned players utilize optimal strategies to farm Voidlight Marl quickly and effectively.</p></li><li><p><strong>Time-Saving:</strong> Skip the repetitive grind and dedicate your playtime to more enjoyable aspects of WoW.</p></li><li><p><strong>Secure and Reliable:</strong> We prioritize account safety and use secure methods for all our services.</p></li><li><p><strong>Access Exclusive Content:</strong> Obtain the necessary currency to unlock rare items and enhance your character''s progression.</p></li><li><p><strong>Flexible Options:</strong> Choose the amount of Voidlight Marl you need to suit your specific goals.</p></li></ul><p>Let misti.services handle the grind while you savor the true adventure of World of Warcraft. Experience seamless service and unlock the rewards you deserve today.</p>', '<ul><li><p><strong>Select Your Quantity:</strong> Choose the desired amount of Voidlight Marl using our convenient slider.</p></li><li><p><strong>Choose Completion Method:</strong> Select either Piloted (our team plays on your account) or Self-Play Remote (you play on your PC with our team''s assistance via secure software).</p></li><li><p><strong>Provide Details:</strong> After purchase, our team will contact you to confirm details and arrange service commencement.</p></li><li><p><strong>Service Begins:</strong> Our professional players will start farming your Voidlight Marl safely and efficiently.</p></li><li><p><strong>Enjoy Your Rewards:</strong> Once the service is complete, you''ll have the Voidlight Marl ready to spend on your chosen items.</p></li></ul><p></p>', '<ul><li><strong>Active World of Warcraft Account:</strong> You must have a current, active WoW subscription.</li><li><strong>Level 90 Character:</strong> Your character needs to be at least level 90 to participate in the relevant farming activities.</li></ul>', 0.008, 'https://kdjlhibxxygfdmlvdfcl.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/game-images/wow-voidlight-marl-farm-1770159202779.webp', NULL, 4.9, 0, true, true, 0, '2026-01-30T20:16:05.589063+00:00', '2026-02-03T23:05:22.871793+00:00', 'e485ce45-0002-4703-b770-7329e3621434', true, '{"step":500,"max_value":50000,"min_value":500,"slider_type":"single","value_label":"Voidlight Marl Amount","default_value":500,"pricing_brackets":[{"end":50000,"price":0,"start":1}],"estimated_time_per_step":0.02}', true, 0, '15 minutes', 'average start time', 'Flexible', 'order completion', 'Our WoW Voidlight Marl farm service helps you quickly acquire any amount of this essential resource. Unlock cosmetics, upgrades, and more without the grind.', 'wow voidlight marl farm buy, voidlight marl farming wow, wow voidlight marl service, buy wow currency, wow marl farm boost, voidlight marl price, wow fast currency, wow gold farm, wow endgame resources, wow cosmetic farm, blizzard wow marl, buy voidlight marl cheap, wow marl farming boost, power leveling wow, wow boost service, misti services wow, buy wow voidlight marl, marl farming, wow resources for sale, world of warcraft marl', 'https://kdjlhibxxygfdmlvdfcl.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/game-images/wow-voidlight-marl-farm-1770159202779.webp', NULL, 'Wow Voidlight Marl Farm', 'Buy WoW Voidlight Marl Farm Service | misti.services', NULL);
INSERT INTO public.products (id, name, slug, short_description, description, how_it_works, requirements, base_price, image_url, badge_text, trust_score, total_reviews, is_active, is_featured, sort_order, created_at, updated_at, category_id, is_slider_product, slider_config, is_manually_popular, total_sales, start_time_text, start_time_value, delivery_text, delivery_value, meta_description, meta_keywords, og_image, canonical_url, image_alt_text, meta_title, parent_link) VALUES ('893023a5-220d-4c92-8145-aef2d8cde98d', 'Mining', 'wow-tbc-classic-mining-boost-1-375', 'Mining is the backbone of the industrial professions in The Burning Crusade Classic. It fuels Blacksmithing, Engineering, and Jewelcrafting, making it essential for crafting the expansion''s strongest weapons, goggles, and gems. However, leveling Mining is a test of patience, requiring you to run thousands of laps around mountainous zones, competing for nodes, and fighting off cave mobs.', '<h1><strong>WoW TBC Classic Mining Boost</strong></h1><p>Mining is the backbone of the industrial professions in <em>The Burning Crusade Classic</em>. It fuels Blacksmithing, Engineering, and Jewelcrafting, making it essential for crafting the expansion''s strongest weapons, goggles, and gems. However, leveling Mining is a test of patience, requiring you to run thousands of laps around mountainous zones, competing for nodes, and fighting off cave mobs.</p><p>At <strong>Misti.services</strong>, we take the pickaxe off your hands. We will manually pilot your character, striking the earth from Elwynn Forest to the Netherstorm, ensuring you reach skill level 375 without spending weeks staring at your minimap.</p><h2><strong>Why Choose Mining in TBC?</strong></h2><p>Mining is a dual-threat profession: it provides massive raw gold potential and supports the best crafting professions in the game.</p><ul><li><strong>Essential for Crafters:</strong> You supply the raw bars for Blacksmithing weapons (like Dragonmaw) and Engineering utility items.</li><li><strong>Jewelcrafting Synergy:</strong> Miners are the only source of raw ore, which Jewelcrafters need to "Prospect" into valuable gems.</li><li><strong>Passive Stats:</strong> Mining provides the raw materials, but also grants access to Smelting, which allows you to process raw ore into bars for the Auction House.</li><li><strong>Sunwell Ready:</strong> With Phase 5, Miners can learn to <strong>Smelt Hardened Khorium</strong> (from Sunwell trash drops), a material required for endgame BiS gear.</li></ul><h2><strong>The Leveling Process: Azeroth (1 - 300)</strong></h2><p>The journey starts with a Mining Pick and a lot of travel. We optimize the route to ensure maximum efficiency.</p><p><strong>Apprentice &amp; Journeyman (1-150)</strong> We begin in the low-level zones farming <strong>Copper</strong> and <strong>Tin</strong>. We smelt these into Bronze to help speed up skill gains. As we progress, we move to the foothills to target <strong>Silver</strong> and <strong>Iron</strong> deposits.</p><p><strong>Expert &amp; Artisan (150-300)</strong> The mid-game grind takes us to zones like Arathi Highlands and Tanaris. Here, we focus on <strong>Mithril</strong> and <strong>Truesilver</strong>, battling through cave systems to find hidden nodes. The final push to 300 is the most lucrative in Azeroth. We farm Un''Goro Crater and Silithus for <strong>Thorium</strong> and <strong>Rich Thorium Veins</strong>. These nodes are famous for dropping <strong>Arcane Crystals</strong>, which you keep!</p><h2><strong>The Leveling Process: Outland (300 - 375)</strong></h2><p>Once we cross the Dark Portal, the ore becomes more volatile and valuable.</p><p><strong>Hellfire Peninsula &amp; Zangarmarsh (300-350)</strong> We start by farming <strong>Fel Iron</strong>, the foundational ore of TBC. It is found along the jagged cliffs of Hellfire. We also collect <strong>Motes of Earth</strong> and <strong>Fire</strong> during this process. Moving into Zangarmarsh, we introduce <strong>Adamantite</strong> into the rotation. We optimize our pathing to hit skill 350 quickly, allowing us to mine the rich versions of these nodes.</p><p><strong>Nagrand &amp; Netherstorm (350-375)</strong> The final stretch takes us to the floating islands of Nagrand and the mana-forges of Netherstorm. Here, we hunt for <strong>Rich Adamantite Deposits</strong> and the incredibly rare <strong>Khorium Veins</strong>. Reaching 375 ensures you can mine any node in the game without failure and unlocks the ability to smelt the highest tier bars.</p><h2><strong>High-Value Loot You Will Acquire</strong></h2><p>We do not empty your bags. Everything we mine is yours to keep, sell, or craft with.</p><ul><li><strong>Khorium Ore:</strong> The rarest spawn in Outland. Essential for high-end crafting.</li><li><strong>Arcane Crystals:</strong> Found in Thorium veins, these still hold high value for transmutes.</li><li><strong>Raw Gems:</strong> Prospectable ores and loose gems like <strong>Deep Peridot</strong>, <strong>Flame Spessarite</strong>, and <strong>Golden Draenite</strong> found inside mining nodes.</li><li><strong>Primal Motes:</strong> Mining in Outland yields Motes of Earth and Fire, which can be combined into Primal Earth/Fire for big profits.</li><li><strong>Dense Stone &amp; Solid Stone:</strong> Essential materials for Engineering explosives and devices.</li></ul><h2><strong>What Our Service Includes</strong></h2><p>When you order a Mining boost from <strong>Misti.services</strong>, you get a secure, professional service designed for gamers.</p><ul><li><strong>1-375 Leveling:</strong> We handle the travel, the training, and the farming.</li><li><strong>Smelting Included:</strong> We utilize smelting to bridge skill gaps and organize your bank with stackable bars.</li><li><strong>Loot Retention:</strong> All Ore, Stone, Gems, and Motes gathered remain on your character.</li><li><strong>VPN Security:</strong> We use a VPN matching your country to ensure your account remains safe and flagged as a "local login."</li></ul><p><strong>Ready to strike gold (and Khorium)? Select your current skill level above, and let us dig up the profits for you.</strong></p>', '<ul><li>Select your desired options and complete your order on&nbsp;Misti.Services.</li><li>You’ll receive an order confirmation and tracking number via email.</li><li>Our support manager will contact you through live chat to confirm all details.</li><li>If you’re unavailable, we’ll reach out via email or your preferred contact method.</li><li>When the boost is finished, you’ll receive a completion notification on Discord or another messenger of your choice.</li></ul>', '<ul><li>Level 70 character</li><li>Active WoW Subscription</li></ul>', 0, 'https://kdjlhibxxygfdmlvdfcl.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/game-images/wow-tbc-classic-mining-boost-1-375-1764586160643.webp', NULL, 4.9, 0, true, false, 0, '2025-12-01T10:15:39.916411+00:00', '2026-02-16T10:51:54.933149+00:00', '1dea78b7-88a7-4056-84fb-9f891ece362c', true, '{"step":1,"end_label":"End Value","max_value":375,"min_value":1,"default_end":300,"start_label":"Start Value","default_start":1,"pricing_brackets":[{"end":300,"price":51,"start":1},{"end":375,"price":68,"start":301}],"estimated_time_per_step":0.005}', false, 2, '15 minutes', 'average start time', 'Flexible', 'order completion', 'Skip the endless laps around mountains! We level your Mining from 1-375 manually. Keep all the Ore, Stone, and Gems. Fast, secure TBC Mining powerleveling.', 'WoW TBC Mining boost, buy Mining skill 375, TBC Classic ore farming, Khorium Ore farm, Adamantite deposit, Rich Thorium Vein, Smelt Hardened Khorium, Engineering materials, Blacksmithing mats, WoW profession powerleveling, Fel Iron Ore farm, Arcane Crystal farming, TBC gold making', 'https://kdjlhibxxygfdmlvdfcl.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/game-images/wow-tbc-classic-mining-boost-1-375-1764586160643.webp', NULL, 'Wow Tbc Classic Mining Boost 1 375', 'WoW TBC Mining Boost - Fast & Easy | misti.services', NULL);
