 direct path to experiencing this exciting content without the prerequisite quests, letting you immediately explore the new possibilities this race-class offers.</p><h3>Why Choose Our Service</h3><ul><li><p><strong>Time-Saving:</strong> Bypass repetitive questing and instantly dive into playing your new Void Elf Demon Hunter.</p></li><li><p><strong>New Content Access:</strong> Be among the first to experience the Devourer spec and unique Void-themed aesthetics.</p></li><li><p><strong>Efficient Process:</strong> Our experienced professionals ensure a swift and smooth unlock procedure.</p></li><li><p><strong>Privacy and Security:</strong> We prioritize the safety of your account with secure service delivery methods.</p></li></ul><p>Choose misti.services to unlock your Midnight Void Elf Demon Hunter quickly and securely, and begin your adventure with this powerful new combination today.</p>', '<ul><li><p><strong>Select Your Mode:</strong> Choose between Piloted (we play on your account) or Remote (we play on your PC remotely while you watch).</p></li><li><p><strong>Provide Details:</strong> For Piloted mode, you will securely share your account login information. For Remote, we will arrange a time to connect to your PC.</p></li><li><p><strong>Service Commencement:</strong> A professional booster will begin completing the necessary questlines, typically within 15 minutes of order confirmation.</p></li><li><p><strong>Completion Notification:</strong> Once the Void Elf Demon Hunter creation is unlocked on your account, you will be notified, and the service will be complete.</p></li><li><p><strong>Enjoy Your New Character:</strong> Log in and create your brand new Void Elf Demon Hunter.</p></li></ul><p></p>', '<ul>
INSERT INTO public.products (id, name, slug, short_description, description, how_it_works, requirements, base_price, image_url, badge_text, trust_score, total_reviews, is_active, is_featured, sort_order, created_at, updated_at, category_id, is_slider_product, slider_config, is_manually_popular, total_sales, start_time_text, start_time_value, delivery_text, delivery_value, meta_description, meta_keywords, og_image, canonical_url, image_alt_text, meta_title, parent_link) VALUES ('c91a2fe3-65dc-4d2d-9fea-31f0db78b197', 'Heroic Dreamrift', 'midnight-heroic-dreamrift-boost', 'Conquer the challenging Heroic Dreamrift raid in Midnight and defeat Chimaerus, the Undreamt God, to secure valuable gear and the prestigious Ahead of the Curve Feat of Strength with misti.services.', '<h1><strong>Midnight Heroic Dreamrift Boost</strong></h1><p>Achieve victory in the Heroic Dreamrift raid in Midnight with our professional boost service. Defeat Chimaerus, the Undreamt God, to claim powerful seasonal gear, including coveted trinkets and Tier Set chest pieces. Secure the prestigious Ahead of the Curve Feat of Strength without the typical raid preparation hassle.</p><h2><strong>Service Includes</strong></h2><ul><li><p><strong>Heroic Chimaerus Defeat:</strong> Successful takedown of the Undreamt God on Heroic difficulty.</p></li><li><p><strong>Gear Opportunities:</strong> Chance to acquire Heroic difficulty raid gear, including the Gaze of the Alnseer Trinket and Tier Set chest items.</p></li><li><p><a target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" href="https://www.wowhead.com/beta/achievement=61491/ahead-of-the-curve-chimaerus-the-undreamt-god"><strong>Feat of Strength</strong></a><strong>:</strong> Attainment of the exclusive Ahead of the Curve: Chimaerus achievement.</p></li><li><p><strong>Great Vault Selection:</strong> Eligibility for Great Vault rewards upon full weekly completion.</p></li></ul><h2><strong>About Midnight Dreamrift Heroic</strong></h2><p>The Dreamrift is a unique single-boss raid encounter in Midnight, featuring Chimaerus, the Undreamt God. While concise, its Heroic difficulty presents a significant challenge, offering some of the season''s most sought-after workhorse gear. Overcoming this encounter on Heroic mode is a clear indicator of skill and dedication, rewarding players with powerful upgrades and a distinguished Feat of Strength.</p><h3>Why Choose Our Service</h3><ul><li><p><strong>Effortless Completion:</strong> Skip the extensive guild organization, gearing, and repeated attempts typically required for Heroic progression.</p></li><li><p><strong>Guaranteed Success:</strong> Join a team of experienced professional raiders who ensure a swift and successful completion of the encounter.</p></li><li><p><strong>Valuable Rewards:</strong> Directly obtain high-end Heroic gear and solidify your in-game achievements with the Ahead of the Curve Feat of Strength.</p></li><li><p><strong>Flexible Scheduling:</strong> We coordinate your raid run at a time that best suits your personal schedule for maximum convenience.</p></li></ul><p>Let misti.services handle the complexities of Heroic raiding so you can enjoy the rewards. Purchase your Midnight Heroic Dreamrift boost today and elevate your gameplay experience.</p>', '<ul><li><p><strong>Select Your Options:</strong> Choose your region (EU/US) and preferred boost mode (Self-Play or Piloted).</p></li><li><p><strong>Schedule Your Run:</strong> Our team will contact you to arrange a convenient time slot for your raid completion.</p></li><li><p><strong>Join the Raid:</strong> For Self-Play, you''ll be invited to join our professional raiding group. For Piloted, our expert player will log into your account.</p></li><li><p><strong>Defeat Chimaerus:</strong> Our skilled team will guide you through or complete the Heroic Chimaerus encounter.</p></li><li><p><strong>Claim Rewards:</strong> Once Chimaerus is defeated, you''ll receive your loot and the Ahead of the Curve Feat of Strength.</p></li><li><p><strong>Service Complete:</strong> Enjoy your newly acquired gear and achievement!</p></li></ul><p></p>', '<ul>
