ssional booster, expertly familiar with all housing mechanics, will be assigned to your order.</p></li><li><p>The booster will efficiently complete the housing unlock questline and secure your chosen plot.</p></li><li><p>You will receive regular updates on the progress, and notification once your housing access is fully unlocked.</p></li><li><p>Log in and enjoy your newly acquired personal estate and all its features!</p></li></ul><p></p>', '<ul><li><p><strong>Character Level:</strong> A Level 80 character in World of Warcraft.</p></li><li><p><strong>Game Subscription:</strong> An active World of Warcraft subscription is required..</p></li><li><p><strong>Account Access (Piloted):</strong> For Piloted mode, temporary account access details will be needed.</p></li></ul><p></p>', 5.99, 'https://kdjlhibxxygfdmlvdfcl.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/game-images/96zlg2v77yk.webp', NULL, 4.9, 0, true, true, 0, '2026-01-22T23:43:42.288139+00:00', '2026-02-09T18:05:50.650388+00:00', '6d33d7a2-0bcf-4ecb-9944-00fe3e779340', false, NULL, true, 0, '15 minutes', 'average start time', '2 Hours', 'order completion', 'Unlock your personal estate in WoW The War Within quickly and safely. Our service completes the housing questline and secures your plot today.', 'wow housing unlock buy, wow housing unlock price, war within housing service, wow housing boost, wow housing service, misti services wow housing, buy wow housing, war within player housing, wow player housing unlock, war within housing boost price, wow housing fast unlock, gaming service, fast delivery, professional, reliable, secure, boosting, carry, account, safe', 'https://kdjlhibxxygfdmlvdfcl.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/game-images/wow-the-war-within-housing-unlock-1769623405579.webp', NULL, 'Wow The War Within Housing Unlock', 'WoW The War Within Housing Unlock | misti.services', NULL);
INSERT INTO public.products (id, name, slug, short_description, description, how_it_works, requirements, base_price, image_url, badge_text, trust_score, total_reviews, is_active, is_featured, sort_order, created_at, updated_at, category_id, is_slider_product, slider_config, is_manually_popular, total_sales, start_time_text, start_time_value, delivery_text, delivery_value, meta_description, meta_keywords, og_image, canonical_url, image_alt_text, meta_title, parent_link) VALUES ('8af46009-2884-407d-8943-17ae1e2ea2e3', 'The Violet Eye', 'the-violet-eye', 'The Violet Eye is a faction tied exclusively to the Karazhan 10-player raid instance. This reputation is highly sought after because it offers unique, progressively upgraded rings that are best-in-slot for many players, alongside crucial profession patterns.', '<h1><strong>The Violet Eye Reputation Farm Boost – WoW TBC Classic</strong></h1><p>Looking to acquire the powerful <strong>Violet Signet</strong> rings and unlock essential Blacksmithing and Jewelcrafting patterns without the endless weekly grind inside Karazhan? Misti.Services offers a fast, secure, and professional <a href="https://www.icy-veins.com/tbc-classic/the-violet-eye-reputation-and-rewards-guide" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank"><strong>The Violet Eye</strong></a><strong> Reputation Farm Boost</strong>, helping you reach Exalted quickly.</p><p>Our expert raid teams efficiently clear the entire <strong>Karazhan</strong> instance and handle the complex attunement to deliver guaranteed reputation gains from Neutral to Exalted.</p><h2><strong>Overview</strong></h2><p><strong>The Violet Eye</strong> is a faction tied exclusively to the <strong>Karazhan</strong> 10-player raid instance. This reputation is highly sought after because it offers unique, progressively upgraded rings that are best-in-slot for many players, alongside crucial profession patterns.</p><p>Earning <strong>Exalted</strong> status with The Violet Eye provides access to:</p><ul><li><strong>Best-in-Slot Rings:</strong> A choice of four progressively upgraded rings for every role: DPS (Physical/Caster), Tank, and Healer. The final version is an exceptional epic item.</li><li><strong>Master''s Key:</strong> Completion of the attunement questline grants <strong>The Master''s Key</strong>, allowing full access to Karazhan.</li><li><strong>Profession Patterns:</strong> Unique patterns for <strong>Blacksmithing</strong>, <strong>Jewelcrafting</strong>, <strong>Enchanting</strong>, <strong>Leatherworking</strong>, and <strong>Alchemy</strong>.</li><li><strong>Unique Ammunition:</strong> Access to some of the most powerful ammunition in the game for Bows and Guns.</li></ul><h2><strong>Gaining Reputation</strong></h2><p>Reputation with The Violet Eye is gained in two ways: completing the initial attunement quest chain and consistently clearing the Karazhan raid instance.</p><h3><strong>1. Karazhan Attunement</strong></h3><p>Our service starts by completing the lengthy and crucial attunement quest chain:</p><ul><li><strong>The Master''s Key:</strong> The chain begins with <em>Arcane Disturbances</em> from <strong>Archmage Alturus</strong> and culminates in the acquisition of <strong>The Master''s Key</strong>, which allows entry into the raid.</li><li><strong>Initial Reputation:</strong> Completing this entire quest chain grants exactly <strong>10,270 reputation</strong> with The Violet Eye.</li></ul><h3><strong>2. Raid Farming (Neutral to Exalted)</strong></h3><p>After attunement, all remaining reputation is gained by killing mobs inside the Karazhan raid instance.</p><ul><li><strong>Farming Strategy:</strong> Our professional raid teams secure a full clear each week, focusing on efficiently clearing bosses and trash mobs to maximize the reputation gained per lockout cycle until Exalted is reached.</li></ul><h2><strong>Reputation Rewards</strong></h2><p>Rewards are obtained from <strong>Archmage Leryda</strong> and <strong>Apprentice Darius</strong> outside Karazhan, and <strong>Koren</strong> inside the raid.</p><h3><strong>Highest Tier Violet Signet Rings (Exalted)</strong></h3><p>The most sought-after rewards are the final, epic rings, providing a crucial item slot upgrade:</p><ul><li><strong>Violet Signet of the Master Assassin</strong> (Physical DPS)</li><li><strong>Violet Signet of the Archmage</strong> (Caster DPS)</li><li><strong>Violet Signet of the Great Protector</strong> (Tank)</li><li><strong>Violet Signet of the Grand Restorer</strong> (Healer)</li></ul><h3><strong>Other Key Rewards</strong></h3><ul><li><strong>Koren (Blacksmith):</strong> Offers repairs and unique Blacksmithing patterns (Honored+).</li><li><strong>Apprentice Darius:</strong> Sells Jewelcrafting, Enchanting, Leatherworking, Alchemy patterns, and powerful ammunition.</li></ul><h2><strong>Why Choose Our The Violet Eye Boost</strong></h2><p>Farming The Violet Eye requires weekly commitment to raiding a 10-player instance, often with groups focused only on specific bosses, not trash rep. Misti.Services offers the most straightforward solution:</p><ul><li><strong>Attunement Handled:</strong> We deal with the long, tedious <strong>Master''s Key</strong> quest chain for you.</li><li><strong>Guaranteed Clears:</strong> We ensure full, efficient clears of Karazhan every week, maximizing reputation from all bosses and trash.</li><li><strong>Best-in-Slot Ring Guarantee:</strong> Secure the highest tier, epic <strong>Violet Signet</strong> ring for your chosen specialization.</li></ul><h3><strong>Service Includes</strong></h3><ul><li>Full The Violet Eye reputation farm from your current standing up to <strong>Exalted</strong>.</li><li>Completion of the <strong>Master''s Key Attunement</strong> quest chain.</li><li>Weekly full clear runs of the <strong>Karazhan</strong> raid instance until Exalted status is achieved.</li><li>Guaranteed access to the highest tier <strong>Violet Signet</strong> ring of your choice.</li></ul><p><strong>Secure your epic ring and raid access! Order your Violet Eye Reputation Boost today.</strong></p>', '<ul><li>Select your desired options and complete your order on&nbsp;Misti.Services.</li><li>You’ll receive an order confirmation and tracking number via email.</li><li>Our support manager will contact you through live chat to confirm all details.</li><li>If you’re unavailable, we’ll reach out via email or your preferred contact method.</li><li>When the boost is finished, you’ll receive a completion notification on Discord or another messenger of your choice.</li></ul>', '<ul><li>Level 70 character</li><li>Active WoW Subscription</li></ul><p><br></p>', 0, 'https://kdjlhibxxygfdmlvdfcl.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/game-images/the-violet-eye-1763847350291.webp', NULL, 4.9, 0, true, true, 0, '2025-11-20T12:21:48.623639+00:00', '2026-02-16T10:52:52.342759+00:00', '9464d1fe-6c00-412a-8ebb-896a4f575b4e', false, NULL, true, 0, '15 minutes', 'average start time', 'Flexible', 'order completion', 'Buy The Violet Eye Exalted boost! Unlock the epic Violet Signet rings, The Master''s Key attunement, and unique Blacksmithing/JC patterns via Karazhan clears.', 'The Violet Eye reputation boost, Karazhan farm, Violet Signet rings, The Master''s Key attunement, Archmage Leryda, Koren blacksmith, Violet Eye Exalted, TBC raid rep carry, Karazhan quest chain, Violet Signet of the Master Assassin', 'https://kdjlhibxxygfdmlvdfcl.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/game-images/the-violet-eye-1763847350291.webp', NULL, 'The Violet Eye', 'WoW TBC Violet Eye Rep Boost | misti.services', NULL);
INSERT INTO public.products (id, name, slug, short_description, description, how_it_works, requirements, base_price, image_url, badge_text, trust_score, total_reviews, is_active, is_featured, sort_order, created_at, updated_at, category_id, is_slider_product, slider_config, is_manually_popular, total_sales, start_time_text, start_time_value, delivery_text, delivery_value, meta_description, meta_keywords, og_image, canonical_url, image_alt_text, meta_title, parent_link) VALUES ('d6ced534-2d2c-41ea-8eb8-a39a87d60e1e', 'Ashes of Belo''ren', 'ashes-of-beloren-mount-boost-midnight', 'Secure the Ashes of Belo''ren mount from Mythic Midnight Falls in World of Warcraft: Midnight. Get a guaranteed drop with professional raid assistance via self-play or pilot service.', '<h1><strong>Ashes of Belo''ren Mount Boost</strong></h1><p>Acquire the prestigious Ashes of Belo''ren mount from World of Warcraft: Midnight through our Mythic Midnight Falls boost service. This exclusive mount is a guaranteed reward for defeating L''ura in the March on Quel''Danas raid, ensuring you add a rare collectible to your collection efficiently.</p><h2><strong>Service Includes</strong></h2><ul><li><p><strong>Guaranteed Mount:</strong> Obtain the <a target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" href="https://www.wowhead.com/beta/item=246590/ashes-of-beloren">Ashes of Belo''ren</a> from the Mythic Midnight Falls encounter.</p></li><li><p><strong>Mythic Raid Completion:</strong> Successful defeat of L''ura, the final boss of the March on Quel''Danas raid on Mythic difficulty.</p></li><li><p><a target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" href="https://www.wowhead.com/beta/achievement=61626/ahead-of-the-curve-midnight-falls"><strong>Ahead of the Curve: Midnight Falls</strong></a><strong>:</strong> Earn this prestigious achievement before the next raid tier begins.</p></li><li><p><strong>Professional Team:</strong> Play alongside skilled and experienced raiders who ensure a smooth run.</p></li></ul><h2><strong>About Ashes of Belo''ren</strong></h2><p>The Ashes of Belo''ren is a coveted Mythic-exclusive mount introduced in Midnight Season 1, awarded to champions who conquer the formidable L''ura within the March on Quel''Danas raid. This radiant mount signifies mastery over the highest difficulties, making it a true statement piece for any collector in World of Warcraft: Midnight.</p><h3>Why Choose Our Service</h3><ul><li><p><strong>No Raid Guild Required:</strong> Skip the extensive recruitment and scheduling; simply join our pre-organized, high-performing team.</p></li><li><p><strong>Guaranteed Drop:</strong> Unlike many rare drops, the Ashes of Belo''ren is a 100% guaranteed reward upon Mythic L''ura''s defeat with this service.</p></li><li><p><strong>Flexible Playstyle:</strong> Choose between actively participating in the raid with our self-play option or letting a professional booster pilot your character.</p></li><li><p><strong>Effortless Acquisition:</strong> Avoid countless wipes and the pressure of Mythic progression; our experts handle the challenge.</p></li></ul><p>Elevate your World of Warcraft: Midnight collection with this magnificent mount. Trust misti.services to deliver a seamless and premium experience for your Ashes of Belo''ren mount acquisition.</p>', '<ul><li><p><strong>Select Your Service:</strong> Choose between Self-Play (you play your character) or Piloted (our booster plays for you).</p></li><li><p><strong>Schedule Your Run:</strong> Our team will contact you to arrange a suitable time for your Mythic March on Quel''Danas raid encounter.</p></li><li><p><strong>Prepare for Raid:</strong> If choosing Self-Play, ensure your character meets basic readiness for raid participation. If Piloted, securely provide account access details.</p></li><li><p><strong>Complete the Raid:</strong> Our professional team will guide you through or complete the Mythic L''ura encounter.</p></li><li><p><strong>Receive Your Mount:</strong> Once L''ura is defeated, the Ashes of Belo''ren mount is guaranteed to drop for your character.</p></li><li><p><strong>Enjoy Your New Mount:</strong> Mount up and showcase your prestigious new acquisition in World of Warcraft: Midnight!</p></li></ul><p></p>', '<ul><li><p><strong>World of Warcraft: Midnight Account:</strong> You must own an active World of Warcraft: Midnight account.</p></li><li><p><strong>Level 90 Character:</strong> Your character must be max level (90) in Midnight.</p></li><li><p><strong>Fresh Raid Cooldown:</strong> Your character must have a fresh raid lockout for Mythic March on Quel''Danas.</p></li><li><p><strong>Account Access (Piloted Only):</strong> If opting for Piloted, you will need to provide account login details for our booster.</p></li></ul><p></p>', 1048.95, 'https://kdjlhibxxygfdmlvdfcl.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/game-images/ashes-of-beloren-mount-boost-midnight-1770254075057.webp', NULL, 4.9, 0, true, true, 0, '2026-02-04T18:51:24.032063+00:00', '2026-02-06T01:47:59.037216+00:00', 'b4c0ccaf-a937-4b30-9ab4-7dacee8f739b', false, NULL, true, 0, '15 minutes', 'average start time', 'Flexible', 'order completion', 'Secure your Ashes of Belo''ren mount in WoW: Midnight with our boost service. Get a guaranteed drop from Mythic Midnight Falls in March on Quel''Danas. ', 'ashes of beloren mount buy, ashes of beloren boost, midnight falls mount, mythic lura mount, march on queldanas mount, wow midnight mount, midnight mounts, wow mount boost, mythic raid mount service, midnight season 1 mounts, buy wow mount, wow mount price, midnight mounts for sale, fast wow mount, ultimate wow mount, gaming service, fast delivery, professional, reliable, secure', 'https://kdjlhibxxygfdmlvdfcl.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/game-images/ashes-of-beloren-mount-boost-midnight-1770254075057.webp', NULL, 'Ashes Of Beloren Mount Boost Midnight', 'Buy WoW Ashes of Belo''ren Mount Boost | misti.services', NULL);
INSERT INTO public.products (id, name, slug, short_description, description, how_it_works, requirements, base_price, image_url, badge_text, trust_score, total_reviews, is_active, is_featured, sort_order, created_at, updated_at, category_id, is_slider_product, slider_config, is_manually_popular, total_sales, start_time_text, start_time_value, delivery_text, delivery_value, meta_description, meta_keywords, og_image, canonical_url, image_alt_text, meta_title, parent_link) VALUES ('e72c5fc9-9517-4d4b-9619-21ba776b08af', 'Fully Furnished Achievement', 'wow-fully-furnished-achievement-boost', 'Unlock the prestigious "the Furnished" title in War Within without the monumental grind. Our experts efficiently collect 500 unique decor items, saving you hundreds of hours.', '<h1><strong>WoW Fully Furnished Achievement Boost</strong></h1><p>Achieve the ultimate housing prestige in War Within with our WoW <a target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" href="https://www.wowhead.com/achievement=61318/fully-furnished">Fully Furnished</a> Achievement Boost. This premium service helps you acquire 500 unique decor items, granting you the coveted "the Furnished" title. Bypass the intensive farming and complex acquisition routes, letting our professional players handle the extensive collection process for you.</p><h2><strong>Service Includes</strong></h2><ul><li><p><strong>Decor Collection:</strong> Acquisition of 500 unique decor items of uncommon quality or higher.</p></li><li><p><strong>Title Unlock:</strong> The prestigious "the Furnished" title for your character.</p></li><li><p><strong>Achievement Completion:</strong> Full progress through all stages leading to the Fully Furnished achievement.</p></li></ul><h2><strong>About World of Warcraft War Within Housing</strong></h2><p>Player Housing in World of Warcraft: War Within introduces a new layer of personalization and collection. The "Fully Furnished" achievement stands as a monumental goal, requiring players to gather 500 distinct decorative items. This extensive task involves everything from rare mob drops and crafting special pieces to uncovering vendor-specific decor. It''s a true test of dedication and time, often spanning hundreds of gameplay hours if pursued organically.</p><h3>Why Choose Our Service</h3><ul><li><p><strong>Expert Acquisition:</strong> Our boosters are masters of housing acquisition, knowing optimal farming routes, crafting recipes, and vendor locations for all decor items.</p></li><li><p><strong>Time Efficiency:</strong> Save hundreds of hours of personal gameplay that would otherwise be spent on repetitive collection tasks.</p></li><li><p><strong>Guaranteed Results:</strong> We ensure the complete collection of 500 unique decor items and the successful unlock of your title.</p></li><li><p><strong>Secure &amp; Professional:</strong> All services are performed by experienced players with a commitment to account safety and privacy.</p></li><li><p><strong>Continuous Updates:</strong> Stay informed with regular progress reports from your dedicated booster.</p></li></ul><p>Let misti.services elevate your War Within experience. Embrace the prestige of a fully furnished home without the exhaustive grind by securing your WoW Fully Furnished Achievement Boost today.</p>', '<ul><li><p><strong>Place Your Order:</strong> Select your desired options and complete the purchase for the WoW Fully Furnished Achievement Boost.</p></li><li><p><strong>Booster Assignment:</strong> We will connect you with a skilled booster who specializes in decor acquisition.</p></li><li><p><strong>Coordinate Access:</strong> For piloted boosts, securely provide your account details. For self-play, we''ll arrange a convenient schedule.</p></li><li><p><strong>Collection Process:</strong> Our booster will efficiently work through the game, collecting 500 unique decor items through farming, crafting, and vendor purchases.</p></li><li><p><strong>Achievement Unlocked:</strong> Once 500 unique decor items are collected, the "Fully Furnished" achievement and "the Furnished" title will be yours.</p></li><li><p><strong>Enjoy Your Prestige:</strong> Log in to your character and proudly display your new title and expertly furnished housing.</p></li></ul><p></p>', '<ul>
