Game Expansion:</strong> The War Within expansion must be active on your account.</p></li><li><p><strong>Character Level:</strong> Your character must be max level.</p></li></ul><p></p>', 99, 'https://kdjlhibxxygfdmlvdfcl.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/game-images/wow-vicious-saddle-boost-1770253866001.webp', NULL, 4.9, 0, true, true, 0, '2026-02-01T00:43:05.798571+00:00', '2026-02-06T01:48:20.2675+00:00', '31441b65-4762-40ea-b89f-9fd09aebe8ba', true, '{"step":1,"max_value":5,"min_value":1,"slider_type":"single","value_label":"Vicious Saddles","default_value":1,"dynamic_options":[{"action":"apply_discount","message":"","option_name":"","trigger_value":3,"discount_percent":10}],"pricing_brackets":[{"end":5,"price":0,"start":1}],"estimated_time_per_step":0.5}', true, 0, '15 minutes', 'average start time', 'Flexible', 'order completion', 'Get your WoW Vicious Saddle token quickly and easily with our professional boost service. Unlock exclusive PvP mounts without the grind. Fast and reliable!', 'wow vicious saddle boost, vicious saddle buy, vicious saddle price, wow pvp boost, wow mount boost, wow vicious mount, wow pvp mount farming, wow vicious saddle carry, wow token boost, wow rated battleground wins, wow arena wins, buy wow vicious saddle, price wow vicious saddle, misti vicious saddle, WoW, Vicious Saddle, gaming service, fast delivery, professional, reliable', 'https://kdjlhibxxygfdmlvdfcl.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/game-images/wow-vicious-saddle-boost-1770253866001.webp', NULL, 'Wow Vicious Saddle Boost', 'Buy WoW Vicious Saddle Boost | Fast PvP Mounts ', NULL);
INSERT INTO public.products (id, name, slug, short_description, description, how_it_works, requirements, base_price, image_url, badge_text, trust_score, total_reviews, is_active, is_featured, sort_order, created_at, updated_at, category_id, is_slider_product, slider_config, is_manually_popular, total_sales, start_time_text, start_time_value, delivery_text, delivery_value, meta_description, meta_keywords, og_image, canonical_url, image_alt_text, meta_title, parent_link) VALUES ('4fb3d480-f8e8-4a3f-a1d7-869c2a14786c', 'Netherwing', 'netherwing', 'Earning Exalted status with the Netherwing grants mandatory access to the Netherwing Drake mounts, which feature distinct models and are considered one of the defining mount rewards of the expansion.', '<h1><strong>Netherwing Reputation Farm Boost – WoW TBC Classic</strong></h1><p>Looking to obtain the highly sought-after <strong>Netherwing Drakes</strong> without spending weeks flying daily routes and farming eggs? Misti.Services offers a fast, secure, and professional <a href="https://www.icy-veins.com/tbc-classic/netherwing-reputation-and-rewards-guide" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank"><strong>Netherwing </strong></a><strong>Reputation Farm Boost</strong>, helping you reach Exalted and unlock one of the game''s most unique flying mount collections.</p><p>Our expert boosters handle the complex initial quest chains, manage the daily quest resets, and efficiently farm <strong>Netherwing Eggs</strong> on Netherwing Ledge, delivering guaranteed reputation gains from Hated to Exalted.</p><h2><strong>Overview</strong></h2><p>The <strong>Netherwing</strong> faction is crucial for players seeking unique prestige mounts in <em>The Burning Crusade Classic</em>. This faction consists of the Netherdrakes and is based almost entirely on <strong>Netherwing Ledge</strong> in southeastern Shadowmoon Valley.</p><p>Earning <strong>Exalted</strong> status with the Netherwing grants mandatory access to the <strong>Netherwing Drake mounts</strong>, which feature distinct models and are considered one of the defining mount rewards of the expansion.</p><h2><strong>Gaining Reputation</strong></h2><p>The Netherwing reputation grind is unique as it begins at <strong>Hated</strong> and relies heavily on a long initial quest chain followed by a mix of reputation-gated daily quests and item turn-ins.</p><h3>Initial Quest Chain (Hated to Neutral)</h3><p>The boost begins by completing the introductory chain started by <strong>Mordenai</strong> in Netherwing Fields, which includes pivotal quests like <em>Seek Out Neltharaku</em> and <em>Ally of the Netherwing</em>, propelling the player directly to <strong>Neutral</strong>.</p><h3>Primary Reputation Sources (Neutral to Exalted)</h3><ol><li><strong>Daily Quests:</strong> The core of the reputation gain comes from daily quests that unlock as your standing improves. The boost includes completing all available dailies, including higher-rep quests that unlock at Friendly (<em>Picking Up The Pieces...</em>, <em>The Booterang...</em>) and Honored.</li></ol><ul><li class="ql-indent-1"><em>Note:</em> We will prioritize and complete profession-specific dailies (e.g., <em>Nethercite Ore</em>, <em>Nethermine Flayer Hide</em>) if your character has the necessary skills.</li></ul><ol><li><strong>Netherwing Egg Farming:</strong> Our service includes targeted farming of <strong>Netherwing Eggs</strong> from mobs, Netherdust Bushes, and Nethercite deposits on the Ledge. The eggs are turned in via the repeatable <em>Accepting All Eggs</em> quest (250 reputation per egg), offering a reliable supplement to daily caps.</li><li><strong>One-Time Quest Chains:</strong> We complete high-value, single-completion chains at each reputation tier, such as <em>The Great Murkblood Revolt</em> (850 rep), <em>Earning Your Wings...</em> (a six-part chain granting 3200 rep total), and the final <strong>Exalted</strong> quests (<em>Bow to the Highlord</em> and <em>Lord Illidan Stormrage</em>).</li></ol><h2><strong>Mount Rewards</strong></h2><p>Upon reaching <strong>Exalted</strong> reputation, you receive one of the Netherwing Drakes for <strong>free</strong>. The remaining five color variations can then be purchased from <strong>Drake Dealer Hurlunk</strong> on the Netherwing Ledge.</p><p>This service unlocks access to the full stable of mounts, all costing 200 gold each:</p><ul><li><strong>Reins of the Cobalt Netherwing Drake</strong></li><li><strong>Reins of the Veridian Netherwing Drake</strong></li><li><strong>Reins of the Purple Netherwing Drake</strong></li><li><strong>Reins of the Onyx Netherwing Drake</strong></li><li><a href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=32858/reins-of-the-azure-netherwing-drake" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank"><strong>Reins of the Azure Netherwing Drake</strong></a></li><li><strong>Reins of the Violet Netherwing Drake</strong></li></ul><h2><strong>Why Choose Our Netherwing Reputation Boost</strong></h2><p>The Netherwing grind is notoriously time-gated, requiring constant commitment over many weeks. Misti.Services removes this tedious repetition entirely:</p><ul><li><strong>Zero Downtime:</strong> We log in daily to complete the maximum available reputation gain, ensuring the fastest path to Exalted.</li><li><strong>Egg Farm Guarantee:</strong> We secure the necessary <strong>Netherwing Eggs</strong> to supplement your daily cap and speed up the process.</li><li><strong>Security Assured:</strong> Your account access is handled securely by trusted Misti.Services boosters utilizing VPNs.</li></ul><h3><strong>Service Includes</strong></h3><ul><li>Full Netherwing reputation farm from your current standing (Hated, Neutral, etc.) up to <strong>Exalted</strong>.</li><li>Completion of all mandatory initial quests (Mordenai, Neltharaku chains).</li><li>Daily completion of all reputation-gated quests (7-8 dailies per day).</li><li>Efficient farming and turn-in of <strong>Netherwing Eggs</strong>.</li><li>Completion of all final <strong>Exalted</strong> quest chains to unlock the free Drake mount.</li><li>Guaranteed access to purchase all six unique <strong>Netherwing Drakes</strong>.</li></ul><p><strong>Stop waiting for daily resets. Secure your Netherwing Drakes today!</strong></p>', '<ul><li>Select your desired options and complete your order on&nbsp;Misti.Services.</li><li>You’ll receive an order confirmation and tracking number via email.</li><li>Our support manager will contact you through live chat to confirm all details.</li><li>If you’re unavailable, we’ll reach out via email or your preferred contact method.</li><li>When the boost is finished, you’ll receive a completion notification on Discord or another messenger of your choice.</li></ul>', '<ul><li><strong>Level 70</strong></li><li>Possession of a <strong>Flying Mount</strong></li><li><strong>300 Riding skill</strong> (required to advance past Neutral reputation)</li></ul>', 0, 'https://kdjlhibxxygfdmlvdfcl.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/game-images/yw1gy6301z.webp', NULL, 4.9, 0, true, true, 0, '2025-11-19T08:04:03.248759+00:00', '2026-02-16T10:52:55.12373+00:00', '9464d1fe-6c00-412a-8ebb-896a4f575b4e', false, NULL, true, 0, '15 minutes', 'average start time', 'Flexible', 'order completion', 'Skip the daily Netherwing grind! Buy our boost to quickly reach Exalted and unlock all six unique Netherwing Drake mounts. Fast, secure farming on Netherwing Ledge.', 'Netherwing reputation boost, Netherwing Exalted farm, buy Netherwing Drake mounts, WoW TBC rep carry, Netherwing Ledge farming, Mordenai quest chain, Netherwing Eggs farm, 300 riding skill boost, Shadowmoon Valley reputation, Netherwing daily quests, get Netherwing Drakes fast', 'https://kdjlhibxxygfdmlvdfcl.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/game-images/og-nnvdozhxbkg.webp', NULL, 'netherwing reputation', 'WoW TBC Netherwing Rep Boost | misti.services', NULL);
INSERT INTO public.products (id, name, slug, short_description, description, how_it_works, requirements, base_price, image_url, badge_text, trust_score, total_reviews, is_active, is_featured, sort_order, created_at, updated_at, category_id, is_slider_product, slider_config, is_manually_popular, total_sales, start_time_text, start_time_value, delivery_text, delivery_value, meta_description, meta_keywords, og_image, canonical_url, image_alt_text, meta_title, parent_link) VALUES ('2f8cb701-94f5-43f8-9967-9914d2794f0f', 'Shattered Sun Offensive', 'shattered-sun-offensive', 'The Shattered Sun Offensive (SSO) is the combined Blood Elf and Draenei faction based on the Isle of Quel''Danas. This is the final major reputation of The Burning Crusade Classic and is essential for acquiring powerful pre-raid gear and highly sought-after crafting recipes leading into the Sunwell Plateau raid.', '<h1><strong>Shattered Sun Offensive Boost – Isle of Quel''Danas</strong></h1><p>Need to quickly gear up for Sunwell Plateau and secure powerful profession patterns without the weekly grind of Isle of Quel''Danas dailies? Misti.Services offers a fast, secure, and professional <a href="https://www.icy-veins.com/tbc-classic/shattered-sun-offensive-reputation-and-rewards-guide" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank"><strong>Shattered Sun Offensive</strong></a><strong> (SSO) Reputation Farm Boost</strong>, helping you reach Exalted and unlock essential pre-raid items.</p><p>Our expert boosters complete all mandatory dailies and execute efficient, guaranteed clears of <strong>Magister''s Terrace (Heroic)</strong> to deliver rapid reputation gains from Neutral to Exalted.</p><h2><strong>Overview</strong></h2><p>The <strong>Shattered Sun Offensive (SSO)</strong> is the combined Blood Elf and Draenei faction based on the <strong>Isle of Quel''Danas</strong>. This is the final major reputation of <em>The Burning Crusade Classic</em> and is essential for acquiring powerful pre-raid gear and highly sought-after crafting recipes leading into the Sunwell Plateau raid.</p><p>Earning <strong>Exalted</strong> status with the Shattered Sun Offensive provides access to:</p><ul><li><strong>Powerful Pre-Raid Items:</strong> The best available gear to fill missing slots before entering Sunwell Plateau.</li><li><strong>Essential Profession Recipes:</strong> Unique patterns for <strong>Jewelcrafting</strong>, <strong>Enchanting</strong>, and <strong>Alchemy</strong>.</li><li><strong>Heroic Dungeon Access:</strong> Completion of the quick, mandatory questline to unlock <strong>Heroic Magister''s Terrace</strong>.</li></ul><h2><strong>Gaining Reputation</strong></h2><p>Reputation with the Shattered Sun Offensive begins at <strong>Neutral</strong> and is gained exclusively through the daily quests on the Isle of Quel''Danas and dungeon clears of <strong>Magister''s Terrace (MT)</strong>.</p><h3><strong>1. Daily Quests (Neutral to Exalted)</strong></h3><p>The majority of your reputation is time-gated by the daily quests offered on the Isle of Quel''Danas.</p><ul><li><strong>Quest Unlock:</strong> Our service ensures all one-time quests are completed to unlock the maximum number of daily versions. We stay up-to-date with your server''s <strong>Isle phase progression</strong> to access new dailies immediately as they unlock.</li><li><strong>Daily Completion:</strong> We complete all available daily quests on the Isle of Quel''Danas every day to maximize daily reputation gains.</li></ul><h3><strong>2. Magister''s Terrace Clears</strong></h3><p>Dungeon runs supplement the daily quests and provide the final push to Exalted:</p><ul><li><strong>Neutral to Revered:</strong> We utilize <strong>Normal Magister''s Terrace</strong> runs to supplement early reputation.</li><li><strong>Revered to Exalted:</strong> The final grind is completed by running <strong>Heroic Magister''s Terrace</strong> daily, as mob kills grant reputation all the way to Exalted.</li></ul><h3><strong>3. Heroic Attunement</strong></h3><p>Before Heroic MT runs can begin, a quick quest chain is required. Our service handles this based on your Shattrath faction:</p><ul><li><strong>Scryers:</strong> Quest chain begins with <em>Duty Calls</em> from Dathris Sunstriker.</li><li><strong>Aldor:</strong> Quest chain begins with <em>Crisis at the Sunwell</em> from Exarch Larethor.</li></ul><p>This chain culminates in defeating Kael''thas and grants permanent access to Heroic Magister''s Terrace.</p><h2><strong>Reputation Rewards</strong></h2><p>The Quartermasters, <strong>Eldara Dawnrunner</strong> and <strong>Shaani</strong>, are located on the Isle of Quel''Danas. This service guarantees the necessary standing to purchase all valuable recipes and gear.</p><h2><strong>Why Choose Our Shattered Sun Offensive Boost</strong></h2><p>The SSO grind is highly restrictive and time-gated, requiring dedicated log-ins every day to complete the maximum number of dailies. Misti.Services offers the complete, hands-off solution:</p><ul><li><strong>Zero Missed Dailies:</strong> We guarantee completion of every available daily quest on the Isle of Quel''Danas.</li><li><strong>Heroic Access Guaranteed:</strong> We complete the full Magister''s Terrace attunement questline for you.</li><li><strong>Fastest Possible Exalted:</strong> We run Heroic Magister''s Terrace daily to ensure the shortest possible path to maximum reputation.</li></ul><h3><strong>Service Includes</strong></h3><ul><li>Full Shattered Sun Offensive reputation farm from your current standing up to <strong>Exalted</strong>.</li><li>Completion of the <strong>Magister''s Terrace Heroic Attunement</strong> questline.</li><li>Daily completion of all available Isle of Quel''Danas quests and dailies.</li><li>Daily runs of <strong>Heroic Magister''s Terrace</strong> until Exalted status is achieved.</li></ul><p><strong>Prepare for Sunwell Plateau! Order your Shattered Sun Offensive Boost today.</strong></p>', '<ul><li>Select your desired options and complete your order on&nbsp;Misti.Services.</li><li>You’ll receive an order confirmation and tracking number via email.</li><li>Our support manager will contact you through live chat to confirm all details.</li><li>If you’re unavailable, we’ll reach out via email or your preferred contact method.</li><li>When the boost is finished, you’ll receive a completion notification on Discord or another messenger of your choice.</li></ul>', '<ul><li>Level 70 character</li><li>Active WoW Subscription</li></ul>', 0, 'https://kdjlhibxxygfdmlvdfcl.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/game-images/shattered-sun-offensive-1763846111594.webp', NULL, 4.9, 0, true, true, 0, '2025-11-20T12:11:12.444792+00:00', '2026-02-16T10:52:52.944568+00:00', '9464d1fe-6c00-412a-8ebb-896a4f575b4e', false, NULL, true, 0, '15 minutes', 'average start time', 'Flexible', 'order completion', 'Buy SSO Exalted boost! Unlock top pre-raid gear, JC/Enchanting recipes, and complete the Magister''s Terrace attunement with fast daily farming.', 'Shattered Sun Offensive reputation boost, SSO Exalted farm, Isle of Quel''Danas dailies, Magister''s Terrace Heroic farm, Kael''thas dungeon attunement, TBC pre-raid gear, Sunwell Plateau preparation, Scryers Crisis at the Sunwell, Eldara Dawnrunner quartermaster', 'https://kdjlhibxxygfdmlvdfcl.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/game-images/shattered-sun-offensive-1763846111594.webp', NULL, 'Shattered Sun Offensive', 'WoW TBC Shattered Sun Rep Boost | misti.services', NULL);
