r Remote Selfplay) and efficiently find all hidden treasures across Harandar.</p></li><li><p><strong>Mount &amp; Achievement Acquired:</strong> Once all treasures are found, you will earn the Treasures of Harandar achievement and the Brilliant Petalwing mount.</p></li><li><p><strong>Service Completion:</strong> You will be notified the moment your new mount is ready for use.</p></li></ul><p></p>', '<ul>
INSERT INTO public.products (id, name, slug, short_description, description, how_it_works, requirements, base_price, image_url, badge_text, trust_score, total_reviews, is_active, is_featured, sort_order, created_at, updated_at, category_id, is_slider_product, slider_config, is_manually_popular, total_sales, start_time_text, start_time_value, delivery_text, delivery_value, meta_description, meta_keywords, og_image, canonical_url, image_alt_text, meta_title, parent_link) VALUES ('06415beb-fc6b-41b8-a3ee-89d5d2eeb991', 'Lower City', 'lower-city', 'The Lower City is the faction of refugees who inhabit the lower section of Shattrath City. This reputation is highly important for all classes, offering some of the game''s most powerful pre-raid gear and a wide array of blueprints for endgame crafting.', '<h1><strong>Lower City Reputation Farm Boost – WoW TBC Classic</strong></h1><p>Tired of endless Auchenai dungeon runs and farming <strong>Arakkoa Feathers</strong>? Misti.Services offers a fast, secure, and professional <strong>Lower City Reputation Farm Boost</strong>, helping you reach Exalted and unlock essential pre-raid gear and valuable profession patterns.</p><p>Our expert boosters execute the optimal dungeon rotation—including repeated runs of <strong>Shadow Labyrinth</strong>—and manage turn-ins to deliver guaranteed reputation gains from Neutral to Exalted.</p><h2><strong>Overview</strong></h2><p>The <strong>Lower City</strong> is the faction of refugees who inhabit the lower section of Shattrath City. This reputation is highly important for all classes, offering some of the game''s most powerful pre-raid gear and a wide array of blueprints for endgame crafting.</p><p>Earning <strong>Exalted</strong> status with the Lower City provides access to:</p><ul><li><strong>Powerful Pre-Raid Gear:</strong> A variety of strong gear pieces suitable for multiple classes and specializations.</li><li><strong>Unique Profession Patterns:</strong> Valuable blueprints for <strong>Enchanting</strong>, <strong>Leatherworking</strong>, <strong>Jewelcrafting</strong>, <strong>Alchemy</strong>, and <strong>Tailoring</strong>.</li><li><strong>Dungeon Access:</strong> Efficiently clearing the Auchenai Crypts dungeons, which are mandatory for attunements and early heroic access.</li></ul><h2><strong>Gaining Reputation</strong></h2><p>Reputation with the <a href="https://www.icy-veins.com/tbc-classic/lower-city-reputation-and-rewards-guide" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">Lower City </a>is gained primarily through a mix of dungeon farming in the <strong>Auchenai Crypts</strong> instances and repeatable material turn-ins in Terokkar Forest.</p><h3><strong>1. Dungeon Farming</strong></h3><p>Dungeon runs are the fastest path to Exalted. Our service optimizes clears based on reputation cut-offs:</p><ul><li><strong>Normal Runs (Up to Honored/Revered):</strong></li><li class="ql-indent-1"><strong>Auchenai Crypts</strong> and <strong>Sethekk Halls</strong> grant reputation until <strong>Honored</strong>.</li><li class="ql-indent-1"><strong>Shadow Labyrinth</strong> grants reputation until <strong>Revered</strong>.</li><li><strong>Heroic Runs (To Exalted):</strong></li><li class="ql-indent-1"><strong>Shadow Labyrinth</strong> is the primary source of endgame reputation, granting mob kills all the way to <strong>Exalted</strong> on Heroic difficulty.</li></ul><h3><strong>2. Questing &amp; Turn-Ins</strong></h3><p>We ensure all non-repeatable reputation sources are utilized:</p><ul><li><strong>Quests:</strong> We complete approximately <strong>8,000 reputation</strong> worth of one-time quests, found mostly in <strong>Terokkar Forest</strong>.</li><li><strong>Arakkoa Feather Turn-ins:</strong> We collect <strong>Arakkoa Feathers</strong> that drop from Arakkoa mobs in Terokkar Forest and turn them in repeatedly to <strong>Vekax</strong> until the <strong>Honored</strong> standing is reached.</li></ul><h2><strong>Why Choose Our Lower City Reputation Boost</strong></h2><p>The Lower City grind requires many dungeon resets and material farming that can be highly monotonous. Misti.Services offers the most straightforward solution:</p><ul><li><strong>Shadow Labyrinth Focus:</strong> We prioritize the most time-efficient dungeon clears necessary for the final push to Exalted.</li><li><strong>Turn-in Management:</strong> We handle the collection and turn-in of <strong>Arakkoa Feathers</strong> before they stop granting reputation.</li><li><strong>Profession Blueprint Access:</strong> Guaranteeing access to the wide variety of crucial <strong>Lower City recipes</strong> that benefit all crafting professions.</li></ul><h3><strong>Service Includes</strong></h3><ul><li>Full Lower City reputation farm from your current standing up to <strong>Exalted</strong>.</li><li>Completion of all available reputation-granting quests (approx. 8,000 rep).</li><li>Efficient, high-speed runs of the Auchenai Crypts dungeons, focusing on <strong>Shadow Labyrinth</strong>.</li><li>Management of <strong>Arakkoa Feather</strong> turn-ins to <strong>Honored</strong>.</li></ul><p><strong>Unlock your endgame blueprints and gear! Order your Lower City Reputation Boost today.</strong></p>', '<ul><li>Select your desired options and complete your order on&nbsp;Misti.Services.</li><li>You’ll receive an order confirmation and tracking number via email.</li><li>Our support manager will contact you through live chat to confirm all details.</li><li>If you’re unavailable, we’ll reach out via email or your preferred contact method.</li><li>When the boost is finished, you’ll receive a completion notification on Discord or another messenger of your choice.</li></ul>', '<ul><li>Level 70 character</li><li>Active WoW Subscription</li></ul>', 0, 'https://kdjlhibxxygfdmlvdfcl.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/game-images/lower-city-1763845432609.webp', NULL, 4.9, 0, true, true, 0, '2025-11-20T12:07:16.023683+00:00', '2026-02-16T10:52:53.427014+00:00', '9464d1fe-6c00-412a-8ebb-896a4f575b4e', false, NULL, true, 0, '15 minutes', 'average start time', 'Flexible', 'order completion', 'Buy Lower City Exalted boost! Farm Shadow Labyrinth, get top pre-raid gear, and unlock essential Enchanting/Tailoring/JC profession patterns fast.', 'Lower City reputation boost, Shadow Labyrinth farm, Arakkoa Feathers turn-in, Lower City Exalted, TBC profession patterns, Auchenai Crypts boost, Sethekk Halls farm, Nakodu quartermaster, Shattrath faction rep, Major Resilience enchant', 'https://kdjlhibxxygfdmlvdfcl.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/game-images/lower-city-1763845432609.webp', NULL, 'Lower City', 'WoW TBC Lower City Rep Boost | misti.services', NULL);
INSERT INTO public.products (id, name, slug, short_description, description, how_it_works, requirements, base_price, image_url, badge_text, trust_score, total_reviews, is_active, is_featured, sort_order, created_at, updated_at, category_id, is_slider_product, slider_config, is_manually_popular, total_sales, start_time_text, start_time_value, delivery_text, delivery_value, meta_description, meta_keywords, og_image, canonical_url, image_alt_text, meta_title, parent_link) VALUES ('9d239622-e475-4b25-9461-6b4c5aa1a667', 'Thunderfury, Blessed Blade of the Windseeker', 'thunderfury-blessed-blade-of-the-windseeker-boost', 'Acquire the legendary Thunderfury sword in World of Warcraft without the extensive grind. Our professional service handles the entire complex questline, delivering this iconic weapon directly to your character.', '<h1><strong>Thunderfury, Blessed Blade of the Windseeker Boost</strong></h1><p>Obtain the legendary Thunderfury, Blessed Blade of the Windseeker for your World of Warcraft character through our efficient boost service. This iconic one-hand sword, coveted by Warrior, Paladin, Hunter, Rogue, and Death Knight classes, is acquired via a lengthy questline within the Molten Core raid. Let our experts handle the challenges so you can enjoy this powerful artifact effortlessly.</p><h2><strong>Service Includes</strong></h2><ul><li><p><strong>Legendary Achievement:</strong> Successful acquisition of <a target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" href="https://www.wowhead.com/item=19019/thunderfury-blessed-blade-of-the-windseeker">Thunderfury, Blessed Blade of the Windseeker</a>.</p></li><li><p><strong>Feat of Strength:</strong> Unlocking the associated ''Thunderfury, Blessed Blade of the Windseeker'' feat of strength.</p></li><li><p><strong>Molten Core Runs:</strong> Numerous completions of the Molten Core raid as part of the legendary quest.</p></li><li><p><strong>Bonus Loot:</strong> Retention of all items, gold, and other drops obtained during the service.</p></li><li><p><strong>Pet Acquisition Chance:</strong> Opportunities for battle pets such as Mark of Flame, Blazing Rune, and Core of Hardened Ash.</p></li></ul><h2><strong>About the Thunderfury Legendary</strong></h2><p>Thunderfury, Blessed Blade of the Windseeker, stands as one of World of Warcraft''s most recognizable and sought-after legendary weapons. Its acquisition requires an arduous journey through the Molten Core raid, involving low-drop-chance bindings from bosses, collection of rare materials, and completion of a multi-stage questline. This lengthy process can span weeks or even months of dedicated farming, making it a significant time investment for any player.</p><h3>Why Choose Our Service</h3><ul><li><p><strong>Skip the Grind:</strong> Avoid the repetitive farming and intricate quest steps required to obtain Thunderfury.</p></li><li><p><strong>Expert Execution:</strong> Our experienced team navigates the Molten Core and completes the questline efficiently and safely.</p></li><li><p><strong>Guaranteed Acquisition:</strong> We ensure the legendary sword is added to your character''s collection.</p></li><li><p><strong>Time-Saving:</strong> Reclaim dozens of hours that would otherwise be spent on this challenging endeavor.</p></li><li><p><strong>Secure Piloted Mode:</strong> Our piloted service is performed by verified professionals, ensuring your account''s safety.</p></li></ul><p>Achieve this monumental in-game goal with ease. Let misti.services provide a seamless and secure path to acquiring Thunderfury, Blessed Blade of the Windseeker, allowing you to focus on other aspects of your World of Warcraft adventure.</p>', '<ul><li><p><strong>Place Your Order:</strong> Select your server and side (Alliance/Horde) and complete your purchase.</p><ol><li><p><strong>Account Details:</strong> Our team will contact you to securely arrange account access. We may utilize a VPN for added security.</p></li><li><p><strong>Boosting Commences:</strong> A professional booster logs into your account and begins the Thunderfury questline in Molten Core.</p></li><li><p><strong>Progress Updates:</strong> You will receive notifications on the service''s progress.</p></li><li><p><strong>Completion:</strong> Once Thunderfury is obtained, you will be notified via email that the service is complete and you can log back in.</p></li></ol></li></ul><p></p>', '<ul>
INSERT INTO public.products (id, name, slug, short_description, description, how_it_works, requirements, base_price, image_url, badge_text, trust_score, total_reviews, is_active, is_featured, sort_order, created_at, updated_at, category_id, is_slider_product, slider_config, is_manually_popular, total_sales, start_time_text, start_time_value, delivery_text, delivery_value, meta_description, meta_keywords, og_image, canonical_url, image_alt_text, meta_title, parent_link) VALUES ('936a554d-3345-4011-b141-7fea391fe3a7', 'Dungeons Unlock', 'dungeons-unlock', 'Get your TBC Dungeon Key Boost and unlock all Heroic dungeons quickly. We farm reputation, complete quests, and secure every Heroic key safely and professionally.', '<h1><strong>TBC Dungeon Key Boost in World of Warcraft</strong></h1><p>Unlock access to all <strong>The Burning Crusade Classic Heroic dungeons</strong> with our professional <strong>TBC Dungeon Key Boost</strong> service. Heroic dungeons in TBC offer powerful pre-raid gear, valuable reputation rewards, and essential progression for your character. However, gaining access requires reaching the necessary reputation and purchasing the correct Heroic key — a time-consuming and challenging grind.</p><p>At <strong>Misti.Services</strong>, we handle the entire process for you efficiently and safely.</p><h2><strong>What Is a TBC Dungeon Key Boost?</strong></h2><p>Many of the older Burning Crusade dungeons are long, complex, and require strict requirements before you can unlock their Heroic modes. To enter them, you must reach <strong>Revered reputation</strong> with the corresponding faction and then obtain the Heroic key from the quartermaster.</p><p>Our service allows you to choose one or multiple dungeons. We will farm the required reputation, complete the needed quests, and acquire the Heroic key for you.</p><p>You can unlock all <strong>5 TBC keys</strong>, granting access to <strong>15 Heroic dungeons</strong>.</p><h2><strong>TBC Heroic Dungeon Keys and the Dungeons They Unlock</strong></h2><h3><strong>Flamewrought Key</strong></h3><p>Unlocks: Hellfire Ramparts, The Blood Furnace, The Shattered Halls</p><p>Faction: Honor Hold / Thrallmar</p><h3><strong>Warpforged Key</strong></h3><p>Unlocks: The Botanica, The Arcatraz, The Mechanar</p><p>Faction: The Sha’tar</p><h3><strong>Reservoir Key</strong></h3><p>Unlocks: The Slave Pens, The Steamvault, The Underbog</p><p>Faction: Cenarion Expedition</p><h3><strong>Key of Time</strong></h3><p>Unlocks: The Black Morass, Old Hillsbrad Foothills</p><p>Faction: Keepers of Time</p><h3><strong>Auchenai Key</strong></h3><p>Unlocks: Auchenai Crypts, Sethekk Halls, Mana-Tombs, Shadow Labyrinth</p><p>Faction: Lower City</p><h2><strong>What You Get With the TBC Dungeon Key Boost</strong></h2><p>When you purchase the <strong>TBC Dungeon Attunements Boost</strong> from Misti.Services, you receive:</p><ul><li><strong>The Heroic key</strong> for every selected dungeon</li><li><strong>Full reputation farming</strong> with the matching TBC faction</li><li><strong>Completion of key questlines and storylines</strong> required for attunements</li><li><strong>Gold, gear, and items</strong> obtained naturally during the boost</li><li><strong>Full progression toward Heroic dungeon access</strong></li></ul><h2><strong>Service Features</strong></h2><ul><li><strong>Completion Time:</strong> 1–2 days depending on selected keys and reputation status</li><li><strong>Top-level safety:</strong> We always use a VPN from your country</li><li><strong>Progress Updates:</strong> Streaming or screenshots available upon request</li><li><strong>Piloted service:</strong> Our professional booster logs into your account to complete the service</li><li><strong>Additional TBC services</strong> available in the corresponding category</li></ul>', '<ul><li>Select your desired options and complete your order on&nbsp;Misti.Services.</li><li>You’ll receive an order confirmation and tracking number via email.</li><li>Our support manager will contact you through live chat to confirm all details.</li><li>If you’re unavailable, we’ll reach out via email or your preferred contact method.</li><li>When the boost is finished, you’ll receive a completion notification on Discord or another messenger of your choice.</li></ul>', '<ul><li><strong>Account Sharing</strong> required for piloted service</li><li><strong>Level 70 character</strong></li></ul>', 0, 'https://kdjlhibxxygfdmlvdfcl.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/game-images/tbc-dungeon-key-boost-unlock-all-heroic-dungeons-fast-1762890687704.webp', NULL, 4.9, 0, true, true, 0, '2025-11-11T19:38:52.422451+00:00', '2026-02-16T10:51:04.269508+00:00', '116b15ba-d76a-44a3-b1be-5bcb88c71693', false, NULL, true, 0, '15 minutes', 'average start time', '1-2 Days', 'order completion', 'Get your TBC Dungeon Key Boost and unlock all Heroic dungeons quickly. We farm reputation, complete quests, and secure every Heroic key safely and professionally.', 'tbc dungeon key boost, tbc heroic key boost, buy tbc dungeon attunement, tbc dungeon attunements boost, tbc heroic dungeon access, tbc reputation farm, burning crusade dungeon keys, tbc heroic attunement service, tbc key of time boost, tbc flamewrought key boost, tbc warpforged key boost, tbc reservoir key boost, tbc auchenai key boost, misti services wow boosts, burning crusade power leveling, tbc heroic unlock service, buy wow tbc boost, tbc classic dungeon keys, wow tbc reputation boosting, wow tbc heroic key unlock', 'https://kdjlhibxxygfdmlvdfcl.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/game-images/tbc-dungeon-key-boost-unlock-all-heroic-dungeons-fast-1762890687704.webp', NULL, 'Tbc Dungeon Key Boost Unlock All Heroic Dungeons Fast', 'WoW TBC Dungeons Unlock - Fast Keys | misti.services', NULL);
INSERT INTO public.products (id, name, slug, short_description, description, how_it_works, requirements, base_price, image_url, badge_text, trust_score, total_reviews, is_active, is_featured, sort_order, created_at, updated_at, category_id, is_slider_product, slider_config, is_manually_popular, total_sales, start_time_text, start_time_value, delivery_text, delivery_value, meta_description, meta_keywords, og_image, canonical_url, image_alt_text, meta_title, parent_link) VALUES ('41bf4151-4d2d-4f49-b454-b53abbd5b706', 'TBC 1-60 Leveling', 'tbc-prepatch-leveling-carry', 'Achieve level 60 in WoW Burning Crusade Classic effortlessly. Our professional players will quickly level your character, saving you significant time and unlocking full access to all Burning Crusade Classic endgame content.', '<h1><strong>WoW TBC 1-60 Power Leveling</strong></h1><p>Experience the journey from level 1 to 60 in World of Warcraft: The Burning Crusade Classic without the time commitment. Our WoW TBC 1-60 power leveling service provides a fast and efficient way to reach max level, preparing your character for all the adventures Outland has to offer. Let our expert team handle the grind while you focus on enjoying the endgame.</p><h2><strong>Service Includes</strong></h2><ul><li><p><strong>Desired Level:</strong> Your character will be leveled from 1 to 60.</p></li><li><p><strong>Riding Skill:</strong> Includes 60% riding skill upon reaching applicable level (if not already acquired).</p></li><li><p><strong>Dual Specialization:</strong> Unlocked for characters level 40 and above (if not already acquired).</p></li><li><p><strong>Quest Completion:</strong> Numerous quests completed during the leveling process.</p></li><li><p><strong>Hand-Leveled:</strong> All leveling is performed manually by our skilled experts.</p></li><li><p><strong>Flexible Schedule:</strong> Service is timed to your preference, ensuring minimal disruption to your game time.</p></li></ul><h2><strong>About WoW TBC 1-60 Leveling</strong></h2><p>Leveling in WoW: The Burning Crusade Classic can be a time-consuming endeavor, often requiring hundreds of hours of dedicated gameplay. Our TBC 1-60 power leveling service is designed to alleviate this burden, allowing you to bypass the repetitive tasks and jump straight into the thrilling endgame content. Our experienced players utilize optimized routes and efficient strategies to ensure a quick and smooth leveling experience for your character.</p><h3>Why Choose Our Service</h3><ul><li><p><strong>Fast and Efficient:</strong> Our boosters follow optimized leveling routes, ensuring your character reaches level 60 quickly.</p></li><li><p><strong>100% Manual Play:</strong> All services are performed by real players, with no bots or automation, ensuring account safety and adherence to game rules.</p></li><li><p><strong>Account Safety Protocol:</strong> We employ strict protocols, including VPN usage, to protect your account during the service.</p></li><li><p><strong>Customizable Experience:</strong> Tailor your leveling experience with options like specific playtimes, additional services, or even self-play options.</p></li><li><p><strong>Endgame Ready:</strong> Your character will be fully prepared for max-level content, including quests, dungeons, and raids, upon completion.</p></li></ul><p>Choosing misti.services means opting for a reliable and professional service to enhance your WoW TBC Classic experience. Secure your 1-60 power level today and conquer Outland with a prepared character.</p>', '<ul><li><p><strong>Place Your Order:</strong> Select your desired options for the WoW TBC 1-60 power leveling service and complete your purchase.</p></li><li><p><strong>Communication:</strong> We will contact you shortly after your purchase via live chat or email to discuss all service details.</p></li><li><p><strong>Schedule and Setup:</strong> We''ll confirm your preferred start time and any specific instructions to align with your schedule.</p></li><li><p><strong>Booster Assignment:</strong> A skilled and experienced booster will be assigned to your order.</p></li><li><p><strong>Service Execution:</strong> The booster will either pilot your character (account-sharing), or you can join a group yourself in a self-play option. Remote control options are also available if you prefer not to share account details.</p></li><li><p><strong>Completion Notification:</strong> You will be informed as soon as your character reaches level 60.</p></li><li><p><strong>Enjoy the Game:</strong> Log in to your max-level character and dive into the TBC Classic endgame!</p></li></ul><p></p>', '<ul>
INSERT INTO public.products (id, name, slug, short_description, description, how_it_works, requirements, base_price, image_url, badge_text, trust_score, total_reviews, is_active, is_featured, sort_order, created_at, updated_at, category_id, is_slider_product, slider_config, is_manually_popular, total_sales, start_time_text, start_time_value, delivery_text, delivery_value, meta_description, meta_keywords, og_image, canonical_url, image_alt_text, meta_title, parent_link) VALUES ('bfffc087-1d49-42fc-b556-caa4d071ad50', 'Spark of Radiance', 'wow-midnight-spark-of-radiance-farm', 'Upgrade your crafted gear in Midnight effortlessly with our Spark of Radiance farm. Skip the weekly grind and immediately equip your upgraded items for challenging encounters.', '<h1><strong>WoW Midnight Spark of Radiance Farm</strong></h1><p>Unlock the full potential of your crafted gear in WoW Midnight with our <a target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" href="https://www.wowhead.com/item=232875/spark-of-radiance">Spark of Radiance</a> farming service. This essential resource is crucial for upgrading your items, ensuring you''re combat-ready for the toughest content. Let our expert team handle the repetitive farming tasks so you can focus on enjoying the game.</p><h2><strong>Service Includes</strong></h2><ul><li><p><strong>Desired Number of Sparks:</strong> We will farm the selected quantity of Spark of Radiance for your character.</p></li><li><p><strong>Midnight Weekly Quests:</strong> Completion of relevant weekly quests and activities that award Spark of Radiance.</p></li><li><p><strong>Crafting Potential:</strong> Ability to craft and upgrade items to their maximum ilvl (up to 285 ilvl) with collected Sparks.</p></li><li><p><strong>Additional Drops:</strong> All other resources, materials, and gold obtained during the service completion are yours to keep.</p></li></ul><h2><strong>About WoW Midnight Spark of Radiance</strong></h2><p>Spark of Radiance is a vital crafting component introduced in WoW Midnight, essential for players looking to enhance their gear. It''s primarily acquired through weekly activities and quests, making its acquisition a time-gated and often tedious process. Obtaining enough Sparks of Radiance is key to maximizing your character''s power through crafted items and preparing for high-end content.</p><h3>Why Choose Our Service</h3><ul><li><p><strong>Efficiency:</strong> Our professional players maximize the Spark of Radiance gain, saving you valuable time.</p></li><li><p><strong>Convenience:</strong> Avoid the weekly grind and tiresome reputation farming required to earn sparks.</p></li><li><p><strong>Gear Advancement:</strong> Quickly upgrade your crafted items to optimal item levels, enhancing your combat effectiveness.</p></li><li><p><strong>Secure Process:</strong> We prioritize your account''s safety with secure play methods and VPN usage.</p></li></ul><p>Opt for the misti.services WoW Midnight Spark of Radiance farm and elevate your gameplay experience. Secure your gear upgrades today and confidently face any challenge Midnight throws your way.</p>', '<ul><li><p><strong>Select Quantity:</strong> Choose the desired number of Spark of Radiance you need using our slider.</p></li><li><p><strong>Select Method:</strong> Pick your preferred completion method: Piloted (we play on your account) or Self-Play Remote (you observe our player remotely).</p></li><li><p><strong>Provide Details:</strong> For Piloted, our manager will securely obtain your account credentials. For Self-Play Remote, we provide instructions for secure access.</p></li><li><p><strong>Service Begins:</strong> Our professional booster logs in (Piloted) or connects remotely (Self-Play Remote) and begins farming the Spark of Radiance.</p></li><li><p><strong>Stay Updated:</strong> We keep you informed on the progress, especially regarding weekly caps and resets.</p></li><li><p><strong>Service Complete:</strong> Once all Sparks are farmed, we notify you, and you can enjoy your upgraded gear.</p></li></ul><p></p>', '<ul>
INSERT INTO public.products (id, name, slug, short_description, description, how_it_works, requirements, base_price, image_url, badge_text, trust_score, total_reviews, is_active, is_featured, sort_order, created_at, updated_at, category_id, is_slider_product, slider_config, is_manually_popular, total_sales, start_time_text, start_time_value, delivery_text, delivery_value, meta_description, meta_keywords, og_image, canonical_url, image_alt_text, meta_title, parent_link) VALUES ('86fd6211-27e2-43b5-992a-3df42d89ca3c', 'Dawncrests Farm', 'wow-midnight-dawncrests-farm', 'Enhance your gear efficiently with our World of Warcraft Midnight Dawncrests farming service. Secure coveted Dawncrests for powerful item upgrades or crafting with ease, avoiding the grind.', '<h1><strong>WoW Midnight Dawncrests Farm</strong></h1><p>Unlock your gear''s true potential in World of Warcraft Midnight with our professional Dawncrests farming service. Acquire Veteran, Champion, Hero, or Myth Dawncrests rapidly to upgrade your equipment, craft potent items, and dramatically boost your item level. Our dedicated team ensures a streamlined and efficient process, allowing you to focus on the epic adventures that matter most.</p><h2><strong>Service Includes</strong></h2><ul><li><p><strong>Desired Dawncrests:</strong> The specific quantity and type of Dawncrests you select (<a target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" href="https://www.wowhead.com/currency=3341/veteran-dawncrest">Veteran</a>, <a target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" href="https://www.wowhead.com/currency=3343/champion-dawncrest">Champion</a>, <a target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" href="https://www.wowhead.com/currency=3345/hero-dawncrest">Hero</a>, or <a target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" href="https://www.wowhead.com/currency=3348/myth-dawncrest">Myth</a>).</p></li><li><p><strong>PvE Activities:</strong> Completion of various in-game activities such as world quests, dungeons, delves, and raids as part of the farming process.</p></li><li><p><strong>Gear Opportunities:</strong> Chances to obtain high item level gear drops from dungeons, delves, and raids during the service.</p></li><li><p><strong>Weekly Vault Progress:</strong> Contribution towards your weekly Great Vault rewards.</p></li><li><p><strong>Additional Loot:</strong> Any other loot, currencies, or resources acquired throughout the service.</p></li></ul><h2><strong>About World of Warcraft Midnight Dawncrests</strong></h2><p>Dawncrests are a pivotal new currency in World of Warcraft Midnight, essential for upgrading your character''s gear and pushing into higher tiers of content. These valuable resources allow you to enhance the item level of your existing equipment or serve as key components in crafting powerful new items. Acquiring enough Dawncrests can be a time-consuming endeavor, requiring players to engage in a variety of challenging PvE content. Our service provides a convenient solution, ensuring you get the Dawncrests you need without the repetitive grind.</p><h3>Why Choose Our Service</h3><ul><li><p><strong>Efficiency:</strong> Our expert players employ optimal strategies to farm Dawncrests quickly and effectively.</p></li><li><p><strong>Safety:</strong> We prioritize your account security with professional methods like premium VPNs for Piloted services or secure remote access for Selfplay Remote.</p></li><li><p><strong>Flexibility:</strong> Choose from various completion methods, including Piloted, Self-Play, or the secure Self-Play Remote option, to suit your preferences.</p></li><li><p><strong>Value:</strong> Benefit from a competitively priced service that delivers tangible results and saves you countless hours of grinding.</p></li><li><p><strong>Customer Support:</strong> Our support team is available to assist you throughout the process, ensuring a smooth and hassle-free experience.</p></li></ul><p>Elevate your World of Warcraft Midnight experience and conquer new challenges with adequately geared characters. Partner with misti.services today to secure your Dawncrests and embark on your next adventure fully prepared.</p>', '<ul><li><p><strong>Select Your Dawncrest Type:</strong> Choose the specific type of Dawncrest you need (Veteran, Champion, Hero, or Myth).</p></li><li><p><strong>Choose Quantity:</strong> Use the slider to specify the desired amount of Dawncrests you wish to acquire.</p></li><li><p><strong>Pick Completion Method:</strong> Opt for Piloted, Selfplay, or Selfplay Remote based on your preference for how our team will complete the service.</p></li><li><p><strong>Process Payment:</strong> Complete your secure purchase through our website.</p></li><li><p><strong>Coordination:</strong> For Piloted, our manager will contact you for account details to arrange a secure login with VPN. For Selfplay/Selfplay Remote, we will coordinate a convenient schedule for you to join our team.</p></li><li><p><strong>Service Execution:</strong> Our professional players will efficiently farm the requested Dawncrests for you.</p></li><li><p><strong>Completion:</strong> Once the service is finished, you will receive notification, and your character will have the specified Dawncrests.</p></li></ul><p></p>', '<ul>
INSERT INTO public.products (id, name, slug, short_description, description, how_it_works, requirements, base_price, image_url, badge_text, trust_score, total_reviews, is_active, is_featured, sort_order, created_at, updated_at, category_id, is_slider_product, slider_config, is_manually_popular, total_sales, start_time_text, start_time_value, delivery_text, delivery_value, meta_description, meta_keywords, og_image, canonical_url, image_alt_text, meta_title, parent_link) VALUES ('9d16b707-217a-41d2-973e-285352d21c4d', 'Ashtongue Deathsworn', 'ashtongue-deathsworn', 'The Ashtongue Deathsworn are the Broken Draenei faction led by Akama, found deep within the Black Temple (BT) raid instance. This reputation is tied directly to successful completion of the raid and offers some of the most specialized and desirable rewards in The Burning Crusade Classic.', '<h1><strong>Ashtongue Deathsworn Reputation Boost – WoW TBC Classic</strong></h1><p>Ready to bypass the grueling Black Temple attunement questline and farm your way to unique, class-specific trinkets and powerful Shadow Resistance gear? Misti.Services offers a fast, secure, and professional <strong>Ashtongue Deathsworn Reputation Farm Boost</strong>, handling both the required pre-raid tasks and the weekly clears.</p><p>Our expert raid teams handle the lengthy <strong>Black Temple Attunement</strong> and complete weekly clears of the raid instance, delivering guaranteed reputation gains from Neutral to Exalted.</p><h2><strong>Overview</strong></h2><p>The <a href="https://www.icy-veins.com/tbc-classic/ashtongue-deathsworn-reputation-and-rewards-guide" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank"><strong>Ashtongue Deathsworn</strong></a> are the Broken Draenei faction led by Akama, found deep within the <strong>Black Temple (BT)</strong> raid instance. This reputation is tied directly to successful completion of the raid and offers some of the most specialized and desirable rewards in <em>The Burning Crusade Classic</em>.</p><p>Earning <strong>Exalted</strong> status with the Ashtongue Deathsworn is mandatory for high-end raiding and provides access to:</p><ul><li><strong>Unique Class Trinkets:</strong> Powerful, class-specific epic trinkets, such as the <em>Ashtongue Talisman of Swiftness</em> or <em>Ashtongue Talisman of Cunning</em>.</li><li><strong>Shadow Resistance Gear:</strong> Patterns and recipes for crafting highly effective Shadow Resistance gear, essential for specific raid encounters.</li><li><strong>Black Temple Attunement Completion:</strong> We handle the complex, faction-dependent quest chain required to enter the raid.</li></ul><h2><strong>Gaining Reputation</strong></h2><p>Reputation with the Ashtongue Deathsworn is earned primarily through boss kills and clearing trash mobs within the <strong>Black Temple (BT)</strong> 25-player raid.</p><h3><strong>1. Black Temple Attunement</strong></h3><p>Before farming can begin, access to the raid must be secured. Our service handles the full attunement process, which varies depending on your chosen Shattrath faction:</p><ul><li><strong>The Aldor:</strong> Quest chain begins with <strong>Anchorite Ceyla</strong>.</li><li><strong>The Scryers:</strong> Quest chain begins with <strong>Arcanist Thelis</strong>.</li></ul><p>Our boosters will complete the entire lengthy questline, allowing your character entry into the Black Temple.</p><h3><strong>2. Weekly Raid Clears</strong></h3><p>Once attuned, reputation is gained by clearing the raid instance.</p><ul><li><strong>Reputation Per Clear:</strong> You gain approximately <strong>7,700 reputation</strong> per raid clear, depending on the number of trash mobs killed.</li><li><strong>Farming Strategy:</strong> Our professional raid teams secure a full clear each week, maximizing the reputation gained per lockout cycle to propel you to Exalted as quickly as possible.</li></ul><h2><strong>Reputation Rewards</strong></h2><p>The Quartermaster, <strong>Okuno</strong>, is located inside the Black Temple instance, immediately after defeating Supremus. Our service ensures you have the standing necessary to purchase all the most coveted rewards.</p><ul><li><strong>Exalted Trinkets:</strong> Unique, epic trinkets designed for every class, providing powerful utility or damage bonuses.</li><li><strong>Shadow Resistance Patterns:</strong> Recipes that allow crafters to create some of the game''s best Shadow Resistance armor pieces (available at Friendly and Honored).</li><li><strong>Gear &amp; Loot:</strong> While farming reputation, you also gain a high chance to obtain Tier 6 armor tokens, powerful weapons, and other epic loot drops from the bosses.</li></ul><h2><strong>Why Choose Our Ashtongue Deathsworn Boost</strong></h2><p>The Ashtongue Deathsworn reputation is an endgame hurdle that is gated by a difficult, multi-stage attunement and weekly raid lockouts. Misti.Services offers the most straightforward path:</p><ul><li><strong>Attunement Handled:</strong> We deal with the complex, multi-dungeon attunement questline regardless of your Aldor/Scryers alignment.</li><li><strong>Guaranteed Clears:</strong> Secure weekly raid clears by professional teams, ensuring consistent reputation gain until Exalted is reached.</li><li><strong>Unique Trinket Unlock:</strong> Guarantee access to your class''s unique, best-in-slot trinket upon completion.</li></ul><h3><strong>Service Includes</strong></h3><ul><li>Full Ashtongue Deathsworn reputation farm from your current standing up to <strong>Exalted</strong>.</li><li>Full completion of the <strong>Black Temple Attunement</strong> questline (Aldor or Scryers path).</li><li>Weekly <strong>Black Temple</strong> raid clears until Exalted status is achieved.</li><li>Guaranteed access to your class-specific <strong>Ashtongue Talisman</strong> at Exalted.</li></ul><p><strong>Don''t wait months for PUGs. Order your Ashtongue Deathsworn Boost and get your Black Temple gear today!</strong></p>', '<ul><li>Select your desired options and complete your order on&nbsp;Misti.Services.</li><li>You’ll receive an order confirmation and tracking number via email.</li><li>Our support manager will contact you through live chat to confirm all details.</li><li>If you’re unavailable, we’ll reach out via email or your preferred contact method.</li><li>When the boost is finished, you’ll receive a completion notification on Discord or another messenger of your choice.</li></ul>', '<ul><li><strong>Level 70</strong></li><li><strong>Active WoW Subscription</strong></li><li><strong>Black Temple Attunement</strong></li></ul>', 0, 'https://kdjlhibxxygfdmlvdfcl.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/game-images/ashtongue-deathsworn-1763586085897.webp', NULL, 4.9, 0, true, true, 0, '2025-11-19T20:22:34.779022+00:00', '2026-02-16T10:52:54.358744+00:00', '9464d1fe-6c00-412a-8ebb-896a4f575b4e', false, NULL, true, 0, '15 minutes', 'average start time', 'Flexible', 'order completion', 'Buy the Ashtongue Deathsworn Exalted boost! We complete the Black Temple Attunement and farm the raid for your unique class trinket and Shadow Resistance patterns.', 'Ashtongue Deathsworn reputation boost, Black Temple attunement boost, BT rep farm, Ashtongue Exalted, unique class trinkets, Shadow Resistance gear patterns, WoW TBC raid service, Anchorite Ceyla quest, Arcanist Thelis quest, Okuno quartermaster', 'https://kdjlhibxxygfdmlvdfcl.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/game-images/ashtongue-deathsworn-1763586085897.webp', NULL, 'Ashtongue Deathsworn', 'WoW TBC Ashtongue Rep Boost | misti.services', NULL);
