i>Access to Sha’tar rewards: rare and epic gear, profession recipes, Sha’tar Tabard, and more</li><li>Chance to obtain extra rare-quality loot for your class and spec</li><li>Account access (safe and handled by trusted Misti.Services boosters)</li></ul><h3><strong>Fastest Way to Reach Exalted With The Sha’tar</strong></h3><p>The Sha’tar faction, located in Shattrath City in Terokkar Forest, plays an important role in your Burning Crusade Classic progression. Reaching Exalted unlocks valuable rewards, including the Warpforged Key required for Tempest Keep Heroics.</p><p>Farming this reputation manually often requires several weeks. Our boosting team handles all necessary dungeon runs and reputation sources, completing Botanica, Mechanar, and Arcatraz efficiently.</p><p>Sit back and relax as we progress your character to Exalted and unlock every Sha’tar reward along the way.</p>', '<ul><li>Select your desired options and complete your order on&nbsp;Misti.Services.</li><li>You’ll receive an order confirmation and tracking number via email.</li><li>Our support manager will contact you through live chat to confirm all details.</li><li>If you’re unavailable, we’ll reach out via email or your preferred contact method.</li><li>When the boost is finished, you’ll receive a completion notification on Discord or another messenger of your choice.</li></ul>', '<ul><li>Level 70 character</li><li>Active WoW Subscription</li></ul><p><br></p>', 0, 'https://kdjlhibxxygfdmlvdfcl.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/game-images/the-shatar-1763075718694.webp', NULL, 4.9, 0, true, true, 0, '2025-11-13T22:56:33.577799+00:00', '2026-02-16T10:52:55.803826+00:00', '9464d1fe-6c00-412a-8ebb-896a4f575b4e', false, NULL, true, 0, '15 minutes', 'average start time', 'Flexible', 'order completion', 'Buy Sha’tar Reputation Farm Boost for WoW TBC Classic and reach Exalted fast to unlock the Warpforged Key and Tempest Keep Heroic attunement. Fast delivery, secure servic', 'sha''tar reputation boost, sha''tar exalted farm, tbc classic reputation boost, warpforged key boost, tempest keep heroic attunement, botanica rep farm, mechanar rep farm, arcatraz rep boost, wow tbc sha''tar service, misti services boosts, wow burning crusade rep farm, shattrath factions boost, wow tbc heroic attunement', 'https://kdjlhibxxygfdmlvdfcl.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/game-images/the-shatar-1763075718694.webp', NULL, 'The Shatar', 'Sha''tar Rep Boost WoW TBC Exalted | misti.services', NULL);
