pically requires a substantial time investment in farming 1600 Voidlight Marls, a specific currency dropped by rare enemies found across the challenging Midnight zones. Additionally, you must achieve Renown Rank 16 with the Hara’ti faction before you can even purchase this unique ride from the vendor Naynar in Harandar.</p><h3>Why Choose Our Service</h3><ul><li><p><strong>Time-Saving:</strong> Bypass the extensive and repetitive farming required to collect Voidlight Marls and Hara’ti Renown.</p></li><li><p><strong>Guaranteed Mount:</strong> Our experienced boosters ensure the successful acquisition of your Fierce Grimlynx mount.</p></li><li><p><strong>Professional Piloted Service:</strong> Experts will securely log into your account and complete all necessary objectives.</p></li><li><p><strong>Efficient Progression:</strong> We utilize optimal strategies to defeat rare bosses and gather resources quickly.</p></li></ul><p>Let misti.services handle the grind while you anticipate riding your new Fierce Grimlynx mount. Secure this exclusive cosmetic reward today and enhance your Midnight experience.</p>', '<ul><li><p><strong>Place Your Order:</strong> Select your desired service and complete the purchase on misti.services.</p></li><li><p><strong>Account Details:</strong> After your order is confirmed, our support team will contact you to arrange account access details. We prioritize your account security.</p></li><li><p><strong>Booster Assignment:</strong> A skilled and vetted Midnight booster is assigned to your order.</p></li><li><p><strong>Farming Begins:</strong> Our booster will diligently farm rare bosses in Midnight zones to collect 1600 Voidlight Marls and increase your Hara’ti Renown to Rank 16.</p></li><li><p><strong>Mount Acquisition:</strong> Once all prerequisites are met, the booster will purchase the Fierce Grimlynx mount.</p></li><li><p><strong>Completion Notification:</strong> You will be notified immediately upon service completion, and you can log back into your account to enjoy your new mount.</p></li></ul><p></p>', '<ul>
INSERT INTO public.products (id, name, slug, short_description, description, how_it_works, requirements, base_price, image_url, badge_text, trust_score, total_reviews, is_active, is_featured, sort_order, created_at, updated_at, category_id, is_slider_product, slider_config, is_manually_popular, total_sales, start_time_text, start_time_value, delivery_text, delivery_value, meta_description, meta_keywords, og_image, canonical_url, image_alt_text, meta_title, parent_link) VALUES ('f16d0753-d2b4-40e7-82a5-3d6c6d84e3e5', 'Keystone Hero', 'wow-keystone-hero-boost', 'Achieve the prestigious Keystone Hero during Midnight Season One. Conquer all Mythic 10+ dungeons with our expert team and earn exclusive rewards, powerful gear, and a unique mount.', '<h1><strong>WoW Midnight Keystone Hero Season One Boost</strong></h1><p>Conquer all Mythic+10 dungeons in World of Warcraft''s <a target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" href="https://www.wowhead.com/achievement=61256/midnight-keystone-master-season-one">Midnight Season One</a> with our reliable Keystone Hero boost. Secure the coveted Keystone Hero achievement, along with a seasonal mount, top-tier gear, and a high Mythic+ Rating, all handled by our skilled professional players.</p><h2><strong>Service Includes</strong></h2><ul><li><p><strong>Midnight Season 1 Mythic +10 Dungeons:</strong> Completion of all Mythic +10 dungeons within the time limit.</p></li><li><p><strong>Exclusive Mount &amp; Achievement:</strong> Receive the <a target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" href="https://www.wowhead.com/item=262620/calamitous-carrion">Calamitous Carrion</a> mount and the Midnight Keystone Master: Season One achievement.</p></li><li><p><strong>Mythic+ Rating:</strong> Your character will achieve at least 2500 Mythic+ Rating in Midnight Season 1.</p></li><li><p><strong>High-Level Gear:</strong> Obtain 259 ilvl Great Vault gear and 272 ilvl dungeon loot.</p></li><li><p><strong>Personal Teleport:</strong> Unlock the ability to teleport to every Midnight Season 1 Mythic Dungeon.</p></li></ul><h2><strong>About World of Warcraft Midnight Mythic+</strong></h2><p>Mythic+ dungeons in World of Warcraft offer challenging, scalable content that rewards players with some of the best gear and unique cosmetic items in the game. Achieving Keystone Hero status signifies mastery over the season''s most difficult dungeon encounters, requiring exceptional coordination, skill, and strategic play. Our service makes this prestigious accomplishment accessible to all players.</p><h3>Why Choose Our Service</h3><ul><li><p><strong>Expert Teams:</strong> Play alongside seasoned WoW professionals who know every dungeon layout and boss mechanic.</p></li><li><p><strong>Fast Completion:</strong> Our teams work efficiently to complete your service quickly, often within 16-24 hours after a 15-20 minute start time.</p></li><li><p><strong>Secure &amp; Private:</strong> We prioritize your account security with VPN usage for piloted options and offer self-play for maximum control.</p></li><li><p><strong>Valuable Rewards:</strong> Beyond the achievement, you''ll gain powerful gear, an exclusive mount, and a high M+ score.</p></li><li><p><strong>Flexible Options:</strong> Choose between self-play, piloted, or the secure self-play remote method to suit your preference.</p></li></ul><p>Experience the pinnacle of Mythic+ success with misti.services. Our commitment to quality and customer satisfaction ensures a smooth and rewarding journey to Keystone Hero. Purchase your boost today and elevate your World of Warcraft Midnight experience.</p>', '<ul><li><p><strong>Select Your Options:</strong> Choose your preferred completion method (Self-play, Piloted, or Self-play Remote) and any additional speed options.</p></li><li><p><strong>Secure Payment:</strong> Complete your purchase through our secure payment gateway.</p></li><li><p><strong>Contact &amp; Schedule:</strong> Our support team will reach out promptly to confirm your order and schedule the service at your convenience.</p><ol><li><p><strong>Service Execution:</strong></p></li></ol></li><li><p><strong>Piloted:</strong> Our professional booster logs into your account using a VPN to match your location and completes the dungeons.</p></li><li><p><strong>Self-play:</strong> You will join our team at the scheduled time and play alongside them through the dungeons.</p></li><li><p><strong>Self-play Remote:</strong> Our booster remotely accesses your game client on your system, allowing you to observe all actions in real-time without sharing credentials.</p></li><li><p><strong>Enjoy Your Rewards:</strong> Once the service is complete, you will receive all the promised achievements, gear, and reputation.</p></li></ul><p></p>', '<ul>
INSERT INTO public.products (id, name, slug, short_description, description, how_it_works, requirements, base_price, image_url, badge_text, trust_score, total_reviews, is_active, is_featured, sort_order, created_at, updated_at, category_id, is_slider_product, slider_config, is_manually_popular, total_sales, start_time_text, start_time_value, delivery_text, delivery_value, meta_description, meta_keywords, og_image, canonical_url, image_alt_text, meta_title, parent_link) VALUES ('4f224d4d-99b0-4c86-b26b-4b9158ad9191', 'Giganto Manis', 'giganto-manis-mount-boost-midnight', 'Secure the majestic Giganto Manis mount in Midnight without the grind. Our professional service handles all Glory of the Midnight Delver meta-achievement objectives for you.', '<h1><strong>Giganto Manis Mount Boost</strong></h1><p>Unlock the prestigious Giganto Manis mount in Midnight with our efficient boosting service. This exclusive ground mount is awarded for mastering the challenging Glory of the Midnight Delver meta-achievement, which involves completing numerous delve-related tasks and defeating powerful bosses. Let misti.services help you add this magnificent pangolin to your collection effortlessly.</p><h2><strong>Service Includes</strong></h2><ul><li><p><strong>Giganto Manis Ground Mount:</strong> Acquire this rare and impressive mount for your collection.</p></li><li><p><a target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" href="https://www.wowhead.com/beta/achievement=61906/glory-of-the-midnight-delver"><strong>Glory of the Midnight Delver</strong></a><strong>:</strong> Successfully complete the comprehensive meta-achievement.</p></li><li><p><strong>Delve Currencies:</strong> Opportunity to earn various delve-specific currencies during the boost.</p></li><li><p><strong>All Loot Acquired:</strong> Keep any valuable items, gear, or resources obtained throughout the service.</p></li></ul><h2><strong>About the Giganto Manis Mount</strong></h2><p>The Giganto Manis is a highly sought-after ground mount from the Midnight expansion, representing a significant accomplishment within the game''s new Delve system. Earning it requires dedicated effort across multiple facets of Delve content, including progressing unique storylines, discovering hidden secrets, and conquering formidable seasonal Nemesis bosses, all while developing your companion. It''s a true symbol of a seasoned Delver.</p><h3>Why Choose Our Service</h3><ul><li><p><strong>Time-Saving:</strong> Skip countless hours of repetitive farming and delve progression.</p></li><li><p><strong>Guaranteed Achievement:</strong> Our experienced boosters ensure the successful completion of the meta-achievement.</p></li><li><p><strong>Expert Players:</strong> Rely on skilled gamers who understand the most efficient strategies for Delve content.</p></li><li><p><strong>Flexible Play Options:</strong> Choose between Self-Play for a cooperative experience or Piloted mode for maximum convenience.</p></li></ul><p>Trust misti.services to deliver a smooth and secure path to your new Giganto Manis mount, allowing you to enjoy the rewards without the stress of the grind. Elevate your Midnight experience today.</p>', '<ul><li><p><strong>Select Your Options:</strong> Choose your preferred play mode (Self-Play or Piloted) and any additional services like gold or stream.</p></li><li><p><strong>Secure Purchase:</strong> Complete your order through our secure payment system.</p></li><li><p><strong>Schedule or Assign:</strong> For Piloted mode, we will arrange a convenient time for our booster to access your account. For Self-Play, we''ll coordinate session times.</p></li><li><p><strong>Service Completion:</strong> Our professional team will efficiently complete all necessary objectives for the Glory of the Midnight Delver achievement.</p></li><li><p><strong>Mount Unlocked:</strong> Once the meta-achievement is complete, the Giganto Manis mount will be yours.</p></li></ul><p></p>', '<ul>
INSERT INTO public.products (id, name, slug, short_description, description, how_it_works, requirements, base_price, image_url, badge_text, trust_score, total_reviews, is_active, is_featured, sort_order, created_at, updated_at, category_id, is_slider_product, slider_config, is_manually_popular, total_sales, start_time_text, start_time_value, delivery_text, delivery_value, meta_description, meta_keywords, og_image, canonical_url, image_alt_text, meta_title, parent_link) VALUES ('bb061112-83d1-4302-a74e-5e9e86d8bd0a', 'Mythic +0 ', 'wow-mythic-0-dungeon-boost', 'Conquer all eight Midnight Mythic 0 dungeons with our expert team, securing valuable starter gear and preparing you for Mythic+ Season One without the hassle.', '<h1><strong>WoW Midnight Mythic +0 8/8 Dungeon Boost</strong></h1><p>Acquire your essential starter gear and clear all eight challenging Midnight Mythic 0 dungeons efficiently with our professional WoW Midnight boost. This service ensures a smooth experience, bypassing the frustrations of uncoordinated groups and directly preparing you for the upcoming Mythic+ Season One in Midnight.</p><h2><strong>Service Includes</strong></h2><ul><li><p><strong>Full Dungeon Clear:</strong> Completion of all 8 Midnight Mythic +0 dungeons, or specific dungeons you select.</p></li><li><p><strong>Gear Acquisition:</strong> Opportunities to obtain 246 ilvl dungeon gear.</p></li><li><p><strong>Great Vault Rewards:</strong> Eligibility for 256 ilvl gear from your Great Vault.</p></li><li><p><strong>Crests:</strong> Valuable crests for upgrading your newly acquired equipment.</p></li><li><p><strong>Achievements:</strong> All associated dungeon achievements earned during the service.</p></li><li><p><strong>Bonus Resources:</strong> Various materials and resources collected throughout the dungeon runs.</p></li></ul><h2><strong>About WoW Midnight Mythic +0 Dungeons</strong></h2><p>Midnight Mythic 0 dungeons are an excellent starting point for new content, offering a good challenge and foundational gear to prepare players for higher-tier Mythic+ difficulties. Clearing these eight dungeons provides a comprehensive overview of the expansion''s initial encounters and a solid gear base to build upon.</p><h3>Why Choose Our Service</h3><ul><li><p><strong>Expert Teams:</strong> Our seasoned PvE specialists ensure quick and flawless dungeon completions.</p></li><li><p><strong>Time Efficiency:</strong> Avoid common LFG pitfalls and group wipes, saving you valuable playtime.</p></li><li><p><strong>Guaranteed Rewards:</strong> Secure your desired gear and achievements with professional assistance.</p></li><li><p><strong>Flexible Options:</strong> Choose between self-play, piloted, or the secure self-play remote method to suit your preference.</p></li><li><p><strong>Season One Preparation:</strong> Get fully geared and ready for the intensive Mythic+ Season One with ease.</p></li></ul><p>Trust misti.services to elevate your World of Warcraft Midnight experience. Our reliable and skilled teams are ready to help you achieve your in-game goals efficiently and effectively.</p>', '<ul><li><p><strong>Select Your Options:</strong> Choose between clearing all 8 dungeons or specific ones, and your preferred completion method (Self-Play, Piloted, or Self-Play Remote).</p></li><li><p><strong>Schedule Your Boost:</strong> For Self-Play, coordinate a convenient time with our support team.</p></li><li><p><strong>Account Piloted (if chosen):</strong> If Piloted, our professional booster will securely log into your account using a Premium VPN.</p></li><li><p><strong>Self-Play Remote (if chosen):</strong> You will observe our pro player securely accessing your game through trusted remote software on your system, maintaining full oversight.</p></li><li><p><strong>Join the Team (if Self-Play):</strong> At the agreed time, join our skilled team in-game and be summoned to the dungeon entrance.</p></li><li><p><strong>Enjoy Your Rewards:</strong> After successful completion, collect all your new gear, achievements, and resources.</p></li></ul><p></p>', '<ul>
INSERT INTO public.products (id, name, slug, short_description, description, how_it_works, requirements, base_price, image_url, badge_text, trust_score, total_reviews, is_active, is_featured, sort_order, created_at, updated_at, category_id, is_slider_product, slider_config, is_manually_popular, total_sales, start_time_text, start_time_value, delivery_text, delivery_value, meta_description, meta_keywords, og_image, canonical_url, image_alt_text, meta_title, parent_link) VALUES ('94229ad5-33a1-48de-843d-c55950722b8e', 'Keystone Master', 'wow-keystone-master', 'Achieve Keystone Master in WoW Midnight Season One with our reliable boost service, securing an exclusive seasonal mount and a significantly improved Mythic+ rating.', '<h1><strong>WoW Midnight Keystone Master Season One Boost</strong></h1><p>Elevate your World of Warcraft experience with our <a target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" href="https://www.wowhead.com/achievement=61256/midnight-keystone-master-season-one">Midnight Keystone Master Season One</a> boost. This premium service is designed to help you conquer the latest Mythic+ challenges, securing the coveted Keystone Master achievement and an exclusive seasonal mount. Our expert players will guide you through dungeons, ensuring a smooth and successful run to boost your Mythic+ rating.</p><h2><strong>Service Includes</strong></h2><ul><li><p><strong>Exclusive Mount:</strong> Obtain the unique<a target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" href="https://www.wowhead.com/item=262620/calamitous-carrion"> Calamitous Carrion</a> mount, a prestigious reward for conquering Midnight Season One''s Mythic+ content.</p></li><li><p><strong>Keystone Master Achievement:</strong> Earn the "Midnight Keystone Master: Season One" achievement, showcasing your prowess in high-level dungeons.</p></li><li><p><strong>Mythic+ Rating:</strong> Achieve a minimum of 2000 Mythic+ Rating on your character, significantly boosting your standing and unlocking further gameplay opportunities.</p></li><li><p><strong>Potential Gear Upgrades:</strong> A chance to receive item level 259 gear from each completed dungeon, along with a guaranteed item level 269 piece from your weekly Great Vault.</p></li></ul><h2><strong>About WoW Midnight Keystone Master</strong></h2><p>The Keystone Master achievement in WoW Midnight Season One is more than just a title; it''s a mark of significant accomplishment within the game''s challenging Mythic+ system. Beyond the visible rewards like a new mount and enhanced RIO score, completing KSM allows for substantial character gearing. Our service offers the flexibility to divide your boost into multiple sessions, maximizing your opportunities for Great Vault rewards and optimal gear acquisition.</p><h3>Why Choose Our Service</h3><ul><li><p><strong>Experienced Team:</strong> Play with highly skilled and coordinated professional players who know the dungeons inside and out.</p></li><li><p><strong>Guaranteed Completion:</strong> We ensure you achieve the Keystone Master Season One achievement and associated rewards.</p></li><li><p><strong>Flexible Scheduling:</strong> Our team works around your availability to provide a convenient and efficient boosting experience.</p></li><li><p><strong>Valuable Loot and Rating:</strong> Boost your character''s power with high-ilvl gear and significantly improve your Mythic+ rating.</p></li><li><p><strong>Secure and Reliable:</strong> Our services prioritize your account''s safety and privacy throughout the boosting process.</p></li></ul><p>Choose misti.services for a professional, efficient, and secure path to securing your WoW Midnight Keystone Master Season One rewards and enjoying the pinnacle of Mythic+ success.</p>', '<ul><li><p><strong>Select Your Options:</strong> Choose your preferred completion method (Piloted, Selfplay, or Selfplay Remote) and any additional extras.</p></li><li><p><strong>Place Your Order:</strong> Complete the purchase securely through our website.</p></li><li><p><strong>Contact Us:</strong> Our team will contact you promptly after your purchase to discuss scheduling and any necessary account details.</p></li><li><p><strong>Service Execution:</strong> Our professional players will begin the boost according to the agreed-upon schedule and method.</p></li><li><p><strong>Enjoy Your Rewards:</strong> Once the service is complete, you will receive all the promised Keystone Master Season One achievements and rewards.</p></li></ul><p></p>', '<ul>
INSERT INTO public.products (id, name, slug, short_description, description, how_it_works, requirements, base_price, image_url, badge_text, trust_score, total_reviews, is_active, is_featured, sort_order, created_at, updated_at, category_id, is_slider_product, slider_config, is_manually_popular, total_sales, start_time_text, start_time_value, delivery_text, delivery_value, meta_description, meta_keywords, og_image, canonical_url, image_alt_text, meta_title, parent_link) VALUES ('44ba9ead-093b-4d81-bf68-22b0becd5f02', 'Chaos Orbs', 'chaos-orbs', 'Enhance your Path of Exile 2 crafting and trading instantly with Chaos Orbs. Acquire any quantity of Normal, Greater, or Perfect Chaos Orbs for immediate in-game delivery, optimizing your build and saving valuable time.', '<h1><strong>PoE 2 Chaos Orbs</strong></h1><p>Acquire any amount of Path of Exile 2 Chaos Orbs through misti.services to fuel your crafting and trading needs. These essential currency items allow you to re-roll modifiers on rare gear, providing a crucial advantage for optimizing your character builds at every stage of your adventure.</p><p>Skip the arduous grind and secure your supply of Chaos Orbs, including Normal, Greater, and Perfect variants, to ensure you always have the resources required for progression and a thriving in-game economy.</p><h2><strong>Service Includes</strong></h2><ul><li><strong>Any Quantity:</strong> Receive your desired amount of Path of Exile 2 Chaos Orbs (Normal, Greater, or Perfect).</li><li><strong>Instant Delivery:</strong> Enjoy swift and secure in-game delivery directly to your character.</li><li><strong>Rare Item Rerolls:</strong> Utilize these orbs to re-roll random modifiers on rare items, seeking optimal stats.</li><li><strong>Crafting Essential:</strong> Access a fundamental currency for all stages of item crafting and optimization.</li><li><strong>Flexible Trading:</strong> Leverage Chaos Orbs as a primary medium of exchange in the player-driven economy.</li><li><strong>Time Savings:</strong> Bypass endless farming, dedicating more time to gameplay and progression.</li><li><strong>Secure Transactions:</strong> Benefit from trusted service with a focus on account safety.</li></ul><h2><strong>About Path of Exile 2 Chaos Orbs</strong></h2><p>Chaos Orbs are a cornerstone currency in the world of Path of Exile 2, renowned for their versatility and importance in item modification and trade. Their primary function lies in their ability to completely re-roll the modifiers on a rare item, transforming its properties and creating new opportunities for character power spikes. This makes them indispensable tools for any player looking to refine their gear and push their builds to the next level.</p><p>Beyond crafting, Chaos Orbs also serve as a widely accepted form of exchange within Path of Exile 2''s robust player economy. Understanding their different tiers—Normal, Greater, and Perfect—is key to mastering both crafting and trading. While Normal Chaos Orbs are relatively common, Greater and Perfect versions offer increasingly powerful and consistent results, making them highly sought after for high-end optimization.</p><h3><strong>Why Choose Our Service</strong></h3><ul><li><strong>Guaranteed Quantity:</strong> Obtain the precise number of Chaos Orbs you need, without reliance on random drops.</li><li><strong>Multiple Variants Available:</strong> Choose from Normal, Greater, or Perfect Chaos Orbs to suit your specific crafting requirements.</li><li><strong>Fast &amp; Safe Delivery:</strong> Our service ensures prompt and secure in-game delivery for your peace of mind.</li><li><strong>Skip the Grind:</strong> Avoid the extensive and often unrewarding process of farming Chaos Orbs yourself.</li><li><strong>Enhance Your Gameplay:</strong> Focus on enjoying the rich content of Path of Exile 2, powered by superior gear.</li><li><strong>Expert Support:</strong> Our team is ready to assist you through every step of the process, ensuring a smooth experience.</li></ul><p>At misti.services, we understand the value of your time and the importance of having the right resources in Path of Exile 2. Our Chaos Orb delivery service is designed to provide you with a convenient, reliable, and secure way to acquire this vital currency, empowering your crafting endeavors and trading ventures. Choose misti.services for a seamless path to power and progression.</p>', '<ul><li><strong>Place Your Order:</strong> Select the desired quantity and type of Path of Exile 2 Chaos Orbs and complete your purchase.</li><li><strong>Confirmation:</strong> A misti.services manager will contact you shortly via chat or email to confirm your order details.</li><li><strong>In-Game Trade:</strong> Our booster will add you in-game and initiate a secure trade.</li><li><strong>Receive Orbs:</strong> For security, place any rare item into the trade window. You will then receive your Chaos Orbs instantly.</li><li><strong>Enjoy:</strong> Utilize your new Chaos Orbs to craft, trade, and dominate in Path of Exile 2.</li></ul>', '<ul><li><strong>Path of Exile 2 Account:</strong> You must have an active Path of Exile 2 account.</li><li><strong>In-Game Item:</strong> Provide any rare (not unique or magic) item to facilitate a safe in-game trade.</li><li><strong>Communication:</strong> Be available for in-game communication to coordinate the trade.</li></ul>', 0, 'https://kdjlhibxxygfdmlvdfcl.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/game-images/chaos-orbs-1767552777165.webp', NULL, 4.9, 0, true, true, 0, '2026-01-02T20:51:52.769079+00:00', '2026-02-17T10:09:46.078303+00:00', '82b5f114-f1d2-41a5-9f5a-d02323795dfc', true, '{"step":1,"max_value":10000,"min_value":1,"slider_type":"single","value_label":"Chaos Orbs","default_value":100,"pricing_brackets":[{"end":10000,"price":0.000534,"start":1}],"estimated_time_per_step":0}', true, 0, '15 minutes', 'average start time', 'Flexible', 'order completion', 'Buy Path of Exile 2 Chaos Orbs for instant delivery. Get any amount of Normal, Greater, or Perfect Chaos Orbs to optimize your crafting and trading.', 'poe 2 chaos orb buy, poe 2 chaos orb price, poe 2 currency, poe 2 crafting orbs, poe 2 orbs, path of exile 2 chaos orbs, buy poe 2 currency, poe 2 normal chaos orb, poe 2 greater chaos orb, poe 2 perfect chaos orb, poe 2 item reroll, poe 2 trade currency, poe 2 services, fast poe 2 delivery, poe 2 currency service, poe 2 item crafting, poe 2 rare items, poe 2 gear optimization, poe 2 currency trade, poe 2 items for sale', 'https://kdjlhibxxygfdmlvdfcl.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/game-images/chaos-orbs-1767552777165.webp', NULL, 'Chaos Orbs', 'Buy PoE 2 Chaos Orbs | Safely Delivered at misti.services', NULL);
INSERT INTO public.products (id, name, slug, short_description, description, how_it_works, requirements, base_price, image_url, badge_text, trust_score, total_reviews, is_active, is_featured, sort_order, created_at, updated_at, category_id, is_slider_product, slider_config, is_manually_popular, total_sales, start_time_text, start_time_value, delivery_text, delivery_value, meta_description, meta_keywords, og_image, canonical_url, image_alt_text, meta_title, parent_link) VALUES ('17881791-5e05-4a90-9aa3-c7b21669edf8', 'Dreamrift Normal', 'midnight-dreamrift-normal-raid-boost', 'Conquer the Dreamrift Normal raid in Midnight with our swift carry service. Secure your Chimaerus kill and initial season rewards without the hassle.', '<h1><strong>Midnight Dreamrift Normal Raid Boost</strong></h1><p>Jumpstart your season in Midnight with a guaranteed victory over Chimaerus in the Dreamrift Normal raid. Our professional boosting team offers a reliable and convenient way to clear this encounter, helping you bypass the common frustrations of group finding and scheduling, and setting you up with essential early-game rewards.</p><h2><strong>Service Includes</strong></h2><ul><li><p><strong>Chimaerus Defeated:</strong> A guaranteed Normal mode kill of Chimaerus, the Undreamt God.</p></li><li><p><strong>Gear Chance:</strong> Opportunities to acquire valuable Champion gear drops from the encounter.</p></li><li><p><strong>Raid Knowledge:</strong> Experience the fight mechanics executed flawlessly by a skilled team.</p></li></ul><h2><strong>About Midnight Dreamrift Normal Raid</strong></h2><p>Dreamrift Normal is the introductory difficulty of the challenging Chimaerus raid in Midnight. While the rewards on this difficulty might not be top-tier, clearing it is crucial for early-season progression, familiarizing yourself with mechanics, and setting a solid foundation for more difficult content. It''s an excellent way to gear up, learn the encounter flow, or simply enjoy a streamlined raiding experience without commitment.</p><h3>Why Choose Our Service</h3><ul><li><p><strong>Effortless Completion:</strong> Avoid the time-consuming process of forming groups, dealing with PUGs, or strict guild schedules.</p></li><li><p><strong>Professional Team:</strong> Be carried by experienced players who ensure a smooth and efficient raid clear.</p></li><li><p><strong>Flexible Scheduling:</strong> Select a convenient time slot that fits your personal gaming schedule.</p></li><li><p><strong>Early Season Advantage:</strong> Secure initial gear and progress without delay, putting you ahead in the new season.</p></li><li><p><strong>Learning Opportunity:</strong> Observe top-tier gameplay and learn the Chimaerus fight mechanics firsthand.</p></li></ul><p>Opt for the Midnight Dreamrift Normal Raid Boost from misti.services and experience a hassle-free, rewarding raid completion designed for your convenience and progression.</p>', '<ul><li><p><strong>Choose Your Option:</strong> Select your preferred region and boost mode (Self-Play or Piloted).</p></li><li><p><strong>Schedule Your Run:</strong> Pick a convenient time slot from our available schedule.</p></li><li><p><strong>Complete Purchase:</strong> Finalize your order securely through our platform.</p></li><li><p><strong>Join the Raid (Self-Play):</strong> At the designated time, you will receive an invite to the raid group. Simply participate and ensure you tag the boss for rewards.</p></li><li><p><strong>Account Piloting (Piloted):</strong> If you choose Piloted, our booster will log into your account at the scheduled time to complete the raid.</p></li><li><p><strong>Collect Rewards:</strong> Once Chimaerus is defeated and loot is distributed, your service is complete. Enjoy your new gear and progression!</p></li></ul><p></p>', '<ul>
