smetic items that showcase your dedication. The Shades of the Row offer some of the game''s most sought-after rewards, but accumulating enough reputation points can be a significant time commitment, often involving repeated daily quests and specific activities that quickly become repetitive.</p><h2>Why Choose Our Service</h2><ul><li><p><strong>Time-Saving:</strong> Skip the repetitive grind and reclaim your valuable gaming time for other activities.</p></li><li><p><strong>Guaranteed Progress:</strong> Our experienced boosters ensure consistent and efficient reputation gains.</p></li><li><p><strong>Unlock Exclusive Rewards:</strong> Gain access to exclusive cosmetic items, housing decorations, and crafting recipes from the Shades of the Row.</p></li><li><p><strong>Secure and Reliable:</strong> All services are performed by skilled professionals in a piloted mode, ensuring account safety and discretion.</p></li></ul><p>Let misti.services handle the grind so you can focus on enjoying the rewards. Secure your Midnight Shades of the Row Reputation Carry today and enhance your gameplay experience.</p>', '<ul><li><p><strong>Select Your Desired Reputation:</strong> Use the slider to choose your current and target Shades of the Row reputation levels.</p></li><li><p><strong>Place Your Order:</strong> Complete the secure checkout process.</p></li><li><p><strong>We Contact You:</strong> A misti.services team member will reach out within 15-30 minutes to confirm details and schedule the service.</p></li><li><p><strong>Piloted Service Begins:</strong> Our professional booster logs into your account and begins farming reputation until your desired level is achieved.</p></li><li><p><strong>Enjoy Your Rewards:</strong> Once the service is complete, you will be notified, and you can access all your new faction rewards and items.</p></li></ul><p></p>', '<ul><li><p><strong>Active Subscription:</strong> A valid World of Warcraft subscription is required.</p></li><li><p><strong>Character Level:</strong> Your character must be level 90.</p></li></ul><p></p>', 0, NULL, NULL, 4.9, 0, true, true, 0, '2026-02-12T22:36:31.561236+00:00', '2026-02-12T22:46:11.882458+00:00', '312870ae-4c42-440f-8510-5704a1c5f333', true, '{"step":1,"end_label":"Desired Rank","max_value":6,"min_value":1,"default_end":6,"start_label":"Current Rank","default_start":1,"pricing_brackets":[{"end":3,"price":89,"start":1},{"end":6,"price":229,"start":4}],"estimated_time_per_step":5}', true, 0, '15 minutes', 'average start time', 'Flexible', 'order completion', 'Buy Midnight Shades of the Row Reputation Carry and reach Luminary rank. Unlock exclusive cosmetics and enchanting formulas fast with our professional boost.', 'midnight shades of the row reputation buy, midnight reputation boost, shades of the row carry, midnight reputation price, luminary rank boost midnight, midnight rep farm, midnight services, wow midnight reputation, gaming service, fast delivery, professional, reliable, secure, boosting, carry, account, safe, trusted', NULL, NULL, 'Midnight Shades of the Row Reputation Boost', 'Midnight Shades of the Row Reputation Carry | misti.services', NULL);
INSERT INTO public.products (id, name, slug, short_description, description, how_it_works, requirements, base_price, image_url, badge_text, trust_score, total_reviews, is_active, is_featured, sort_order, created_at, updated_at, category_id, is_slider_product, slider_config, is_manually_popular, total_sales, start_time_text, start_time_value, delivery_text, delivery_value, meta_description, meta_keywords, og_image, canonical_url, image_alt_text, meta_title, parent_link) VALUES ('85cb5f96-d256-4a8f-805d-875c263d1bd3', 'Unbound Star-Eater', 'unbound-star-eater', 'The Unbound Star-Eater was introduced in Season 3 of The War Within as the "Mythic" mount. Currently, the mount has a 100% drop rate (dropping 2 mounts per raid group) for defeating the final boss on Mythic', '<h1><strong>Unbound Star-Eater Mount Boost</strong></h1><p><strong>Own the cosmos. Defeat Mythic Dimensius and secure the most prestigious Void Dragon in The War Within.</strong></p><p>The <strong>Unbound Star-Eater</strong> is the ultimate status symbol in Patch 11.2. With its glowing cosmic scales and a chest that houses a singularity, this Void Dragon is the exclusive reward for defeating <strong>Dimensius, the All-Devouring</strong>, the final boss of the <strong>Manaforge Omega</strong> raid on <strong>Mythic difficulty</strong>.</p><p>Mythic raiding is the pinnacle of PvE content, requiring months of progression, perfect coordination, and a top-tier guild. For most players, this content is inaccessible. With <strong>misti.services</strong>, you do not need a guild or months of wipes. Our elite raiding team will carry you through the final encounter, securing the kill and the mount guaranteed before the season ends and the drop rate plummets to 1%.</p><h2><strong>Service Includes</strong></h2><p>When you purchase the <strong>Unbound Star-Eater Carry</strong>, you are booking a spot in a top-tier Mythic raid. The service guarantees:</p><ul><li><strong>The Mount:</strong> Unbound Star-Eater (Guaranteed drop).</li><li><strong>The Kill:</strong> Defeat of <strong>Dimensius, the All-Devouring</strong> on <strong>Mythic difficulty</strong>.</li><li><strong>The Title:</strong> The prestigious title <strong>Void Vanquisher</strong>.</li><li><strong>Achievements:</strong> <strong>Cutting Edge: Dimensius, the All-Devouring</strong> (Feat of Strength) and the standard Mythic achievement.</li><li><strong>High-Tier Loot:</strong> A chance to loot <strong>717 ilvl gear</strong> from the boss.</li><li><strong>Upgrade Currency:</strong> <strong>Gilded Ethereal Crests</strong> and <strong>Valorstones</strong> for upgrading your gear.</li></ul><h2><strong>About Unbound Star-Eater Service</strong></h2><p>The Unbound Star-Eater was introduced in Season 3 of <em>The War Within</em> as the "Mythic" mount. Currently, the mount has a <strong>100% drop rate</strong> (dropping 2 mounts per raid group) for defeating the final boss on Mythic. However, once the next expansion or pre-patch arrives, this drop rate will be nerfed to a frustrating 1%, making it nearly impossible to farm.</p><p><strong>Why buy this boost now?</strong></p><ul><li><strong>Guaranteed Acquisition:</strong> By booking now, you remove the RNG. You get the mount 100%.</li><li><strong>Cutting Edge:</strong> You earn the Feat of Strength achievement which is only available during the current season.</li><li><strong>Skip the Wipes:</strong> Manaforge Omega on Mythic is unforgiving. Our boosters are among the best in the world, ensuring a smooth and quick execution of the boss mechanics so you get your rewards without the stress.</li></ul><h2><strong>Boost Options Explained</strong></h2><p>We offer flexible and secure ways to deliver your mount:</p><ul><li><strong>Selfplay (Recommended):</strong> You log into your own character and join our raid group. You will witness the fight firsthand. You must tag the boss at least once to receive the loot. You can choose to participate in the fight mechanics or die early to watch safely—our raid leader will instruct you.</li><li><strong>Piloted:</strong> Our professional player logs into your account using a <strong>VPN matching your country</strong> to ensure safety. They complete the encounter while you are offline.</li><li><strong>Remote Control:</strong> For maximum security, our booster connects to your PC via a secure app like <strong>Parsec</strong>. They play using your mouse and keyboard while you watch the screen live. No account sharing is required.</li></ul>', '<ul><li><strong>Select Options:</strong> Choose your boost method (Piloted, Selfplay, or Remote).</li><li><strong>Order Placed:</strong> After payment, you will receive an order ID and email confirmation.</li><li><strong>Contact:</strong> Our support manager will reach out via Live Chat or Discord to schedule your raid slot.</li><li><strong>The Boost:</strong></li><li><em>For Selfplay:</em> You receive an in-game invite at the scheduled time. You are summoned to the boss.</li><li><em>For Piloted/Remote:</em> Our booster logs in or connects to your PC to perform the kill.</li><li><strong>Execution:</strong> We defeat Mythic Dimensius. You loot the mount and receive your achievements.</li><li><strong>Completion:</strong> We notify you immediately via your preferred messenger.</li></ul>', '<ul><li><strong>Level:</strong> Level 80 Character.</li><li><strong>Expansion:</strong> The War Within active.</li><li><strong>Account:</strong> Active World of Warcraft subscription.</li><li><strong>Cooldown:</strong> A fresh Mythic raid lockout for the current week (if applicable).</li></ul>', 65, 'https://kdjlhibxxygfdmlvdfcl.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/game-images/unbound-star-eater-1763929615396.webp', NULL, 4.9, 0, true, true, 0, '2025-11-22T19:06:53.323818+00:00', '2026-02-11T21:39:29.049925+00:00', 'b4c0ccaf-a937-4b30-9ab4-7dacee8f739b', false, NULL, true, 0, '15 minutes', 'average start time', 'Flexible', 'order completion', 'Easily defeat the Mythic Manaforge Omega final boss and snag one of the game’s most stunning mounts with the Unbound Star‑Eater Boost. Grab it now!', 'unbound star eater mount boost, buy unbound star eater, wow mythic mount, war within season 3 mount, unbound star eater boost, mythic star eater carry, wow mythic raid mount, the war within mythic, 100% drop rate mount, unbound star eater service, fast unbound star eater, wow rare mount, star eater mythic drop, war within mount farm', 'https://kdjlhibxxygfdmlvdfcl.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/game-images/unbound-star-eater-1763929615396.webp', NULL, 'Game gaming service - Unbound Star Eater', 'War Within Unbound Star-Eater Mount | misti.services', NULL);
INSERT INTO public.products (id, name, slug, short_description, description, how_it_works, requirements, base_price, image_url, badge_text, trust_score, total_reviews, is_active, is_featured, sort_order, created_at, updated_at, category_id, is_slider_product, slider_config, is_manually_popular, total_sales, start_time_text, start_time_value, delivery_text, delivery_value, meta_description, meta_keywords, og_image, canonical_url, image_alt_text, meta_title, parent_link) VALUES ('fe2c4393-8783-4518-bb86-e6e95bc18db4', 'Serpentshrine Cavern Attunement', 'serpentshrine-cavern-attunement', 'Serpentshrine Cavern (SSC) is a 25-man raid instance located in Zangarmarsh. Gaining access to this raid is one of the most complex attunement processes in The Burning Crusade Classic, requiring the player to defeat bosses in two different raids (Karazhan and Gruul''s Lair) and venture into Heroic dungeons.', '<h1><strong>Serpentshrine Cavern (SSC) Attunement Boost – WoW TBC Classic</strong></h1><p>Struggling to find a raid group capable of summoning and defeating Nightbane? Can''t get a spot for Gruul the Dragonkiller? Misti.Services offers a fast, secure, and professional <strong>Serpentshrine Cavern Attunement Boost</strong>. We handle the complex, multi-stage quest chains involving Heroic dungeons and multiple raids to grant you permanent access to Lady Vashj''s lair.</p><p>Our expert boosters manage the entire <strong>Cudgel of Kar''desh</strong> questline, including the tedious <strong>Blackened Urn</strong> chain and the required raid boss kills, ensuring you are raid-ready for Phase 2 content.</p><h2><strong>Overview</strong></h2><p><strong>Serpentshrine Cavern (SSC)</strong> is a 25-man raid instance located in Zangarmarsh. Gaining access to this raid is one of the most complex attunement processes in <em>The Burning Crusade Classic</em>, requiring the player to defeat bosses in two different raids (<strong>Karazhan</strong> and <strong>Gruul''s Lair</strong>) and venture into Heroic dungeons.</p><p>The primary hurdle for most players is the <strong>Nightbane</strong> requirement, which demands a long prerequisite quest chain just to summon the boss. Our service bypasses these headaches entirely.</p><h2><strong>The Attunement Process</strong></h2><p>The SSC attunement is a test of endurance, requiring specific keys and raid coordination. Our service covers every step of <strong>The Cudgel of Kar''desh</strong> questline.</p><h3><strong>1. Quest Pickup (Heroic Slave Pens)</strong></h3><ul><li><strong>Prerequisite:</strong> You must have the <strong>Reservoir Key</strong> (Heroic Slave Pens access).</li><li><strong>The Step:</strong> We enter <strong>The Slave Pens (Heroic)</strong>, clear to the first boss, and speak to <strong>Skar''this the Heretic</strong> to accept <em>The Cudgel of Kar''desh</em>. This quest requires two signets: <strong>Earthen</strong> and <strong>Blazing</strong>.</li></ul><h3><strong>2. The Earthen Signet (Gruul''s Lair)</strong></h3><ul><li><strong>The Step:</strong> We take your character into a <strong>Gruul''s Lair</strong> 25-man raid.</li><li><strong>The Kill:</strong> We defeat <strong>Gruul the Dragonkiller</strong> and loot the <strong>Earthen Signet</strong>.</li></ul><h3><strong>3. The Blazing Signet (Nightbane Chain)</strong></h3><p>This is the most difficult part of the attunement. To get the Blazing Signet, you must summon and kill <strong>Nightbane</strong> in Karazhan.</p><ul><li><strong>Unlock Chain:</strong> If you do not have the <strong>Blackened Urn</strong> (summoning item), we complete the entire prerequisite chain:</li><li class="ql-indent-1"><em>Medivh''s Journal</em> &amp; <em>The Shade of Aran</em> questline inside Karazhan.</li><li class="ql-indent-1"><em>A Colleague''s Aid</em> &amp; <em>Kalynna''s Request</em> involving runs of <strong>Sethekk Halls</strong> and <strong>The Shattered Halls</strong> to retrieve quest items.</li><li><strong>The Kill:</strong> Once the summon is unlocked (or if we use our own summoner), we defeat <strong>Nightbane</strong> in Karazhan and loot the <strong>Blazing Signet</strong>.</li></ul><h3><strong>4. Completion (Mark of Vashj)</strong></h3><ul><li><strong>The Final Step:</strong> We return to <strong>Skar''this</strong> in Heroic Slave Pens to turn in the signets. He casts <strong>The Mark of Vashj</strong> on you, granting permanent access to Serpentshrine Cavern.</li></ul><h2><strong>Why Choose Our SSC Attunement Boost</strong></h2><p>The SSC attunement is notorious for being a "guild breaker" due to the difficulty of Nightbane and the coordination required for Gruul. Misti.Services offers the stress-free alternative:</p><ul><li><strong>Nightbane Summon Included:</strong> You don''t need to have the Blackened Urn unlocked; we handle the pre-quests or provide a summoner.</li><li><strong>Guaranteed Raid Spots:</strong> No need to roll for your spot in a PUG for Gruul or Karazhan; our teams are ready to go.</li><li><strong>Complex Chain Management:</strong> We handle the travel, the dungeon runs (Sethekk/Shattered Halls), and the raid clears efficiently.</li></ul><h3><strong>Service Includes</strong></h3><ul><li>Full completion of <strong>The Cudgel of Kar''desh</strong> questline.</li><li><strong>Gruul the Dragonkiller</strong> kill and <strong>Earthen Signet</strong> loot.</li><li><strong>Nightbane</strong> summon and kill with <strong>Blazing Signet</strong> loot.</li><li>Completion of the <strong>Blackened Urn</strong> quest chain (if required).</li><li>Permanent access to <strong>Serpentshrine Cavern</strong> via <strong>The Mark of Vashj</strong>.</li></ul><p><strong>Don''t get left behind in Phase 2. Order your Serpentshrine Cavern Attunement Boost today.</strong></p>', '<ul><li><strong>Place Your Order:</strong> Select the service and provide your character details.</li><li><strong>Coordination:</strong> We will contact you (via Discord or Email) to schedule the raid times. Since this involves specific raid lockouts (Gruul and Karazhan), we will find a slot that fits our raid team''s schedule.</li><li><strong>The Boost:</strong> Our professional booster logs into your account using a VPN matching your country for maximum security. They will complete the quest steps, attend the raids, and secure the kills.</li><li><strong>Completion:</strong> Once <strong>The Mark of Vashj</strong> is applied to your character, we log out and notify you immediately. You are now ready to enter SSC!</li></ul><p><br></p>', '<ul><li><strong>Level 70 Character:</strong> You must be max level to enter the required raids.</li><li><strong>The Master''s Key:</strong> You must already be attuned to <strong>Karazhan</strong> to enter the raid for the Nightbane kill.</li><li><strong>Reservoir Key:</strong> You must be <strong>Revered with Cenarion Expedition</strong> and have purchased the Reservoir Key to enter <strong>The Slave Pens (Heroic)</strong> for the initial quest pickup and final turn-in.</li></ul>', 188.06, 'https://kdjlhibxxygfdmlvdfcl.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/game-images/serpentshrine-cavern-attunement-1764008154861.webp', NULL, 4.9, 0, true, true, 0, '2025-11-24T11:11:30.595596+00:00', '2026-02-16T10:51:03.931717+00:00', '116b15ba-d76a-44a3-b1be-5bcb88c71693', false, NULL, true, 0, '15 minutes', 'average start time', 'Flexible', 'order completion', 'Buy Serpentshrine Cavern Attunement boost! We handle the Nightbane quest chain, Gruul kill, and The Cudgel of Kar''desh to unlock SSC raid access.', 'Serpentshrine Cavern attunement, SSC boost, Nightbane kill service, Gruul the Dragonkiller kill, Blackened Urn quest chain, Cudgel of Kar''desh, Lady Vashj raid access, The Mark of Vashj, TBC raid attunement service', 'https://kdjlhibxxygfdmlvdfcl.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/game-images/serpentshrine-cavern-attunement-1764008154861.webp', NULL, 'Serpentshrine Cavern Attunement', 'WoW SSC Attunement - Fast & Easy | misti.services', NULL);
INSERT INTO public.products (id, name, slug, short_description, description, how_it_works, requirements, base_price, image_url, badge_text, trust_score, total_reviews, is_active, is_featured, sort_order, created_at, updated_at, category_id, is_slider_product, slider_config, is_manually_popular, total_sales, start_time_text, start_time_value, delivery_text, delivery_value, meta_description, meta_keywords, og_image, canonical_url, image_alt_text, meta_title, parent_link) VALUES ('217d34d4-adfb-4519-ae5d-7d00f99c5315', 'Madness of the Betrayer', 'tbc-anniversary-madness-of-the-betrayer-boost', 'Secure the highly sought-after Madness of the Betrayer trinket for your WoW TBC Anniversary character with our professional carry service. Avoid the grind and unreliable raid groups to equip this physical DPS powerhouse.', '<h1><strong>TBC Anniversary Madness of the Betrayer Boost</strong></h1><p>Obtain the elite Madness of the Betrayer trinket for your physical DPS in WoW TBC Anniversary with this reliable boost. This rare drop from Black Temple is a game-changer, and our service ensures you acquire it efficiently, bypassing countless raid lockouts and frustrating groupfinder experiences.</p><h2><strong>Service Includes</strong></h2><ul><li><p><a target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" href="https://www.wowhead.com/tbc/item=32505/madness-of-the-betrayer"><strong>Madness of the Betrayer</strong></a><strong>:</strong> Guaranteed acquisition of the powerful trinket.</p></li><li><p><strong>Black Temple Raids:</strong> Completion of multiple Black Temple runs until the item drops.</p></li><li><p><strong>Additional Gear Chances:</strong> Opportunities to loot other valuable 141-151 ilvl gear during runs.</p></li></ul><h2><strong>About Madness of the Betrayer in TBC Anniversary</strong></h2><p>The Madness of the Betrayer is a coveted trinket in World of Warcraft: The Burning Crusade that stands out as a best-in-slot item for many physical damage dealers. Its potent stats and proc make a significant difference in combat, pushing your character''s performance to new heights. However, its extremely low drop rate from Illidan Stormrage in Black Temple means players often spend many weeks, if not months, farming for it, contingent on luck and consistent raid clear.</p><h3>Why Choose Our Service</h3><ul><li><p><strong>Guaranteed Trinket:</strong> We ensure you receive the Madness of the Betrayer, no matter how many runs it takes.</p></li><li><p><strong>Time-Saving:</strong> Skip the repetitive grind and let our experts handle the farming for you.</p></li><li><p><strong>Expert Team:</strong> Our professional raiders utilize efficient strategies for smooth and consistent Black Temple clears.</p></li><li><p><strong>Secure &amp; Private:</strong> Experience a safe and discreet piloted boost that respects your account''s privacy.</p></li><li><p><strong>Flexible Scheduling:</strong> We work around your availability to start and complete your boost.</p></li></ul><p>Elevate your WoW TBC Anniversary character''s power with the Madness of the Betrayer, acquired through the trusted and efficient services of misti.services, your premium gaming marketplace.</p>', '<ul><li><p><strong>Place Your Order:</strong> Select the TBC Anniversary Madness of the Betrayer Boost and complete your purchase.</p></li><li><p><strong>Contact &amp; Schedule:</strong> Our support team will reach out promptly to confirm your order and discuss scheduling the Black Temple runs.</p></li><li><p><strong>Account Piloting:</strong> You will provide your account details for our professional booster to log in (Piloted mode). We use VPNs for security and privacy.</p></li><li><p><strong>Trinket Acquisition:</strong> Our team will persistently clear Black Temple until the Madness of the Betrayer drops and is secured on your character.</p></li><li><p><strong>Service Complete:</strong> We notify you once the trinket is obtained and the service is successfully finished.</p></li></ul><p></p>', '<ul>
INSERT INTO public.products (id, name, slug, short_description, description, how_it_works, requirements, base_price, image_url, badge_text, trust_score, total_reviews, is_active, is_featured, sort_order, created_at, updated_at, category_id, is_slider_product, slider_config, is_manually_popular, total_sales, start_time_text, start_time_value, delivery_text, delivery_value, meta_description, meta_keywords, og_image, canonical_url, image_alt_text, meta_title, parent_link) VALUES ('bc3ff26c-75a8-4e21-8bd8-28e0097e38d4', 'Lockpicking', 'wow-tbc-classic-lockpicking-boost-1-350', 'For a Rogue, Lockpicking is not just a skill—it''s a service, a shortcut, and a passive gold stream. In The Burning Crusade Classic, having maximum Lockpicking (350) is essential for accessing highly valuable containers and navigating complex dungeons like the Shattered Halls.', '<h1><strong>WoW TBC Classic Lockpicking Boost</strong></h1><p>For a Rogue, Lockpicking is not just a skill—it''s a service, a shortcut, and a passive gold stream. In <em>The Burning Crusade Classic</em>, having maximum Lockpicking (350) is essential for accessing highly valuable containers and navigating complex dungeons like the <strong>Shattered Halls</strong>.</p><p>The challenge lies in the grind: leveling Lockpicking requires hours of competing for static chest spawns or monotonous <strong>Pick Pocket</strong> spam on mobs across Outland. At <strong>Misti.services</strong>, we eliminate the repetition. We handle the specific zone-hopping, chest-scouting, and mob-pickpocketing required to efficiently take your Rogue from the Classic cap of 300 to the TBC cap of 350.</p><h2><strong>Why Max Your Lockpicking Skill?</strong></h2><p>While the skill is passive, the benefits are active and highly profitable.</p><ul><li><strong>Access Khorium Lockboxes:</strong> At 325 skill (or 320 with <strong>Dark Leather Gloves</strong>), you can open the highest-tier player-dropped lockboxes, which contain valuable TBC gems and materials. Opening these for tips is instant gold.</li><li><strong>Dungeon Utility:</strong> Open the main door in <strong>Shattered Halls</strong> and bypass numerous side locks and shortcuts in dungeons across Outland.</li><li><strong>Pick Pocket Profits:</strong> Max skill ensures every <strong>Strong Junkbox</strong> looted from Humanoids can be opened instantly, providing gold, vendor trash, and poison ingredients.</li><li><strong>Leveling Efficiency:</strong> We use the Lockpicking grind to your advantage, focusing on areas like Nagrand where you can combine skill leveling with quest objectives.</li></ul><h2><strong>Our Strategy: Unlocking the TBC Cap</strong></h2><p>We utilize the three most effective methods—static chests, junkboxes, and player lockboxes—to ensure the fastest path to 350.</p><h3>Phase 1: Chest &amp; Footlocker Farming (300-325)</h3><p>To start, we focus on static spawn points that offer quick, repetitive skill-ups.</p><ul><li><strong>Feralfen Village, Zangarmarsh:</strong> We farm the <strong>Wicker Chests</strong> scattered around the buildings and tents. This location is ideal for the 300-325 range, despite high competition, due to the reasonable respawn rate.</li><li><em>Note: If competition is too high, we switch to targeted </em><strong><em>Pick Pocket</em></strong><em> farming to ensure continuous progression.</em></li></ul><h3>Phase 2: Dented Footlockers &amp; Ogre Pockets (325-350)</h3><p>Once we hit 325 skill (the key requirement for all high-end locks), we move to more lucrative zones.</p><ul><li><strong>Kil’sorrow Fortress, Nagrand:</strong> This location provides numerous <strong>Dented Footlockers</strong> around the buildings. We use the Rogue’s utility (<strong>Sap</strong> and <strong>Distract</strong>) to ensure safe and efficient lockpicking without engaging large groups of mobs.</li><li><strong>Ogre Hunting:</strong> We spam <strong>Pick Pocket</strong> on Humanoids, particularly the Ogre camps in Nagrand (<strong>The Twin Clefts</strong>) and <strong>Blade’s Edge Mountains</strong>, to loot valuable <strong>Strong Junkboxes</strong> that continue to grant skill points up to the cap.</li></ul><h3>Phase 3: Final 350 &amp; Future-Proofing</h3><p>The last few points can be slow, but we guarantee the skill cap. We also leverage the ability to open player-dropped <strong>Khorium Lockboxes</strong> for the final, minimal effort points, allowing the Rogue to wait in a major city and gain the last skills while providing a valuable service.</p><h2><strong>What Our Service Includes</strong></h2><p>When you order a Lockpicking boost from <strong>Misti.services</strong>, you gain maximum utility and a guarantee of the TBC cap.</p><ul><li><strong>300-350 Skill Leveling:</strong> We handle the manual grind, travel, and farming.</li><li><strong>Efficiency Maximized:</strong> We utilize a combination of static chest spawns and <strong>Pick Pocket</strong> farming to ensure the fastest progression speed.</li><li><strong>Rogue Utilities Used:</strong> We use <strong>Sap</strong> and <strong>Distract</strong> strategically to manage mobs around locked chests.</li><li><strong>Loot Retention:</strong> All <strong>Strong Junkboxes</strong>, loot, and gold acquired during the Pick Pocket phase are yours to keep.</li><li><strong>Secure Service:</strong> Performed by experienced, human boosters using VPNs to protect your account.</li></ul><p><strong>Ready to bypass any obstacle in Outland? Select your options above and receive a Master Lockpicking skill today!</strong></p>', '<ul><li>Select your desired options and complete your order on&nbsp;Misti.Services.</li><li>You’ll receive an order confirmation and tracking number via email.</li><li>Our support manager will contact you through live chat to confirm all details.</li><li>If you’re unavailable, we’ll reach out via email or your preferred contact method.</li><li>When the boost is finished, you’ll receive a completion notification on Discord or another messenger of your choice.</li></ul>', '<ul><li>Level 70 character</li><li>Active WoW Subscription</li></ul>', 0, 'https://kdjlhibxxygfdmlvdfcl.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/game-images/wow-tbc-classic-lockpicking-boost-1-350-1764585999536.webp', NULL, 4.9, 0, true, true, 0, '2025-12-01T10:35:11.869193+00:00', '2026-02-16T10:52:23.274968+00:00', '1dea78b7-88a7-4056-84fb-9f891ece362c', true, '{"step":1,"end_label":"End Value","max_value":350,"min_value":1,"default_end":300,"start_label":"Start Value","default_start":1,"pricing_brackets":[{"end":300,"price":38.25,"start":1},{"end":350,"price":63.75,"start":301}],"estimated_time_per_step":0.005}', true, 0, '15 minutes', 'average start time', 'Flexible', 'order completion', 'Master Lockpicking 350 for TBC dungeons and profit! We handle the repetitive grind, enabling your Rogue to open any lock and maximize gold from Strong Junkboxes.', 'TBC Lockpicking boost, Rogue Lockpicking 350, Khorium Lockbox, Feralfen Village, Dented Footlocker, Strong Junkbox, Rogue utility boost, WoW Rogue skill leveling, Shattered Halls key, Dark Leather Gloves, Pick Pocket gold farm', 'https://kdjlhibxxygfdmlvdfcl.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/game-images/wow-tbc-classic-lockpicking-boost-1-350-1764585999536.webp', NULL, 'Wow Tbc Classic Lockpicking Boost 1 350', 'WoW TBC Lockpicking Service | misti.services', NULL);
INSERT INTO public.products (id, name, slug, short_description, description, how_it_works, requirements, base_price, image_url, badge_text, trust_score, total_reviews, is_active, is_featured, sort_order, created_at, updated_at, category_id, is_slider_product, slider_config, is_manually_popular, total_sales, start_time_text, start_time_value, delivery_text, delivery_value, meta_description, meta_keywords, og_image, canonical_url, image_alt_text, meta_title, parent_link) VALUES ('fa8f2ffe-dd64-44f2-a232-ef35afa408c6', 'Farstriders', 'midnight-farstriders-reputation-boost', 'Achieve Luminary reputation with the Farstriders in Midnight without the endless grind. Our expert team efficiently boosts your standing, unlocking exclusive cosmetic rewards, housing items, and rare crafting techniques.', '<h1><strong>Midnight Farstriders Reputation Boost</strong></h1><p>Elevate your standing within the Farstriders faction in Midnight with our professional reputation boost service. Attain the coveted Luminary level effortlessly, gaining access to unique in-game cosmetics, special housing decorations, and powerful Inscription techniques that enhance your character''s abilities and style.</p><h2><strong>Service Includes</strong></h2><ul><li><p><strong>Selected Reputation Level:</strong> Reaching your desired standing with the <a target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" href="https://www.wowhead.com/item=243610/farstriders-reputation">Farstriders</a> faction.</p></li><li><p><strong>Exclusive Faction Rewards:</strong> Unlocking access to all unique items and benefits associated with your new reputation tier.</p></li><li><p><strong>All Loot Acquired:</strong> Every item, currency, or resource obtained during the boost is yours to keep.</p></li></ul><h2><strong>About Farstriders in Midnight</strong></h2><p>The Farstriders are a prominent faction within the world of Midnight, known for their unique crafting methods, distinctive cosmetic items, and elegant housing decorations. Building a strong reputation with them is key to unlocking some of the game''s most sought-after aesthetic and functional rewards, including advanced Inscription techniques that can significantly boost your character''s potential.</p><h2><strong>Why Choose Our Service</strong></h2><ul><li><p><strong>No Grind Required:</strong> Skip the repetitive tasks and time-consuming efforts typically needed to raise reputation.</p></li><li><p><strong>Fast and Efficient:</strong> Our experienced players utilize optimized strategies to achieve your desired reputation level quickly.</p></li><li><p><strong>Piloted Service:</strong> A skilled professional takes care of the entire process on your account while you relax.</p></li><li><p><strong>Secure and Reliable:</strong> We adhere to strict security protocols to ensure the safety and integrity of your account.</p></li><li><p><strong>Exclusive Rewards:</strong> Gain access to rare cosmetics, unique housing items, and powerful Inscription recipes upon reaching Luminary.</p></li></ul><p>Let misti.services handle the grind, so you can focus on enjoying the rewards. Purchase your Midnight Farstriders Reputation Boost today and transform your gameplay experience.</p>', '<ul><li><p><strong>Select Your Range:</strong> Choose your current and desired Farstriders reputation levels using our slider.</p></li><li><p><strong>Complete Your Order:</strong> Finalize your purchase securely through our platform.</p></li><li><p><strong>Account Handover:</strong> Our support team will contact you to arrange a suitable time for account access via piloted mode.</p></li><li><p><strong>Reputation Farming Begins:</strong> A professional booster will log into your account and diligently work towards achieving your selected reputation level.</p></li><li><p><strong>Receive Rewards:</strong> Once your desired reputation is reached, we will notify you, and you can enjoy all the new benefits and items.</p></li></ul><p></p>', '<ul><li><p><strong>Active Game Subscription:</strong> You must have an active Midnight game subscription.</p></li><li><p><strong>Character Level 90:</strong> Your character needs to be at level 90. If not, consider our Midnight Leveling Boost service.</p></li></ul><p></p>', 0, NULL, NULL, 4.9, 0, true, true, 0, '2026-02-12T22:43:54.427908+00:00', '2026-02-12T22:46:18.987527+00:00', '312870ae-4c42-440f-8510-5704a1c5f333', true, '{"step":1,"end_label":"Desired Reputation Level","max_value":6,"min_value":1,"default_end":6,"start_label":"Current Reputation Level","default_start":1,"pricing_brackets":[{"end":4,"price":159,"start":1},{"end":6,"price":159,"start":5}],"estimated_time_per_step":5}', true, 0, '15 minutes', 'average start time', 'Flexible', 'order completion', 'Buy Midnight Farstriders Reputation Boost service to reach Luminary level. Unlock exclusive cosmetics, housing items, and Inscription techniques!', 'Midnight Farstriders reputation boost, Farstriders reputation carry, Midnight reputation farm, buy Farstriders boost, Midnight Luminary reputation, Farstriders reputation service, Midnight reputation price, fast Midnight reputation, Midnight cosmetics, Inscription technique boost, Farstriders rewards, Midnight reputation farming, buy Farstriders reputation, gaming service, fast delivery, professional, reliable, secure, boosting, carry', NULL, NULL, 'Midnight Farstriders Reputation Boost Service Banner', 'Midnight Farstriders Reputation Boost | misti.services', '/game/wow/leveling-and-gearing/wow-level-boost');
INSERT INTO public.products (id, name, slug, short_description, description, how_it_works, requirements, base_price, image_url, badge_text, trust_score, total_reviews, is_active, is_featured, sort_order, created_at, updated_at, category_id, is_slider_product, slider_config, is_manually_popular, total_sales, start_time_text, start_time_value, delivery_text, delivery_value, meta_description, meta_keywords, og_image, canonical_url, image_alt_text, meta_title, parent_link) VALUES ('a28f449b-7db3-45e0-9e06-329f6bef835a', 'First Aid', 'wow-tbc-classic-first-aid-boost-1-375', 'First Aid is one of the most essential secondary professions in TBC Classic, offering a crucial Mana-free recovery option that is available to every class. Whether you''re a Warrior or Rogue leveling alone, or a raid member needing to stabilize yourself after taking unavoidable damage, a bandage can save your life. The top-tier Heavy Netherweave Bandage restores a massive amount of health quickly, making it a staple in any Arena or dungeon run.', '<h1><strong>WoW TBC Classic First Aid Boost</strong></h1><p>First Aid is one of the most essential <em>secondary</em> professions in TBC Classic, offering a crucial Mana-free recovery option that is available to <em>every</em> class. Whether you''re a Warrior or Rogue leveling alone, or a raid member needing to stabilize yourself after taking unavoidable damage, a bandage can save your life. The top-tier <strong>Heavy Netherweave Bandage</strong> restores a massive amount of health quickly, making it a staple in any Arena or dungeon run.</p><p>The catch? Leveling First Aid requires farming or buying hundreds of stacks of cloth and completing a notoriously stressful timed quest. At <strong>Misti.services</strong>, we eliminate the hassle. We provide all the cloth, track down all the rare manuals, and guarantee a perfect score on the infamous Triage test.</p><h2><strong>Why Choose First Aid?</strong></h2><p>As a secondary profession, First Aid never conflicts with your two main professions (like Blacksmithing or Enchanting). It’s pure utility and survival.</p><ul><li><strong>Mana-Free Healing:</strong> Provides a quick, efficient self-heal for all non-healing classes, reducing downtime while leveling and farming.</li><li><strong>PvP Essential:</strong> Bandages are crucial for clutch heals in the Arena, often providing the edge needed to finish off an opponent.</li><li><strong>Raid Stabilization:</strong> Bandaging an ally or yourself can save a wipe or conserve valuable healer Mana, especially during extended fights.</li><li><strong>Massive Recovery:</strong> The final <strong>Heavy Netherweave Bandage</strong> heals for <strong>3,400 health</strong> over 8 seconds—a significant, life-saving boost.</li></ul><h2><strong>The Journey to Mastery: Overcoming the Hurdles</strong></h2><p>Leveling First Aid is a linear process, but several major roadblocks require specific travel and execution. We handle every one of them for you.</p><h3>1. Apprentice to Expert (1-150)</h3><p>The early stages focus on Linen and Wool cloth. We craft Linen Bandages and Heavy Wool Bandages to quickly reach the Expert cap. At this point, we travel to either Arathi Highlands or Dustwallow Marsh to purchase and use the <strong>Expert First Aid - Under Wraps</strong> manual.</p><h3>2. The Artisan Hurdle: Triage (225-300)</h3><p>To unlock the Artisan skill cap, the character must complete the <strong>Triage / Triage</strong> quest. This is a stressful timed trial where you must prioritize bandaging 15 critically injured patients before they die. Our experienced boosters guarantee a flawless completion of this required test.</p><h3>3. Master First Aid (300-375)</h3><p>Once the Triage quest is complete, we travel to Hellfire Peninsula to purchase the <strong>Master First Aid - Doctor in the House</strong> manual from <strong>Burko</strong> (Alliance) or <strong>Aresella</strong> (Horde). This unlocks the final skill tier, allowing us to use the Outland cloth.</p><h2><strong>The Cloth Grind: All Materials Provided</strong></h2><p>The biggest cost of leveling First Aid is the sheer volume of materials. We provide 100% of the cloth required from start to finish, including:</p><ul><li>Linen and Wool Cloth for the early levels.</li><li>Silk and Mageweave Cloth for the mid-level climb.</li><li>Runecloth for the final push to 300.</li><li>The expensive and highly demanded <strong>Netherweave Cloth</strong> for the final 330-375 climb.</li></ul><p>This material-inclusive service ensures your own gold is protected and the process is instant.</p><h2><strong>What Our Service Includes</strong></h2><p>When you order a First Aid boost from <strong>Misti.services</strong>, you receive a complete, ready-to-use profession.</p><ul><li><strong>1-375 Skill Guarantee:</strong> Complete manual leveling of the profession from scratch.</li><li><strong>Triage Quest Completion:</strong> Guaranteed completion of the difficult Triage quest.</li><li><strong>All Cloth Supplied:</strong> We provide all necessary Linen, Silk, Runecloth, and Netherweave.</li><li><strong>Manual Acquisition:</strong> We purchase all required manuals (<em>Under Wraps</em>, <em>Netherweave Bandage</em>, <em>Doctor in the House</em>).</li><li><strong>Secure &amp; Fast:</strong> Performed by experienced boosters using VPNs for account security.</li></ul><p><strong>Ready to become your own healer? Select your options above and receive a Master First Aid profession today!</strong></p>', '<ul><li>Select your desired options and complete your order on&nbsp;Misti.Services.</li><li>You’ll receive an order confirmation and tracking number via email.</li><li>Our support manager will contact you through live chat to confirm all details.</li><li>If you’re unavailable, we’ll reach out via email or your preferred contact method.</li><li>When the boost is finished, you’ll receive a completion notification on Discord or another messenger of your choice.</li></ul>', '<ul><li>Level 70 character</li><li>Active WoW Subscription</li></ul>', 0, 'https://kdjlhibxxygfdmlvdfcl.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/game-images/wow-tbc-classic-first-aid-boost-1-375-1764585842246.webp', NULL, 4.9, 0, true, true, 0, '2025-12-01T10:27:19.061169+00:00', '2026-02-16T10:51:53.714907+00:00', '1dea78b7-88a7-4056-84fb-9f891ece362c', true, '{"step":1,"end_label":"End Value","max_value":375,"min_value":1,"default_end":300,"start_label":"Start Value","default_start":1,"pricing_brackets":[{"end":300,"price":76.5,"start":1},{"end":375,"price":102,"start":301}],"estimated_time_per_step":0.005}', true, 0, '15 minutes', 'average start time', 'Flexible', 'order completion', 'Instantly master the TBC secondary profession. We complete the complex Triage quest, supply all cloth (Linen to Netherweave), and level your First Aid 1-375.', 'WoW TBC First Aid boost, Triage quest completion, Master First Aid 375, Heavy Netherweave Bandage, secondary profession leveling, Linen Cloth farming, Doctor Gregory Victor, Mana-free heal, PvP bandages, First Aid powerleveling, Burko trainer, WoW cloth grinding', 'https://kdjlhibxxygfdmlvdfcl.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/game-images/wow-tbc-classic-first-aid-boost-1-375-1764585842246.webp', NULL, 'Wow Tbc Classic First Aid Boost 1 375', 'WoW TBC First Aid Profession Boost | misti.services', NULL);
INSERT INTO public.products (id, name, slug, short_description, description, how_it_works, requirements, base_price, image_url, badge_text, trust_score, total_reviews, is_active, is_featured, sort_order, created_at, updated_at, category_id, is_slider_product, slider_config, is_manually_popular, total_sales, start_time_text, start_time_value, delivery_text, delivery_value, meta_description, meta_keywords, og_image, canonical_url, image_alt_text, meta_title, parent_link) VALUES ('3c36f5aa-4124-4e94-9e46-ada08de7a574', 'Enchanting', 'wow-tbc-classic-enchanting-boost-1-375', 'Enchanting is widely regarded as the single best PvE profession in The Burning Crusade Classic thanks to the exclusive stat boosts you can apply to your own rings. However, it is also notoriously expensive and complicated to level. Unlike other professions, Enchanting requires you to destroy valuable gear to get materials, and you must constantly upgrade your "Enchanting Rod" using expensive metals and pearls.', '<h1><strong>WoW TBC Classic Enchanting Boost (1-375)</strong></h1><p>Enchanting is widely regarded as the single best PvE profession in <em>The Burning Crusade Classic</em> thanks to the exclusive stat boosts you can apply to your own rings. However, it is also notoriously expensive and complicated to level. Unlike other professions, Enchanting requires you to destroy valuable gear to get materials, and you must constantly upgrade your "Enchanting Rod" using expensive metals and pearls.</p><p>At <strong>Misti.services</strong>, we handle the cost and the complexity. We provide the mountains of Strange Dust, Greater Planar Essences, and Primal Mights required to take you from Apprentice to Master. We deliver a fully leveled Enchanter equipped with a <strong>Runed Eternium Rod</strong>, ready to enhance your guild''s gear and dominate the meters.</p><h2><strong>Why Choose Enchanting in TBC?</strong></h2><p>Enchanting provides unique self-buffs and high gold-making potential that remains relevant throughout the entire expansion.</p><ul><li><strong>Ring Enchants:</strong> The primary reason to pick this profession. You can enchant your own rings with <strong>Spellpower</strong>, <strong>Healing Power</strong>, or <strong>Stats (+4 all)</strong>. These cannot be bought or traded.</li><li><strong>Disenchanting:</strong> Turn unwanted quest rewards, dungeon drops, and crafted items into valuable dusts, shards, and <strong>Void Crystals</strong>.</li><li><strong>Gold Making:</strong> High-end enchants like <strong>Mongoose</strong> and <strong>Soulfrost</strong> are always in demand. Sitting in Shattrath and selling your services is a proven way to fund your epic flying mount.</li><li><strong>Raid Utility:</strong> Be the hero of your raid by providing essential buffs to tank and DPS gear immediately after a drop.</li></ul><h2><strong>The Leveling Process: Azeroth (1 - 300)</strong></h2><p>We handle the "old world" grind efficiently, supplying all necessary materials so you don''t have to scour the Auction House.</p><p><strong>Apprentice to Expert (1-225)</strong> We start by crafting your initial Copper, Silver, and Golden Rods. We burn through stacks of <strong>Strange Dust</strong> and <strong>Soul Dust</strong> on bracer and chest enchants. This phase establishes the foundation of your skill.</p><p><strong>Artisan Enchanting (225-300)</strong> The cost increases here. We utilize <strong>Vision Dust</strong> and <strong>Dream Dust</strong> to push your skill to 300. We also handle the creation of the <strong>Runed Arcanite Rod</strong>, which requires an Arcanite Bar and a Golden Pearl—expensive items that we provide as part of the service.</p><h2><strong>The Leveling Process: Outland (300 - 375)</strong></h2><p>Once in Outland, Enchanting becomes a prestige profession. We visit the Master trainers in Honor Hold, Thrallmar, or Shattrath to unlock the final tier.</p><p><strong>The Rod Progression</strong> TBC introduces complex rod upgrades. We craft the <strong>Runed Fel Iron Rod</strong>, <strong>Runed Adamantite Rod</strong>, and finally the <strong>Runed Eternium Rod</strong>. <em>Note: The final rod requires Primal Might and Void Crystals. We supply these high-end materials.</em></p><p><strong>The Skill Push (300-375)</strong> We bridge the gap using <strong>Arcane Dust</strong> and <strong>Greater Planar Essences</strong>. The final levels (360-375) are particularly difficult, often requiring the enchanting of your own rings or expensive yellow-skill recipes. We ensure you hit the hard cap of 375 so you can learn every recipe in the game.</p><h2><strong>Rare Formulas &amp; Reputation</strong></h2><p>Reaching 375 is just the beginning. The best enchants in TBC are locked behind Reputation or dropped by Raid Bosses. We can help you target these specific upgrades.</p><p><strong>Essential Reputation Recipes</strong></p><ul><li><strong>Keepers of Time:</strong> Unlocks <strong>Enchant Gloves - Major Spellpower</strong> and <strong>Enchant Ring - Spellpower</strong>.</li><li><strong>The Sha''tar:</strong> Unlocks <strong>Enchant Gloves - Major Healing</strong> and <strong>Enchant Ring - Healing Power</strong>.</li><li><strong>The Violet Eye:</strong> Unlocks <strong>Enchant Weapon - Greater Agility</strong> (Exalted).</li><li><strong>Cenarion Expedition:</strong> Unlocks <strong>Enchant Cloak - Stealth</strong>.</li></ul><p><strong>Sought-After Rare Drops</strong></p><ul><li><strong>Enchant Weapon - Mongoose:</strong> The BiS melee enchant, dropped by Moroes in Karazhan.</li><li><strong>Enchant Weapon - Sunfire:</strong> The BiS Arcane/Fire caster enchant, dropped by Shade of Aran.</li><li><strong>Enchant Weapon - Soulfrost:</strong> The BiS Frost/Shadow caster enchant, dropped by Terestian Illhoof.</li><li><strong>Enchant Boots - Surefooted:</strong> Essential for PvP and Hit Capping, dropped in Karazhan.</li><li><strong>Enchant Weapon - Executioner:</strong> The Armor Penetration enchant from Zul''Aman (Phase 4).</li></ul><h2><strong>Disenchanting Capabilities</strong></h2><p>By boosting to 375, you gain the ability to Disenchant every item in the game.</p><ul><li><strong>Skill 225:</strong> Disenchant Level 60 Epics (Vanilla Raids).</li><li><strong>Skill 275:</strong> Disenchant Level 70 Blues.</li><li><strong>Skill 300+:</strong> Disenchant Level 70 Epics (Kara/Gruul/Magtheridon loot) into <strong>Void Crystals</strong>.</li></ul><h2><strong>What Our Service Includes</strong></h2><p>When you order an Enchanting boost from <strong>Misti.services</strong>, you receive a premium, all-inclusive package.</p><ul><li><strong>1-375 Leveling:</strong> Complete manual leveling.</li><li><strong>All Materials Provided:</strong> We supply every Dust, Essence, Shard, Pearl, and Metal Bar needed.</li><li><strong>Rod Upgrades:</strong> You finish the boost with the <strong>Runed Eternium Rod</strong> in your bag, capable of performing ANY enchant in the game.</li><li><strong>Secure &amp; Fast:</strong> Performed by experienced players using VPNs to match your location for account safety.</li></ul><p><strong>Ready to wield the power of the Void? Select your current skill level above and let us enchant your character to perfection.</strong></p>', '<ul><li>Select your desired options and complete your order on&nbsp;Misti.Services.</li><li>You’ll receive an order confirmation and tracking number via email.</li><li>Our support manager will contact you through live chat to confirm all details.</li><li>If you’re unavailable, we’ll reach out via email or your preferred contact method.</li><li>When the boost is finished, you’ll receive a completion notification on Discord or another messenger of your choice.</li></ul>', '<ul><li>Level 70 character</li><li>Active WoW Subscription</li></ul>', 0, 'https://kdjlhibxxygfdmlvdfcl.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/game-images/wow-tbc-classic-enchanting-boost-1-375-1764585693448.webp', NULL, 4.9, 0, true, false, 0, '2025-12-01T10:23:03.17377+00:00', '2026-02-16T10:51:54.140374+00:00', '1dea78b7-88a7-4056-84fb-9f891ece362c', true, '{"step":1,"end_label":"End Value","max_value":375,"min_value":1,"default_end":300,"start_label":"Start Value","default_start":1,"pricing_brackets":[{"end":300,"price":76.5,"start":1},{"end":375,"price":127.5,"start":301}],"estimated_time_per_step":0.005}', false, 1, '15 minutes', 'average start time', 'Flexible', 'order completion', 'Master the Arcane arts without the cost! We level your Enchanting from 1-375, providing all dusts, essences, and rods. Get access to Ring Enchants and rare formulas like ', 'WoW TBC Enchanting boost, buy Enchanting skill 375, TBC Classic Mongoose enchant, Enchant Ring Spellpower, Runed Eternium Rod, Disenchanting guide TBC, Void Crystal farming, Soulfrost formula, Sunfire enchant, Primal Might, WoW profession powerleveling, Karazhan enchanting recipes, TBC gold making,tbc anniversary boost,tbc anniversary carry', 'https://kdjlhibxxygfdmlvdfcl.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/game-images/wow-tbc-classic-enchanting-boost-1-375-1764585693448.webp', NULL, 'Wow Tbc Classic Enchanting Boost 1 375', 'WoW TBC Enchanting Boost | misti.services', NULL);
INSERT INTO public.products (id, name, slug, short_description, description, how_it_works, requirements, base_price, image_url, badge_text, trust_score, total_reviews, is_active, is_featured, sort_order, created_at, updated_at, category_id, is_slider_product, slider_config, is_manually_popular, total_sales, start_time_text, start_time_value, delivery_text, delivery_value, meta_description, meta_keywords, og_image, canonical_url, image_alt_text, meta_title, parent_link) VALUES ('1deec384-bad8-463c-9623-228714ca2eba', 'Blacksmithing', 'wow-tbc-classic-blacksmithing-boost', 'Blacksmithing is one of the most essential professions for Plate and Physical DPS classes in Burning Crusade Classic. Unlike many professions, Blacksmithing offers powerful Bind-on-Pickup (BoP) gear, meaning that if you want the very best armor and weapons available in Phases 2 and 3, you must be the Blacksmith.', '<h1><strong>WoW TBC Classic Blacksmithing Profession Boost</strong></h1><p>Blacksmithing is one of the most essential professions for Plate and Physical DPS classes in <strong>Burning Crusade Classic</strong>. Unlike many professions, Blacksmithing offers powerful <strong>Bind-on-Pickup (BoP)</strong> gear, meaning that if you want the very best armor and weapons available in Phases 2 and 3, you <strong>must</strong> be the Blacksmith.</p><h3>At <strong>Misti.services</strong>, we eliminate the colossal grind and immense gold drain associated with leveling Blacksmithing. Our expert service ensures you reach 375 skill, unlock the specialization of your choice, and gain immediate access to the most coveted gear in Outland.</h3><h2><strong>Why Blacksmithing is Essential in TBC</strong></h2><p>Blacksmithing is not just a profitable profession; it is often mandatory for maximizing performance due to several key, powerful, <strong>Soulbound</strong> items.</p><ul><li><strong>Best-in-Slot (BiS) Weapons:</strong> Blacksmithing provides some of the most powerful weapons in the game, culminating in Phase 3 with the <strong>[Lionheart Executioner]</strong>, <strong>[Dragonstrike]</strong>, and <strong>[Stormherald]</strong>.</li><li><strong>BoP Armor:</strong> Armorsmiths gain access to potent chest and helm pieces throughout the expansion (e.g., <strong>[Breastplate of Kings]</strong>).</li><li><strong>Runes and Weightstones:</strong> Craft essential consumables like <strong>[Fel Weightstone]</strong> for immediate weapon benefits.</li><li><strong>Gold Savings:</strong> While leveling is costly, having the profession allows you to make these high-demand items for yourself and your guild, bypassing the Auction House markup.</li></ul><h3><strong>The Scale of the Grind: Materials Needed</strong></h3><p>Blacksmithing is notorious for requiring an extraordinary quantity of base materials, making it one of the most expensive professions to level manually. Our service includes the sourcing and farming of all necessary materials.</p><h3><strong>Blacksmithing Specializations</strong></h3><p>At skill level 300, you must choose between two specializations. Furthermore, Weaponsmithing splits into three sub-specializations. We can complete any of these long quest chains for you.</p><h4><strong>1. Armorsmithing</strong></h4><p>This specialization focuses on high-end Plate and Mail armor pieces.</p><ul><li><strong>Trainer &amp; Quest:</strong> Horde players start in Orgrimmar and Alliance in Ironforge with the quest <strong>The Art of the Armorsmith</strong>.</li><li><strong>Key Quest Deliverables (Must be supplied):</strong></li><li class="ql-indent-1">4 x <strong>[Ornate Mithril Helm]</strong></li><li class="ql-indent-1">2 x <strong>[Ornate Mithril Boots]</strong></li><li class="ql-indent-1">1 x <strong>[Ornate Mithril Breastplate]</strong></li><li><strong>Notable Crafts:</strong> <strong>[Bulwark of Kings]</strong>, <strong>[Embrace of the Twisting Nether]</strong>.</li></ul><h4><strong>2. Weaponsmithing</strong></h4><p>This specialization is the path for crafters seeking the game''s best Physical DPS weapons. It requires an additional step to select a sub-specialization.</p><ul><li><strong>Trainer &amp; Quest:</strong> Horde players start in Orgrimmar and Alliance in Ironforge with the quest <strong>The Way of the Weaponsmith</strong>.</li><li><strong>Key Quest Deliverables (Must be supplied):</strong></li><li class="ql-indent-1">4 x <strong>[Moonsteel Broadsword]</strong></li><li class="ql-indent-1">4 x <strong>[Massive Iron Axe]</strong></li><li class="ql-indent-1">2 x <strong>[Heavy Mithril Axe]</strong></li><li class="ql-indent-1">2 x <strong>[Big Black Mace]</strong></li></ul><h3><strong>Our Blacksmithing Boost Service Includes:</strong></h3><ul><li><strong>Full Skill Maxing (1-375):</strong> We guarantee maximum skill level achievement.</li><li><strong>All Materials Included:</strong> We source and acquire <em>all</em> necessary Vanilla and TBC stones and bars.</li><li><strong>Specialization Completion:</strong> Completion of the full quest line for your chosen specialization (Armorsmithing, Axesmithing, Hammersmithing, or Swordsmithing).</li><li><strong>Trainer Unlocks:</strong> Learning of all core <strong>Master Blacksmithing</strong> recipes from trainers in Hellfire Peninsula.</li><li><strong>Rapid Delivery:</strong> Efficient and secure service by dedicated Misti professionals.</li></ul><p><strong>Stop mining and start raiding with BiS gear. Let Misti.services handle the forge for you!</strong></p>', '<ul><li>Select your desired options and complete your order on&nbsp;Misti.Services.</li><li>You’ll receive an order confirmation and tracking number via email.</li><li>Our support manager will contact you through live chat to confirm all details.</li><li>If you’re unavailable, we’ll reach out via email or your preferred contact method.</li><li>When the boost is finished, you’ll receive a completion notification on Discord or another messenger of your choice.</li></ul><p><br></p>', '<ul><li>Level 70 character</li><li>Active WoW Subscription</li></ul>', 0, 'https://kdjlhibxxygfdmlvdfcl.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/game-images/wow-tbc-classic-blacksmithing-boost-1764280636873.webp', NULL, 4.9, 0, true, true, 0, '2025-11-27T20:57:39.631285+00:00', '2026-02-16T10:51:58.469716+00:00', '1dea78b7-88a7-4056-84fb-9f891ece362c', true, '{"step":1,"end_label":"End Value","max_value":375,"min_value":1,"default_end":60,"start_label":"Start Value","default_start":1,"pricing_brackets":[{"end":375,"price":0.00002295,"start":1}],"estimated_time_per_step":0.0005}', true, 0, '15 minutes', 'average start time', 'Flexible', 'order completion', 'Get 1-375 Blacksmithing fast in TBC Classic. Unlock BiS Phase 3 weapons (Dragonstrike, Stormherald, Lionheart) and all Specializations (Weaponsmithing, Armorsmithing).', 'WoW TBC Blacksmithing boost, TBC Blacksmithing leveling, Weaponsmithing TBC, Armorsmithing TBC, Dragonstrike, Stormherald, Lionheart Executioner, TBC profession boost, Blacksmithing 1-375', 'https://kdjlhibxxygfdmlvdfcl.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/game-images/wow-tbc-classic-blacksmithing-boost-1764280636873.webp', NULL, 'Wow Tbc Classic Blacksmithing Boost', 'WoW TBC Blacksmithing Boost | misti.services', NULL);
INSERT INTO public.products (id, name, slug, short_description, description, how_it_works, requirements, base_price, image_url, badge_text, trust_score, total_reviews, is_active, is_featured, sort_order, created_at, updated_at, category_id, is_slider_product, slider_config, is_manually_popular, total_sales, start_time_text, start_time_value, delivery_text, delivery_value, meta_description, meta_keywords, og_image, canonical_url, image_alt_text, meta_title, parent_link) VALUES ('ff9a4348-a4c0-44a6-9fed-c4276fa1ee58', 'Magisters', 'midnight-magisters-reputation-boost', 'Swiftly achieve the Luminary reputation rank with the Magisters faction in Midnight. Our professional service secures exclusive rewards and saves you countless hours of grinding, making your journey seamless.', '<h1><strong>Midnight Magisters Reputation Boost</strong></h1><p>Unlock the highest Luminary reputation with the Magisters faction in Midnight through our efficient reputation boost service. Avoid the weeks of arduous farming and gain access to prestigious cosmetic rewards, unique housing decorations, valuable Enchanting formulas, and a special battle pet with ease.</p><h2><strong>Service Includes</strong></h2><ul><li><p><strong>Selected Reputation Level:</strong> The chosen reputation rank with the Midnight <a target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" href="https://www.wowhead.com/item=243608/magisters-reputation">Magisters</a> faction.</p></li><li><p><strong>Exclusive Factional Rewards:</strong> Access to all unique items unlocked at your new reputation level.</p></li><li><p><strong>All Loot Acquired:</strong> Any items, currency, or resources obtained during the reputation boosting process.</p></li></ul><h2><strong>About the Midnight Magisters Reputation</strong></h2><p>The Magisters are a pivotal faction in Midnight, offering an array of highly sought-after rewards that significantly enhance your gameplay experience and character customization. Reaching the Luminary rank demonstrates significant dedication and unlocks the faction''s most prestigious offerings, from unique visuals to powerful utility items. Achieving this status through conventional means requires a substantial time investment, often involving repetitive tasks and extensive grinding across multiple days or weeks.</p><h3>Why Choose Our Service</h3><ul><li><p><strong>Time-Saving Efficiency:</strong> Our expert boosters drastically reduce the time needed to reach Luminary status, letting you enjoy the rewards without the grind.</p></li><li><p><strong>Guaranteed Luminary Rank:</strong> We ensure you achieve your desired reputation level, unlocking all associated benefits.</p></li><li><p><strong>Secure Piloted Mode:</strong> Your account''s safety is our priority, with all services performed by professional and trustworthy players.</p></li><li><p><strong>Access to Exclusive Rewards:</strong> Gain early access to coveted cosmetic items, housing decorations, crafting recipes, and battle pets.</p></li><li><p><strong>Flexible Scheduling:</strong> We work around your schedule to deliver the boost at your convenience.</p></li></ul><p>Opt for misti.services for a reliable and professional Midnight Magisters Reputation Boost, and let us handle the grind while you prepare to enjoy your new rewards.</p>', '<ul><li><p><strong>Select Your Range:</strong> Choose your current reputation level and your desired Luminary rank using our intuitive slider.</p></li><li><p><strong>Review Options:</strong> Consider adding extra services like gold or a private stream to enhance your experience.</p></li><li><p><strong>Secure Purchase:</strong> Complete your order through our secure checkout process.</p></li><li><p><strong>Account Coordination:</strong> Our support team will contact you within 15-30 minutes to arrange access to your account for the piloted service.</p></li><li><p><strong>Booster Performs Service:</strong> A professional booster will log in and efficiently farm the necessary reputation to reach your selected rank.</p></li><li><p><strong>Enjoy Rewards:</strong> Once the Luminary rank is achieved, you''ll be notified, and you can fully enjoy all the exclusive Magisters’ rewards.</p></li></ul><p></p>', '<ul><li><p><strong>Active World of Warcraft Subscription:</strong> You must have a current subscription to World of Warcraft.</p></li><li><p><strong>Character Level 90:</strong> Your character must be at level 90. If not, consider our Midnight Leveling Boost.</p></li></ul><p></p>', 0, NULL, NULL, 4.9, 0, true, true, 0, '2026-02-12T22:48:35.468502+00:00', '2026-02-12T22:51:13.841148+00:00', '312870ae-4c42-440f-8510-5704a1c5f333', true, '{"step":1,"end_label":"Desired Rank ","max_value":6,"min_value":1,"default_end":5,"start_label":"Current Rank","default_start":1,"pricing_brackets":[{"end":4,"price":129,"start":1},{"end":6,"price":149,"start":5}],"estimated_time_per_step":5}', true, 0, '15 minutes', 'average start time', 'Flexible', 'order completion', 'Boost your Midnight Magisters reputation to Luminary rank quickly and safely. Unlock exclusive cosmetics, housing items, and pets with our professional service!', 'midnight magisters reputation boost, midnight reputation carry, buy midnight rep, midnight luminary rank, midnight faction boost, midnight magisters rewards, midnight services, wow midnight reputation, fast midnight rep, midnight rep farming, midnight reputation price, buy midnight rep boost, gaming service, fast delivery, professional, reliable, secure, boosting, carry, account', NULL, NULL, 'Midnight Magisters Reputation Boost service graphic', 'Midnight Magisters Reputation Boost | misti.services', '/game/wow/leveling-and-gearing/wow-level-boost');
INSERT INTO public.products (id, name, slug, short_description, description, how_it_works, requirements, base_price, image_url, badge_text, trust_score, total_reviews, is_active, is_featured, sort_order, created_at, updated_at, category_id, is_slider_product, slider_config, is_manually_popular, total_sales, start_time_text, start_time_value, delivery_text, delivery_value, meta_description, meta_keywords, og_image, canonical_url, image_alt_text, meta_title, parent_link) VALUES ('01d53c93-97a6-4957-a86f-5cfa2b16b8f5', 'Engineering ', 'wow-tbc-classic-engineering-boost-gnomish-goblin', 'Engineering is arguably the most unique and fun profession in Burning Crusade Classic, offering a wide array of powerful combat utility items, highly desirable pre-raid gear, and unique quality-of-life tools. It is an extremely popular choice for all classes and roles, particularly Tanks who benefit from specialized high-stamina trinkets, and PvP players who rely on explosives and stun devices.', '<h1><strong>WoW TBC Classic Engineering Profession Boost</strong></h1><p>Engineering is arguably the most unique and fun profession in <strong>Burning Crusade Classic</strong>, offering a wide array of powerful combat utility items, highly desirable pre-raid gear, and unique quality-of-life tools. It is an extremely popular choice for all classes and roles, particularly <strong>Tanks</strong> who benefit from specialized high-stamina trinkets, and <strong>PvP</strong> players who rely on explosives and stun devices.</p><p>The sheer volume of materials and the complexity of the leveling path make Engineering one of the most expensive and time-consuming professions to max out. <strong>Misti.services</strong> handles the entire 1-375 grind, secures the costly materials, and completes the specialization quests, ensuring you get maximum utility with minimum effort.</p><h2><strong>Why Engineering is a Must-Have in TBC</strong></h2><p>Engineering is a source of direct combat advantage and invaluable farming tools, making it a cornerstone profession for competitive players.</p><ul><li><strong>Combat Advantage:</strong> Engineers craft powerful, on-use consumables like <strong>[The Bigger One]</strong> and <strong>[Super Sapper Charge]</strong> for burst AoE damage, alongside utility items like the <strong>[Nigh Invulnerability Belt]</strong> (PvP) and <strong>Jumper Cables</strong> (Raid recovery).</li><li><strong>Best-in-Slot Gear:</strong> Engineers can craft powerful <strong>Goggles</strong> (Helmets) that are excellent pre-raid BiS items for every class and role, with further upgrades available in Phase 5 (<strong>Sunwell Plateau</strong>).</li><li><strong>High-Stamina Trinkets:</strong> Both Gnomish and Goblin branches offer potent trinkets (<strong>[Gnomish Poultryizer]</strong>, <strong>[Goblin Rocket Launcher]</strong>) that are highly valued by tanks for early threat and survivability.</li><li><strong>Gold &amp; Utility Farming:</strong> The <strong>[Zapthrottle Mote Extractor]</strong> is an essential tool for efficiently farming Primals (Motes) from the floating Gas Clouds in Outland, generating significant passive gold.</li><li><strong>Mounts:</strong> Engineers are the only profession capable of crafting the high-speed <strong>[Turbo-Charged Flying Machine Control]</strong> mount.</li></ul><h3><strong>The Engineering Gold Sink: Materials Required</strong></h3><p>Engineering''s cost quickly surpasses most other professions due to the large variety of stone, metal, and cloth needed across 375 levels. Our service includes the sourcing of these costly materials:</p><ul><li><strong>Vanilla Materials:</strong> Requires hundreds of Copper, Silver, Gold, Mithril, and Thorium Bars, along with a high volume of Rough, Coarse, and Dense Stones.</li><li><strong>TBC Core Materials:</strong> Over <strong>430 x [Fel Iron Bar]</strong>, <strong>144 x [Adamantite Bar]</strong>, and a significant amount of <strong>[Khorium Bar]</strong> are needed for the final stages, along with various Motes and Primal materials.</li></ul><h3><strong>Engineering Specializations: Gnomish vs. Goblin</strong></h3><p>At skill level 200, Engineers must choose between Gnomish and Goblin specializations. This choice locks you into specific powerful items. <strong>Misti.services</strong> will complete the challenging specialization quest for your chosen path.</p><h4><strong>Gnomish Engineering (Utility &amp; Defense)</strong></h4><p>The Gnomish path focuses on complex, often erratic, mechanical devices and tools.</p><ul><li><strong>Quest Deliverables:</strong> Requires complex intermediate crafts like <strong>[Mithril Tube]</strong>, <strong>[Accurate Scope]</strong>, and <strong>[Advanced Target Dummy]</strong>.</li><li><strong>Notable Items:</strong></li><li class="ql-indent-1"><strong>[Gnomish Poultryizer]</strong> (Stamina Tank Trinket).</li><li class="ql-indent-1"><strong>[Gnomish Battle Chicken]</strong> (Group Battle Squawk buff).</li><li class="ql-indent-1"><strong>[Nigh Invulnerability Belt]</strong> (Essential PvP shield).</li><li class="ql-indent-1"><strong>[Ultrasafe Transporter: Toshley''s Station]</strong> (Teleport).</li></ul><h4><strong>Goblin Engineering (Explosives &amp; Aggression)</strong></h4><p>The Goblin path focuses on raw firepower and highly destructive explosives.</p><ul><li><strong>Quest Deliverables:</strong> Requires a high quantity of explosives like <strong>[Big Iron Bomb]</strong>, <strong>[Solid Dynamite]</strong>, and <strong>[Explosive Sheep]</strong>.</li><li><strong>Notable Items:</strong></li><li class="ql-indent-1"><strong>[Goblin Rocket Launcher]</strong> (Stamina Tank Trinket/Threat device).</li><li class="ql-indent-1"><strong>[The Bigger One]</strong> (Highest Damage Bomb, craftable only).</li><li class="ql-indent-1"><strong>[Super Sapper Charge]</strong> (Powerful AoE damage, craftable only).</li><li class="ql-indent-1"><strong>[Dimensional Ripper - Area 52]</strong> (Teleport).</li></ul><blockquote><strong>Note:</strong> While some powerful items like the <strong>[Goblin Jumper Cables XL]</strong> and the high-end bombs do not require the specialization to <em>use</em>, you must be a Goblin Engineer to <em>craft</em> them.</blockquote><h3><strong>Misti.services Engineering Boost Guarantee</strong></h3><p>Our comprehensive Engineering service takes you from 1 to 375 while managing the material costs and tedious quest requirements:</p><ul><li><strong>1-375 Skill Guarantee:</strong> We ensure your character reaches maximum skill efficiency.</li><li><strong>Specialization Quest Completion:</strong> We obtain and turn in all necessary materials for your preferred Gnomish or Goblin specialization.</li><li><strong>Master Trainer Access:</strong> We unlock all necessary TBC trainer recipes.</li><li><strong>All Materials Included:</strong> The high cost of all bars, stones, cloth, and elemental motes is covered by our service.</li></ul><p><strong>Stop wasting time farming copper and start crafting BiS gear. Get your Engineering Boost today!</strong></p>', '<ul><li>Select your desired options and complete your order on&nbsp;Misti.Services.</li><li>You’ll receive an order confirmation and tracking number via email.</li><li>Our support manager will contact you through live chat to confirm all details.</li><li>If you’re unavailable, we’ll reach out via email or your preferred contact method.</li><li>When the boost is finished, you’ll receive a completion notification on Discord or another messenger of your choice.</li></ul><p><br></p>', '<ul><li>Level 70 character</li><li>Active WoW Subscription</li></ul>', 0, 'https://kdjlhibxxygfdmlvdfcl.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/game-images/wow-tbc-classic-engineering-boost-gnomish-goblin-1764282172740.webp', NULL, 4.9, 0, true, true, 0, '2025-11-27T21:06:25.099322+00:00', '2026-02-16T10:51:58.223695+00:00', '1dea78b7-88a7-4056-84fb-9f891ece362c', true, '{"step":1,"end_label":"End Value","max_value":375,"min_value":1,"default_end":60,"start_label":"Start Value","default_start":1,"pricing_brackets":[{"end":300,"price":76.5,"start":1},{"end":375,"price":127.5,"start":301}],"estimated_time_per_step":0.0005}', true, 1, '15 minutes', 'average start time', 'Flexible', 'order completion', 'Get 1-375 Engineering fast in TBC Classic. Unlock BiS Goggles, Tank Trinkets, and powerful explosives. We handle all materials and specialization quests.', 'WoW TBC Engineering boost, TBC profession leveling, Gnomish Engineering, Goblin Engineering, TBC Goggles, Zapthrottle Mote Extractor, Engineering 1-375', 'https://kdjlhibxxygfdmlvdfcl.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/game-images/wow-tbc-classic-engineering-boost-gnomish-goblin-1764282172740.webp', NULL, 'Wow Tbc Classic Engineering Boost Gnomish Goblin', 'TBC Classic Engineering Profession | misti.services', NULL);
INSERT INTO public.products (id, name, slug, short_description, description, how_it_works, requirements, base_price, image_url, badge_text, trust_score, total_reviews, is_active, is_featured, sort_order, created_at, updated_at, category_id, is_slider_product, slider_config, is_manually_popular, total_sales, start_time_text, start_time_value, delivery_text, delivery_value, meta_description, meta_keywords, og_image, canonical_url, image_alt_text, meta_title, parent_link) VALUES ('6b0894b5-3f7d-49c7-9724-a49ca0112827', 'Blood Knights', 'midnight-blood-knights-reputation-carry', 'Achieve Luminary reputation with the Blood Knights in Midnight without the daily grind. Our service provides a fast and reliable path to unlock exclusive rewards and collections.', '<h1><strong>Midnight Blood Knights Reputation Carry</strong></h1><p>Elevate your standing with the esteemed <a target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" href="https://www.wowhead.com/item=243612/blood-knights-reputation">Blood Knights</a> faction in Midnight to Luminary rank with our professional reputation carry service. This efficient boost saves you significant time and effort, bypassing the repetitive daily farming activities required to earn your desired reputation level and unlock unique in-game benefits.</p><h2><strong>Service Includes</strong></h2><ul><li><p><strong>Desired Reputation Tier:</strong> We will boost your Blood Knights reputation to the chosen level, up to Luminary.</p></li><li><p><strong>Blood Knights Reputation Gain:</strong> All necessary activities to earn reputation points are covered.</p></li><li><p><strong>Loot and Resources:</strong> Any items, currency, or materials acquired during the reputation grind will remain on your character.</p></li></ul><h2><strong>About Midnight Blood Knights Reputation</strong></h2><p>Gaining reputation with the Blood Knights in Midnight opens the door to a wealth of exclusive rewards, including distinctive cosmetic items, special housing decorations, and powerful Enchanting formulas. Reaching the highest echelons, such as Luminary, typically involves a prolonged commitment to daily quests and specific activities, which can become tedious for many players. Our service provides a streamlined solution to enjoy these benefits without the extensive time investment.</p><h3>Why Choose Our Service</h3><ul><li><p><strong>Time-Saving:</strong> Skip the repetitive daily tasks and enjoy your gaming time on more engaging content.</p></li><li><p><strong>Guaranteed Progress:</strong> Our experienced boosters ensure consistent and efficient reputation gains.</p></li><li><p><strong>Access Exclusive Rewards:</strong> Unlock unique cosmetics, housing items, and powerful formulas faster.</p></li><li><p><strong>Secure and Reliable:</strong> We prioritize account safety and use professional methods for all boosts.</p></li><li><p><strong>Customer Support:</strong> Our dedicated team is available to assist you throughout the process.</p></li></ul><p>misti.services is committed to providing premium gaming assistance, ensuring you achieve your in-game goals efficiently and securely. Let us handle the grind so you can enjoy the rewards.</p>', '<ul><li><p><strong>Select Your Desired Range:</strong> Use the slider to choose your current Blood Knights reputation level and your target Luminary rank.</p></li><li><p><strong>Place Your Order:</strong> Complete the purchase process securely on our website.</p></li><li><p><strong>Account Details:</strong> Our support team will contact you to arrange account access and discuss scheduling.</p></li><li><p><strong>Booster Assignment:</strong> A skilled Midnight booster will be assigned to your order.</p></li><li><p><strong>Reputation Grind:</strong> Our booster will diligently play on your account to achieve the selected reputation level.</p></li><li><p><strong>Completion:</strong> We will notify you once your Blood Knights reputation reaches the desired rank. Enjoy your new rewards!</p></li></ul><p></p>', '<ul>
INSERT INTO public.products (id, name, slug, short_description, description, how_it_works, requirements, base_price, image_url, badge_text, trust_score, total_reviews, is_active, is_featured, sort_order, created_at, updated_at, category_id, is_slider_product, slider_config, is_manually_popular, total_sales, start_time_text, start_time_value, delivery_text, delivery_value, meta_description, meta_keywords, og_image, canonical_url, image_alt_text, meta_title, parent_link) VALUES ('9a154a60-f3b5-4fb0-b94a-c826398caaab', 'Alchemy', 'wow-tbc-classic-alchemy-boost', 'Alchemy is widely considered one of the most versatile and profitable professions in Burning Crusade Classic. Whether you are looking to maximize your raid performance with powerful consumables or generate passive gold through daily cooldowns, Alchemy is a top-tier choice for both main characters and alts.', '<h1><strong>WoW TBC Classic Alchemy Boost</strong></h1><p>Alchemy is widely considered one of the most versatile and profitable professions in <strong>Burning Crusade Classic</strong>. Whether you are looking to maximize your raid performance with powerful consumables or generate passive gold through daily cooldowns, Alchemy is a top-tier choice for both main characters and alts.</p><p>At <strong>Misti.services</strong>, we take the hassle out of herb gathering and skill grinding. We will level your Alchemy from 1 to 375, unlock your desired Specialization, and help you obtain the most sought-after recipes in Outland.</p><h3><strong>Why Choose Alchemy in TBC?</strong></h3><p>Alchemy is the backbone of the PvE and PvP economy. It provides immediate combat benefits and long-term economic value.</p><ul><li><strong>Raid Utility:</strong> Craft essential <strong>Potions</strong>, <strong>Elixirs</strong>, and <strong>Flasks</strong> required for competitive content.</li><li><strong>Gold Making:</strong> Utilize the 20-hour Transmute cooldowns to turn base materials into expensive reagents like <strong>[Primal Might]</strong> or <strong>[Skyfire Diamond]</strong>.</li><li><strong>Cauldrons:</strong> Discover recipes to create Cauldrons, allowing your entire party or raid to benefit from protection potions efficiently.</li><li><strong>Trinket Access:</strong> Unlocks the Alchemist''s Stone trinkets, which are excellent for early gearing.</li></ul><h3><strong>Alchemy Consumables Overview</strong></h3><p>Understanding the consumable system in TBC is vital. Mechanics have changed since Classic, introducing the "Battle" and "Guardian" system.</p><h4><strong>1. Potions</strong></h4><p>Potions provide instant benefits, such as restoring resources or granting a short burst of power.</p><ul><li><strong>Cooldown:</strong> 2 minutes.</li><li><strong>Top Crafts:</strong> <strong>[Super Mana Potion]</strong>, <strong>[Haste Potion]</strong>, and <strong>[Destruction Potion]</strong>.</li><li><strong>Utility:</strong> We can help you unlock Protection Potion recipes which may lead to discovering <strong>Cauldrons</strong> (e.g., <strong>[Cauldron of Major Shadow Protection]</strong>).</li></ul><h4><strong>2. Elixirs</strong></h4><p>Elixirs provide long-duration buffs (1 hour). In TBC, you can have <strong>one Battle Elixir</strong> and <strong>one Guardian Elixir</strong> active simultaneously.</p><ul><li><strong>Battle Elixirs:</strong> Offensive stats (e.g., <strong>[Elixir of Healing Power]</strong>, <strong>[Adept''s Elixir]</strong>).</li><li><strong>Guardian Elixirs:</strong> Defensive/Utility stats (e.g., <strong>[Elixir of Major Defense]</strong>, <strong>[Elixir of Draenic Wisdom]</strong>).</li></ul><h4><strong>3. Flasks</strong></h4><p>Flasks are the ultimate consumable. They persist through death and provide powerful buffs for 2 hours.</p><ul><li><strong>Note:</strong> A Flask counts as <em>both</em> a Battle and a Guardian elixir.</li><li><strong>Top Crafts:</strong> <strong>[Flask of Pure Death]</strong>, <strong>[Flask of Relentless Assault]</strong>, and <strong>[Flask of Fortification]</strong>.</li><li><strong>Location:</strong> Flasks require an Alchemy Lab to craft (found in Shattrath City).</li></ul><h4><strong>4. Transmutes</strong></h4><p>The primary gold-maker for Alchemists. TBC Transmutes share a <strong>20-hour cooldown</strong>.</p><ul><li><strong>Key Transmutes:</strong> <strong>[Primal Might]</strong>, <strong>[Earthstorm Diamond]</strong>, and <strong>[Skyfire Diamond]</strong>.</li><li><strong>Synergy:</strong> Combine with Jewelcrafting or Mining to maximize profit margins.</li></ul><h3><strong>Alchemy Specializations (Masteries)</strong></h3><p>Introduced in TBC, choosing a specialization is critical. Once specialized, you have a chance to <strong>proc additional items</strong> (usually ~17% more yield) when crafting items of that type. <strong>Misti.services</strong> can complete these tedious prerequisite quests for you.</p><h4><strong>Elixir Master</strong></h4><ul><li><strong>Benefit:</strong> Chance to create extra Elixirs and Flasks.</li><li><strong>Best For:</strong> Raiders and Guild Alchemists who supply flasks.</li><li><strong>Quest:</strong> Requires items from The Black Morass and crafting various high-level elixirs.</li></ul><h4><strong>Potion Master</strong></h4><ul><li><strong>Benefit:</strong> Chance to create extra Potions.</li><li><strong>Best For:</strong> High-volume sellers of mana/health/haste potions.</li><li><strong>Quest:</strong> Requires items from The Botanica and crafting high-level potions.</li></ul><h4><strong>Transmutation Master</strong></h4><ul><li><strong>Benefit:</strong> Chance to create extra Transmutes (e.g., proccing x2 <strong>[Primal Might]</strong>).</li><li><strong>Best For:</strong> Passive gold making via daily cooldowns.</li><li><strong>Quest:</strong> Requires turning in 4x <strong>[Primal Might]</strong> to Zarevhi in Netherstorm. <em>Note: This is the most expensive mastery to unlock.</em></li></ul><blockquote><strong>Pro Tip:</strong> If you want Transmutation Master, it is often cheaper to complete the Potion or Elixir quest first, pay 150g to unlearn it, and then instantly learn Transmutation Master without paying the Primal Might cost. We can handle this optimization for you.</blockquote><h3><strong>Important Recipes &amp; Acquisition</strong></h3><p>Many of the best recipes are not learned from trainers; they must be <strong>Discovered</strong> by crafting other items or purchased after grinding <strong>Reputation</strong>.</p><h4><strong>Top Discoverable Recipes</strong></h4><p><em>These are learned randomly while crafting Outland alchemy items.</em></p><ul><li><strong>[Flask of Blinding Light]</strong> (Arcane/Holy/Nature Dmg)</li><li><strong>[Flask of Pure Death]</strong> (Shadow/Fire/Frost Dmg)</li><li><strong>[Flask of Relentless Assault]</strong> (Attack Power)</li><li><strong>[Super Rejuvenation Potion]</strong></li><li><strong>[Cauldron of Major Shadow Protection]</strong></li></ul><h4><strong>Top Reputation &amp; Drop Recipes</strong></h4><ul><li><strong>[Recipe: Haste Potion]:</strong> World Drop (BiS for Physical DPS).</li><li><strong>[Recipe: Destruction Potion]:</strong> World Drop (BiS for Casters).</li><li><strong>[Recipe: Transmute Primal Might]:</strong> Sold by Vendors (Standard Transmute).</li><li><strong>[Recipe: Major Nature Protection Potion]:</strong> Exalted with Cenarion Expedition.</li><li><strong>[Recipe: Flask of Distilled Wisdom]:</strong> Exalted with Cenarion Expedition.</li><li><strong>[Recipe: Transmute Earthstorm Diamond]:</strong> Honored with Cenarion Expedition.</li></ul><h3><strong>What Our Service Includes</strong></h3><p>When you order an Alchemy boost from <strong>Misti.services</strong>, you can expect:</p><ul><li><strong>Leveling 1-375:</strong> We farm the herbs and perform the crafts to hit max skill.</li><li><strong>Specialization Unlock:</strong> We complete the questlines for Potion, Elixir, or Transmutation Master.</li><li><strong>Recipe Farming:</strong> Optional add-ons to grind reputation or farm specific world-drop recipes.</li><li><strong>Secure &amp; Fast:</strong> Performed by experienced players using VPNs for account safety.</li></ul><p><strong>Ready to become the Master Alchemist? Select your options above and let us brew success for you!</strong></p>', '<ul><li>Select your desired options and complete your order on&nbsp;Misti.Services.</li><li>You’ll receive an order confirmation and tracking number via email.</li><li>Our support manager will contact you through live chat to confirm all details.</li><li>If you’re unavailable, we’ll reach out via email or your preferred contact method.</li><li>When the boost is finished, you’ll receive a completion notification on Discord or another messenger of your choice.</li></ul>', '<ul><li>Level 70 character</li><li>Active WoW Subscription</li></ul>', 0, 'https://kdjlhibxxygfdmlvdfcl.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/game-images/wow-tbc-classic-alchemy-boost-1764280478745.webp', NULL, 4.9, 0, true, true, 0, '2025-11-27T20:50:00.549368+00:00', '2026-02-16T10:51:58.692215+00:00', '1dea78b7-88a7-4056-84fb-9f891ece362c', true, '{"step":1,"end_label":"End Value","max_value":375,"min_value":1,"default_end":60,"start_label":"Start Value","default_start":1,"pricing_brackets":[{"end":375,"price":226.95,"start":1}],"estimated_time_per_step":0.0005}', true, 0, '15 minutes', 'average start time', 'Flexible', 'order completion', 'Master Alchemy in TBC Classic without the grind. We offer 1-375 Alchemy boosting, Specialization quests (Elixir, Potion, Transmute), and rare recipe farming.', 'WoW TBC Alchemy boost, TBC Classic profession leveling, Transmutation Master service, Elixir Master quest, buy WoW TBC alchemy, Primal Might transmute, TBC Flasks,', 'https://kdjlhibxxygfdmlvdfcl.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/game-images/wow-tbc-classic-alchemy-boost-1764280478745.webp', NULL, 'Wow Tbc Classic Alchemy Boost', 'WoW TBC Alchemy Profession Boost | misti.services', NULL);
INSERT INTO public.products (id, name, slug, short_description, description, how_it_works, requirements, base_price, image_url, badge_text, trust_score, total_reviews, is_active, is_featured, sort_order, created_at, updated_at, category_id, is_slider_product, slider_config, is_manually_popular, total_sales, start_time_text, start_time_value, delivery_text, delivery_value, meta_description, meta_keywords, og_image, canonical_url, image_alt_text, meta_title, parent_link) VALUES ('fa7d5776-54ec-42cb-8eb2-8dfdf6277e04', 'Hourglass of the Unraveller', 'tbc-anniversary-hourglass-of-the-unraveller-carry', 'Secure the rare Hourglass of the Unraveller trinket from The Black Morass in WoW TBC Classic. Our professional team will efficiently farm this valuable item for your character, saving you time and effort.', '<h1><strong>TBC Anniversary Hourglass of the Unraveller Carry</strong></h1><p>Obtain the highly sought-after Hourglass of the Unraveller trinket in WoW TBC Classic with our anniversary carry service. This unique item drops from Normal The Black Morass, and our expert team provides efficient farming to ensure you get this valuable TBC trinket without the repetitive grind.</p><h2><strong>Service Includes</strong></h2><ul><li><p><strong>Trinket:</strong> The prestigious <a target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" href="https://www.wowhead.com/tbc/item=28034/hourglass-of-the-unraveller">Hourglass of the Unraveller</a>.</p></li><li><p><strong>Dungeon Runs:</strong> Numerous runs through The Black Morass on normal difficulty until the trinket drops.</p></li><li><p><strong>Bonus Gear:</strong> Opportunities to acquire other dungeon items during the farming process.</p></li></ul><h2><strong>About the Hourglass of the Unraveller</strong></h2><p>The Hourglass of the Unraveller is a powerful trinket from The Black Morass dungeon, a classic instance in WoW TBC. Known for its significant stat benefits, it''s a must-have for many classes and specializations. However, farming this particular drop can be a tedious and time-consuming undertaking, often requiring many repeated runs.</p><h3>Why Choose Our Service</h3><ul><li><p><strong>Guaranteed Drop:</strong> We farm until the Hourglass of the Unraveller is yours, no matter how many runs it takes.</p></li><li><p><strong>Time-Saving:</strong> Skip the repetitive grind and let our experienced boosters handle the farming for you.</p></li><li><p><strong>Security:</strong> Our piloted service ensures your account''s safety and privacy throughout the boosting process.</p></li><li><p><strong>Efficiency:</strong> Our team knows the optimal strategies to clear The Black Morass quickly and effectively.</p></li></ul><p>Let misti.services help you acquire this essential TBC Anniversary Hourglass of the Unraveller trinket today, making your gaming experience more enjoyable and rewarding.</p>', '<ul><li><p><strong>Select Your Options:</strong> Choose any additional services like extra gold or stream.</p></li><li><p><strong>Confirm Order:</strong> Complete your purchase securely on misti.services.</p></li><li><p><strong>Account Details:</strong> Our support team will contact you to arrange account access for the piloted service.</p></li><li><p><strong>Boosting Commences:</strong> A professional booster will begin farming The Black Morass on your character until the Hourglass of the Unraveller drops.</p></li><li><p><strong>Completion:</strong> Once the trinket is secured, we will notify you, and you can enjoy your new powerful item.</p></li></ul><p></p>', '<ul>
INSERT INTO public.products (id, name, slug, short_description, description, how_it_works, requirements, base_price, image_url, badge_text, trust_score, total_reviews, is_active, is_featured, sort_order, created_at, updated_at, category_id, is_slider_product, slider_config, is_manually_popular, total_sales, start_time_text, start_time_value, delivery_text, delivery_value, meta_description, meta_keywords, og_image, canonical_url, image_alt_text, meta_title, parent_link) VALUES ('ce98802d-08f7-42e8-a932-b31cb4566752', 'Tailoring', 'wow-tbc-classic-tailoring-boost-specialization-sets', 'Tailoring is one of the most game-changing and powerful professions in Burning Crusade Classic, offering essential Best-in-Slot (BiS) gear sets, permanent armor enhancements, and crucial bags for all Caster and Healing classes (Mages, Warlocks, Priests, Druids, Shamans).', '<h1><strong>WoW TBC Classic Tailoring Profession Boost</strong></h1><p>Tailoring is one of the most game-changing and powerful professions in <strong>Burning Crusade Classic</strong>, offering essential Best-in-Slot (BiS) gear sets, permanent armor enhancements, and crucial bags for all Caster and Healing classes (Mages, Warlocks, Priests, Druids, Shamans).</p><p>The power of Tailoring lies in its unique <strong>Specializations</strong> which double the output of daily cooldown cloths (Spellcloth, Shadowcloth, Primal Mooncloth). The process is material-intensive, relying heavily on <strong>[Netherweave Cloth]</strong> and long quest chains. <strong>Misti.services</strong> handles the entire 1-375 grind, securing the vast cloth supply, and completing your chosen specialization quest quickly and efficiently.</p><h2><strong>Why Tailoring is a Caster''s Mandatory Profession</strong></h2><p>Tailoring provides direct, powerful combat benefits and permanent quality-of-life upgrades that are non-transferable.</p><ul><li><strong>BiS Phase 1/2 Gear:</strong> Tailors craft the three defining specialized gear sets—<strong>Spellfire Set</strong> (Fire/Arcane), <strong>Frozen Shadoweave Set</strong> (Frost/Shadow), and <strong>Primal Mooncloth Set</strong> (Healing/Mana Regen)—which are often pre-raid and early raid BiS items.</li><li><strong>Specialization Cooldowns:</strong> Being specialized allows you to craft <strong>two specialty cloths</strong> (e.g., Spellcloth) per daily cooldown, instead of one. This is absolutely critical for crafting your gear faster and for passive gold making.</li><li><strong>Permanent Enchantments:</strong> Tailors craft the powerful Bind-on-Pickup (BoP) leg enchantments like <strong>[Runic Spellthread]</strong> and <strong>[Runic Healing Spellthread]</strong>.</li><li><strong>Bag Creation:</strong> Tailors craft all high-capacity bags, including the 20-slot <strong>[Netherweave Bag]</strong> and various specialized containers.</li></ul><h3><strong>The Specialization System: Double Your Cloth Output</strong></h3><p>The choice of specialization at skill 350 is the most important decision for a Tailor in TBC. Our service completes the corresponding quest to unlock this permanent, material-doubling benefit.</p><h3><strong>The Material Cost: The Netherweave Consumption</strong></h3><p>Tailoring requires one of the highest volumes of base materials of any profession in TBC. The primary cost driver is <strong>[Netherweave Cloth]</strong>.</p><ul><li><strong>TBC Material Estimate:</strong> Leveling 300-375 requires approximately <strong>2040–2160 x [Netherweave Cloth]</strong>.</li><li><strong>Final Stages:</strong> The leveling path relies on crafting <strong>Bolt of Netherweave</strong>, <strong>Bolt of Imbued Netherweave</strong>, and then high-cost items like <strong>Netherweave Tunic</strong> and <strong>Imbued Netherweave Tunic</strong>.</li><li><strong>Mana Loom:</strong> The creation of <strong>Bolt of Imbued Netherweave</strong> requires the use of a <strong>Mana Loom</strong> in Shattrath (near the specialization trainers), adding an extra step to the crafting process.</li></ul><h3><strong>Misti.services Tailoring Boost Guarantee</strong></h3><p>Take the fastest route to raid-ready gear and gold earning. Our Tailoring boost is guaranteed to provide you with a maxed profession and the crucial specialization benefit.</p><ul><li><strong>Full Skill Maxing (1-375):</strong> We handle the massive cloth requirement and complicated leveling path.</li><li><strong>Specialization Completion:</strong> We complete the entire quest chain for your chosen specialization (Spellfire, Shadoweave, or Mooncloth).</li><li><strong>BiS Patterns Unlocked:</strong> We unlock all core trainer recipes and ensure you have access to the materials needed for your specialization gear sets.</li><li><strong>Mana Loom Ready:</strong> Your character will be familiar with the crafting locations necessary for high-end item creation.</li></ul><p><strong>Start crafting your BiS gear today. Secure your Tailoring Boost and double your cloth output!</strong></p>', '<ul><li>Select your desired options and complete your order on&nbsp;Misti.Services.</li><li>You’ll receive an order confirmation and tracking number via email.</li><li>Our support manager will contact you through live chat to confirm all details.</li><li>If you’re unavailable, we’ll reach out via email or your preferred contact method.</li><li>When the boost is finished, you’ll receive a completion notification on Discord or another messenger of your choice.</li></ul>', '<ul><li>Level 70 character</li><li>Active WoW Subscription</li></ul>', 0, 'https://kdjlhibxxygfdmlvdfcl.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/game-images/wow-tbc-classic-tailoring-boost-specialization-sets-1764281901924.webp', NULL, 4.9, 0, true, true, 0, '2025-11-27T21:21:12.916321+00:00', '2026-02-16T10:51:57.475832+00:00', '1dea78b7-88a7-4056-84fb-9f891ece362c', true, '{"step":1,"end_label":"End Value","max_value":375,"min_value":1,"default_end":60,"start_label":"Start Value","default_start":1,"pricing_brackets":[{"end":300,"price":76.5,"start":1},{"end":375,"price":127.5,"start":301}],"estimated_time_per_step":0.0005}', true, 1, '15 minutes', 'average start time', 'Flexible', 'order completion', 'Buy 1-375 Tailoring boost in TBC Classic. Unlock BiS Spellfire, Frozen Shadoweave, or Primal Mooncloth sets and double your daily cloth cooldowns instantly.', 'WoW TBC Tailoring boost, TBC Tailoring leveling, Spellfire Set, Frozen Shadoweave, Primal Mooncloth, Tailoring specialization, Netherweave Cloth, Runic Spellthread.', 'https://kdjlhibxxygfdmlvdfcl.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/game-images/wow-tbc-classic-tailoring-boost-specialization-sets-1764281901924.webp', NULL, 'Wow Tbc Classic Tailoring Boost Specialization Sets', 'WoW TBC Tailoring Boost - BiS Gear | misti.services', NULL);
INSERT INTO public.products (id, name, slug, short_description, description, how_it_works, requirements, base_price, image_url, badge_text, trust_score, total_reviews, is_active, is_featured, sort_order, created_at, updated_at, category_id, is_slider_product, slider_config, is_manually_popular, total_sales, start_time_text, start_time_value, delivery_text, delivery_value, meta_description, meta_keywords, og_image, canonical_url, image_alt_text, meta_title, parent_link) VALUES ('550da282-b569-42a0-b579-957d0fff7e54', 'Tempest Keep Attunement', 'tempest-keep-attunement', 'Tempest Keep (TK) is a 25-man raid instance and home to Kael''thas Sunstrider. The attunement process, known as the Trials of the Naaru, is a grueling test of skill, speed, and tenacity across multiple Heroic dungeons and a major raid boss.', '<h1><strong>Tempest Keep (TK) Attunement Boost – Trial of the Naaru</strong></h1><p>Tired of LFG spam for specific Heroic dungeon clears or struggling to keep Millhouse Manastorm alive? Misti.Services offers a fast, secure, and professional <strong>Tempest Keep Attunement Boost</strong>. We guarantee success across all four <strong>Trials of the Naaru</strong>, securing your access to the Eye of the Storm and earning you the powerful <strong>Phoenix-fire Band</strong>.</p><p>Our expert dungeon and raid teams handle the strict mechanics and coordination required across <strong>four Heroic Dungeons</strong> and the <strong>Magtheridon''s Lair</strong> raid, ensuring you receive <strong>The Tempest Key</strong>.</p><h2><strong>Overview</strong></h2><p><strong>Tempest Keep (TK)</strong> is a 25-man raid instance and home to Kael''thas Sunstrider. The attunement process, known as the <strong>Trials of the Naaru</strong>, is a grueling test of skill, speed, and tenacity across multiple Heroic dungeons and a major raid boss.</p><ul><li><strong>Prerequisite:</strong> This chain cannot begin until <strong>The Cipher of Damnation</strong> questline in Shadowmoon Valley is fully completed.</li><li><strong>Primary Reward:</strong> <strong>The Tempest Key</strong> (raid access) and the <strong>Phoenix-fire Band</strong> (a powerful epic ring).</li></ul><h2><strong>The Attunement Process: Trial of the Naaru</strong></h2><p>The service handles the entire chain starting with Khadgar in Shattrath, clearing the four challenges set forth by A''dal.</p><h3><strong>1. Trial of Mercy (The Shattered Halls Heroic)</strong></h3><ul><li><strong>The Challenge:</strong> We must clear the instance quickly to reach the Shattered Hand Executioner <em>before</em> he executes any prisoners.</li><li><strong>The Goal:</strong> Defeating the Executioner fast enough to loot the <strong>Unused Axe of the Executioner</strong>.</li></ul><h3><strong>2. Trial of Strength (The Steamvault &amp; Shadow Labyrinth Heroic)</strong></h3><ul><li><strong>The Challenge:</strong> This trial requires two separate dungeon runs.</li><li><strong>The Goal:</strong> Defeating <strong>Warlord Kalithresh</strong> in Steamvault Heroic for <strong>Kalithresh''s Trident</strong>, and defeating <strong>Murmur</strong> in Shadow Labyrinth Heroic for <strong>Murmur''s Essence</strong>.</li></ul><h3><strong>3. Trial of Tenacity (The Arcatraz Heroic)</strong></h3><ul><li><strong>The Challenge:</strong> This is one of the most mechanically difficult Heroic runs.</li><li><strong>The Goal:</strong> We defeat <strong>Harbinger Skyriss</strong> while ensuring <strong>Millhouse Manastorm</strong> (released during the fight) survives the encounter to receive credit for the quest. <em>We specialize in keeping Millhouse alive!</em></li></ul><h3><strong>4. Trial of Magtheridon (Magtheridon''s Lair)</strong></h3><ul><li><strong>The Challenge:</strong> The final step requires coordination in a 25-man raid.</li><li><strong>The Goal:</strong> We take your character into <strong>Magtheridon''s Lair</strong> to defeat <strong>Magtheridon</strong> and complete the quest.</li></ul><h3><strong>Completion</strong></h3><p>After the trials, we return to A''dal to receive <strong>The Tempest Key</strong>, granting permanent access to Tempest Keep.</p><h2><strong>Why Choose Our Tempest Keep Attunement Boost</strong></h2><p>This attunement is time-consuming and prone to failure when relying on PUGs due to the strict mechanical requirements in Heroic dungeons. Misti.Services offers the guaranteed solution:</p><ul><li><strong>Guaranteed Mechanics:</strong> We guarantee the difficult timed kill in Shattered Halls and the successful survival of <strong>Millhouse Manastorm</strong> in Arcatraz.</li><li><strong>Magtheridon Kill Secured:</strong> No need to join uncertain Magtheridon groups; our raid teams guarantee the kill and quest credit.</li><li><strong>Save Time on LFG:</strong> We eliminate the hours of effort required to find competent groups for four different Heroic attunement runs.</li></ul><p><strong>Unlock the most iconic raids in the expansion! Order your Tempest Keep Attunement Boost today.</strong></p>', '<ul><li><strong>Place Your Order:</strong> Select the service and confirm your prerequisites are met.</li><li><strong>Coordination &amp; Scheduling:</strong> We contact you to schedule the raid slots (Magtheridon) and dungeon runs. Since Magtheridon is a weekly lockout, coordination is key.</li><li><strong>The Boost:</strong> Our professional booster logs into your account using a VPN matching your country for maximum security. They will queue for the four Heroics, executing the specific mechanical requirements (like saving Millhouse), and attend the Magtheridon raid.</li><li><strong>Completion:</strong> Once the final trial is complete, we notify you. Your character will have <strong>The Tempest Key</strong> and the <strong>Phoenix-fire Band</strong> in their inventory!</li></ul>', '<ul><li><strong>Level 70 Character:</strong> Required for all dungeon and raid entries.</li><li><strong>Cipher of Damnation Completed:</strong> You must have finished this prerequisite quest chain in Shadowmoon Valley.</li><li><strong>Heroic Keys:</strong> You must have the keys/reputation required to enter:</li><li class="ql-indent-1">Shattered Halls Heroic (Requires Honored with Thrallmar/Honor Hold).</li><li class="ql-indent-1">Steamvault Heroic (Requires Honored with Cenarion Expedition).</li><li class="ql-indent-1">Shadow Labyrinth Heroic (Requires Honored with Lower City).</li><li class="ql-indent-1">The Arcatraz Heroic (Requires Exalted with Sha''tar).</li></ul>', 89.1, 'https://kdjlhibxxygfdmlvdfcl.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/game-images/tempest-keep-attunement-1764022218630.webp', NULL, 4.9, 0, true, true, 0, '2025-11-24T11:20:57.5667+00:00', '2026-02-16T10:51:03.586244+00:00', '116b15ba-d76a-44a3-b1be-5bcb88c71693', false, NULL, true, 0, '15 minutes', 'average start time', 'Flexible', 'order completion', 'Buy Cipher of Damnation boost! We complete the full Oronok Torn-heart chain, kill Cyrukh the Firelord, and unlock the Tempest Keep attunement chain.', 'Cipher of Damnation questline, Oronok Torn-heart, Tempest Keep pre-quest, Cyrukh the Firelord kill, Ruul the Darkener, Hand of Gul''dan quest, Shadowmoon Valley quests, Letter from Shattrath, Khadgar''s staff quest, tempest keep attunement,tempest keep boost,tk attunement,tbc tk boost,tempest keep carry, wow tbc tk attunement', 'https://kdjlhibxxygfdmlvdfcl.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/game-images/tempest-keep-attunement-1764022218630.webp', NULL, 'Tempest Keep Attunement', 'WoW TBC Tempest Keep Attunement | misti.services', NULL);
