chantments are faithfully preserved. While the duplicated item cannot be further modified, its value lies in creating perfect copies of already optimized gear, making it a cornerstone for true endgame customization. For many, finding a Mirror is a once-in-a-lifetime event, solidifying its status as an aspirational achievement and a significant economic driver within the game.</p><h3><strong>Why Choose Our Service</strong></h3><ul><li><strong>Guaranteed Access:</strong> Secure the rare Mirror of Kalandra without relying on luck or endless farming.</li><li><strong>Instant Delivery:</strong> Receive your purchased currency quickly, allowing you to enhance your build without delay.</li><li><strong>Unmatched Rarity:</strong> Gain access to the scarcest and most powerful currency item in PoE 2.</li><li><strong>Player Safety:</strong> Our methods prioritize the security of your account and in-game assets.</li><li><strong>Expert Handling:</strong> Services are carried out by experienced players ensuring a smooth and efficient process.</li></ul><p>At misti.services, we understand the value of your time and your desire for ultimate power in Path of Exile 2. Purchasing a Mirror of Kalandra from us is your shortcut to unparalleled gear duplication and economic advantage. Elevate your gameplay today.</p>', '<ul><li><strong>Select Your Quantity:</strong> Choose the desired number of Mirrors of Kalandra on our product page.</li><li><strong>Order Confirmation:</strong> Our team will contact you within 10-15 minutes to confirm your order details.</li><li><strong>In-Game Trade:</strong> A booster will add you in Path of Exile 2 and initiate a secure trade.</li><li><strong>Receive Your Mirror:</strong> During the trade, place any rare item into the trade window and receive your Mirror of Kalandra instantly.</li><li><strong>Enjoy Your Power:</strong> Utilize your new currency to duplicate your strongest items and dominate the game.</li></ul>', '<ul><li><strong>Path of Exile 2 Account:</strong> You must own a Path of Exile 2 account.</li><li><strong>Rare Item for Trade:</strong> You will need a rare item (not unique or magic) to trade to our booster for security purposes.</li><li><strong>In-Game Communication:</strong> Limit in-game chat to essential greetings to ensure account safety.</li></ul>', 0, 'https://kdjlhibxxygfdmlvdfcl.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/game-images/poe-2-mirror-of-kalandra-1767553157937.webp', NULL, 4.9, 0, true, true, 0, '2026-01-04T18:36:23.163771+00:00', '2026-02-17T10:09:44.830568+00:00', '82b5f114-f1d2-41a5-9f5a-d02323795dfc', true, '{"step":1,"max_value":100,"min_value":1,"slider_type":"single","value_label":"Mirrors of Kalandra","default_value":1,"pricing_brackets":[{"end":300,"price":23.042618,"start":1}],"estimated_time_per_step":0}', true, 0, '15 minutes', 'average start time', '10 Minutes ', 'order completion', 'Secure your PoE 2 Mirror of Kalandra and duplicate your strongest items. Get this rarest currency in Path of Exile 2 instantly and safely. Buy now!', 'poe 2 mirror of kalandra buy, poe 2 mirror of kalandra price, poe 2 currency, poe 2 mirror, path of exile 2 mirror of kalandra, poe 2 items, poe 2 boost, poe 2 service, buy poe 2 mirror, price poe 2 mirror, get poe 2 mirror, fast poe 2 mirror, safe poe 2 mirror, poe 2 rare currency, poe 2 best currency, duplicate item poe 2, poe 2 endgame, poe 2 trade, poe 2 services, poe 2 instant delivery, path of exile 2 currency, path of exile 2 mirror, buy path of exile 2 mirror of kalandra, path of exile 2 mirror price, poe 2 legendary item', 'https://kdjlhibxxygfdmlvdfcl.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/game-images/poe-2-mirror-of-kalandra-1767553157937.webp', NULL, 'Poe 2 Mirror Of Kalandra', 'Buy PoE 2 Mirror of Kalandra Quickly | misti.services', NULL);
INSERT INTO public.products (id, name, slug, short_description, description, how_it_works, requirements, base_price, image_url, badge_text, trust_score, total_reviews, is_active, is_featured, sort_order, created_at, updated_at, category_id, is_slider_product, slider_config, is_manually_popular, total_sales, start_time_text, start_time_value, delivery_text, delivery_value, meta_description, meta_keywords, og_image, canonical_url, image_alt_text, meta_title, parent_link) VALUES ('2c784d82-ea30-4860-b864-ebd32b90b9b6', 'The Cipher of Damnation', 'the-cipher-of-damnation', 'The Cipher of Damnation is one of the longest and most important quest chains in Shadowmoon Valley. While it offers excellent pre-raid blue rewards, its primary importance is serving as the mandatory pre-requisite for the Tempest Keep Attunement.', '<h1><strong>Cipher of Damnation Questline Boost – WoW TBC Classic</strong></h1><p>Is the massive <strong>Cipher of Damnation</strong> quest chain standing between you and your Tempest Keep attunement? Misti.Services offers a fast, secure, and professional <strong>Cipher of Damnation Questline Boost</strong>. We handle the tedious travel across Shadowmoon Valley, the annoyance of farming Shadowmoon Tubers, and the difficult elite group kills required to complete this legendary chain.</p><p>Our expert boosters manage the entire storyline—from <strong>The Hand of Gul''dan</strong> to the defeat of <strong>Cyrukh the Firelord</strong>—ensuring you receive the "Letter from Shattrath" to begin your Trials of the Naaru.</p><h2><strong>Overview</strong></h2><p><strong>The Cipher of Damnation</strong> is one of the longest and most important quest chains in Shadowmoon Valley. While it offers excellent pre-raid blue rewards, its primary importance is serving as the mandatory pre-requisite for the <strong>Tempest Keep Attunement</strong>.</p><p>You cannot begin the "Trial of the Naaru" questline until you have completed the Cipher of Damnation. This chain involves running errands for <strong>Oronok Torn-heart</strong> and his three sons, culminating in difficult group encounters that can be hard to solo or find a group for.</p><h2><strong>The Quest Chain Process</strong></h2><p>Our service covers every step of this lengthy saga, saving you hours of travel time and mob grinding.</p><h3><strong>1. The Hand of Gul''dan (The Beginning)</strong></h3><p>We pick up the starting quest at <strong>Wildhammer Stronghold</strong> (Alliance) or <strong>Shadowmoon Village</strong> (Horde) and proceed to <strong>Earthmender Torlok</strong>.</p><ul><li><strong>Elemental Grinding:</strong> We complete the <em>Enraged Spirits</em> series (Fire, Earth, Water, Air) by placing totems and capturing elemental souls.</li><li><strong>Finding Oronok:</strong> We are sent to find <strong>Oronok Torn-heart</strong> in the northern part of the zone.</li></ul><h3><strong>2. Tubers and History</strong></h3><p>We handle the tedious chores for Oronok:</p><ul><li><strong>I Was A Lot Of Things...:</strong> We farm <strong>Shadowmoon Tubers</strong> using the boar whistle (a notoriously annoying quest).</li><li><strong>A Lesson Learned:</strong> We destroy Ravenous Flayer Eggs.</li></ul><h3><strong>3. The Three Fragments (The Sons of Oronok)</strong></h3><p>We track down Oronok''s three sons to recover the fragments of the Cipher.</p><ul><li><strong>First Fragment (Grom''tor):</strong> Located at Coilskar Point. We loot the fragment from the Coilskar Chests.</li><li><strong>Second Fragment (Ar''tor):</strong> Located at Illidari Point. We kill demons to recover his bow and defeat <strong>Veneratus the Many</strong>.</li><li><strong>Third Fragment (Borak):</strong> Located at Eclipse Point. This is the most complex step involving:</li><li class="ql-indent-1">The <strong>Rotten Arakkoa Egg</strong> run to Shattrath.</li><li class="ql-indent-1">The <strong>Bundle of Bloodthistle</strong> stealth mission.</li><li class="ql-indent-1">Disguising as a Blood Elf to speak to Grand Commander Ruusk.</li><li class="ql-indent-1"><strong>Elite Kill:</strong> Defeating <strong>Ruul the Darkener</strong> (Group Quest).</li></ul><h3><strong>4. The Finale (Cyrukh the Firelord)</strong></h3><p>Once all fragments are returned to Oronok, we summon the final boss.</p><ul><li><strong>The Cipher of Damnation:</strong> We summon and defeat the elite boss <strong>Cyrukh the Firelord</strong>.</li><li><strong>Completion:</strong> We return to Earthmender Torlok to turn in the final quest.</li></ul><h2><strong>Why Choose Our Cipher of Damnation Boost</strong></h2><p>This quest chain is a "rite of passage" in TBC that many players dread doing on alts due to its length and the elite mobs at the end. Misti.Services offers the stress-free alternative:</p><ul><li><strong>Elite Kills Handled:</strong> No need to spam "LFG Cyrukh" or "LFG Ruul" in chat for hours. Our boosters can handle these elites solo or with their own support.</li><li><strong>Tuber Farming Done:</strong> We handle the boring boar whistling so you don''t have to.</li><li><strong>TK Access Unlocked:</strong> We ensure the chain is fully completed so you can immediately pick up <em>The Tempest Key</em> questline in Shattrath.</li></ul><p><strong>Unlock the path to Kael''thas! Order your Cipher of Damnation Questline Boost today.</strong></p>', '<ul><li><strong>Place Your Order:</strong> Select the service and provide your character details.</li><li><strong>Scheduling:</strong> We will contact you to confirm a time window for the boost.</li><li><strong>The Boost:</strong> Our professional booster logs into your account using a VPN matching your country. They will efficiently run the entire quest route.</li><li><strong>Completion:</strong> Once <strong>Cyrukh the Firelord</strong> is defeated and the quest is turned in, we will notify you. You will then check your in-game mail for the <strong>Letter from Shattrath</strong>, which starts your Tempest Keep attunement!</li></ul>', '<ul><li><strong>Level 70 Character:</strong> Required to survive the high-level mobs in Shadowmoon Valley.</li><li><strong>Flying Mount:</strong> Highly recommended to speed up the service, as the quest chain requires traveling to every corner of the zone.</li></ul>', 89.1, 'https://kdjlhibxxygfdmlvdfcl.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/game-images/the-cipher-of-damnation-1764022889979.webp', NULL, 4.9, 0, true, true, 0, '2025-11-24T11:16:46.091714+00:00', '2026-02-16T10:51:03.768027+00:00', '116b15ba-d76a-44a3-b1be-5bcb88c71693', false, NULL, true, 0, '15 minutes', 'average start time', 'Flexible', 'order completion', 'Buy Cipher of Damnation boost! We complete the full Oronok Torn-heart chain, kill Cyrukh the Firelord, and unlock the Tempest Keep attunement chain.', 'Cipher of Damnation questline, Oronok Torn-heart, Tempest Keep pre-quest, Cyrukh the Firelord kill, Ruul the Darkener, Hand of Gul''dan quest, Shadowmoon Valley quests, Letter from Shattrath, Khadgar''s staff quest', 'https://kdjlhibxxygfdmlvdfcl.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/game-images/the-cipher-of-damnation-1764022889979.webp', NULL, 'The Cipher Of Damnation', 'WoW TBC Cipher of Damnation Attunement | misti.services', NULL);
INSERT INTO public.products (id, name, slug, short_description, description, how_it_works, requirements, base_price, image_url, badge_text, trust_score, total_reviews, is_active, is_featured, sort_order, created_at, updated_at, category_id, is_slider_product, slider_config, is_manually_popular, total_sales, start_time_text, start_time_value, delivery_text, delivery_value, meta_description, meta_keywords, og_image, canonical_url, image_alt_text, meta_title, parent_link) VALUES ('244987e0-2f07-4fe1-8a63-37c6d7a2fd2a', 'Black Temple Attunement', 'black-temple-attunement', 'Black Temple is a 25-man raid in Shadowmoon Valley and the iconic stronghold of Illidan Stormrage. Attunement is tied to a long, multi-stage storyline involving Akama, Maiev Shadowsong, Serpentshrine Cavern, Tempest Keep, the Battle for Mount Hyjal, and finally the gates of the Black Temple itself.', '<h1><strong>Black Temple Attunement Boost – Medallion of Karabor</strong></h1><p>Done with endless quest chains, raid pugs, and backtracking between Shadowmoon Valley, SSC, TK, and Hyjal just to step inside Black Temple? The Black Temple Attunement Boost from misti.services takes care of the entire Medallion of Karabor chain for you – from the first Ashtongue quests to the final “A Distraction for Akama” event, unlocking permanent access to Illidan’s lair.</p><p>Our professional TBC Classic teams handle every required dungeon, raid, and quest step, so your character walks away fully attuned with the Medallion of Karabor ready to use.</p><h2><strong>Overview</strong></h2><p>Black Temple is a 25-man raid in Shadowmoon Valley and the iconic stronghold of Illidan Stormrage. Attunement is tied to a long, multi-stage storyline involving Akama, Maiev Shadowsong, Serpentshrine Cavern, Tempest Keep, the Battle for Mount Hyjal, and finally the gates of the Black Temple itself.</p><p>This service covers:</p><ul><li>Completion of the full Akama and Ashtongue Deathsworn questlines.</li><li>All required steps in Serpentshrine Cavern, Tempest Keep, and the Battle for Mount Hyjal.</li><li>The final “A Distraction for Akama” event at the gates of the Black Temple.</li><li>Acquisition of the Medallion of Karabor, granting access to Black Temple.</li></ul><p>Optionally, you can later continue to upgrade it into the Blessed Medallion of Karabor by defeating Illidan Stormrage, which can be combined with our Black Temple raid services.</p><h2><strong>The Attunement Process: Medallion of Karabor</strong></h2><p>The service handles the full chain, starting in Shadowmoon Valley and ending at the Black Temple gates.</p><h3><strong>1. The Ashtongue Quest Chain</strong></h3><p>We begin by earning Akama’s trust and assembling the Medallion fragments.</p><ul><li><strong>Tablets of Baa’ri</strong></li><li>We farm the required Baa’ri Tablet Fragments from the Ruins of Baa’ri and turn them in at either the Altar of Sha’tar or Sanctum of the Stars (Aldor or Scryer).</li><li><strong>Oronu the Elder</strong></li><li>We locate and defeat Oronu the Elder on his balcony within the Ruins of Baa’ri to obtain the Orders From Akama, pushing the story forward.</li><li><strong>The Ashtongue Corruptors</strong></li><li>Our team travels across Shadowmoon Valley to track down the four corrupt Elders: Eykenen, Haalum, Lakaan, and Uylaru. We defeat each target and loot their Medallion Fragments, assembling the Medallion of Karabor for the first time.</li></ul><p>This phase completes your initial bond with the Ashtongue Deathsworn and unlocks the path deeper into Akama’s plan.</p><h3><strong>2. Akama’s Promise</strong></h3><p>Next, we descend into the Warden’s Cage and beyond, helping Akama prepare his rebellion against Illidan.</p><ul><li><strong>The Warden’s Cage, Proof of Allegiance, and Akama</strong></li><li>We interrogate Sanoru, eliminate the traitor Zandras, and meet Akama in the depths of the Warden’s Cage to advance the story.</li><li><strong>Seer Udalo (The Arcatraz)</strong></li><li>Our team forms an Arcatraz group, enters the dungeon, and locates Seer Udalo to complete this critical step.</li><li><strong>A Mysterious Portent</strong></li><li>After reporting back to Akama, we follow his instructions into the next phase of the plan.</li><li><strong>The Ata’mal Terrace &amp; Akama’s Promise</strong></li><li>We assemble a group to assault the Ata’mal Terrace (on the upper terrace of Black Temple). Shadowlord Deathwail is defeated, and the Heart of Fury is looted from his corpse. We then return to Akama and proceed to Shattrath to speak with A’dal, unlocking the next chapter of the chain.</li></ul><h3><strong>3. Entry Into the Black Temple</strong></h3><p>With Akama committed and A’dal informed, the attunement shifts into raid content across SSC, TK, and Hyjal before culminating at Black Temple.</p><ul><li><strong>Serpentshrine Cavern – The Secret Compromised</strong></li><li>Inside Serpentshrine Cavern, we defeat Fathom-Lord Karathress. After the kill, Seer Olum appears and offers “The Secret Compromised,” which we complete by returning to Akama at the Warden’s Cage.</li><li><strong>Ruse of the Ashtongue – Tempest Keep</strong></li><li>Using the Ashtongue Cowl, we infiltrate the Eye and defeat Al’ar while disguised, preserving Akama’s plan and completing “Ruse of the Ashtongue.”</li><li><strong>An Artifact From the Past – Battle for Mount Hyjal</strong></li><li>We join a Hyjal raid, defeat Rage Winterchill, and loot the Time-Phased Phylactery. The phylactery is returned to Akama, pushing the story to its climax.</li><li><strong>The Hostage Soul &amp; Entry Into the Black Temple</strong></li><li>After reporting to A’dal in Shattrath, we obtain “Entry Into the Black Temple” and are sent back to Shadowmoon Valley for the final step.</li><li><strong>A Distraction for Akama – Final Attunement</strong></li><li>Outside the Black Temple, we speak to Xi’ri and trigger the “A Distraction for Akama” event. Once completed, your character is rewarded with the Medallion of Karabor, officially attuned to Black Temple.</li></ul><p>At this point, the attunement is complete and your character can enter the Black Temple raid.</p><h3><strong>Completion</strong></h3><p>By the end of this service, you receive:</p><ul><li>Full completion of the Black Temple attunement questline, from the early Ashtongue quests to “A Distraction for Akama.”</li><li>The Medallion of Karabor in your inventory, granting permanent access to Black Temple.</li><li>All associated quest reputation and story progression with Akama, the Ashtongue Deathsworn, and A’dal.</li><li>Optional follow-up guidance on upgrading to the Blessed Medallion of Karabor via Illidan Stormrage.</li></ul><p>Your character will be ready to join any Black Temple raid without worrying about attunement requirements ever again.</p><h2><strong>Why Choose Our Black Temple Attunement Boost</strong></h2><p>The Black Temple attunement is one of the longest and most demanding chains in The Burning Crusade Classic, requiring:</p><ul><li>Multiple high-end raids across different phases.</li><li>Long quest chains in Shadowmoon Valley.</li><li>Coordinated story events with Akama and A’dal.</li></ul><p>misti.services offers a secure, efficient, and fully managed solution:</p><ul><li><strong>End-to-End Coverage</strong></li><li>We handle every required quest, dungeon, and raid step tied to the Medallion of Karabor, so you never have to worry about missing a step.</li><li><strong>Reliable Raid Teams</strong></li><li>No more risking failed pugs in SSC, TK, or Hyjal. Our organized groups guarantee boss kills and quest credit.</li><li><strong>Time Savings</strong></li><li>Skip days or weeks of LFG, quest grinding, and raid scheduling. We compress the entire attunement into a streamlined, professional service.</li><li><strong>Account Security</strong></li><li>VPN-protected piloted boosts and strict privacy standards ensure your account stays safe while we work.</li></ul><p>Unlock one of the most iconic raids in World of Warcraft history without the hassle. Order your Black Temple Attunement Boost and step into Illidan’s fortress with confidence</p>', '<ul><li>Select the Black Temple Attunement Boost on misti.services and confirm your prerequisites or let us know if you need a custom package.</li><li><strong>Coordination and Scheduling</strong></li><li>We contact you to arrange raid times for SSC, TK, and Hyjal, along with any necessary dungeon runs. We schedule around weekly raid lockouts to deliver the service efficiently.</li><li><strong>The Boost in Action</strong></li><li>Our experienced booster logs into your account, completes all Ashtongue and Akama quests, runs the required dungeons, and joins our raid teams for Fathom-Lord Karathress, Al’ar, Rage Winterchill, and the final “A Distraction for Akama” event.</li><li><strong>Completion and Handover</strong></li><li>Once the Medallion of Karabor is safely in your bags and attunement is fully complete, we log off and notify you. Your character is now permanently attuned to Black Temple.</li></ul>', '<ul><li><strong>Level 70 Character</strong></li><li>Required to access all dungeons, heroic modes, and raids involved in the chain.</li><li><strong>Raid Access and Progression</strong></li><li>Your character must be eligible to enter:</li><li class="ql-indent-1">Serpentshrine Cavern</li><li class="ql-indent-1">Tempest Keep (The Eye)</li><li class="ql-indent-1">Battle for Mount Hyjal</li><li>If you are missing any raid access or attunements, contact us for a custom package that includes SSC, TK, or Hyjal attunement as needed.</li><li><strong>Shadowmoon Valley Progress</strong></li><li>Basic quest access in Shadowmoon Valley (Aldor or Scryer friendly) so we can pick up and complete the Ashtongue questlines.</li><li><strong>Account Sharing</strong></li><li>This is a piloted service. Our booster will log into your account to complete the quest, dungeon, and raid steps using a VPN that matches your country whenever possible.</li></ul>', 